translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055531_1_bf506e43:
    # "Failure"
    "失败"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055543_1_7702c60d:
    # "In the attic, Atsuki sobbed on top of a bed. He'd seen Shiroya's dead body. She had been killed, next to Naomi."
    "阁楼里，Atsuki 趴在床上痛哭。他看见了 Shiroya 的尸体。她被人杀害，就倒在 Naomi 身旁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055544_1_a9251b0c:
    # "Atsuki couldn't believe the world had suddenly taken such a turn. Shiroya couldn't have possibly died mere days after Miiya. He had been hopeful the previous night—it was absurd for him to think that he was in reality."
    "Atsuki 无法相信世界竟会突然变成这样。Miiya 才走了没几天，Shiroya 怎么可能也死了。昨晚他还满怀希望——现在要把这一切当作现实，对他来说实在太荒唐了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055545_1_4c2e0c57:
    # "But his tears conveyed what he already knew. He would never speak to Shiroya again."
    "可泪水已经说出了他早已明白的事。他再也无法和 Shiroya 说话了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055546_1_229fa85c:
    # "He had run up the floors after seeing the body. The attic should've been locked, but that hadn't been the case. After failing to find who he'd been searching for, Atsuki had collapsed onto the bed."
    "看到尸体后，他一口气跑上了楼。阁楼本该锁着，门却没有锁。要找的人始终没找到，Atsuki 最终倒在了床上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055549_1_318b45e6:
    # "Meanwhile, the tower... was almost empty. Only one other person was in the building with Atsuki."
    "而此时，塔里……几乎空无一人。整栋建筑里，除了 Atsuki，只剩一个人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055550_1_7b016ffc:
    # "That person was Sai."
    "那个人就是 Sai。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055559_1_c7fa1d86:
    # "Puzzled, he stepped into hallway B. ...What had just happened?{w} Out of nowhere, the Sekimeiya had disappeared."
    "他满腹疑惑，走进了 B走廊。……刚才究竟发生了什么？{w} Sekimeiya 竟凭空消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055561_1_66281e1c:
    # "He wondered if he'd traveled through time. Even though he hadn't touched the Sekimeiya, something peculiar had occurred."
    "他怀疑自己是不是经历了时间穿越。明明没有碰过 Sekimeiya，怪事却发生了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055565_1_7291d3f1:
    # "When he looked around him, his confusion intensified. Naomi wasn't in the bathroom."
    "他环顾四周，心里愈发困惑。Naomi 不在洗手间里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055568_1_bac8bc1c:
    # "Then, he saw the bloody corpse next to the stairs. Erina had died. Going off of the blood, it seemed she'd hit her head on the stairs and tumbled down."
    "接着，他看见了楼梯旁那具满是鲜血的尸体。Erina 死了。从血迹来看，她像是头撞在楼梯上，一路滚了下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055569_1_00a7d8db:
    # "Sai saw something else. There was no longer a green light on the security cameras. Did that mean they weren't recording?{w} Without a doubt, he wasn't where he'd been a minute ago."
    "Sai 还注意到了另一件事。监控摄像头上的绿灯不亮了。这意味着摄像头没在录像吗？{w}毫无疑问，他已经不在刚才那个地方了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055576_1_e5f25bd5:
    # "Sai had recently learned valuable information regarding the Sekimeiya; he was confident he knew more than everyone else. However, he had no clue what had just happened."
    "Sai 最近掌握了关于 Sekimeiya 的重要情报，他自信比谁都了解内情。然而，刚才发生的事，他却毫无头绪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055577_1_0003ca9e:
    # "He took his time looking through the crystal floor. Someone might've been there, and perhaps the Sekimeiya as well."
    "他不紧不慢地查看着水晶层。或许那里有人，说不定 Sekimeiya 也在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055580_1_3737bcdf:
    # "He stared into a crystal room. It was where they'd found Naomi's first corpse, but she had also vanished from there, and the velvet curtain, which had been laid on top of her, was attached to its original cabinet."
    "他朝一间水晶展室里望去。那里正是他们最初发现 Naomi 第一具尸体的地方，可她的尸体也从那儿消失了；原本盖在她身上的天鹅绒遮布，已经重新罩回原来的展示柜上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055583_1_e9b9fccf:
    # "Deep in thought, Sai walked to room A5, where Isla had died. Lifting up the cabinet's lid, he verified her body was gone as well."
    "Sai 沉思着走到 Isla 死去的水晶展室 A5。他掀起展示柜的盖子，确认她的尸体也不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055587_1_fbd09698:
    # "When he looked at the lobby, he was met with Shiroya's immobile body. Next to her was a puddle of blood, and her eyes showed that no life remained within them.{w} Shiroya had been killed... By who, though? ...Sai didn't find anything important among her belongings."
    "他望向大厅，映入眼帘的是 Shiroya 一动不动的身体。她身旁积着一摊血，双眼已经毫无生气。{w}Shiroya 是被杀的……可凶手是谁？……Sai 也没从她的随身物品里找到任何要紧的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055588_1_ff6614f5:
    # "Again, he wondered. Where was he...? The corpses he knew of had vanished, while Shiroya and Erina, who should've been in the attic, had been killed.{w} What did the silence mean? Where was Atsuki and everyone else...? His wristwatch wouldn't help him figure any of that out, so he headed to the security room."
    "他又一次问自己：这里到底是哪儿……？他所知道的那些尸体都不见了，本该待在阁楼的 Shiroya 和 Erina，反倒被人杀死。{w}这片寂静意味着什么？Atsuki 和其他人都在哪里……？光看手表也想不明白这些，于是他朝监控室走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055596_1_e7fb3a6f:
    # "But the door was locked."
    "可是门锁着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055597_1_3b2f3051:
    # "Had Katei locked it? That seemed strange.{w} Sai wanted to know the time. The bodies vanishing indicated that he was in the past, but the truth couldn't have been so simple.{w} The future, perhaps? Had the earlier crimes been covered up? ...Sai wasn't sure what to think."
    "是 Katei 锁的吗？这未免奇怪。{w}Sai 想知道现在几点。尸体消失，说明他回到了过去，可真相不可能这么简单。{w}也许是未来？先前那些命案都被掩盖了？……Sai 想不明白。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055602_1_eccce080:
    # "Then, he looked at the elevator, frowning in consternation. The button was gone...{w} Nonetheless, when he tried to open the door, it budged."
    "随后，他望向电梯，困惑地皱起眉。按钮不见了……{w}可他试着开门，门却动了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055608_1_2b86e4d5:
    # "Inside it was blood and a pile of metallic panels."
    "里面是血迹，还有一堆金属板。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055614_1_466b5861:
    # "It was a long time later when Sai stepped into the attic. He hadn't found anyone else, and only the last floor remained. He immediately noticed that the suitcase was gone from the sofa."
    "过了很久，Sai 才踏进阁楼。他始终没找到其他人，只剩最后一层还没查看。他立刻注意到，沙发上的手提箱不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055615_1_e62de5f0:
    # "But Atsuki's sobs began to reach his ears. His cries came in broken bursts, muffled by the pillow."
    "这时，Atsuki 的哭声传进了他耳中。那哭声断断续续，被枕头捂得发闷。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055620_1_86dcb015:
    # "...What are you doing?"
    "……你在做什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055621_1_1fd36f26:
    # "Sai noticed that one of the bed sheets was gone. When Atsuki heard him, his head immediately turned and he saw him approaching through his bleary vision.{w} Then, Atsuki's fist flew. If Sai hadn't reacted fast enough, the blow would've broken his jaw."
    "Sai 注意到床上少了一条被单。Atsuki 听见他的声音，猛地转过头，透过模糊的泪眼看见他走近。{w}紧接着，Atsuki 的拳头挥了过来。若不是 Sai 反应够快，这一拳会打断他的下巴。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055627_1_15604744:
    # "Wh-What the fuck!?"
    "你、你他妈发什么疯！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055630_1_0d8fb17a:
    # "Sai felt his tongue. It was bleeding."
    "Sai 动了动舌头，发现它正在流血。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055635_1_660cc1ab:
    # "Before he could process it, Atsuki struck again. When Sai saw Atsuki's fist had barely missed its full impact, he realized it could've easily just killed him.{w} ...After all, from Atsuki's perspective, Sai had to be the murderer."
    "他还没反应过来，Atsuki 又打了一拳。Sai 看出这一拳并未完全打实，否则轻易就能要了他的命。{w}……毕竟在 Atsuki 眼里，凶手只能是 Sai。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055636_1_28030545:
    # "Everyone had stayed in a crystal room, and Sai had been the first to leave. Only Naomi should've been outside, but she had been one of the victims.{w} Then, Erina had left, and she had been killed as well. Lastly, after Shiroya's departure, she'd instantly been met with the same fate.{w} It was only Sai who could've done that; the one still alive, who had willingly not returned."
    "所有人都待在各自的水晶展室里，而 Sai 是第一个出去的。外面本该只有 Naomi 一人，她却成了死者之一。{w}接着 Erina 也出去了，同样被杀。最后，Shiroya 一出去，立刻遭遇了相同的命运。{w}能做到这些的只有 Sai——只有他还活着，并且有意没有回去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055637_1_6bd6cd38:
    # "However, Atsuki wasn't aware of where he was. He wasn't aware of what the Sekimeiya truly were, as he had never witnessed their powers."
    "但 Atsuki 并不知道自己身在何处。他也从未亲眼见过 Sekimeiya 的力量，不知道它们究竟是什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055642_1_e6a7aa29:
    # "When Atsuki's third strike came, it was immediately returned. In Sai's hand was a knife that slashed Atsuki's shirt."
    "Atsuki 第三拳刚挥出，就立刻挨了一记回击。Sai 手里握着一把刀，刀锋划破了 Atsuki 的衬衫。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055648_1_82f127e7:
    # "...!"
    "……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055649_1_dc1c6859:
    # "That confirmed it to him: Sai was the killer. He had just tried to make Atsuki his fourth victim."
    "这下他确信无疑：Sai 就是凶手。他刚才还想让 Atsuki 成为第四个牺牲者。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055651_1_5c96fc31:
    # "He felt a chill up his spine. He couldn't die there, not after Shiroya's death, but he wasn't a match against Sai's knife.{w} Before he could swing again, Atsuki ran out of the room."
    "后背窜起一阵寒意。Shiroya 已经死了，他绝不能也死在这里——可他敌不过 Sai 手里的刀。{w} 没等对方再次挥刀，Atsuki 便逃出了房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055659_1_6eecafd3:
    # "You're not gonna fucking run away!"
    "你他妈休想逃！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055660_1_968b169f:
    # "Sai wouldn't let him go—not after he'd tried to kill him out of nowhere. On top of that, he was aware of a few things.{w} Nobody else was in the tower. Murders had occurred. The cameras didn't seem to be working. He had a knife.{w} ...He had been handed the perfect circumstances to finally know what killing a person was like."
    "刚才对方毫无征兆地对他痛下杀手，Sai 怎么可能放他走。更何况，他清楚几件事。{w} 塔里没有其他人。已经出了命案。摄像头似乎没在工作。而他手里有刀。{w} ……一切都为他备好了，只等他亲手弄清楚杀人是什么滋味。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055661_1_d5467b8a:
    # "When he'd cut his shirt, Sai had discerned fear within Atsuki's eyes. He had run away, but there weren't many places where he could hide.{w} Sai had enjoyed Atsuki's presence in the tower, and he was poised to enjoy it even more. Thanks to the knife he had, he could hunt him down."
    "刚才划破 Atsuki 衬衫时，Sai 从他眼里看出了恐惧。Atsuki 虽然跑了，能藏身的地方却不多。{w} 塔里有 Atsuki 作伴，Sai 原本就乐在其中，如今更是兴味盎然。有这把刀在手，他大可以像追捕猎物一样把他找出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055662_1_fb285a64:
    # "And at the same time, he felt enraged. Atsuki had almost killed him; he'd almost suffered a sudden, clueless, and pathetic death.{w} His confusion toward the world was gone. In the blink of an eye, Sai's thoughts had shifted drastically."
    "与此同时，他也怒不可遏。Atsuki 差点杀了他；他险些就这样不明不白地突然送命，死得既荒唐又窝囊。{w} 他原本对这个世界的困惑已经一扫而空。眨眼之间，Sai 的想法已经彻底转向。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055667_1_3fbfd0c0:
    # "He grabbed the key to the bedroom. Strangely, it wasn't where he'd left it, but in its original drawer."
    "他拿起卧室的钥匙。奇怪的是，钥匙不在他原先放的地方，而是回到了原本的抽屉里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055670_1_a268904c:
    # "Then, he grabbed the one in the other bedroom and removed its chain with a screwdriver. With that, Atsuki had very few places to hide."
    "接着，他又取了另一间卧室的钥匙，用螺丝刀卸下上面的链子。这样一来，Atsuki 能藏身的地方就更少了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055675_1_80fd4349:
    # "The key to the attic had been in the door, and Sai had grabbed it. That meant Atsuki couldn't lock himself inside. The two remaining options Sai could think of were the security room and a bathroom, which could both be bypassed with Katei's keys."
    "阁楼的钥匙本来插在门上，已经被 Sai 拔走了。也就是说，Atsuki 没法把自己反锁在里面。Sai 能想到的剩下两个去处，是监控室和一间浴室；这两处都能用 Katei 的钥匙打开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055680_1_0aaa3792:
    # "He began to search for him, aware that Atsuki could attack first.{w} In the living room, he saw footprints running out, yet he cautiously looked through the whole floor to confirm Atsuki wasn't still there."
    "他开始搜寻 Atsuki，心里清楚对方可能先一步动手。{w} 客厅里有一串向外跑去的脚印，但他仍旧谨慎地把整层楼查了一遍，确认 Atsuki 没有藏在这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055689_1_70b3ddba:
    # "Coming out of the partitions, Sai stared at both bathrooms. He noticed only one of them was closed."
    "从隔间出来后，Sai 盯着两间浴室。他发现只有一间的门关着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055696_1_d6d955c9:
    # "I see, so you're here."
    "原来如此……你在这儿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055698_1_002c19dc:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055699_1_67fd92f7:
    # "Atsuki, open the door."
    "Atsuki，开门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055704_1_f81ba583:
    # "Atsuki!{w} I bet you want to know what happened to Shiroya. Open, you stupid moron!"
    "Atsuki！{w} 你八成想知道 Shiroya 出了什么事吧。快开门，你这个白痴！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055710_1_0caa08c6:
    # "...Oh, I see.{w} You're not answering...{w} because you're already dead."
    "……哦，我明白了。{w} 你不回答……{w} 是因为你已经死了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055711_1_a8bbc5d5:
    # "Sai grinned. In the storeroom on the crystal floor, he had found both Sekimeiya.{w} He'd had a reason to hide one while leaving the other there, but what mattered was that he had access to both.{w} That bathroom was where Atsuki had hidden. If Sai went to the past, he could wait for him inside. Hence, on the other side of the door, Atsuki must've already been dead, and a future version of Sai must've been waiting for his past self to leave."
    "Sai 咧嘴一笑。在水晶层的储藏室里，他找到了两个 Sekimeiya。{w} 他藏起一个、把另一个留在原处，是有原因的；但真正重要的是，两个 Sekimeiya 他都能拿到。{w} Atsuki 就藏在那个浴室里。只要 Sai 回到过去，就能先一步进去等他。所以，门后的 Atsuki 肯定已经死了，而未来的 Sai 一定正等着过去的 Sai 离开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055716_1_59a3dd64:
    # "Briskly, Sai ran all the way down. He didn't know which of the two Sekimeiya to activate, but it didn't matter."
    "Sai 一路快步跑下楼。他不知道该启动两个 Sekimeiya 中的哪一个，但这无所谓。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055723_1_7214bc43:
    # "Behind the storeroom's wall, Sai hurried to the glowing gemstone, knowing it had been there a long time."
    "在储藏室的墙后，Sai 快步走向那颗发光的宝石；他知道它已经在那里很久了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055736_1_4e24ae2d:
    # "Atsuki had been in the bathroom on floor 6 since Sai had gone down. He had no idea how much time had passed, but the silence hadn't wavered once."
    "自从 Sai 下楼以后，Atsuki 就一直待在六楼的浴室里。他不知道过了多久，但四周的寂静始终没有一丝变化。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055737_1_0863476f:
    # "How long had it been...? Perhaps two hours.{w} No matter the time, for Atsuki, it had felt like a still instant; Atsuki's mind had been consumed by the persistent image of Shiroya's corpse."
    "到底过了多久……？也许两个小时。{w} 但不管是多久，在 Atsuki 的感受里都只像一瞬；Shiroya 的尸体一直在脑海中挥之不去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055738_1_94112928:
    # "...Why had Sai not come back? Had he killed everyone else...?{w} Atsuki was incapable of shedding more tears. He'd been in the tower almost the entire day, and he didn't know if the exit would ever unlock."
    "……Sai 为什么还没回来？他是不是把其他人都杀了……？{w} Atsuki 已经流不出眼泪了。他在这座塔里待了将近一整天，也不知道出口究竟还会不会解锁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055739_1_8d327d76:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055740_1_5f502bca:
    # "He wanted to leave the bathroom. Putting a firm end to Sai—that desire spurred him onward."
    "他想离开浴室。彻底了结 Sai——正是这份念头推着他往前走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055741_1_e36ad489:
    # "What if the police couldn't prove what he'd done? Exploring that thought for a second almost broke Atsuki."
    "如果警方拿不出证据证明 Sai 的所作所为呢？光是稍一动这个念头，Atsuki 就几乎承受不住。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055742_1_691f6c49:
    # "He had to find Sai before the police... but he was wielding a knife, and Atsuki didn't know where he was."
    "他得赶在警察之前找到 Sai……可对方拿着刀，他也不知道 Sai 究竟在哪里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055745_1_59f608af:
    # "...Finally, Atsuki was able to reach the doorknob. He didn't think he had decided, but he couldn't stay there anymore."
    "……终于，Atsuki 的手碰到了门把手。他并不觉得自己已经下定决心，但他无法再待在这里了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055753_1_8f87a9a9:
    # "Sai hadn't been waiting for him outside. The floor was as desolate as it had sounded."
    "Sai 并没有在门外等他。整层楼果然如方才听见的那般死寂。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055756_1_12d257ad:
    # "Atsuki had heard him going down the stairs hours before. The red around his eyes had mostly faded, and they were otherwise empty. Slowly, he descended to the fifth floor."
    "几小时前，Atsuki 听见他下了楼。Atsuki 眼周的红肿已经褪去大半，眼神空茫茫的。他缓缓下到五楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055760_1_bcc3f4f2:
    # "But the Sai he was searching for wasn't there. He wasn't anywhere in that building."
    "但他要找的 Sai 不在那里。整栋楼里都不见他的踪影。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055765_1_b1b61098:
    # "When he arrived at the lowest floor, he was drawn to the open storeroom beyond Erina's lifeless body. There, he learned of its secret."
    "他来到最底层。Erina 那具毫无生气的尸体后方，储藏室的门敞开着，他不由自主地朝那边走去。在那里，他发现了储藏室的秘密。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055772_1_55638605:
    # "The movable wall was open, showing the way to the hidden corridor. Behind it, a strange light came from the floor."
    "活动墙敞开着，露出通往隐藏走廊的路。墙后，地板上透出一缕奇异的光。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055774_1_4f71d44a:
    # "Atsuki didn't react, but he crouched beside it."
    "Atsuki 没有反应，只是蹲到了那道光旁边。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055779_1_d333c95e:
    # "When he placed his finger on it, he retracted it immediately. He'd been burned, and before he could be surprised, the lights went out. Both the faint glow and the room's; the movable wall had closed."
    "他的手指刚碰上去，便立刻缩了回来。他被烫到了；还没等他吃惊，灯就灭了。微光与室内的灯光同时熄灭，活动墙已经合上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055782_1_ad31bfdb:
    # "Astonished, Atsuki looked back. The wall was in place, and where there'd been a soft glow before, there was nothing."
    "Atsuki 吃惊地回头。墙已经回到原位，先前微微泛光的地方，现在什么也没有了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055785_1_ba4a7833:
    # "He stood up and walked into the darkness. Immediately, he encountered a door that he couldn't open: its handle was missing."
    "他站起身，走进黑暗，立刻碰到一扇打不开的门——门把手不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055788_1_01c07dbd:
    # "He stepped back to the wall that had closed. It didn't seem to have a handle either, and he couldn't get it to open.{w} For an instant, Atsuki thought he'd been trapped, but he soon felt the area that allowed him to open the hidden wall."
    "他退回到那面已经合上的墙前。它似乎也没有把手，他怎么也打不开。{w} 有那么一瞬，Atsuki 以为自己被困住了，但很快摸到了能打开这面暗墙的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055794_1_771dc7cb:
    # "In the hallway, Atsuki stared at the stairs in fright.{w} What was happening to him? Erina had just been there, hadn't she? Yet she no longer was, and the sea of blood there had been reduced to a single droplet."
    "走廊里，Atsuki 惊恐地盯着楼梯。{w} 他到底怎么了？Erina 刚才明明还在那里，不是吗？可她现在不见了，那片血海也只剩下一滴血。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055800_1_36f8d1f5:
    # "When he looked at the other side, the sensation persisted. The event room had been open before he'd entered the storeroom, but it wasn't anymore."
    "他转向另一侧，那种异样感仍未消退。他进入储藏室之前，活动室的门原本开着，现在却关上了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055803_1_b7bf226d:
    # "Nobody was in it, but the same glow lay on the floor near the cabinet. That was when Atsuki understood what it had been: the Sekimeiya."
    "里面空无一人，但展示柜附近的地板上泛着同样的微光。直到这时，Atsuki 才明白那是什么：Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055806_1_e26ba9ee:
    # "As he crouched next to it, he shivered slightly at both the temperature of the room and how odd everything was. Could the Sekimeiya really have disappeared when he'd touched it? And why had he been burned? He still felt it on his finger."
    "他在那道光旁边蹲下，既因房间的温度，也因这一切太过诡异，微微打了个寒颤。Sekimeiya 真的会在他碰到时消失吗？他又为什么会被烫到？指尖的痛感仍未消退。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055810_1_32a452f6:
    # "Carefully, he reached out to it with his left hand.{w} Again, as soon as he contacted it, the gemstone disappeared and he felt a painful burn."
    "他小心翼翼地伸出左手，探向它。{w} 可刚一碰到，宝石又消失不见，随即一阵灼痛袭来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055817_1_9d781b8f:
    # "Atsuki was lost. Was he delusional? ...He couldn't convince himself that was impossible, but he'd seen it clearly: the gemstone had vanished."
    "Atsuki 不知所措。难道是错觉？……他没法排除这个可能，可他看得清清楚楚：宝石确实消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055818_1_6bf79d90:
    # "He looked around, almost beginning to cry again in desperation. Hopefully, Shiroya's corpse had also been a hallucination, but he couldn't bring himself to verify it."
    "他环顾四周，绝望得几乎又要哭出来。他多希望 Shiroya 的尸体也只是幻觉，却始终没有勇气去确认。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055824_1_d99ff6c7:
    # "He staggered to hallway B. Perhaps Akaro and Isla were still in that room."
    "他踉跄着走向 B走廊。也许 Akaro 和 Isla 还在那个房间里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055828_1_5808e7ec:
    # "They weren't. The room was empty."
    "他们不在。房间里空无一人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055831_1_6059702d:
    # "The lobby door wasn't closed, but Atsuki quickly looked away. Instead, he went to hallway C, wondering if Erina had truly disappeared."
    "大厅的门没有关，但 Atsuki 飞快地移开了视线。他转而走向 C走廊，想确认 Erina 是否真的消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055835_1_c0cbcf80:
    # "...She had. She really wasn't there."
    "……是的，她确实消失了。她真的不在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055841_1_8f0407e5:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055845_1_90e5b6c8:
    # "Atsuki had failed to notice another change earlier: the elevator button. ...It was attached where it should have been on the wall."
    "先前还有一处变化，Atsuki 没有留意到：电梯按钮。……它已经重新装回墙上原本的位置。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055846_1_738ed9c4:
    # "He pressed it softly, causing the burn on his fingertip to prickle painfully.{w} Long seconds later, the button's outline flashed orange."
    "他轻轻按下按钮，指尖的烫伤处立刻一阵刺痛。{w} 过了好几秒，按钮的轮廓才闪起橙光。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055848_1_4844cdb0:
    # "Hesitantly, Atsuki tried to open the door."
    "Atsuki 犹豫片刻，试着去开门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055861_1_56e1e83c:
    # "At {time=21:04}, the shutter opened.{w} A group of policemen had been in front of it, awaiting that time. As soon as the glass came into view, they saw the figure of a young girl lying next to a puddle of blood."
    "{time=21:04}，卷帘门升了起来。{w} 一队警察早已守在门外，等的就是这一刻。玻璃一露出来，他们便看见一个少女倒在血泊旁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055862_1_5a714003:
    # "However, they couldn't rush in. An unknown gas was quickly detected inside the building."
    "然而他们无法立刻冲进去。楼内很快检测出一种不明气体。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055866_1_eff1b360:
    # "When they were prepared, the team raided Ashiya Tower.{w} The girl in the lobby was young and had blue hair. She didn't have an open wound, so the blood next to her was strange."
    "准备妥当后，队伍冲进了芦屋塔。{w} 大厅里的少女年纪尚轻，一头蓝发。她身上没有外伤，身旁那摊血便显得蹊跷。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055870_1_24da49c8:
    # "On the other side of the door was another body. Along with a much larger pool of blood, an older woman was found. She had hit her head on a step, dying instantly."
    "门的另一侧还有一具尸体。旁边是一大片血迹，死者是一名年长女性。她的头撞在台阶上，当场毙命。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055871_1_1725c788:
    # "What exactly had happened during the twelve hours when the tower had been sealed off? The officers were speechless as they stared at the corpses.{w} However, that was nothing compared to what awaited in hallway B."
    "塔被封锁的这十二个小时里，究竟发生了什么？警官们盯着那些尸体，说不出话来。{w} 然而，和 B走廊里等着他们的景象相比，这根本不算什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055877_1_cef2f1d1:
    # "Dimly lit, its entire floor was red. It took a moment for the first officer to realize that it was blood, not lighting.{w} Then, when he saw its source, the wind was knocked out of him.{w} He froze, knowing that would be the most gruesome image he'd ever see—the sad remains of what had once been a human being."
    "走廊光线昏暗，整片地面却是红的。走在前头的警官愣了一瞬，才明白那是血，不是灯光。{w} 等他看清血的源头，胸口猛地一窒，气都提不上来。{w} 他僵在原地，知道那会是他这辈子见过最惨烈的画面——曾经活生生的一个人，如今只剩凄惨的残骸。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055878_1_e31426d1:
    # "In the middle of the hallway, by the door of a crystal room in the right wall, was the origin of the blood.{w} It wasn't a body. It was only half of one."
    "血迹的源头在走廊中央——右侧墙上一间水晶展室的门口。{w} 那不是一具完整的尸体，只有半具。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055879_1_61a2e164:
    # "The other half was beyond the door, as it had split it in two."
    "另外半具在门后——尸体被那扇门从中间截成了两半。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055880_1_df0696ae:
    # "The officer stared at it while his heart hammered. It looked like a young man."
    "警官死死盯着，心脏狂跳。那看上去是个年轻男子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055888_1_e760b1a9:
    # "They raised the curtain to the Sekimeiya cabinet. As Ashiya had feared, it was empty."
    "他们拉开 Sekimeiya 展示柜的遮布。正如芦屋所担心的，柜中空空如也。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055889_1_a15dce54:
    # "Lei had let them know about the Sekimeiya's appearance and about the necessity for cold. They knew the Sekimeiya were two identical egg-shaped stones."
    "Lei 已告知他们 Sekimeiya 的外观，以及必须低温保存。他们知道，Sekimeiya 是两颗一模一样的蛋形石头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055892_1_592dc255:
    # "It didn't take long for them to be found. One was in the storeroom, behind a secret wall. The other had been hidden inside a crystal room in hallway B. As instructed, an officer brought them to their cabinet, but he felt something strange. Through his protective suit, he noticed one of the stones was hot. The other, however, was not."
    "没过多久，两颗石头就被找到了。一颗在储藏室里，藏在一道暗墙之后；另一颗被藏进 B走廊的一间水晶展室。一名警官遵照指示将它们送回展示柜，却察觉出异样。隔着防护服，他感到其中一颗石头是热的，另一颗却没有温度。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055896_1_db2e79fc:
    # "Even when the police climbed to the highest floor, no one else had been found."
    "警察一直搜到最高一层，也没有再发现任何人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055902_1_a225c693:
    # "The team exited and reported their findings. Three people had been found dead, zero alive."
    "队伍撤出，报告了搜查结果：发现三名死者，没有生还者。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055903_1_38f210c1:
    # "It didn't make sense; at least five were missing. Thanks to the entrance tickets, they knew the names of the people who hadn't been found outside."
    "这说不通——至少还有五个人下落不明。多亏了门票记录，他们知道那些没在塔外找到的人姓甚名谁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055904_1_6ec2319a:
    # "While the citizens learned the tragic events that had transpired, the bodies were identified.{w} The girl in the lobby was Shiroya Mirana.{w} The woman beside the stairs was Erina Majutsu.{w} And the body split in two was Sai Yomiya's."
    "就在市民们得知这场惨剧的同时，尸体也完成了身份确认。{w} 大厅里的少女是 Shiroya Mirana。{w} 楼梯旁的女性是 Erina Majutsu。{w} 而那具被劈成两半的尸体，是 Sai Yomiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055906_1_637fe0ec:
    # "There was a secret corridor in the storeroom that Ashiya didn't know about. When the police learned it led outside, a single conclusion was drawn: the missing people had left through it minutes after the attack. Since then, all sides of the tower had been observed."
    "储藏室里有一条连芦屋也不知道的暗道。警方查明它通往塔外后，只得出一个结论：失踪的人在袭击发生几分钟后便从那里离开了。自那以后，塔的四面都处于监视之下。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055907_1_5cc71dce:
    # "So... what had happened inside? Who had killed those three people?"
    "那么……塔里究竟发生了什么？是谁杀了那三个人？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055913_1_46247eec:
    # "The building was raided a second time. If someone was still there, they had to be found immediately. Every possible spot was inspected."
    "大楼遭到第二次搜查。若还有人留在里面，必须立刻找到。每一处可能的地方都被查了个遍。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055916_1_d129a986:
    # "On the crystal floor, a member of the team entered the elevator. Blood and metallic panels were on the floor, but his attention went higher."
    "水晶层上，一名队员走进了电梯。地板上留着血迹和金属板，但他的目光投向了更高处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055919_1_82634d6c:
    # "It was the only remaining place in the tower. With the tools he'd been given, he unlocked the hatch on the ceiling to look into the narrow elevator shaft."
    "那是塔里最后一处尚未搜查的地方。他用配发的工具打开天花板的检修口，向狭窄的电梯井里望去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055927_1_ec2de3f5:
    # "When he pulled his head up through it, he saw a face before his eyes.{w} It was that of a young, unconscious boy. Blood issued from his mouth in a thin stream."
    "他把头探进去，一张脸便出现在眼前。{w} 那是个昏迷的少年。血从他嘴里细细地流出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055928_1_41ab83cc:
    # "The officer placed his hand under the boy's nose; he was still breathing. He gently shook his shoulder, but there was no response."
    "警官把手探到少年鼻下——还有呼吸。他轻轻晃了晃少年的肩膀，却没有回应。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055929_1_05ac260e:
    # "He was unsure how to safely remove the boy from where he was or how he'd even gotten there in the first place. The full extent of his injuries was also an unknown factor."
    "他不确定怎样才能把少年安全地弄出来，也不明白少年究竟是怎么进去的。伤势到底有多重，同样无从判断。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055930_1_2ebf38c3:
    # "He called for help, and a team of men slowly and gingerly extricated the boy shortly afterward."
    "他呼叫支援，随后一队人小心翼翼、一点一点地把少年救了出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055937_1_a3ce6bde:
    # "Atsuki Hakutoki. That was the name of the person who'd been found above the elevator.{w} Hours after his rescue, he regained consciousness. At first, he sounded devastated due to the death of his close friend. However, as he continued to be questioned, his answers only grew stranger."
    "在电梯上方被发现的人名叫 Atsuki Hakutoki。{w} 获救数小时后，他恢复了意识。起初，他因挚友的死而显得悲痛欲绝。然而随着问话继续，他的回答却越来越离奇。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055938_1_609d0d9e:
    # "He didn't know how he'd ended up in the elevator shaft, and the events he described didn't make sense. According to him, the missing people had been in the building for hours, which the police rejected immediately, as there was no way they would have been able to escape through the secret door."
    "他不知道自己是怎样落进电梯井的，他描述的事情也说不通。按他的说法，那些失踪的人已在楼里待了好几个小时；警方当即驳回了这一说法，因为那些人根本不可能从暗门逃出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055939_1_88977771:
    # "He didn't have a valid explanation for any of the deaths. No clues at the crime scenes pointed to their truth, and no video footage had been recorded. Quickly, the possibility that Atsuki was lying was presented—only he could've committed those murders.{w} He must've been lying: none of what he'd said could be the truth. However, nobody could be completely sure. Sai's death... It hadn't been natural.{w} How would Atsuki have killed him? How would anyone have killed him like that? And how would Atsuki have ended up unconscious above the elevator?"
    "对于任何一桩死亡，他都给不出合理的解释。现场没有任何线索能印证他的说法，也没有录下任何影像。很快，有人提出了 Atsuki 在说谎的可能——那些命案只可能是他做的。{w} 他一定在撒谎：他说的话不可能有半句是真的。然而，谁也无法完全确定。Sai 的死……绝非寻常。{w} Atsuki 怎么可能杀得了他？又有谁能用那种方式杀他？而 Atsuki 又怎么会昏迷在电梯上方？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055940_1_10912213:
    # "And, admittedly, there was a point of truth to Atsuki's words: the blood in the lobby.{w} Next to Shiroya's body, there'd been a puddle of blood, which was confirmed not to match with any of the bodies present.{w} Could it really have been... Naomi's? The corpse Atsuki swore had disappeared...?"
    "而且，不得不承认，Atsuki 的话里有一点是真的：大厅里的血。{w} Shiroya 的尸体旁有一摊血，经确认，并不属于在场的任何一具尸体。{w} 那真的会是……Naomi 的血吗？那具 Atsuki 坚称已经消失的尸体……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055947_1_7a6c6938:
    # "The backlash Ashiya received was immense. They had allowed a tragedy to unfold on their own property."
    "芦屋遭到了铺天盖地的责难。毕竟，一场惨剧是在他们自己的地盘上发生的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055948_1_3c50edaa:
    # "After the attack, the tower didn't open again. Containing countless mysteries and an unknown gas, it was closed indefinitely."
    "袭击之后，塔再也没有开放。它里面藏着数不清的谜团和一种不明气体，因此被无限期封闭了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055949_1_7220cdea:
    # "And eventually, Ashiya's voice faded. There was nothing they could do anymore."
    "最终，芦屋的声音也沉寂了下去。他们再也无能为力。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055958_1_e5fdb1c8:
    # "Many weeks had passed since December 15th. Lonely, Atsuki looked at the sky through the glass of a window."
    "自12月15日以来，已经过去了许多个星期。Atsuki 孤身一人，透过窗玻璃望着天空。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055959_1_bb53ca30:
    # "He could not yet believe what his life had become, and imagining the worst years ahead of him, he could only cry."
    "他还无法相信自己的人生已变成这副模样；想到前方那些最糟糕的年月，他唯有落泪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055960_1_76ea616a:
    # "The sky he saw... He wasn't happy he could still see it. He wanted it to disappear."
    "他看见的那片天空……他并不高兴自己还能看见它。他更希望它消失。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055963_1_d79cfe02:
    # "And it did."
    "然后，它真的消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055971_1_2d6020db:
    # "Through the glass of a window, the cloudy sky could be seen.{w} However, no one was there to see it."
    "透过窗玻璃，能望见阴云密布的天空。{w} 然而，已经没有人站在那里看它了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055977_1_5c13eefe:
    # "Around the country, some people had the opportunity to witness the disappearance of countless citizens.{w} Speechless, they walked to where everyone had been... In the blink of an eye, the streets had become desolate, and even some cars had disappeared."
    "在全国各地，有些人亲眼看见了无数市民的消失。{w} 他们说不出话，走向众人原本所在的地方……眨眼之间，街道已变得空荡荒凉，连一些汽车也不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055978_1_fe49694d:
    # "The news was heard across the world: every being within an immense radius had vanished—almost a third of Japan was gone."
    "消息传遍了世界各地：在一片极其广阔的区域里，所有生灵都已消失——日本将近三分之一的地方不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055983_1_5c9a5025:
    # "It was humanity's most shocking event ever recorded. In a mere instant, millions of people disappeared without a trace. What had occurred was far beyond anyone's understanding."
    "这是人类有史以来最令人震惊的事件。仅仅一瞬间，数百万人就消失得无影无踪。发生的一切远远超出了任何人的理解。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055985_1_df3c5709:
    # "You might know what was in the center of that radius."
    "你也许知道，那片范围的中心是什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055989_1_b17efebd:
    # "A little town on the foot of a mountain range, called Yushibana."
    "一座山脚下的小镇，名叫丰花。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055990_1_496d73b5:
    # "...Then, everyone traveled through time. That must be what you're thinking."
    "……然后，所有人都穿越了时间。你一定是这么想的吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L055992_1_958c48f3:
    # "However, not one of the people who disappeared reappeared anywhere. The instant they vanished, their existence was {tip=disappearance}erased forever{/tip}."
    "然而，那些消失的人，没有一个再出现过。就在他们消失的那一刻，他们的存在便{tip=disappearance}被永远抹去了{/tip}。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056011_1_d0ffa520:
    # "First Cause Dilemma"
    "第一因困境"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056017_1_298dfa1c:
    # "Airun was covered by a vast cape of snow. During the winter, Calliant were the only flowers that had survived the climate, and they encompassed its entire spectrum of flora."
    "艾伦山被大片白雪覆盖，像披了一件雪做的斗篷。到了冬天，只有卡利安特花能熬过这种气候，山上也就只剩下它们了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056018_1_6bc01300:
    # "A member of a large range, the mountain extended behind Yushibana, its perpetual snowy top reaching higher than the others."
    "这座山是一条漫长山脉的一部分，横亘在丰花镇后方，终年积雪的山顶高过其余诸峰。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056020_1_635fa445:
    # "Years had passed since it had last been visited. It had long ago been said that only its neighbors were holders of innumerable gemstones."
    "上一次有人造访，已是许多年前的事。很早以前就有说法称，只有与它相邻的几座山才蕴藏着数不清的宝石。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056022_1_9a09710e:
    # "On its base, different species of Calliant peeked through the snow. After so long, however, they were accompanied by something else."
    "山脚下，好几种卡利安特花从雪中探出头来。可过了这么久，它们身旁却多了别的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056023_1_9c56bbcc:
    # "Human footprints. Marked on the ground, they wandered about."
    "地上留着人类的脚印，杂乱地在雪中散开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056026_1_68e8ebe6:
    # "Far from them, a man walked on the snow. His name was Gan, and in the distance, he could see the mountains he'd often traveled through."
    "在远离那些脚印的地方，一个男人踏雪而行。他名叫 Gan，远远就能看见那几座他经常翻越的山。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056027_1_9ce7d743:
    # "It was the first time he'd brought his equipment to Airun. He'd always been curious to know whether the common belief about it being devoid of value was true."
    "这是他头一回带着工具上艾伦山。人们都说这座山毫无价值，他一直好奇这说法究竟是真是假。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056028_1_7a8d57a2:
    # "And, after hours, he had verified it. He hadn't found any caves, and the surface had been harder to traverse than Airun's neighbors."
    "几个小时后，他证实了这一点：一个洞穴也没找到，而且这里的地面比艾伦山周围那几座山都难走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056029_1_684026e9:
    # "Disappointed, he walked back before the sun set. He'd been out all day, and he was exhausted."
    "他失望地在日落前折返。在外奔波了一整天，人早已疲惫不堪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056034_1_de7302f8:
    # "He was walking down a narrow path when something caught his eye."
    "他正沿一条窄路走着，忽然有什么东西映入眼帘。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056037_1_a6f187a3:
    # "He'd already crossed the treeline, so tall trees were surrounding him. He stopped himself when he noticed an opening between two of them."
    "他早已越过林线，四周尽是高大的树木。瞥见两棵树之间有道缺口，他停下了脚步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056038_1_cbc898b4:
    # "Intrigued, he walked over to it, and as he got closer, he realized what it was."
    "他起了兴致，朝那边走去，靠近时才看清那是什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056041_1_840fd56e:
    # "An entrance to a vast field of grass, enclosed by the trees that hid it from view.{w} However, what truly stood out was farther ahead."
    "那是一片开阔草地的入口，四周的树木将它遮得严严实实。{w}然而，真正惹眼的还在更远处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056042_1_dd8398e7:
    # "There was a wooden cabin. In the corner of the field, it lay covered in white."
    "草地一角立着一座木屋，覆着一层白雪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056045_1_d341eff0:
    # "Speechless, he was drawn to it.{w} The grass was tall, and it had almost been concealed by the snow. Slowly making his way inward, Gan didn't take his eyes off the cabin."
    "他说不出话，脚步却不由自主地朝那里挪去。{w}草长得很高，几乎被雪盖住。Gan 缓缓向里走，目光始终没有离开那座木屋。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056046_1_b5b6ab0e:
    # "He'd never heard about it, and it looked abandoned. Many questions came to him, but they all suddenly vanished."
    "他从没听说过这个地方，木屋看着也早已废弃。许多疑问涌上心头，却又忽然散得一干二净。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056047_1_017c11b4:
    # "He looked at the ground. On top of the snow, he'd almost missed something that easily blended in."
    "他低头看向地面。雪地上有个东西几乎和雪融为一体，他差点就错过了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056049_1_bc1e3b66:
    # "Was it... an egg? He crouched by its side and felt its surface. Strangely, no snow was on it."
    "那是……一颗蛋？他蹲下身，摸了摸它的表面。奇怪的是，上面一点雪也没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056050_1_a0e03755:
    # "When he touched it, his face was one of amazement. It was incredibly smooth, but it was heavier than it looked. He'd never seen anything like it in his life."
    "他伸手一摸，满脸惊讶。它光滑得不可思议，分量也比看上去重得多。这样的东西，他这辈子从没见过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056051_1_507ec5f7:
    # "What was it, and why was it there? Gan didn't care and was eager to bring it home."
    "这究竟是什么，又怎么会出现在这儿？Gan 顾不上多想，只想赶快把它带回家。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056052_1_658eb0f3:
    # "It looked like a gemstone, but it hadn't been underground. Content to have found something, he kept walking toward the cabin."
    "它看着像颗宝石，却并没有埋在地下。总算有所收获，他心满意足，继续朝木屋走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056056_1_dda4963f:
    # "The door was open, so he took a look inside.{w} A few spiders had set up shop there. Most of them had died out during the winter, but their webs still decorated the room."
    "门开着，他便探头往里看。{w}几只蜘蛛在此安了家。它们大多没能熬过冬天，蛛网却仍装点着屋子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056057_1_e060dab7:
    # "Gan didn't dare look down into the storeroom. The last thing he wanted was for some large spider still living down there to be disturbed by him."
    "Gan 没敢往下面的储藏室张望。他可不希望惊动还住在那儿的大蜘蛛。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056058_1_e730c036:
    # "As he'd expected, it didn't seem like anyone had been there in a long time."
    "果然如他所料，这里看上去很久没人来过了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056062_1_5d6dcd80:
    # "The 27th of November was a Sunday. That was why Gan had chosen it to go to Airun."
    "十一月二十七日是星期天。Gan 正是挑了这个日子去艾伦山。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056066_1_edcb59d4:
    # "Late into the day, he arrived at home. With one hand, he unlocked his front door."
    "天色已晚，他才回到家，单手打开了前门的锁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056072_1_6ffafbdf:
    # "He stepped into his shop, Musashi Gemstones.{w} He left his discovery on a stand and hurried to turn on the heater. Then, he grabbed the phone and dialed a number he had memorized."
    "他走进自己的店——武藏宝石。{w}他把发现的东西搁在展台上，赶紧去打开取暖器，随后抓起电话，拨了一个记熟的号码。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056076_1_fdac1177:
    # "Lei! I'm sorry to call you so late. Is this a good time?"
    "Lei！这么晚打扰你，实在抱歉。现在方便说话吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056077_1_5625a344:
    # "What do you want?"
    "什么事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056078_1_3d72665a:
    # "I just found something that will interest you. You have to see it."
    "我刚找到一样你一定会感兴趣的东西。你得亲眼看看。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056079_1_d8e6aa4a:
    # "Is it about a gemstone?"
    "跟宝石有关？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056080_1_2c034428:
    # "Y-Yes, but it's not a normal one. I found it on Airun, and it's unlike any I've seen."
    "是、是的，可不是寻常货色。我在艾伦山找到的，从没见过那样的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056081_1_27acb801:
    # "...Is that so?{w} If you're not exaggerating, you might be in luck."
    "……是吗？{w}要是你没夸大其词，说不定你走运了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056082_1_92d7afc6:
    # "I'm not. I'm certain this would fit perfectly in the tower."
    "我没有夸大。这东西放进芦屋塔里，绝对再合适不过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056083_1_004bbc56:
    # "Is it all right if I come tomorrow? I want to speak to you about something."
    "我明天过去一趟，可以吗？有些事想跟你谈谈。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056084_1_9d53d9e3:
    # "Yes, that's perfectly fine."
    "当然可以，没问题。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056085_1_b1df83ed:
    # "I'll be there in the afternoon, then."
    "那我下午到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056086_1_8e032f98:
    # "Thank you! I'll be waiting.{w} Good night."
    "谢谢！我等你。{w}晚安。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056091_1_5a8f57c5:
    # "The call cut off.{w} Gan pumped his fist in relief. It had been a while since he'd struck a deal with Ashiya."
    "电话挂断了。{w}Gan 松了口气，挥了挥拳头。他已经很久没和芦屋谈成一笔生意了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056092_1_0dd10eef:
    # "He sat on his chair. He was tired, and he had to think about what he'd say the next day."
    "他在椅子上坐下。人很疲惫，可明天该说些什么，他还得好好想想。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056098_1_df7fe6fe:
    # "A while later, he raised his head. He had noticed something.{w} A smell he hadn't perceived before was in his shop."
    "过了一会儿，他抬起头，察觉到了异样。{w}店里弥漫着一股先前没有的气味。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056099_1_37333442:
    # "He couldn't discern what it was, but he slowly walked over to the gem he'd brought."
    "他分辨不出那是什么味道，却慢慢朝带回来的那颗宝石走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056100_1_82dceb37:
    # "Was it the source? He got close to it, but he suddenly retreated."
    "气味的源头是它吗？他凑近了些，却又猛地退开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056101_1_6933133d:
    # "Then, carefully, he placed his hand on it."
    "随后，他小心翼翼地把手放了上去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056102_1_cb5664b2:
    # "...{w}It was hot. Very hot.{w} Why? It had been cold before. Why had its temperature changed?"
    "……{w}很烫。烫得厉害。{w}怎么会？之前明明还是凉的。温度为什么会变？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056103_1_4922ff30:
    # "Concerned, he grabbed it.{w} He examined it closely, but there was no explanation for the temperature change. What could've caused that? And most importantly, would it ward Ashiya off from buying it?"
    "他心里不安，把宝石拿了起来。{w}他仔细端详，却找不出温度变化的原因。究竟是什么让它变热的？更要紧的是，芦屋会不会因此不肯买下它？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056107_1_d939f71b:
    # "He stepped out of his shop. Outside, it had remained cold."
    "他走出店门。屋外依旧寒冷。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056108_1_07e60d88:
    # "And soon after he did, the gem cooled down. In the blink of an eye, the warmth around it had faded."
    "他刚出去没多久，宝石就凉了下来。转眼之间，它周围的温热便消退了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056109_1_e6feac15:
    # "Was it the surrounding temperature? No matter what, it hadn't seemed normal."
    "是因为周围的温度吗？无论如何，这东西都不寻常。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056112_1_6141fc56:
    # "In awe, Gan stepped back in, letting the heat make contact with the gem."
    "Gan 满心惊异，又走回店里，让室内的热气碰到宝石。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056113_1_3ee3668e:
    # "Immediately, he noticed the change. The smooth surface began to heat up exponentially."
    "他立刻察觉到变化。光滑的表面开始急剧升温。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056114_1_5d9e9994:
    # "What did he have in his hands, exactly? How was such a rapid change in temperature occurring?"
    "他手里拿的到底是什么？温度怎么会升得如此之快？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056115_1_68892ee1:
    # "And would Ashiya be against taking such a thing? Gan began to worry."
    "芦屋会不会不肯收这样的东西？Gan 开始担忧起来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056116_1_32cd8b49:
    # "He remembered that a long time ago, Ashiya had sold him storage cabinets, and one of them had been equipped with temperature regulation. Biting his lip, he went to his storage room."
    "他想起很久以前，芦屋卖过他几台展示柜，其中一台配有温控装置。他咬了咬嘴唇，走向储藏室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056125_1_9bbd40bb:
    # "One of the dusty cabinets had a wheel on its side. He dragged it close to an outlet and plugged it in."
    "那些积满灰尘的展示柜中，有一个侧面装着转轮。他把它拖到插座旁，接上了电源。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056126_1_bfb03034:
    # "The temperature in Yushibana was around 0 °C. Matching it, he rotated the wheel and brought the gemstone there."
    "丰花的气温大约在 0 °C。他把转轮调到同一温度，把宝石放了进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056127_1_faf7594b:
    # "After leaving it inside, he waited for the temperature to stabilize."
    "把宝石放进去后，他等着温度稳定下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056128_1_687bf320:
    # "And when it had, he touched the gemstone one more time.{w} All warmth was long gone, and the smell had also faded."
    "等温度稳住了，他又碰了一次那颗宝石。{w}温热早已散尽，那股气味也淡了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056129_1_ac2f676a:
    # "It was bizarre, but Gan's mind went again to Ashiya. What would they say about something so peculiar...?"
    "事情实在离奇，可 Gan 又想起了芦屋。碰上这么古怪的东西，他们会怎么说呢……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056132_1_82df5e05:
    # "Tired, he went to his bedroom. He knew he would fall asleep instantly."
    "他累坏了，回到卧室。他知道自己一躺下就会睡着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056133_1_add590d9:
    # "He was still in his mountain equipment—jacket, hat, and gloves—so he hurried to take them off."
    "他身上还穿着上山那套行头——外套、帽子、手套——便赶紧脱了下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056141_1_9ef225f9:
    # "The next day, Lei came to visit Gan, who had been preparing what to say."
    "第二天，Lei 来找 Gan。Gan 已经想好了该怎么说。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056142_1_a7f17200:
    # "After a warm welcome, she was brought to the Sekimeiya—that was the name Gan had chosen for the gemstone."
    "寒暄过后，他带她去看 Sekimeiya——那是 Gan 给这颗宝石起的名字。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056146_1_a941b9ab:
    # "As soon as Lei saw it, she let him know Ashiya were interested in buying it. It had taken a lot less convincing than Gan had expected."
    "Lei 一看到它，就告诉他芦屋有意买下。说服她比他预想的容易得多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056147_1_b176f51c:
    # "Lei let him know the reason. Ashiya had been searching for a unique gemstone, and the one he'd found would serve that purpose well."
    "Lei 说明了缘由。芦屋一直在寻找一颗独一无二的宝石，而他找到的这颗正好合用。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056148_1_ecf591eb:
    # "Gan and Lei had long ago agreed on a standard starting sum per gemstone, which Gan couldn't pass on. However, he hadn't yet mentioned what he'd found out about the Sekimeiya."
    "Gan 和 Lei 早就约定过每颗宝石的标准起价，Gan 不能跳过这一步。不过，他还没提起自己对 Sekimeiya 的发现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056152_1_b0939d03:
    # "Yesterday, I noticed the heater's temperature might've damaged it. That's why I've got it cold right now."
    "昨天我发现暖气的温度可能把它弄坏了。所以现在让它保持低温。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056153_1_7c5a8e6e:
    # "Oh, it's cold in there?"
    "哦？里面是冷的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056154_1_a5317e4f:
    # "...Yes. I advise you to do the same. The lower temperature seemed to immediately alleviate the problem. It's currently set to 0 °C."
    "……是的。我建议你们也这么做。低温似乎立刻就缓解了问题。现在温度设在 0 °C。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056155_1_d9d8286a:
    # "That's fine. We can do that."
    "好，没问题。我们可以照办。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056156_1_064c3843:
    # "Good. Just in case, I would suggest you not touch it while it's not refrigerated. It's delicate, so I wouldn't risk it."
    "那就好。保险起见，我建议在没冷藏的时候不要碰它。它很娇贵，我不想冒这个险。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056157_1_3694d0e8:
    # "Lei silently nodded.{w} Gan took a deep breath. If Ashiya did what he had instructed, there would be no problem."
    "Lei 默默点了点头。{w}Gan 深吸一口气。只要芦屋照他说的做，就不会出问题。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056158_1_01f542d1:
    # "We'll deal with the paperwork, then. You know the usual.{w} We'll be here this Wednesday. Is {time=21} a good time? Sorry if it's too late, we're pretty overloaded."
    "那手续就由我们来办。老规矩，你知道的。{w}我们这周三过来。{time=21}方便吗？要是太晚了很抱歉，我们实在忙不过来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056159_1_49524dcd:
    # "Yes, any time is fine. I'm still open at that hour, so I'll have everything prepared."
    "可以，几点都行。那个时间我店里还开着，我会把一切都准备好。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056160_1_03defbd1:
    # "Perfect."
    "那就好。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056166_1_917dc11b:
    # "Both of them bowed, and Lei calmly exited his shop."
    "两人互相鞠了一躬，Lei 从容地走出他的店。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056176_1_2f517efb:
    # "When Gan woke up, he didn't open the shop. He'd been thinking that something else could've been on that mountain."
    "Gan 醒来后没有开店。他一直在想，那座山上或许还有别的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056177_1_deefd543:
    # "The gemstone he'd found... Why had it been there? Snow had fallen days prior, so why had none been on it?{w} Had someone dropped it there? Someone who knew about that place?"
    "他找到的那颗宝石……为什么会出现在那里？几天前下过雪，它上面为什么一点雪也没沾？{w}是有人把它掉在那里的吗？一个知道那个地方的人？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056178_1_461fbcef:
    # "Ashiya paid well, so Gan hadn't stopped thinking about going back to that grassy field... Was it possible he had missed something?"
    "芦屋出手阔绰，Gan 一直在琢磨要不要再回那片草地……会不会自己漏掉了什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056184_1_3caf8112:
    # "When he spotted the familiar opening between the trees, Gan deviated from the narrow path."
    "望见树丛间那道熟悉的缺口，Gan 便离开了那条窄路。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056187_1_e5a9b6e0:
    # "Once more, he saw the short cabin. It was two days later, so his footprints had almost fully disappeared."
    "他又一次看到了那座低矮的小屋。已经过去两天，他的脚印几乎全消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056189_1_81e6b249:
    # "He scanned the terrain, slowly stepping forward. He noticed something and hurried over to it."
    "他缓步向前，扫视着四周。他发现了什么，便急忙赶了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056191_1_386bc566:
    # "A section of white stood out, but it wasn't snow. He approached and slowly reached down."
    "有一块白色的东西格外显眼，但那不是雪。他走上前，慢慢俯下身，伸出手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056194_1_663051b4:
    # "It was another gemstone, identical to the one he'd found."
    "那是另一颗宝石，和他找到的那颗一模一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056199_1_906cde48:
    # "Gan searched through the entire field, but he found nothing else."
    "Gan 把整片草地都搜了一遍，却再没找到别的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056204_1_a2633688:
    # "At home, he called Lei and told her about his latest discovery. When she heard it looked the same, she sounded interested."
    "回到家，他打电话给 Lei，说了这次的发现。听说那颗宝石长得一模一样，她似乎很感兴趣。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056205_1_64c9ff52:
    # "However, there was an issue: Ashiya had already revealed the Sekimeiya's existence. On that day, the primary announcements had been made."
    "然而，有一个问题：芦屋已经公开了 Sekimeiya 的存在。就在那天，初步公告已经发布。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056206_1_7304051f:
    # "You know what? This might be great.{w} You remember what I told you, don't you?{w} We're keeping the details of the Sekimeiya a secret, and this could be something perfect to reveal on the day of the event. We'll buy both of them."
    "你知道吗？这也许是件大好事。{w}你还记得我跟你说过的吧？{w}Sekimeiya 的细节我们一直保密，而这件事正好可以在活动当天公布。我们两颗都要了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056207_1_63969886:
    # "There were many things Lei hadn't told Gan, but that was the truth. If Xyn didn't make their move before the 15th, Ashiya could justify part of the build-up on the existence of two identical, paired gemstones."
    "Lei 有很多事没告诉 Gan，但这句话是真的。只要 Xyn 在 15 号之前没有动作，芦屋就能用这两颗一模一样的成对宝石，让之前的一部分造势显得有正当理由。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056208_1_49d1bcd0:
    # "That is why, until that day, most people who uttered the words \"the Sekimeiya\" weren't aware they were referring to two gemstones at once."
    "因此，直到那一天为止，说出「Sekimeiya」这个词的人，大多并不知道自己指的是两颗宝石。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056237_1_fb50238c:
    # "Corrosion Fatigue"
    "腐蚀疲劳"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056241_1_e1c50609:
    # "In a small town encircled by mountains, a house stood out from the others. It was surrounded by an empty field, and it was often referred to as a mansion."
    "在群山环抱的小镇上，有一栋房子格外醒目。它四周是一片空地，人们常称它为宅邸。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056242_1_c2ef2150:
    # "Nobody truly knew the family who lived in it, but the numerous nasty rumors about them were known by all.{w} For a long time, they were believed to be secretly authoritarian. However, crimes had recently started to be linked back to them."
    "住在里面的是怎样一家人，没人真正了解，但关于他们的种种恶毒传言却无人不知。{w}长久以来，人们都认为他们暗地里独断专横。可近来，开始有案件被追查到他们头上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056248_1_15cc67ba:
    # "When the afternoon came, a swarm of students exited the single school in town. It was starting to get cold, so most of them walked home."
    "到了下午，镇上唯一一所学校涌出一群学生。天气渐渐冷了，大多数人步行回家。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056253_1_691a4cc3:
    # "In the mansion's living room, a thirteen-year-old boy named Kyuuka sat on a large sofa. It was his favorite spot, the most comfortable place in his own world. Idly, just passing the time, he watched whatever was on television by himself."
    "宅邸的客厅里，一个叫 Kyuuka 的十三岁男孩坐在一张大沙发上。那是他最喜欢的位置，在他自己的世界里，没有比这更舒服的地方。他一个人看着电视，随便播什么也无所谓，就这么闲散地打发时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056254_1_d8884372:
    # "Most days, he would come home from school and do that. In the past, he had sometimes played with friends, but he had distanced himself from them as time went on."
    "大多数日子，他放学回家后都是这样。从前他偶尔还会和朋友一起玩，可随着时间推移，他和他们疏远了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056255_1_e0533bcc:
    # "Solitude was his preference. The lesson he had taught himself from years of exposure to others was that they weren't worth his time, and so once in a while, he wouldn't go to school for the simple reason that it was too much of a bother."
    "他偏爱独处。多年来与别人打交道，他自己得出的结论是：他们不值得他费时间。所以，他偶尔会嫌上学太麻烦，干脆不去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056257_1_0e65b71b:
    # "His parents were upstairs. He had, over time, picked up on what their \"business\" entailed, but the details were neither accessible nor relevant to him."
    "他的父母在楼上。久而久之，他也隐约察觉到他们的「生意」是做什么的，但细节他既接触不到，也与己无关。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056264_1_186e1964:
    # "Kyuuka heard the door open. When he glanced over, he saw his older brother stepping in with a girl he'd never seen before."
    "Kyuuka 听见门开了。他瞥了一眼，见哥哥正走进来，身边跟着一个他从没见过的女孩。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056265_1_a2bc91c9:
    # "Who's that?"
    "那是谁？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056266_1_3651651a:
    # "She's a friend of mine. I'm just going to show her the house."
    "我的朋友。我带她参观一下房子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056267_1_45f22ba5:
    # "Without saying a word, she was brought upstairs. Kyuuka saw it as none of his concern at all. In his eyes, she was either somebody related to his parents' business or just another source of entertainment for his brother."
    "她一言不发，被带上了楼。Kyuuka 觉得这事同自己毫无关系。在他眼里，她要么和父母的生意有关，要么只是哥哥又一个消遣的对象。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056271_1_b49270fd:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056272_1_f8d1faf4:
    # "When night had come, he hadn't seen anyone else."
    "直到入夜，他再没见过其他人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056276_1_06375116:
    # "After making his own food, Kyuuka walked to his bedroom. He couldn't easily fall asleep with things being so noisy, so he covered himself with the sheets."
    "自己做了点吃的之后，Kyuuka 回了卧室。四下这般吵闹，他很难入睡，便裹上了被子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056284_1_a6b9b203:
    # "The next evening, watching television as usual, he saw a familiar face. A girl had disappeared in the town where he lived."
    "第二天傍晚，他照例看着电视，屏幕上出现了一张熟悉的面孔。他居住的镇上，有一名少女失踪了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056286_1_5ae21244:
    # "Kyuuka wasn't remotely surprised. They didn't operate in shadows; there was no need to do so."
    "Kyuuka一点也不意外。他们行事从不遮遮掩掩，也没那个必要。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056287_1_ad9e77cd:
    # "...She was the daughter of someone with strong ties to the town's leadership. That made sense. His brother was just carrying out something that was both productive and fun for him."
    "……她是镇上掌权者亲信的女儿。这就说得通了。哥哥只是在做一件对他而言既有好处又有趣的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056294_1_a2077a38:
    # "Hours later, his older brother came down from upstairs. He looked cheerful and left after silently waving to Kyuuka."
    "几个小时后，哥哥从楼上下来。他一脸愉快，默默朝Kyuuka挥了挥手，便出门了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056295_1_ae63e4d7:
    # "He'd learned the girl's name: Anora. It made no difference. Regardless of her name, she was locked in the same room as always.{w} Soon, he heard plaintive cries coming from above."
    "他知道了那名少女的名字：Anora。这并没有什么不同。不管她叫什么，都还是像往常一样被锁在那个房间里。{w} 不久，楼上传来凄楚的哭喊声。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056296_1_5b4da412:
    # "Kyuuka responded by turning up the volume."
    "Kyuuka把电视音量调大了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056297_1_b3f10ae8:
    # "Eventually, his brother came back with some bags he hadn't left with."
    "后来，哥哥回来了，手里提着几个他出门时没带的袋子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056305_1_f2620b52:
    # "A day had passed with no minute full of silence. In the living room, Kyuuka tried to ignore the muffled noise. Whenever those situations occurred, he went to school just to get away from it for a while, but he had to come home eventually."
    "一天过去，没有哪一分钟是安宁的。Kyuuka待在客厅里，尽量不去理会那阵沉闷的动静。每次遇上这种情形，他都会去学校躲上一阵，可终究还是要回家。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056306_1_16cf5d30:
    # "He didn't like it. He knew that girl was suffering, and he didn't want that.{w} However, he wouldn't talk his brother out of it, and he didn't want to annoy him. Furthermore, the room upstairs was always locked, and he couldn't bring himself to let anybody know."
    "他不喜欢这样。他知道那个女孩正在受苦，他并不想看到这种事。{w} 可他不会去劝哥哥收手，也不想惹他心烦。再说，楼上的房间总是锁着，他实在没法鼓起勇气告诉别人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056307_1_acf982cf:
    # "She hadn't done anything to deserve it, presumably. Few of the people his brother brought home gave him that impression. He didn't think of himself as a bad person, and would have helped her if he could, but that was a mere notion. It wasn't realistic enough for him to act on."
    "她大概也没做过什么该遭这份罪的事。哥哥带回家的人里，几乎没人让他觉得活该如此。他不认为自己是个坏人，如果有能力，他也愿意帮她——可那不过是个念头，还不足以让他真的去做。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056308_1_16d6f9b5:
    # "That was why he'd always stayed aside, quietly sitting on that sofa."
    "所以他一向置身事外，只是安静地坐在那张沙发上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056309_1_4ac62a79:
    # "But his mind suddenly changed when he saw something he hadn't seen in a long time."
    "然而，当他看见一样久违的东西时，想法忽然变了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056314_1_9236007b:
    # "It was a key.{w} When his brother had gone up loaded with what he'd bought, he'd left his keys in the keyhole."
    "是一把钥匙。{w} 哥哥抱着一堆买回来的东西上楼时，把钥匙忘在了锁孔里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056315_1_7be2affb:
    # "Kyuuka silently stood up and walked over. He looked back, confirming his brother wasn't coming."
    "Kyuuka无声地起身，走了过去。他回头望了一眼，确认哥哥没有下楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056316_1_fbe5d85d:
    # "Then, he detached one of the keys from the ring and stored it in his pocket."
    "然后，他从钥匙串上取下一把，收进了口袋。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056321_1_803566f5:
    # "Beyond the wooden ceiling, she continued to yell. On some level, such barbarism disgusted Kyuuka. He was getting tired of it."
    "木天花板上头，她仍在叫喊。这种野蛮行径让 Kyuuka 有些恶心。他也快受够了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056322_1_55e120fc:
    # "Sighing, he lay on his side to muffle the sound entering at least one of his ears. He'd endured louder, and for longer."
    "他叹了口气，侧身躺下，好堵住至少一只耳朵，少听些声音。比这更响、更久的声音，他都忍过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056323_1_f4f391c8:
    # "Part of him really did wish to take action for once, whether it was from the presence of the key or not. It had been ages since he'd had a conversation with his brother, but at some point, a part of him had come to revile his sibling."
    "他心底确实有一部分想真的行动一次，不论是不是那把钥匙的缘故。他已经很久没和哥哥说过话，但不知从什么时候起，他心里开始厌恶这个兄长。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056324_1_06b5decc:
    # "He asked himself a question. Was it worth doing something?"
    "他问自己：值得去做吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056328_1_2cbcb3cf:
    # "Answering that was difficult for Kyuuka. He didn't like people. They were rude, selfish, and just too much effort to deal with. If any of them had cared about him, he might have thought differently."
    "Kyuuka很难回答这个问题。他不喜欢跟人打交道。他们粗鲁、自私，应付起来又太费力气。若是有人曾真正关心过他，他或许会有别的想法。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056329_1_1216129b:
    # "On the other hand, he knew that he'd barely tried to speak to anyone in a long time, and his brother wasn't exactly deserving of anyone's attention, let alone approval."
    "可另一方面，他也清楚自己很久没有主动和谁说过话了；而哥哥这样的人，本就不值得谁来关心，更谈不上认可。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056330_1_8b3eceeb:
    # "His parents and his brother—his whole family—was composed of deplorable individuals. He saw himself as different. It wasn't his choice to hurt people, and he would have actively stopped it if he could."
    "父母和哥哥——他这一家人——尽是可鄙之人。他觉得自己与他们不同。伤害别人从来不是他的选择，若有能力，他也会主动去阻止。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056331_1_3f187a94:
    # "So, given the fact that he could, it only made sense to do so. When he thought about it like that, he came to a decision."
    "既然他做得到，那就理应去做。这样一想，他便下了决心。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056337_1_5d3e7d7d:
    # "The next day, Kyuuka stayed home. As soon as his parents left the house, he went up the stairs."
    "第二天，Kyuuka留在家里。父母一出家门，他便上了楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056341_1_89ce2e09:
    # "The phone was there. Quietly, he dialed the police's number.{w} When they picked up, he anonymously revealed Anora's whereabouts, claiming to have heard yells coming from the house. Then, before his brother could hear him, he slipped back to his sofa."
    "电话就在那里。他悄悄拨了报警电话。{w} 接通后，他匿名说出了Anora的下落，只说自己听见那栋房子里传出喊叫声。随后，趁哥哥还没察觉，他又溜回了沙发上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056345_1_6a3d8b7e:
    # "There was no way out for his brother. He hadn't asked about the missing key, so thanks to that, he knew Anora would be found."
    "哥哥已无路可逃。他没有问起那把不见的钥匙，也正因如此，Kyuuka知道Anora一定会被发现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056346_1_462cfeb4:
    # "Many years earlier, Kyuuka's parents had added a secret to their house. An entrance, or exit, nobody would notice. Kyuuka had seen it being used a handful of times."
    "许多年前，Kyuuka的父母给这栋房子添了一个秘密。一处谁也不会留意的入口——或者说出口。Kyuuka曾见它被用过几次。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056347_1_3c4731a7:
    # "The rumors about the mansion were known by the whole town. The first time that someone had disappeared, the police had quickly shown up.{w} Yet, thanks to that well-hidden exit, Kyuuka's brother had avoided being caught."
    "这栋宅子的传闻，全镇无人不知。第一次有人失踪时，警察很快就赶来了。{w} 可凭着那处藏得极深的出口，Kyuuka的哥哥躲过了抓捕。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056348_1_fc1545e4:
    # "Kyuuka knew that when the police appeared, his brother would try to escape with the girl. However, with the key that he had taken, that would be impossible."
    "Kyuuka知道，警察一到，哥哥一定会带着那个女孩一起逃。可钥匙已经被Kyuuka拿走，他就不可能逃了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056354_1_de4579a5:
    # "Hey, Kyuuka. What was that?"
    "喂，Kyuuka。刚才那是什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056355_1_4362a304:
    # "His brother had appeared from upstairs. Internally panicking, Kyuuka responded."
    "哥哥从楼上下来了。Kyuuka心里一惊，应道。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056356_1_c0c315e0:
    # "What was what?"
    "什么什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056357_1_23255198:
    # "I heard a noise. Did you want to come see or something?"
    "我听见有动静。你是想上来看一眼还是怎么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056358_1_d5dd5668:
    # "...No. It was the TV."
    "……没有。是电视。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056359_1_69b6bd1f:
    # "Ah, ah, okay. You have some free time though, right? Want to learn the works? Job training."
    "啊，啊，这样。不过你现在有空吧？想不想学学这一行的门道？就当上岗培训。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056360_1_79513896:
    # "No. I'm tired, so maybe later."
    "不了。我累了，以后再说吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056361_1_7743c6db:
    # "You say that every time. Oh well. I'll get back to it. If you don't want to learn the family business, you'd better go to school more. Keep your grades up. Hehe."
    "你每次都这么说。算了。我回去继续了。你要是不想学家里的生意，那就多去学校，成绩别落下。嘿嘿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056364_1_d1068ead:
    # "He went back upstairs. A few minutes had passed since Kyuuka had gotten off the phone. He'd accidentally alerted his brother, but that danger was gone. All he had to worry about from that point on was looking like an accomplice."
    "他回了楼上。Kyuuka挂掉电话才过了几分钟。他刚才不慎惊动了哥哥，可那点风险已经过去。从现在起，他唯一要担心的，是自己看起来像个同伙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056370_1_e59d7832:
    # "Barely seconds after his brother had gone back to the room, a sharp sound came from it."
    "哥哥回房不过几秒，房里便传出一声尖锐的响动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056374_1_413875de:
    # "No more yelling. No more anything. It was silent. A horrible feeling like being submerged in icy water overtook Kyuuka."
    "喊声停了。什么声音都没有了。一片死寂。一种如被冰水浸没般的恶寒攫住了Kyuuka。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056375_1_ba76cfa2:
    # "His brother had a gun. He knew that. What he didn't know was why he would just shoot the girl."
    "哥哥有枪，这他知道。他不知道的是，哥哥为什么就这样把那个女孩打死了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056376_1_2290c0ed:
    # "The police were coming, and there was absolutely no chance his brother escaped with anything less than a murder charge. He deserved no less, but for him to kill her so suddenly was unthinkable. He hadn't given that impression at all a few seconds earlier."
    "警察马上就到，哥哥绝无可能脱身，至少也要背上一桩杀人罪。他罪有应得，可这样突然就把人打死，实在难以想象。几秒钟之前，他可一点也没露出那种迹象。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056377_1_c71bb42d:
    # "Kyuuka stood up and stepped up the stairs, eyeing the door warily. Each of his footsteps was carefully placed to prevent a repeat of being detected."
    "Kyuuka站起身，走上楼梯，警惕地盯着那扇门。每一步都落得极轻，免得再被察觉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056382_1_2ff2ffb4:
    # "The door wasn't locked. He gingerly nudged it open, not afraid that he'd see something worse than what he had before, but afraid that he might be shot by reflex."
    "门没有上锁。他小心地把门推开，不是怕看见比先前更糟的景象，而是怕对方条件反射般开枪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056385_1_e7190462:
    # "The body of Kyuuka's brother was on the floor, completely immobile. There was no doubt in his mind that he was dead."
    "Kyuuka的哥哥倒在地上，一动不动。他心里很清楚，他已经死了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056386_1_55ff1afa:
    # "Something connected in his mind. His brother hadn't gone up just to shoot her right away. She had shot him. His noise had been the distraction that allowed her to escape confinement and get a weapon."
    "他忽然把整件事串联了起来。哥哥上楼，并不是为了立刻开枪杀她。是她先开枪打死了哥哥。是他弄出的动静引开了哥哥的注意，让她得以挣脱束缚，拿到武器。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056387_1_935e2b13:
    # "The girl wasn't in the usual chair he used. Around it was an untied rope, and bloodstains much older than the ones surrounding Kyuuka's brother."
    "那个女孩不在哥哥常用的那把椅子上。椅子周围散着解开的绳索，还有比Kyuuka哥哥身边那些陈旧得多的血迹。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056388_1_f991d9ea:
    # "But Kyuuka didn't see her anywhere. The girl had vanished. Bewildered, he stepped into the room."
    "可Kyuuka哪里都没看见她。女孩不见了。他满心困惑，走进了房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056393_1_f8c43c01:
    # "In an instant, she emerged from behind the door and shoved a gun up to his face. The barrel took up almost his entire field of vision."
    "刹那间，她从门后闪出，把枪抵到他脸上。枪口几乎占满了他的整个视野。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056394_1_7b008b1d:
    # "He couldn't think of a thing to say. No longer feeling like he was sinking, he felt nothing."
    "他想不出该说什么。那种不断下沉的感觉已经消失，他什么也感觉不到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056395_1_acd04479:
    # "Give m-me one reason... not to... shoot you too."
    "给、给我一个理由……不把你也……打死。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056396_1_5c8e42bf:
    # "...{w}I called the police. They're on their way right now."
    "……{w}我报警了。他们正在赶来的路上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056397_1_22ec68f1:
    # "Wh-What...? When?"
    "什、什么……？什么时候？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056398_1_3480c458:
    # "A few minutes ago."
    "就在几分钟前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056399_1_dcf83c5c:
    # "Her hand was shaking violently, and beyond the metal barrel, Kyuuka could see her face."
    "她的手抖得厉害。隔着那截金属枪管，Kyuuka 看清了她的脸。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056400_1_fb281db1:
    # "One of her eyes was missing, and the pain, dulled as it must have been, was getting to her. Adrenaline couldn't keep her going against exhaustion forever."
    "她的一只眼睛已经没了。那份疼痛想必已经迟钝，却仍折磨着她。只靠肾上腺素，她终究撑不过疲惫。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056401_1_a0aff422:
    # "Why... Why wouldn't you c-call them earlier!? You were h-here... when I got here!"
    "为、为什么……你为什么不早点叫他们！？我来的时候……你明明就、就在这里！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056403_1_8087b888:
    # "He didn't say anything for a few seconds. The wrong response could've killed him."
    "他沉默了几秒。答错一句话，就可能要了他的命。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056406_1_0111cf56:
    # "It was clear that she was completely unstable. She had lost so much blood that her actions were slightly sluggish as well."
    "她显然已经完全失控。她失血过多，动作也变得有些迟缓。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056407_1_29e4fe70:
    # "Do you know what he would have done if I'd called the police earlier? What he did to you, but worse."
    "你知道我要是早点报警，他会做出什么吗？他会把对你做过的事再做一遍，而且变本加厉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056410_1_e801ce7f:
    # "Y-You didn't do anything! You let him... You let him do this!"
    "你、你什么都没做！你就那么看着他……看着他做出这种事！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056411_1_ab7c0f2e:
    # "...The police will be here in a few minutes. You're safe."
    "……警察几分钟后就到。你安全了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056412_1_dbb2b123:
    # "I don't believe you!"
    "我不信你！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056413_1_9ae9ec6c:
    # "Kyuuka considered for a moment. He didn't have a good way to escape. Entering the room blindly had been a mistake for him."
    "Kyuuka 权衡了一瞬。他找不出什么好的退路。贸然闯进这间屋子，本就是他的一步错棋。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056414_1_8156aea0:
    # "He had believed that even if she was just like everyone else, not worth caring about, it would be a good thing to put a stop to what his brother was doing to people. And it could have ended up costing him.{w} All Kyuuka had accomplished was getting him killed and putting himself in a dangerous position."
    "他原以为，哪怕她和旁人没什么两样、不值得在意，能阻止哥哥再害人，总归是件好事。可这念头本可能让他自己付出性命。{w}到头来，Kyuuka 做到的，不过是害得哥哥丢了命，也把自己推入了险境。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056415_1_be4876d2:
    # "There was only one course of action he could take at that moment, and it happened almost automatically."
    "那一刻，他能做的只有一件事，而且几乎是下意识地做了出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056422_1_e36b2866:
    # "After repeatedly knocking, the police forced the door open."
    "反复敲门无果后，警察强行撞开了门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056426_1_d7403a66:
    # "Drawn by the smell of blood and gunpowder, they immediately located the room where two corpses lay. A man and the kidnapped girl were on the floor."
    "循着血腥与火药的气味，他们很快找到了躺着两具尸体的房间。一名男子和那名被绑架的少女倒在地上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056429_1_1551ac3b:
    # "Immediately, the entire mansion was secured, but nobody else was found."
    "整座宅邸随即被封锁，但再没找到其他人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056439_1_47df9c91:
    # "The next day, the news was published: Anora, the girl who'd disappeared, had been found dead high on a mountain. One of her eyes had been gouged out, and the other had a bullet through it. A bewildered Kyuuka read that article."
    "第二天，新闻登了出来：失踪的少女 Anora 被发现死在山上。她的一只眼睛被剜掉，另一只眼睛被子弹打穿。Kyuuka 茫然地读完了那篇报道。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056443_1_ade75d18:
    # "That day, he came back home and realized that his parents were there.{w} As usual, he had no idea what they would say."
    "那天他回到家，才发现父母也在。{w}和往常一样，他完全猜不到他们会说些什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056447_1_1fe9e80b:
    # "Before they saw him, his parents looked terribly sad. However, when he appeared, relief spread through them."
    "他还没出现时，父母看上去悲伤极了。可他一露面，两人都松了口气。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056448_1_a8958938:
    # "His parents didn't talk about what had happened. While he found it strange, Kyuuka couldn't bring himself to utter a word about it either."
    "父母对发生过的事只字不提。Kyuuka 觉得奇怪，可他自己也一个字都说不出口。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056456_1_833cd464:
    # "Kyuuka would be the family's final generation. That was something he was sure of."
    "Kyuuka 会是这个家族的最后一代。这一点他确信无疑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056457_1_59f772e8:
    # "However, even that was stripped away. On paper, at least. After what had happened with his brother, his last name carried a heavy stigma, and so his parents took action."
    "可就连这一点也被剥夺了。至少在纸面上如此。哥哥的事之后，这个姓氏背负了沉重的污名，父母于是采取了行动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056458_1_40f77025:
    # "He was released from that family. Then, he kept secretly living in that mansion until he was given a new place in the center of the town."
    "他被那个家族除名。此后，他一直偷偷住在宅邸里，直到在镇中心得到了一处新的住处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056459_1_5a7505e4:
    # "If nothing else, he appreciated that his job wasn't nearly as dirty as it could have been—and that he had some peace and quiet."
    "至少有一点让他庆幸：这份工作远没有那么肮脏，而且他还能落得几分清静。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056474_1_d0a87c46:
    # "Molehill"
    "鼹鼠丘"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056478_1_ba2ec721:
    # "The lights turned on in the tower.{w} The lobby door opened, and a man stepped into the hallway."
    "塔内亮起了灯。{w}大厅的门打开，一名男子走进走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056479_1_03e86db2:
    # "It was Katei, who had recently changed into his working uniform. Ready to begin his morning shift, he entered the security room."
    "是 Katei。他刚换好工作制服，准备开始早班，走进了监控室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056489_1_479dbe47:
    # "His colleague Cou was ready to leave. After greeting each other, Katei sat on his chair."
    "同事 Cou 正准备下班。两人打过招呼，Katei 在椅子上坐下。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056492_1_4d4f82b7:
    # "Over the phone, he'd learned Xyn had attacked again. It had happened on the 24th, and it had started during his own shift.{w} On that Thursday, there had been an event in the tower where many gemstones had been replaced. The next night, they had all been taken."
    "他在电话里得知，Xyn 又动手了。事情发生在 24 号，而且一开始就发生在他当班期间。{w}那个星期四，塔里办过一场活动，许多宝石被替换。第二天夜里，它们全被劫走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056493_1_eef8f287:
    # "Long ago, his job had started to exclusively revolve around Xyn. Ashiya had been outsmarted repeatedly, and every countermeasure they designed was continually bypassed.{w} It was Katei's job to put an end to those incidents. However, his thoughts on Ashiya were far from positive. He'd worked in the tower for years, and he knew information that eluded public knowledge."
    "很久以前，他的工作就开始只围着 Xyn 打转。芦屋一次次被人算计，他们设计的每一项对策也一次次被绕开。{w}Katei 的职责就是制止这类事件。但他对芦屋的评价绝谈不上正面。他在塔里工作多年，知道许多外界无从得知的内情。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056494_1_96290bb3:
    # "He was fully aware that none of his superiors belonged to the Ashiya family anymore. It had been long ago when the corporation had lost all ties to their actual bloodline."
    "他很清楚，自己的上司里没有一个人还属于芦屋家族。这家公司早就和他们真正的血脉没有任何关系了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056499_1_fe326463:
    # "Katei stared at the three monitors in front of him, and as he moved the cursor toward a folder, his heart began to race."
    "Katei 盯着面前的三台显示器。当他把光标移向一个文件夹时，心跳陡然加快。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056500_1_80990a38:
    # "Xyn had circumvented their measures multiple times, but that hadn't been all. Camera footage had been erased, and they'd taken advantage of the rare times when the security room had been empty."
    "Xyn 不止一次绕过了他们的防线，事情还不止于此。监控录像被人抹去，而对方正是趁着监控室难得无人的时候下的手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056501_1_ea59fcfc:
    # "Katei knew someone close to them worked for Xyn. There was no other explanation anymore."
    "Katei 知道，他们身边有人替 Xyn 做事。事到如今，已经没有别的解释了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056502_1_99f0d3e3:
    # "There were many candidates he had considered, but they'd all looked clean. As he approached a hidden folder, he wondered again who it was. A few places in the tower weren't fitted with cameras, but trying to catch Xyn on video had long ago started to feel like a futile effort."
    "他考虑过的可疑对象不少，可每一个看上去都很清白。光标移近那个隐藏文件夹时，他又一次想：到底会是谁？塔里有几处没有安装摄像头，但他早就觉得，想靠录像抓住 Xyn 是徒劳。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056503_1_2fa277e6:
    # "Katei had ruminated on something for quite a while. He wanted to use the places without cameras to catch the infiltrator."
    "有件事 Katei 已经盘算很久了。他想利用那些没有摄像头的区域，揪出混进来的人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056504_1_9188a3a4:
    # "Before arriving at the tower, he'd been told that footage of hallway A had been erased. That was why he'd been nervous all morning."
    "来塔里之前，他听说 A走廊的录像被抹掉了。所以整个上午他都心神不宁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056507_1_146f4801:
    # "But he had to be careful. Opening that folder might've been a bad idea."
    "但他必须小心。打开那个文件夹，也许并不是个好主意。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056508_1_e39fa6a1:
    # "How had Xyn erased the footage? It had always happened during times when the security room was vacant, but Katei thought that was off. Most recently, it had happened when he'd been out, but he didn't think anyone would've had enough time to remove the footage."
    "Xyn 究竟是怎么抹掉录像的？每次出事，监控室都恰好无人，可 Katei 觉得这不对劲。最近这次发生在他外出期间，但他并不认为有谁来得及删除录像。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056509_1_b6621b9f:
    # "Could that computer have been infected? Like he'd done in the past, he spent the entire morning cleaning it up as much as he could."
    "那台电脑会不会中了病毒？像以前那样，他花了一整个上午，尽可能地把它清理干净。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056512_1_2b7bcfe1:
    # "And when he was done, he sent the folder to an e-mail address that he had created at home."
    "做完之后，他把那个文件夹发送到自己在家注册的电子邮箱。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056519_1_38ecc826:
    # "That evening, he hurried to his personal computer. He'd been wondering all day if his plan had worked."
    "那天傍晚，他匆匆赶到自己的电脑前。一整天他都在想，自己的计划究竟有没有奏效。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056520_1_320fca9e:
    # "He hadn't spoken to anyone about it. There was no way Xyn had known about it."
    "他没对任何人提起过。Xyn 不可能知道。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056523_1_3425b175:
    # "Finally, he logged into his account and downloaded the folder."
    "终于，他登录账户，下载了那个文件夹。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056524_1_8df034da:
    # "Inside it, there was a long video."
    "里面是一段很长的视频。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056525_1_29416eed:
    # "The day before Xyn's attack, he'd been forced to momentarily rush out of the security room. During that time, part of the footage had been erased."
    "Xyn 动手的前一天，他不得已临时冲出了监控室。就在那段时间里，一部分录像被抹掉了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056526_1_d2de06a4:
    # "Katei had been waiting for that to happen. That was why, when he'd dashed out of the security room, he hadn't closed its door."
    "Katei 一直在等那一刻到来。正因如此，他冲出监控室时，才没有把门关上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056527_1_8a3cfc4c:
    # "The footage from hallway A had been erased, but had Xyn accounted for Katei's idea? During that time, another camera had been recording part of the hallway."
    "A走廊的录像已经被抹掉，但 Xyn 有没有算到 Katei 这一手？在那段时间里，另一台摄像头录下了走廊的一部分。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056528_1_9b01eae1:
    # "The computer's webcam, tucked behind one of the monitors. It spent most of the time turned off, but that time, it had been recording the hallway through the open door.{w} Katei had pressed a button behind the camera to begin the recording, and it wasn't a new device in the tower. There was no way Xyn had learned of his plan."
    "那是电脑的摄像头，藏在其中一台显示器后面。它平时大多关着，可那一次，它正透过敞开的门，录下走廊里的情形。{w} Katei 按下了摄像头背后的按钮开始录像，而这并不是塔里新添的设备。Xyn 不可能得知他的计划。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056531_1_6f66cdcb:
    # "Katei played the video, his trembling hand advancing it to the time he'd left the room. That had been the only time of the day when he hadn't monitored hallway A, so Xyn must've wanted to hide those few seconds."
    "Katei 播放录像，颤抖的手把进度拖到他离开房间的那一刻。那是他当天唯一没有盯着 A走廊的时候，所以 Xyn 想遮掩的，一定就是那几秒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056532_1_250c57c1:
    # "The time was before {time=9.} When Katei saw his face disappearing from the video, he let go of the mouse.{w} Then, he saw all he needed to see.{w} Through hallway A, someone he knew passed by. They were pushing a cleaning cart."
    "时间停在 {time=9.} 之前。看到自己的脸从画面中消失，Katei 松开了鼠标。{w} 随后，该看的他都看到了。{w} 一个他认识的人推着清洁推车，从 A走廊经过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056533_1_c8fe014a:
    # "That was what Xyn had wanted to hide. Finally, he knew the identity of the infiltrator.{w} Ido, the janitor."
    "Xyn 想遮掩的就是这个。他终于知道了潜入者的身份。{w} 清洁工 Ido。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056534_1_6d68248e:
    # "...But he still didn't know what had happened. Gemstones had been stolen from one of the rooms, but that hadn't happened until the following night. Yet, when they'd gone through the available footage, nobody had entered that room at the time of the attack."
    "……可他依旧不知道究竟发生了什么。有一个房间的宝石被盗，但那要到第二天夜里才发生。然而，他们查遍手头能用的录像，袭击发生时并没有人进过那个房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056535_1_860935fb:
    # "Had they been moved? Katei stared at the cleaning cart, wondering if they'd been inside it. If that was the case, they could've immediately been taken out. However, during the time of the attack, Ido hadn't been in the building."
    "宝石事先被转移了吗？Katei 盯着那辆清洁推车，想着它们是否曾藏在里面。若真是如此，它们本可以立刻被运出去。可袭击发生的时候，Ido 并不在楼里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056536_1_0276e501:
    # "There was something else of value Katei learned. The footage of some cameras had been erased while he was out of the security room. However, as he'd suspected, nobody had entered it before his return."
    "Katei 还发现了另一件有价值的事。他离开监控室期间，有几台摄像头的录像被抹掉了。然而，正如他所料，在他回来之前，没人进过监控室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056544_1_949b0e80:
    # "Katei had started working in the tower decades ago, and many years were still ahead of him. He had worked on the building's security before the security room had been constructed, but that hadn't always been his job."
    "Katei 几十年前就开始在塔里工作，前头还有好些年要熬。监控室建成之前，他就做过这栋楼的安保，不过安保并不是他一直以来的工作。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056545_1_8d96c2e6:
    # "When he looked at the future, he hated it. He loathed the thought of working there for even another year."
    "想到未来，他只觉得憎恶。哪怕再多在这里干一年，他都无法忍受。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056546_1_1bb0540b:
    # "He had no respect for Ashiya, and there was nothing about what the company had become that he identified with. He had seen the building change over the years to the point where it simply didn't feel the same."
    "他对芦屋毫无敬意，公司变成如今这副模样，也没有任何让他认同的地方。多年来，他看着这栋楼一点点改变，到最后，这里已经全然不是从前的感觉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056547_1_0cd0f54d:
    # "Since Xyn had reared their head in pursuit of Ashiya, some concepts had become tempting to Katei."
    "自 Xyn 冒头、盯上芦屋以来，有些念头对 Katei 而言变得格外诱人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056550_1_08d6a97f:
    # "During his night shifts, he was sometimes the only person in the building. He had given plenty of thought to taking out Ashiya's collection of gemstones."
    "值夜班时，他有时是楼里唯一的人。他无数次想过把芦屋收藏的宝石弄走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056551_1_514fd9fe:
    # "It should've been simple. It had happened before, so he could claim that the security footage had suddenly been erased and that he hadn't seen anything through the monitors."
    "这本该很简单。以前也出过这种事，他大可以声称监控录像突然被抹掉，而他在监视器里什么也没看见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056552_1_4fb914c2:
    # "But that was too dangerous. Xyn seemed to know everything that happened in that place. What if they exposed Katei as being responsible? Would they dislike being impersonated? He was worried they would threaten him too.{w} And even if none of that happened, Katei didn't know what he'd do with those gems."
    "但那太危险了。那地方发生的任何事，Xyn 似乎都了如指掌。万一他们揭穿这件事是 Katei 干的呢？他们会介意有人冒充自己吗？他也担心自己会遭到他们的威胁。{w} 就算这些都没发生，Katei 也不知道自己拿到那些宝石后能怎么办。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056553_1_b8809b0f:
    # "After everything, Katei didn't think it was fair that he had to keep working there; he couldn't bear the thought of staying in that place for much longer. His parents had died, and he wouldn't be able to support himself for too long if he left his job. ...It wasn't fair.{w} After Xyn's first attack, his mind had produced various scenarios that gave him what he wanted."
    "事到如今，Katei 觉得继续留在那里工作，对他并不公平；一想到还要在那地方待很久，他就无法忍受。父母已经去世，他若辞了工作，也撑不了多久。……这不公平。{w} Xyn 第一次袭击之后，他脑中就冒出过种种设想，每一种都能让他得偿所愿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056564_1_df317a23:
    # "When the morning came, Katei had slept very little. He'd wanted to find a Xyn member for so long, and he was confident he finally had.{w} Months ago, he'd come up with a tempting plan. However, it was fairly large scale, so he'd been very hesitant to set it into motion."
    "天亮时，Katei 几乎没怎么睡。他找 Xyn 成员已经很久了，如今终于确信自己找到了一个。{w} 几个月前，他想出一个诱人的计划。可那计划规模不小，他一直迟迟不敢动手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056568_1_57fff072:
    # "He left his house earlier than usual. On the way, he called Lei. She was the only person he'd always been confident wasn't part of Xyn, as she wanted to catch them more than anyone else."
    "他比平时更早出门。路上，他给 Lei 打了电话。她是他唯一始终确信与 Xyn 无关的人，因为没有人比她更想抓住 Xyn。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056570_1_221f4cc1:
    # "Katei? What do you want?"
    "Katei？有什么事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056571_1_32bf5054:
    # "I would like to talk to you later. It might not be a good idea to do it in the tower, so if I can meet you outside before my shift starts, that'd be great."
    "我想晚些时候和你谈谈。在塔里说恐怕不合适，如果能在上班前到外面见一面，那就太好了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056572_1_194cc0a2:
    # "Is it important?"
    "重要吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056573_1_23f23110:
    # "Yes."
    "重要。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056574_1_e4df34bc:
    # "I understand. I will be there as soon as I can."
    "我知道了。我会尽快赶过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056575_1_2f530f2a:
    # "Thank you."
    "谢谢。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056580_1_e9960082:
    # "Outside the tower's entrance, Katei and Lei met. Furtively, they stepped aside."
    "在塔的入口外，Katei 和 Lei 碰了面。两人悄悄走到一旁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056588_1_3ab75f89:
    # "What is it?"
    "什么事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056594_1_6ba4a2ba:
    # "I've had this idea for some time. If we're ever going to do something like this, it's right now."
    "这个念头我盘算很久了。真要做这种事，现在就是最好的时机。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056595_1_4e1b2077:
    # "After hearing that, Lei frowned. Meanwhile, Katei thought of the best way to phrase what he'd wanted to say for months."
    "听到这话，Lei 皱起了眉。Katei 则在琢磨，该如何把憋了几个月的话说得最妥当。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056600_1_14dbc31d:
    # "It's evident Xyn has a way to be in the tower without being seen, even when we're prepared. I believe we have to stop trying to see them while they're attacking."
    "很明显，就算我们有所防备，Xyn 也有办法潜进塔里不被发现。我认为，我们不能再指望趁他们袭击时当场撞见他们了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056605_1_029b560d:
    # "When we added locks to the cabinets, they were able to unlock them and even broke some of them. It was a while ago, but remember what we thought? We removed those locks to prevent future damage and because that would incite Xyn to easily come back, so we'd be able to catch them."
    "我们给展示柜加锁时，他们照样能开锁，甚至弄坏了几把。那是之前的事了，还记得当时我们是怎么想的吗？我们撤掉那些锁，一是免得锁再被弄坏，二是这样会诱使 Xyn 轻易再来，我们才好抓住他们。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056606_1_1fe77348:
    # "We added an alarm to be alerted that cabinets were opened, but it didn't go off when they attacked. At this point, I find it impossible to believe they can't externally access the computer. I've looked into it many times, but that has to be true."
    "我们装了警报，好在展示柜被打开时收到提醒，可他们袭击时警报没响。事到如今，我实在无法相信他们不能从外部访问电脑。我查过很多次，但结论只能是这样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056611_1_c3d312f9:
    # "Do you think we should change out the computer entirely?"
    "你觉得我们该把整台电脑换掉吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056616_1_7e0d51c8:
    # "No. Access to our computer can't be all they have. If we change it, they'll immediately know they lost that information, which could be bad. I would also not be able to protect the new computer at all times.{w} I have an idea. If I develop the mechanism behind a new alarm at home, it's possible they won't be able to bypass it.{w} I think this is what we should do so that they don't think we're suspicious of anything involving our computer setup.{w} Once I set up the software for this at home, I'll bring it to the tower's computer. If I do it well, it's unlikely they'll notice it."
    "不行。他们不可能只靠入侵我们的电脑。要是把电脑换掉，他们立刻就会知道自己失去了那条情报渠道，那可能会坏事；而且我也没法时时刻刻守着新电脑。{w} 我有个主意。要是我在家先把新警报的装置做出来，他们说不定就绕不过去了。{w} 我觉得就该这么做，这样他们也不会想到我们对电脑相关的布置起了疑心。{w} 等我在家把配套软件准备好，再装到塔里的电脑上。只要做得够稳妥，他们不太可能发现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056621_1_e1bf56a7:
    # "...I see. I think that's worth doing."
    "……我明白了。这值得一试。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056622_1_8749a98d:
    # "Me too, but we have to be smart. If this works, we have to catch them.{w} We can't screw this up. If they really activate the alarm, they might still have a method of escape. We have to make sure that won't be possible."
    "我也这么想，但必须做得巧妙。若计划奏效，我们就一定要抓住他们。{w} 绝不能搞砸。就算他们真的触发了警报，也还可能有逃跑的办法。我们得确保他们无路可逃。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056627_1_46debd88:
    # "How?"
    "怎么做？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056632_1_659795fb:
    # "I can build it so that when the alarm is activated, any exits will close. As soon as they open a cabinet, they will be stuck in the tower.{w} I have thought a lot about this. They have attacked during times I was in the security room, so we'll make sure one of us is always there. If the mechanism also locks that door, we will trap the attacker."
    "我可以把它做成这样：警报一触发，所有出口都会关闭。他们只要打开展示柜，就会被困在塔里。{w} 这件事我想了很久。他们之前几次动手时，我都待在监控室，所以我们得保证总有一人守在那里。如果机关也能把那扇门锁上，就能把袭击者困住。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056635_1_c34a05bd:
    # "...Do you think this could work?"
    "……你觉得这能行吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056640_1_66e4588a:
    # "It must. They have always attacked during the night, so I'm confident it will go smoothly."
    "一定行。他们一向在夜里动手，我相信会顺利的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056645_1_f9fe302e:
    # "For the first time in what seemed like forever, Lei thought that one of Katei's ideas had real promise."
    "仿佛隔了许久许久，Lei 第一次觉得 Katei 的某个主意确实有成功的希望。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056646_1_2e9ef067:
    # "How would the exits be locked, though?"
    "可是出口要怎么锁上？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056651_1_322f8175:
    # "That's what I can't handle. If I use the old system, I can have the mechanism ready for tomorrow. The installation would have to be done during the night, though, when no one else is here.{w} It will be independent of the computer, so Xyn shouldn't learn about it. I believe it's possible they're receiving the camera's feed, but the lobby isn't recorded, so they won't see it."
    "难就难在这里。若沿用旧系统，我明天就能把机关准备好。不过安装只能安排在夜里、楼里没别人的时候。{w} 它会独立于电脑，Xyn 应该不会知道。他们可能收得到摄像头的画面，但大厅没有录像，所以他们看不到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056652_1_587dacd2:
    # "But what about the windows? Shouldn't they be shut as well?"
    "可窗户呢？窗户不也得关上吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056653_1_296502f3:
    # "...You're right—that would be seen. I wouldn't like to disable the camera system because they could learn something is being done under their noses.{w} Nothing happens on the higher floors during the night. I can modify the system from home as well to disable those cameras and loop a still image of the floors, then quickly install the modification on the tower's computer. I doubt Xyn will look at that footage, but if they do, they shouldn't notice the cameras were stopped."
    "……你说得对，关窗会被看见。我不想关掉摄像系统，那样他们可能会察觉有人就在他们眼皮底下动手脚。{w} 夜里楼上不会有什么事。我也可以在家里改系统，关掉那些摄像头，让楼层的静止画面循环播放，然后尽快把改动装到塔里的电脑上。Xyn 未必会去看那段录像，就算看了，应该也看不出摄像头已经停了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056658_1_375df124:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056661_1_48a4f543:
    # "However, we can't do it like the last time. Altering every cabinet to trigger the alarm is something that could easily be noticed, and it would take a long time."
    "不过，不能照上次那样做。把每个展示柜都改得能触发警报，太容易被发现了，而且耗时很长。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056666_1_368f9f13:
    # "That's true, but it's what we would have to do."
    "确实，可我们也只能这么做。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056671_1_528b3ba0:
    # "We can draw them to a specific cabinet. Do you remember when we obtained the Nomdaid? It was targeted by Xyn immediately.{w} If we procure something of that caliber, Xyn won't be able to resist a repeat. That will be the cabinet we'll need to alter, and since it won't be one currently displayed, we can modify it before they know it exists."
    "我们可以把他们引到某个特定的展示柜。还记得我们拿到诺姆达伊德的时候吗？Xyn 立刻就盯上了它。{w} 若再弄到一件那种级别的东西，Xyn 一定忍不住故技重施。要改的就是那个展示柜；既然它现在还不会展出，我们就能在他们知道它存在之前先动手改好。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056676_1_ce1bf9ec:
    # "Lei nodded thoughtfully. Katei's plan could definitely work."
    "Lei 若有所思地点了点头。Katei 的计划确实行得通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056677_1_4e0dc4b9:
    # "I see. I will try to find a good fit for that."
    "我明白了。我会试着找一件合适的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056680_1_6cc72dd3:
    # "Perfect. We should hurry up before they attack again.{w} If I'm not mistaken, the event for the 15th of next month was hindered. It was going to be a guided tour to cover the last wave of gems, but that can't be done anymore."
    "很好。得赶在他们下次动手之前抓紧时间。{w}如果我没记错，下个月15号的活动已经出了状况。原定要办一场导览，介绍最后一批宝石，现在办不成了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056685_1_c2b465eb:
    # "That's right. It's canceled as of now."
    "没错。目前已经取消了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056686_1_05ddcb34:
    # "When you find a suitable gemstone, announce it'll be shown on that Thursday. This way, if Xyn doesn't attack beforehand, we'll still solve that problem."
    "等找到合适的宝石，就宣布它将在那个周四展出。这样一来，即便Xyn没有提前动手，这个问题也能解决。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056687_1_171f784f:
    # "That's a very good idea. I'll do that."
    "这个主意很好。就这么办。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056692_1_8cd43f2e:
    # "Katei nodded slowly. That was what he'd needed the most.{w} The 15th was a Thursday, and also the middle point of the month. That meant that it was the day his work shift would change. In the first half of the month, Katei worked during the night, and in the second half, he worked during the morning.{w} Up until the 15th, he'd be in the tower all night, ready for Xyn's attack. However, he'd also learned Xyn made daylight moves. So, if the attack didn't happen before the 15th, Katei would be present during the event."
    "Katei缓缓点头。这正是他最需要的。{w}15号是周四，也正好是月中，也就是说，那天他的班次会调换。上半月Katei值夜班，下半月值早班。{w}15号之前，他整夜都会守在塔里，等着Xyn来袭。不过他也已经知道，Xyn会在白天动手。所以，如果袭击没在15号前发生，Katei也会在活动当天在场。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056696_1_09655909:
    # "I will do my best to find something appropriate. When it's ready, we'll put it in a prepared cabinet, and you will enable the system on the tower's computer."
    "我会尽力找一件合适的。准备好之后，我们把它放进预留的展示柜，然后由你在塔里的电脑上启用系统。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056697_1_2cc15b9a:
    # "Yes."
    "好。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056702_1_7d4382e4:
    # "Why don't we do it differently? Why not make it so that opening the cabinet locks the room it's in, as opposed to the entire building?"
    "不如换个做法。让展示柜一打开就封锁它所在的房间，而不是整栋楼，怎么样？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056707_1_559b45f8:
    # "No. That could go wrong. Altering those doors is much more likely to be noticed, and if someone inside the room was quick, they could get out before being trapped."
    "不行，那样容易出岔子。改动那些门更容易被人察觉，而且房里的人动作够快的话，还可能在封死之前逃出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056708_1_91673437:
    # "Katei's voice was stern. He couldn't waver in initiating the plan."
    "Katei的语气很严厉。启动这个计划时，他不能有半点动摇。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056713_1_8e22a68e:
    # "You think so? I was thinking about a mechanical lock, not a shutter."
    "你这么觉得？我想的是机械锁，不是卷帘门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056714_1_24bed4ba:
    # "That wouldn't work. They could keep the door open and put a hard object between it and the wall to prevent it from locking. I'm aware my idea is more complex, but we can't risk this."
    "那行不通。他们可以让门一直开着，在门和墙之间塞个硬东西，门就锁不上。我知道我的办法更复杂，但我们不能冒这个险。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056719_1_4ef346e8:
    # "All right, we'll talk about it further.{w} I will let Cou know about this when he leaves, and I'll speak to Wis. Is that fine?"
    "好，我们再详谈。{w}Cou走的时候我会把这件事告诉他，也会跟Wis说一声。这样可以吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056725_1_9e1d372f:
    # "Katei nodded after a pause. Cou and Wis were the first people he'd personally investigated, as they shared his job. He couldn't be completely certain, but he really didn't think they were part of Xyn.{w} Katei's shift was about to start, so he bowed and stepped into the tower. As he walked to the security room, he sighed, relieved Lei hadn't put more pressure on him.{w} That would've prevented what he had in mind. It was something only he could do, and it was thanks to a key that had once saved him."
    "Katei停顿了一下，才点了点头。Cou和Wis跟他做着同样的工作，是他最先亲自调查的两个人。他无法完全确定，但他实在不觉得他们是Xyn的人。{w}Katei的值班时间快到了，他鞠了一躬，走进塔里。走向监控室时，他松了口气——幸好Lei没有进一步向他施压。{w}否则他心里盘算的事就行不通了。那件事只有他能做到，靠的是一把曾经救过他的钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056741_1_0e56d6af:
    # "It was the 6th of December. Katei had been shut in the security room for a few hours."
    "那是12月6日。Katei已经把自己关在监控室里好几个小时。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056742_1_ee473b1e:
    # "He was staring at the screens, knowing Xyn's attack could come at any time."
    "他盯着屏幕，知道Xyn随时可能动手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056745_1_f893002e:
    # "Suddenly, an alarm blared. Immediately, he knew they were in the building.{w} But he didn't understand how that could be. Through the monitors, he couldn't see anyone anywhere."
    "忽然，警报大作。他立刻明白，他们已经进楼了。{w}可他不懂这怎么可能。他把监控画面全看了一遍，哪里都不见人影。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056746_1_8609664c:
    # "Ah, I see. The security system was hacked. It almost worked."
    "啊，原来如此。安防系统被入侵了。差一点就成功了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056747_1_3aba9523:
    # "Katei smirked. Before the alarm ceased, he found the anomaly in the system. Xyn had sabotaged it without being noticed."
    "Katei冷笑一声。警报还没停，他就找出了系统里的异常。Xyn在无人察觉的情况下动了手脚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056749_1_4971eb4f:
    # "When Katei fixed the problem, all the screens updated, and through one, he saw a man in the event room. He looked disconcerted, desperately glancing around him."
    "Katei排除故障后，所有画面都刷新了，其中一格画面显示活动室里有个男人。他神色慌张，正拼命四下张望。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056750_1_38ac0a82:
    # "Katei moved the microphone close to his mouth and turned it on. When he spoke, his voice played everywhere in the building."
    "Katei把麦克风移到嘴边，打开开关。他一开口，声音便传遍整栋楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056751_1_5677537b:
    # "We knew you would come. The gemstone in front of you was all we needed to draw you here."
    "我们早就知道你会来。你面前那颗宝石，就足以把你引到这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056756_1_d8cf4ac8:
    # "The man looked up, trying to find the source of the audio. Because his face was covered, Katei couldn't tell who he was."
    "男人抬起头，想找出声音的来源。他的脸被遮住了，Katei认不出他是谁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056757_1_d14cf978:
    # "Unfortunately, you have been trapped. You won't be able to leave this building."
    "可惜，你已经被困住了。你出不了这栋楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056760_1_e50631cb:
    # "When he heard that, the man ran to the lobby. He disappeared from Katei's sight, but he soon reappeared, dashing toward the staircase."
    "听到这话，男人朝大厅跑去。他从Katei的视野里消失，但很快又出现了，正冲向楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056761_1_d0165239:
    # "It's futile. The way to the second floor is locked, and the elevator has been disabled."
    "没用的。通往二楼的通道已经锁死，电梯也停用了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056762_1_f6851497:
    # "The man ignored Katei's voice and took out a key."
    "男人没有理会Katei的声音，掏出一把钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056763_1_b43378fb:
    # "Oh, Xyn even has that key? I'm impressed."
    "哦，Xyn连那把钥匙都有？真让我佩服。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056764_1_ab4377bf:
    # "With it, he unlocked the door protecting the next floor. However, when he saw the windows, he slowed down, unable to accept it."
    "他用它打开了通往上一层的门。然而看到那些窗户时，他的脚步慢了下来，无法接受眼前的事实。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056768_1_c5852722:
    # "Haha, it's useless! All the windows have been sealed. You cannot escape."
    "哈哈，白费力气！所有窗户都封死了。你逃不掉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056771_1_916d9f66:
    # "The man didn't give up. Instead, he turned around and ran to where Katei was."
    "男人没有放弃，反而转身朝Katei所在的方向跑去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056774_1_8e75cdf3:
    # "He arrived at the security room, slamming into the door behind Katei."
    "他冲到监控室，狠狠撞上Katei身后的门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056779_1_0f4573e0:
    # "This door is perfectly shut. You will not open it."
    "这扇门关得严严实实。你打不开的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056784_1_ada9a601:
    # "Finally, the man seemed to give up. After a few seconds of silence, he stepped back and fell defeatedly to the floor."
    "终于，男人似乎放弃了。沉默了几秒，他后退一步，颓然跌坐在地上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056785_1_107610f2:
    # "Now you understand your position.{w} When the alarm played, Ashiya were notified. They will be here in less than ten minutes.{w} Before that, there's something I want to tell you."
    "现在你明白自己的处境了。{w}警报响起时，芦屋那边已经收到通知。不出十分钟他们就会赶到。{w}在那之前，我有件事要告诉你。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056786_1_c6be27fe:
    # "Slowly, the man looked up, once again trying to determine where Katei's voice was coming from."
    "男人缓缓抬头，又一次想辨明Katei的声音从哪里传来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056791_1_68055444:
    # "It is not possible for me to unlock the exit. For that, Ashiya's input is needed.{w} However, I know of a secret way out."
    "出口不是我一个人能解锁的，那需要芦屋那边介入。{w}不过，我知道一条秘密的出路。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056795_1_df40c235:
    # "When Katei said that, the man stood back up. Had his hearing failed him?"
    "听到这话，男人又站了起来。是他听错了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056796_1_26b1c094:
    # "In this building, there's a hidden door. I have also hidden the key you'll need to unlock it somewhere here.{w} If you don't waste time, you can leave before Ashiya comes.{w} This alarm has never been activated before. I will tell them that a malfunction set it off. If nobody's found when the building is unlocked, they will believe my word.{w} If you want that, there are two conditions you must agree on.{w} You have stolen from us countless times—it is undeniable that Xyn must be a wealthy group. For your liberty, you will provide me with 50 million yen. I believe that is a fair sum.{w} Secondly, you must reveal your identity in front of the cameras.{w} I know you, Xyn. I know a lot more than you think.{w} Ido is the mole; I know where you gather, and I've investigated many of you.{w} Just like I know you, you know me. For that reason, if anything were to happen to me, this recording and all the information I have will be immediately exposed.{w} Do you agree to these conditions?"
    "这栋楼里有一扇暗门。开这扇门要用的钥匙，我也藏在了这里的某处。{w}只要你抓紧时间，就能在芦屋赶到之前离开。{w}这道警报以前从未响过。我会告诉他们，是设备故障触发了它。解锁之后若没找到人，他们会信我的话。{w}如果你想这样，就得答应我两个条件。{w}你们从我们这里偷过无数次东西——不可否认，Xyn必定是个财力雄厚的组织。为了你的自由，给我五千万日元。我认为这个数目很公道。{w}第二，你必须在镜头前露脸。{w}我了解你，Xyn。我掌握的比你想象的多得多。{w}Ido是内鬼；我知道你们在哪儿聚集，也调查过你们中的不少人。{w}就像我了解你一样，你也了解我。正因如此，若我出了什么事，这段录音和我手上的所有情报都会立刻公开。{w}这些条件，你答应吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056797_1_5d4ae412:
    # "The loud voice faded with static. Before the silence could grow uncomfortable, the man nodded.{w} Then, he slowly took off his mask."
    "洪亮的声音在杂音中渐渐消失。还没等沉默变得尴尬，男人就点了点头。{w}然后，他缓缓摘下面罩。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056799_1_413f1962:
    # "B-{w=0.2}Brother?"
    "哥……{w=0.2}哥？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056809_1_e5d5554a:
    # "When Katei saw his brother's face, he snapped out of his daydream."
    "看到哥哥的脸，Katei才从白日梦里回过神来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056810_1_5bf73989:
    # "It was going to work; Lei hadn't suspected him at all. After going over his plan and stepping into the security room, he reassured himself."
    "这计划行得通，Lei丝毫没起疑。他把计划在心里过了一遍，走进监控室，又给自己打了打气。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056818_1_5142eab7:
    # "Katei got home and took something out of a drawer. He finally had a use for it."
    "Katei回到家，从抽屉里取出一样东西。它终于能派上用场了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056824_1_cfeec6d9:
    # "All staff members were often checked despite their positions, and they had to leave their phones behind before beginning their work.{w} That was the reason Katei had set an alarm so early."
    "无论职位高低，员工都常被抽查，上班前还必须把手机留在外面。{w}正因如此，Katei才把闹钟定得那么早。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056826_1_c41d73ec:
    # "Before the sun had risen, he was outside the tower."
    "太阳还没升起，他已经站在了塔外。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056835_1_777f2961:
    # "A while later, he showed himself in the lobby to begin his shift."
    "过了好一阵，他才出现在大厅，开始当班。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056843_1_1ab389da:
    # "Once hours had passed, he left the security room and walked down the hallway.{w} He entered the storeroom, leaving it shortly after."
    "几个小时过去，他离开监控室，沿着走廊走去。{w}他进了储藏室，没多久又出来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056844_1_d0b451e9:
    # "He had seen Ido cleaning those hallways countless times. He knew Ido was given multiple keys, which he often had at the front of the cleaning cart.{w} Katei waited for Ido to exit the building. Snow had just stopped falling, and Ashiya always wanted to keep the plaza outside the tower free of any buildup."
    "他无数次见过Ido打扫那几条走廊。他知道Ido手上有好几把钥匙，平时总放在清洁车的前头。{w}Katei等到Ido离开大楼。雪刚停，而芦屋一向要求塔外的广场保持整洁，不留积雪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056847_1_49f60626:
    # "That was when Katei walked to the cleaning room. The cart was there—Ido didn't always bring it with him, so he examined it carefully. However, he was surprised to find what he wanted on one of the shelves instead. It was the key he needed."
    "就在这时，Katei 走向清洁间。推车就放在那里——Ido 并不总把它随身带着，于是他仔细查看了一番。没想到，他要找的东西反而放在架子上。那正是他需要的那把钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056850_1_c99e5e2f:
    # "He brought it to the staff room. There, he unlocked Ido's locker. Every day, Ido would change into a white uniform, leaving his normal clothes behind."
    "他把钥匙带到员工室，打开了 Ido 的储物柜。Ido 每天都会换上白色制服，把自己的便装留在柜里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056853_1_53d6d3b4:
    # "His coat, which he always wore, was hanging inside. As fast as he could, Katei took the tiny device he'd retrieved in the storeroom and attached it to the coat's neck, where it'd be close to Ido's mouth."
    "他平日总穿的那件外套就挂在里面。Katei 以最快的速度取出之前在储藏室拿到的小装置，装到外套的领口处——那里离 Ido 的嘴最近。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056859_1_f0cc5a2f:
    # "When he got back to the security room, he tested it to see if it was working."
    "回到监控室后，他试了试装置是否正常运作。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056862_1_c000a332:
    # "What he had attached to Ido's clothes was linked to a tiny playback device. He took it out, and when he pressed the record button, a flat line appeared on the screen, indicating it was receiving audio feed."
    "他装在 Ido 衣服上的东西与一台小型回放设备相连。他把设备取出来，按下录音键，屏幕上便浮现出一条平直的波形，说明它正在接收音频信号。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056863_1_16680295:
    # "The internal storage of the device would quickly run out, so he had inserted a large SD card in the back. Katei pressed the play button, and soft static began to come out of the speaker. Nothing else played, but he knew that nothing was making any sound in the staff room."
    "设备自带的存储很快就会写满，所以他在背面插了一张大容量 SD 卡。Katei 按下播放键，扬声器里传出轻柔的电流杂音。除此之外什么都没有，但他知道，员工室里本就没什么会发出声响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056866_1_9ba599dd:
    # "He couldn't risk leaving the tower with the device, and he had to go to the storeroom only when it was absolutely necessary. When the hallways were empty, he went back to the staff room and left the device in his locker."
    "他不能冒险带着设备离开塔，只有到了万不得已的时候才会去储藏室。等走廊里空无一人，他才回到员工室，把设备放回自己的储物柜。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056882_1_ca2a8975:
    # "The next day, he listened to what had been recorded. The waveform highlighted the noisy moments, but after minutes of perusing, he realized nothing of importance was there.{w} After Ido's job had ended, he'd walked home and hadn't left again until the next morning."
    "第二天，他听了录下的内容。波形图上标出了几处嘈杂的片段，可他仔细查看了几分钟，终于确认其中没有任何要紧的东西。{w} Ido 下班后便走回了家，直到第二天早上都没有再出门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056888_1_80f92054:
    # "From there, all Katei had to do was wait for Lei to do her job."
    "接下来，Katei 只需等 Lei 把她那一部分做完。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056889_1_11144e81:
    # "The following day was a Sunday. Even though the tower was closed, Katei still had to work in it."
    "第二天是周日。塔虽然闭馆，Katei 仍旧得在里面上班。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056890_1_2c1c6768:
    # "Alone on the crystal floor, Katei skimmed through the newest audio. Once again, it seemed nothing substantial had been recorded."
    "Katei 独自待在水晶层，快速过了一遍最新的录音。这一次，似乎依旧没有录到任何实质内容。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056898_1_a5eda049:
    # "On Monday the 28th, he stepped into the building. Very few days of his morning shift remained.{w} He listened to what the bug had recorded, and yet again, he hadn't obtained anything valuable. It appeared Ido was always at home."
    "28 日星期一，他走进大楼。他上早班的日子已经所剩无几。{w} 他听了窃听器录下的内容，还是没能得到任何有价值的线索。看来 Ido 一直待在家里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056899_1_4948ace0:
    # "Could he have been mistaken? What if Ido wasn't with Xyn?{w} Perhaps that wasn't it. Maybe they were too careful, and spying on them like that was never going to work."
    "难道是他搞错了？万一 Ido 和 Xyn 没有关系呢？{w}也许并不是这个原因。也可能只是对方太谨慎，靠这种办法监视根本行不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056900_1_6e546f58:
    # "Katei was hesitant. He didn't have a lot of time, and his will was wavering."
    "Katei 犹豫了。时间所剩不多，他的决心也开始动摇。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056906_1_5f092b47:
    # "That afternoon, he received Lei's call."
    "那天下午，他接到了 Lei 的电话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056907_1_d5884e86:
    # "Hello. I believe I found what we needed."
    "你好。我想我找到我们要的东西了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056908_1_16afbfa3:
    # "...You found a special gemstone?"
    "……你找到那种特别的宝石了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056909_1_8aeabe43:
    # "Yes. I just went to see it, and I think it'll fit what we need.{w} Apparently, Gan found it yesterday on Airun. It's a white, egg-shaped stone, bright and smooth, that he called the \"Sekimeiya\"."
    "是的。我刚去看过，应该正合我们的需要。{w} 听说 Gan 昨天在艾伦山找到了它。那是一块白色的蛋形石头，光洁明亮，他把它叫作「Sekimeiya」。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056910_1_f5570d91:
    # "Good. Anything should work as long as we advertise it like the last time.{w} I have finished doing my part, by the way."
    "很好。只要像上次那样宣传，什么都行。{w} 顺便说一句，我这边已经做完了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056911_1_54058b5b:
    # "The alarm system's done? Perfect. We'll have the Sekimeiya on the 30th, so we might want to install the alarm the night before."
    "警报系统做好了？太好了。Sekimeiya 30 号就能到手，我们最好在前一晚把警报装上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056912_1_52efcd50:
    # "Yes."
    "嗯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056921_1_6a9a8f09:
    # "Katei began to get very worried. If Ido wasn't part of the group, he had to know. He wondered if he could do something with the information Lei had just given him."
    "Katei 越来越担心。他必须弄清 Ido 到底是不是那伙人。他琢磨着，能不能利用 Lei 刚告诉他的消息做点什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056922_1_09cdd581:
    # "Katei's lone hunt had begun far in the past. He had looked into most employees and had conversed with all of them. Although he hadn't determined anything at the time, that might've ended up being useful, as Ido wouldn't find it strange if Katei suddenly talked to him."
    "Katei 独自追查已经很久了。他调查过大部分员工，也和每个人都谈过话。当时虽没查出什么，如今却可能派上用场——毕竟 Katei 突然找 Ido 搭话，也不会显得奇怪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056925_1_84d5ecba:
    # "He had to make sure he wasn't mistaken, so he briefly exited the security room and walked to the lobby."
    "他得确认自己没有判断错，于是暂时离开监控室，走向大厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056934_1_bfe14298:
    # "Hey. How's it going?"
    "嗨，最近怎么样？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056935_1_4dfb825a:
    # "Ido turned to Katei and bowed with a jolly expression."
    "Ido 转向 Katei，满脸笑容地鞠了一躬。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056936_1_a40dc109:
    # "Everything has been going good, thank you for asking. How about you?"
    "一切都好，谢谢关心。你呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056941_1_cf1a3fe7:
    # "...I don't think I can say the same, unfortunately. You know what happened on the 24th. We're doing our best to catch Xyn, but we're as lost as ever."
    "……很遗憾，我可没法这么说。24 号的事你也知道。我们正尽全力追查 Xyn，却始终毫无头绪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056942_1_3dcd4eb9:
    # "Is that so...? I hope you can figure them out soon."
    "是这样吗……？但愿你们能早日查个水落石出。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056947_1_b9034342:
    # "Me too, but we're in a bit of a hurry. The event for the 15th was changed. We're going to pick up a valuable gemstone this Wednesday, and you probably remember what happened the last time an event of this caliber was about to be held. ...We have to catch them before that day."
    "我也这么希望，不过我们的时间有点紧。15 号的活动改了。这周三我们要去接收一颗贵重的宝石，上次办这种规模的活动之前出了什么事，你大概还记得吧。……我们必须在周三之前抓住他们。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056948_1_2208cfe2:
    # "Oh, really? I hadn't heard about that."
    "哦，真的吗？这事我还没听说。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056953_1_bcb2f778:
    # "Yeah, it's called the Sekimeiya, apparently, and it was found yesterday. We're handling everything with utmost care, but we're worried Xyn might attack at any moment. Keep an eye out for me, and mention anything you think is suspicious."
    "是啊，据说它叫 Sekimeiya，昨天才被找到。我们处处小心，可还是担心 Xyn 随时会动手。帮我多留意着点，发现什么可疑的就告诉我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056954_1_5da57b2c:
    # "Oh, absolutely. I'm sorry to hear the situation is this bad, but I trust you'll catch them soon."
    "哦，那是当然。听说情况这么糟，我很遗憾，不过我相信你们很快就能抓到他们。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056959_1_114d4050:
    # "...Thank you.{w} I have to go now. *sigh*"
    "……谢谢。{w} 我得走了。*叹气*"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056962_1_45ac4f51:
    # "Ido bowed again as Katei walked to the reception desk."
    "Katei 走向前台时，Ido 又鞠了一躬。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056975_1_9ee3962c:
    # "The Copse"
    "树丛"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056981_1_a143f403:
    # "You did a good job, Atase."
    "你做得很好，Atase。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056982_1_c57a2823:
    # "Behind a short chair, Atase's boss congratulated him. As he did, however, Atase knew he must've been called there for a different reason."
    "矮椅后面，Atase 的上司向他道贺。可就在上司道贺时，Atase 却明白，自己被叫来这里肯定另有原因。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056983_1_69327e1a:
    # "Thank you. I'm glad everything went well."
    "谢谢。事情顺利就好。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056984_1_2dae8b69:
    # "Yes, me too.{w} How was it?"
    "嗯，我也一样。{w} 事情办得怎么样？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056985_1_dc8b4dfa:
    # "How? It was simple, of course.{w} I had to spend a long time in the tower, but it went as we'd expected."
    "怎么样？当然很简单。{w} 我在塔里耗了很久，但一切都如我们所料。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056986_1_2c8c6f03:
    # "Good. I verified that we received everything. It seems nothing went wrong."
    "很好。我确认过，东西全都收到了。看来没有出任何差错。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056987_1_568d21f0:
    # "...Yes. It went smoothly."
    "……是的。一切顺利。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056988_1_8e3c4fe6:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056989_1_3c59d0e0:
    # "Atase's boss stared into his eyes.{w} Why? Why was he being tested like that?"
    "Atase 的上司直直盯着他的眼睛。{w} 为什么？为什么要这样试探他？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056992_1_8ea044d3:
    # "Is that all you have to say?"
    "你要说的就这些？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056993_1_854adcf8:
    # "Y-Yes. Am I missing something?"
    "是、是的。我漏了什么吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056994_1_381122da:
    # "If it's as you said, no."
    "如果你说的都是实话，那就没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056995_1_5e0d5d04:
    # "...{w}Is this why you called me?"
    "……{w} 你叫我来就是为了这个？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056996_1_7ce467ea:
    # "Yes. You can go now."
    "是的。你可以走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056997_1_91075e32:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L056998_1_1a7f79cd:
    # "Atase was confused. He'd been surprised to have been called four days after the assignment, but his boss's attitude had left him even more fazed."
    "Atase 满心困惑。任务结束四天后忽然被叫来，本就让他意外，而上司的态度更叫他摸不着头脑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057001_1_7e76f59c:
    # "...I'll go, then."
    "……那我先走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057002_1_d9e7c57d:
    # "His boss didn't show the slightest sign of movement. After a long pause, Atase stood up."
    "上司纹丝不动。过了好一会儿，Atase 才站起身来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057006_1_759f27b1:
    # "Suddenly, five knocks reverberated through the small space."
    "忽然，敲门声响了五下，在狭小的空间里回荡开来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057007_1_f0303720:
    # "Go ahead."
    "进来吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057008_1_e4665585:
    # "The door opened, and the outline of a thin man appeared. Hesitantly, he looked into the room, worried he was a disturbance."
    "门开了，一道瘦削的身影出现在门口。他迟疑地向房里张望，像是怕自己打扰了什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057009_1_4e33dda9:
    # "What do you want, Ido?"
    "什么事，Ido？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057010_1_3203d120:
    # "...There's something I have to tell you."
    "……有件事，我得告诉你。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057011_1_ff16350d:
    # "Speak, then."
    "说吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057012_1_61493974:
    # "I have been told Ashiya will pick up a... notable gem this Wednesday."
    "有人告诉我，芦屋这周三会去取一颗……很了不得的宝石。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057013_1_55235670:
    # "Who told you that?"
    "谁说的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057014_1_15baa94d:
    # "Katei Kuiji, from security. He compared it to the situation with the Nomdaid."
    "安保部的 Katei Kuiji。他还把它和诺姆达伊德那次的事相提并论。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057015_1_3489def7:
    # "Hm."
    "嗯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057018_1_90179c12:
    # "He said they'll show it on the 15th; the event is going to be changed."
    "他说 15 号会公开展出，活动安排也会改。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057019_1_d34a366c:
    # "What else did he say?"
    "还说了什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057020_1_1e498216:
    # "...That they're working very hard to catch us before that day, handling the situation with utmost care and having a lot of trouble with it.{w} The gemstone was found yesterday on Airun, and it's called the Sekimeiya."
    "……说他们正全力争取在那天之前抓住我们，对这件事处理得极为谨慎，也为此颇费周折。{w}那颗宝石是昨天在艾伦山找到的，名字叫 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057022_1_f0dd8fc6:
    # "Anything else?"
    "还有别的吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057023_1_a5eadcc7:
    # "...No."
    "……没有了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057024_1_77202ef1:
    # "Why were you told this?"
    "为什么要告诉你这些？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057025_1_931ca885:
    # "I don't know. I think he was venting, honestly. I've worked there since years before the first attack, so I believe I'm considered trustworthy. We had a brief conversation this morning."
    "我不知道。老实说，我觉得他只是在发牢骚。早在第一次袭击的几年前，我就在那里做事了，大概因此才被当成信得过的人。今天早上我们聊了几句。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057026_1_bfe259e9:
    # "I see."
    "原来如此。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057030_1_3c459772:
    # "Thank you for letting us know immediately, and do so again in the future.{w} You may go now."
    "多谢你立刻来告知，今后也照这样办。{w}你可以走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057031_1_bc69436a:
    # "...Yes."
    "……是。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057034_1_48abfdce:
    # "After Ido left the room, Atase's boss looked pensive for some time before inquiring what Atase's thoughts were.{w} Atase had been the most involved in Ashiya-related manners; as such, his superior was curious to know his thoughts on what they'd heard."
    "Ido 离开房间后，Atase 的上司沉思了片刻，才问他有什么想法。{w}与芦屋相关的事务，Atase 一向参与最多，因此上司很想听听他对刚才那番话的看法。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057035_1_35d0b009:
    # "They must expect an attack is imminent, so I'm sure they have something prepared."
    "他们一定料定袭击就在眼前，想必已经做好了准备。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057036_1_d91e8b6e:
    # "Of course.{w} Three days ago, our access to the tower's computer was terminated. It's unlikely we were detected, though, so they're repeating the same preemptive actions.{w} Infecting the computer again is not a priority. They must be paying close attention to it, and if they found out a way to identify us, we can't risk notifying them of the moment we regained access."
    "当然。{w}三天前，我们对塔内电脑的访问被切断了。不过我们不太可能已经暴露，他们只是在重复同样的防范措施。{w}再次入侵电脑不是当务之急。他们现在一定盯得很紧，万一他们已经找到锁定我们的办法，我们一恢复访问就等于通知了他们，这个险不能冒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057039_1_d70f173b:
    # "...{w}I have a thought.{w} The computer was cleaned, so they're evidently preparing something in the tower. However, we have very early information about the event they're preparing. If we want to make a move, it might be a good call to do it before they actually retrieve the gem on the 30th."
    "……{w}我有个想法。{w}电脑被清理过，说明他们显然在塔里准备着什么。不过那场正在筹备的活动，我们早就拿到了情报。如果要动手，赶在他们 30 号真正取回宝石之前，也许是个好时机。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057040_1_87091b67:
    # "What? That would be disastrous.{w} Did you not listen to Ido? He was told they're handling the situation extremely carefully. And he was told about a few key details.{w} Ashiya are hunting for a spy. If we take advantage of the information Ido was given, we're handing them his identity."
    "什么？那会闯下大祸。{w}你没听 Ido 说吗？对方告诉过他，这件事他们处理得极为谨慎，还透了几处关键细节。{w}芦屋正在清查内鬼。我们要是利用 Ido 得到的情报，就等于把他的身份拱手送出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057041_1_7851a9d8:
    # "...{w}You're right. That's a bad idea."
    "……{w}你说得对。这主意不妥。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057043_1_2fc51d26:
    # "...{w}You can leave now. I'll think about this."
    "……{w}你先出去吧。这件事我再想想。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057044_1_cc26d5ff:
    # "Yes."
    "是。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057045_1_ef7e4c2c:
    # "Atase gave his boss a slow nod and walked out of the room."
    "Atase 缓缓向上司点头，走出了房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057054_1_0bc4c2fa:
    # "Why were you told this?"
    "为什么要告诉你这些？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057055_1_64cc6415:
    # "I don't know. I think he was venting, honestly. I've worked there since years before the first attack, so I believe I'm considered trustworthy. We had a brief conversation this morning."
    "我不知道。老实说，我觉得他只是在发牢骚。早在第一次袭击的几年前，我就在那里做事了，大概因此才被当成信得过的人。今天早上我们聊了几句。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057056_1_4c59b862:
    # "I see."
    "原来如此。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057057_1_8eb4d75a:
    # "Thank you for letting us know immediately, and do so again in the future.{w} You may go now."
    "多谢你立刻来告知，今后也照这样办。{w}你可以走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057058_1_a4b9a5be:
    # "...Yes."
    "……是。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057061_1_b9d38a79:
    # "Katei's heart rapidly pounded his chest. He had landed his first hit."
    "Katei 的心脏在胸腔里狂跳。他的第一击得手了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057062_1_d7f73e8a:
    # "Ido was part of Xyn, and Ashiya's bait had sunk into their pond. Shaking, Katei combed through the rest of the recording, but it didn't contain anything else of relevance."
    "Ido 是 Xyn 的人，芦屋抛下的诱饵已经沉进了他们的水塘。Katei 双手发颤，把余下的录音逐一听完，却再没发现任何有用的内容。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057068_1_095791d8:
    # "The door to the security room opened."
    "监控室的门开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057069_1_facd6cb3:
    # "We have made the primary announcement of the Sekimeiya. We won't have it until tomorrow, but there's no way an issue will come up with Gan."
    "Sekimeiya 的初步公告已经发出。它要到明天才能到手，不过 Gan 那边不会出问题。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057070_1_641cf775:
    # "That's good. We have to build it up as early as possible, and we always announce the events well in advance."
    "很好。造势要越早开始越好，我们的活动一向都提前很久公布。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057080_1_8b0b53c9:
    # "Jiro had called Atase again. When he stepped into the room, he was gestured to sit in front of the table."
    "Jiro 又把 Atase 叫了过来。他刚进门，就被示意坐到桌前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057082_1_a2264541:
    # "Have you heard about it?"
    "你听说了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057083_1_9cdc477d:
    # "Ashiya's announcement?"
    "芦屋的公告？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057084_1_190b54b5:
    # "Yes. They have revealed the existence of the Sekimeiya, and the details match what Ido was told.{w} I think your idea is now worth considering."
    "对。他们公开了 Sekimeiya 的存在，细节与 Ido 听到的完全吻合。{w}我看你那个主意，现在值得考虑了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057085_1_be35eaf7:
    # "Right. Now that the information is out, we won't be linked to Ido."
    "对。既然情报已经公开，我们就不会和 Ido 扯上关系了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057086_1_3f2cffe3:
    # "They think we'll attack the tower as usual. As you said, they cleaned up their computer, so what they're preparing has to entail the building.{w} We know Ashiya will obtain the Sekimeiya tomorrow, but we could've investigated for this information after the announcement."
    "他们认为我们会照旧袭击那座塔。正如你所说，他们清理了电脑，那么他们准备的事必然与这栋楼有关。{w}芦屋明天就会拿到 Sekimeiya，其实这些信息，等公告出来后再查也能查到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057087_1_f9eb568a:
    # "And we still need to do that. We don't know where the Sekimeiya currently is or what it looks like."
    "而且我们仍然得去查。Sekimeiya 现在在哪里、长什么样子，我们都还不知道。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057088_1_6556566e:
    # "No. We know enough."
    "不。我们知道的已经够多了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057091_1_0428bb01:
    # "Ashiya said they will pick it up tomorrow as opposed to having it brought. We know that means the source is established and from Yushibana. It was found on the 27th, so that Ashiya will already have it tomorrow confirms it's currently here.{w} There are a few established points in contact with Ashiya, but not many. There are a couple of amateur collectors that try to sell all their findings to them. If it was found on the 27th and Ashiya already knew they would obtain it yesterday, it's likely they were immediately called about it in hopes they'd buy it.{w} The 27th is a Sunday, the day Gan closes his shop to go to the caves. It's highly possible it was him who found it. It was also given a name before Ashiya obtained it, which is something he has done in the past."
    "芦屋那边说，明天会自己来取，而不是让人送过去。这就说明货源已经确定，而且出自丰花。东西是27号被发现的，芦屋明天就能拿到手，可见它眼下就在这里。{w} 与芦屋有往来的固定卖家不多，只有几位业余收藏家，挖到什么都会想卖给他们。如果东西是27号发现的，而芦屋昨天就已经知道能拿到，那多半是有人发现后立刻打电话通知，指望他们买下。{w} 27号是周日，正是 Gan 关店去山洞的日子。发现它的人极有可能就是他。而且这东西在芦屋拿到之前就已经有了名字——这种事他以前也干过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057093_1_5ad6db65:
    # "...I understand. We don't know how it looks, though.{w} Should Ido try to obtain that information?"
    "……我明白了。不过，我们还不知道它长什么样。{w} 要不要让 Ido 去打听一下？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057094_1_b0595797:
    # "I don't think so."
    "我看不必。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057095_1_9931eb20:
    # "Jiro took a cellphone out of a drawer."
    "Jiro 从抽屉里取出一部手机。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057096_1_e056eada:
    # "Let's try this."
    "那就试试这个办法。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057097_1_7384b95b:
    # "With a serious expression, Jiro dialed a number and put the cellphone close to his ear."
    "Jiro 神情严肃，拨通一个号码，把手机贴到耳边。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057101_1_cdc64f97:
    # "Yes?"
    "喂？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057102_1_8099b535:
    # "Am I calling Musashi Gemstones?"
    "请问是武藏宝石吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057103_1_79b264d1:
    # "You are."
    "是的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057104_1_aee4bfaf:
    # "Glad to speak with you. I'm Zane, from Ashiya.{w} I'm calling you to confirm that I'll come tomorrow at {time=14.}"
    "很高兴和你通话。我是芦屋的 Zane。{w} 打电话来是想确认一下，我明天 {time=14.} 过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057105_1_98acfb22:
    # "...{time=14}? I was told it'd be at {time=21.}"
    "……{time=14}？我听到的说法是 {time=21.}。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057106_1_45f3efc9:
    # "...Oh,{w} really?{w} My mistake, I was looking at the wrong page.{w} You're right, it'll be at {time=21.} Is that still all right?"
    "……啊，{w}是吗？{w} 抱歉，是我看错了页面。{w} 你说得对，是 {time=21.}。这样安排还方便吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057107_1_f9b80d0b:
    # "Yes, I'll be here."
    "方便，我会在店里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057108_1_8da07816:
    # "Perfect. That was all, then."
    "那就好。没有别的事了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057109_1_a8c2ba85:
    # "I'll see you."
    "到时候见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057110_1_a4e288df:
    # "Goodbye."
    "再见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057112_1_d152bf95:
    # "It appears you have a new job tomorrow."
    "看来你明天有新任务了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057113_1_3e3cbe0c:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057120_1_7ac207ac:
    # "The plan was simple.{w} Atase had to pass himself off as an Ashiya member. In order to not be easily recognizable in the future, his figure had to be slightly disguised, and he knew how to change his voice."
    "计划很简单。{w} Atase 要冒充芦屋的人。为了以后不容易被认出来，他的外形得稍微伪装一下；声音方面，他也有办法改变。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057126_1_051e5826:
    # "On November 30th, snow began to fall. Xyn had been preparing their move, and Ashiya did the same."
    "11月30日，雪开始飘落。Xyn 一直在为行动做准备，芦屋那边也一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057127_1_ef6f068e:
    # "Minutes before {time=21}, a car parked outside Musashi Gemstones. Atase emerged from inside it, wearing a long coat.{w} Stepping into the snow, he approached the bright window, leaving the prints of a new pair of shoes behind."
    "{time=21} 前几分钟，一辆车停在武藏宝石门外。Atase 穿着长外套，从车里下来。{w} 他踏进雪中，朝那扇明亮的橱窗走去，身后留下一串新鞋的脚印。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057131_1_6904a3fc:
    # "He wasn't even close to calm. If Gan had told Ashiya about the call he'd received, they might've been waiting for Xyn's arrival."
    "他一点也不镇定。如果 Gan 把接到的那通电话告诉了芦屋，对方可能早已在等着 Xyn 上门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057132_1_8777c5f2:
    # "Slowly, he pushed open the door, a wave of warm air hitting his guarded face."
    "他缓缓推开门，一股暖风扑面而来，拂过他戒备的脸。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057141_1_3695c413:
    # "Inside the shop, he saw a young man near the entrance, who only glanced at him emptily. Avoiding eye contact, Atase stared behind his shoulders.{w} Gan rushed over to the door after hearing the sound."
    "店里靠近门口的地方有个年轻人，只淡淡地瞥了他一眼。Atase 避开视线，把目光投向那人身后。{w} Gan 听到动静，匆匆赶到门边。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057142_1_5155684e:
    # "Hello. I'm sorry for coming earlier than arranged."
    "你好。抱歉，比约定的时间早到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057143_1_fb02592a:
    # "No, don't worry! I'm happy to see you."
    "不不，别在意！见到你我很高兴。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057144_1_13fc428b:
    # "Gan's face shaped into a big smile. Then, he brought Atase to the reception desk."
    "Gan 脸上堆起大大的笑容，随后把 Atase 领到接待台前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057149_1_87f27ed9:
    # "I'd like to see the Sekimeiya."
    "我想看看那个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057150_1_149ee8af:
    # "Yes. I have prepared everything. Wait here."
    "好。都准备好了。请你稍等。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057151_1_67c832de:
    # "Gan walked away and shortly came back. He held a small, brown box between his hands and handed it over to Atase. During the time it couldn't be in the cold, he had made sure the Sekimeiya's temperature wouldn't go through the box."
    "Gan 走开片刻便回来了，双手捧着一只棕色的小盒子，递给 Atase。这东西不能受冻，他事先已经确保 Sekimeiya 的温度不会透过盒子散失。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057152_1_58baf5d0:
    # "I'm not done, give me a moment. Oh, and you're aware of what I discussed with Lei, right? The price will be double the usual."
    "我还没弄完，稍等一下。对了，我和 Lei 谈过的事，你知道吧？价钱会是平常的两倍。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057158_1_e57c64fc:
    # "Surprisingly, Gan walked away again. As he did, Atase peeked into the box and saw an egg-shaped stone, glowing faintly. That must have been the Sekimeiya."
    "没想到 Gan 又走开了。趁这工夫，Atase 往盒里瞥了一眼，看见一块蛋形的石头，泛着微弱的光。那想必就是 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057159_1_501faabf:
    # "That was his time—he had it.{w} As he'd discussed with his boss, Gan had to be paid before leaving, so Atase couldn't simply step out of the shop. If he ran away, Gan would try to chase him and would immediately call Ashiya and the police, and it was possible he'd see their car. Atase slowly took something out of his large pocket."
    "这就是机会——东西已经到手。{w} 按他和上司说好的，离开前必须先付钱，所以 Atase 不能就这么走出店门。要是他跑了，Gan 会追出来，还会立刻通知芦屋和警察，说不定还会看见他们的车。Atase 慢慢从大衣口袋里取出一样东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057169_1_6f7412fc:
    # "A grenade that would rapidly disperse smoke through the shop, knocking out everyone who inhaled it."
    "那是一枚烟雾弹，能在店里迅速散开浓烟，让吸入的人当场昏倒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057174_1_06cf317a:
    # "As soon as he activated it, he dashed to the door, colliding with the light falling snow. A curtain blocked the view through the window, so no one could see what had happened from outside."
    "他一启动，便冲向门口，一头撞进飘落的细雪里。橱窗被遮布挡着，外面的人看不到店里发生了什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057175_1_44214875:
    # "Without slowing down, Atase ran to the car. He had seen the immense cloud of smoke appearing before his eyes, and Gan had been farther into the room. There was no way he'd avoided being knocked unconscious."
    "Atase 没有放慢脚步，直奔汽车。他亲眼看见浓烟在眼前涌起，而 Gan 站的位置更靠里。那人不可能没被熏倒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057179_1_02170d39:
    # "Faiten, another member of Xyn, had opened the car door. Atase rapidly stepped in and hurried to close it."
    "Xyn 的另一名成员 Faiten 已经打开了车门。Atase 迅速钻进车里，急忙把门关上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057181_1_6a6fe6c7:
    # "Go! I'm pretty sure he was hit, but Ashiya could come at any time!"
    "走！他应该中招了，但芦屋的人随时可能到！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057182_1_87054651:
    # "Faiten accelerated as fast as he could. The vehicle took off at a speed far beyond the legal limit, almost running over an old man past the first turn."
    "Faiten 全力加速。车子以远超限速的速度冲了出去，转过第一个弯时险些撞上一位老人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057196_1_912cd7e4:
    # "At the appointed time, Lei gripped the handle of the door, ahead of a notary from Ashiya."
    "约定的时间到了，Lei 握住门把手，身后跟着芦屋派来的公证人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057201_1_74c46d92:
    # "When she laid eyes inside the shop, a thin darkness hindered her sight.{w} Confused, she placed a finger on the light switch next to the door, but that turned off all remaining light.{w} Immediately, she flipped it back."
    "她朝店里望去，视线被一层薄薄的黑暗挡住了。{w} 她有些困惑，伸手按向门旁的电灯开关，却把仅剩的光也关掉了。{w} 她立刻又按了回去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057211_1_5db0f28d:
    # "Both she and the notary were taken aback by the loud noise."
    "一声巨响，她和公证人都吓了一跳。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057216_1_0e767e4d:
    # "Astonished, they looked through the door and saw that the opposite part of the shop had disappeared. Their hearts almost stopped when they saw blood and human flesh on the edges of the hole."
    "两人惊愕地朝门里看去，只见店铺的另一侧已经不见了。看到洞口边缘的血迹和血肉，他们的心脏几乎停跳。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057218_1_cac7873e:
    # "It had been Xyn. As Lei stared at the scene, she found no other option.{w} They had never taken their attacks to such an extent before, but she knew they were responsible.{w} How? How had they learned about the time and place of the Sekimeiya's tradeoff? Had her phone been hijacked?"
    "是 Xyn 干的。Lei 盯着眼前的景象，想不出别的可能。{w} 他们以前从没把袭击闹到这种地步，但她知道是他们干的。{w} 可他们是怎么知道的？怎么会知道 Sekimeiya 交易的时间和地点？她的手机被人动了手脚吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057220_1_5be6d141:
    # "On the floor were Gan and a boy she didn't know. However, someone else had been farther ahead. ...Someone had just died, and she couldn't fathom it."
    "地上躺着 Gan 和一个她不认识的少年。可还有一个人倒在更里面。……刚刚有人死了，她怎么也接受不了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057221_1_5c01b4db:
    # "...Are you two okay?"
    "……你们两个没事吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057222_1_4c172f07:
    # "The man beside Lei began to shake both bodies.{w} Soon, Gan, who had inhaled a lesser amount of the smoke thanks to the shelves, opened his eyes, obstructing the blood from flowing down.{w} In disbelief, he told Lei about what had happened, stuttering as he stared at the broken floor."
    "Lei 身旁的男人开始摇晃地上的两人。{w} 没过多久，Gan 睁开了眼睛——多亏有货架挡着，他吸入的烟较少——血也没再往下淌。{w} 他难以置信地把发生的事讲给 Lei 听，一边盯着破碎的地板，一边结结巴巴地说着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057223_1_85991036:
    # "While an ambulance was being called, Lei's phone was also by her ear, linked to the police."
    "有人叫救护车的同时，Lei 也把手机贴在耳边，和警察通着电话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057230_1_2ab85319:
    # "I'm telling you they just escaped! They're in a vehicle—I see their tire marks outside the shop!{w} They must be found immediately! They just stole an incredibly valuable gemstone!"
    "我说了，他们刚跑掉！他们开着车——店外还有轮胎印！{w} 必须马上找到他们！他们刚抢走了一颗极其贵重的宝石！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057238_1_f0b4068f:
    # "When the boy woke up, he stood in a daze. Then, staggering forward, he stared at the back of the shop with desperate eyes."
    "男孩醒来后，怔怔地站在原地。随后他踉跄着向前，用近乎绝望的目光望向店铺深处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057243_1_41ce9280:
    # "Wh-Where are the two girls that were here?"
    "那、那两个女孩呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057245_1_ba13304d:
    # "There was silence. Nobody knew the answer, but they didn't think they could have spoken even if they had."
    "一片沉默。没人知道答案；就算知道，他们也不觉得自己说得出口。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057261_1_21fafe21:
    # "It went well. We're on the way."
    "「很顺利。我们正在路上。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057262_1_44f3a75d:
    # "Faiten and Atase were driving away. Just in case, they couldn't go straight to their boss."
    "Faiten 和 Atase 驱车离开。为防万一，他们不能直接去见老板。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057263_1_0f524381:
    # "The dim streets of Yushibana were empty, but the snow prevented them from going as fast as they wanted to. They had to be careful not to let the wheel marks show their destination.{w} When he had calmed down, Atase lifted the box's lid."
    "丰花昏暗的街道上空无一人，积雪却让他们没法把车开得像预想中那么快。他们得小心，别让车轮印暴露目的地。{w} 等心绪平复下来，Atase 掀开了盒盖。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057264_1_b11c827d:
    # "He saw one of the Sekimeiya. It had to be what Ashiya had announced, as Atase had never seen a gemstone like it."
    "他看见了其中一颗 Sekimeiya。那应该就是芦屋公布过的那颗——Atase 从未见过这样的宝石。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057270_1_ce53aea3:
    # "Out of the blue, they heard a siren behind them.{w} Through the rearview mirror, they could see a police car approaching."
    "突然，身后传来警笛声。{w} 他们从后视镜里看见一辆警车正逼近。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057271_1_f8e37241:
    # "Wh-What!?{w} Stop! Don't keep going!"
    "「什、什么！？{w} 停车！别再开了！」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057277_1_50cfca6f:
    # "Pale, Faiten pulled over to the right. He couldn't muster a word—he slowly looked at the box on Atase's lap.{w} Had Ashiya set a trap for them?"
    "Faiten 脸色发白，把车靠向右侧。他一句话也说不出来，只是缓缓看向 Atase 膝上的盒子。{w} 是芦屋设下的圈套吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057278_1_c196488a:
    # "...Don't tell me there's a tracker in that box."
    "「……别告诉我那盒子里装了追踪器。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057279_1_cc91f98e:
    # "What? No, I didn't see anything."
    "「什么？没有，我什么也没看到。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057282_1_e3edc7bc:
    # "A police officer knocked on their door, demanding they open it."
    "一名警察敲了敲车门，命令他们把门打开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057291_1_700de2e6:
    # "What's the problem?"
    "「有什么问题吗？」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057292_1_0a0d8eec:
    # "We were notified your vehicle almost ran over someone at Maura. Two people saw you going at a much faster speed than the limit allowed."
    "「我们接到通报，说你们的车在莫拉差点撞到人。有两个人看到你们以远超限速的速度行驶。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057293_1_c41f0e77:
    # "...Oh, is that so? Sorry, I don't remember how fast I was going."
    "「……哦，是吗？抱歉，我不记得自己当时开得多快。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057294_1_995afac7:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057295_1_6f529179:
    # "The officer paused as he smelled the air.{w} ...Inside the vehicle, both men frowned. What was he doing?"
    "警察停了下来，嗅了嗅空气。{w}……车内，两个男人都皱起了眉。他在做什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057297_1_4b920184:
    # "Hand me your license, please."
    "「请把驾照给我。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057298_1_fdc2275e:
    # "Faiten took out a few documents from the glove compartment and handed them to the officer."
    "Faiten 从手套箱里取出几份证件，递给警察。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057300_1_a85e8491:
    # "Step out of the vehicle."
    "「下车。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057301_1_bc218a1f:
    # "S-Sure."
    "「好、好的。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057306_1_49a8a49f:
    # "...This is a screening device. Please take a breath test."
    "「……这是检测仪。请对着它吹一口气。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057310_1_1e2641f8:
    # "After a minute, the officer looked at the result.{w} It said \"zero\"."
    "一分钟后，警察看了看结果。{w} 上面显示「零」。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057311_1_67ba658d:
    # "There are no traces of alcohol on you."
    "「你身上没有酒精反应。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057312_1_445fd274:
    # "Of course. I would never drink before driving."
    "「当然。我开车前从不喝酒。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057313_1_6ffe03fc:
    # "...{w}You can get back in the vehicle.{w} Please, make sure you don't drive over the speed limit."
    "「……{w}你可以回车里了。{w} 请务必不要超速。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057314_1_643aca45:
    # "Yes, I'm sorry. If I went over it, I promise that I didn't notice."
    "「好的，抱歉。要是我超速了，我保证自己当时真没察觉。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057318_1_878da558:
    # "Faiten stepped into the car. As he did so, the officer received a radio call.{w} Trying to hide his haste, Faiten asked if he could get going."
    "Faiten 坐回车里。就在这时，警察接到了无线电呼叫。{w} Faiten 掩饰着自己的急切，问他能不能走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057319_1_c1b29e3a:
    # "With his hand, the officer indicated to hold off."
    "警察抬手示意他稍等。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057323_1_fa047093:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057326_1_d9447305:
    # "Suddenly, the officer's look changed.{w} Both men noticed he was staring at the brown box.{w} Then, the officer saw something else. On Atase's attire, there was an Ashiya logo."
    "忽然，警察的神色变了。{w} 两人都注意到，他正盯着那个棕色盒子。{w} 紧接着，警察又发现 Atase 的衣服上印着芦屋的标志。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057327_1_1889d8d2:
    # "What's in that box?"
    "「那盒子里装的是什么？」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057328_1_23761e79:
    # "In this one? A present for my girl."
    "「这个？给我女朋友的礼物。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057329_1_e57b11e8:
    # "Give it to me."
    "「把它给我。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057330_1_43facea3:
    # "...Should I? It's snowing, and I wouldn't like it to get dirty."
    "「……有这个必要吗？外面正下着雪，我可不想把它弄脏。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057331_1_b30ce2cc:
    # "Please give me that box."
    "「请把那个盒子给我。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057333_1_84487a1b:
    # "Slowly, Faiten took it and handed it to the officer.{w} He lifted the lid, and his eyes didn't waver."
    "Faiten 缓缓拿起盒子，递给警察。{w} 警察掀开盒盖，目光没有丝毫动摇。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057334_1_8e835cb4:
    # "Both of you step out of the vehicle."
    "「你们两个都下车。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057335_1_f144705d:
    # "Faiten and Atase looked at each other. Then, after a pause, Faiten extricated his lower body from below the dashboard.{w} The officer never expected the car to accelerate as he did.{w} It was Atase's foot that pressed down the accelerator. Immediately, the officer ran to his car as he yelled for them to stop."
    "Faiten 和 Atase 对视一眼。停顿片刻后，Faiten 把腿从仪表盘下方抽了出来。{w} 警察完全没料到车子会突然加速。{w} 是 Atase 踩下了油门。警察立刻奔向自己的车，一边大喊让他们停车。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057343_1_c1b3d9e3:
    # "Later into the night, a handful of men were in Musashi Gemstones.{w} Everyone had been ordered to leave, and the scene had been preserved as well as possible."
    "夜深之后，武藏宝石店里还留着几个人。{w} 所有人都被命令离开，现场也尽可能保持原样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057344_1_15f7ef68:
    # "Atsuki Hakutoki and Gan had been sent to the hospital. Their physical condition was fine, but they'd have to spend the night there."
    "Atsuki Hakutoki 和 Gan 已被送往医院。两人身体没有大碍，但得在医院过一夜。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057347_1_e1ddd824:
    # "Under the shop was a channel sheltered from the icy air. There had been two more people inside at the time of the explosion. One of them had fallen through the floor, whereas the other had died on the spot."
    "店铺底下有一条通道，寒气侵不进去。爆炸发生时，店里还有两个人。其中一人从塌陷的地板坠落下去，另一人则当场死亡。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057348_1_f7317b16:
    # "Shiroya Mirana had hit her head after falling from high up and entered a coma. As soon as the paramedics had reached that place, she had been taken to the hospital too.{w} A few people were scattered around where her body had fallen."
    "Shiroya Mirana 从高处摔下时撞到了头，陷入昏迷。急救人员赶到后，她也被送往医院。{w} 在她坠落的位置周围，零散地站着几个人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057351_1_fd0e1286:
    # "The forensic team. They were investigating the scene and had confirmed that the missing girl, Miiya Moiromo, had died."
    "是鉴识小组。他们正在勘查现场，并已确认失踪的女孩 Miiya Moiromo 已经死亡。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057352_1_c10bda95:
    # "Something else had fallen with the rubble. An open box, identical to the one Atase had received.{w} Its lid had burst open on impact, and its contents had rolled away. A handful of people had seen the shining, egg-shaped stone within the darkness, but nobody had been allowed to touch anything. Its faint shine highlighted the drop of blood that had arced across its surface."
    "还有一样东西和瓦砾一同坠落——一只盒子，和 Atase 收到的那只一模一样。{w} 盒盖在撞击中弹开，里面的东西滚了出去。有几个人在黑暗中看见了那颗发亮的蛋形石头，但谁都不准碰任何东西。它幽微的光映照着溅在表面的一道血痕。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057353_1_777f8912:
    # "When a woman from the forensic team felt the gem for the first time, she was taken aback. ...It was very hot.{w} Ashiya had quickly learned that only one of the Sekimeiya had been taken and asked the investigation team to return the fallen one. However, as it was related to the incident, it had to be inspected by them first."
    "鉴识小组的一名女成员第一次摸到那颗宝石时，吃了一惊。……它烫得厉害。{w}芦屋很快得知只有一颗 Sekimeiya 被拿走，便要求调查组归还掉落的那颗。可由于它与案件有关，必须先由调查组检查。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057355_1_4804d0b0:
    # "The woman grabbed the box and shut it inside. Then, gripping a flashlight with her tight latex gloves, she kept searching around the place."
    "女人拿起盒子，把宝石放进去，合上了盒盖。随后，她戴着紧贴手部的乳胶手套，握着手电筒继续在周围搜寻。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057364_1_d870a2a3:
    # "When midnight hit, it was December."
    "午夜降临时，已经是十二月了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057370_1_5d4e30ee:
    # "Katei's night shift had begun. Before entering the security room, he had spoken to Lei."
    "Katei 的夜班开始了。进监控室之前，他先和 Lei 说了几句话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057371_1_9bcc8b1a:
    # "Xyn had attacked the gem shop. However, for the first time, their plan had failed due to external factors; the Sekimeiya would be returned to Ashiya."
    "Xyn 袭击了宝石店。然而这一次，他们的计划头一回因为外部因素而落了空；Sekimeiya 即将被送回芦屋。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057372_1_cdf4634b:
    # "How had Xyn learned about the location? Katei didn't know, but it didn't matter.{w} The preparations for his plan had been completed, so he needed Xyn to attack again. It wasn't in Ashiya's interests to pursue the attack of the 30th any further. As if nothing had happened, the Sekimeiya plan needed to continue as devised."
    "Xyn 是怎么查到那个地点的？Katei 不得而知，但这已无关紧要。{w}他计划的准备工作已经就绪，所以他需要 Xyn 再动一次手。继续追查 30 日那起袭击，对芦屋没有好处。要像什么都没发生过一样，让 Sekimeiya 计划按原定方案继续推进下去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057381_1_3d548bc0:
    # "When the stillness had gone on for a while, Katei listened to the latest recording.{w} Nothing related to Xyn was there. Since Ido had told them about the Sekimeiya, the recordings had been nothing but uneventful."
    "静默持续了一阵，Katei 听了最新的录音。{w}里面没有半点与 Xyn 相关的内容。自从 Ido 向他们提起 Sekimeiya 之后，录音就一直平淡无奇。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057382_1_5ae8936f:
    # "The SD card behind the device had been swapped out. If the device was ever found in the tower, Katei didn't want the information he had to be revealed; he needed it for himself.{w} It was a small card that wouldn't be questioned, so he could easily leave the building with it. After listening to Xyn's brief meeting, he had saved the recording on his own computer, inserting a new, empty card in the recording device."
    "装置背面的 SD 卡已经换过了。万一这装置在塔里被人发现，Katei 不希望自己掌握的情报暴露出去；那份情报他还有用。{w}那不过是张小卡，不会有人起疑，他能轻易带着它离开大楼。听完 Xyn 那场简短会议的录音后，他把录音存进了自己的电脑，再往录音装置里换上一张空白的卡。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057393_1_1443d7f7:
    # "At home, Lei hadn't calmed down yet. A young girl had died in Musashi Gemstones, and she'd learned the initial details."
    "在家里，Lei 还没能平静下来。武藏宝石有个小女孩死了，她已经得知了初步情况。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057395_1_917b87fa:
    # "Xyn had impersonated Ashiya. Yet again, they had possessed confidential information to carry out their plan."
    "Xyn冒充了芦屋的人。他们又一次掌握了机密情报，才得以实施计划。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057396_1_4689c9d2:
    # "However, they hadn't known about the second Sekimeiya. After being given one, they had released a potent gas in the small shop which had put everyone to sleep."
    "可他们并不知道还有第二个 Sekimeiya。拿到其中一个后，他们在小店里释放了强效气体，让所有人都昏睡过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057397_1_b966705a:
    # "The girl's death hadn't been part of Xyn's plan. It had been the result of a common domestic accident, but Xyn had made it possible."
    "女孩的死并不在 Xyn 的计划之中。那本来只是一起普通的家中意外，可正因为 Xyn，它才真的发生了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057398_1_f91ca19b:
    # "The Sekimeiya Xyn had stolen was being brought back to Ashiya, but the other one, which had fallen through the shop's floor, had been taken by the forensics. Lei had insisted that it be returned and kept cold; Gan had warned her about the temperature, but she had been told she would have to wait 36 hours."
    "Xyn 偷走的 Sekimeiya 正被送回芦屋，可另一个从店内地板掉下去的，已被鉴识人员取走。Lei 坚持要把它取回并冷藏保存；Gan 提醒过她温度的问题，但对方告诉她必须等上 36 个小时。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057408_1_d9ae5cd0:
    # "You fucked up badly."
    "你们捅的篓子可不小。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057410_1_ad889bf9:
    # "Atase and Faiten had explained the events to his boss. They'd managed to slip away and safely arrived at the meeting place."
    "Atase和Faiten已经向老板说明了经过。他们设法脱身，平安抵达了会合地点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057411_1_dcc1c17b:
    # "Jiro looked stern. He wasn't a man to grow uncontrollably angry, but his eyes showed how displeased he was."
    "Jiro神情严峻。他不是那种会任由怒火失控的人，但眼里已写满了不快。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057412_1_002883d9:
    # "Are you convinced you won't be tracked here?"
    "你确定他们不会追到这里来？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057413_1_7859008b:
    # "Absolutely.{w} The car is parked quite a ways away, but the police will find it soon. We have to give it up."
    "确定。{w}车停在很远的地方，但警察很快就能找到。那辆车只能放弃了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057414_1_bd2315bb:
    # "...{w}Have you learned what happened?"
    "……{w}出的事，你们听说了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057416_1_d9a61c6c:
    # "Wh-What do you mean?"
    "什、什么意思？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057417_1_585486ce:
    # "Someone died in Musashi. There was a gas explosion after you left."
    "武藏宝石那边死了人。你们走后，那里发生了燃气爆炸。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057418_1_85710e0c:
    # "Both lackeys looked at each other, lost for words."
    "两个手下面面相觑，说不出话来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057419_1_f4b80c1a:
    # "I-It can't be. We didn't do anything."
    "不、不可能。我们什么都没做。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057422_1_c3243bd9:
    # "Watch the news tomorrow. You knocked everyone out, so no one noticed the heater was busted and leaking gas. When Ashiya entered, there was an explosion. You killed a civilian. Someone else was sent to the hospital in a coma."
    "明天看看新闻吧。你们把所有人都弄晕了，所以没人发现取暖器坏了，正在漏气。芦屋的人一进门，就发生了爆炸。你们害死了一个平民。还有一个人被送进医院，陷入昏迷。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057423_1_4c1be89b:
    # "Do you understand? This is a major fuck up. Xyn does {i}not{/} get involved in murder cases."
    "听明白了吗？这次篓子捅大了。Xyn{i}绝不{/}插手命案。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057424_1_d0309158:
    # "...That wasn't our fault, though. We did as planned."
    "……可那不是我们的错。我们都是按计划行事的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057425_1_26a5fc05:
    # "You're right. All you did was draw the police to you and lose the Sekimeiya. You both should've been arrested, but now you're going to land us all in hot water."
    "说得对。你们做的，不过是把警察引到自己身上，再把Sekimeiya弄丢。你们俩本该被抓进去，可现在你们要把我们全都拖下水。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057426_1_20c894b8:
    # "...{w}I don't think I'll be recognized."
    "……{w}我想不会有人认出我吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057427_1_0547886f:
    # "Atase, shut up. You might be done for already."
    "Atase，闭嘴。你也许已经完了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057428_1_11574bc3:
    # "What...?"
    "什么……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057431_1_5a0a0c9b:
    # "I'm going to ask you the same thing I did once already. Did everything truly go as planned on the 24th?"
    "有件事我之前已经问过你了，现在再问一遍。24号那天，一切真的都照计划走了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057432_1_206b6403:
    # "Y-Yes. Why are you asking this again?"
    "是、是的。为什么又问这个？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057433_1_4e421561:
    # "That afternoon, an unidentified person escaped from a prison cell. I was later called and told that you were seen near that place, wearing the same clothes as them."
    "那天下午，有个身份不明的人从牢房里逃了出来。后来有人打电话给我，说你被人看到在那附近，穿的衣服和那人一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057434_1_2ea3414f:
    # "Wait, what!? That wasn't me! I was in the tower at that time!"
    "等等，什么！？那不是我！那会儿我正在塔里！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057435_1_83a1ae00:
    # "You say that, but we erased those records.{w} I don't know what the fuck is going on with you, but what just happened isn't acceptable. Now you're being hunted for causing a death, and the police pulled you over. Both of you are basically sacrificial lambs at this point."
    "你嘴上这么说，可那些记录已经被我们抹掉了。{w}我不知道你那边到底在搞什么鬼，但刚才发生的事不能就这么算了。现在你因为闹出人命被追捕，警察还拦了你们的车。到这一步，你们两个基本上就是弃子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057436_1_73f8889e:
    # "Atase couldn't believe what he was hearing. He'd been part of Xyn for many years, and he'd never been told something like that."
    "Atase不敢相信自己的耳朵。他在Xyn里待了这么多年，从没听过这样的话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057439_1_f2f78cea:
    # "...Then what should we do?"
    "……那我们该怎么办？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057440_1_9990068a:
    # "You have to be quiet. Wait, and when you're arrested, you stay quiet."
    "你们得管住嘴。等着，就算被抓了也别开口。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057441_1_39620295:
    # "Come on, we won't say anything, but isn't there something you can do?"
    "别这样，我们什么都不会说，可你就不能想想办法吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057442_1_dc4ec2df:
    # "Something I can do? What do you want, to go live in a different country?"
    "想办法？你们想怎样，跑到国外去生活吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057443_1_8f4a8346:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057444_1_fe3efaee:
    # "Why would I help you two? You allowed our first failure against Ashiya. I'm not sticking my neck out here. Anything involving you from now on will be exceptionally problematic."
    "我凭什么帮你们？我们第一次败在芦屋手上，就是你们害的。我不会为你们冒这种险。从今往后，凡是跟你们沾边的事都会麻烦得要命。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057449_1_a10ac2cb:
    # "...What about the Sekimeiya?"
    "……那Sekimeiya呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057450_1_65fc9657:
    # "What about it?"
    "它怎么了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057451_1_e4a51345:
    # "Are we... gonna do anything else about it?"
    "我们……还要对它做些什么吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057452_1_b383399d:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057453_1_dcfcd656:
    # "Jiro didn't have an immediate answer for that question."
    "Jiro一时答不上来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057454_1_1be1ed4a:
    # "Did you see it?"
    "你见到它了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057455_1_428a617b:
    # "I did. I was surprised by how it looked.{w} It honestly looks like an egg made of marble, and I think it was shining a little."
    "见到了。它的样子让我吃了一惊。{w}说实话，看着就像一颗大理石做的蛋，好像还微微发着光。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057456_1_248fbfdf:
    # "...An egg? How big was it?"
    "……蛋？多大？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057457_1_77bb5093:
    # "A bit more than the length of this finger, I'd say."
    "大概比这根手指长一点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057458_1_74265bfb:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057461_1_38c9df19:
    # "Jiro was pensive for a while. His plan had been so close to working, but he couldn't blindly throw out a new move."
    "Jiro沉思了一会儿。他的计划本来差一点就成功了，但他不能贸然再出新招。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057462_1_007cf27a:
    # "Go home for now.{w} Atase, I want you here tomorrow at {time=14.}"
    "先回家去吧。{w}Atase，明天{time=14.}我要你到这里来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057463_1_ea410a68:
    # "...Okay. I'll be here."
    "……好。我会来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057467_1_6b8bc3bf:
    # "Both men knew not to push the issue, so they slowly stepped out of the room."
    "两人都明白不该再追问下去，便缓缓退出了房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057475_1_c320bc0a:
    # "Atase got home late into the night. He'd lived alone for years, so he had nobody to wake up.{w} The first thing he did was look up the recent news."
    "Atase 回到家时已是深夜。他独居多年，不必担心吵醒谁。{w}他做的第一件事，就是查看最近的新闻。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057476_1_351f1051:
    # "As he'd been told, he came across an article from the 24th of November. Someone had escaped from a prison cell, but the story was enigmatic.{w} It hadn't been him; as he'd said, he had been in Ashiya Tower at the time. However, he couldn't help but feel that the man in the attached picture did strangely resemble him."
    "他按吩咐去查，翻到了一篇11月24日的报道。有人从牢房里逃了出来，但报道写得语焉不详。{w}那并不是他；正如他所说，当时他人在芦屋塔。然而，他忍不住觉得，报道所附照片里的那个男人，竟和他莫名地相似。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057480_1_a8790ca1:
    # "When the sun rose, Atase still hadn't managed to fall asleep."
    "直到太阳升起，Atase 始终没能睡着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057481_1_c02691f5:
    # "The latest news was posted online, and he didn't have to search for what he wanted. The highlighted article said: \"Twenty-year-old girl dies by gas explosion in Yushibana\"."
    "最新消息已经发布到网上，他想找的内容根本不用费心去搜。首页醒目的那篇报道写着：「丰花一名二十岁少女死于煤气爆炸」。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057482_1_414b8326:
    # "His eyes locked onto the headline painfully, and he was unable to clear his suddenly clogged throat. It was the first time his actions had killed someone.{w} When he read that two friends of the girl had been there, a cold hollow expanded within his chest. He vividly remembered how he'd received the death of a close friend of his years ago. It hadn't been his intention, but he had created that pain for someone else, and a friend of the girl he'd killed was in grave danger as well.{w} It was the last thing he'd ever wanted to happen. However, his mind kept going to what his boss had said. It was true—his situation was volatile."
    "他痛苦地盯着那行标题，喉咙突然堵得厉害，怎么清嗓子也清不开。这是他第一次因为自己的行动害死人。{w}读到少女的两位朋友当时也在场，一股冰冷的空洞感在胸口蔓延开来。他清楚地记得，多年前得知挚友死讯时，自己是什么感受。他并非有意，却让别人承受了同样的痛苦；而他害死的那个少女的朋友，如今也身陷险境。{w}这是他最不愿发生的事。可是，上司的话一次次在他脑中响起。的确——他的处境随时可能生变。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057483_1_bd4e9313:
    # "He frowned as he finished reading the article.{w} He went over it again to confirm he hadn't been mistaken, but there was no mention of Xyn or their plan."
    "读完报道，他皱起了眉。{w}他又从头看了一遍，确认自己没有看错，可文中只字未提 Xyn，也没提到他们的计划。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057484_1_c0fa9a52:
    # "Why...? There was no way Ashiya didn't think Xyn had been behind it. However, they hadn't been mentioned, nor had the Sekimeiya..."
    "为什么……？芦屋不可能想不到是 Xyn 干的。可是报道里既没有提到他们，也没有提到 Sekimeiya……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057496_1_b6024fd0:
    # "Initial Singularity"
    "初始奇点"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057502_1_794d4bcb:
    # "The appointed time came. Atase had been able to get a bit of sleep, and he sat in front of his boss after a silent nod."
    "约定的时间到了。Atase 总算睡了一会儿，他沉默地点了下头，坐到上司对面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057503_1_0d055ec9:
    # "We're going to wait for Ido to come. He'll be here soon."
    "我们等 Ido 过来。他马上就到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057504_1_c3eae306:
    # "All right."
    "好。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057505_1_b5f6ca84:
    # "Ashiya haven't stopped talking about this Sekimeiya, and it was found two days before its announcement. Like you said, they're doing something in the tower, I have no doubt—that's why our name wasn't on the news."
    "芦屋那边一直在议论这个 Sekimeiya，而它是在公布前两天才被发现的。正如你说的，他们肯定在塔里动了手脚，我毫不怀疑——所以我们才没上新闻。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057506_1_a1178f98:
    # "...Yes, that's very likely. I also noticed that."
    "……嗯，很有可能。我也注意到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057507_1_84d8b1ac:
    # "A surprising amount of people have echoed Ashiya. It appears the Sekimeiya event is gaining a lot of traction. There's been a great deal of interest in it."
    "附和芦屋说法的人多得惊人。看来 Sekimeiya 的活动声势越来越大，外界的兴趣相当浓厚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057508_1_80245938:
    # "Do you remember what Ido was told? Katei Kuiji's information was real, and he said they're doing their best to catch us before the 15th. They were sending the Sekimeiya to the tower, expecting our attack before the event."
    "还记得 Ido 打听到的话吗？Katei Kuiji 的情报是真的，他说他们正竭尽全力要在15号之前抓住我们。他们把 Sekimeiya 送进塔里，就是料到我们会在活动之前动手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057509_1_cdce4859:
    # "Right."
    "嗯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057510_1_23ba0559:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057514_1_fce834cd:
    # "There was a knock at the door."
    "门外传来敲门声。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057515_1_7b876c7d:
    # "\"Enter.\"{w} Ido stepped in, sensing the tense atmosphere. Then, he sat beside Atase."
    "「进来。」{w}Ido 推门而入，察觉到了屋内的紧张气氛，随后在 Atase 身旁坐下。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057516_1_0211bd74:
    # "Did you get it?"
    "拿到了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057517_1_cb859ad2:
    # "...Yes. I didn't think I would, but I have what you asked for."
    "……拿到了。我本来没抱希望，不过你要的东西我带来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057518_1_98091833:
    # "The tower's janitor put his hand in his pocket and slowly took out a rectangular piece of paper.{w} It was a photograph. He handed it to his boss, who stared at it intensely."
    "这位塔里的清洁工把手伸进口袋，缓缓取出一张长方形的纸。{w}那是一张照片。他把它递给上司，上司目不转睛地盯着它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057519_1_7970659c:
    # "You were right. It looks like an egg made of marble."
    "你说得没错。它看起来就像一颗大理石做的蛋。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057520_1_fc8f8650:
    # "When he showed it to Atase, he saw the same gemstone that had been inside the box. It was shut behind glass, and the wall in the background was from inside the tower."
    "他把照片拿给 Atase 看。Atase 认出，那正是原先装在盒子里的那块宝石。它封在玻璃后面，背景中的墙壁是塔内的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057521_1_bee8e6b9:
    # "Y-You took a picture of it? Isn't that risky as hell?"
    "你、你拍了照片？这风险也太大了吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057522_1_6a3b1bcf:
    # "That's what I thought too, but it went well."
    "我也这么想，不过结果还算顺利。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057525_1_508c8f47:
    # "Xyn had figured out a way to sneak tiny devices into the tower. That was the reason they'd chosen Ido as their associate.{w} Staff members were frequently inspected upon arrival, especially after Xyn's first attacks. However, the janitor's job entailed the maintenance of the tower's plaza. By bringing the cleaning cart outside of the building and using a different Xyn member to drop the desired device in it, they had managed to slip a small camera into the tower."
    "Xyn 摸索出了一套把微型装置带进塔里的办法。他们也正因此才选中 Ido 做内应。{w}员工每次进塔都要接受频繁的检查，Xyn 最初的几次袭击之后更是如此。不过清洁工的工作包括维护塔前的广场。他们先把清洁车推到楼外，再由另一名 Xyn 成员把需要的装置丢进车里，就这样把小巧的摄像头带进了塔。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057526_1_4cbc70c0:
    # "How did you do it, though?"
    "可你是怎么做到的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057531_1_9f6f5ba0:
    # "The Sekimeiya was brought to the event room, and it was inside a cabinet. I hoped it would be out of all the security cameras' sight at some point, but that wasn't the case.{w} I wanted to use the cart to cover my hands so that I wouldn't be seen taking the picture, but it was easier than that.{w} Entering the event room was forbidden to the public, but I stepped in to clean it. As soon as I did, Katei Kuiji entered too—his night shift was about to end. It was very fortunate because a long curtain covered the Sekimeiya. He asked if I was curious about it and offered to let me see it."
    "Sekimeiya 被送进了水晶展室，放在展示柜里。我原本指望它总有一刻会避开所有监控摄像头的视野，可并没有。{w}我本想用清洁车挡住双手，免得被人看见我在拍照，但实际比这还容易。{w}水晶展室不向公众开放，不过我是进去打扫的。我刚进去，Katei Kuiji 也跟着进来了——他的夜班快结束了。运气实在好，因为有一块长遮布盖着 Sekimeiya。他问我好不好奇，还说可以让我看看。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057536_1_2d940a8a:
    # "...{w}Is that so?{w} What did he say this time?"
    "……{w}是这样吗？{w}他这次都说了些什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057537_1_1fa06f0e:
    # "He seemed to want to make small talk. I believe he doesn't suspect me.{w} He had a key for the cabinet, and he said they'd only made one for the event so that Xyn wouldn't be able to unlock it.{w} He even used it to open the cabinet and let me touch the Sekimeiya. It was pretty smooth and felt like cold marble.{w} It was kept refrigerated because it can apparently get damaged otherwise. He didn't say much else of importance, but he kept reiterating that they're hard at work upgrading their security measures to catch us."
    "他似乎只是想闲聊几句。我看他并不怀疑我。{w}他有一把展示柜的钥匙，说为了这次活动只配了一把，好让 Xyn 打不开柜子。{w}他甚至用那把钥匙打开柜子，让我摸了摸 Sekimeiya。它相当光滑，摸起来像冰凉的大理石。{w}它一直冷藏保存，据说否则会受损。别的要紧话他没多说，只是一再强调他们正加紧升级安保措施，好抓住我们。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057539_1_a15320a1:
    # "...What the hell is that man doing?"
    "……那家伙到底在干什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057540_1_db641b5e:
    # "I don't know, but when he left, I knew nobody was going to be in the security room for a very short time. That's when I took the picture. ...Just in case the footage is ever reviewed, I still did it covered by the cart, so I'll only be seen uncovering the curtain again."
    "我不知道，不过他离开时，我知道监控室会有一小段时间没人。我就是那时候拍的照片。……为防万一录像被人回看，我拍照时还是用清洁车挡着，所以录像里最多只会看到我再次掀开遮布。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057541_1_51087fc4:
    # "Jiro's eyes had a glint to them. He knew they couldn't take things lightly."
    "Jiro 眼神一凛。他明白这件事马虎不得。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057544_1_90d22ffb:
    # "Do you know what the upgraded security measures he talked about could be?"
    "你知不知道他说的升级安保可能是什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057545_1_95450cbe:
    # "No. He didn't elaborate, and I haven't noticed any difference."
    "不知道。他没有细说，我也没察觉出任何变化。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057546_1_605cbf8a:
    # "It's strange. You said the cabinet where the Sekimeiya is can be locked and unlocked with a single key. When they did that in the past, we broke them open, so they must've accounted for that.{w} When they linked an alarm to the cabinets, we disabled it remotely thanks to our access to their computer. Given what you've said, it's likely they're doing something similar, and that's why they cleaned their entire system. However, infecting it again to intercept what they're doing might be what they're waiting for."
    "奇怪。你说过，放 Sekimeiya 的那个展示柜只用一把钥匙就能开关。以前他们也是这么做的，结果被我们撬开了，所以他们肯定考虑过这一点。{w}后来他们给展示柜连上警报，我们通过侵入他们的电脑远程关掉了。照你说的来看，他们很可能在做类似的事，所以才清理了整个系统。不过，如果我们为了掌握他们的动向再次感染系统，说不定正是他们等着我们做的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057551_1_bcbd153d:
    # "A long time ago, Xyn had the chance to manually install a piece of software they'd created on Ashiya's computer. Thanks to the cleaning cart, they'd brought a storage device inside, and by keeping it in Ido's locker, they'd waited for the chance they'd needed. When the security staff was drawn out of their room, Ido had the chance to boot it up in their system."
    "很久以前，Xyn 曾有机会亲手把他们制作的软件装进芦屋的电脑。他们靠清洁车把一个存储设备带进塔内，藏在 Ido 的储物柜里，等待时机。等到安保人员被引开、离开监控室的那一刻，Ido 便得以在那台电脑上启动它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057552_1_82614114:
    # "Despite Xyn's knowledge in the field, creating an undetectable malicious program wasn't simple. Because of that, the application they placed on the computer was a harmless one. That allowed it to stay hidden, only booting up for instants at a time.{w} Its purpose was to check a path on the cloud owned by Xyn. If it contained a file, it would be downloaded and executed. However, if the file had already been downloaded once, the process wouldn't be repeated.{w} That remote method allowed Xyn to gain access to Ashiya's computer. They knew about their security system, but a malicious file couldn't remain undetectable for long. By shuffling it every few days, however, they had kept their connection to the computer for months."
    "尽管 Xyn 在这方面颇有本事，要写出一个无法被检测的恶意程序却并不简单。因此，他们装在电脑上的程序是无害的。正因如此，它才能一直隐藏，每次只启动一瞬。{w}它的用途是检查 Xyn 名下云端的一个路径。若那里有文件，它就会下载并执行。不过，若该文件已经下载过一次，这个过程就不会重复。{w}靠这种远程手段，Xyn 得以访问芦屋的电脑。他们了解对方的安保系统，可恶意文件瞒不了太久。于是他们每隔几天就换一次文件，就这样让与那台电脑的连接维持了数月。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057555_1_42693b06:
    # "It entailed a risk. If the server file was found at any given time, reverse tracking Xyn could've been feasible. To prevent that, they had made sure their file wouldn't ever be automatically detected, but their connection to Ashiya had been cut a few days previously. They knew the computer had undergone a thorough cleanup that had managed to erase Xyn's file in the process.{w} However, what about the application that had been manually installed months ago? Had it been erased too?"
    "这其中也有风险。只要服务器上的文件在某一刻被发现，顺藤摸瓜追查 Xyn 并非不可能。为防万一，他们确保自己的文件永远不会被自动检测到，但几天前，他们与芦屋电脑的连接还是断了。他们知道那台电脑经过了彻底清理，Xyn 的文件也在过程中被抹去。{w}可是，几个月前手动安装的那个程序呢？它是否也被一并清除了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057556_1_6b27ce96:
    # "Jiro feared the reason behind the computer's cleanup. If their original application was still present within the computer, they could infect it again by putting up a new file on the path. What Jiro didn't like was the thought that Ashiya were monitoring every change.{w} While the file itself couldn't be detected as malicious, they might've committed a manual cleanup to assure it or anything similar would be deleted. Then, if Xyn remotely downloaded a new one, its appearance would be noticed, and although it wouldn't be detected as malicious, Ashiya could be sure Xyn had sent it."
    "Jiro 担心的是电脑被清理背后的原因。假如他们原先的程序还留在电脑里，只要在云端路径上放一个新文件，就能再次感染它。让 Jiro 不安的是，芦屋或许正在监视每一次变动。{w}文件本身虽不会被判定为恶意，他们却可能特意做了一次人工清理，以确保它或类似的东西被删掉。这样一来，如果 Xyn 远程下载了新文件，文件的出现就会被察觉；即便不被判为恶意，芦屋也能确定是 Xyn 送进来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057557_1_ead8e57a:
    # "He had come up with a test. To know if their original application was still there, he put up a different file on the path. Upon execution, it would send a request to a web server before deleting itself.{w} The request had been received, so Jiro knew infecting Ashiya's computer again was possible. However, he was considerably hesitant about doing it."
    "他想出了一个试探的办法。为了确认原先的程序是否还在，他在那个路径上放了一个不同的文件。它一旦被执行，就会向一台网络服务器发送请求，然后自行删除。{w}请求已经收到，Jiro 由此知道再次感染芦屋的电脑是可行的。然而，他迟迟下不了决心。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057562_1_17d253c1:
    # "The event will be on the 15th, but until then, it seems the Sekimeiya will be in the event room, merely locked inside a cabinet. Nothing we can do should involve breaking it open.{w} It'll be there for two weeks; they definitely expect our attack, and they think it'll happen during any night.{w} You said the cabinet looks different than all the others, right? It was prepared specifically for this, and the computer was cleaned up. I'll repeat that Katei Kuiji said their intent is to catch us before the 15th.{w} There's one more thing that caught my attention. You were told that they'd only made one key for the day of the event. This means the key will be used on the 15th."
    "活动在15号举行。在那之前，Sekimeiya 似乎会一直放在活动室，就锁在展示柜里。我们无论做什么，都不该走撬柜子这条路。{w}它要在那里放两个星期；他们显然料到我们会动手，而且认为会在某一个夜里发生。{w}你说过，那个展示柜和别的都不一样，对吧？它是为这次活动专门准备的，电脑也清理过了。我再重复一遍，Katei Kuiji 说他们的打算是在15号之前抓住我们。{w}还有一点让我在意。你听说他们只为活动当天配了一把钥匙。这意味着那把钥匙会在15号用上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057563_1_22b6135d:
    # "Oh, yes. He said he'd let me be the first to touch it and warned me to be very gentle."
    "啊，对。他说会让我第一个摸它，还叮嘱我要非常小心。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057564_1_a8b0a2b7:
    # "The first to touch it. So they'll let visitors feel it during the event. That confirms that they'll unlock the cabinet, which we can't and shouldn't try to do."
    "第一个摸它。这么说，活动期间他们会让参观者亲手触摸。那就证实了他们会打开柜子——而这正是我们不能、也不该去尝试的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057565_1_99252fba:
    # "Both subordinates were paying close attention and slowly understood what Jiro was getting at."
    "两名部下都听得聚精会神，渐渐明白了 Jiro 的意思。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057568_1_559bff02:
    # "If we're going to attack, there are many reasons why it should be on the very day of the event. Now that Ashiya are putting so much effort into this, we can't follow along with their expectations.{w} ...And there's another important reason why we shouldn't try to steal the Sekimeiya any day before the 15th.{w} Since the announcement, Ashiya haven't stopped building excitement for this mysterious gemstone; they're likely being excessive on purpose. Today, the Sekimeiya's value is already greater than yesterday's. Every day it's kept as a mystery, Ashiya are artificially inflating its value.{w} On the 15th, the Sekimeiya's value will be the highest it can be. That is when we want it."
    "既然要动手，就有很多理由说明该选在活动当天。芦屋现在投入了这么多心力，我们偏不能顺着他们的预想来。{w}……而且还有一个重要的理由，说明我们不该在15号之前的任何一天去偷 Sekimeiya。{w}自公布以来，芦屋一直在为这块神秘宝石造势，恐怕是故意做得过头。今天 Sekimeiya 的价值已经超过昨天。它每多神秘一天，芦屋就在人为地抬高它的价值。{w}到15号，Sekimeiya 的价值会达到顶点。那才是我们下手的时候。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057570_1_b34ec3e2:
    # "...How would we actually get it, though? It will always be guarded when the cabinet's open, and there's a security camera in the room."
    "……可我们究竟要怎么拿到它？柜子打开的时候，它一定有人看守，而且活动室里还装着监控摄像头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057573_1_3258ded6:
    # "Ashiya are supposedly raising the scale of their measures. So should we.{w} You're right. When the cabinet is unlocked, we won't easily be able to access the Sekimeiya. But when it's locked, there's no way we will.{w} It is possible we could acquire the single key they have, but that's not exactly likely, and it would pretty much reveal Ido. This is why I'm willing to prioritize my first idea.{w} I asked you to bring a picture of the Sekimeiya because I found Atase's description of it interesting. It was supposedly found on Airun, that derelict mountain. I find that very hard to believe.{w} Where did Gan find it? There are no caves there, and like Ashiya are saying, this is far from a typical gemstone.{w} Doesn't it look too good to you? Its shape isn't natural if it's supposed to be a stone formed over the years. There's something about this story that is off."
    "听说芦屋正在扩大戒备规模。我们也得跟上。{w} 你说得对。展示柜解锁时，我们没法轻易接近 Sekimeiya；可它锁着的时候，我们更无从下手。{w} 拿到他们那把唯一的钥匙并非不可能，但希望不大，而且几乎等于把 Ido 暴露出去。所以我愿意优先考虑最初那个方案。{w} 我让你带 Sekimeiya 的照片来，是因为 Atase 对它的描述让我很感兴趣。据说它是在艾伦山那座荒山上被发现的。我很难相信这种说法。{w} Gan 究竟是在哪里找到它的？那里根本没有洞穴，而且正如芦屋所说，这远不是寻常宝石。{w} 你不觉得它好得过分了吗？如果它真是经年累月形成的石头，这个形状就太不自然了。这个故事里总有什么地方不对劲。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057574_1_1b2da86f:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057577_1_9b575112:
    # "It was found right after our latest attack, and right as the computer was cleaned up. What I believe is that the emergence of this gemstone is directly related to us.{w} Both of you compared it to marble, and it glows faintly. Added to its shape, vague origin, and the lack of details Ashiya are providing, I can't help but feel this was deliberately organized... As if the Sekimeiya was handcrafted to draw us to the focus of their upgraded security."
    "它是在我们最近一次袭击之后、电脑刚被清理干净时被发现的。我认为，这颗宝石的出现与我们直接相关。{w} 你们两个都把它比作大理石，而且它会发出微弱的光。再加上它的形状、含糊的来历，以及芦屋提供的信息少得可怜，我忍不住觉得这一切是刻意安排的……就好像 Sekimeiya 是被人手工做出来，专门把我们引向他们加强戒备的核心。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057578_1_d8396706:
    # "Do you mean that they made the Sekimeiya?"
    "你的意思是，Sekimeiya 是芦屋造出来的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057579_1_6e1a8d38:
    # "That is irrelevant. However, if they did, it would've been simple. They crafted a material of a single color into a simple shape. There are some that glow like this, and luminous paint would achieve the same effect.{w} It doesn't matter if the gemstone in this picture was fabricated. Ashiya are giving it real value. However, what I've said could be of immense use to us.{w} Ido, it felt like marble, right? We can have its dimensions, and the color and form aren't an issue. Do you know that molding marble is fairly simple?"
    "那无关紧要。不过，如果真是他们做的，那做起来也简单。把单一颜色的材料做成一个简单的形状就是了。确实有些东西会这样发光，用夜光涂料也能达到同样的效果。{w} 照片里这颗宝石是不是伪造的并不重要。芦屋赋予了它真实的价值。不过，我刚才说的那些，对我们可能大有用途。{w} Ido，它摸起来像大理石，对吧？我们能拿到它的尺寸，颜色和形状也不成问题。你知道大理石塑形其实相当简单吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057580_1_50fd3a77:
    # "...What are you saying? That we could replicate the Sekimeiya?"
    "……你在说什么？我们能复制 Sekimeiya？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057581_1_fb732926:
    # "We easily could."
    "这并不难。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057584_1_bdc75211:
    # "...I see. So we could sell it as the real Sekimeiya."
    "……我明白了。所以我们可以把它当成真正的 Sekimeiya 卖出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057585_1_89f2387f:
    # "Of course not. That would eliminate all our credibility.{w} I said this as a solution to Ido's question—how to obtain the real Sekimeiya.{w} On the 15th, if we take it while the cabinet's unlocked, it will be noticed immediately. The real problem is taking it out of the building.{w} We replace it with ours, and Ido takes it out with the cleaning cart."
    "当然不是。那会把我们的信誉彻底毁掉。{w} 我这么说，是为了回答 Ido 的问题——如何拿到真正的 Sekimeiya。{w} 15 日那天，如果趁展示柜解锁时取走它，立刻就会被发现。真正的问题在于怎么把它带出大楼。{w} 我们用仿制品把它换掉，再由 Ido 用清洁推车运出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057586_1_2e866a4d:
    # "Do you really think we could swap them? How would that not be noticed?{w} Also, doesn't this create the same problem? If we managed to replace it with a similar-looking stone, how would we demonstrate we have the real one? If we sold it, Ashiya would claim to still have it."
    "你真觉得我们能把它们换掉？怎么可能不被发现？{w} 而且，这不会带来同样的问题吗？就算我们成功换上一颗外观相近的石头，又怎么证明真品在我们手上？如果我们把它卖了，芦屋照样会宣称 Sekimeiya 还在他们那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057587_1_0777e11a:
    # "We could easily demonstrate it. And not only to assert our credibility, but also to let Ashiya know their measures have failed again.{w} I know who could do this for us: my good friend Cevin Neneco. I have an idea of how to account for this, but I'll need to think more about it.{w} Your other question, how the swap wouldn't be noticed... That has an easier answer."
    "证明起来并不难。而且不只是为了保住我们的信誉，也要让芦屋知道，他们的防范又一次没能奏效。{w} 我知道谁能替我们办这件事：我的好朋友 Cevin Neneco。至于怎么解释这件事，我有个想法，但还得再仔细想想。{w} 你另一个问题——掉包怎么会不被发现……这个答案比较简单。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057590_1_c3fce185:
    # "We'd have to do it when the cabinet is open. However, we can't be seen either in person or from the security room.{w} There is a way. The same thing we used last time, a smoke grenade."
    "必须趁展示柜打开时动手。可我们既不能被人亲眼看到，也不能被监控室的人看见。{w} 有办法。和上次一样，用烟雾弹。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057591_1_c04131f8:
    # "...D-Do you want to release that in the tower?"
    "……你、你是要在塔里放那个东西？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057596_1_dc09a090:
    # "The event will consist of guided visits for three people at once, and it will start at {time=9.}{w} Like always, at that time, the floor will be almost empty. That's when we make our move—before anyone knows what the Sekimeiya is. We know the people who show up earliest get in earliest. Atase, you will be there first."
    "活动会以导览形式进行，每次三人，从 {time=9.} 开始。{w} 和往常一样，那个时段楼层里几乎没人。我们就趁那时候动手——赶在任何人知道 Sekimeiya 是什么之前。我们知道最早到的人会先进去。Atase，你会第一个进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057600_1_8fbb365b:
    # "Intimidated by his boss's words, Atase stared hesitantly. He hadn't heard the entire plan yet, but it already sounded dangerous."
    "Atase 被上司的话镇住了，迟疑地望过去。他还没听完整个计划，却已经觉得危险重重。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057601_1_0e93a6e5:
    # "Ido will be there too. Once you're inside, he will secretly give you a small grenade that he'll bring in the previous day with the cleaning cart. When the event begins, it'll go off in front of the Sekimeiya, and it'll knock everyone out. The smoke will rapidly rise up, so to avoid inhaling any, you'll immediately throw yourself to the floor.{w} The cabinet will be unlocked, which will give you the chance to swap the Sekimeiya. Ours will be in the cleaning cart, and so that you don't have to go back to the lobby, Ido will leave it in the cleaning room. After that, you'll keep acting as if you fell unconscious.{w} In the end, despite the attack, Ashiya will think they still have the Sekimeiya, so, the following day, Ido will be able to take the real one out."
    "Ido 也会在那里。你一进去，他就会悄悄把一枚小烟雾弹交给你——那是他前一天用清洁推车带进来的。活动开始时，它会在 Sekimeiya 前引爆，把所有人熏得昏过去。烟雾会迅速上升，所以为了不吸入，你要立刻扑倒在地。{w} 展示柜那时会解锁，你就有机会掉包 Sekimeiya。我们的仿制品会放在清洁推车里；为了不让你再跑回大厅，Ido 会把推车留在清洁间。之后，你要继续装作昏倒。{w} 最后，尽管遭受袭击，芦屋仍会以为 Sekimeiya 还在自己手里，于是第二天，Ido 就能把真品带出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057604_1_491365ad:
    # "Wait a second... Wh-Why do I have to do this? Shouldn't Ido be the one? This could go horribly wrong!"
    "等一下……为、为什么是我？不该让 Ido 去吗？这事要是出了岔子，后果不堪设想！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057605_1_4e34b50e:
    # "No. At the time of the event, Ido has no reason to be in the event room. Furthermore, it's likely the people present will be investigated, which could lead Ashiya to find the real Sekimeiya in the cart before we can obtain it.{w} This could go wrong, sure, but it can work. However, see it as a chance I'm giving you.{w} You screwed up badly. Not only should you redeem yourself to us, but to yourself. If you're found, you will be seen as a killer. Make sure this plan works before you think of asking for our help again."
    "不行。活动开始后，Ido 没有理由待在活动室里。而且，在场的人很可能会被调查，那样芦屋说不定会在我们拿到真品之前，就从推车里找到真正的 Sekimeiya。{w} 这事确实可能出岔子，但也能成功。不过，把它当成我给你的机会。{w} 你犯下大错。你不仅该向我们、也该向你自己赎罪。一旦被发现，你就会被当成杀人犯。先确保这个计划成功，再考虑向我们求助。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057606_1_503a7168:
    # "W-Will you offer help if this goes well?"
    "如、如果事情顺利，你们会帮我吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057607_1_9ec75d40:
    # "That's something you will have to ask again after the 15th. Until then, you're still nothing but trouble for us—disposing of you is what we should do. ...Do you understand why it is essential that this is not a failure?"
    "那要等 15 日之后，你再来问。在那之前，你对我们来说依旧只是麻烦——按说我们该把你处理掉。……你明白这次行动为什么绝不能失败了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057611_1_079a041a:
    # "...{w}I don't even get what you said, though. I'll still be recorded if I do this."
    "……{w}可我还是没听懂你刚才说的。我这么做，不还是会被拍下来吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057612_1_0befcf59:
    # "No. The smokescreen will cover you. We'll make sure it works as a barrier for the camera."
    "不会。烟雾会遮住你。我们会确保它足以挡住摄像头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057613_1_392df2d0:
    # "But what about the hallway!? I'll be seen going to the cleaning room!"
    "可走廊怎么办！？我去清洁间的时候会被看到的！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057614_1_a12cacfd:
    # "That is one reason why smoke should also be released there.{w} Like in every guided visit, everyone else will be in the lobby. If smoke appears in both hallways, everyone will quickly evacuate, as they'll be worried about it being poisonous or there being a fire. Then, the exit will be guarded to make sure nobody runs out with stolen gems.{w} Katei Kuiji will be in the security room, so due to the smoke, he won't be able to leave it without falling unconscious, and he won't see what's happening in the building.{w} When everyone is knocked out, you will go to the cleaning room and obtain our fake. It is essential that you do this first to make sure no one sees you. You will leave your smoke grenade in the cart and subsequently go back to swap the gemstones."
    "这也是为什么那里也得释放烟雾。{w} 每次导览参观时，其他人都会待在大厅。如果两条走廊都出现烟雾，大家都会赶紧撤出去，因为他们会担心烟雾有毒，或者发生了火灾。随后，出口会有人把守，确保没人带着偷来的宝石跑出去。{w} Katei Kuiji 会在监控室，所以烟雾一出现，他只要离开监控室就会昏倒，也就看不到楼里发生了什么。{w} 等所有人都昏过去，你就去清洁间取出我们的赝品。你必须先做这件事，确保没人看见你。把你的烟雾弹留在推车里，然后再回去掉包宝石。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057619_1_983a987e:
    # "...Who will set off the smoke outside the event room, though?"
    "……可是，活动室外的烟雾由谁来触发？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057620_1_56bcff9b:
    # "Nobody will. Setting up a timer is the easiest thing in the world. We know when they have to go off: at {time=9:04.}"
    "不需要人。装个定时器再简单不过。我们知道它们该在什么时候启动：{time=9:04.}"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057621_1_fe8a0b3b:
    # "No, we don't...! The event will begin at {time=9}, but we don't know when the cabinet will be unlocked!"
    "不，我们不知道……！活动确实在 {time=9} 开始，可我们不知道展示柜什么时候才会解锁！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057622_1_1dff5c71:
    # "That doesn't matter. Ido has seen the key and how to use it. If the smoke goes off before the cabinet is unlocked, the guide will be knocked out, and they will have the key on their person."
    "那不重要。Ido 见过那把钥匙，也知道该怎么用。如果烟雾在展示柜解锁前就启动，导览员会被熏昏，而钥匙就在他身上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057623_1_a5c085fc:
    # "And where exactly will the smoke bombs be in the hallways?"
    "那烟雾弹在走廊里究竟要放在哪儿？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057624_1_aafe1ff8:
    # "Don't you remember? We can use the handrails.{w} Behind them, the small grenades will be hidden, and it works perfectly for us. The cameras in the hallways are placed to focus on the doors, so there are parts of the handrails that aren't visible.{w} When Ido is cleaning, he can secretly place a grenade and slide it toward a point of the handrail that's being recorded. We will need two per hallway, and it'll seem like anyone could've placed them the previous day."
    "不记得了吗？我们可以利用扶手。{w} 小烟雾弹藏在扶手后面，对我们来说正合适。走廊的摄像头都对着门，因此扶手有些位置拍不到。{w} Ido 打扫时，可以悄悄放下一枚烟雾弹，再把它滑到会被摄像头拍到的扶手位置。每条走廊需要两枚，看上去就像前一天谁都有可能放进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057628_1_7429f63c:
    # "Finally, both subordinates understood how serious their boss was and broke into a sweat. As they took off and draped their heavy attire on the back of their chairs, they began to process each step of what they would be performing."
    "两名下属终于明白上司有多认真，不由得冒出了冷汗。他们脱下厚重的外套搭在椅背上，开始逐一琢磨接下来要执行的每一步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057630_1_8ec84b47:
    # "...And that's not all. There's something else we'll do that will divert suspicion from Ido.{w} After all, if this works, we still wouldn't be in the clear. After suffering such a major attack, will Ashiya really believe nothing was stolen? If they're careful, they might not believe it and end up finding the real Sekimeiya.{w} So, we will give them a reason to believe it.{w} Their focus will be on the Sekimeiya; that's what they expect to be targeted, and the measures they're taking clearly involve it, as proven by the new cabinet and it only having one key. Targeting a different room will be much less problematic.{w} In the morning, before the event, the cameras will be monitored. However, there are more cameras than monitors, and only the hallways and a few crystal rooms are displayed at once, correct, Ido?"
    "……还不止这些。我们还要做一件事，把怀疑从 Ido 身上引开。{w} 毕竟，就算计划成功，我们也还没完全脱身。遭到这么大规模的袭击后，芦屋真的会相信什么都没丢吗？如果他们谨慎些，或许不会信，最后还是会找到真正的 Sekimeiya。{w} 所以，我们要给他们一个相信的理由。{w} 他们的注意力会放在 Sekimeiya 上；那才是他们预期会被下手的目标，而他们采取的戒备显然也围绕着它——新的展示柜和只有一把钥匙就是证明。相比之下，去针对另一个展室，麻烦会小得多。{w} 早上活动开始前，监控会有人盯着。但摄像头比监视器多，同一时间只会显示走廊和少数几个水晶展室，对吧，Ido？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057631_1_e490e545:
    # "...Yes. I've never seen the smaller one in hallway A being displayed. It's normally just the hallway."
    "……对。我从没见过 A走廊里那台小一点的摄像头画面被调出来。平时只显示走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057634_1_a96047a2:
    # "Exactly. This means that if you put all the gems there into a case, you won't be seen. We would usually never do this, as it makes you the only suspect, but this isn't an issue this time.{w} The curtains aren't raised until {time=9:10}, so you'll leave all of them down. You'll also leave the case in the room, in the corner beneath the camera, so that we can have a visitor be there when the smoke is released, crouching right as it happens. If they keep their head near the floor as they exit the tower with the case, they won't fall unconscious.{w} Two minutes after the smoke has been released, he will attempt to flee. This will make Ashiya think their expectations were subverted and that the failed attack had that room as its final target.{w} ...I doubt Faiten will be willing to take this job under any circumstances, but I'll find the right person without telling them the full extent of the plan."
    "正是如此。也就是说，只要你把那里的宝石全装进箱子，就不会被拍到。平时我们绝不会这么做，因为那样你就成了唯一的嫌疑人，但这次没关系。{w} 遮布要到 {time=9:10} 才会拉起，所以你要让它们一直垂着。你还要把箱子留在那个房间里，放在摄像头下方的角落。这样烟雾释放时，我们可以安排一名访客正好在场，并在那一刻蹲下。只要他带着箱子离开塔时把头贴近地面，就不会昏过去。{w} 烟雾释放两分钟后，他会尝试逃走。这会让芦屋以为他们的预想落空了，以为那场失败的袭击最终针对的其实是那个房间。{w} ……我怀疑 Faiten 无论如何都不肯接这活，但我会找到合适的人，并且不把计划的全部内容告诉他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057635_1_6b771204:
    # "Since the reason behind doing this is passing off that room as the target, the smoke will need to be released there as well, so that's where Ido will leave the last grenade."
    "既然这么做是为了让那个房间看起来像真正的目标，烟雾也得在那里释放，所以最后一枚烟雾弹就由 Ido 留在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057636_1_8f81e10d:
    # "...But, what...? I'm very confused. All of this will be recorded."
    "……可是，什么……？我完全糊涂了。这些全都会被拍下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057639_1_5a8477bd:
    # "Yes.{w} Before, I said that infecting the computer again could be risky. While that is true, it won't be an issue if we take the proper measures.{w} When the smoke is released, I will infect the computer remotely. While Katei is overwhelmed by the attack, it'll take me a few seconds to erase the saved footage of the previous 24 hours. Then, I will immediately disconnect our access so that we can't be tracked.{w} This will work in four different ways.{w} It will remove the footage that incriminates Ido.{w} It will remove the footage showing the source of the smoke in the event room.{w} It will make them think we had to remove the hallways' footage to hide who placed the grenades there, when that's not actually needed.{w} And lastly, it will hide that we can access the computer at any time, because they might think we were able to erase the footage thanks to the commotion of the attack.{w} ...This is it. This is what we'll do, and how we'll nab the Sekimeiya."
    "是的。{w} 我之前说过，再次侵入电脑可能有风险。确实如此，但只要措施得当，就不会出问题。{w} 烟雾释放时，我会远程侵入电脑。趁 Katei 被袭击弄得手忙脚乱，我只要几秒钟就能抹掉过去 24 小时的录像。然后我会立刻断开我们的访问，让他们无法追踪。{w} 这会起到四个作用。{w} 删掉会让 Ido 暴露的录像。{w} 删掉显示活动室烟雾来源的录像。{w} 让他们以为我们必须删掉走廊录像来隐藏放置烟雾弹的人，而实际上那并非必要。{w} 最后，还能掩盖我们可以随时访问电脑这一点，因为他们可能会以为，我们是趁袭击造成的混乱才删掉录像的。{w} ……就是这样。这就是我们的做法，也是我们夺得 Sekimeiya 的办法。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057640_1_e8207007:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057641_1_c656928e:
    # "Once the plan is a success, we'll get it out of the building with the cart. However, how do we let Ashiya know their Sekimeiya is fake? Whatever the best answer is, it relies on the crafting process.{w} You said the Sekimeiya's kept pretty cold. There aren't many chemical reactions that occur at low temperatures, but perhaps we could make use of one to damage the Sekimeiya after a couple of days of exposure.{w} If not, then a mere timed reaction would suffice, one that would break our Sekimeiya and leave behind a card with our name."
    "计划成功后，我们就用推车把它运出大楼。可是，怎么让芦屋知道他们的 Sekimeiya 是赝品？不管最终用哪种办法，关键都在制作工艺。{w} 你说过，Sekimeiya 存放的环境相当冷。低温下能发生的化学反应不多，但也许我们可以利用其中一种，让 Sekimeiya 在暴露于常温几天后受损。{w} 如果不行，单纯的定时反应也够了——让我们的 Sekimeiya 碎裂，并留下一张写有我们名号的卡片。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057654_1_fc52f258:
    # "When Katei saw the busy waveform, he knew his bait had been effective.{w} Since Xyn had attacked the gem shop, Ido hadn't spoken to his boss. Katei had wanted to know Xyn's position after their failure, so he had given Ido information about the Sekimeiya to report to his group."
    "看到那密集的波形时，Katei 就知道自己的诱饵奏效了。{w} 自从 Xyn 袭击宝石店后，Ido 一直没和上司说过话。Katei 想知道 Xyn 在失败后的动向，于是把关于 Sekimeiya 的情报交给 Ido，让他转告自己的组织。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057660_1_4221638b:
    # "At a low volume, he listened to the audio in his dim office. The second time, the conversation was a lot more substantial.{w} Katei thrilled internally; an overwhelming amount of details were being revealed to him. He finally knew many of Xyn's secrets that had tormented him for so long.{w} He heard Xyn design their plan, even though the end sounded muffled. Ashiya's lure wouldn't work; there would be no attack before the 15th, and most importantly, Katei could no longer follow through with his scheme.{w} Xyn would attack during the daytime. The alarm wouldn't be activated, and Katei's voice could be heard by other people. In addition, even if the alarm was activated, Katei wouldn't be able to offer a Xyn member a quick escape, as the outside of the building wouldn't be deserted."
    "他把音量调得很低，在昏暗的办公室里听着录音。第二次，对话内容充实了许多。{w} Katei 内心一阵狂喜；无数细节正展现在他面前。他终于知道了 Xyn 的许多秘密——这些秘密折磨了他那么久。{w} 他听见 Xyn 在敲定计划，尽管结尾部分听起来含混不清。芦屋的诱饵不会奏效；15 日之前不会有袭击，而最重要的是，Katei 再也无法按自己的计划行事。{w} Xyn 会在白天发动袭击。警报不会启动，而其他人可能会听见 Katei 的声音。此外，就算警报启动，Katei 也无法帮 Xyn 成员迅速脱身，因为大楼外不会空无一人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057663_1_7d4d7096:
    # "However, there was something else Katei realized: Xyn were right. The Sekimeiya's value was already much higher than what Ashiya had expected.{w} To incentivize Xyn's attack, Ashiya had been building an air of mystery around the gemstone, which had rapidly expanded. Until the 15th, the Sekimeiya's worth would be far higher than everything else Ashiya had ever possessed.{w} Katei didn't feel pressured. He had very valuable information, and he had learned that the concept of his plan could still be executed, albeit differently. He could anonymously threaten Ido with the audio, but that would give away Katei's source of information, and unlike after his previous plan, Xyn wouldn't be indebted to him. As such, he decided to change his way of thinking for the time being."
    "不过，Katei 还意识到了另一件事：Xyn 说得对。Sekimeiya 的价值早已远超芦屋的预期。{w} 为了诱使 Xyn 出手，芦屋一直在给这颗宝石营造神秘气氛，而这种气氛迅速膨胀。到 15 日为止，Sekimeiya 的价值会远远高过芦屋拥有过的任何东西。{w} Katei 并不觉得有压力。他掌握了极有价值的情报，也明白了自己计划的构想仍可实行，只是方式要变。他可以用录音匿名威胁 Ido，但那会暴露 Katei 的情报来源；而且与上次计划之后不同，Xyn 不会因此欠他人情。于是，他决定暂且改变思路。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057664_1_24bc2a75:
    # "The Sekimeiya... he could obtain it himself and postpone the idea of blackmailing Xyn. He had the key to the cabinet and a trump card he'd saved for years—the storeroom's secret.{w} Before Katei's parents had died, the building had undergone severe expansions. The secret corridor had always remained a hidden part of the lowest floor, but nobody who knew about it remained.{w} Naturally, Katei had tested it already to deduce whether Xyn were aware of its existence. He had easily been able to confirm it had never opened during their attacks."
    "Sekimeiya……他可以亲自拿到它，把勒索 Xyn 的念头暂时搁下。他手里有展示柜的钥匙，还有一张藏了多年的王牌——储藏室的秘密。{w} 在 Katei 的父母去世之前，这栋大楼经历过大规模扩建。那条秘密通道一直是底层不为人知的一部分，但知道它的人已经都不在了。{w} 当然，Katei 已经试探过，想推断 Xyn 是否知道它的存在。他很容易就确认，在 Xyn 的历次袭击中，那条通道从未被打开过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057667_1_9a0e05dc:
    # "How could Katei take the Sekimeiya out of the tower? Despite all he knew, it wasn't a simple task.{w} He couldn't act out a fake Xyn attack when he didn't have the night shift: if he entered through the storeroom, he would be seen from the security room.{w} He could take action when he had the night shift. He could bring the Sekimeiya to the storeroom and claim Xyn had erased the security footage. But would such a thing be believable?{w} He wasn't worried that Xyn could threaten him anymore—he had the upper hand in that battle, as he could expose a good deal about them. Yet, Katei's story would be too convenient. His alarm would have to be somehow bypassed, and Katei would have to let them escape."
    "Katei 要怎么把 Sekimeiya 带出塔？尽管他知道这么多，这仍不是件容易的事。{w} 不值夜班时，他无法伪造一场 Xyn 的袭击：如果他从储藏室进去，就会被监控室看到。{w} 他可以在值夜班时动手。他可以把 Sekimeiya 带到储藏室，声称 Xyn 删掉了监控录像。可这种说法会有人信吗？{w} 他已经不再担心 Xyn 能威胁自己——在这场较量中他占了上风，因为他能揭发 Xyn 的许多事。可是，Katei 的说法会显得太过凑巧。警报总得被绕过，而且 Katei 还得放他们逃走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057668_1_2cc9c74b:
    # "What if he activated the alarm by forcing open the cabinet? Then, when the exit unlocked, no Xyn member would be found in the building, and the Sekimeiya would've magically disappeared.{w} There was only one way Katei could make that work: by saying he had seen someone escaping toward the storeroom. However, he didn't want to reveal the existence of the hidden door yet.{w} There was no smooth story that let Katei weasel out. He didn't want to be investigated by Ashiya or Xyn, but every scenario sounded iffy and had him as an easy suspect.{w} That was until he realized that the perfect moment existed.{w} A moment where he wouldn't be the only suspect, and where his story would be believed without doubt: the day of the event."
    "如果他用强行打开展示柜的方式触发警报呢？那么出口解锁时，楼里不会找到任何 Xyn 成员，而 Sekimeiya 则会像变魔术一样消失。{w} 要让这套说法成立，Katei 只有一个办法：声称自己看见有人朝储藏室方向逃走了。但他还不想暴露暗门的存在。{w} 没有哪套说辞能让 Katei 顺利脱身。他不想被芦屋或 Xyn 调查，可每一种情形都漏洞百出，让他很容易成为嫌疑人。{w} 直到他意识到，完美的时机确实存在。{w} 在那个时机里，他不会成为唯一的嫌疑人，而他的说法也会被毫无疑问地采信：活动当天。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057673_1_a33a17b2:
    # "The day when Xyn would be in the tower, and when Katei would be in the security room. He could use their own attack against them to obfuscate his involvement."
    "那一天，Xyn 会在塔里，而 Katei 会在监控室。他可以借 Xyn 的袭击来掩盖自己参与其中。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057674_1_8214adf3:
    # "He knew what would happen and what Xyn's actions would be. He immediately thought of a way to take advantage of them."
    "他知道将会发生什么，也知道 Xyn 会如何行动。他立刻想到了利用他们的办法。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057675_1_6a17da12:
    # "The Sekimeiya cabinet had been designed to trigger the alarm upon being minimally damaged. At {time=9:04}, a vast cloud of smoke was going to be released in the event room. Even though the cabinet could be unlocked, the mere damage of the smoke could set off the alarm.{w} In any case, if the alarm went off at that time, it wouldn't be questioned: a real attack would've triggered it, so it would've served its function."
    "Sekimeiya 的展示柜被设计成只要轻微受损就会触发警报。到 {time=9:04}，活动室里将释放出大片烟雾。即使展示柜可以解锁，烟雾本身造成的损伤也可能触发警报。{w} 无论如何，如果警报在那个时候响起，不会有人质疑：真正的袭击本就会触发它，所以它也算尽到了职责。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057676_1_8959ed7f:
    # "Katei had designed the system, and he knew Xyn didn't have access to the tower's computer. If he altered the system to automatically activate the alarm at that time, no one would know.{w} He could trap Xyn in the tower and commandeer the rest of their plan himself. In addition, Katei had another reason to trigger the alarm: to aid Xyn before his intervention. The only way their plan could fail was if people from the outside quickly raided the building despite the smoke. That was something the alarm could prevent."
    "这套系统是 Katei 设计的，他知道 Xyn 无法访问塔里的电脑。如果他改动系统，让警报在那个时候自动触发，不会有人知道。{w} 他可以把 Xyn 困在塔里，并亲自接管他们计划的剩余部分。此外，Katei 触发警报还有另一个理由：在他介入之前先帮 Xyn 一把。他们的计划唯一可能失败的地方，就是外面的人不顾烟雾迅速冲进大楼。而警报恰好能阻止这种事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057679_1_85cf5fd9:
    # "Katei's initial idea was promising, and he could develop it further.{w} Xyn would disable the hallway A cameras, where the security room and the storeroom were. That meant that before the attack, Katei could quickly go to the lobby to discuss what to do during the event with the police. That would be the last recording of hallway A.{w} Upon seeing the smoke, everyone would rapidly evacuate, unaware that the alarm was soon to be activated. Then, during the chaos, Katei would reenter the hallway."
    "Katei 最初的想法很有前景，而且他还能进一步完善。{w} Xyn 会关掉 A走廊的摄像头，而监控室和储藏室都在那边。这意味着，在袭击发生前，Katei 可以迅速去大厅，与警察商量活动期间该如何应对。那会成为 A走廊的最后一段录像。{w} 一看到烟雾，所有人都会迅速疏散，没人知道警报即将启动。随后，在混乱之中，Katei 会重新进入走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057680_1_642f71e2:
    # "That would no longer be caught by the cameras. As he'd heard Xyn's discussion, he knew that by crawling, he would avoid falling unconscious.{w} He knew what Atase's movements would be—the alarm wouldn't influence them. He would go to the cleaning room, so Katei had the opportunity to take the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet if it was unlocked. If it wasn't, he'd go take it from the cleaning cart after Atase finished his job."
    "这样便不会再被摄像头拍到。他听过 Xyn 的商议，知道只要匍匐爬行，就能避免失去意识。{w} 他清楚 Atase 的行动会如何展开——警报不会改变那些步骤。Atase 会去清洁间，因此只要展示柜未上锁，Katei 就有机会取出 Sekimeiya。若柜子锁着，他就等 Atase 做完清洁，再从清洁车里取走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057681_1_a4a8bbf9:
    # "Then, he could rapidly go to the storeroom and leave the Sekimeiya behind the movable wall. Lei had told him it couldn't be kept at a warm temperature, but the storeroom's corridor was colder than the rest of the tower due to its lack of insulation and air conditioning.{w} Lastly, he would leave using his unique key. Everyone would be in front of the entrance, so he wouldn't be seen stepping out of the building. Then, he would appear from behind them, as if he had evacuated, which hallway A's camera would corroborate."
    "接着，他可以迅速前往储藏室，把 Sekimeiya 留在可移动墙后面。Lei 告诉过他，Sekimeiya 不能保存在温暖的环境中；储藏室的走廊没有隔热层，也没有空调，因此比塔内其他地方更冷。{w} 最后，他会用自己的专属钥匙离开。所有人都会聚在入口前，所以没人会看见他走出大楼。然后，他会从人群后方现身，仿佛自己也是刚撤离出来，而 A走廊的摄像头会印证这一点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057685_1_d9c34027:
    # "Nobody would be in the security room, so after twelve hours, the shutter would open. Then, someone inside the building would be guaranteed to be a member of Xyn and responsible for triggering the alarm."
    "监控室里不会有人，因此十二小时后，卷帘门会打开。届时，楼内必定会有一个 Xyn 成员，而警报正是由他触发的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057686_1_bf12e03b:
    # "However, nobody would know the Sekimeiya had been stolen because Xyn's fake would remain inside, and nobody would suspect Katei of having any involvement, as he couldn't have. Not even Xyn would suspect him."
    "然而，没人会知道 Sekimeiya 已被偷走，因为里面会留着 Xyn 制作的赝品 Sekimeiya；也没人会怀疑 Katei 参与其中，因为他根本不可能参与。就连 Xyn 也不会怀疑到他头上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057687_1_e9825b76:
    # "And in the future, he could retrieve the real Sekimeiya from the storeroom without an issue."
    "而日后，他可以毫无阻碍地从储藏室取回真正的 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057700_1_12ea9f0b:
    # "Everything was finally in motion, and the long wait for the day of the event began.{w} Ashiya, Xyn, and Katei. Each of those three parties had their own unique agenda."
    "一切终于开始运转，接下来便是对活动当日的漫长等待。{w}芦屋、Xyn、Katei——三方各有各的盘算。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057701_1_3edab9bd:
    # "Every night, Ashiya expected Xyn's attack. However, Katei knew it wouldn't happen yet and kept mentally rehearsing his plan."
    "每晚，芦屋都在等着 Xyn 动手。然而 Katei 知道那还不会发生，只是在脑中反复演练自己的计划。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057702_1_53b92323:
    # "Meanwhile, Xyn received their replica of the Sekimeiya.{w} Ido, who had seen, touched, and measured the original, confirmed there was no glaring difference between the two, and that unless Ashiya had foreseen a replica being created, it would work."
    "与此同时，Xyn 收到了他们制作的 Sekimeiya 仿制品。{w} Ido 见过、摸过并测量过真品，确认两者没有明显差异；除非芦屋早已预料到会有人仿制，否则这件复制品足以奏效。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057707_1_dc6296e2:
    # "As the days approached, Ashiya realized Xyn were likely to not fall for their trap, and as Xyn had predicted, the Sekimeiya continued to grow more valuable in the eyes of the world.{w} Ashiya hadn't fully prepared the event yet, so a trusted employee of theirs was chosen to plan out the guided visits."
    "随着日期临近，芦屋意识到 Xyn 很可能不会中自己布下的圈套；而正如 Xyn 所料，Sekimeiya 在世人心中的价值持续攀升。{w}芦屋尚未完全准备好活动，于是选了一名信得过的员工来筹划导览参观。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057708_1_7401de55:
    # "Atase was under a lot of pressure. He had to make sure the plan was a success, and if he executed what had been laid out perfectly, the odds would be in his favor."
    "Atase 承受着巨大的压力。他必须确保计划成功；只要把安排好的步骤执行得天衣无缝，胜算就会站在他这边。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057709_1_a5e618bc:
    # "All the preparations had been made. Slowly, the days of December ticked up to the 15th."
    "所有准备都已完成。十二月的日子一天天过去，最终到了十五日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057737_1_885de1fb:
    # "However, nobody expected what would happen on that day."
    "然而，那一天发生的事，没有人预料得到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057738_1_a656c97b:
    # "Eight people were trapped in Ashiya Tower, but they weren't alone. That was the catalyst of the construction of a mountainous maze.{w} Who reached its peak? It wasn't everyone who began the climb."
    "八个人被困在芦屋塔中，但他们并不孤单。这件事，成了建造一座层叠如山的迷宫的契机。{w} 谁最终登上了峰顶？并非每个开始攀登的人都能登顶。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057739_1_04cc4328:
    # "You are lucky enough to have access to all its sides, but what about the peak?{w} Three parties formed the mountain's base, unaware of how high it would go."
    "你足够幸运，能接触到它的每一面，可峰顶呢？{w} 三方构成了这座山的底座，却不知道它会升到多高。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057761_1_3fd87c2a:
    # "Xyn"
    "Xyn"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057765_1_c56f6b6b:
    # "Katei"
    "Katei"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057769_1_c97e1e12:
    # "Ashiya"
    "芦屋"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057773_1_30230bf3:
    # "Continue"
    "继续"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057777_1_6a2d9c02:
    # "Contrition"
    "悔悟"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057788_1_1cd10cd5:
    # "When the tower opened, Atase was the only person waiting outside. He wore light attire despite the cold."
    "芦屋塔开门时，在外等候的只有 Atase 一人。天这么冷，他却穿得很单薄。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057795_1_6140cc07:
    # "He bowed at the receptionist and stepped in slowly. A man walked up to him, asking for his ticket. After showing it and confirming that he didn't have a phone, he stepped to the hallway B door."
    "他向接待员鞠了一躬，缓缓走入。一名男子迎上来，请他出示门票。他出示了门票，又确认自己没有带手机，然后走到 B走廊门口。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057798_1_001e7b80:
    # "It was very early in the morning. For a while, all he heard was the receptionist shuffling a bunch of papers behind the desk."
    "这时天还很早。有好一阵子，他耳边只有接待员在柜台后翻动一叠文件的窸窣声。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057805_1_b3d6a1cf:
    # "The next person he saw was Ido. Without looking over, he casually made his way to the hallway.{w} It took him a while to come back. When he did, his clothes were different, and he was carrying a cleaning bucket."
    "他见到的下一个人是 Ido。Ido 没往他这边看，若无其事地走向走廊。{w} 过了好一阵，Ido 才回来。回来时已换了一身衣服，手里提着清洁桶。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057810_1_0e329db8:
    # "Atase was relieved. Nothing had happened, so Ido's part of the plan had gone well. He didn't have the cleaning cart, as it was waiting for Atase with the fake Sekimeiya."
    "Atase 松了口气。什么都没发生，说明 Ido 负责的那部分计划进展顺利。Ido 没有推清洁车，因为那辆车正载着赝品 Sekimeiya，等着 Atase 去取。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057815_1_c68ea4b1:
    # "Idly mopping the floor, Ido got close to Atase. That was when he dropped a tiny grenade in his pocket. At that point, everything was ready—the action was poised to begin."
    "Ido 漫不经心地拖着地，慢慢靠近 Atase，趁机把一颗小巧的手雷丢进他的口袋。到这一刻，一切已准备妥当——行动一触即发。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057827_1_653154f9:
    # "Atase turned around when he heard something at his back. Two more people were by the entrance: a boy and a girl."
    "身后传来动静，Atase 转过身。入口处又多了两个人：一个少年和一个少女。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057828_1_fa621db3:
    # "Out of nowhere, Atase felt a sudden wave of heat. ...He had seen the boy before.{w} In Musashi Gemstones, he had been the first to be hit by the smoke. Atsuki Hakutoki was his name, and he'd been safely discharged from the hospital."
    "没来由地，Atase 感到一阵燥热。……他见过那个少年。{w} 在武藏宝石，少年是第一个被烟雾波及的人。他叫 Atsuki Hakutoki，后来已平安出院。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057834_1_c7548fce:
    # "Atase swiftly looked away. On that day, his face had been disguised, but what if he was recognized? He stared at the floor as they walked closer to him, clenching his fists tightly."
    "Atase 立刻移开视线。那天他易过容，可万一被认出来呢？两人越走越近，他死死盯着地面，攥紧了拳头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057839_1_b1b1a361:
    # "...{w}He had to avoid eye contact; the boy next to him had lost someone, and it had been his fault.{w} He had taken a glance at the girl as well. Although he hadn't seen her before, the eyes below her red hair looked identical to the boy's."
    "……{w}他不能和对方对上视线；那个少年曾失去过某个人，而那都是他的错。{w} 他也瞥了少女一眼。他从未见过她，可红发下的那双眼睛，和少年一模一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057845_1_26d8b9ad:
    # "{time=9:00} was distant. Long before it, police officers arrived outside the tower.{w} Atase's rough facial description must've been known. He didn't think he'd be recognized, but he couldn't bring himself to look back."
    "距离{time=9:00}还早。远在那之前，警察就已抵达塔外。{w} Atase 的大致长相想必早已传开。他觉得自己不会被认出，可还是不敢回头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057846_1_638c4f97:
    # "All at once, a wave of people flooded in. Faint chatter took over the silence, but none of it reached Atase. He had to look calm and know exactly what to do.{w} He saw someone he knew outside the lobby. However, that person didn't know who Atase was. His job was to take out a suitcase at {time=9:06.}"
    "忽然间，人潮涌了进来。细碎的交谈声取代了寂静，却没有一句落进 Atase 耳中。他必须显得镇定，而且清楚自己该做什么。{w} 他看见大厅外有个认识的人。可那人并不知道 Atase 是谁。他的任务，是在{time=9:06.}把手提箱取出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057847_1_f4fbfc2f:
    # "Ido had left through the opposite hallway a while ago. When he came back, he started to mop the floor a second time."
    "Ido 不久前从另一侧的走廊离开了。回来之后，他又开始拖地。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057848_1_a976417e:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057849_1_30b5f2b0:
    # "Slowly, the time kept passing.{w} After Ido was done with the little plaza, he entered again, mopping the new snowy footprints and the already shining floor."
    "时间缓缓流逝。{w} Ido 把小广场拖完后，又走了进来，擦掉新留下的雪水脚印，把本就发亮的地面又拖了一遍。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057850_1_0ee7cffd:
    # "For a while, he kept doing that. He had to stay there, as he knew what was soon to happen in the hallways."
    "有一阵子，他一直重复着这些动作。他必须留在那里，因为他知道走廊里很快会发生什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057857_1_699faf4e:
    # "Shiroya...?"
    "Shiroya……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057858_1_e12c79ca:
    # "Atase's heart skipped a beat. Behind him, he'd heard the voice of Katei Kuiji. However, that name..."
    "Atase 心跳漏了一拍。身后传来的是 Katei Kuiji 的声音。可是，那个名字……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057859_1_eaa2e512:
    # "Is this yours? I think you dropped it."
    "这是你的吗？我想是你掉的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057860_1_4c9604f9:
    # "...Thank you."
    "……谢谢。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057865_1_df795756:
    # "Atase's head slowly turned to the girl.{w} She wasn't Shiroya. That was the name of the girl whose memory pressed down on his shoulders."
    "Atase 缓缓转头看向那个少女。{w} 她不是 Shiroya。Shiroya 是另一个少女的名字，关于她的记忆一直沉沉压在他肩上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057867_1_bf72a7b4:
    # "Who was that, then?{w} Atase would soon learn."
    "那么，她是谁？{w} Atase 很快就会知道。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057874_1_71002083:
    # "At {time=9}, the door to hallway B opened. Through it came Naomi Cabca, who gave a brief explanation of the event.{w} It was time. Only four minutes were left."
    "到了{time=9}，B走廊的门打开了。Naomi Cabca 从门里走出来，简短地说明了活动内容。{w} 时候到了。只剩四分钟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057879_1_71227c5c:
    # "Are you three the first group?"
    "你们三位是第一组吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057884_1_51c446bd:
    # "Yeah, we've been here for a while."
    "对，我们在这儿等了好一会儿了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057885_1_72bcc518:
    # "Perfect. Please follow me to the event room to be the first to see the Sekimeiya."
    "很好。请随我去活动室，你们会是第一批见到 Sekimeiya 的人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057891_1_dda7323f:
    # "Quietly, the three people at the front of the line stepped into the hallway and were drawn to the room in the middle."
    "队伍最前面的三人悄无声息地走进走廊，朝中间的房间走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057896_1_8d94e774:
    # "A single cabinet was there, covered by a velvet curtain. It was a sight Atase had seen before through a picture."
    "那里只摆着一座展示柜，上面罩着天鹅绒遮布。这样的景象，Atase 曾在照片上见过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057904_1_106b1ae6:
    # "All right. It would be helpful if you could tell me your names so that I know how to address you."
    "好。方便的话，请告诉我你们的名字，我好知道该怎么称呼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057905_1_0e6be0d0:
    # "I'm Miiya Moiromo."
    "我是 Miiya Moiromo。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057906_1_4746dbeb:
    # "That was her name. It was one Atase remembered. Miiya Moiromo had been in the shop as well, but she hadn't been hit by the impact of the explosion."
    "原来是这个名字。Atase 记得她。Miiya Moiromo 当时也在那家店里，只是没有被爆炸波及。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057911_1_7f3f11be:
    # "\"Akaro Esata\". For the first time in hours, Atase opened his mouth, voicing the name that had been on his ticket."
    "「Akaro Esata」。几个小时以来，Atase 第一次开口，说出了票上那个名字。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057916_1_bc30df97:
    # "...Atsuki Hakutoki."
    "……Atsuki Hakutoki。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057926_1_e1e659c3:
    # "Naomi began to explain the story behind the Sekimeiya. As she did, Atase wondered if any bit of truth was coming out of her mouth."
    "Naomi 开始讲起 Sekimeiya 背后的故事。Atase 一边听着，一边在心里琢磨：她嘴里能有几分真话？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057927_1_daae02f7:
    # "Part of the experience is the touch, so I will open the glass and let you experience it yourselves. However, I must insist that you be gentle and keep your hands inside the cabinet at all times."
    "这次体验的一部分就是亲手触摸，所以我会打开玻璃罩，让你们亲自感受。不过我必须强调，请务必轻柔，手自始至终都要放在展示柜内。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057928_1_93ffb66b:
    # "She took out a keyring. After inserting a small one into the cabinet, she unlocked it."
    "她取出一串钥匙，拣出一把小钥匙插进展示柜，打开了锁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057933_1_0d9da406:
    # "I have a question."
    "「我有个问题。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057934_1_01133efb:
    # "Hm? What is it?"
    "「嗯？什么问题？」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057935_1_b96dbc03:
    # "Atase suppressed his nervousness as best he could. The cabinet had been unlocked, so the plan was very close to succeeding. However, a few seconds still remained until {time=9:04.}"
    "Atase 竭力压住紧张。展示柜已经解锁，计划离成功只差一步。可距离 {time=9:04.} 还剩几秒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057936_1_64ee64f8:
    # "He attempted to slow Naomi down. She had been about to raise the curtain and let them touch the gemstone. If that happened before the smoke was released, the Sekimeiya could be hit by it, which could later reveal that the clean one was Xyn's fake."
    "他设法拖住 Naomi。她正要掀起遮布，让他们去摸那颗宝石。若在烟雾放出之前掀开，Sekimeiya 就可能沾上烟尘，日后便会暴露出那颗干净的宝石其实是 Xyn 的赝品。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057939_1_c5780309:
    # "You keep mentioning how valuable the Sekimeiya is, but is there proof of that? The way you're explaining it, you don't even say what kind of gem it is, only that it's \"rare\"."
    "你一直说 Sekimeiya 有多珍贵，可有什么证据？照你的说法，你连它是什么宝石都没讲，只说是「罕见」而已。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057940_1_1e1816d8:
    # "But the value could've been arbitrarily created by Ashiya, as it's not being officially recognized as anything more than an unusual discovery."
    "但这价值也可能是芦屋随意定出来的——官方至今只把它当作一件不寻常的发现而已。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057941_1_94d53b80:
    # "Well, I will let you decide that for yourself. As you said, it's not categorized because nobody was able to properly appraise it. That's all you need to be assured of its value."
    "这个嘛，就由你自己判断吧。正如你所说，它之所以没有被归类，是因为没人能对它作出恰当的鉴定。光凭这一点，就足够让你相信它的价值了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057942_1_107b66aa:
    # "I apologize for being skeptical, but you must be aware that Ashiya aren't exactly recognized for their fairness."
    "恕我直言，我确实心存疑虑，但你想必也清楚，芦屋可并不以公正著称。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057947_1_50c1bae2:
    # "Do you have a reason to say that?"
    "你这么说，有什么根据吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057948_1_da139795:
    # "Yes, that everyone in the lobby sounded as skeptical as I am."
    "有。大厅里那些人，听起来都跟我一样怀疑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057949_1_277e43d3:
    # "Maybe seeing it for yourself will convince you."
    "等你亲眼见到，或许就会信服了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057950_1_73eaabf7:
    # "That's what I'm hoping."
    "我也希望如此。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057956_1_a46ef878:
    # "After a pause, Naomi shook her head and crouched beside the cabinet. When she raised the curtain, a huge cloud of smoke rose with it, coming from the grenade Atase had taken out of his pocket."
    "顿了顿，Naomi 摇了摇头，蹲到展示柜旁。她掀起遮布的瞬间，一大团烟雾跟着涌了出来——那烟雾来自 Atase 从口袋里掏出的烟雾弹。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057963_1_fc025fed:
    # "Ah...!"
    "「啊……！」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057967_1_185249cc:
    # "Before anyone could resist, Atase had already fallen to the floor. Looking down and covering his nose, he avoided having his consciousness fade."
    "还没等任何人反应过来，Atase 就已经伏倒在地。他低下头，捂住口鼻，不让自己失去意识。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057969_1_327bcf74:
    # "Once everyone plummeted down, a sudden, unsettling silence consumed the room.{w} What was happening outside? Had everyone evacuated? Had the gems been brought out in the suitcase? For a few seconds, Atase had to wait to make sure nobody remained conscious."
    "众人相继倒下后，一阵令人不安的死寂笼罩了房间。{w}外面究竟发生了什么？人都撤走了吗？宝石已经装进手提箱带出去了吗？Atase 不得不等上几秒，确认没有一个人还醒着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057970_1_7743aeae:
    # "He heard someone running through hallway A. It must have been the man with the gemstones, but why? Two minutes hadn't passed yet."
    "他听见有人从 A走廊跑过。那应该是带着宝石的那个男人，可为什么？两分钟明明还没到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057976_1_1812cc64:
    # "Atase's eyes widened. What the hell was that sound?"
    "Atase 睁大了眼睛。那到底是什么声音？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057978_1_075bab55:
    # "He waited, wondering what was happening. ...Had the plan been a failure?"
    "他等着，不知道外面出了什么事。……计划失败了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057981_1_a54a4e82:
    # "After a few seconds, the loud noise faded. However, Atase could not hear anything else outside the room."
    "几秒之后，巨响渐渐平息。可除此之外，Atase 再听不到房外有任何动静。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057984_1_9ad8930c:
    # "When he looked up, he couldn't believe he was in the same place. Very little light was being cast from the ceiling, and the walls had become dark."
    "他抬起头，简直不敢相信自己还在同一个地方。天花板上透下的光所剩无几，墙壁也已暗了下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057985_1_e9dce486:
    # "The three people who'd been with him were lying on the floor. Once he knew he could move, he silently stepped to hallway B."
    "刚才和他在一起的三个人都躺在地上。确认自己能动了之后，他悄无声息地走向 B走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057991_1_c6d2e188:
    # "Again, it was hard to believe it was the same place as before. However, nobody was there.{w} Covering his face, Atase dashed to the cleaning room."
    "和刚才一样，他几乎无法相信这里还是同一个地方。可这里一个人也没有。{w}Atase 捂住脸，冲进清洁间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057997_1_56cb8542:
    # "There was light; almost no smoke had gone through the door.{w} Occupying most of the space, the cart sat in the room. Without hesitating, he dropped the smoke grenade inside it."
    "里面亮着灯，几乎没有烟从门缝里透进来。{w}那辆推车占去了大半个房间。他没有犹豫，把烟雾弹丢进了推车。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L057998_1_a3995ebe:
    # "The fake Sekimeiya was there. However, Atase couldn't touch it with his bare hands, or he would leave smoky fingerprints on it. He took it with the clean sleeves of his shirt and brought it to the hallway, crouching so that the remaining smoke wouldn't make contact with it."
    "赝品 Sekimeiya 就在那里。可 Atase 不能赤手去碰，否则会在上面留下带烟的指纹。他用干净的衬衫袖子裹住它，拿到走廊上，又蹲下身，免得残留的烟雾沾到它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058003_1_cb2a510f:
    # "Back in the event room, he walked to the cabinet. Like Naomi had been about to do, he raised the curtain."
    "回到活动室，他走向展示柜，像 Naomi 刚才正准备做的那样，掀起了遮布。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058010_1_e2aee526:
    # "...{w}H-Huh?"
    "……{w}怎、怎么回事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058011_1_ec743c01:
    # "He stopped cold, suddenly bewildered. Two glowing stones were in front of him."
    "他猛地僵住，一时不知所措。眼前竟有两颗发光的石头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058012_1_715a1c71:
    # "Why? He couldn't comprehend what he was seeing.{w} Had there been two Sekimeiya?"
    "怎么会？他无法理解眼前的景象。{w}难道 Sekimeiya 有两个？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058013_1_85112f9d:
    # "Atase had to rush, but he didn't know what to do. If he took both gemstones, Xyn's plan would never work.{w} Dumbfounded, he reached for one of the two; he could only replace a single one."
    "Atase 必须抓紧时间，却不知该怎么办。若把两颗宝石都拿走，Xyn 的计划就绝不可能成功。{w}他怔怔地伸手去拿其中一颗——他只能换掉一颗。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058014_1_d3025358:
    # "He felt a screen of glass that he was able to slide open. Then, without placing his fingers on it, he took a gemstone out, swapping it with his.{w} Still in awe, he closed the glass and dropped the curtain down."
    "他摸到一块可以滑开的玻璃。随后，他尽量不让手指碰到宝石，把其中一颗取出来，换成了自己带来的那颗。{w}他仍满心惊愕，合上玻璃，放下遮布。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058020_1_2207dc04:
    # "He ran back with the gem in his hands. After locating the door, he moved into hallway B and silently went to the cleaning room."
    "他捧着宝石跑回去。找到门后，他进入 B走廊，悄声来到清洁间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058024_1_af70437c:
    # "He dropped the Sekimeiya next to the grenade, and once he was done, Atase rushed back to the event room."
    "他把 Sekimeiya 放在烟雾弹旁边。做完这些，Atase 便急忙赶回活动室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058031_1_76b08955:
    # "He made sure to close the door and stepped to the spot where he'd fallen down."
    "他特意关好门，走回自己先前倒下的位置。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058032_1_7602eb5d:
    # "However, the darkness prevented him from noticing something.{w} Naomi was no longer there."
    "然而黑暗让他没能察觉到一件事。{w}Naomi 已经不在了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058036_1_07fdb45e:
    # "While Atase lay down, he heard sounds around him: the floor wasn't empty."
    "Atase 躺下时，听见四周有响动：这一层并非空无一人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058037_1_5802be7d:
    # "Just what was happening? Everything started to become stranger when nobody entered where he was."
    "究竟出了什么事？他待在那里，没人进来，情况却开始变得越来越奇怪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058038_1_b67f7c50:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058039_1_5170b56b:
    # "His job was to stay there, and that was what he did."
    "他的任务就是待在那里，而他也照做了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058041_1_d3221699:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058042_1_5af84f32:
    # "...{w}But he couldn't make sense of it. Why weren't they being rescued?"
    "……{w}可他怎么也想不通。为什么没人来救他们？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058047_1_10ee483b:
    # "Wh—{w=0.4} *cough*"
    "什——{w=0.4}*咳*"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058048_1_7a8fcbaf:
    # "The boy woke up.{w} That was the start of a very long day.{w} During the previous weeks, Atase had come up with countless outcomes. However, the real one was far from any he'd devised."
    "那个少年醒了。{w}漫长的一天由此开始。{w}在此之前的几周里，Atase 设想过无数种结果。可真正发生的那一种，与他所设想的任何一种都相去甚远。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058051_1_74313b0f:
    # "They were trapped. The alarm he'd heard had removed all methods of escape.{w} When he learned Naomi had left the event room before his return, he had to hide his fear. ...Could she have noticed Atase's absence upon awakening?"
    "他们被困住了。他听到的那阵警报封锁了所有逃生的手段。{w}得知 Naomi 在他回来之前就已离开活动室时，他只能把恐惧藏起来。……她会不会一醒来就发现 Atase 不见了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058054_1_1b44c1d9:
    # "That was one of his initial questions, but they didn't stop piling up. Atase would have to spend twelve hours in that building until he could leave."
    "这只是他最初的疑问之一，可问题却接二连三地堆积起来。Atase 要在这栋楼里待满十二个小时才能离开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058055_1_8b288be2:
    # "He didn't know how worried he had to be or what had triggered the alarm. Even though the building was full of cameras, he knew not to be afraid of them.{w} He was told the internet connection had been cut by the alarm. In the meantime, Xyn couldn't remotely access the computer. However, he knew his group well. According to Katei, at {time=21}, the connection would come back, and Xyn would immediately erase all the recorded footage."
    "他不知道自己该有多担心，也不知道是什么触发了警报。楼里到处都是摄像头，可他清楚不必怕它们。{w} 他听说警报切断了网络连接，Xyn 一时无法远程访问电脑。不过，他很了解自己的同伴。按 Katei 的说法，到了 {time=21}，连接就会恢复，Xyn 会立刻抹掉所有录像。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058056_1_fe9ee875:
    # "He recalled the conversation he'd had with his boss word by word; he knew how important it was for him not to fail.{w} Therefore, despite the unforeseen alarm, Atase had only one priority: to make the plan a success."
    "他逐字回想与上司的那番对话，清楚自己绝不能失手。{w} 所以，尽管警报来得意外，Atase 也只有一个目标：让计划成功。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058066_1_5f676099:
    # "Inside Out"
    "里外翻转"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058075_1_4318d330:
    # "It was almost time."
    "时候快到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058082_1_e7c62138:
    # "Upon arriving at the tower, Katei had listened to the latest recording. As he'd hoped, Ido and his boss had talked one last time and gone over their movements.{w} Katei took out the SD card—he couldn't allow that audio to be heard by anyone else. As he didn't want the card on his person either, he hid it in the security room."
    "一到芦屋塔，Katei 就先听了最新那段录音。正如他所期望的，Ido 和他的上司最后谈了一次，把行动安排过了一遍。{w} Katei 取出 SD 卡——那段音频绝不能让其他人听到。他也不愿把卡带在身上，便把它藏进了监控室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058083_1_56e2dfe9:
    # "The time was rapidly approaching, and he didn't have the opportunity to go back to the staff room. While he tried to remain calm, he hid the voice recorder as well. Although the large device could've been found if Ashiya searched, he knew the SD card wouldn't be, which was all that mattered.{w} Through the monitors, Katei saw the first group approaching the event room. He had to act."
    "时间越来越近，他已经没机会回员工室了。他竭力保持镇定，把录音笔也藏了起来。那东西个头不小，芦屋那边若仔细搜查，或许能找到，但 SD 卡不会——这才是关键。{w} 透过监视器，Katei 看见第一批人正走向活动室。他必须行动了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058087_1_a2c00f16:
    # "Even though nobody was seeing him, he approached the hallway nonchalantly. During the previous days, he'd kept coming up with good excuses to get out of the security room at that time."
    "尽管没人看见他，他还是若无其事地朝走廊走去。前几天，他一直在琢磨合适的借口，好让自己能在那个时间点离开监控室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058093_1_93dd766a:
    # "Hallway A was empty, but as soon as Katei entered it, so did someone else. From the lobby came a man with long hair who he'd never seen before.{w} Paying no attention to Katei, he walked forward."
    "A走廊空无一人，可 Katei 刚走进去，另一个人也跟着进来了。那是个从大厅走来的长发男人，Katei 从没见过他。{w} 那人看都没看 Katei，径直向前走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058094_1_42204bf7:
    # "Behind the handrails, Katei knew the grenades were concealed. However, he couldn't look at them because that footage was going to be reviewed."
    "Katei 知道栏杆后面藏着烟雾弹。可他不能朝那边看，因为这段录像之后会被人查看。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058095_1_79063076:
    # "Katei couldn't get distracted. Keeping his expression natural, he stepped into the lobby."
    "Katei 不能分神。他表情自然地迈步走进大厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058103_1_dda45cc4:
    # "The room was full of people. All the visitors formed a line behind hallway B, while police officers conversed with Ashiya's guard.{w} Dote and Asfu, Katei's co-workers, greeted him with a smile. Their job was to uncover the cabinets in most of the crystal rooms, but they knew very few people there that day wanted to see those."
    "大厅里挤满了人。参观者都在B走廊后面排队，警察则与芦屋的警卫交谈。{w} Katei 的同事 Dote 和 Asfu 笑着向他打招呼。他们的职责是掀开大部分水晶展室里展示柜的遮布，但他们知道，今天在场的人里几乎没有谁想看那些东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058104_1_2bd315e2:
    # "One more person reacted to Katei's arrival: the janitor. However, only Katei noticed it, as Ido looked away immediately."
    "还有一个人对 Katei 的到来有所反应：那个清洁工。不过，察觉到这一点的只有 Katei——Ido 立刻就移开了视线。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058105_1_1ee10356:
    # "...{w}Nobody was looking at him, and he didn't want to walk away from the door. As if waiting for the conversation to end, he stared at the police as they talked."
    "……{w}没有人看着他，他也不想离开门边。他盯着交谈中的警察，像是在等那番对话结束。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058106_1_2775014b:
    # "Katei's plan wasn't guaranteed to work, but he wasn't at risk. Once the smoke was released, the chance to step back into the hallway might not have existed. If someone gestured at Katei to evacuate, he couldn't turn around.{w} However, it didn't matter; he wouldn't be blamed for the attack, and Xyn's plan would still fail. Furthermore, he could attempt to sneak away outside and then reenter the building through the storeroom anyway."
    "Katei 的计划未必成功，但他本人不会有危险。烟雾一旦释放，他也许就再没机会回到走廊里了。要是有人示意他撤离，他就不能回头。{w} 不过这无所谓；袭击不会算到他头上，Xyn 的计划照样会失败。再说，他大可以先悄悄溜到外面，再从储藏室绕回楼里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058110_1_8d90aabd:
    # "The time passed faster than Katei had imagined. All of a sudden, he noticed the light in hallway A disappear."
    "时间过得比 Katei 预想的快。忽然间，他注意到A走廊的灯光消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058111_1_90ef66c5:
    # "Wh-What's this!?"
    "这、这是什么！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058117_1_0478a412:
    # "Smoke! Something happened in the hallway!"
    "烟雾！走廊里出事了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058118_1_25a4c2b8:
    # "Someone opened the door in front of the crowd. In an instant, a plume of smoke invaded the lobby, and the door was forcibly shut again."
    "有人当着众人的面推开了门。刹那间，一股浓烟涌入大厅，门又被强行关上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058119_1_ac1369c3:
    # "It's in both hallways!"
    "两条走廊都有！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058122_1_964413f6:
    # "Katei felt a shock going through his body: that was the moment. In the blink of an eye, everyone had turned around toward the exit, while both police officers were alerting their superiors.{w} As quickly as he could, Katei dashed into the hallway and dropped to his hands and knees."
    "Katei 浑身一震：就是现在。眨眼间，所有人都转身朝出口看去，两名警察则在向上级报告。{w} Katei 用最快的速度冲进走廊，双手双膝着地趴了下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058126_1_0e4ab07e:
    # "...!"
    "……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058127_1_07d4d9ed:
    # "On the floor, someone almost crashed onto him. A person he couldn't distinguish through the veil of smoke rapidly crawled to the lobby, slamming the door shut behind them."
    "地上有个人，差点撞到他身上。隔着烟雾，他看不清那人的模样，只见对方飞快地爬向大厅，反手把门重重关上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058132_1_33714fd4:
    # "Suddenly, Katei could only hear his heartbeat. That person was undoubtedly the man he'd seen entering the hallway, but he couldn't be heard anymore. Only faint yells could."
    "忽然间，Katei 只听得见自己的心跳。那个人无疑就是他先前看见走进走廊的男人，可现在已经听不到他的动静了，只剩隐约的喊声。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058135_1_1c04b447:
    # "That was until a loud alarm rang through the building. Immediately afterward, a rough sound came from the lobby, along with stronger yells. The shutter was closing."
    "直到刺耳的警报响彻整栋楼。紧接着，大厅传来粗重的声响，喊声也愈发响亮。卷帘门正在落下。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058139_1_a6ad5050:
    # "And just like that, Katei's plan was set in motion. He had trapped himself, but nobody had realized it."
    "就这样，Katei 的计划开始运转。他把自己困在了里面，却没有一个人察觉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058140_1_ffb113f7:
    # "He'd seen the floor through the cameras: it was very likely only him and Atase were conscious. With utmost care, he slowly crawled toward the event room."
    "他通过摄像头看过那一层的情况：很可能只有他和 Atase 还清醒着。他小心翼翼地慢慢朝活动室爬去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058143_1_8725b75b:
    # "From outside, he heard a sound: Atase was standing up. Amidst the pure silence, Katei heard him going to the cleaning room."
    "门外传来声响：Atase 站起来了。在一片死寂中，Katei 听见他走向清洁间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058145_1_1d976314:
    # "That was Katei's chance to open the door slightly. When he did, he saw the floor of the event room, but all the bodies were too far away to be distinguished."
    "这正是 Katei 把门推开一条缝的机会。门一开，他看见了活动室的地面，可那些倒在地上的人都离得太远，分不清是谁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058146_1_0df40498:
    # "Through the gap, he stared. He knew the darkness would prevent Atase from noticing him, and there was something he had to see.{w} Days earlier, he had uncovered the cabinet's curtain. ...He had seen two identical Sekimeiya lying atop the cushion.{w} Although he'd gotten scared at first, Xyn hadn't planted a fake yet—he knew Ashiya had two identical gemstones."
    "他透过门缝盯着里面。他知道黑暗里 Atase 不会察觉到他，而且有件事他必须看清。{w} 几天前，他曾掀开展示柜的遮布。……他看见两个一模一样的 Sekimeiya 躺在垫子上。{w} 起初他确实吓了一跳，但 Xyn 还没有把赝品放进去——他知道芦屋手上有两块一样的宝石。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058147_1_dbd46173:
    # "Xyn would only be able to replace one, but Katei had the chance to obtain both. He merely had to observe from the hallway to learn which one got replaced."
    "Xyn 只能换掉一个，而 Katei 有机会把两个都弄到手。他只要在走廊里盯着，就能知道被换掉的是哪一个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058152_1_b7262862:
    # "It only took Atase a few seconds to come back. When he did, he approached the cabinet while holding a glowing stone."
    "Atase 只离开了几秒就回来了。他一回来，便拿着块发光的石头走向展示柜。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058153_1_e6dd773a:
    # "Despite the darkness, once he uncovered the curtain, Katei was able to perceive Atase's shock. Two gemstones were contained in the cabinet."
    "尽管四周昏暗，遮布一掀开，Katei 仍能感觉到 Atase 的震惊。展示柜里放着两块宝石。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058154_1_41490e20:
    # "He was completely still until he reached for one of them. After taking out the rightmost one, Atase placed his own inside.{w} He ran back without wasting even a second."
    "他僵立不动，直到伸手去拿其中一个。Atase 取出右边那个，把自己带来的放了进去。{w} 他一秒都没耽搁，转身跑了回去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058156_1_386672e3:
    # "That was Katei's moment. Overwhelmed by his unrelenting heartbeat, he rushed to the cabinet, covering his nose as he looked down."
    "轮到 Katei 了。心脏狂跳不止，几乎难以自持，他冲到展示柜前，捂着鼻子低头看去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058160_1_8e8c5d87:
    # "Admittedly, there was a small difference between them, but he knew the gem on the left was the valuable one. After taking it out, he hurriedly dropped the curtain as if nothing had happened."
    "平心而论，两块之间有些细微差别，但他知道左边那块才是真正值钱的。取出它之后，他匆匆放下遮布，装作什么都没发生。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058164_1_27f3e1c1:
    # "He reentered the hallway. Everything was going as planned, but his frantic breaths refused to steady."
    "他重新回到走廊。一切都在按计划进行，可他的呼吸急促得怎么也平复不下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058165_1_89e61858:
    # "The other Sekimeiya would be in the cleaning cart. Katei only had to be in the tower for a few more seconds.{w} Hallway C was still being recorded, so he skittered to the lobby. However, on the way, he abruptly stopped himself."
    "另一个 Sekimeiya 应该在清洁推车里。Katei 只需在塔里再待几秒。{w} C走廊仍在录像范围之内，于是他快步溜向大厅。可走到半路，他猛地停住了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058167_1_fc4bb3e6:
    # "He stared at his hands in confusion. ...What had happened? There was no glow there.{w} It didn't make any sense: he could feel the Sekimeiya's touch, but it didn't look like it was there."
    "他困惑地盯着自己的双手。……怎么回事？那里没有光芒。{w} 这说不通：他分明能感觉到 Sekimeiya 的触感，却看不出它就在手里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058172_1_f83f11fe:
    # "Bewildered, he stepped toward the light in the lobby, and once it illuminated his hands, he saw what had happened: the Sekimeiya was no longer white.{w} Puzzled, he looked around him. A metal shutter was covering the exit, but somehow the gemstone in his hands was more bizarre."
    "他满心惶惑，朝大厅的光亮走去。光线照到手上时，他才看清发生了什么：Sekimeiya 不再是白色的了。{w} 他困惑地环顾四周。出口被一道金属卷帘门封住了，可不知为何，手里的宝石更让他觉得诡异。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058173_1_47dc6f01:
    # "He looked at it with concern at the same time that he recalled Lei's words. It was essential for the Sekimeiya to remain in a cold space, and it couldn't be touched outside the cabinet."
    "他忧心忡忡地看着它，同时想起 Lei 说过的话。Sekimeiya 必须保存在低温环境中，而且不能在展示柜外触碰。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058174_1_e5506ac7:
    # "Had he damaged it? A nervous sweat broke out across his body. He lightly held the Sekimeiya with his suit instead so that he wouldn't directly contact it."
    "是自己弄坏它了吗？他紧张得冒出一身冷汗，于是改用自己的西装轻轻裹住 Sekimeiya，免得直接碰到它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058180_1_0a81ed3a:
    # "The view of hallway B was identical: not much could be seen a few steps ahead."
    "B走廊的景象也一样：往前几步就什么都看不清了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058181_1_7bd46da9:
    # "Atase had surely left the cleaning room already. Slowly, Katei turned its doorknob."
    "Atase 肯定早就离开清洁间了。Katei 缓缓转动了门把手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058185_1_ac4da0f4:
    # "The cart was there. Inside it, Katei saw the second Sekimeiya. Unlike the one between his hands, it still glowed dimly."
    "推车就在那里。Katei 在里面看见了第二个 Sekimeiya。与手里那个不同，它仍散发着微弱的光。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058186_1_f59884a0:
    # "He reached his right arm inside and took out the other Sekimeiya without touching it directly.{w} Amazed, Katei stared at it. He couldn't know if the cloth of his shirt had made a difference, but its glow hadn't vanished that time."
    "他伸出右臂探进去，没有直接触碰就取出了另一个 Sekimeiya。{w} Katei 惊讶地盯着它。他无从判断是不是衬衫的布料起了作用，但这一次，它的光芒没有消失。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058192_1_d359c160:
    # "But the amazement quickly morphed into stupefaction. The Sekimeiya was hot."
    "可惊讶很快变成了惊愕。Sekimeiya 是热的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058193_1_fc9e089d:
    # "He couldn't believe it, but there was no mistaking it: the Sekimeiya that had been in the cart was clearly warmer than everything around it. Why...? Was it also due to the absence of cold?"
    "他不敢相信，可事实确凿无疑：原本在推车里的那个 Sekimeiya，明显比周围的一切都温暖。为什么……？也是因为缺少低温吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058197_1_b2a081bc:
    # "Katei had to ignore it—he was running out of time. After stepping back into the hallway, he went inside the storeroom."
    "Katei 只好先不管它——时间不多了。他退回走廊，进了储藏室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058201_1_7e362118:
    # "He knew the secret mechanism very well. Entering the secret corridor, he placed both Sekimeiya on a suitcase lying open on the floor. He had left it there to be able to leave with the gemstones in the future."
    "他对这个隐秘的机关再熟悉不过。走进秘密通道，他把两个 Sekimeiya 放在地上敞开的行李箱里。那是他特意留在这里的，好让自己日后能带着宝石离开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058205_1_74a88d0a:
    # "Finally, he felt the last door, and as he did, he wondered. Would anyone see him? It couldn't be; he anticipated that everyone was in front of the main door."
    "终于，他摸到了最后一道门。就在那时，他心里嘀咕起来：会不会有人看见他？应该不会。他料想所有人都聚在大门前面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058211_1_031dd9f3:
    # "...{w}Wh-What?{w} Wh-Where is it!?"
    "...{w}什、什么？{w}在、在哪儿！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058212_1_00dfceb8:
    # "Petrified, Katei kept going through all his pockets.{w} The key wasn't there.{w} There was no way out for him without it. Desperately, he looked at all the keys he had, but none of them had the particular rust he most wanted to feel."
    "Katei 僵在原地，把全身上下的口袋翻了个遍。{w}钥匙不在。{w}没有那把钥匙，他根本无路可逃。他急切地翻看手里所有的钥匙，却没有一把带着他最想摸到的那种锈迹。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058217_1_f4fb1907:
    # "He realized that he must have dropped it.{w} He didn't keep it with the others, and he'd verified that he had it in the security room. Therefore, he'd dropped it in hallway A, when he'd been crawling toward the event room. Since his pocket had been so close to the floor, he hadn't noticed the sound of it falling out."
    "他意识到钥匙一定是掉在路上了。{w}那把钥匙他从不与其他钥匙放在一起，而且在监控室里还确认过自己带着它。那么，就是在他爬向活动室时掉在了A走廊。{w}口袋离地面那么近，钥匙滑出去的声音他自然没能听见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058222_1_4db715f6:
    # "F-Fuck! No!"
    "混、混蛋！不可能！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058226_1_249102f2:
    # "Tightening his fist, he went back to the hallway. It was drenched in darkness, but the key had to be somewhere."
    "他攥紧拳头，回到走廊。四下浸透了黑暗，可钥匙一定就在某处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058232_1_fcbeaec4:
    # "He moved to the wall he'd crawled next to and repeated the action, scanning the entire surface."
    "他来到先前爬行时贴着的那面墙边，重复了一遍刚才的动作，把整面墙细细扫过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058234_1_4674b8ed:
    # "Yes!"
    "有了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058236_1_2d76d9c3:
    # "Although he'd lost many precious seconds, he found it camouflaged under the smoke. He'd been trying to make very little noise, but he couldn't care about that anymore. As fast as he could, he ran back to the storeroom."
    "虽然耽误了不少宝贵的时间，他还是找到了那把被烟雾掩住的钥匙。此前他一直尽量不发出声响，如今也顾不得这些了。他以最快的速度跑回储藏室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058244_1_eaa04ff6:
    # "He stopped before the secret exit. A bright, grassy field was outside it, and he was so close to seeing it.{w} He located the keyhole and inserted the chilly key into it."
    "他在暗门前停下。门外是一片明亮青翠的草地，只差一步就能看见。{w}他摸到锁孔，把冰凉的钥匙插了进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058251_1_73ff6d9a:
    # "What?"
    "怎么回事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058254_1_fe6bbe61:
    # "It wasn't turning. The door wasn't opening."
    "钥匙转不动。门打不开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058261_1_470c5675:
    # "No. There's no way. Why is it..."
    "不可能。怎么会这样。为什么……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058264_1_19201d74:
    # "Something was preventing him from turning the key, and no matter how much he tried, it didn't budge. Such a thing had never happened to him before."
    "有什么东西卡住了钥匙，无论他怎么用力，它都纹丝不动。这样的事他从未遇到过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058271_1_51c2b344:
    # "They... Did they learn about this door?"
    "他们……难道他们发现了这扇门？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058275_1_4d9f8083:
    # "Subsumed by the darkness, Katei fell to his knees in defeat. The last method of escape, which he'd held as a trump card for years, had betrayed him.{w} The situation only became worse for him when he turned around.{w} There was nothing there."
    "黑暗吞没了 Katei，他绝望地跪倒在地。他多年来一直当作最后王牌的退路，到头来背叛了他。{w}可当他转过身时，情况更糟。{w}那里什么都没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058278_1_2c4c4155:
    # "H-Huh?{w} Where are... the Sekimeiya?"
    "咦、咦？{w}Sekimeiya 呢……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058280_1_30a73344:
    # "The two telltale glows weren't there. When he crawled to where the suitcase should've been, he saw that it had vanished as well."
    "那两团标志性的光芒不见了。他爬到行李箱本该在的地方，发现箱子也已消失无踪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058281_1_db9caa35:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058282_1_48020d11:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058283_1_b2b945c5:
    # "On the floor, Katei was consumed by a wave of cold fear. He'd been outsmarted—there was no other explanation."
    "趴在地上的 Katei 被一阵冰冷的恐惧吞没。他被人算计了——除此之外没有别的解释。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058284_1_e3c26674:
    # "Two doors blocked his view into hallway A, but he was scared to leave. Xyn must've been there."
    "两道门挡住了他望向 A走廊的视线，可他又不敢离开。Xyn 一定就在那边。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058285_1_e9e88490:
    # "Katei waited. Were they going to come now that they'd defeated him?"
    "Katei 等待着。既然对方已经击败了他，现在会过来吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058286_1_fe0f2844:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058287_1_52383dc1:
    # "What were they going to do? Would Katei's name be exposed? ...Those were the only thoughts he could formulate."
    "他们会怎么做？他的名字会不会暴露？……他脑子里只剩下这些念头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058291_1_3191a1e7:
    # "Katei looked up. He had heard a brief sound."
    "Katei 抬起头。他听见了一声轻响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058292_1_6c5a5936:
    # "Someone was in the hallway.{w} Slowly, he rose and stepped out of the secret corridor, then gripped the doorknob."
    "走廊里有人。{w}他缓缓起身，走出秘密通道，握住了门把手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058296_1_d6676816:
    # "Hallway A was still dark, but a bit more light had begun to pass through the smoke cover. That was how he saw a human figure walking to the lobby as it carried his suitcase."
    "A走廊依旧昏暗，但已有微光透过烟雾。借着这点光，他看见一个人影提着他的行李箱，正朝大厅走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058297_1_76966f59:
    # "It was Naomi, one of the people he was certain had fallen unconscious. Given the conversations he'd heard, Katei knew she wasn't working with Xyn."
    "那是 Naomi——他本以为肯定已经昏迷的几个人之一。从听来的那些对话判断，Katei 知道她没有和 Xyn 一伙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058298_1_7ea11a07:
    # "In an instant, he ran up behind her. He had to talk to her before everyone woke up.{w} However, as soon as she heard his movements, Naomi sprinted away to escape him."
    "他立刻追到她身后。必须赶在所有人醒来之前和她谈一谈。{w}然而 Naomi 一听到他的动静，便猛地跑起来，想要甩开他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058309_1_2017189c:
    # "When Katei set foot in the lobby, Naomi was nowhere to be seen. The hallway B door was slightly closed, but he couldn't rush. She could easily have been hiding behind the desk or in the room below."
    "Katei 踏进大厅时，Naomi 已不见踪影。B走廊的门半掩着，但他不能贸然冲过去。她完全可能藏在柜台后，或是楼下那间房里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058314_1_fdc6d6c8:
    # "He stepped forward slowly. His goal was to find Naomi as soon as possible—to learn how much she knew, what had happened, what she intended to do, and to retrieve the suitcase."
    "他缓步向前。当务之急是尽快找到 Naomi——弄清她知道多少、发生了什么、她打算怎么做，还要夺回行李箱。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058318_1_dbb6128c:
    # "But Katei didn't make it far before he turned back to the door. He heard running footsteps on the other side of the hallway."
    "可 Katei 没走几步便转身回到门边。他听见走廊另一头传来奔跑的脚步声。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058322_1_89aa9bf5:
    # "He peered into the hallway, but the dark cloud prevented a clear line of sight. Despite that, he was able to see that someone was there, and they began to go up the stairs.{w} He ran without thinking. He had to stop Naomi no matter how much panic assaulted him."
    "他朝走廊里张望，烟雾却挡住了视线。尽管如此，他还是看出那边有人，而且正往楼上走。{w}他想都没想就跑了过去。无论心里多么慌乱，他都必须拦下 Naomi。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058328_1_6dc7c3e3:
    # "The gray door was unlocked. That was all he needed to confirm that it was Naomi who'd gone up."
    "灰色的门没有上锁。这就足以确认上楼的是 Naomi。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058331_1_711c7b5a:
    # "He stepped onto the second floor—the echoing sound of footsteps was clearly audible. They were still running, so he had to pursue them."
    "他踏上二楼——脚步声在楼道里回响，清晰可闻。对方还在跑，他必须追上去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058334_1_9d8fc310:
    # "His life depended on it. He put all his strength into his legs and ran, disregarding everything else his body demanded. Rest and oxygen could wait."
    "这关乎他的性命。他把全身的力气都集中在双腿上，拼命奔跑，身体的其他需求一概不管。休息和氧气都可以等。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058338_1_f56f85bf:
    # "The stairs toward the fourth floor were before him. He maintained the highest speed possible, but he already knew everything was over. No matter what, the plan he'd crafted would never succeed."
    "通往四楼的楼梯就在眼前。他维持着极限速度，却已经明白一切都完了。无论怎样，他精心筹划的计划都不可能成功了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058342_1_55e899da:
    # "Ah...!"
    "啊……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058346_1_dd2ce764:
    # "Before reaching the top, he tripped on a step."
    "还没到顶，他便在台阶上绊了一跤。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058347_1_b8aaf611:
    # "He intercepted the fall with his wrist, but he couldn't immediately stand back up."
    "他用手腕撑了一下才没摔倒，却没能马上站起来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058348_1_0098632c:
    # "F-Fuck!"
    "混、混蛋！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058349_1_29be0b4e:
    # "When he did manage to rise, he was about to keep running. However, he realized that was a bad idea."
    "好不容易站起来，他正要继续跑，却意识到那是个糟糕的主意。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058350_1_a4a7bc69:
    # "Wait, shit...! She's going to the attic!"
    "等等，糟了……！她要去阁楼！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058351_1_b845f9ab:
    # "Finally, he understood how doomed he was. He couldn't open the attic, where Naomi would lock herself with the suitcase. Continuing to go up was a futile waste of time."
    "他终于明白自己已无力回天。阁楼他打不开，而 Naomi 会带着行李箱把自己锁在里面。再往上追，只是白白浪费时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058357_1_608ac450:
    # "In total disarray, Katei turned around. ...How much did Naomi know? Had she identified Katei...?"
    "Katei 心乱如麻地转过身。……Naomi 到底知道多少？她有没有认出 Katei……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058363_1_72e6d63b:
    # "What was he supposed to do...? Overwhelmed, he tried to think of a course of action."
    "他该怎么办……？他只觉得喘不过气，努力思索着下一步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058364_1_f156b397:
    # "More people were on the crystal floor. He had to act as if he'd gotten trapped like everyone else, but there were many things he had to take care of."
    "水晶展室里还有其他人。他必须装作和众人一样被困在这里，可又有很多事等着他处理。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058369_1_d337544c:
    # "His hands trembled as he walked back down. He balled them into fists and slowly released them.{w} The trembling stopped, but he was internally collapsing. Attempting a calming breath, he walked to the crystal floor, where he began to look around as if he'd been innocently imprisoned."
    "下楼时他的双手一直在抖。他握紧拳头，又缓缓松开。{w}颤抖止住了，心里却已经崩溃。他深吸一口气让自己镇定，然后走向水晶展室，装出一副无辜被困的模样四处张望。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058379_1_29f9b9bc:
    # "Tachyon Rotation"
    "快子旋转"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058386_1_00295a05:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058392_1_e9cf5ef9:
    # "Naomi's eyes opened in pain. Before them was a pair of shoes."
    "Naomi 在疼痛中睁开眼。眼前是一双鞋。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058393_1_a1be37ca:
    # "She recognized them, but not the scenery behind them. ...Where was she?"
    "她认得这双鞋，却不认得鞋后面的景象。……这里是哪儿？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058394_1_6ae790e6:
    # "A sharp sound refocused all of her senses.{w} She was in the event room, and there had just been an attack in the tower.{w} After getting that far, she almost gasped. Those shoes belonged to Katei, and what she'd heard was the cabinet opening."
    "一声锐响，让她猛然回过神来。{w}她在活动室，塔里刚刚发生过一场袭击。{w}想到这里，她差点倒吸一口凉气。那双鞋是 Katei 的，而她听见的，是展示柜打开的声音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058395_1_8febd26e:
    # "While she was still processing that information, the steps began to depart.{w} She had to stop him. At once, Naomi considered the possibility that Katei had been responsible for the smoke.{w} Her head hurt, and her limbs took a few seconds to respond. However, she was able to force her body up."
    "她还来不及理清这些，脚步声已经要远去了。{w}她必须拦住他。几乎同时，Naomi 想到烟雾也许正是 Katei 放的。{w}她的头很痛，四肢过了好几秒才听使唤，但她还是硬撑起了身体。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058396_1_3617385d:
    # "Speechless, she saw two people who she'd just met on the floor. Their names were Atsuki and Shiroya.{w} But what about the third person...? Another man had been with them, and Naomi couldn't find him."
    "她一时说不出话，只看见地上躺着刚认识不久的两个人——Atsuki 和 Shiroya。{w}可第三个人呢……？他们身边本来还有个男人，Naomi 却找不到他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058399_1_af60b12d:
    # "She grabbed her glasses from the floor. Immediately, her sight blackened, as the smoke had covered the lenses. Trying not to inhale what lingered of it in the air, she slowly staggered to hallway A, wondering how long she'd been asleep and cleaning her glasses with her sleeves."
    "她从地上抓起眼镜。镜片被烟熏黑，眼前顿时一暗。她屏住呼吸，尽量不吸入空气中残留的烟雾，一边用袖子擦着镜片，一边踉跄走向 A走廊，心里琢磨着自己究竟昏睡了多久。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058404_1_64105778:
    # "Six people had fallen unconscious. When the smoke was released, Naomi had been looking at the cabinet; out of all of them, she'd been the farthest from the source, as everyone else had been next to a grenade.{w} Atase had faked his unconsciousness, meaning that in the event room, Naomi's was the only adult body to be knocked out. Added to the lesser quantity of smoke that she inhaled, she would've been the first to awaken.{w} Because of that, when Katei stepped next to her ears, she was brought back to reality minutes before everyone else."
    "昏过去的一共六个人。烟雾释放时，Naomi 正在看展示柜；所有人里她离源头最远，因为其他人身边都有一颗烟雾弹。{w}Atase 是装昏的，也就是说，活动室里真正被放倒的成年人只有 Naomi 一个。再加上她吸入的烟雾更少，她本该是最先醒来的。{w}正因如此，当 Katei 的脚步声在她耳边响起时，她比其他人早了几分钟清醒过来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058410_1_fe8d8714:
    # "She couldn't believe the appearance of the hallway. Like in the event room, a dark, sticky coating was everywhere, blocking out the light. Thanks to hallway C's ceiling light, though, she was able to see the storeroom closing."
    "走廊的样子让她难以置信。和活动室一样，到处覆着一层黏腻的黑色物质，把光都挡住了。多亏 C走廊的顶灯，她才看见储藏室的门正在合上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058411_1_175a4804:
    # "It had been Katei, hadn't it...? She'd spoken to him a few times, but she'd never gotten a specific impression of him."
    "那是 Katei 吧……？她和他说过几次话，却对他没什么具体印象。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058414_1_193fe11d:
    # "Approaching the storeroom, Naomi hoped she'd been mistaken. Katei should've been in the security room, so perhaps he was acting against the attack by protecting the target.{w} Outside the door, she heard a noise."
    "Naomi 走向储藏室，希望是自己看错了。Katei 本该待在监控室，也许他正在应对袭击、保护目标。{w}走到门外，她听见了动静。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058415_1_315b9734:
    # "What was it...? It sounded like a door was being forced open, but that didn't make any sense."
    "那是什么声音……？听着像是有人在撬门，可这怎么也说不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058416_1_29fb7c7c:
    # "When it stopped, Naomi heard the person approaching and sharply burst to her side out of fear of being attacked."
    "声音一停，Naomi 听见那人正朝这边走来，她怕遭到袭击，猛地闪到一旁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058420_1_202a5b9b:
    # "...It was Katei. However, he didn't see Naomi, and instead, he rushed back into the darkness."
    "……是 Katei。但他没有看见 Naomi，而是转身冲回了黑暗里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058426_1_a266ee33:
    # "As soon as Naomi peeked inside the vacant room, her mouth dropped.{w} What the hell was she seeing? The wall was open..."
    "Naomi 往空无一人的屋里一探头，顿时目瞪口呆。{w}她到底看见了什么？墙竟然敞开着……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058427_1_be255dd7:
    # "All doubts vanished from her mind: Katei was behind the attack. A corridor extended beyond the wall—one she'd never known about. As much as she couldn't believe it, it explained a lot of things."
    "她心里再无怀疑：袭击是 Katei 干的。墙后延伸出一条她从未听说过的走廊。尽管难以置信，很多事却因此说得通了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058428_1_db12a50d:
    # "Then, she took notice of a glow on the floor. ...The Sekimeiya."
    "这时，她注意到地上有微光。……是 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058429_1_4ac88ec7:
    # "Concealing her footsteps, she approached the faint light. It was in a suitcase, and it appeared both gemstones were there. Slowly, she closed it and brought it out of the room."
    "她放轻脚步，走近那点微光。光来自一只手提箱，两颗宝石似乎都在里面。她缓缓合上箱子，把它带出了房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058436_1_7f4f5961:
    # "Although she couldn't see anyone, she was able to perceive Katei nearby. He was there, in the hallway.{w} Wishing not to be seen, she sprinted toward hallway C."
    "她看不见任何人，却能感觉到 Katei 就在附近。他就在走廊里。{w}为了不被他发现，她朝 C走廊奔去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058439_1_dbacc26d:
    # "Before she could breathe steadily, she heard Katei getting closer. Without moving her eyes, Naomi continued to take slow steps back."
    "她还没喘匀气，就听见 Katei 越靠越近。Naomi 双眼紧盯着那边，缓缓后退。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058441_1_27604977:
    # "But Katei wasn't coming for her. He simply reentered the storeroom."
    "可 Katei 不是冲她来的。他只是又走进了储藏室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058442_1_2082c99a:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058443_1_e5cd660f:
    # "That was when Naomi finally thought about how strange everything was. What was that silence? What had happened after she'd lost consciousness?"
    "直到这时，Naomi 才意识到一切都透着古怪。那份寂静是怎么回事？她昏过去之后，究竟发生了什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058444_1_6c210aea:
    # "From where she was, she could see that hallway B looked the same. Something of large scale had happened, so why was nobody else there?"
    "从她站的地方望过去，B走廊看起来也一样。出了这么大的事，怎么一个人都没有？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058445_1_b1507014:
    # "She felt frozen, and clueless as to what to do. ...At least, she had retrieved the Sekimeiya."
    "她僵在原地，完全不知该如何是好。……至少，Sekimeiya 已经到手了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058448_1_bd65851f:
    # "She had to leave. The exit was on the other side of the hallways, but she could only see a dark void."
    "她必须离开。出口在走廊的另一头，可她望过去只看见一片黑暗。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058449_1_2b569242:
    # "Was someone else there? She hesitated, scared to surround herself with the darkness."
    "那边还有别人吗？她犹豫了，不敢让自己没入黑暗。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058450_1_50636749:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058453_1_60c46d87:
    # "Holding tightly onto the suitcase, she took a step forward. A thin fog obscured her vision, but the lobby door shortly came into view."
    "她紧紧抓住手提箱，向前迈出一步。薄雾模糊了视线，但大厅的门很快出现在眼前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058454_1_6fb1d00d:
    # "However, alarm bells went off in her head. Someone was behind her, running at full speed."
    "然而她脑中警铃大作。有人在她身后，正全速奔来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058455_1_4b2fcab4:
    # "She couldn't look back. With the scarce energy she had, she went through the door."
    "她不敢回头，用仅剩的力气穿过了那扇门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058464_1_091b729a:
    # "Wh—"
    "什——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058466_1_5196e795:
    # "Her eyes went wider than ever before. A metal shutter was in front of the door.{w} It didn't make any sense, but she didn't have time to think. She had to keep running."
    "她的眼睛睁得比以往任何时候都大。门前是一道金属卷帘。{w}这根本说不通，但她没有时间思考，只能继续跑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058472_1_186b0e7b:
    # "Covering her face, she ran through hallway B. When she returned to where she'd been, she confirmed she wasn't being chased anymore."
    "她捂着脸跑过B走廊。回到刚才的位置时，她确认已经没人追来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058473_1_f173a4c9:
    # "She couldn't leave the building. It was ridiculous, but a huge piece of metal she'd never seen was blocking the way out. If Katei was the one who'd run behind her, there was only one place where she'd be safe."
    "她出不去了。说来荒唐，一块她从未见过的大金属板堵住了出路。如果身后追她的人就是 Katei，那她能安全待着的地方只有一个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058477_1_341337c0:
    # "She tried to open the elevator, but it wasn't on that floor.{w} She couldn't wait for it, so she took out her keys and dashed up the stairs."
    "她试着打开电梯，可电梯不在这一层。{w}她等不起，便掏出钥匙，冲上楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058480_1_8fde8f75:
    # "She unlocked the gray door, but she couldn't waste time locking it behind her; if her pursuer was Katei, he had that key as well."
    "她打开了那扇灰门的锁，却顾不上回身锁门——如果追她的人是 Katei，那把钥匙他也有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058483_1_39fe043e:
    # "She didn't slow down. Once she was on the third floor, a sound alerted her: she was being chased again."
    "她没有放慢脚步。到了三楼，一个声响让她警觉起来：又有人在追她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058484_1_9885faf6:
    # "Through the many floors of the tower, her goal was to make it to the attic. The Sekimeiya bounced inside the suitcase, and Naomi gripped the key without stopping once."
    "她穿过塔中一层又一层，目标就是阁楼。Sekimeiya 在手提箱里颠动，Naomi 一刻不停地攥着钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058489_1_7755c611:
    # "At last, the final floor was in sight, and nobody was behind her."
    "终于，最后一层近在眼前，身后已经没有人了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058492_1_cd7b8a12:
    # "With the key, she locked the door behind her."
    "她用钥匙反锁了身后的门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058494_1_ecaa1891:
    # "She had made it; Katei wouldn't be able to reach that place. Panting, she went up the narrow staircase."
    "她成功了，Katei 到不了那个地方。她喘着气，走上狭窄的楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058498_1_ac0d1dcf:
    # "Naomi stepped to the sofa, where she dropped her keys and the suitcase. Exhausted, she took a moment to catch her breath. The bright living room looked nothing like the lowest floor.{w} When she opened the case, she saw both identical gemstones. Even though she'd brought them to safety, she'd been told the cabinet's temperature was essential for their well-being."
    "Naomi 走到沙发前，把钥匙和手提箱放下。她筋疲力尽，缓了好一会儿才把气喘匀。明亮的客厅和最底层看起来完全不像同一个地方。{w}她打开箱子，两颗一模一样的宝石都在。尽管她已经把它们带到了安全之处，但有人告诉过她，展示柜的温度对宝石至关重要。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058499_1_ca3d48fe:
    # "Huh...?"
    "咦……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058502_1_60d0477f:
    # "Something was strange. The interior of the suitcase was very hot. Naomi felt around in it and gripped it tightly, unable to comprehend why it had heated up so much."
    "有些不对劲。手提箱里面烫得厉害。Naomi 伸手进去摸索，紧紧握住，怎么也不明白它为什么会变得这么烫。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058513_1_2db1789a:
    # "Wh-What!?"
    "什、什么！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058514_1_6e7d936e:
    # "Out of nowhere, both of the Sekimeiya vanished.{w} Astonished, Naomi stared at the empty suitcase. She had felt one of their white surfaces for an instant before both had disappeared."
    "两颗 Sekimeiya 凭空消失了。{w}Naomi 惊愕地盯着空荡荡的箱子。就在它们消失的前一瞬，她还摸到过其中一颗白色宝石的表面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058515_1_09aca4a7:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058516_1_b42f8885:
    # "She couldn't comprehend what had occurred; it wasn't possible. They couldn't have disappeared.{w} ...However, they weren't there anymore."
    "她无法理解发生了什么；这不可能。它们不可能凭空消失。{w}……可它们确实已经不在了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058517_1_3a517eb0:
    # "Wha...!"
    "怎……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058518_1_9556962b:
    # "Then, she noticed something else was gone: her keys, which she'd left next to the suitcase."
    "接着，她发现还有别的东西不见了：她放在手提箱旁的钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058519_1_8f7b0ed9:
    # "She questioned her own memories. She had just left the keyring there, hadn't she...?{w} Or had she left it in the keyhole?{w} Speechless, she peeked down the stairs."
    "她开始怀疑自己的记忆。自己刚才明明把钥匙串放在那儿了……？{w}还是说，插在锁孔里了？{w}她哑然无语，探头朝楼梯下张望。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058523_1_070bc891:
    # "It... wasn't there. But it wasn't on the sofa either.{w} She couldn't understand. How could her keys have disappeared with the Sekimeiya? It was utterly nonsensical.{w} She'd looked through the sofa, the suitcase, and all her pockets; they really weren't anywhere."
    "钥匙……不在那儿。可沙发上也没有。{w}她想不通。钥匙怎么会跟 Sekimeiya 一起消失？这根本说不通。{w}沙发、行李箱、所有口袋她都翻遍了，就是哪儿都找不到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058529_1_27066138:
    # "Wondering if she'd gone insane, Naomi walked to the hallway. She knew the layout of the attic well, and she was sure she was alone."
    "Naomi 怀疑自己是不是疯了，走到走廊上。阁楼的布局她再熟悉不过，而她确信这里只有自己一个人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058530_1_8a01e0a3:
    # "She'd intended to keep the Sekimeiya in a safe place, but somehow, she'd failed. Completely lost, she wondered what to do.{w} More people were on the crystal floor, and they could have already woken up."
    "她本想把 Sekimeiya 藏到稳妥的地方，结果却不知怎么没能做到。她茫然无措，不知该如何是好。{w}水晶层上还有不少人，他们或许已经醒了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058533_1_f1b1a21e:
    # "However... she couldn't leave. Without the key, she couldn't unlock the door she'd just locked, so she pressed the elevator button.{w} ...But nothing happened."
    "可是……她走不了。钥匙不在手上，刚锁上的门就打不开，于是她按下电梯按钮。{w}……然而毫无反应。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058534_1_3de3028a:
    # "Naomi couldn't believe her situation, but no matter how much she thought about it, she didn't think she was wrong about what had happened: she'd seen the Sekimeiya disappear before her eyes, so the same must have happened with the keys."
    "Naomi 不敢相信自己的处境，可无论怎么回想，她都不觉得自己记错了：她亲眼看着 Sekimeiya 在眼前消失，钥匙想必也是同样的情况。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058535_1_01f69e42:
    # "...What had happened in the tower? Had she been hallucinating everything since she'd fallen unconscious? She simply couldn't accept that she'd trapped herself in the attic."
    "……塔里到底出了什么事？难道自从昏过去之后，所见的一切都是幻觉？她居然把自己困在了阁楼里——这实在让她无法接受。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058536_1_34720ea8:
    # "But she had. Alone on the highest floor of the tower, Naomi had no method of escape."
    "可事实就是如此。Naomi 独自困在塔的最高一层，无路可逃。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058548_1_82725e0e:
    # "---"
    "---"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058559_1_dd7b36f6:
    # "And so began the day."
    "这一天，就这样开始了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058560_1_539c80b0:
    # "How did it end, however?"
    "可这一天最后又是怎么结束的呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058578_1_74305710:
    # "Bioluminescent"
    "生物荧光"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058604_1_b14433db:
    # "{w=0.6}My body crumpled down; I couldn't keep going."
    "{w=0.6}我双腿一软，再也支撑不住。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058605_1_808ab696:
    # "A month? What kind of joke was that? I couldn't bear one more second."
    "一个月？这算什么玩笑？我一秒都熬不下去了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058606_1_4fe504f3:
    # "Shiroya's words played back in my head. \"Don't forget what I said... I meant all of it.\""
    "Shiroya 的话在脑中回响。「别忘了我说过的话……每一句都是真心的。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058607_1_f847af5f:
    # "I laughed, alone. I didn't know where I was, what anything had become... none of it. Nothing we'd done had any meaning. We'd made it to the end of that impossibly long day for nothing."
    "我独自笑了。我不知道自己身在何处，不知道一切都变成了什么样……什么都不知道。我们所做的一切毫无意义。我们熬过了那漫长得不可思议的一天，却什么也没换来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058608_1_8be43db1:
    # "The words Shiroya had abandoned me with... Were they supposed to be reassuring?"
    "Shiroya 抛下我时说的那些话……那算是安慰吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058611_1_74591ad2:
    # "I tried to continue yelling her name, but my voice broke. She'd known what would happen and hadn't warned us. She'd kept waiting at our side, bolstering our hope, until she'd run away.{w} Why...!? She would never have done that... I couldn't let a single day change my view of her."
    "我还想继续喊她的名字，喉咙却发不出声。她明明知道会发生什么，却什么都没提醒我们。她一直守在我们身边，为我们打气，直到最后独自逃走。{w}为什么……！？她不可能做出这种事……我不能因为这一天就改变对她的看法。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058612_1_c4d4669f:
    # "But I couldn't help but despair. I wanted to leave. I wanted to be hit by the icy air and feel released. I wanted to talk to more people, even if they were the police."
    "可我无法不绝望。我想离开这里。我想让冰冷的空气扑面而来，好松一口气。我想和更多人说话，哪怕对方是警察也好。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058613_1_ae13c443:
    # "And it wouldn't happen. Could we survive an entire month? Of course not...! Shiroya hadn't been mentioned in the recording, so would I not see her for weeks?"
    "可这不会发生。我们能撑过整整一个月吗？当然不能……！录音里没有提到 Shiroya，难道我要好几周都见不到她？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058614_1_deede32b:
    # "Would the nightmare persist in the Sekimeiya's domain? It was too horrible of a thought to bear. People had died, and I still didn't know who, how, why..."
    "这场噩梦会在 Sekimeiya 的领域里一直持续下去吗？这念头太可怕，我承受不住。有人死了，而我至今不知道是谁、怎么死的、为什么……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058615_1_f64f1132:
    # "The lights had gone out, so I followed their example. I closed my eyes, intensifying the darkness, before I felt once again how insignificant I was."
    "灯已经灭了，我便也照做。我闭上眼睛，让黑暗更深一层，随后再一次感到自己是多么渺小。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058619_1_a6f41eef:
    # "I—{w=0.4}Isla?{w=0.5} Where...?"
    "我——{w=0.4}Isla？{w=0.5}这是哪儿……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058620_1_9dc611da:
    # "Erina's voice came from the hallway."
    "Erina 的声音从走廊传来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058621_1_f005dbed:
    # "Sh-She's not here!"
    "她、她不在这儿！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058622_1_b1f21d46:
    # "What?"
    "什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058623_1_ff3ac541:
    # "Where is she...!?"
    "她人在哪儿……！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058624_1_c82fdf2a:
    # "What are you talking about?"
    "你在说什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058625_1_e4fcfb13:
    # "Sai sounded confused too, near the end of hallway A."
    "Sai 的声音从 A走廊尽头传来，听起来同样困惑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058626_1_b6afd3a7:
    # "She's not here? Could she mean...?"
    "她不在这儿？难道是……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058627_1_835d30d6:
    # "I mustered the strength to scramble back out of the lobby."
    "我勉强聚起力气，踉跄着退出了大厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058634_1_0eb71513:
    # "Look! She isn't in the cabinet!"
    "你看！她不在展示柜里！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058639_1_7fbcc2ae:
    # "I entered the crystal room. Although I knew its walls were stained dark, I couldn't differentiate them from the rest.{w} I stepped to the cabinet where Isla rested and reached my hand inside.{w} ...She wasn't there."
    "我走进水晶展室。我知道墙上染着大片暗色，却分不清那些痕迹和周围有什么不同。{w}我走向 Isla 躺着的展示柜，把手伸了进去。{w}……她不在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058644_1_3e9fef2e:
    # "Y-You're right...{w} She was here just minutes ago."
    "你、你说得对……{w}几分钟前她明明还在这儿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058645_1_44024bd8:
    # "What the fuck? Did Shiroya take her out?"
    "搞什么鬼？是 Shiroya 把她带出去了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058646_1_fbd2afae:
    # "...What? Why would she do that?"
    "……什么？她为什么要那么做？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058647_1_ea53c59d:
    # "I'm sure you can explain why she did everything else."
    "别的事情你都能解释，这一件想必也不在话下吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058648_1_1354fac6:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058649_1_637462dc:
    # "What if she was saved? That could be it, right?"
    "说不定她被人救走了？也有这种可能吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058650_1_6b164542:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058651_1_7e678af3:
    # "Well, something just happened. That's for sure."
    "总之，刚刚肯定出了什么事。这一点错不了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058658_1_09e40de8:
    # "I followed Sai out.{w} Utterly lost, we went to check the bathrooms."
    "我跟着 Sai 走了出去。{w}我们全无头绪，只好去查看洗手间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058664_1_068ecac9:
    # "Man, what the fuck is this?"
    "喂，这他妈到底是怎么回事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058665_1_1f13e5de:
    # "Naomi isn't here either..."
    "Naomi 也不在这儿……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058670_1_f13f9b50:
    # "We ran to the crystal room where we'd found her first body.{w} It wasn't there. The curtain wasn't on the floor either."
    "我们跑到当初发现她那具遗体的水晶展室。{w}遗体不见了。地上的遮布也不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058674_1_e98014fc:
    # "...Did all the bodies disappear? In that case, Katei's must not be in the security room either, but why the hell is it locked?"
    "……所有遗体都不见了？那样的话，Katei 的遗体应该也不在监控室里了，可那扇门到底为什么锁着？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058675_1_9f2f4930:
    # "And it wasn't only the bodies. We had thought that if the exit didn't unlock at {time=21}, we would let the others listen to the recording. However, that could no longer happen; the recorder itself had certainly vanished alongside Isla."
    "而且不见的不只是遗体。我们本来打算，如果到了 {time=21} 出口仍未解锁，就让其他人听那段录音。可这件事已经办不到了——录音笔一定也和 Isla 一起消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058682_1_336fb3a1:
    # "Atsuki, when the lights went out, did you really not see anything?"
    "Atsuki，灯灭的时候，你真的一点都没看见？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058683_1_e776a875:
    # "I... didn't see anything, no."
    "我……确实什么都没看见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058684_1_149e44e8:
    # "Then why did Erina and I see a flashing light? It lasted an instant, but I find it really strange that it didn't happen to you."
    "那为什么我和 Erina 都看见了一道闪光？只有一瞬间，可偏偏你没看见，我实在觉得奇怪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058685_1_07c74ebf:
    # "I don't know. I have no idea...!"
    "我不知道。我完全不知道……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058686_1_d421bcbf:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058687_1_ea6eff27:
    # "Why was I the only one to not see that...? Could that indicate what happened?{w} Shiroya ran to hallway B and told us to not follow her. Was she going to the Sekimeiya in the cabinet?{w} Then, out of nowhere, the lights went off, and the shutter remained unmoving."
    "为什么只有我没看见……？那会不会恰好说明了什么？{w} Shiroya 跑向 B走廊，还叫我们别跟过去。她是要去取展示柜里的 Sekimeiya 吗？{w} 紧接着灯光毫无征兆地熄灭，卷帘门也始终没有动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058688_1_dee297b7:
    # "What the fuck had happened? Shiroya's face had looked the opposite of malicious, so why would she have done anything harmful? She couldn't have trapped us there for an entire month...!"
    "到底出了什么事？Shiroya 当时的表情绝无半分恶意，又怎么会做出伤人的事？她不可能把我们困在这里整整一个月……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058691_1_ae306bb6:
    # "Erina was behind us, and she sounded like she was in pain. Although we couldn't see it, it appeared her finger had started bleeding out of nowhere."
    "Erina 就在我们身后，声音听着很痛苦。虽然看不见，但她的手指似乎不知怎的开始流血了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058692_1_c72070af:
    # "Erina, before the lights went off, you went to the mechanical room, right?"
    "Erina，灯灭之前，你去过机械室，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058693_1_8a94c737:
    # "...{w}Y-Yes."
    "……{w}是、是的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058694_1_55eb1b87:
    # "Why?"
    "为什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058695_1_c66eb361:
    # "...I thought maybe someone was there. We still have to find Akaro."
    "……我想着说不定会有人在。我们还得去找 Akaro。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058696_1_eab77a91:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058697_1_cea51ee3:
    # "There's no way you believe her, right?"
    "你总不会信她吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058698_1_5e4481f5:
    # "...{w}The light breakers are there. Did you turn them off? What the hell happened to your finger?"
    "……{w}照明电闸就在那儿。是你关的吗？你的手指到底怎么了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058699_1_6345a7ea:
    # "What!? How would I have done that? They're locked up, and there's still electricity. The cameras are working."
    "什么！？我怎么可能做得到？那些都锁着，而且现在还有电。摄像头也还在运转。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058700_1_b9b98e4c:
    # "I glanced at the ceiling of the hallway, where the faint green lights of the cameras could be seen."
    "我朝走廊天花板瞥了一眼，那里能看见摄像头微弱的绿光。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058701_1_d3f1d6f3:
    # "A-And I don't know, but it really hurts! Did you just hear that? A drop of blood fell to the floor, but I can't see what kind of injury I have!"
    "而、而且我也不知道怎么回事，可真的很疼！你们刚听见了吗？有一滴血落到地上了，我却看不见自己伤成什么样！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058704_1_0ebd40c6:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058705_1_3f394eba:
    # "You could've only turned off the breakers that control the light, right?"
    "你能关掉的，也只有控制照明的那几个电闸吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058706_1_93798a26:
    # "Go check them! You'll see that I didn't touch any!"
    "你们去查啊！查过就知道，我一个都没碰！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058707_1_a77adf67:
    # "Did the light go off in the mechanical room?"
    "机械室里的灯也灭了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058708_1_998f916b:
    # "Yes!"
    "灭了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058709_1_ed0090e5:
    # "Then how are we supposed to check them!? We can't see anything!"
    "那我们还怎么查！？什么都看不见！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058710_1_912640bb:
    # "Doesn't your wristwatch give off some light?"
    "你的手表不是会发光吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058711_1_dbfd5a4e:
    # "Do you think this is gonna do anything!?"
    "你觉得这点光能管用吗！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058712_1_0dbdd462:
    # "Sai lit his watch's blue screen, but it didn't illuminate anything in front of it."
    "Sai 点亮手表蓝色的屏幕，可那点光连眼前都照不亮。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058713_1_e889d213:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058714_1_276d25d5:
    # "Is Shiroya still here? ...Is she currently listening to us?"
    "Shiroya 还在这里吗？……她此刻是不是正听着我们说话？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058715_1_c4a2d13b:
    # "\"Don't forget what I said... I meant all of it.\"{w} If she's not here anymore, then who did this? It can't be just a coincidence that Erina left our side minutes before the shutter was going to open."
    "「别忘了我说过的话……每一句我都是认真的。」{w} 如果她已经不在了，那这事又是谁做的？卷帘门就要打开的前几分钟，Erina 偏偏离开了我们身边，这不可能只是巧合。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058718_1_272e0a63:
    # "A month in the tower... That was impossible. There was no way that fate awaited us, but merely thinking about it was almost enough to make me lose my grip on reality."
    "在塔里待上一个月……绝无可能。我们绝不会有那样的下场，可光是想到这一点，我就几乎要分不清现实了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058719_1_908823a5:
    # "I couldn't stand it anymore. I wanted to know what was happening...! I wanted to know what had been going on since the start!"
    "我再也忍受不下去了。我想知道究竟发生了什么……！我想知道从最开始到现在，到底都在发生些什么！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058720_1_c68c42ba:
    # "\"Now stay here, and don't follow me.\"{w} Why!? Why did I have to stay there!? Leaving the tower with Shiroya was the only thing I wanted—it was the only thing both of us wanted!"
    "「待在这里，别跟过来。」{w} 为什么！？为什么我非得留在那儿不可！？和 Shiroya 一起离开这座塔，是我唯一的心愿——也是我们两人唯一的心愿！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058721_1_7cf26815:
    # "...Are the other floors going to be like this too?"
    "……别的楼层也会是这样吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058722_1_1643c3cf:
    # "You're asking as if I have a clue."
    "你问得好像我知情似的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058727_1_973158d3:
    # "We trudged along, bit by bit. In hallway C, Sai tried to open the elevator."
    "我们一点一点往前挪。到了 C走廊，Sai 试着打开电梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058729_1_06ee7fda:
    # "It's not here."
    "电梯不在这儿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058730_1_ee024b4f:
    # "He found the button on the wall and pressed it.{w} A while later, it still hadn't lit up."
    "他摸到墙上的按钮，按了下去。{w} 过了好一会儿，按钮依旧没有亮起。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058731_1_0ab5b7dd:
    # "Unless it's open on another floor, the elevator is disabled too.{w} I didn't want to use it, though. Let's take the stairs."
    "除非它停在别的楼层开着门，否则电梯也不能用了。{w} 不过我本来也不想坐它。走楼梯吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058734_1_baeecfb0:
    # "...Wh-What the...?{w} What happened to the lights?"
    "……怎、怎么回事？{w} 灯怎么了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058735_1_43827d04:
    # "That voice..."
    "这个声音……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058737_1_31247376:
    # "I turned around to where it had come from."
    "我转过身，朝声音传来的方向望去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058741_1_fba00613:
    # "Whose voice was it?"
    "那是谁的声音？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058742_1_a00f388d:
    # "What do you think? What are the remaining mysteries that you have solved?"
    "你怎么看？剩下的谜题里，你已经解开了哪些？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058743_1_f07088f1:
    # "Perhaps you would like to prove yourself as well. You will have the chance to do that.{w} Show that the peak is also awaiting you—that the keys you were given were put to use."
    "或许你也想证明自己。你会有这个机会的。{w} 去证明顶峰同样在等着你——证明交到你手上的那些钥匙都已派上用场。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058752_1_c7cc605d:
    # "Exactly, Akaro's return. That was what the voice signified."
    "正是如此——那声音意味着 Akaro 回来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058753_1_a318ddd2:
    # "From here on out, you'll be able to submit your own answers for the mysteries of this story and show what you've solved. At the end, you'll have access to the total number of correct answers, but your performance won't influence the story. Best of luck."
    "从现在起，你可以就本故事的谜题提交自己的答案，展示你已经解开了什么。到最后，你可以得知答对的总数，但你的表现不会影响故事本身。祝你好运。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058755_1_6f026055:
    # "Unfortunately, that is incorrect. Don't worry, though, as this is just the beginning."
    "很遗憾，这个答案是错的。不过不必担心，这才刚刚开始。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058756_1_aa771b5d:
    # "From here on out, you'll be able to submit your own answers for the mysteries of this story and show what you've solved. At the end, you'll have access to the total number of correct answers, but your performance won't influence the story. Best of luck."
    "从现在起，你可以就本故事的谜题提交自己的答案，展示你已经解开了什么。到最后，你可以得知答对的总数，但你的表现不会影响故事本身。祝你好运。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058763_1_3f766509:
    # "A-Akaro! Is that you?"
    "A-Akaro！是你吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058764_1_9242f3f1:
    # "Huh? Yes! ...Where am I!?"
    "啊？是我！……我在哪儿！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058765_1_2e293dfe:
    # "What the fuck do you mean!? We haven't seen you in hours!"
    "你他妈什么意思！？我们好几个小时没见到你了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058766_1_5158fb16:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058767_1_5164e213:
    # "What? What time is it? We're still in the tower, right?"
    "什么？现在几点了？我们还在塔里吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058768_1_69bae280:
    # "Of course we are, and it's past {time=21}! The shutter didn't open!"
    "我们当然还在，而且现在已经过了{time=21}！卷帘门没有打开！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058769_1_8d424d65:
    # "W-Wait, what!? That can't be...!"
    "等、等等，什么！？这怎么可能……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058770_1_e0019a82:
    # "Cut it out! Where the fuck have you been!?"
    "少来这套！你他妈到底去哪了！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058771_1_9e5bc6e1:
    # "What does that mean!? I just touched the Sekimeiya and appeared here!"
    "什么意思！？我只是碰了一下 Sekimeiya，就出现在这里了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058774_1_f558a2ea:
    # "Where? When did you touch it?"
    "在哪？什么时候碰的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058775_1_0ec8a3a1:
    # "U-Uh... it was..."
    "呃、那个……是在……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058776_1_1da5a88b:
    # "Spit it out! Was it after we escaped from the attic's bedroom? I don't even give a shit anymore!"
    "快说！是在我们从阁楼卧室逃出来之后吗？我他妈已经不在乎了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058777_1_62aecf82:
    # "Y-Yes."
    "是、是的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058778_1_d9c5f16d:
    # "You son of a bitch! He punched me in the stomach!{w} I was knocked out, and when I woke up, I couldn't even stand up straight!"
    "你这王八蛋！他朝我肚子打了一拳！{w}我被打昏过去，醒来后连站都站不直！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058779_1_561dc34e:
    # "...I told him to tell me where he put the Sekimeiya since I knew he had it. I just touched it on the crystal floor, and the lights went off."
    "……我知道 Sekimeiya 在他手上，就叫他告诉我他放哪儿了。我只是在水晶层碰了它一下，灯就灭了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058780_1_76aea7dd:
    # "Are you saying that you traveled forward in time? You're a fucking liar."
    "你是想说，你穿越到了未来？你他妈就是在撒谎。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058781_1_4634cba7:
    # "I'm not lying!"
    "我没撒谎！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058782_1_3a629ba7:
    # "My mind was worn out, but what Akaro was saying didn't make sense. I had seen him earlier, before Shiroya had run up to the attic."
    "我脑子已经累得不行了，可 Akaro 的话怎么也说不通。我之前见过他，就在 Shiroya 跑上阁楼之前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058785_1_14e45577:
    # "I don't care if you don't believe me, just tell me what the fuck happened! Why are the lights off, and where is everyone else!?"
    "你们不信也无所谓，先告诉我到底他妈发生了什么！为什么灯灭了，其他人又都去哪了！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058786_1_e8f79c9b:
    # "You were gone for six hours! Do you think I'm gonna believe that nonsense!? Katei died, and God knows where Shiroya is!"
    "你消失了六个小时！你觉得我会信这种鬼话！？Katei 死了，Shiroya 也不知去向！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058787_1_2a667505:
    # "Wait, what!? Katei was killed...?"
    "等等，什么！？Katei 被杀了……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058788_1_e76ae20e:
    # "Yes!"
    "没错！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058789_1_70204c4b:
    # "What about Isla?"
    "Isla 呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058790_1_7ebc0524:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058791_1_a4864cb8:
    # "I-Isla...? Y-You... know what happened, right...?"
    "Isla……？你、你……知道发生了什么吧……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058792_1_7a18e4be:
    # "Yes, but she was here again!{w} Sai, why did you go quiet!? You saw her as well!"
    "对，可她又在这里了！{w}Sai，你怎么不说话了！？你也看见她了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058793_1_b1dfec05:
    # "...{w}I don't know what happened.{w} She was alive when we left the attic. We talked to her, but she didn't remember anything about what had happened. After this son of a bitch knocked me out, I wasn't able to find her again."
    "……{w}我不知道发生了什么。{w}我们离开阁楼时，她还活着。我们跟她说过话，可她对之前发生的事一点印象都没有。这个王八蛋把我打昏之后，我就再也没找到她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058796_1_373cd7bd:
    # "What...!? You never said that! That means she's alive! The recording was right—she'll be here!"
    "什么……！？你从没说过这些！那说明她还活着！录音里说的是真的——她会来的！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058797_1_dc9e287c:
    # "What recording?"
    "什么录音？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058798_1_37683fdb:
    # "...{w}Can you please answer me? Why are the lights off!? There's no way it's {time=21.}"
    "……{w}能不能回答我？灯到底为什么灭了！？现在不可能是{time=21.}吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058799_1_a17d8d81:
    # "Sai stabbed his wristwatch with one finger."
    "Sai 伸出一根手指点了点自己的腕表。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058800_1_1c8e39da:
    # "It's {time=21:12}, dumbass! And we don't know what happened! The lights went off just minutes before the shutter was gonna open, and we have no idea why!"
    "现在是{time=21:12}，蠢货！而且我们也不知道发生了什么！卷帘门本来再过几分钟就要打开，灯却灭了，我们根本不知道为什么！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058801_1_f6156eeb:
    # "That's not all that happened. The dead bodies disappeared too. It wasn't just the light."
    "出的事还不止这些。尸体也消失了。不只是灯灭了而已。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058802_1_8a31feed:
    # "That was why Akaro's story was unbelievable. Had he traveled... to the future? Was that possible?{w} Even if it was, his appearance didn't make sense. Something had happened at {time=21} that went against the normal flow of time. I didn't think that Akaro could've simply traveled forward in time to appear where we were."
    "所以 Akaro 的话才让人难以置信。他……穿越到了未来？这可能吗？{w}就算可能，他出现在这里也说不通。{time=21}时一定发生了什么违背正常时间流动的事。我不觉得 Akaro 只是单纯穿越到未来，然后出现在我们面前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058805_1_0774863b:
    # "Wait a second! What the fuck are...{w} these clothes?"
    "等一下！这他妈……{w}是什么衣服？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058806_1_84623a25:
    # "Huh?"
    "嗯？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058807_1_f46992ff:
    # "I'm not wearing the clothes I was wearing before! What the fuck!?"
    "我穿的不是之前那身衣服！搞什么鬼！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058808_1_d2caee21:
    # "Speechless, we stepped over to his voice. Once I felt the texture of his shirt, I realized it wasn't the one he'd been wearing before."
    "我们一时无言，循着他的声音走近。摸到他衬衫的布料后，我才发现那确实不是他先前穿的那件。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058809_1_2a5ba64e:
    # "Ah, the Sekimeiya changed your clothes. Is that right?"
    "啊，是 Sekimeiya 给你换了衣服。是这意思吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058810_1_5f2a3490:
    # "Th-That's what happened! They just changed!"
    "就、就是这样！衣服自己变了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058811_1_290f2990:
    # "You're several galaxies out of your mind if you think we'll believe anything that you're saying. What the fuck is your goal?"
    "你要是觉得我们会信你这些鬼话，那你脑子都飞出银河系了。你他妈到底想干什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058812_1_ff6dd451:
    # "Are they yours?"
    "那是你的衣服？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058813_1_7bd3d5b1:
    # "These clothes...?{w} I... think so. They're not the ones I had on, though!"
    "这些衣服……？{w}我……应该是吧。可这不是我原来穿的那套！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058814_1_3df903da:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058815_1_a8c6d753:
    # "I had no idea what to believe. Had the Sekimeiya made Akaro travel to the future? Had it swapped his clothing...? I couldn't rule anything out as impossible, but it wasn't easy to trust him."
    "我不知道该相信什么。是 Sekimeiya 让 Akaro 穿越到了未来吗？连他的衣服也一并换掉了……？我无法排除任何可能，可要信任他并不容易。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058818_1_ea9881a7:
    # "If he was telling the truth... who was the Akaro I'd seen? His existence had gradually gotten harder to comprehend."
    "如果他说的是真话……那我先前见到的 Akaro 又是谁？他的存在正变得越来越难以理解。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058819_1_49b8f2e8:
    # "You're really saying the shutter is still there...?{w} We're in hallway C, right?"
    "你是说，卷帘门真的还在……？{w}这里是C走廊，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058820_1_50980453:
    # "Hugging the wall, Akaro walked to the lobby."
    "Akaro 贴着墙，朝大厅走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058822_1_2086fd5e:
    # "It is... It really is still here.{w} Is it actually after {time=21}? What the fuck do we do, then!?"
    "确实……卷帘门确实还在。{w}现在真的过了{time=21}吗？那我们他妈该怎么办！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058823_1_479b9e2b:
    # "What the fuck do you think we can do!? Nothing!"
    "你觉得我们他妈还能怎么办！？什么都做不了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058824_1_a3b356d3:
    # "Despite being aware of another option for so long, there was another choice. We had the Sekimeiya.{w} We could travel through time. According to Akaro, he had traveled hours forward, so nothing said we couldn't escape the tower with it.{w} The reason I hadn't explored that option yet was what Shiroya had said. Due to her, I wasn't sure that trying to escape from the dark tower was what I had to do. However, Sai and Akaro weren't even discussing the Sekimeiya. Supposedly, Akaro had just appeared, and he hadn't even asked about its whereabouts."
    "我明明早就知道还有另一个选择，却一直没去走。我们手里有 Sekimeiya。{w}我们可以穿越时间。据 Akaro 说，他曾穿越到几小时之后，那靠它逃出塔也并非不可能。{w}我之所以迟迟没考虑这条路，是因为 Shiroya 的那番话。因为她，我不确定自己是否该设法逃出这座黑暗的塔。可 Sai 和 Akaro 却连提都没提 Sekimeiya。Akaro 才刚出现，甚至没问过它在哪儿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058825_1_3f4599de:
    # "And... you said Shiroya is gone? What happened to her?"
    "还有……你说 Shiroya 不见了？她出了什么事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058826_1_0efd3d22:
    # "We don't know! If you're not behind whatever just happened, it must be her! She ran away before the lights went out and said not to follow her. She should be somewhere."
    "我们不知道！如果刚刚发生的事不是你搞的，那就一定是她！灯灭之前她跑掉了，还叫我们别跟过去。她应该还在什么地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058829_1_3b72b632:
    # "Sai, you've reiterated that you know more about the Sekimeiya than us, and you haven't fundamentally denied what Akaro said. Does that mean that traveling to the future is possible?"
    "Sai，你一再强调自己比我们更了解 Sekimeiya，也没有真正否定 Akaro 的说法。这是否意味着，穿越到未来是可能的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058830_1_8f2205b3:
    # "...I don't know. Even if it was, would you really believe the nonsense he's spewing?"
    "……我不知道。就算真是那样，你会信他那些胡话？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058831_1_a598a804:
    # "You're the one spewing nonsense! Why would the exit not unlock!? One of you killed Katei, right? Who was it!?{w} And what, the bodies disappeared? Have you searched for them? We know the Sekimeiya doesn't make them vanish, right? Is it even in the cabinet?"
    "说胡话的是你吧！出口怎么会解不开锁！？Katei 是你们当中某个人杀的，对不对？到底是谁！？{w} 还有，尸体消失了？你们找过没有？Sekimeiya 不会让人凭空消失，这我们总该知道吧？它到底在不在展示柜里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058832_1_0c6acb7a:
    # "...Yes.{w} And we were planning to search through the higher floors. We don't even know if the lights went off up there, but the elevator doesn't work, and the security room is locked for some reason."
    "……是。{w} 况且我们本来就打算搜上面几层。上面灯有没有灭，我们也不清楚，可电梯用不了，监控室不知怎么还锁着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058833_1_a5e00d40:
    # "What...? I'm really going to lose it. I have no idea how I've gone through all of this without losing it already."
    "什么……？我真要疯了。我都不知道自己是怎么撑到现在还没疯的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058834_1_e579877a:
    # "Shut the fuck up! If you're telling the truth, we've been here twice as long as you!{w} Let's just go up. We can hope there's still light somewhere."
    "你他妈闭嘴！如果你说的是真的，我们在这儿待的时间是你的两倍！{w} 先上去再说。只能指望哪儿还亮着灯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058842_1_e2f3bb0e:
    # "That put the discussion on pause. I couldn't believe my legs were still obeying me, but I proceeded up the stairs.{w} Was there anything to find? ...Shiroya? Maybe Isla...? I had moved beyond taking things for granted."
    "争论就此打住。我的腿居然还听使唤，连我自己都不敢相信，可我还是顺着楼梯往上走。{w} 能找到什么吗？……Shiroya？也许是 Isla……？我已经不敢再把任何事当作理所当然。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058846_1_e45acc00:
    # "Once we went through the gray door, we saw that the darkness would likely persist."
    "穿过那扇灰门后，我们意识到黑暗多半还会持续下去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058851_1_c2b89392:
    # "Did the lights really go out everywhere?"
    "灯真的全都灭了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058852_1_c6df6848:
    # "Seems so."
    "看来是。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058853_1_f6a21113:
    # "Even if there's something to find, there's no way we can find it."
    "就算真有什么线索，这种黑灯瞎火也根本找不到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058854_1_8ceba582:
    # "And if someone else is here, they're staying away from us on purpose. We should go all the way up first."
    "而且要是这里还有别人，那人就是故意躲着我们。我们先一路走到顶再说。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058855_1_7848d7e9:
    # "We went around the floor without entering the offices. Our steps echoed loudly in comparison to the more muffled corridors on the first floor."
    "我们绕着这一层走了一圈，没有进办公室。跟一楼那些声音闷闷的走廊相比，这里的脚步声回荡得格外响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058860_1_3d6ac2f4:
    # "Gripping the handrail, we went up the stairs step by step.{w} On the third floor, I wondered if we would even be able to step into the attic. Perhaps Sai had a second key, but the original one should've been in the inner keyhole, and it could've already been taken."
    "我们抓着扶手，一级一级往上走。{w} 到了三楼，我开始担心我们究竟进不进得了阁楼。也许 Sai 还有另一把钥匙，可原来那把应该插在内侧的锁孔里，说不定已经被人取走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058866_1_7fb436dd:
    # "We were all disheartened. Silently, we arrived on the sixth floor, though we could only know because we'd counted the stairwells."
    "所有人都泄了气。我们默默走到了六楼，全靠数着楼梯间才知道到了哪一层。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058873_1_c2659628:
    # "The door's unlocked."
    "门没锁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058874_1_7ce37c12:
    # "Sai opened the door to the attic, but we didn't see anything ahead of us."
    "Sai 推开了阁楼的门，可我们眼前什么也看不见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058875_1_d3b55d2f:
    # "The key's still inserted here. ...It doesn't seem like there's light above, though."
    "钥匙还插在这儿。……不过上面好像也没灯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058881_1_bbbc02dc:
    # "We stepped up the narrow staircase. At the top, we confirmed no light was on the final floor either."
    "我们踏上狭窄的楼梯。到了顶上一看，最上层同样没有灯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058883_1_3b63bbfd:
    # "Fuck, man. Do we really have to stay in the dark?"
    "操。难不成我们真得一直摸黑待着？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058884_1_113c1eac:
    # "As if having light would be that much better."
    "说得好像有灯就能好多少似的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058885_1_dfeb112c:
    # "...Hang on."
    "……等等。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058889_1_c8b8f6d1:
    # "I stepped forward, toward the table."
    "我朝桌子走了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058890_1_19d16884:
    # "After fiddling with a cable, I pressed a switch."
    "我摆弄了一阵电线，按下了开关。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058899_1_e582b75e:
    # "Oh, the lamp!"
    "啊，那盏灯！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058900_1_ee4c90c1:
    # "It works, thank God. I wasn't sure if it would, but it'll do."
    "谢天谢地，还能用。我本来也没把握，不过够用了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058907_1_a1cb7c95:
    # "I looked at everyone and almost fell back. It took me a second to notice that the man behind Erina was Akaro. Not only were his clothes different, but also his hair—he was hardly recognizable."
    "我转头看向众人，差点向后跌倒。过了片刻我才认出，站在 Erina 身后的男人是 Akaro。不光衣服换了，连头发也不一样——几乎认不出他来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058913_1_7b9d22d0:
    # "Oh my God! Th-The tip of my finger is cut! L-Look how much blood I'm losing!"
    "天啊！我、我的指尖割破了！你、你看看我流了多少血！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058914_1_e6b94f1f:
    # "Erina looked inside her purse and brought out bandages. Grimacing from the sight of the blood, she covered her finger with them."
    "Erina 翻找手提包，取出了创可贴。看到血，她皱起眉，还是把手指包上了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058921_1_1b3772f4:
    # "The bedrooms... had a lamp as well, right?"
    "卧室里……也有台灯吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058922_1_cad2ce36:
    # "Yes."
    "有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058927_1_5f07d040:
    # "Thanks to them, we were able to light up the bedrooms, and by opening the doors, the hallway, kitchen, and bathroom were slightly illuminated as well."
    "多亏这些灯，卧室亮了起来；门一开，走廊、厨房和浴室也透进了些光。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058931_1_112534f8:
    # "Two of those places contained a minor indication that shed light on their situation, but in a third one was the biggest clue."
    "其中两处各有一点细微的迹象，能说明他们的处境；而第三处藏着的，才是最大的线索。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058940_1_d29b1cef:
    # "Precisely. It was in the kitchen."
    "正是。就在厨房。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058941_1_b6d3e871:
    # "Initially, Atsuki noticed that the footprints they'd just left in the living room were the only ones. It was very strange; fainter ones should've been there."
    "起初，Atsuki 注意到客厅里只有他们刚踩出的脚印。这非常奇怪——本该还有更浅的脚印才对。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058942_1_254123ca:
    # "Then, he saw that the inner handle of the right bedroom was unattached, like it had been minutes prior."
    "接着，他发现右侧卧室内侧的门把手脱落了，像是几分钟前才掉下来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058944_1_8cada942:
    # "In the living room, Atsuki noticed that the footprints they'd just left were the only ones. It was very strange; fainter ones should've been there."
    "在客厅里，Atsuki 注意到地上只有他们刚留下的脚印。这非常奇怪——本该还有更浅的脚印才对。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058945_1_3439a819:
    # "He frowned and moved on, unaware that another place held a much stronger clue."
    "他皱了皱眉，继续往前走，却不知道另一处还藏着更确凿的线索。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058946_1_43ab3e64:
    # "Then, he saw that the inner handle of the right bedroom was unattached, like it had been minutes prior.{w} Confused, he stepped out."
    "接着，他发现右侧卧室内侧的门把手脱落了，像是几分钟前才掉的。{w} 他满心疑惑，退了出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058948_1_83422e63:
    # "There was nothing in the storeroom that indicated where they were."
    "储藏室里没有任何能说明他们身处何处的线索。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058949_1_592b26ce:
    # "In the living room, however, Atsuki noticed that the footprints they'd just left were the only ones. It was very strange; fainter ones should've been there."
    "然而在客厅里，Atsuki 注意到地上只有他们刚留下的脚印。这非常奇怪——本该还有更浅的脚印才对。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058950_1_8c1dceb6:
    # "Then, he saw that the inner handle of the right bedroom was unattached, like it had been minutes prior.{w} Confused, he stepped out."
    "接着，他发现右侧卧室内侧的门把手脱落了，像是几分钟前才掉的。{w} 他满心疑惑，退了出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058952_1_75b946f8:
    # "There was nothing in the bathroom that indicated where they were."
    "浴室里没有任何能说明他们身处何处的线索。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058953_1_3992a462:
    # "In the living room, however, Atsuki noticed that the footprints they'd just left were the only ones. It was very strange; fainter ones should've been there."
    "然而在客厅里，Atsuki 注意到地上只有他们刚留下的脚印。这非常奇怪——本该还有更浅的脚印才对。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058954_1_2917ee54:
    # "Then, he saw that the inner handle of the right bedroom was unattached, like it had been minutes prior.{w} Confused, he stepped out."
    "接着，他发现右侧卧室内侧的门把手脱落了，像是几分钟前才掉的。{w} 他满心疑惑，退了出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058956_1_c8c3536b:
    # "In the right bedroom, Atsuki noticed that the inner handle was unattached, like it had been minutes prior.{w} He had seen that in the living room, the footprints they'd just left had been the only ones. It was very strange; fainter ones should've been there as well."
    "在右侧卧室里，Atsuki 发现内侧的门把手脱落了，像是几分钟前才掉的。{w} 他先前在客厅已经看到，地上只有他们刚留下的脚印。这非常奇怪——本该还有更浅的脚印才对。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058957_1_65eec0ae:
    # "Confused, he stepped out, unaware that another place held a much stronger clue."
    "他满心疑惑，退了出来，却不知道另一处还藏着更确凿的线索。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058962_1_067923e5:
    # "...!"
    "……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058963_1_dfa342f8:
    # "That glass..."
    "那只杯子……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058964_1_2067b6ec:
    # "There was a glass next to the sink.{w} I recognized it—when I'd been with Shiroya, I had tried to drink tap water. It had tasted terrible, and I'd set it aside."
    "水槽边放着一只杯子。{w} 我认得它——和 Shiroya 在一起的时候，我曾试着喝自来水。那水难喝得要命，我就把杯子搁到了一边。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058965_1_29510333:
    # "After that time, I had seen the glass again. But there was a major distinction between that glass and the one I was looking at."
    "那之后，我又见过那只杯子。可那只杯子和眼前这一只，有个很大的不同。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058966_1_e8a61699:
    # "Specifically, it had since become empty."
    "确切地说，那只杯子已经空了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058967_1_852c3cb0:
    # "H-Hey, guys! Come to the kitchen."
    "喂、喂，大家！到厨房来一下。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058974_1_4224a129:
    # "Everyone entered."
    "所有人都走了进来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058975_1_1d3b32f8:
    # "What do you want?"
    "有什么事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058976_1_790c3d64:
    # "Did any of you pour out the water in this glass?"
    "你们谁把这只杯子里的水倒掉了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058981_1_71fa6004:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058987_1_98b8ef16:
    # "I didn't."
    "我没倒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058988_1_765ca746:
    # "Everyone denied it with confusion."
    "所有人都一脸困惑地否认了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058989_1_5824d68b:
    # "I left it here a few hours ago, and it was filled with water. I don't think it moved either."
    "几个小时前我把它放在这儿，里面装满了水。我想它也没被人动过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058994_1_2f912092:
    # "So it vanished on its own?"
    "那就是它自己消失了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L058995_1_00571818:
    # "Yes."
    "嗯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059000_1_3464faf9:
    # "Sai frowned."
    "Sai 皱起了眉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059001_1_f092a135:
    # "What, did it evaporate?"
    "怎么，蒸发了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059002_1_1a4ed9cc:
    # "Water evaporates at any temperature that doesn't freeze it, right?"
    "只要没结冰，水在任何温度下都会蒸发吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059007_1_c3171676:
    # "Atsuki, we're indoors. The air isn't moving, and it's not hot at all. It could take a month for the water in a glass to evaporate."
    "Atsuki，我们是在室内。空气不流动，也一点都不热。一杯水要蒸发掉，说不定得花上一个月。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059008_1_551fcac2:
    # "...A month?"
    "……一个月？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059009_1_5ea1fc7c:
    # "Yes."
    "对。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059010_1_40afe05a:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059011_1_c3127a66:
    # "I silently stared back at Sai, wondering if he was thinking what I was."
    "我默默回望着 Sai，心想他是不是和我想到了一处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059017_1_7c96e118:
    # "...What, do you think we traveled into the future? A month into the future?"
    "……怎么，你觉得我们穿越到未来了？一个月后的未来？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059022_1_a530f505:
    # "Beside me, Erina's eyes were wide. Could that have been the truth behind the recording's prediction?"
    "身旁的 Erina 瞪大了眼睛。录音里的预言，真相莫非就是这个？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059025_1_0412fa4b:
    # "Sai, is traveling to the future possible?"
    "Sai，有可能穿越到未来吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059030_1_efe19c47:
    # "...{w}It is, I'm pretty sure."
    "……{w}有可能，我很确定。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059031_1_b7302f7b:
    # "And you said something happened before the lights went out, right? I didn't see it, but could we have traveled forward right as Shiroya ran away?"
    "你还说灯灭之前发生过什么，对吧？我没看见，不过会不会就在 Shiroya 跑掉的那一刻，我们穿越到了未来？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059032_1_ef972a88:
    # "A month into the future? The Sekimeiya couldn't have had enough energy to make that happen, right?"
    "一个月后的未来？Sekimeiya 不可能有足够的能量做到这种事吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059033_1_75ee7911:
    # "...{w}But there are no other footprints in the living room. The ones we left just a while ago should be visible.{w} And there's no way we went to the past because the handle in the right bedroom is on the floor."
    "……{w}可客厅里没有别的脚印。我们刚才留下的那些，本来应该还看得见才对。{w}而且我们也不可能回到过去——右边卧室的门把手还掉在地上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059038_1_a2da322f:
    # "You think the shutter would still be in place after a month?"
    "你觉得过了一个月，卷帘门还会好好地在那儿？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059039_1_2dffbdb8:
    # "Well, it is..."
    "呃，它确实还……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059046_1_a834cb3c:
    # "Everyone was deep in thought, seriously entertaining the possibility I was presenting."
    "所有人都陷入沉思，认真琢磨我提出的这个可能性。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059047_1_6d43c26e:
    # "There are plenty of things unaccounted for.{w} Who activated this future travel, and why? Why did we go so far into the future?{w} Why are the lights off?{w} What was the flash Erina and I saw? And why did it not feel like we traveled? We didn't change places, did we?"
    "解释不通的地方还多着呢。{w}是谁启动了这次穿越，目的又是什么？为什么一下子去了那么远的未来？{w}为什么灯是灭的？{w}我和 Erina 看到的那道闪光是什么？还有，为什么我们完全没有穿越的感觉？我们并没有换地方，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059048_1_93fcff22:
    # "Sai was right. If we were in the future, all of those questions had to be answered.{w} However, others would be resolved.{w} Spending a month in the tower without any source of food was no longer necessarily a problem."
    "Sai 说得对。如果我们真的身处未来，那些问题就都必须有答案。{w}可反过来，另一些问题也会迎刃而解。{w}在没有任何食物来源的塔里待上一个月，也就不一定是死局了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059049_1_f850c1f1:
    # "Akaro, do you want to change up your account a little?"
    "Akaro，你的说法要不要稍微改一改？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059054_1_534d7d9a:
    # "No. I don't know where we are, but it's where I appeared after touching the Sekimeiya you had hidden."
    "不改。我不知道这里是哪儿，但我碰了你藏起来的那个 Sekimeiya 之后，就出现在了这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059059_1_6ef1a079:
    # "Ah, right."
    "啊，也对。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059066_1_eb1beca6:
    # "Well, there's nothing else in the attic."
    "算了，阁楼里也没别的东西了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059067_1_3b6475fc:
    # "No matter what's happening, we should just stay somewhere. We can't do anything else..."
    "不管发生了什么，我们也只能先待在某个地方。别的什么都做不了……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059068_1_62ca5572:
    # "Yeah, let's go shack up somewhere for a few dozen more hours just in case the shutter opens some day. Who knows if Shiroya is gonna send us another month forward a minute before they unlock, though.{w} I'm starving, by the way. Think I'll pass out any time now."
    "是啊，那就找个地方再窝上几十个小时，万一哪天卷帘门开了呢。不过话又说回来，谁知道 Shiroya 会不会在他们开锁前一分钟，又把我们送到一个月之后。{w}顺带一提，我快饿死了。感觉随时都会昏过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059075_1_bc8bf07b:
    # "Before anyone could reply, Sai departed to the living room.{w} He was followed by everyone but me."
    "还没等人答话，Sai 已经往客厅去了。{w}除了我，所有人都跟了上去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059081_1_e405fbc7:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059082_1_2dc7e8e3:
    # "If something like that is what happened, Shiroya knew about it...{w} She didn't say anything about it—only that she meant everything she'd said."
    "如果真是那样，Shiroya 是知道的……{w}可她一个字也没提，只说她说过的每句话都是认真的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059083_1_56315c3a:
    # "How could she have even known we'd end up in this situation? If it was her who made this happen, then why? And how...!?"
    "她怎么会知道我们会落到这种境地？如果这一切是她造成的，那又是为了什么？又是怎么做到的……！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059084_1_5438e83d:
    # "Is it really possible that we're in the future? There's not even a guarantee we're one month forward. We could've gone a year into the future; no point after the water evaporated can be concretely determined."
    "我们真的有可能身处未来吗？甚至连是不是刚好过了一个月都无法保证。说不定已经过了一年。水蒸发之后究竟过了多久，根本无法确定。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059085_1_1cee8014:
    # "And the security room is locked, so we can't see the date on the computer.{w} Is this what Shiroya wanted? Did she want this to happen for a reason...?{w} Everything she said in hallway C... She already knew about this."
    "而且监控室锁着，看不到电脑上的日期。{w}这就是 Shiroya 想要的结果吗？她希望这种事发生，是有原因的吗……？{w}她在 C走廊说的那些话……她早就知道会这样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059090_1_051efd39:
    # "I ran my fingers through my hair as I walked to the right bedroom. The inner handle was in the hallway, and the sheets were messy."
    "我一边用手捋着头发，一边走向右边的卧室。内侧的门把手搁在走廊上，床单也乱着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059091_1_e37476f2:
    # "What happened to the real Shiroya...? To the one who went to the bathroom.{w} Did she touch the Sekimeiya in the water tank? If so, where is she now? Could she eventually have become the other Shiroya...?"
    "真正的 Shiroya 后来怎么样了……？我是说去洗手间的那个。{w}她碰过水箱里的 Sekimeiya 吗？如果碰过，她现在又在哪儿？她会不会最终变成了另一个 Shiroya……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059092_1_014b24b0:
    # "It was the most frustrating thing in the world. But although I hated the thought of them, Shiroya's final words were kindling a bit of hope within me."
    "世上再没有比这更令人恼火的事了。可尽管这些念头让我厌恶，Shiroya 最后说的那番话，还是在我心里燃起了一点希望。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059093_1_71fe0a7a:
    # "...How the hell would we even have traveled to the future!? Sai said it's possible, and I doubt he was lying."
    "……可我们到底是怎么穿越到未来的！？Sai 说这有可能，我想他没在骗人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059094_1_271aa735:
    # "Is it random, like the replicated location?{w} I suppose it can't be random if someone made us travel forward in time deliberately, but what exactly caused it?"
    "难道像复制出来的地点一样，是随机的？{w}可如果是有人刻意让我们穿越到未来，那就不该是随机的。那么，究竟是什么触发了它？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059100_1_555aee85:
    # "I lay on the bed. I was exhausted, and my parched throat demanded a drink, an urge I knew wouldn't relent any time soon."
    "我躺倒在床上。浑身疲惫，喉咙干得直想喝水——我知道这股渴意一时半会儿消不下去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059103_1_1b8652cc:
    # "Why did we have to step into the tower in the first place? I didn't have the will to push that thought away anymore."
    "我们当初为什么非得走进这座塔不可？我已经没力气再把这种念头赶走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059113_1_6533bdb9:
    # "The door opened a few minutes later. I looked over and saw everyone coming in from the hallway. They seemed just as tired as me as they stepped in slowly. Closing the door would've trapped us, so they left it open."
    "几分钟后，门开了。我转头望去，见众人正从走廊里鱼贯而入，脚步迟缓，看上去和我一样疲惫。门若关上，反倒会把我们锁死在里面，他们便索性让它敞着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059116_1_2592c178:
    # "Akaro sat on the bed, making a deep noise."
    "Akaro 坐到床上，发出一声低沉的闷哼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059117_1_ece41f09:
    # "Huh?"
    "咦？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059124_1_fa5faec0:
    # "Well... What do we do now?"
    "那么……现在怎么办？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059130_1_d6f75ee0:
    # "What do you want to do? We might've been here for more than a month and the exit's not open. Unless you wanna take down the shutter by hand, we can only keep waiting."
    "你想怎么办？我们可能已经在这儿待了一个多月，出口还是没开。除非你想徒手把卷帘门拆下来，否则只能继续等。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059135_1_8ecaa882:
    # "This conversation...!"
    "这段对话……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059136_1_b74e5677:
    # "I don't get it. What the hell happened? Did Ashiya just abandon their own building with us inside...? And we thought we'd be free after twelve hours..."
    "我不明白。到底出了什么事？芦屋就这么把自己楼里的人丢下不管了……？我们还以为熬过十二小时就能出去……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059137_1_cb187e9d:
    # "A tingling dread began at the tips of my fingers and wormed its way deeper inward. I glanced at Erina, and she looked like no more than a ghost."
    "一阵发麻的恐惧从指尖升起，一点点往里钻。我瞥了眼 Erina，她脸色惨白，形同幽灵。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059142_1_c01ad663:
    # "Atsuki, what are you thinking about? Do you have any more ideas...? And hey, Erina, what's with that face?"
    "Atsuki，你在想什么？还有什么主意吗……？还有，Erina，你那是什么表情？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059143_1_527b81be:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059144_1_dd19c96d:
    # "What, not going to answer?"
    "怎么，不打算回答？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059145_1_67de4ef7:
    # "Before we even heard the sound, Erina and I turned to the door.{w} Then, it opened further, followed by gasps."
    "还没听见声响，我和 Erina 就已转头望向门口。{w}紧接着，门又开大了些，随之响起几声惊呼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059152_1_6ff11f48:
    # "Isla...! What the hell!?"
    "Isla……！搞什么鬼！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059153_1_de7f9d80:
    # "From the door, Isla looked at all of us. She seemed to be searching for something.{w} However, she paid no mind to our perplexed faces and kept scanning the room."
    "Isla 站在门口，目光逐一扫过我们。她像是在找什么。{w}可她对我们的满脸困惑视若无睹，仍旧扫视着房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059154_1_f41524ab:
    # "Hey, answer us...! Wh-What are you looking at!?"
    "喂，回答我们啊……！你、你在看什么！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059155_1_24b8ea80:
    # "...{w}Where am I...?"
    "……{w}我这是……在哪儿？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059156_1_e0404c2c:
    # "Wh-What do you mean? We're still in Ashiya Tower. Do you not remember?"
    "你、你说什么？我们还在芦屋塔里啊。你不记得了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059157_1_6d6653cc:
    # "No, I know. What I mean is... what happened to me? Where am I?"
    "不，我知道。我是说……我到底怎么了？我在哪儿？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059158_1_dd9605a3:
    # "What?"
    "什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059159_1_8b3b0ed4:
    # "No... I should be..."
    "不对……我应该在……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059162_1_ed381121:
    # "Out of nowhere, she staggered forward and began to cry painfully."
    "她冷不防踉跄着向前，随即痛苦地哭了起来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059163_1_f6474f20:
    # "I-Isla, what's gotten into you? ...What are you holding?{w} And Erina, why aren't you doing anything!?"
    "Isla，你、你这是怎么了？……你手里拿的是什么？{w} 还有 Erina，你怎么什么都不做！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059166_1_3d631fb1:
    # "She'd pushed the door with both hands, and her left was holding a device—one that I'd seen before. She twitched as she gripped it tightly, sobbing uncontrollably."
    "她双手推开门，左手握着一件东西——那东西我见过。她浑身一颤，把它攥得更紧，哭得不能自已。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059173_1_881f9238:
    # "Isla..."
    "Isla……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059174_1_3cf30f0b:
    # "Almost afraid she would disappear, Erina tentatively approached her."
    "Erina 像是怕她会忽然消失，试探着走近她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059178_1_fc925470:
    # "Realizing that she was corporeal, she embraced her daughter as she fell to her knees."
    "确认她确有实体后，她双膝一软跪下，将女儿拥入怀中。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059179_1_61cf3d1d:
    # "On the floor, both of them wept.{w} The recording... it had always been genuine. I finally understood its context, but even that understanding brought an immense number of questions along with it."
    "两人就那样跪坐在地上痛哭。{w}那段录音……从来都是真的。我终于明白了它的来龙去脉，但明白之后，反而冒出了更多疑问。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059185_1_5345eb7f:
    # "Isla... Where were you? What have you been doing?"
    "Isla……你之前在哪儿？都做了什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059190_1_25a8deaa:
    # "Through her sobs, she managed to repeat her question."
    "她抽泣着，又问了一遍同样的问题。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059191_1_be804668:
    # "What happened to me?"
    "我到底怎么了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059192_1_1aa2e0ba:
    # "Wh-What do you mean!? You should be the one answering that!"
    "你、你这话什么意思！？该回答的是你才对吧！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059193_1_eb03462e:
    # "N-No! Not to me! To Isla!{w} Why isn't she here!?"
    "不、不是！不是问我！是问 Isla！{w}她为什么不在这里！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059198_1_cc5f94bf:
    # "Everyone was speechless. However, I knew that wasn't the Isla the others were thinking of."
    "众人都说不出话来。可我知道，她问的并不是大家心里想的那位 Isla。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059201_1_d004c2fc:
    # "Do you mean to your friend?"
    "你是指你那位朋友？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059206_1_327d72d1:
    # "She gave me an intense look and nodded."
    "她直直地看了我一眼，点了点头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059209_1_eefdefd8:
    # "When she saw I couldn't answer, her face broke even further, and she buried it in Erina's chest."
    "见我说不出话，她的表情彻底垮了下来，把脸埋进了 Erina 怀里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059210_1_d45dfd5f:
    # "This is the friend we were told about. She's searching for the Isla we knew.{w} I have no idea how this came to happen, but this Isla is the person that \"my\" Isla mentioned."
    "她就是别人跟我们提过的那位朋友。她在找我们认识的那个 Isla。{w}我不知道事情怎么会变成这样，但这位 Isla，正是「我那个」Isla 提过的人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059217_1_cfd926c8:
    # "Their sobs continued for a long time. Although they weren't understood, nobody could interrupt them."
    "两人的哭声持续了很久。没人听得懂她们为何而哭，却也没人忍心打断。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059218_1_16168ce7:
    # "But, as soon as they began to peter out, Sai spoke."
    "可哭声刚渐渐平息，Sai 便开了口。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059223_1_0939ea49:
    # "Isla, this is very important.{w} What day is it? Do you know that?"
    "Isla，这件事很要紧。{w}今天是几号？你知道吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059228_1_e4cbb414:
    # "She looked up at him and managed to muster a date."
    "她抬头看向他，勉强报出了一个日期。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059235_1_7adcf869:
    # "Correct. January 5th, 2012."
    "没错。2012 年 1 月 5 日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059244_1_65898368:
    # "January 5th of 2012... So we did go about three weeks into the future."
    "2012 年 1 月 5 日……看来我们确实往未来跳了大约三周。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059245_1_327d3f61:
    # "Wh-What about Shiroya... Is she here?"
    "那、那 Shiroya 呢……她在这里吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059246_1_cbf7c296:
    # "Shiroya...? We don't know where she is.{w} Do you? Should she be here?"
    "Shiroya……？我们不知道她在哪儿。{w}你知道吗？她应该在这里吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059251_1_0c7a6eec:
    # "After a long pause, Isla nodded faintly."
    "沉默了许久，Isla 轻轻点了点头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059256_1_c5851177:
    # "Sweetie, how did you get here? And why do you have that in your hands?"
    "宝贝，你是怎么到这儿来的？手里又为什么拿着那个东西？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059264_1_d096cc99:
    # "With her glistening eyes, Isla looked at the device she was holding. It was the one that had played the recording. Of course, that meant the conversation in the bedroom had just been recorded."
    "Isla 泪光盈盈地看向手中的装置。正是它播放了那段录音。也就是说，卧室里的那场谈话，刚刚被录了下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059272_1_7a9d100e:
    # "I... saw him hiding it in the living room."
    "我……看到他把这个藏在客厅里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059279_1_1c122c9c:
    # "Everyone looked at Sai, who smiled playfully."
    "众人齐齐看向 Sai，他却促狭地笑了笑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059284_1_8f228520:
    # "So she did.{w} I actually found that in the security room a while ago. I didn't know what it was for until I found something else, a bug Atsuki hid in a coat pocket in one of the lockers."
    "果然如此。{w}其实那东西是我先前在监控室找到的。起初我不知道它有什么用，直到后来在某个储物柜的一件外套口袋里，发现了 Atsuki 藏的窃听器。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059285_1_ac62751d:
    # "Wait, what? I didn't hide that! It was already there."
    "等等，什么？那不是我藏的！本来就在那儿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059290_1_c6285499:
    # "How did you even open that locker?"
    "那个储物柜你到底是怎么打开的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059291_1_ac929794:
    # "The key was in the cleaning room."
    "钥匙在清洁间里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059292_1_2b74a44b:
    # "...Really? Well, unfortunately, I found the bug late into the day, but I figured the device I'd found earlier could receive its audio.{w} I thought this was a good occasion to use it, what with Akaro's story being questionable as hell. His clothes changed, and he was out of the tower for a long time. That's why I just placed the bug on him and started recording. I wanted to know if he had a way to exit the building."
    "……真的？唉，不巧的是，我发现窃听器时这天已经过去大半了。不过我想，之前找到的那台设备应该能接收它的音频。{w}Akaro 的说辞疑点太多，我觉得正好可以借此一用。他的衣服换了，又离开塔很长时间。所以我就把窃听器放到他身上，开始录音。我想知道他有没有离开这栋楼的办法。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059297_1_7e4edc7f:
    # "Wh-What!? Where is it!?"
    "什、什么！？在哪儿！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059302_1_f07e1d7b:
    # "Calm down. Did you really not realize it? It's behind your neck.{w} To be honest, I was also curious about something else. I've still got no explanation for a lot of things that occurred, and I've thought for a while that one of us might travel far to the past to carry out their plan. If that person happened to be Akaro, I hoped that when I pressed the play button, two recordings would show up at once. That would've immediately exposed him, but it didn't happen. I suppose that doesn't matter anymore since he's aware of the bug."
    "冷静点。你真没察觉到？就在你脖子后面。{w}说实话，我还有另一件事想弄清楚。发生的许多事我至今都解释不了，而且我早就想过，我们之中或许有人会穿越到很久以前去执行自己的计划。如果那个人恰好是 Akaro，我希望按下播放键时能同时出现两段录音，那样就能当场揭穿他——可惜没有。不过既然他已经知道窃听器的事，这些也无所谓了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059309_1_910ef38d:
    # "After frantically feeling his neck, Akaro was able to remove it."
    "Akaro 慌忙摸向自己的脖子，总算把它取了下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059319_1_e309cac3:
    # "I see. So this is how the conversation was recorded. But... why did Isla have it on the morning of the 15th? Is it going to travel to the past?"
    "原来如此。这段对话就是这么录下来的。可是……为什么 15 日早上录音笔会在 Isla 手里？它是要穿越到过去吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059324_1_6ff376ab:
    # "While Erina's trembling hand stroked Isla's hair, she noticed something other than the recorder."
    "Erina 一边用颤抖的手抚着 Isla 的头发，一边注意到了录音笔之外的另一件东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059325_1_32d58656:
    # "What are you hiding, sweetie?"
    "你在藏什么呢，乖孩子？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059331_1_c010661a:
    # "Erina's voice sounded concerned, and I knew why. Isla's right hand was a fist; she was holding something.{w} But she shook her head in fear."
    "Erina 的声音里透着担忧，我知道缘由。Isla 的右手握成拳，手里攥着什么。{w}可她却害怕地摇了摇头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059336_1_a0020ecd:
    # "Come on, open it. What do you have there?"
    "来，张开手。你手里是什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059337_1_826fea76:
    # "Erina had told us about it: during the two weeks before the event, Isla had sometimes hidden something in her fist. It appeared that had been Isla's friend, who still refused to open her hand."
    "Erina 曾跟我们提过：事件前的两周里，Isla 有时会把什么东西攥在拳头里。看来她攥着的正是她的那位朋友，可她仍旧不肯张开手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059342_1_2726b972:
    # "However, Isla's remaining strength was negligible. Erina gently forced her hand open until we saw her palm."
    "可 Isla 已经没多少力气了。Erina 轻轻掰开她的手，让我们看到了掌心。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059371_1_aa1cc1bb:
    # "Wet from her tears, her fingertip had a {tip=burn3}burn{/tip}."
    "她的指尖被泪水打湿，上面有一处{tip=burn3}灼伤{/tip}。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059372_1_32d28945:
    # "Wh-What is this...?"
    "这、这是怎么回事……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059377_1_c8cdff1f:
    # "I don't know... but it doesn't hurt..."
    "我不知道……可是不疼……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059378_1_4dceabe3:
    # "Did you get burned? When?"
    "你是被烫到了吗？什么时候？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059383_1_ba19535b:
    # "Isla didn't reply. It didn't seem like she was sure."
    "Isla 没有回答。她自己似乎也说不准。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059384_1_5a536d2f:
    # "Isla, I believe that it's January 5th, but please tell us why you're here. What happened to you?"
    "Isla，我相信今天是 1 月 5 日，但请你告诉我们，你为什么在这里。你身上发生了什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059385_1_54eb7f61:
    # "It was clear nobody wanted to question why she was alive; no matter the answer, it had to be the Sekimeiya's doing."
    "显然，没有人想追问她为什么还活着；无论答案是什么，那都只能是 Sekimeiya 的手笔。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059386_1_64ddb7b5:
    # "I...{w} I followed her steps."
    "我……{w}我是跟着她的脚步来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059387_1_324e0a08:
    # "Her steps...?"
    "她的脚步……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059388_1_c25d532d:
    # "Th-There was a hidden door outside. That's how I entered th-the storeroom."
    "外、外面有一扇暗门。我就是从那儿进了储、储藏室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059393_1_1a1ba9c7:
    # "Wait, what!?{w} Is that door open!?"
    "等等，什么！？{w}那扇门开着吗！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059394_1_150eb5d9:
    # "N-No. It clo—"
    "没、没有。它关——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059399_1_67a902bd:
    # "Before she could finish, Sai and Akaro ran out of the room. Then, even Erina hurried to pick Isla up and leave. They were all going straight to the door to see if they could open it."
    "她话还没说完，Sai 和 Akaro 就冲出了房间。紧接着，连 Erina 也匆匆抱起 Isla 离开。他们全都径直赶往那扇门，看能不能打开它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059405_1_e0555922:
    # "Once again, I was the only one left behind, trying to get to a final thought."
    "又一次，只剩我一个人留在原地，想理出最后的结论。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059408_1_35d1e23c:
    # "Isla followed \"her steps\"... and she thought Shiroya had to be here. Does that mean Shiroya recently entered from the storeroom?"
    "Isla 跟着「她的脚步」……而且认定 Shiroya 一定在这里。这么说，Shiroya 最近是从储藏室进来的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059410_1_02b296b6:
    # "Wait a second...{w} I might understand our misconception.{w} Somehow, we traveled days into the future, and the shutter was still here. That's what led us to think it never opened."
    "等等……{w}我大概明白我们哪里想错了。{w}我们不知怎么穿越到了几天之后，而卷帘门还留在原处。所以我们才以为它从没打开过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059411_1_368d72a5:
    # "That's not it, though...! It actually opened minutes after we vanished from the 15th.{w} Long after that, it was closed again. That's why the security room is locked and the elevator isn't working. Those are the alarm's effects—we were trapped for a second time. That's why the corpses are gone!"
    "可并不是这样……！其实，就在我们从 15 日消失几分钟后，它打开过。{w}很久之后，它才再次关闭。所以监控室才锁着，电梯也不动了。这都是警报造成的——我们第二次被困在了里面。尸体不见了也是因为这个！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059412_1_d5b130ff:
    # "This means the exit should still unlock within twelve hours... But will it be that easy...? Will we be allowed to leave this time?"
    "也就是说，出口应该还是会在十二小时内解锁……可会这么顺利吗……？这一次，我们会被允许离开吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059416_1_e60d99b7:
    # "Why are the lights off, though? Why was nobody in the security room? Why was the attic unlocked? And why was the alarm activated again?"
    "可是为什么灯是灭的？为什么监控室里没有人？为什么阁楼没锁？还有，为什么警报又启动了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059417_1_33106293:
    # "Why did we travel days into the future? Why didn't it feel like we traveled? Why did Shiroya enter the tower on January 5th?"
    "我们为什么会穿越到几天之后？为什么一点穿越的感觉都没有？Shiroya 为什么会在 1 月 5 日进入塔里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059418_1_4d7e678c:
    # "We arrived on this day when, from our point of view, the lights went off. The alarm was activated before then, so it felt as if the shutter never withdrew..."
    "我们当时以为，自己是在灯光熄灭的那一刻来到这一天的。警报在那之前就已启动，所以感觉就像卷帘门从未升起过……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059419_1_0a14787d:
    # "When? What's the deadline this time?"
    "什么时候？这次截止到什么时候？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059420_1_2abe6f3f:
    # "And was it Shiroya? Whoever it was, they were here recently."
    "还有，那人是 Shiroya 吗？不管是谁，那个人最近确实来过这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059421_1_26dc9322:
    # "...{w}Hm. Someone had to be here."
    "……{w}唔。当时这里一定有人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059422_1_be1301dd:
    # "Oh.{w} I know when it happened! I can't believe I didn't realize it, but it happened immediately before our arrival on this day!"
    "啊。{w}我知道那是什么时候了！真不敢相信我居然没意识到——那件事就发生在我们抵达这一天的前一刻！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059429_1_dc1ffbf6:
    # "Someone had been there right as the group had appeared on January 5th.{w} Atsuki knew that thanks to the last time he'd been in..."
    "就在一行人 1 月 5 日出现的那一刻，那里已经有人了。{w}Atsuki 之所以知道，是因为他上一次待在里面的时候……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059436_1_88e47b10:
    # "Not the lobby."
    "不是大厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059438_1_831b6768:
    # "Not the hallways."
    "也不是走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059440_1_57283460:
    # "You realized it, didn't you?"
    "你已经察觉了吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059442_1_9df4c2df:
    # "Not the attic."
    "也不是阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059447_1_dcd39fc9:
    # "I was so overwhelmed that I didn't notice it. When I went to the event room..."
    "我那时太慌乱了，根本没注意到。我去活动室的时候……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059452_1_9c1104d8:
    # "\"The room was cold. Had Shiroya run to get the Sekimeiya? I carefully walked to the cabinet, moved aside the curtain, and tried to open the glass.\""
    "「房间里很冷。Shiroya 是跑去拿 Sekimeiya 了吗？我小心地走到展示柜前，拨开遮布，试着打开玻璃。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059453_1_7eccbb35:
    # "\"It should've been locked, but it wasn't. The glass was partially open, and I could put my hand inside.\""
    "「它本该是锁着的，却没有。玻璃半开着，我可以把手伸进去。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059454_1_8dbdd1c6:
    # "\"I felt the Sekimeiya's surface and confirmed it was still there.\""
    "「我摸了摸 Sekimeiya 的表面，确认它还在里面。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059459_1_0ef7fbe5:
    # "I only realized the Sekimeiya was in the cabinet when I felt it! That means it wasn't glowing!"
    "我是摸到之后，才发现 Sekimeiya 就在展示柜里！也就是说，它当时没有发光！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059460_1_c98e5ea7:
    # "Although it was kept cold, the Sekimeiya was powered off. It had been used moments prior!{w} How can it be that it was powered off within the cabinet? When the cold hit it, it always regained its glow immediately.{w} The glass was partly open, cooling down the whole room. Was it due to that single detail?{w} Or was it something else? If I'm not mistaken, the longer the travel, the longer the Sekimeiya spends powered off..."
    "虽然一直被冷藏，Sekimeiya 却处于断电状态。它不久前刚被用过！{w}怎么会在展示柜里就断了电？每次一遇冷，它总会立刻重新亮起。{w}玻璃半开着，整个房间都冷了下来。是因为这个吗？{w}还是另有原因？如果我没记错，穿越的时间跨度越长，Sekimeiya 断电的时间就越久……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059462_1_6a599d40:
    # "I'd been under the impression that using the Sekimeiya would be futile; I hadn't known that the shutter wouldn't be there in the past, so I'd figured traveling through time would only make a bigger mess of things."
    "我一直以为使用 Sekimeiya 也无济于事；我不知道过去并没有那道卷帘门，所以认定时间穿越只会把事情搅得更乱。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059463_1_d227b758:
    # "I didn't know what I had to do in order to travel forward in time, but if I simply traveled enough time back to appear before our arrival, I could meet the person who had secretly trapped us in January."
    "我不知道该怎么穿越到未来，但只要往回穿越得足够远，回到我们抵达之前，就能见到那个在一月暗中把我们困住的人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059471_1_9e29a667:
    # "I walked out of the bedroom.{w} Everyone else had already gone down."
    "我走出卧室。{w}其他人都已经下楼了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059475_1_7dbb947a:
    # "I left through the staircase and went around the sixth floor by hugging the right wall."
    "我从楼梯间出去，贴着右侧墙壁在六楼绕行。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059480_1_3a0398f5:
    # "Attentively walking through the darkness, I reached the crystal floor.{w} I heard knocks and voices coming from the storeroom; it appeared Isla hadn't thought to keep the door open. Perhaps she hadn't been aware of the missing handle.{w} Without making a sound, I slowly tiptoed to the event room."
    "我小心地穿过黑暗，来到水晶层。{w}储藏室那边传来敲击声和人声；看来 Isla 没想到要让门开着。也许她并不知道门把手不见了。{w}我悄无声息，慢慢踮脚走向活动室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059485_1_58722534:
    # "The air was still cold, and when I raised the curtain, the Sekimeiya's glow appeared before me."
    "空气依旧寒冷。我掀开遮布，Sekimeiya 的光芒便出现在眼前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059492_1_515f16af:
    # "It's still here... I'm a little surprised."
    "它还在……我有点意外。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059493_1_b487649b:
    # "The glass wasn't closed, so I could reach it easily. Without directly touching it, I took the Sekimeiya out."
    "玻璃罩没合上，我伸手就能够到。我没有直接用手碰它，把 Sekimeiya 取了出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059497_1_89d80123:
    # "I just want to go a little while back. It should be simple.{w} This room is pretty cold, so it might not be a good idea to stay here if I want the Sekimeiya to gather energy."
    "我只想回到不久之前。这应该很简单。{w}这房间太冷了，想让 Sekimeiya 积蓄能量的话，待在这里恐怕不合适。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059502_1_95a5007f:
    # "I walked to the hallway and entered room B5, which wasn't in range of the lower temperature. Then, I left the gemstone on the floor."
    "我走到走廊，进了 B5房间——那里不在低温波及的范围内。随后我把宝石放在了地上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059503_1_a81fdcf4:
    # "With how dark it is, even if the others search for me, I'll be hard to find."
    "光线这么暗，就算其他人来找我，也很难发现我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059504_1_4be36660:
    # "The lights went off when Sai's watch read {time=21:03.} I need to arrive before that point, and now his watch must say almost {time=21:20.}{w} I need to leave the Sekimeiya here..."
    "Sai 的手表显示 {time=21:03.} 时，灯灭了。我必须在那之前抵达，而现在他的表应该快到 {time=21:20.} 了。{w}我得把 Sekimeiya 留在这里……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059511_1_28ac88ac:
    # "If I wait for 10 minutes, I doubt I'll be able to go back 30 minutes at {time=21:30.}"
    "如果等上 10 分钟，到 {time=21:30.} 时，我恐怕没法回到 30 分钟前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059513_1_7c5efb36:
    # "If I wait for 15 minutes, I doubt I'll be able to go back 35 minutes at {time=21:35.}"
    "如果等上 15 分钟，到 {time=21:35.} 时，我恐怕没法回到 35 分钟前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059515_1_b61793c8:
    # "If I wait for 20 minutes, I doubt I'll be able to go back 40 minutes at {time=21:40.}"
    "如果等上 20 分钟，到 {time=21:40.} 时，我恐怕没法回到 40 分钟前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059517_1_1a0b91d5:
    # "35 minutes is probably too much."
    "35 分钟大概太多了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059518_1_1d9215f3:
    # "I'd say for about 25 minutes, so that at {time=21:45} I can travel 45 minutes back. I think that's it, based on all the travels, and especially everything that I just learned.{w} I don't have a way to measure the time by myself, though."
    "我看等 25 分钟左右正好，这样到 {time=21:45} 时，我就能回到 45 分钟前。根据之前所有的穿越，尤其是刚刚弄明白的这些，我想就是这样。{w}只是我没法自己计时。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059522_1_80f28414:
    # "Hm...{w} I can't measure the real time, but I might have a way to measure minutes."
    "嗯……{w}我没法知道确切时间，但或许有办法数出过了多少分钟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059523_1_719e4219:
    # "The security room is locked, so I don't think there's anything on the crystal floor that isn't Sai's watch. There are a bunch of computers on the office floors, but I need access information to look at the time.{w} I can only think of the kitchen in the attic.{w} The refrigerator was working, so the oven should be too. There's still electricity, so I should be able to count the minutes that pass with that."
    "监控室锁着，水晶层上除了 Sai 的手表，我想不出还有什么能看时间。办公楼层倒是有一堆电脑，可要查看时间就得有登录信息。{w}我能想到的就只有阁楼的厨房了。{w}冰箱还在运转，烤箱应该也没问题。电还没断，用它来计时应该可行。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059530_1_bd71cb40:
    # "Faint voices were still coming from the storeroom. Like before, I ascended the stairs without making noise."
    "储藏室那边仍隐约传来说话声。和先前一样，我悄无声息地上了楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059535_1_2def8562:
    # "I arrived at the kitchen and kneeled in front of the oven. When I pressed the \"on\" button, a round light lit up red."
    "我来到厨房，在烤箱前跪下。按下「on」键后，一个圆形指示灯随即亮起红光。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059536_1_7f3b8fa7:
    # "I set the lowest possible temperature and rotated the timer toward 22 minutes. Immediately, a quiet buzz indicated that it had begun to count down."
    "我把温度调到最低，又将定时器拧到 22 分钟。紧接着一阵轻微的嗡鸣响起，表示它已经开始倒计时。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059540_1_c72d8695:
    # "I closed the door and walked back to the bedroom, where I lay on the same bed."
    "我关上门，回到卧室，躺回同一张床上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059544_1_f3a15b72:
    # "Unless the Sekimeiya's found, this should work. I'll come across whoever set this up, and most importantly, I'll appear before the alarm does anything."
    "只要 Sekimeiya 没被人发现，这计划应该能成。我会碰上设下这一切的人，而最重要的是，我会赶在警报响起之前现身。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059545_1_682ced11:
    # "Was I going against Shiroya's wishes? I couldn't care anymore. If it was her, I needed to know why she'd done everything."
    "我这是在违背 Shiroya 的意愿吗？可我已经不在乎了。如果那个人真是她，我必须知道她为什么要做这一切。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059550_1_becb49d1:
    # "I didn't let myself fall asleep. A number of minutes had passed, and nobody had come back up."
    "我没让自己睡着。好几分钟过去了，始终没人上楼来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059554_1_cd0d4e3d:
    # "I reentered the kitchen. Less than two minutes remained on the timer."
    "我再次走进厨房。定时器上只剩下不到两分钟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059555_1_c543c574:
    # "In front of the oven, I watched the indicator rotate until it finished with a beep."
    "我守在烤箱前，看着指示盘转动，直到它「嘀」的一声停下。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059556_1_15af45ca:
    # "I can go now."
    "现在可以走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059560_1_cdbda2c5:
    # "I pressed the \"off\" button and went down the stairs."
    "我按下「off」键，走下楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059565_1_816378fd:
    # "Two floors down, I stopped abruptly. The others were making their way up.{w} I took a step aside and hushed my breathing. Unaware that I was there, they passed me by."
    "下了两层，我猛地停住脚步。其他人正往上走。{w}我侧身让到一旁，屏住呼吸。他们没察觉到我，就从我身旁经过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059566_1_b5aa75e7:
    # "Once the sounds of their movement had faded, I kept going down."
    "等他们的动静渐渐远去，我才继续下楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059576_1_7135235d:
    # "The Sekimeiya was still behind room B5's door.{w} I felt it through my sleeve and instantly determined that it had built up considerable energy. I had to quickly withdraw my hand to avoid harm."
    "Sekimeiya 还在 B5 展室的门后。{w}我隔着袖子碰了碰它，立刻发觉它已经积蓄了相当多的能量。为了不被伤到，我赶紧把手缩了回来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059577_1_351d1d78:
    # "This should be enough, but I wonder if it'll work as I want it to."
    "这些应该够了，只是不知道能不能如我所愿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059578_1_40c5130d:
    # "I was certain 25 minutes had passed since I'd taken it out of the cabinet. Without hesitation, I rapidly forced my hand through the wall of heat until I contacted the smooth stone."
    "我确信，把它从展示柜里取出来之后，已经过去了 25 分钟。我不再犹豫，迅速把手探进那团灼热里，直到碰到它光滑的表面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059588_1_6978454d:
    # "...{w}Did I... change places?"
    "……{w}我……换了个地方？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059589_1_6606bc57:
    # "I spun; the darkness around me was identical."
    "我转过身，四周的黑暗和刚才一模一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059590_1_063c8c91:
    # "Wait! The shutter isn't here!"
    "等等！卷帘门不在了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059595_1_fdfe7c8e:
    # "I stared in awe. I could see a streetlight within the night, illuminating the snow around it. I was in the lobby of the tower; a light from the reception desk confirmed that."
    "我惊讶地望着眼前的一切。夜色中有一盏路灯，照亮了周围的雪。我站在塔的大厅里——接待台那边透出的灯光证实了这一点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059596_1_79aa732e:
    # "It did work...! The alarm hasn't gone off yet!"
    "成功了……！警报还没响！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059601_1_ed82892e:
    # "However, when I tried to open the door, it was still locked. I had also been assaulted by a wave of tiredness and wished to lie down.{w} Suddenly, a sharp sound echoed in my ears. ...Had it come from hallway B?"
    "然而，我试着开门时，门依旧锁着。同时一阵强烈的倦意袭来，让我只想躺下。{w}忽然，一声尖锐的声响在耳边回荡。……是从 B走廊传来的吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059604_1_8880b09c:
    # "Someone's there."
    "有人在那儿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059608_1_b58dc397:
    # "Was it Shiroya? Slowly, I moved closer."
    "是 Shiroya 吗？我慢慢靠近。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059613_1_3373e8cc:
    # "...{w}I stopped still. No sound could be heard anymore.{w} I didn't know what to do, and I was more than a little afraid. If that was the person who'd killed everyone, I was finally in real danger—the recording had guaranteed my safety for a long time, but it had become a past event, and the promise of my well-being had expired."
    "……{w}我僵在原地。四周再听不到任何声响。{w}我不知所措，心里不止一点害怕。如果那就是杀死了所有人的凶手，我终于真正身处险境了——那段录音曾在很长一段时间里保证我的安全，可它已经成了过去的事，那份保我平安的承诺也早已失效。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059616_1_18d31b2d:
    # "Huh?{w} What...?"
    "咦？{w}什么……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059617_1_42433700:
    # "Though I couldn't see it, I looked at my hand. It hadn't hurt for a while, but it was where I'd suffered a painful injury in the elevator."
    "虽然看不见，我还是低头看了看自己的手。它已经有一阵子没疼了，可我在电梯里受了重伤的，正是这只手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059624_1_a76411fe:
    # "Amazed, I opened and closed it in succession. I could feel the injury was gone."
    "我惊讶地把手张开又握起。能感觉到伤已经不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059625_1_23143990:
    # "Why...? I traveled to the past with it before, and it didn't disappear!"
    "为什么……？我以前也带着这道伤穿越到过去，它却没有消失啊！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059626_1_1df26938:
    # "It must've had to do with the replicated location, but my attention was again taken by resuming footsteps."
    "这大概跟那个被复制出来的地点有关，但重新响起的脚步声又把我的注意力引了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059628_1_e457b39e:
    # "Are they Shiroya's...?"
    "那是 Shiroya 她们的……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059629_1_ba747167:
    # "I couldn't deny it, but I wasn't sure either."
    "我无法否认，可也不敢确定。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059630_1_3d61f1ab:
    # "I think they just entered the event room. ...Are they planning to travel through time? The alarm will probably be activated from there."
    "她们好像刚进了活动室。……难道打算穿越时间？警报多半会从那里被触发。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059631_1_a7fff301:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059632_1_0c96d937:
    # "I'm not sure what the best course of action is. Should I change the past to prevent the alarm from going off? That could be dangerous."
    "该怎么做才最好，我也拿不准。要不要改变过去，阻止警报响起？那样做可能很危险。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059637_1_4d6ec9ed:
    # "I could hear faint sounds, but I couldn't make them out. Trying to quickly come to a conclusion, I waited helplessly from a distance."
    "隐约能听见些声响，却辨不出内容。我想尽快得出结论，却只能在远处无计可施地等待。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059638_1_3fa164d6:
    # "Oh, wait...!"
    "啊，等等……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059639_1_cd029897:
    # "If this is Shiroya, she came in from the storeroom! Isla seemed like she entered the tower by following her steps.{w} If Isla was able to enter from the outside, the door was open. I might be able to leave right now...!"
    "如果这是 Shiroya，那她就是从储藏室进来的！Isla 似乎就是顺着她的踪迹进了塔。{w} 既然 Isla 能从外面进来，说明那扇门开着。我现在说不定就能出去……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059640_1_cd97f8ff:
    # "I tried not to panic. Freedom was potentially in reach, but I couldn't let myself be noticed."
    "我努力不让自己慌起来。自由也许近在眼前，但我绝不能被人察觉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059643_1_c87406da:
    # "Fuck! That's the alarm!"
    "该死！是警报！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059648_1_aca197e5:
    # "A loud sound came from behind me. When I turned around, I saw the streetlight beyond the glass disappearing. The shutter was beginning to cover it, and before I knew it, it was no longer visible."
    "身后传来一声巨响。我回过头，只见玻璃外的路灯正在消失。卷帘门缓缓将它遮住，转眼便再也看不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059651_1_58bf7d32:
    # "No, it doesn't matter! It's not gonna lock the other exit!"
    "不，不要紧！另一个出口不会被锁上的！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059655_1_d1a28732:
    # "I stepped back, placing my feet on the floor as slowly as I could. Then, feeling the wall, I walked to the next door."
    "我退后一步，尽可能轻地把脚放到地板上。随后摸着墙壁，走向下一扇门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059661_1_786df588:
    # "Hallway A extended beyond me. Was the other person still there? I couldn't hear anything."
    "A走廊在我前方延伸。那个人还在吗？我什么都听不见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059665_1_2d254bdb:
    # "I didn't want to run in case the door was closed. I stepped to the left wall and walked as I counted the rooms."
    "我怕门是关着的，所以不敢跑。我走到左墙边，一边数着房间一边往前走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059669_1_7d6d64a5:
    # "One,{w=0.6} two,{w=0.6} three,{w=0.6} four,{w=0.6} five."
    "一，{w=0.6}二，{w=0.6}三，{w=0.6}四，{w=0.6}五。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059670_1_bcf65226:
    # "This one has to be the storeroom's! It's not even closed!"
    "这扇肯定就是储藏室的门！居然都没关上！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059672_1_6e5fe375:
    # "When I looked through it, I saw a light. It was very faint, but it illuminated the narrow walls slightly."
    "透过门缝望去，里面有光。那光十分微弱，却稍稍照亮了狭窄的四壁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059676_1_c7bd363e:
    # "Are those... the stars...?"
    "那是……星星……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059681_1_e284e96a:
    # "Sheer Intent"
    "纯粹意志"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059684_1_45afe737:
    # "What?"
    "什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059692_1_cd6cf79a:
    # "No way."
    "不可能。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059693_1_4d2eab3c:
    # "A-Atsuki...?"
    "A-Atsuki……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059694_1_a317e6a6:
    # "H—"
    "啊——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059695_1_36db031a:
    # "From behind, I heard a voice that made me jump."
    "身后传来一个声音，吓了我一跳。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059701_1_38440e02:
    # "You...!"
    "你……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059702_1_e2706921:
    # "It was her, wearing clothes I hadn't seen in a long time."
    "是她，穿着我很久没见过的衣服。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059703_1_f61ec239:
    # "A-Are you Shiroya...?"
    "你、你是 Shiroya……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059708_1_d4b14eeb:
    # "What? Y-Yes. Where are we? I just appeared here."
    "什么？是、是我。这是什么地方？我刚才突然就出现在这儿了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059709_1_a03b1580:
    # "Both of us just appeared here? The Sekimeiya was activated, and the range reached to the storeroom..."
    "我们俩都是突然出现在这儿的？Sekimeiya 被激活了，影响范围一直延伸到了储藏室……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059710_1_339d0f99:
    # "Hold on, isn't that...?"
    "等等，那不就是……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059713_1_247fb74e:
    # "Behind her was the hallway B door, and on its edges was the dark outline caused by the smoke. However, it didn't look dry yet."
    "她身后是通往B走廊的门，门框边缘留着一道被烟熏黑的痕迹。可那痕迹看起来还没干透。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059714_1_a9f2ad7a:
    # "W-Wait, that..."
    "等、等等，那个……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059717_1_707f602a:
    # "She looked back and realized the same. And most of the ceiling lights were off, like they had been in the morning..."
    "她回头一看，也察觉到了同样的事。而且天花板上的灯大半都熄着，和早上那时一样……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059722_1_50ac679a:
    # "...It's the smoke, right?"
    "……是烟雾吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059723_1_36205f63:
    # "Y-Yes, but doesn't it look different?"
    "是、是的，可你不觉得样子不太一样吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059728_1_a06bde87:
    # "What...?"
    "什么……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059729_1_624807a4:
    # "I'm not sure where we are. I just appeared here too."
    "我也不清楚这是哪儿。我也是突然出现在这里的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059733_1_bd8f6b88:
    # "Could we have been back at the beginning? Before asking anything else, I got closer to the hallway.{w} A sound from the other side caused me to stop; a door had closed."
    "难道我们回到了起点？我还没来得及多问，便朝走廊走近。{w} 对面传来一声响，我立刻停住——有扇门关上了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059735_1_4846e78a:
    # "It seemed like nobody was coming, so I slowly continued until I gripped the knob. Then, when I looked through the door, a dark plume clouded my vision."
    "似乎没人过来，我便慢慢向前，直到握住门把手。透过门缝望去，一团黑雾模糊了视线。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059739_1_4d485b8b:
    # "Oh, fuck. Don't breathe."
    "操。别吸气。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059740_1_3b34132c:
    # "Wh-What...?"
    "什、什么……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059742_1_b6508ca4:
    # "Erina, Isla, and Sai were on the floor. It was the start of the incident."
    "Erina、Isla 和 Sai 倒在地上。事件就是从这一刻开始的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059743_1_7cc4e99a:
    # "I couldn't believe it. I'd been so close to escaping, but it hadn't been permitted. I had no idea what was ahead of me anymore, but the tower held me in its grip like a python.{w} I lowered my head and saw my own hand. Exposed to the light, I could see the injury was still gone.{w} Then, I noticed something else—I wasn't hungry or tired anymore. Those sensations had also disappeared."
    "我简直无法相信。明明只差一步就能逃出去，却终究没能如愿。前方还会发生什么，我全然不知，而这座塔像蟒蛇一样死死缠住我。{w} 我低下头，看见自己的手。借着光，我看出那道伤依然不见踪影。{w} 接着我又发现了一件事——我不再饥饿，也不再疲惫。那些感觉同样消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059748_1_c7353235:
    # "A-Are we on the morning of the 15th?"
    "我、我们是在15日的早上？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059749_1_a58c0263:
    # "I turned around warily. Shiroya was there, but I still felt that something about her was different. She didn't feel like the person I'd entered the tower with."
    "我警惕地转过身。Shiroya 就在那里，可我总觉得她有些不对劲。她不像那个和我一起进塔的人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059750_1_45c64ced:
    # "...Are you really Shiroya? The real one?"
    "……你真的是 Shiroya？本人？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059755_1_4bcc7fb0:
    # "What does that mean...!? Who else would I be?"
    "这话什么意思……！？我还能是谁？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059756_1_06e7efac:
    # "...What do you remember? Please, tell me everything."
    "……你记得些什么？拜托，全都告诉我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059761_1_90f7112d:
    # "What!? I-I don't know what you mean! We got trapped here, and a bunch of things happened!"
    "什么！？我、我不明白你在说什么！我们被困在这儿，出了好多事！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059762_1_1604682d:
    # "What happened? How did you end up here?"
    "出了什么事？你怎么会到这儿来？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059763_1_17247835:
    # "H-Huh? A lot of things! Do you remember everything? Late into the day, we were in the lobby, and I went to the bathroom. There, I activated the Sekimeiya and appeared on the 30th of November, below that gem shop.{w} Then... a few days later, I entered the tower and touched the Sekimeiya. That's how I just appeared here."
    "啊？很、很多事！你全都记得吗？那天很晚了，我们在大厅，我去了洗手间。就在那儿，我启动了 Sekimeiya，出现在11月30日，就在那家宝石店的下方。{w}然后……过了几天，我进了塔，碰到了 Sekimeiya。于是我就出现在了这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059764_1_5641d17f:
    # "W-Wait, that's all...? What about appearing after you'd gone to the bathroom? Do you remember that?"
    "等、等等，就这些……？那你上完洗手间之后突然出现的事呢？你记得吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059769_1_9a75de5f:
    # "What? N-No...? I found the Sekimeiya in the toilet's water tank and went a long way into the past."
    "什么？不、不记得……？我在马桶的水箱里找到了 Sekimeiya，然后回到了很久以前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059770_1_248ca17f:
    # "...{w}Are you really... the real Shiroya? I don't really understand what you're telling me."
    "……{w}你真的是……Shiroya本人吗？你说的话我实在听不明白。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059775_1_3b744b60:
    # "She gave me a disoriented stare, as if she had no idea why I was so skeptical."
    "她茫然地看着我，似乎不明白我为什么这样怀疑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059776_1_316ba3a0:
    # "Wait a second. That sound from before was a door, right? It sounded like it came from the right wall."
    "等一下。刚才那声响是门吧？听起来是从右边那面墙传来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059781_1_a6c86663:
    # "...I think so."
    "……我想是吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059785_1_696a7a4c:
    # "It had to be that one, then.{w} That's where Naomi died and where I traveled for the first time. If the smoke was just released, someone might have just been there because it's where the temperature regulation cabinets are."
    "那就只能是那扇门了。{w}Naomi 就是在那儿死的，我也是在那儿第一次穿越的。如果烟雾才刚放出来，那说不定有人刚去过那里——毕竟控温展示柜就放在那儿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059786_1_1287b087:
    # "Were we really at the beginning, just like that? It didn't make any sense; if we had always been present, we would've been found on many occasions.{w} Were we going to change the past? I really wanted Shiroya to be telling the truth. If she was, we would get through everything, but I knew she had withheld the truth from me before."
    "我们真的就这么回到了最初？这说不通——如果我们一直都在，早就该被人撞见很多次了。{w}我们是要改变过去吗？我真心希望 Shiroya 说的是实话。如果她说的是真的，我们就能挺过一切；可我知道，她以前也瞒过我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059789_1_d46fd021:
    # "I think we just heard the culprit. I have no idea why we're here, but only a few people should be conscious at this time."
    "我想，我们刚才听到的就是犯人。我们为什么会在这里，我完全不清楚，但这个时间还醒着的人应该没几个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059793_1_d64b4450:
    # "I couldn't hesitate. The real culprit, the person who had removed the storeroom's handle, could have been present. Low to the ground, I scurried to the crystal room.{w} I turned to Shiroya, who was following me. At that point, I noticed something intriguing, but I couldn't stop there."
    "我不能犹豫。真正的犯人——那个卸下储藏室门把手的人——可能就在那里。我压低身子，快步溜向水晶展室。{w}我回头看向跟在身后的 Shiroya。那一刻，我注意到一件耐人寻味的事，却没法停下脚步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059802_1_1fa72637:
    # "We entered the room, and I closed the door behind us."
    "我们进了展室，我关上身后的门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059803_1_1b8aec98:
    # "Did you see the door to the lobby?"
    "你看到通往大厅的门了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059804_1_540dbe67:
    # "...What about it?"
    "……那扇门怎么了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059805_1_795065f7:
    # "We just left it open."
    "我们刚才走的时候没关。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059810_1_607deff3:
    # "Oh. Does that matter?"
    "哦。有什么关系吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059811_1_098d920a:
    # "You remember, right? When we met everyone else, Sai pointed out that it was open, and Katei said he did that. I'm pretty sure it looked exactly the way we just left it."
    "你还记得吧？我们和其他人会合时，Sai 说那扇门开着，Katei 说是他打开的。我敢肯定，那扇门跟我们刚离开时看起来一模一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059816_1_6a400521:
    # "...I see what you mean, but please answer one thing for me. Why are we here? Did something happen after I traveled to the past?"
    "……我明白你的意思，不过请先回答我一件事。我们为什么会在这里？我回到过去之后，是不是出了什么事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059817_1_ce60eac6:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059820_1_97c5b191:
    # "Are you telling me the truth? Do you not know what happened after?"
    "你说的是真话？之后发生了什么，你真的不知道？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059825_1_3555dca4:
    # "I don't...! I just told you. I appeared on the 30th of November.{w} I stayed at my apartment while my past self was in the hospital, and a few days later, I entered the tower.{w} I have no idea what happened there, though. The Sekimeiya was already in the cabinet, and I touched it since nobody was in the security room. After that, I appeared in the lobby with you. Now we're here."
    "我不知道……！我不是刚说过吗。我是在11月30日出现的。{w}过去的我还在住院时，我一直待在自己的公寓里；几天后，我进了芦屋塔。{w}不过塔里发生了什么，我完全不清楚。Sekimeiya 那时已经在展示柜里了。我看监控室里没人，就伸手碰了它。之后，我便和你一起出现在大厅里。再然后，就是现在这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059826_1_8ab08fc8:
    # "I didn't know what to think. While I was aware such lengthy travels were possible, what she was saying didn't sound right. Had she traveled to the future from early December? Why had we appeared at the same time, then?"
    "我不知道该怎么想。我知道这种长时间的穿越是可能的，但她的说法还是不太对劲。她是从 12 月初穿越到未来的吗？那我们又为什么会在同一时刻出现？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059827_1_39e5d405:
    # "But it was impossible for me to think she was lying; her voice sounded as sincere as always.{w} When I'd activated the Sekimeiya from room B5... had I perhaps traveled to the first days of December?{w} I was stumped. If she was telling the truth, I couldn't explain what had happened to me."
    "可要我认定她在说谎，我做不到——她的声音一如既往地真诚。{w}当我在水晶展室 B5 启动 Sekimeiya 时……莫非我穿越到了 12 月初？{w}我陷入了困惑。如果她说的是真的，那我就无法解释自己身上发生的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059830_1_bf78ae36:
    # "Wait, you said you traveled to the 30th? Did you try to save Miiya?"
    "等等，你说你穿越到了30日？你试过去救 Miiya 吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059835_1_a75497f3:
    # "I couldn't... I appeared too late for that, but I did change the past—"
    "我没能……我出现得太晚，已经来不及了，但我确实改变了过去——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059836_1_dd9256f5:
    # "She cut herself off, as if doubting what she was saying."
    "她话说到一半就停住了，似乎对自己说的话也起了疑心。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059837_1_03bde91b:
    # "I'm trying to understand what you've said..."
    "我在试着理解你说的这些话……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059838_1_8d821cd9:
    # "Don't worry, even I don't understand anything of what I lived through. I'm not lying, though."
    "别担心，连我自己都搞不懂我经历的那些事。不过我没有撒谎。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059839_1_88cc88d6:
    # "...Then I'm not sure it would help if I told you what happened after you left.{w} Another version of you was there, but it wasn't you, right?"
    "……那我不确定，把在你离开之后发生的事告诉你有没有用。{w}当时还有另一个你也在场，但那不是你，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059844_1_cff237fc:
    # "N-No. I have no idea who that was."
    "不、不是的。我根本不知道那到底是谁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059845_1_5ca0fadb:
    # "Well, we weren't able to leave when the time came. I'm not sure what happened, why, or how, but the lights went off, and we couldn't get out.{w} ...You remember the recording, right?{w} It was real."
    "结果，时间一到，我们却没能离开。发生了什么、为什么会这样、又到底是怎么发生的，我都不清楚，但灯灭了，我们也出不去。{w}……你还记得那段录音吧？{w}那是真的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059850_1_fff74edb:
    # "Wait, what...?"
    "等等，什么……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059851_1_522089ba:
    # "Yes, it did happen. It wasn't a trick.{w} It still doesn't make any sense, though. I can't wrap my head around what happened."
    "对，那确实发生了。不是障眼法。{w}可我还是想不通。这件事我怎么想也想不明白。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059854_1_40e1fcd3:
    # "You said that you touched the Sekimeiya in the event room days before the 15th, right?"
    "你说过，15日的前几天，你在活动室碰过 Sekimeiya，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059859_1_35f33b55:
    # "Y-Yes."
    "是、是的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059860_1_fe83dfdb:
    # "I see. What the fuck, then...? I don't get anything.{w} I thought I got caught up in your travel and both of us appeared in front of the hallway B door, the location where we were on the morning of the 15th."
    "我明白了。那他妈到底是怎么回事……？我完全搞不懂。{w}我本来以为，自己被卷进了你的时间穿越，两个人才会一起出现在 B走廊的门前——也就是15日早上我们所在的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059861_1_026587ca:
    # "But that makes no sense...! And look at my clothes, I wasn't wearing these on the 15th!"
    "但这根本说不通……！而且你看看我的衣服，15日那天我穿的可不是这身！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059862_1_465603a1:
    # "You're right, actually. Were you wearing them when you touched the Sekimeiya?"
    "说起来，你说得对。你碰 Sekimeiya 的时候，穿的就是这些吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059867_1_239aa4c3:
    # "As she shook her head, my attention was grabbed by a cabinet I recognized."
    "她摇了摇头，而我的目光被一个熟悉的展示柜吸引了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059874_1_2441d40e:
    # "...That's where the Sekimeiya was, right?"
    "……Sekimeiya 原本就放在那里，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059878_1_a6b485ef:
    # "Yes, and look at the wheel."
    "对，而且你看看那个转轮。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059883_1_6df66820:
    # "It's set to be cold... Oh, and it's not damaged yet. Wasn't this the one with a crack?"
    "温度设得很低……哦，而且它还没损坏。这个不就是有裂痕的那个吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059884_1_795ebd35:
    # "Yes... it was."
    "是啊……就是它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059885_1_8e633c5a:
    # "I unlocked its lid, and both of us looked inside."
    "我打开了锁，掀开盖子，我们两人一起朝里面看。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059890_1_6c6d6f82:
    # "Wh-What?{w} I...{w} don't get it."
    "什、什么？{w}我……{w}不明白。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059891_1_61bc4281:
    # "The Sekimeiya was there."
    "Sekimeiya 就在里面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059892_1_69038aca:
    # "Someone left it in here."
    "有人把它留在了这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059893_1_75839f32:
    # "Yes, which is what I don't get. When we woke up, it was in the event room, still in its cabinet."
    "对，这正是我想不通的地方。我们醒来的时候，它明明还在活动室的展示柜里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059894_1_6e3901fa:
    # "You're... right."
    "你……说得对。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059897_1_f68401f1:
    # "I took the Sekimeiya out. Although the cabinet had been set to 0 °C, it wasn't cold, likely because it had been recently set. In contrast, the Sekimeiya was burning, forcing me to double layer the cloth of my sleeves."
    "我把 Sekimeiya 取了出来。展示柜的设定温度是 0 °C，柜内却一点也不冷，大概是刚设好不久的缘故。反倒是 Sekimeiya 烫得厉害，我只好把袖子叠成两层。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059902_1_e0d1d385:
    # "It's set to 0 °C, but the cabinet isn't cold at all."
    "温度设的是 0 °C，可展示柜一点也不冷。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059903_1_0352f27e:
    # "It could've been set just now, so it didn't have enough time to cool off."
    "也可能是刚刚才设好的，所以还没来得及变冷。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059904_1_4f4c06c7:
    # "God, the Sekimeiya is burning, though...!"
    "天哪，Sekimeiya 却烫得厉害……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059905_1_5a39ec13:
    # "Shiroya reached out to me, and I reflexively jumped back a bit. She didn't do anything, however."
    "Shiroya 朝我伸出手，我下意识往后缩了一下。不过她也没再做什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059910_1_ae054abc:
    # "Sorry, when I touched it in the bathroom, its surroundings were incredibly hot. ...I can feel the heat, but it's nothing like then.{w} Do you know more about how the Sekimeiya works?"
    "抱歉，我在浴室里碰到它的时候，它周围烫得吓人。……现在也能感觉到热，但和那时完全不能比。{w} 关于 Sekimeiya 的原理，你还知道些什么吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059911_1_a4822347:
    # "I know nothing, and even less with what you've told me."
    "我什么都不知道，听你这么一说，反倒更糊涂了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059916_1_88b5adaa:
    # "It's working, so if we're really at the start of the incident, wouldn't touching it put us outside?"
    "它现在有反应了。如果我们真的回到了事件刚开始的时候，碰它一下，不就能把我们送到外面去吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059917_1_af34ae5e:
    # "M-Maybe. That's what I was thinking. It should be hot enough for that."
    "也、也许吧。我也是这么想的。热度应该够了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059918_1_47ce3891:
    # "Once again, the chance to escape had appeared right in front of me. Was it finally a genuine opportunity?"
    "逃脱的机会又一次出现在眼前。这一次，总该是真的了吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059921_1_3d4c35e7:
    # "Let's touch it."
    "碰一下吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059923_1_b12c568d:
    # "I nodded and got close to her. Slowly, my hand reached for the Sekimeiya in defiance of the burning aura around it.{w} However, the instant I contacted the gemstone, it vanished."
    "我点点头，凑近她，顶着那股灼人的热浪，慢慢把手伸向 Sekimeiya。{w} 可就在指尖触到宝石的一瞬间，它消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059929_1_27b6b204:
    # "...Huh?"
    "……咦？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059931_1_56cb9232:
    # "The Sekimeiya wasn't there anymore. We hadn't appeared anywhere else either, as I could still feel the burn on my fingers."
    "Sekimeiya 已经不在那里了。我们也没有出现在别的地方——指尖的灼痛还留着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059932_1_3a0dfeac:
    # "Th-This is what happened before. It teleported, and we didn't travel."
    "这、这就是之前发生过的事。它传送走了，我们却没有穿越。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059937_1_58a42d06:
    # "Oh."
    "这样啊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059938_1_0e38627e:
    # "I couldn't believe it. All we wanted was to leave that place, but it was a hope constantly rebuilt only to be repeatedly crushed."
    "我简直不敢相信。我们一心只想离开这里，可这份希望总是一次次重新燃起，又一次次被碾碎。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059943_1_3fc3d858:
    # "Wait, n-no... I-It can't be that."
    "等等，不、不对……不、不可能是那样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059948_1_c5f0d2b0:
    # "I followed Shiroya's eyes and almost fell back from the shock. The cabinet was shut, and the curtain neatly covered it again."
    "我顺着 Shiroya 的目光看去，惊得差点向后跌倒。展示柜已经合上，遮布也重新整整齐齐地遮住了它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059949_1_88df758c:
    # "Wh-What the fuck...? It didn't fall, right?"
    "搞、搞什么……？它没掉下来吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059951_1_46f4e589:
    # "She denied it; the cabinet had closed without making a sound.{w} Could we have traveled back in time to a point before I'd unlocked it? In that case, why hadn't we teleported?"
    "她摇头否认。展示柜无声无息地合上了。{w} 难道我们穿越到了我打开它之前？可那样的话，为什么没有被传送？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059955_1_e15c7b90:
    # "Suddenly, we turned to the door. Someone was running through the hallway."
    "忽然，我们齐齐转向门口。有人正从走廊上跑过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059959_1_85d3a352:
    # "As they did, we ran to grab the doorknob."
    "我们当即冲过去抓住门把。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059964_1_074f2c3b:
    # "A bit of smoke remained in the air, and nobody could be seen. It didn't seem like we'd gone to the past."
    "空气里还残留着些许烟雾，视野中空无一人。看来我们并没有回到过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059966_1_1afa9c5b:
    # "However, those rapid footsteps were still audible in the distance. It had to be the person responsible for our imprisonment...!{w} We ran behind the sound, covering our faces."
    "可是远处仍能听见那急促的脚步声。那一定就是把我们关在这里的人……！{w} 我们掩住脸，循着声音追了上去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059971_1_bff30730:
    # "They had gone up the stairs, and the gray door was unlocked. We went up, hearing the echoing steps far ahead. If they were going to the attic, we couldn't slow down."
    "对方上了楼梯，那扇灰门没有上锁。我们跟了上去，远远听见前方回荡的脚步声。如果那人要去阁楼，我们就不能慢下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059982_1_eaebdd4b:
    # "When we got to the sixth floor, the crack of a door closing resounded through the air. We hadn't been fast enough."
    "我们赶到六楼时，关门声在空中回荡。我们还是慢了一步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059991_1_7322a359:
    # "Damn it...!"
    "可恶……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059992_1_29e23556:
    # "As expected, the attic door was locked.{w} Had it been Naomi? She was the one with the key."
    "果然，阁楼的门锁上了。{w} 是 Naomi 吗？钥匙在她手上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059997_1_c0344ebf:
    # "Frustrated, I looked at Shiroya, who had a key in her hand."
    "我懊恼地看向 Shiroya，却见她手里正拿着一把钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059998_1_73a58c3a:
    # "What...!? Why do you have it!?"
    "什么……！？你怎么会有这个！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L059999_1_a54fc0e5:
    # "I... don't know... I found it when I entered the tower, in the mechanical room. I found the rusty key in a drawer in the security room as well, but... how is it possible I still have them when my clothes completely changed?"
    "我……不知道……这是我进塔时在机械室里找到的。生锈的钥匙也是在监控室抽屉里找到的，可是……我的衣服明明全变了，这两样东西怎么还会在我身上？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060002_1_af63a6bd:
    # "I frowned along with her, as it sounded unbelievable. She hurried to unlock the door and revealed the narrow staircase."
    "我也跟着皱起眉，这话实在难以置信。她急忙开了门，露出里面狭窄的楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060013_1_33bb3e80:
    # "Barely any light illuminated the steps. Following Shiroya, I began to silently ascend them."
    "台阶上几乎没有光。我跟在 Shiroya 身后，无声地往上走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060016_1_6f510a51:
    # "When she reached the top, Shiroya peeked through the small gap between the door and wall.{w} Then, she turned to me."
    "到了顶端，Shiroya 从门与墙之间的细缝往里窥看。{w} 随后，她转向我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060023_1_bce4bf32:
    # "Your perception of what occurred is gravely mistaken. Before Atsuki, Shiroya's figure vanished."
    "你对当时情形的认知错得离谱。在 Atsuki 眼前，Shiroya 的身影先消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060029_1_ed73ac76:
    # "But before she could face me, she disappeared."
    "可她还没来得及转过身来面对我，就消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060032_1_666318f4:
    # "What!? Did she travel!?"
    "什么！？她穿越了！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060036_1_66faf51b:
    # "I ran up the stairs and looked through the door."
    "我冲上楼梯，透过门缝看去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060040_1_61b33ed2:
    # "Nobody was there."
    "里面空无一人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060041_1_47c2f03e:
    # "But something was on the sofa that left me dazed. Two Sekimeiya were there, and one of them was powered off.{w} Next to them, I saw a set of keys. ...It was Naomi's."
    "可沙发上的东西让我怔住了。那里放着两个 Sekimeiya，其中一个已经关闭。{w} 旁边还有一串钥匙。……是 Naomi 的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060044_1_1daac21d:
    # "Was Naomi here? Did she touch that Sekimeiya, teleporting Shiroya away?"
    "Naomi 来过这里？是她碰了那个 Sekimeiya，把 Shiroya 传送走了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060048_1_9f017474:
    # "Naomi and Shiroya had disappeared. However, Atsuki didn't know something else had too."
    "Naomi 和 Shiroya 都消失了。然而 Atsuki 并不知道，还有一样东西也一并消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060054_1_cabf9021:
    # "Yes. Atsuki didn't see the suitcase Naomi had been holding; both Sekimeiya lay alone on top of the sofa's cushion."
    "是的。Atsuki 没有看见 Naomi 原本提着的手提箱；两个 Sekimeiya 孤零零地摆在沙发坐垫上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060056_1_c667738f:
    # "It was the suitcase that Naomi had been holding. Atsuki saw both Sekimeiya lying alone on top of the sofa's cushion."
    "消失的是 Naomi 原本提着的手提箱。Atsuki 只看见两个 Sekimeiya 孤零零地摆在沙发坐垫上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060061_1_c2b8ba79:
    # "Why are there two Sekimeiya...? Were there two from the beginning? Is this really why Sai had one in his hip pack once...?"
    "为什么会有两个 Sekimeiya……？从一开始就有两个？Sai 那次腰包里带着一个，难道就是因为这个……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060062_1_4d131c6d:
    # "Where the hell did Shiroya appear? Could she be back on the crystal floor?"
    "Shiroya 到底被传送到哪里去了？会不会又回到了水晶层？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060066_1_a086efcb:
    # "I took a step back, hesitant to walk into the living room. My footprints would stay on the floor, and we'd never seen them."
    "我退后一步，迟迟不敢走进客厅。我的脚印会留在地板上，而在我们经历过的情形里，从没见过这些脚印。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060067_1_631da1ce:
    # "Wait, no... Shiroya couldn't have gone to the past.{w} If she had, she would've shown up immediately after her disappearance, right?{w} Could she have gone to the future...? Is that really possible?"
    "等等，不对……Shiroya 不可能回到过去。{w} 如果去了过去，她应该刚一消失就立刻出现，不是吗？{w} 难道她去了未来……？那种事真的可能吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060068_1_680585de:
    # "Or what if she went far enough to the past to appear outside the tower? The range picked her up, but not me. It was likely not a very lengthy travel, I'm just not sure how much I can trust the range."
    "又或者，她回到足够久远的过去，出现在了塔外？重叠范围把她带走了，却没有带上我。这次穿越的时间大概不算长，只是我实在拿不准这个范围有多可靠。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060069_1_2ef7fe35:
    # "...And Naomi was definitely here. Why did she run up to the attic with the Sekimeiya, just to travel through time?{w} She didn't know we'd unlocked the way in, so she might think she locked the Sekimeiya in here.{w} ...Which is strange. After all, the attic was locked when we first came across the door."
    "……而且 Naomi 确实来过这里。她带着 Sekimeiya 跑上阁楼，难道就是为了穿越时间？{w}她不知道我们已经打开了入口，说不定以为把 Sekimeiya 锁在这里就安全了。{w}……可这说不通。毕竟我们第一次撞见那扇门时，阁楼还是锁着的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060072_1_5bc18426:
    # "I don't get it...! The Sekimeiya disappeared from the crystal room, and immediately, Naomi was bringing two of them up. At the same time, another one must've been in its original cabinet.{w} What the hell happened before we woke up? How many Sekimeiya are there...?"
    "我完全想不通……！Sekimeiya 刚从水晶展室消失，Naomi 转眼就搬了两个上去。而与此同时，原本的展示柜里应该还有一个。{w}我们醒来之前究竟发生了什么？Sekimeiya 到底有几个……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060073_1_219731b2:
    # "It was enigmatic. Naomi had to still be in the tower, but if Shiroya also was, why had she not come back?"
    "实在令人费解。Naomi 一定还在塔里；可如果 Shiroya 也在，她为什么没有回来？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060074_1_33ce7d8f:
    # "Could they both have gone to the past, but only Naomi reappeared in the tower?"
    "难道两人都去了过去，却只有 Naomi 重新出现在塔里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060078_1_0508f981:
    # "Suddenly, I realized I had to go back downstairs and found myself bolting out of the attic."
    "我猛然意识到自己必须下楼，等回过神时，人已经冲出了阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060081_1_3f54ab3e:
    # "The storeroom...! Now I know it leads outside, and its handle must've been taken off at this time. If it was Naomi, I might get there before it happens!"
    "储藏室……！我现在知道那里通向外面，而门把手应该就是在这个时间被拆掉的。如果真是 Naomi 干的，我也许能赶在她动手之前到！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060085_1_0b630172:
    # "Shiroya could no longer have been in the building, but perhaps she was outside. As another chance to escape presented itself, I found myself gathering foolish hope once more."
    "Shiroya 不可能还留在楼里了，但或许就在外面。逃脱的机会又一次摆在眼前，我竟又生出几分可笑的期待。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060091_1_b742c2aa:
    # "Almost no smoke hung in the air, and I could hear people on the same floor. I was not the only person there, but my only interest was the room I ran to."
    "空气里几乎没有烟雾，还能听见同层有人声。这层楼不止我一个人，但我只在意自己跑向的那个房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060096_1_9e6a958d:
    # "In the storeroom, I rapidly shut myself behind the secret wall and approached the door."
    "一进储藏室，我就飞快地躲到暗墙后面，然后朝那扇门走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060099_1_d4dde4a7:
    # "In the dark, I felt it for its handle."
    "黑暗中，我摸索着寻找门把手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060105_1_2739b60a:
    # "It is here! I can leave!"
    "在这里！我能出去了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060106_1_67ea6925:
    # "I couldn't believe it, but I gripped the handle and turned it with all my might."
    "我几乎不敢相信，却还是握住把手，用尽全力转动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060109_1_65c2bad0:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060113_1_9b633961:
    # "You've gotta be kidding me. It's locked..."
    "开什么玩笑。锁上了……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060114_1_ab01a152:
    # "Wait, no, of course it is! That's why it was ripped off, so that we couldn't unlock it with the key that we found!"
    "等等，不对，当然是锁着的！所以才有人把把手拆掉——好让我们没法用捡来的那把钥匙开门！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060119_1_41d278d6:
    # "I ran back to the hallway. We'd found the rusty key on the floor, in front of the event room."
    "我跑回走廊。那把生锈的钥匙，我们是在活动室门前的地上捡到的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060120_1_f6e3af04:
    # "If I get it and unlock the door, I'll definitely be changing the past, won't I? The police might even see me and set everyone free."
    "只要拿到它打开门，我肯定会改变过去吧？说不定警察甚至会看到我，把所有人都放了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060121_1_b148eccd:
    # "All of that no longer mattered. The real Shiroya had likely appeared somewhere, and I had a definite avenue of escape. I wasn't even aware of the possible consequences that would come, so I couldn't care about them. They were abstract things, and escaping was concrete."
    "这些都已无关紧要。真正的 Shiroya 很可能已经出现在某处，而我也确实有了一条退路。往后会有什么后果，我根本无从知晓，自然也顾不上。那些东西太过空泛，逃出去才是实实在在的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060128_1_5a3b2f09:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060129_1_677c1e98:
    # "Where the fuck is it...!? It was right here."
    "该死的，钥匙去哪了……！？明明就在这儿的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060130_1_9f1bc61e:
    # "There was very little light, but I couldn't see the key anywhere."
    "光线很暗，可无论往哪儿看，都不见钥匙的影子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060132_1_00a92136:
    # "What the fuck!? I just want to leave!"
    "搞什么鬼！？我只想离开这里！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060133_1_38482eb7:
    # "I didn't want to accept it, but the key wasn't there."
    "我不愿相信，可钥匙确实不在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060134_1_858654db:
    # "Was it not dropped yet?"
    "难道是还没掉到这里吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060141_1_10c35000:
    # "Although it was ridiculous, I went back to the chilly storeroom. It was a bit of a gamble, but the culprit had to arrive there relatively soon to detach the handle."
    "明知荒唐，我还是回到了阴冷的储藏室。这多少是在赌，但拆把手的人应该很快就会来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060142_1_8babbae9:
    # "...{w}Wait, is that right?{w} Will the culprit really come in here...?"
    "……{w}等等，真是这样吗？{w}那个人真的会进这里来……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060143_1_2556c275:
    # "When we found the secret wall, a single set of fingerprints was on it, meaning that it had been opened one time in the recent past. I swear I just saw those same fingerprints right now... Does that mean that nobody will come until our past selves find the mechanism?{w} Alternatively, what if they come from outside and won't touch the other side of the wall?{w} ...This doesn't make any sense, though. How is it possible we only saw one set of fingerprints? What about the ones I left just now?"
    "我们发现暗墙的时候，上面只有一组指纹，说明前不久它被人打开过一次。可我刚才分明看见了同一组指纹……这是不是说，要等过去的我们找到机关，才会有人来？{w}又或者，对方是从外面进来的，根本不会碰到墙的另一面？{w}……可这说不通。怎么可能只有一组指纹？我刚才留下的那些又算什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060146_1_0d9456b4:
    # "Did it mean that the past had changed? Was everything going to happen differently?"
    "这是不是说，过去已经改变？一切都会变得不一样吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060147_1_f3423237:
    # "...And where in the world is Shiroya? If she somehow went to the future, she'll definitely come here when she appears.{w} Is it possible she's outside and won't tell the police just so she can avoid changing the past...?"
    "……还有，Shiroya 究竟在哪里？如果她去了未来，那她出现时一定会来这里。{w}会不会她就在外面，只是为了不改变过去，才不去告诉警察……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060148_1_4978144a:
    # "The key isn't in the hallway, the handle hasn't been taken off, I left extra fingerprints, and two Sekimeiya are in the attic. This cannot be the same morning. After all, if I'd been here since the start, I would've been found."
    "走廊里没有钥匙，把手还没被拆下，我留下了多余的指纹，阁楼里还放着两个 Sekimeiya。这绝不可能是同一个早晨。毕竟，如果我从一开始就在这里，早就被人发现了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060149_1_5eab62aa:
    # "So what exactly is going to happen? Is everything gonna be different?{w} What about our past selves? If the past was changed somewhere, I'm no longer the other Atsuki who's currently here."
    "那么接下来到底会发生什么？一切都会变得不一样吗？{w}过去的我们又该怎么办？如果过去在某处被改变，我就不再是此刻待在这里的另一个我了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060150_1_12949c2f:
    # "I had to stay in the storeroom, merely hoping Shiroya would come. I had no desire to go back to the attic either; the Sekimeiya would clearly never aid us, and I didn't want anyone to slip into the storeroom while I wasn't present."
    "我只能留在储藏室，一心盼着 Shiroya 出现。我也不想再回阁楼去：Sekimeiya 显然帮不上我们任何忙，而我不在的时候，万一有人溜进储藏室就糟了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060151_1_b11d5b3f:
    # "What the hell is all of this!? When I finally found Shiroya, she suddenly disappeared! There's no way I'm going to spend twelve more hours here from the start, and I have no idea what the fuck is even going to happen! How did everything turn into this so quickly!?"
    "这到底算怎么回事！？好不容易找到 Shiroya，她却突然消失了！我才不要从头开始，又在这里耗上十二个小时，而且我压根不知道接下来还会发生什么鬼事！怎么就变成这样了！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060155_1_6acea93b:
    # "I took a moment to recenter. Panicking wasn't going to get me anywhere."
    "我花了一会儿才定下神来。慌张解决不了任何问题。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060156_1_3bac707c:
    # "...Didn't Shiroya say that she found the rusty key in a security room drawer? What if it was her who changed the past?"
    "……Shiroya 不是说过，她是在监控室抽屉里找到那把生锈的钥匙吗？万一改变过去的人就是她呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060157_1_439e38fc:
    # "If she grabbed it days ago, it wouldn't be in hallway A now.{w} And if the world changed independent of her actions, could the key currently be in the security room? I can't try to find it before everyone wakes up because the alarm locked the room..."
    "如果几天前她就拿走了钥匙，那现在它就不会在 A走廊。{w}可要是世界的改变与她的行动无关，钥匙此刻会不会就在监控室里？警报把监控室锁上了，我没法赶在大家醒来之前去找……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060158_1_356eafdd:
    # "The key was in the security room days ago... Katei was surely who dropped it, then."
    "几天前钥匙还在监控室……那么掉钥匙的人一定是 Katei。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060159_1_46412da0:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060166_1_823107ab:
    # "It was earlier than I'd anticipated when sound came from the hallway.{w} From the lobby side, a group of people approached where I was."
    "走廊里传来动静，比我预想的要早。{w}一群人从大厅那边朝我这边走来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060168_1_9b7123dc:
    # "Huh...? Is that everyone?{w} This isn't what we did. We went to the security room the first time we stepped into this hallway."
    "咦……？所有人都来了？{w}我们可不是这么做的。第一次踏进这条走廊时，我们是先去了监控室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060169_1_dcc25541:
    # "However, the steps went to the crystal room in front of me."
    "可那些脚步声却朝我前方的水晶展室去了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060170_1_ecae7508:
    # "That's the room where the gemstones were stolen. Why did they go there without entering the security room first?"
    "宝石就是在那间展室被盗的。他们为什么连监控室都不进，就直接去了那里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060171_1_444acda0:
    # "From behind the wall, I was able to pick up a voice. It was Sai's, although I couldn't make out the words."
    "隔着墙，我隐约听见了说话声。是 Sai 的声音，只是听不清在说什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060172_1_4551bc95:
    # "Do they know what happened there? Why, though? That's so strange."
    "他们知道那里发生过什么吗？可他们为什么要去那儿？太奇怪了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060173_1_4c103603:
    # "They left the room not long after and walked closer to the stairs."
    "没过多久，他们便离开那间屋子，朝楼梯这边走来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060174_1_beb0e412:
    # "That's Katei talking, isn't it?"
    "那是 Katei 在说话吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060175_1_5922af9d:
    # "I focused as much as I could to understand what he was saying."
    "我竭力集中精神，想听清他在说什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060178_1_14439677:
    # "...elevator won't move— ...arm disabled it."
    "……电梯动不了了——……警报把它停掉了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060179_1_3bdcb2e8:
    # "...Sorry, Isla, but there's no—"
    "……抱歉，Isla，可是没有——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060181_1_7a5ba7b6:
    # "What the hell? This is entirely different from what we experienced."
    "搞什么？这跟我们经历过的完全不一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060182_1_222ca1af:
    # "Everyone went up the stairs, leaving behind the bizarre silence."
    "所有人都上了楼梯，只留下那片诡异的寂静。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060183_1_b07e053f:
    # "They didn't even unlock the security room, so I can't go see if the key's there!"
    "他们连监控室都没打开，我根本没法去看钥匙在不在里面！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060184_1_3ab841f5:
    # "It was evident there had been a change in history, but where? I hadn't willingly changed the past, so someone else must have... Why had it had such a particular effect on me, though? Did I possess memories of the past reality because I'd traveled from it...?"
    "历史确实被改动过了，可到底改在了哪里？我并没有主动去改变过去，那做这件事的只可能是别人……可为什么偏偏对我产生了这样的影响？我之所以还保留着原来那个现实的记忆，难道是因为我从那里穿越而来……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060185_1_58864cf2:
    # "That didn't quite make sense, but I knew the answer wouldn't be simple regardless."
    "这说不通，但我也清楚，答案本就不会简单。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060189_1_704511fe:
    # "...Is that it? Did a person alter reality, or is what happened something else...?"
    "……就这样？是有人改变了现实，还是说事情另有蹊跷……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060190_1_747ed772:
    # "But most importantly, what was I supposed to do? I had no idea. Nothing was guaranteed."
    "可最关键的是，我接下来该做什么？我毫无头绪，什么都无法保证。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060191_1_636388fe:
    # "If the past has already changed, no matter what I do, I'll have no direct relation to the Atsuki who just went up. ...That means my priority should be to find Shiroya, who's in the same position as me.{w} Where could she be? If she traveled through time and another deviation occurred, she might not exist in this world anymore."
    "如果过去已经被改变，那无论我再做什么，都和刚才上楼的那个 Atsuki 没有直接关系了。……也就是说，我该优先去找和我处境相同的 Shiroya。{w}她会在哪儿？如果她穿越了时间，之后又发生了一次偏差，她或许已经不存在于这个世界了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060192_1_ebf5becc:
    # "Assuming that was actually the case, was finding her conceivable in the first place? I couldn't even know that, seeing as I was already neck-deep in the nonsensical."
    "就算真是如此，找得到她吗？连这一点我都无从判断——毕竟我早已陷进一堆荒唐之中。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060196_1_4343c6fa:
    # "Once again, I didn't have to wait very long before I heard some of the others come back."
    "又一次，我没等多久就听见几个人回来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060197_1_41cf3c1b:
    # "Who's that? It's not everyone who went up."
    "是谁？刚才上楼的人没全回来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060198_1_67f20a79:
    # "Quietly, they walked past the storeroom."
    "他们悄无声息地从储藏室外走过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060200_1_1b3efc40:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060201_1_55aeaf61:
    # "Following them, another person came from the stairs, crossing in front of the storeroom.{w} A few seconds later, someone else did too, but they didn't enter hallway A."
    "紧跟着，又有一个人从楼梯过来，从储藏室门前走过。{w}几秒后，另一个人也一样走过，却没有进 A走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060204_1_3979e941:
    # "What the hell is happening here...!? Why is everyone silently walking around on their own!?"
    "这到底是怎么回事……！？为什么每个人都一声不响地各走各的！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060205_1_aa150bae:
    # "At some point, someone briefly entered the storeroom and left without saying anything. After listening for a few minutes, everything occurred in reverse. Several footsteps went up the stairs in a small group. A bit later, I heard a single person going up, followed by another shortly after that."
    "不知什么时候，有人短暂地进了储藏室，又一言不发地离开。又听了几分钟，一切便反过来重演了一遍。几个人结伴上了楼梯。过了一会儿，我听见一个人独自上楼，紧接着又是一个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060206_1_f3f4655c:
    # "...{w}What the fuck just happened!? Is everyone gone again?"
    "……{w}刚才到底发生什么了！？所有人又都不见了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060211_1_bc3b9a9f:
    # "Nothing else could be heard on the crystal floor, but I had no idea what any of those people had done or who they were."
    "水晶层上再听不到别的动静，可那些人都做了什么、又是谁，我全然不知。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060212_1_2d774754:
    # "The silence continued for some time, and eventually, I was tempted to step out. Multiple people had walked toward the security room, but I didn't know if they'd entered it."
    "寂静持续了好一阵，我终于有些想出去看看。好几个人都朝监控室的方向走过，可我不知道他们有没有进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060213_1_2790733a:
    # "Was one of them Katei? Nobody seems to be here, so I could go check if it's unlocked."
    "那些人里会不会有一个是 Katei？这里似乎没人了，我可以去看看门有没有开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060214_1_3cf295c5:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060218_1_f3863968:
    # "I slipped out of the secret corridor and opened the way out just a crack."
    "我从暗道里溜出来，把出口推开一道细缝。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060221_1_dbb99b3c:
    # "Nobody was in hallway C."
    "C走廊里空无一人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060225_1_d27115a5:
    # "I slowly moved the other way."
    "我缓缓往另一个方向挪动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060229_1_d71f7283:
    # "When I tried to open the security room, I found it to be unlocked."
    "我试着推监控室的门，发现它没有上锁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060235_1_1602df7a:
    # "Oh... all the screens are off.{w} It looks like the same thing that happened to us, where they all shut down at the same time. It seems it occurred again despite all the differences."
    "哦……所有屏幕都黑着。{w}看起来和我们那时一样，全部同时熄掉了。看来尽管情况处处不同，这件事还是照样发生了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060239_1_7652e29e:
    # "I couldn't waste time, so I hurried over to the drawers."
    "我不能再耽搁，赶紧奔向那几个抽屉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060240_1_55cacb7d:
    # "I doubt it's still here.{w} What's most likely is that Katei has—"
    "我看它多半已经不在了。{w}最有可能的是，Katei 已经——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060245_1_4c98fa22:
    # "I cut myself off. The key was there, deep within a drawer."
    "我把话咽了回去。钥匙就在那里，躺在抽屉深处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060246_1_d93e5966:
    # "Although I could no longer be certain that leaving the tower was what I had to do, I couldn't help but feel a brief thrill at the prospect."
    "虽然我已经无法确定离开塔是不是我该做的事，可一想到这个可能，心里还是忍不住一阵兴奋。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060250_1_1d0040c5:
    # "Was the universe going to allow it for once? Back in the storeroom, I pressed my hand against the hidden door, nearly out of breath."
    "这一次，世界总该容许了吧？回到储藏室，我把手按在暗门上，几乎喘不上气。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060256_1_dba38947:
    # "The handle was there, and so was the keyhole. I inserted the key, which confirmed it was the right one."
    "把手在，钥匙孔也在。我把钥匙插进去，确认正是这一把。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060259_1_bf9efda1:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060262_1_9798e830:
    # "...Really? Is leaving this place simply not possible?"
    "……真的吗？难道离开这里根本就是不可能的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060265_1_6bbae41d:
    # "It wasn't working. Although the key was the right one, it wasn't unlocking the door."
    "打不开。钥匙明明是对的，门锁却纹丝不动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060267_1_115e9431:
    # "This is absurd. What the fuck am I supposed to do!?{w} Do I wait half a day here, hoping Shiroya will just appear and the exit will open?{w} And then what? Two versions of us remain forever? ...This is insane! There has to be something we can do."
    "这太荒唐了。我到底该怎么办！？{w}难道我要在这里等上半天，指望 Shiroya 自己出现、出口自己打开？{w}然后呢？我们两个就永远这样并存下去？……简直疯了！总该有我们能做的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060268_1_1bb7a09a:
    # "...{w}I had the rusty key, so an old thought came back to me."
    "……{w}手里握着那把生锈的钥匙，一个旧的念头又浮了上来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060274_1_4487c98d:
    # "\"Unless I go back to thinking about thought-up loops, I suppose. There could be something that would work.{w} The person who killed Katei took that rusty key and walked out of the tower through the storeroom door, which was open. That created a location outside the tower where they were holding the key that could be replicated. Then, they reentered and used the Sekimeiya to go back in time. In the past, they appeared outside the tower holding the key, so they were able to unlock the door and reenter with something they'd obtained outside—like a knife. They left the door open so that their past self could exit with the key and create the replicated location.\""
    "「除非我又回头去琢磨那种假想出来的循环。说不定真有什么办法行得通。{w}杀死 Katei 的人拿起那把生锈的钥匙，从敞开的储藏室门走出了塔。于是，塔外就有了一个他持着钥匙的地点，而这个地点可以被复制。接着，他重新进塔，用 Sekimeiya 回到过去。在过去，他拿着钥匙出现在塔外，因此能打开门，带着从外面弄到的东西——比如一把刀——重新进来。他故意让门开着，好让过去的自己带着钥匙出去，造出那个复制地点。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060280_1_c707cca9:
    # "Could I pull off something like that, after all?"
    "说到底，这种事我做得成吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060281_1_d1f23573:
    # "I still have no idea how the replicated location works, but I could try it. I'll step out and spend a long time outside holding the key. After that, I'll come back in and travel to the past as many times as needed to appear outside holding the key so that I can unlock the door and let my past self out. I can't really construct it in a cleaner way."
    "我到现在也不明白复制地点是怎么运作的，但可以试一试。我先走出去，带着钥匙在外面待上很久。之后再回到里面，反复回到过去，直到我拿着钥匙出现在塔外，打开门，把过去的自己放出去。我实在想不出更干净的做法了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060285_1_9f0317cb:
    # "I stepped out of the secret area so that another self of mine could unlock the door without alerting me. My knocks from before would be their cue to do it."
    "我走出暗间，好让另一个我能在不惊动我的情况下打开门。我之前敲门的声音，就是给另一个我的信号。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060292_1_b3964efe:
    # "Great. I'm just gonna be here all my life."
    "好啊。看来我这辈子都得耗在这儿了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060293_1_c41a0af3:
    # "I knew that feeling all too well. My plan had failed, but I couldn't know why. For all I knew, it was viable, but if the police or civilians were observing the surroundings of the tower, that was one of countless ways it would be blocked. It was possible I wouldn't have been able to unlock the door from outside either."
    "那种滋味我再熟悉不过。计划失败了，可我不知道原因。说不定它本来就行得通，但如果警察或平民正在监视塔的四周，那也不过是无数种让它失败的情况之一。也有可能，我在外面同样打不开那道门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060301_1_221ce184:
    # "I sat down, defeated."
    "我颓然坐下。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060302_1_9ffd6511:
    # "I stayed on the cold floor, waiting for the door to open. It seemed the last hope that remained entailed being able to leave at {time=21.}{w} Was that going to happen, or was I going to wait another twelve hours just to be faked out again?"
    "我坐在冰冷的地板上，等着门打开。仅剩的最后一点指望，似乎就是能在 {time=21.} 出去。{w}那会成真吗？还是说我又要再等上十二个小时，到头来再一次空等一场？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060303_1_46cdcab5:
    # "...And would the secret door ever open? Would I ever see the Shiroya I'd just been with again?"
    "……还有，那道暗门会打开吗？我还能再见到刚才和我在一起的 Shiroya 吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060304_1_fe9b6924:
    # "I didn't bother thinking; there was nothing else I felt compelled to solve, as the march of time alone would decide everything. Soon after I rested my jaw on my knees, I heard people returning to the crystal floor."
    "我懒得再去想。反正时间流逝自会决定一切，我也没有别的非解决不可的事。我把下巴搁在膝盖上没多久，就听见有人回到了水晶层。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060305_1_3a1a1f48:
    # "I knew everyone was outside, but I didn't want to show myself. If I had to wait all day again, I would do it peacefully—alone."
    "我知道所有人都在外面，却不想露面。如果还要再等上一整天，那我就安安静静地一个人等。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060306_1_dd0f5162:
    # "When I stashed the key in my pocket, I noticed something else: another key had disappeared. ...The one that opened the locker that wasn't Naomi's.{w} When had it disappeared? I had only just realized it, but it was a result of one of my last two travels."
    "我把钥匙塞进口袋时，又注意到一件事：另一把钥匙不见了。……就是那把能打开另一个储物柜的钥匙——那个柜子不是 Naomi 的。{w}它是什么时候不见的？我直到现在才发现，但这一定是我最近两次穿越中的某一次造成的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060308_1_e1615ac0:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060312_1_b93a4785:
    # "I heard faint voices sporadically, but I had no real idea of what was happening in the building. Once some time had passed, only occasional footsteps met my ears."
    "隐约的人声时断时续，但楼里究竟在发生什么，我毫无头绪。过了一阵，传进耳朵里的便只剩零星的脚步声。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060313_1_68136c79:
    # "My body began to feel noticeably chilled, so I tried to cover myself well. Shiroya wasn't coming—that was very clear. ...Was Naomi present, though? I hadn't heard anything regarding her."
    "身上明显冷了起来，我尽量把自己裹紧。Shiroya 不会来了——这一点再清楚不过。……可 Naomi 在吗？关于她，我什么也没听到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060314_1_447662ba:
    # "...{w}What about the Sekimeiya? During the prolonged silence, I considered trying to find it. Assuming two existed, obtaining a single one wasn't too hard. Nobody knew about the hidden section I was in, so I could conceal it there."
    "……{w}那 Sekimeiya 呢？漫长的沉默里，我也动过找找看的念头。如果存在两个，弄到一个并不算难。没人知道我藏身的这处暗间，正好可以把它藏在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060315_1_928e07d2:
    # "But I knew that would only complicate things further. Escaping the building by touching the Sekimeiya couldn't be possible; when that was supposed to occur, the Sekimeiya vanished instead.{w} What the hell had happened at that time? Why had the cabinet's state reverted? Without a thorough understanding of the Sekimeiya's powers, I couldn't begin to use it."
    "但我知道，那只会让事情更复杂。想靠触碰 Sekimeiya 逃出这栋楼根本行不通——真到了那一刻，Sekimeiya 却消失了。{w}那时候究竟发生了什么？展示柜的状态为什么会恢复原样？不把 Sekimeiya 的力量彻底弄清楚，我根本无从使用它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060316_1_d9772660:
    # "So I stayed there, ignorant to the actual time.{w} ...However, I could tell that a few hours had passed."
    "于是我待在那里，不知道实际过了多久。{w}……不过，我大致能判断已经过了几个小时。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060317_1_c6de0307:
    # "It had been a while since I'd heard anyone's voice. Only individual steps had crossed the hallway here and there."
    "很久没听到人声了，只有零星的脚步偶尔穿过走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060322_1_c49b1a66:
    # "Hey! ...the fuck...! Where have you—"
    "喂！……搞什么……！你跑到哪——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060324_1_bbfabf01:
    # "I looked at the door. It was Sai's voice, which I hadn't heard in a long time."
    "我望向门的方向。那是 Sai 的声音，我已经很久没听到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060325_1_840dac26:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060329_1_bdaba8b2:
    # "There was no immediate response that I could hear, but I remained attentive. Had Sai seen someone who hadn't been there for a long time? My mind immediately went to Naomi."
    "我没有立刻听到任何回应，但仍旧留心听着。Sai 是不是看到了某个许久没露面的人？我脑中立刻想到 Naomi。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060330_1_b17ba746:
    # "I wasn't able to properly distinguish anything else, but I could at least tell that a group was in the hallway. I'd only understood Sai due to his volume."
    "别的话我分辨不清，但至少能听出走廊里有一群人。只是因为 Sai 嗓门大，我才听懂了他的话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060331_1_f0015ed6:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060335_1_0310668a:
    # "A few minutes later, even those faint signs of life faded out."
    "几分钟后，连那点微弱的动静也消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060336_1_5b8f9966:
    # "Are they not there anymore...?"
    "他们已经不在了吗……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060337_1_7b66c995:
    # "It didn't seem so. Leaning against the wall, I attempted to think about nothing."
    "似乎确实不在了。我靠着墙，努力什么都不去想。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060341_1_b2f5404a:
    # "Minutes later, a couple sets of footsteps approached from the far end of the hallway. As always, my eyes instinctively turned to the door."
    "几分钟后，几道脚步声从走廊尽头传来，越来越近。我像往常一样，目光不由自主地转向门口。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060343_1_26e01990:
    # "It's certainly po— ...on this floor. Don't move fro—"
    "肯定就在——……这一层。别走开——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060344_1_070992cb:
    # "...Was that me?"
    "……那是我吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060346_1_3f5483f4:
    # "...Okay."
    "……好。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060347_1_5eb89270:
    # "...{w}What?"
    "……{w}什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060348_1_b603bc24:
    # "That voice..."
    "那个声音……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060355_1_1c6052b5:
    # "Was that Miiya...? ...I must be mistaken."
    "那是Miiya……？……多半是我听错了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060356_1_bf4da7fc:
    # "Suddenly, the storeroom door opened, and I had to fight to contain my panic.{w} It appeared my past self was looking for something, as he quickly moved on to the next crystal room."
    "突然，储藏室的门开了，我拼命压住心里的惊慌。{w}看来过去的我正在找什么，很快又转向了下一间水晶展室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060357_1_9971adfa:
    # "It was her, wasn't it...? It was only one word, but wasn't that her voice...?"
    "是她吧……？虽然只听见一个词，可那不就是她的声音吗……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060358_1_a4b52443:
    # "While it seemed impossible, her existence in the tower had been mentioned before. Erina, Sai, and Akaro had all claimed to have seen her."
    "尽管难以置信，但此前确实有人提过她在塔里。Erina、Sai和Akaro都说过自己见过她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060359_1_b332d969:
    # "Is she there, on the other side of the door?"
    "她就在门那边吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060360_1_6a5cb10b:
    # "Multiple people emerged from the lobby side and stopped in hallway C. Meanwhile, I could hear doors being opened."
    "好几个人从大厅那头过来，停在了C走廊。与此同时，我能听见开门的声音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060364_1_e13b7148:
    # "...you hear that?"
    "……你听见了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060365_1_b751644f:
    # "What?"
    "什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060366_1_698afe65:
    # "No?"
    "没有？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060367_1_e332b74c:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060368_1_ca79109a:
    # "What are they doing? Searching for the Sekimeiya?"
    "他们在做什么？在找Sekimeiya吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060370_1_95691ade:
    # "Stay the—{w=0.4} ...look at the mechani—"
    "待在那儿——{w=0.4}……你看机械室——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060371_1_972451e2:
    # "That was my voice again."
    "又是我自己的声音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060372_1_83437048:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060374_1_08a90042:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060375_1_8ad07bc3:
    # "I think they moved over to hallway B."
    "他们好像挪到B走廊去了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060379_1_7305b77d:
    # "...right. Let's go."
    "……好。走吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060380_1_8006dc65:
    # "And now they're going up."
    "现在他们上楼了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060385_1_db4e26d1:
    # "I emerged from the hidden area so that I could hear a little bit better. It seemed everyone was walking up the stairs.{w} Had I actually heard Miiya? If she was there, I had to see her."
    "我从藏身处走出来，好听得更清楚些。看来所有人都上楼了。{w}我真的听到Miiya了吗？如果她就在那里，我一定要见到她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060389_1_b8d9da16:
    # "I closed the secret wall. I assumed everyone's backs were facing me, so I peeked out from behind the door. If Miiya was with them, I didn't mind being seen, but half of me thought my mind had played a trick on me."
    "我合上暗墙，料想众人都背对着我，便从门后探出头去。如果Miiya和他们在一起，我不介意被发现；可我心里有一半觉得，那不过是自己听岔了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060396_1_627d7c39:
    # "Most of them had turned past the gray door; I could only see Sai's legs slowly disappearing."
    "大部分人已经拐过那扇灰门，我只看见Sai的腿慢慢消失在门后。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060400_1_77a53c00:
    # "I approached the stairs, hoping I could watch them from a distance. However, all of a sudden, Sai stopped."
    "我走近楼梯，想远远看他们一眼。可Sai忽然停住了脚步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060404_1_ed016693:
    # "Had he heard me? I stepped aside reflexively."
    "他听见我了？我下意识地往旁边一闪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060405_1_eac71d42:
    # "...What's up?"
    "……怎么了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060406_1_6bf2d43e:
    # "Akaro, why is that door open?"
    "Akaro，那扇门怎么开着？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060407_1_ef4fdb69:
    # "Shit. They noticed me."
    "糟了，他们发现我了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060412_1_8b1096d4:
    # "As their suspicion grew, I stepped back several times. By the time they came back down, I was in hallway B."
    "他们起了疑心，我连退了好几步。等他们折返下来时，我已经退到了B走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060413_1_61b17203:
    # "Sai and Akaro approached the storeroom and were followed by Katei, Erina, and Isla."
    "Sai和Akaro朝储藏室走来，Katei、Erina和Isla跟在后面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060414_1_4e674e6b:
    # "...What about Miiya? Is she not here?{w} My past self isn't either..."
    "……Miiya呢？她不在这里吗？{w}过去的我也不在……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060415_1_b70d4c6f:
    # "I couldn't see what was happening from where I was, but suddenly, I heard gasps."
    "从我这里看不到发生了什么，可忽然传来了几声倒抽冷气的声音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060416_1_c9ff95af:
    # "What...?"
    "什么……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060424_1_8d9abd02:
    # "I got closer and shut my eyes in regret when I saw what they were looking at. They had found the secret corridor."
    "我走近几步，看清他们正盯着什么，懊恼地闭上了眼。他们发现了那条秘密通道。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060425_1_ec3b3929:
    # "What the fuck do I do now...? There's nowhere else to hide."
    "我他妈现在该怎么办……？已经没有别的地方可躲了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060429_1_7a247791:
    # "I looked around in desperation. I could never hide in a bathroom, as Katei would unlock it.{w} I saw the elevator was open; it was working, and the others had definitely been in the process of searching the whole building."
    "我绝望地环顾四周。洗手间根本藏不了——Katei 会把门打开。{w} 我看到电梯开着，还能运行，而其他人显然正在搜查整栋楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060431_1_21005201:
    # "Did I really mishear that? Was that not Miiya...?{w} Where is my other self, then? What about the past Shiroya? She isn't here either."
    "难道我真的听错了？那不是 Miiya……？{w} 那另一个我在哪里？过去的 Shiroya 呢？她也不在这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060436_1_50640342:
    # "I moved to the event room, an easy bridge between the hallways."
    "我挪到活动室。那里连着两条走廊，穿过去很方便。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060443_1_d77cd8a5:
    # "Just to check, I uncovered the curtain. The Sekimeiya wasn't there."
    "为确认一下，我掀开遮布。Sekimeiya 不在里面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060445_1_92ea9d05:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060446_1_ab5a984e:
    # "I'm not gonna spend hours trying to hide from everyone. If I'm discovered, I'll explain what happened to me."
    "我没打算花上几个小时躲着所有人。真被发现了，我就把发生在我身上的事解释清楚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060452_1_5920148f:
    # "At least a few of them were still in the storeroom, discussing what they'd found. Some minutes later, I was surprised by the sound of someone walking through hallway A."
    "至少还有几个人留在储藏室里，讨论着他们的发现。几分钟后，我听到有人穿过 A走廊的脚步声，吃了一惊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060457_1_8a3f6e26:
    # "What was strange was that they'd come from the lobby side. They'd come out of a crystal room to my left."
    "奇怪的是，那人是从大厅那边过来的。他是从我左边的一间水晶展室里走出来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060458_1_6adad84b:
    # "Was someone in there...?"
    "里面有人吗……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060459_1_da892672:
    # "Whoever it was had walked to the storeroom, but all the voices I could make out were too muffled."
    "那个人已经走到储藏室去了，可我能分辨出的说话声都太模糊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060463_1_766788b7:
    # "Eventually, I stopped sensing people in the hallway."
    "最后，我感觉走廊里已经没有人了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060464_1_60e0d6e1:
    # "...Did they go anywhere?"
    "……他们是去了什么地方吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060468_1_ded07324:
    # "Just in case, I left through the other side."
    "为保险起见，我从另一侧离开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060472_1_576aae93:
    # "Yeah, they're not there anymore.{w} Where did they go? There's no way they opened the door out, is there?"
    "嗯，人已经不在了。{w} 到底去了哪里？总不可能把通向外面的门打开了吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060477_1_ff46501b:
    # "They hadn't. It was still locked."
    "没有。门还锁着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060478_1_00af80ad:
    # "Maybe they continued going up...?"
    "也许他们继续往上走了……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060482_1_71e57456:
    # "I stared at the crystal rooms in hallway A. There was only one farther ahead on the same wall as the event room: A1."
    "我盯着 A走廊里的水晶展室。再往前，与活动室位于同一侧的只剩一间：A1。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060486_1_e90a35bc:
    # "That person... Did they come out of here?"
    "那个人……是从这里出来的吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060492_1_e679d913:
    # "It was a little strange. After all, I knew the floor had just been inspected, and since the others had been about to go up, it was likely they hadn't found whatever they'd been searching for."
    "这有点奇怪。毕竟我知道这一层刚被检查过，而其他人正要上楼，看来他们并没有找到自己在找的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060493_1_06ac7695:
    # "I hadn't heard anyone entering the room, so if someone had left it, they had definitely done so after spending a while inside. That was what I found odd."
    "我没听见有人进过这间展室；既然如此，如果有人从里面出来，那一定是在里面待了好一阵子。我觉得奇怪的就是这一点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060497_1_63731ff6:
    # "The curtains were raised, showing that the cabinets had recently been looked into. Curious, I went ahead and opened them."
    "遮布被拉了起来，说明展示柜最近被人查看过。我出于好奇，也上前打开了柜门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060502_1_4d130ac9:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060505_1_675f4fd5:
    # "I was surprised to find out my suspicion had been on the mark. A Sekimeiya was inside one of the cabinets."
    "让我意外的是，我的猜测竟然没错。其中一个展示柜里放着一个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060508_1_2a3bdb38:
    # "What the hell...? So someone managed to hide it despite the search."
    "怎么回事……？竟然有人能在搜查时把它藏起来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060512_1_0045ccce:
    # "I knew an identical gemstone existed, so I went through the remaining cabinets until I was confident that it was the only Sekimeiya in the room."
    "我知道还有一颗一模一样的宝石，于是把剩下的展示柜逐一查过，直到确信这间展室里只有这一个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060520_1_d1381cce:
    # "...Should I take it? Now that I can't stay in the storeroom, it might be useful to keep it."
    "……要拿走吗？既然我不能再待在储藏室，带在身上也许有用。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060521_1_bca86b47:
    # "Unsure, I reached in to grab it, and as I took it out, I was reminded of an unexplained problem."
    "我犹豫着伸手去拿；把它取出来时，又想起了一个没弄明白的问题。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060522_1_f5324968:
    # "...It's not hot at all.{w} That means it's not currently working, but it should be."
    "……一点都不烫。{w} 也就是说它现在没在运作，可它本该在运作才对。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060523_1_b084423e:
    # "This is what happened sometimes. The Sekimeiya remained cold outside the cabinet, and touching it didn't do anything."
    "以前也出现过这种情况。Sekimeiya 放在展示柜外时一直是凉的，碰它也没有任何反应。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060524_1_6cefedf4:
    # "Hm... Could it be that out of the two Sekimeiya, only one works?"
    "嗯……会不会两个 Sekimeiya 中只有一个能用？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060525_1_81b610f4:
    # "That sounded like a plausible idea, but it was denied by the time a Sekimeiya had appeared inactive in Sai's hip pack.{w} It was useless, and I didn't want to give myself another headache trying to resolve it. I put it back where I'd found it."
    "这猜测看似合理，但 Sai 腰包里也出现过毫无反应的 Sekimeiya，这个说法便站不住脚了。{w} 它反正没用，我也不想再为弄清它头疼一次。我把它放回了原处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060528_1_e6b05ee4:
    # "I wonder who hid it here, though."
    "不过，会是谁把它藏在这里的呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060535_1_cd88f9c5:
    # "Where do I even go?"
    "我到底该去哪儿？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060536_1_9e80cd71:
    # "The tower was being inspected, so I figured the least likely places to be revisited were the bathrooms on floor 2."
    "整座塔正在被搜查，我想二楼洗手间应该是最不可能有人再去检查的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060540_1_0afc41ba:
    # "I shut myself inside one."
    "我把自己关进其中一间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060542_1_21643a83:
    # "I'll definitely be found eventually no matter where I stay."
    "无论我躲在哪儿，迟早都会被找到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060543_1_c06fba4a:
    # "Was that voice really Miiya's? I need to know that.{w} It couldn't have been anyone else. If it wasn't my imagination, it was the real Miiya."
    "那真的是 Miiya 的声音吗？我必须确认这一点。{w} 不可能是别人。如果不是我的错觉，那就是真正的 Miiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060544_1_d3b4f70f:
    # "I had no idea why she would be there, but if she was, that was the biggest question of them all."
    "我不知道她为什么会在那里，但如果她真在那里，那才是最大的谜团。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060545_1_5eb99b54:
    # "It's likely they'll all come back down. If she's here, I'll be able to see her.{w} She wasn't with the others in the storeroom, though. My past self and Shiroya were missing too..."
    "他们多半都会下来。如果她在这里，我就能看见她。{w} 可她并不在储藏室那群人里。过去的我和 Shiroya 也不见了……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060549_1_1fa89e4f:
    # "They haven't come back yet. I have to assume they have access to the attic."
    "他们还没回来。我只能认为他们能进阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060550_1_afd455e0:
    # "I decided that if nobody came after a while, I would quietly go up to see if I could find everyone.{w} But soon after that resolution, I thought I might've heard someone just outside the bathroom, separated from the rest."
    "我决定，如果过了一会儿还没人来，就悄悄上楼看看能不能找到大家。{w} 可刚下定决心，我好像听见洗手间外有人，而且和其余人分开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060552_1_4db2543d:
    # "Did someone go to the crystal floor?"
    "有人去水晶层了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060556_1_578c8ea1:
    # "I went out and walked halfway down the stairs."
    "我走出去，沿楼梯下到一半。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060559_1_81f01b3a:
    # "Through the gray door, I saw Sai in hallway A, going from room to room."
    "透过灰色的门，我看见 Sai 在 A走廊里，正一间间地查看。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060560_1_ae6e5d95:
    # "What the hell is he doing now?{w} And what the hell is everyone else doing, letting him roam around freely?"
    "他他妈在干什么？{w} 其他人又是怎么回事，竟然让他自由行动？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060561_1_95c4dcb5:
    # "Was he the person who came out of that crystal room? If he traveled through time, he could've been there and in the storeroom at the same time.{w} But everyone had to see that person when they left A1. They would've reacted at seeing two of one person, and I guess it would've been a paradox..."
    "他是不是那个从水晶展室出来的人？如果他穿越了时间，就可能同时出现在那边和储藏室。{w} 但那人离开 A1 时，大家肯定都看见了。要是看到同一个人同时出现两个，他们不可能没有反应——我想那会形成悖论……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060564_1_153d311a:
    # "This is strange. He's likely searching for the Sekimeiya, which means he didn't hide it in that cabinet. However, a search just happened, so why is he doing this? Does he not trust the results?"
    "奇怪。他多半是在找 Sekimeiya，也就是说，他没有把它藏进那个展示柜。可是刚刚才搜查过，他为什么还这么做？是不相信搜查结果吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060565_1_d93b3476:
    # "I guess that's not all. There must be another Sekimeiya somewhere..."
    "看来还不止这些。别处一定还有另一个 Sekimeiya……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060567_1_0f67b7ed:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060571_1_2fa2f39a:
    # "I stepped away. I could still hear him moving downstairs, but the others were my concern."
    "我走开了。楼下还能听见他走动的声响，但我更在意的是其他人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060575_1_e10db4d0:
    # "I kept waiting in the bathroom."
    "我继续在洗手间里等着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060579_1_bef56595:
    # "If Sai sneaked away, they'll notice it pretty quickly. He probably came down to search for himself, and he might find the Sekimeiya I saw."
    "Sai 要是偷偷溜走，他们很快就会察觉。他多半是自己下楼来搜，说不定会发现我看见的那个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060580_1_b0855ab4:
    # "I wonder what he'll do if he actually does. It wasn't working, so he won't be able to activate it."
    "真让他找到了，他会怎么做呢。那个已经失效，他也启动不了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060581_1_239c3c8f:
    # "The sound of his movements no longer reached me. Bemused by the fact that I could still be patient, I waited for something to happen."
    "他的动静再也传不到我这边。我居然还沉得住气，自己都觉得意外，就这样等着事情发生。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060582_1_75950d65:
    # "I don't know what Sai's intentions could be. Surely he still has to learn everything about the Sekimeiya, but what is his ultimate goal? ...He was trying to achieve something all day, and I have no idea what."
    "我不知道 Sai 究竟有什么打算。他必然还要弄清与 Sekimeiya 有关的一切，可他最终想达成什么？……他一整天都在设法做成某件事，我却毫无头绪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060586_1_70a7503d:
    # "Is that someone above me...?"
    "上面有人……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060587_1_3bd279bc:
    # "For a second, I could discern footsteps coming from the ceiling."
    "有一瞬，我隐约听出天花板那边传来脚步声。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060588_1_55e66407:
    # "Is it the others...?"
    "是其他人吗……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060589_1_90e07207:
    # "The sound grew clearer: a group of people was coming down.{w} Once they went down the stairs, I slowly opened the door."
    "声音渐渐清晰：一群人正往下走。{w}等他们下了楼梯，我才慢慢推开门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060594_1_4cfa305a:
    # "I couldn't see anyone in hallway A."
    "A走廊里看不见任何人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060595_1_2137b560:
    # "They're not in hallway C either?"
    "C走廊也没有？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060596_1_b1b36f88:
    # "...any of the—{w} Can you he—"
    "……这些里面有没有——{w}你听得见——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060597_1_eced68d7:
    # "Akaro's voice came from hallway B. From the stairs, I didn't have a good angle to observe."
    "Akaro 的声音从 B走廊传来。我站在楼梯上，角度不好，看不真切。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060598_1_b937c4e3:
    # "I chose not to step down. If I was more patient, I would see them from afar without showing myself."
    "我决定不下去。再多等一会儿，我就能不露面，从远处看清他们。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060602_1_07d01724:
    # "the hell...! ...seriously burning!"
    "搞什么……！……烫得要命！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060603_1_ab3b6736:
    # "Wait, did Katei find a Sekimeiya in hallway B?"
    "等等，Katei 在 B走廊找到了一个 Sekimeiya？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060604_1_d66619c4:
    # "...it there?"
    "……它在那边？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060605_1_45734732:
    # "And that's me. My past self is with them this time.{w} ...Where the hell is Sai, though?"
    "那是我。这次和他们在一起的是过去的我。{w}……可 Sai 到底跑哪去了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060606_1_215360a2:
    # "I have no clue!"
    "我哪知道！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060607_1_a658326b:
    # "...either."
    "……我也一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060609_1_f24800bf:
    # "...eed to leave this—"
    "……得离开这里——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060610_1_f877e73f:
    # "They're walking away."
    "他们走开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060611_1_ad6c0973:
    # "The sound of their footsteps was fading, when all of a sudden, a sharp sound split the air."
    "脚步声渐渐远去，忽然，一声脆响划破了空气。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060612_1_dbed59d1:
    # "What was that...? It came from hallway B too."
    "那是什么声音……？也是从 B走廊传来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060620_1_b7371fda:
    # "I couldn't hear the others anymore. After waiting a bit behind the door, I stepped down cautiously."
    "其他人的声音已经听不见了。我在门后又等了一阵，才小心翼翼地下了楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060624_1_b10f8efc:
    # "It sounded like something fell to the floor..."
    "听上去像有什么东西掉在了地上……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060625_1_eaa9978e:
    # "It didn't seem like anyone was still there. After that sound, the crystal floor's characteristic silence had arisen."
    "似乎已经没人在了。那声响过后，水晶层特有的寂静又笼罩下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060629_1_ee3548c9:
    # "Keeping myself hidden, I peeked into hallway B.{w} Nobody was there, but I saw what had hit the floor next to the event room."
    "我藏起身形，朝 B走廊里张望。{w}那里空无一人，但我看见了掉在活动室旁地上的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060633_1_76a22f8c:
    # "Snowmelt"
    "融雪"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060642_1_82c84c40:
    # "It was a Sekimeiya."
    "那是一个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060643_1_75c0e1b2:
    # "...What just happened? Did they touch it, so it fell when they disappeared?"
    "……刚才到底怎么回事？是他们碰了它，消失时它才掉下来？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060644_1_1d725c03:
    # "That doesn't make sense, though..."
    "可这说不通啊……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060651_1_57306a1d:
    # "...They wouldn't necessarily have come back here. Especially since they could've traveled to the future."
    "……他们未必会回到这里。何况他们也可能穿越到了未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060652_1_77af0ac8:
    # "What was strange was its color. It was white, and if they'd touched it, it would've been gray."
    "奇怪的是它的颜色。它是白色的；要是他们碰过，就会变成灰色。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060654_1_def20c0d:
    # "Even though the Sekimeiya didn't work for me earlier, it could've been working now. It could also be another Sekimeiya."
    "虽然之前我碰它时它没反应，现在却可能正在运作。也可能这根本是另一个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060655_1_ea2b56a1:
    # "What was strange was its color. It was white, and if they'd touched it, it would've been gray."
    "奇怪的是它的颜色。它是白色的；要是他们碰过，就会变成灰色。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060657_1_d7259357:
    # "Its color... It's white.{w} If they had touched it, it would be gray."
    "颜色……是白的。{w}要是被他们碰过，就该是灰色了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060659_1_389c0c90:
    # "...Would it have teleported if they'd activated it? Not necessarily; it didn't when Sai and Shiroya traveled from the event room."
    "……如果他们启动了它，它会传送过去吗？未必；Sai 和 Shiroya 从活动室穿越时，它就没跟过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060660_1_04a92eac:
    # "What was strange was its color. It was white, and if they'd touched it, it would've been gray."
    "奇怪的是它的颜色。它是白色的；要是他们碰过，就会变成灰色。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060664_1_9a746f60:
    # "I approached it while scanning the area around me. Then, I felt it through my sleeve."
    "我一边留意四周，一边走近，然后隔着衣袖碰了碰它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060666_1_c8c0538e:
    # "Damn, it's super hot, just like Katei said. There's no way they activated it."
    "可恶，烫得厉害，和 Katei 说的一样。他们绝不可能启动过它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060667_1_3de606dd:
    # "They had to have been going to the event room, so I opened its door."
    "他们一定是往活动室去了，所以我打开了那扇门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060671_1_68387fde:
    # "When I did, I hit something on the other side."
    "门一开，我撞上了对面的什么东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060680_1_936f5841:
    # "It was another Sekimeiya. However, it was powered off."
    "又是一个 Sekimeiya。不过，它已经停用了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060681_1_bd14432e:
    # "Oh, what?"
    "哦？怎么回事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060682_1_df364fad:
    # "...What happened? They touched this one instead?{w} Hang on, is this the one I found in the cabinet? If it's not working now, that means it was previously working."
    "……怎么回事？他们碰的是这一个？{w}等等，这是我在展示柜里找到的那个吗？它现在失效，说明之前是能用的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060685_1_09e6d3eb:
    # "The empty cabinet was uncovered..."
    "空荡荡的展示柜露了出来……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060691_1_d1c2c800:
    # "I went to room A1."
    "我去了水晶展室 A1。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060696_1_06c39b9e:
    # "Inside the same cabinet from before, a third Sekimeiya rested."
    "先前那个展示柜里，静静躺着第三个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060697_1_1c597568:
    # "What the hell...? There are three of them?"
    "怎么回事……？居然有三个？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060700_1_74a646b5:
    # "I felt it through my sleeve as well. As I'd expected, it was cold."
    "我也隔着衣袖碰了碰。果然，是凉的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060701_1_4c1f75e8:
    # "So this one doesn't work?"
    "这么说，这个不能用？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060705_1_dc6195ac:
    # "Frowning, I went back to the event room. Two functional Sekimeiya were on the floor, close to each other."
    "我皱着眉回到活动室。地板上放着两个还能用的 Sekimeiya，彼此相距不远。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060706_1_d4c63fa7:
    # "...{w}Hm..."
    "……{w}嗯……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060707_1_a543dde1:
    # "A vague idea had formed in my head during the hours I'd been waiting."
    "等待的那几个小时里，脑中隐约浮起一个念头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060708_1_b98cbffc:
    # "Was I... right?"
    "我……猜对了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060709_1_64269109:
    # "Where was everyone? If they had traveled through time, where were they?"
    "其他人呢？如果他们真的穿越了时间，人又在哪里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060710_1_d3556f69:
    # "Wait, I have to see if I can find them. This is critical."
    "等等，我得设法找到他们。这是关键。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060714_1_e9e9d228:
    # "Focused on my thoughts, I walked through the crystal floor."
    "我满脑子想着事情，走过水晶展室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060721_1_d58096f4:
    # "Atsuki suspected that perhaps..."
    "Atsuki 猜想，或许……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060728_1_854304a3:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060729_1_e6e9ad35:
    # "Is nobody here? ...What about Sai? Did he disappear with everyone else?"
    "没人吗？……Sai 呢？他也跟其他人一起消失了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060733_1_80b71f31:
    # "I had to look above too, so I grabbed both functional Sekimeiya and went up the stairs."
    "楼上也得看看，于是我拿起两个还能用的 Sekimeiya，走上楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060738_1_243966ed:
    # "I reached the attic and saw that the door was open. However, the key wasn't in the keyhole."
    "到了阁楼，我发现门开着。可钥匙并不在锁孔里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060739_1_b87be634:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060744_1_4080e1ea:
    # "Recent footprints were in the living room, but I couldn't hear anyone moving around."
    "客厅里留着新鲜的脚印，却听不到有人走动的声响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060749_1_9b617b68:
    # "I looked in the kitchen, the bathroom, the storeroom, both bedrooms... They were all empty."
    "我找过厨房、浴室、储藏室，还有两间卧室……全都空无一人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060753_1_ff4d1ee1:
    # "I... don't think the people who were in hallway B are currently here."
    "我觉得……之前在B走廊的那些人，现在应该不在这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060757_1_132a4c62:
    # "I sat on the sofa. The Sekimeiya I'd seen weren't there anymore, likely because they were the same ones I was holding."
    "我在沙发上坐下。先前见过的那些 Sekimeiya 已经不见了，多半是因为它们就是我手上这两个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060762_1_a1830324:
    # "This world... it's clearly not the one I started in. Many things are happening differently."
    "这个世界……显然不是我最初所在的那个。很多事情的走向都不一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060763_1_f772556d:
    # "I thought that maybe the past changed at some point. This would've led into the countless deviations I've noticed.{w} ...But there's something about this world that I recognize."
    "我原以为，是过去在某个时刻被改变了。我察觉到的那些数不清的偏差，大概就由此而来。{w}……可这个世界里，有一点让我觉得熟悉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060764_1_3e76b992:
    # "And, if I'm really recognizing something from this world, there's no way it was created after the first time I visited it."
    "而且，如果那真是我认出的、属于这个世界的东西，那它绝不可能是在我第一次踏入这个世界之后才出现的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060767_1_7a3f4c90:
    # "What Atsuki recognized from this world was..."
    "Atsuki 在这个世界里认出的，是……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060775_1_6b4bad3b:
    # "Not the storeroom handle; he never saw it before his appearance in this world."
    "不是储藏室的门把手——他来到这个世界之前，从未见过它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060777_1_6332ea86:
    # "What I recognized from that world was Miiya's existence."
    "我从那个世界里认出的，是 Miiya 的存在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060778_1_4674f5ea:
    # "Even though I haven't been able to see her, what I heard was her voice. I can't doubt that.{w} When that happened, everyone was there. In other words, Miiya's existence wasn't something anyone found strange—not even my past self."
    "虽然我没能看见她，但我听到的是她的声音，这一点毋庸置疑。{w}那时所有人都在场。也就是说，Miiya 的存在对谁来说都不奇怪——包括过去的我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060779_1_b7d839d7:
    # "A while ago, Erina claimed she saw Miiya, but her reaction to that was appropriate. She said she didn't think Miiya had been in the tower before."
    "刚才 Erina 说看见了 Miiya，但她的反应很自然。她说她以为 Miiya 之前并不在这座塔里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060780_1_658f6ecf:
    # "However, the same thing didn't occur shortly after that."
    "可没过多久，同样的情形却不再出现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060787_1_1afb137b:
    # "Of course, I'm assuming Miiya's in on it as well."
    "当然，我猜 Miiya 也有份。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060788_1_9694e0ca:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060792_1_e0e85b06:
    # "Not gonna keep trying to clear your name? I suppose it'd be futile with how obvious it is that this is your doing."
    "不打算继续证明清白了？事情明摆着是你干的，再挣扎也是白费。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060793_1_42fdfeb0:
    # "...Okay, I'll ask. How do you know about Miiya?"
    "……好吧，我问一句。你怎么知道 Miiya 的事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060794_1_5fb64e03:
    # "What? She's been here—"
    "什么？她一直就在这里——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060795_1_04d86dfc:
    # "That's it, ignore him from now on. He can't get out of the corner he's backed himself into."
    "行了，从现在起别理他。他已经把自己逼进死角，出不来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060801_1_68e12f5d:
    # "Sai and Akaro acted as if Miiya's existence was normal.{w} And that's not all. Akaro disappeared after that point, and when he appeared with different clothes after {time=21}, he said he hadn't been present at the last time I'd seen him."
    "Sai 和 Akaro 的表现，就好像 Miiya 的存在理所当然。{w}不仅如此。那之后 Akaro 就消失了，过了 {time=21}，他换了身衣服出现，还说我最后一次见到他时，他并不在场。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060802_1_6fc56126:
    # "In addition, Sai's attitude at that time was different from how he behaved afterward."
    "还有，Sai 当时的态度和他后来的表现也不一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060803_1_a271ac09:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060804_1_d4a655c4:
    # "So, when did that happen? When did Miiya's existence become normal for the world?"
    "那么，那是什么时候的事？从什么时候起，Miiya 的存在对这个世界来说变得理所当然了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060811_1_9a773981:
    # "When that happened, he and Shiroya appeared in the attic. At that point, though, Miiya's existence wasn't yet normal."
    "那件事发生时，他和 Shiroya 出现在阁楼。不过在那个时候，Miiya 的存在还没有变得寻常。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060813_1_98e90530:
    # "When that happened, he appeared in the event room. At that point, though, Miiya's existence wasn't yet normal."
    "那件事发生时，他出现在活动室。但在那个时候，Miiya 的存在仍算不上寻常。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060816_1_4c2a58ac:
    # "Erina, Sai, Shiroya, and I were in the event room. At that point, everyone was surprised to hear Erina mention Miiya."
    "Erina、Sai、Shiroya 和我当时都在活动室。听到 Erina 提起 Miiya，所有人都吃了一惊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060817_1_94c8186a:
    # "When Erina touched the Sekimeiya, that changed. Both Sai and Akaro, who came from outside the room, found Miiya's existence to be an expected thing."
    "Erina 碰到 Sekimeiya 之后，情况就变了。从房间外进来的 Sai 和 Akaro，对 Miiya 的存在毫不意外。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060818_1_3585ce45:
    # "Once again, that's not all. There was another major change."
    "而且还不止这些。还有一处重大的变化。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060824_1_a7a1a7ea:
    # "It was Shiroya's existence. Sai and Akaro were shocked when they saw her, and perfectly in line with that, I haven't seen her here."
    "那就是 Shiroya 的存在。Sai 和 Akaro 见到她时都愣住了，而我在这里也确实没见过她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060825_1_d27fa8b8:
    # "...When Erina touched the Sekimeiya, something major occurred. I'm sure of that. The Sekimeiya had some hidden effect all this time."
    "……Erina 碰到 Sekimeiya 的那一刻，发生了某种重大的事。这一点可以肯定。那个 Sekimeiya 一直以来都潜藏着某种效果。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060826_1_e77af576:
    # "That effect occurred when Erina touched it. That was definitely the strangest travel of them all."
    "那效果就在 Erina 触碰它时发动了。那无疑是所有穿越中最离奇的一次。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060827_1_b03bc006:
    # "Three major questions arose: why did Erina, Shiroya, and I not travel, but Sai did?{w} Why did the Sekimeiya teleport instantly back to its cabinet?{w} Why was the range bigger than it should've been?"
    "三个疑问随之浮现：为什么 Erina、Shiroya 和我没有穿越，Sai 却穿越了？{w}为什么 Sekimeiya 会瞬间传送回展示柜？{w}为什么范围比应有的更大？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060828_1_2ab88240:
    # "Now I'm aware of a factor that I didn't consider at the time, which could be the answer to what happened."
    "如今我意识到一个当时未曾考虑的因素，或许它正是那件事的答案。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060836_1_55dd23ba:
    # "I don't believe Miiya's existence is the answer to those questions."
    "我不认为 Miiya 的存在能解答那些疑问。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060837_1_4a0c3846:
    # "It must be the second Sekimeiya."
    "一定是第二个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060839_1_3e59cf28:
    # "I don't believe traveling to the future is the answer to those questions."
    "我不认为前往未来能解答那些疑问。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060840_1_71c4612b:
    # "It must be the second Sekimeiya."
    "一定是第二个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060842_1_af59fffd:
    # "The second Sekimeiya..."
    "第二个 Sekimeiya……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060843_1_b1e35c61:
    # "Before Erina touched the Sekimeiya, when we entered the event room, Shiroya and I were confused to see the Sekimeiya in the cabinet.{w} In my case, it was because I'd recently hidden it.{w} ...Specifically, in a locker in the staff room."
    "Erina 触碰 Sekimeiya 之前，我们走进活动室时，Shiroya 和我看到展示柜里的 Sekimeiya，都感到困惑。{w} 我之所以困惑，是因为我不久前才把它藏起来。{w}……准确地说，是藏进了员工室的一个储物柜里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060844_1_c180a5e3:
    # "When I saw it in the cabinet, I thought it must've teleported to its \"original place\", or where the cold temperature was.{w} The reality was..."
    "看到它出现在展示柜里时，我以为它一定是传送回了“原本的位置”，也就是温度较低的地方。{w} 可事实却是……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060851_1_c270d784:
    # "That's not it."
    "不是这样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060852_1_e6c44ff0:
    # "...I don't think it was the same Sekimeiya. However, the one I hid in the staff room was working, and the one in the cabinet, which Erina touched, was working as well."
    "……我觉得那不是同一个 Sekimeiya。可是，我藏在员工室的那个仍在运作，展示柜里 Erina 碰过的那个也同样在运作。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060853_1_df236853:
    # "So, I think that what I believe to be the main key to most of those questions is..."
    "所以我想，那些疑问的关键，多半就在……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060860_1_d168e52c:
    # "Erina touched the Sekimeiya, but that shouldn't matter."
    "Erina 碰过 Sekimeiya，但这一点应该无关紧要。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060861_1_f6df4554:
    # "The answer might be the location of both Sekimeiya."
    "答案或许在于两个 Sekimeiya 所在的位置。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060863_1_a7bf4bba:
    # "I'm not sure the Sekimeiya that was activated was the reason."
    "我不确定被启动的那个 Sekimeiya 是不是原因。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060864_1_d32554cd:
    # "The answer might be the location of both Sekimeiya."
    "答案或许在于两个 Sekimeiya 所在的位置。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060866_1_f1c544a2:
    # "The location of the Sekimeiya... One was near the cabinet, and the other was in a locker."
    "Sekimeiya 的位置……一个在展示柜附近，另一个在储物柜里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060868_1_6c4e4e40:
    # "How many people were in range? ...Actually, I don't think that has any relevance after all."
    "当时有多少人在范围内？……不，仔细想来，那应该无关紧要。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060869_1_f142a7a2:
    # "The answer might be the position of both Sekimeiya."
    "答案或许在于两个 Sekimeiya 所在的位置。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060870_1_b23f93b4:
    # "The one in the event room spent fifteen minutes outside the cabinet. Meanwhile, as I had touched the one in the staff room at around {time=18:30}, it should've gathered power there for almost half an hour."
    "活动室里的那个在展示柜外待了十五分钟。而我大约在 {time=18:30} 碰过员工室里的那个，所以它应该已经在那里蓄能将近半小时了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060878_1_5efffb2a:
    # "The range of the Sekimeiya Erina touched probably looked like this.{w} However, the hidden factor that I didn't account for..."
    "Erina 碰过的那个 Sekimeiya，范围大概是这样。{w} 然而，还有一个我当时没考虑到的隐藏因素……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060883_1_58bd8a82:
    # "...Was the Sekimeiya in the staff room.{w} It was in the rightmost set of lockers, and given the time it had been there, I imagine its range extended halfway through the event room."
    "……就是员工室里的那个 Sekimeiya。{w} 它在最右侧的那排储物柜里；按它在那儿放的时间来算，它的范围应该已经覆盖到活动室的一半了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060887_1_f690f091:
    # "...{w}If this is what was special about that travel, then what happened to us?{w} Sai did travel because he was only within range of Erina's Sekimeiya. However, the rest of us didn't teleport through space or time."
    "……{w}如果那次穿越的特殊之处就在这，那我们又经历了什么？{w} Sai 确实穿越了，因为他只在 Erina 那个 Sekimeiya 的范围内。可我们其余人并没有在空间或时间上传送。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060897_1_0e34a1c4:
    # "Instead, what changed was the world around us.{w} The Sekimeiya didn't teleport back to the cabinet—that was a mere illusion."
    "真正改变的，是我们周围的世界。{w} Sekimeiya 并没有传送回展示柜——那不过是错觉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060902_1_c694e05a:
    # "Then, I quickly went to check the locker and found out the Sekimeiya I'd hidden there was gone. That only contributed to the same illusion."
    "随后我急忙去查看储物柜，发现藏在那里的 Sekimeiya 不见了。而这也只是加深了同一个错觉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060903_1_ddca5450:
    # "I might be mistaken somewhere, but I don't think that was still the same world.{w} However, what happened later? We did reunite with the Sai who'd traveled in the event room, didn't we?{w} Similarly, Akaro and the other Sai weren't found again. It was as if we'd gone back to our world."
    "也许我在某处弄错了，但我觉得那已经不是同一个世界。{w} 可是后来呢？我们确实和那位在活动室里穿越的 Sai 重逢了，不是吗？{w} 而 Akaro 和另一个 Sai 也再没被找到。就好像我们回到了自己的世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060904_1_9914700a:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060910_1_e3d3558c:
    # "I wonder... Does that hypothesis solve every mystery surrounding that travel?{w} What about the range? It was bigger than previous fifteen-minute travels, wasn't it?{w} ...Two functional Sekimeiya existed.{w} If their ranges overlapped, the Sekimeiya's effect wouldn't just be time travel.{w} I think that could be right. It's not an idea that can only be applied in that instance."
    "我在想……那个假设能解开围绕那次穿越的所有谜团吗？{w} 范围又该怎么解释？它比以往十五分钟的穿越更大，不是吗？{w}……当时有两个能运作的 Sekimeiya。{w} 如果它们的范围发生重叠，Sekimeiya 的效果就不只是时间穿越了。{w} 我觉得这有可能。这个想法不只适用于那一次。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060911_1_2c35feba:
    # "Where is everyone? The Sekimeiya was just activated when both of them were close to each other on the crystal floor, and it doesn't seem like the others are still in this tower.{w} How did I get to this world? Could it really be the same one we briefly visited?{w} This morning, Shiroya and I witnessed the Sekimeiya teleport. But that isn't what's been going on—the Sekimeiya isn't teleporting. It only appears that way because the entire world is changing."
    "大家都去哪了？两个 Sekimeiya 在水晶层上彼此靠近时，其中一个刚被启动，而其他人似乎已经不在这座塔里了。{w} 我是怎么来到这个世界的？难道这真的是我们短暂造访过的那个世界？{w} 今天早晨，Shiroya 和我亲眼看见 Sekimeiya 传送。可事情并不是这样——Sekimeiya 并没有在传送。它看起来是这样，只是因为整个世界都在改变。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060914_1_deddce55:
    # "When it happened, we found the Sekimeiya inside a cabinet in room B4. It's very possible the other one was hidden nearby.{w} That's why Naomi was running to the attic with both Sekimeiya immediately after it disappeared.{w} We chased her up, but in the attic's staircase, Shiroya disappeared.{w} When I looked at the living room, both Sekimeiya were next to each other, and one of them was gray. As a result, neither Naomi nor Shiroya are here."
    "那件事发生时，我们在 B4房间的展示柜里发现了 Sekimeiya。另一个很可能就藏在附近。{w} 所以它一消失，Naomi 就带着两个 Sekimeiya 跑向阁楼。{w} 我们追了上去，可就在阁楼的楼梯上，Shiroya 消失了。{w} 我看向客厅时，两个 Sekimeiya 并排放在一起，其中一个已经变成灰色。结果，Naomi 和 Shiroya 都不在这里了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060915_1_c25e679a:
    # "Lastly, though... this would answer the question of how Naomi's corpse appeared two times.{w} If Naomi touched the Sekimeiya and the world around her changed, she would've appeared in the attic. Her keys had been left behind, so she had no way to leave.{w} That's what happened. That's what we saw on the floor of the living room. That's why we found Naomi dead twice.{w} The Naomi that Shiroya disappeared with was one of the two bodies that we found dead. ...Does this mean that version of Shiroya was there since the beginning?"
    "最后……这也能解释 Naomi 的尸体为何会出现两次。{w} 如果 Naomi 触碰了 Sekimeiya，周围的世界随之改变，她就会出现在阁楼里。她的钥匙被留在了原地，所以她没法离开。{w} 事情就是这样。那就是我们在客厅地板上看到的情景。也正因如此，我们才会两次发现 Naomi 死去。{w} 和 Shiroya 一起消失的那个 Naomi，就是我们发现的两具尸体之一。……这是否意味着，那个 Shiroya 从一开始就在那里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060922_1_4c0154e8:
    # "\"The Naomi that Shiroya disappeared with was one of the two bodies that we found dead.\""
    "“和 Shiroya 一起消失的那个 Naomi，就是我们发现的两具尸体之一。”"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060923_1_f0c69c7b:
    # "That is..."
    "那就是……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060931_1_d5377e59:
    # "Unfortunately, it is not correct. While it's understandable for Atsuki to have made that mistake, I thought perhaps you had realized the flaw."
    "很遗憾，这不对。Atsuki 犯这个错情有可原，不过我原以为你已经看出破绽了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060933_1_c63ecb6e:
    # "Indeed, it is incorrect. While it's understandable for Atsuki to have made that mistake, I figured you would've realized the flaw."
    "确实不对。Atsuki 会犯这个错可以理解，但我本以为你已经看出破绽了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060937_1_86dfd4dd:
    # "...So, if I activate the Sekimeiya right now, will I go back to the other world?"
    "……那么，如果我现在启动 Sekimeiya，我会回到另一个世界吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060938_1_3b3df8e1:
    # "When Shiroya disappeared, she wasn't in the living room yet, meaning that she didn't leave any footprints..."
    "Shiroya 消失时，她还没有进客厅，也就是说她没有留下任何脚印……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060939_1_5fc68a84:
    # "I wondered earlier how I'd be here for twelve hours without being found when the searches we executed would've found me. Of course, in this world, this doesn't apply. Everyone is gone."
    "我之前还在想，既然我们展开的搜索应该能找到我，我怎么可能在这里待了十二个小时还没被发现。当然，在这个世界里，这并不适用。所有人都不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060940_1_856fc718:
    # "Where are they, though? Am I really correct in what I'm thinking?{w} Everyone who was in hallway B is no longer in this world. If that is the case, are they in the world I came from?"
    "可是，他们去哪了？我的想法真的正确吗？{w} 原本在B走廊的所有人都不在这个世界了。如果是这样，他们是在我来的那个世界吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060941_1_8c2ffcc5:
    # "Is that possible? ...It might be, but it doesn't feel right. After all, if this is the world where I was when Erina touched the Sekimeiya, Sai and Akaro must eventually come back."
    "有这种可能吗？……也许有，可总觉得不对。毕竟，如果这里就是 Erina 触碰 Sekimeiya 时我所在的世界，那么 Sai 和 Akaro 终究会回来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060944_1_1341ef54:
    # "It was a speculative mess, especially because I couldn't prove anything. However, the fundamental basis that I was working with seemed correct."
    "那只是一团乱糟糟的推测，何况我什么都证明不了。不过，我所依据的基本前提似乎没错。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060945_1_2a557c20:
    # "What exactly were the body double mysteries? I can't understand Shiroya's case at all, and I'm not sure about Sai's.{w} Isla's, though... Could her \"friend\" have been the Isla from this world?"
    "那些替身之谜究竟是怎么回事？Shiroya 的情况我完全想不通，Sai 的我也说不准。{w} 但 Isla 的……她那位“朋友”会不会就是这个世界的 Isla？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060946_1_d89ca522:
    # "\"From this world\"... I don't know what the hell to think, and that's mostly due to the most blatant example: the second Akaro.{w} The Akaro who had different memories and disappeared from the bedroom. Did he come from a different world in the way that I'm thinking?{w} If so, he couldn't have been the Akaro from this world because he didn't know who Katei was, but he did know Shiroya."
    "“来自这个世界”……我根本不知道该怎么想，而最明显的例子就是第二个 Akaro。{w} 那个记忆和我们不同、从卧室里消失的 Akaro。他会不会就像我想的那样，来自另一个世界？{w} 若是如此，他就不可能是这个世界的 Akaro，因为他不认识 Katei，却认识 Shiroya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060951_1_1fbb35ff:
    # "Now, what have you been thinking all this time? Do you have your own answers?"
    "那么，你一直以来都在想些什么？你自己有答案了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060952_1_5cb49655:
    # "First off, what is the explanation behind that Akaro?"
    "首先，那个 Akaro 究竟该怎么解释？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060960_1_869b37be:
    # "Correct.{w} A world beyond Atsuki's knowledge."
    "正确。{w} 那是 Atsuki 认知之外的世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060962_1_8b2e1973:
    # "That's not it."
    "不是这样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060963_1_549cd983:
    # "The explanation is a world beyond Atsuki's knowledge."
    "答案在于 Atsuki 认知之外的世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060964_1_a216d6c1:
    # "So, where did that Akaro come from?{w} Could he have come from a world without Katei?{w} If that's it, though, this is too fucking confusing! Could changing worlds bring me to any kind of world? There could be infinite worlds, and the Sekimeiya could act as random bridges between them!"
    "那么，那个 Akaro 是从哪来的？{w} 他会不会来自一个没有 Katei 的世界？{w} 可要真是这样，这也太他妈让人糊涂了！世界切换会把我带到任何一种世界吗？世界也许有无数个，而 Sekimeiya 可能在它们之间随机架起桥梁！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060966_1_7b87d464:
    # "Now, tell him. Although he can't hear you, tell him why he's wrong."
    "现在，告诉他。就算他听不见，也要告诉他错在哪里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060975_1_1460e8d4:
    # "Yes. Only three different worlds exist."
    "没错。不同的世界只有三个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060976_1_b447e4b2:
    # "How did you know that, though? How could you be sure of such a powerful assertion?"
    "不过，你是怎么知道的？这么笃定的结论，你怎么能确定？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060978_1_bde90c13:
    # "No. The answer is three."
    "不。答案是三。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060979_1_eb60c51c:
    # "Now that you know, perhaps you have an idea of how you could've asserted that fact."
    "既然你已经知道了，或许也能想到自己本来可以怎么断定这一点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060990_1_3df9ead1:
    # "...Why is it proven that there are not infinite worlds? Why can't a fourth one exist?"
    "……凭什么说世界不是无限的？为什么不能存在第四个？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060991_1_0cd29e1e:
    # "Because the three worlds loop. Congratulations."
    "因为三个世界构成了循环。恭喜。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060992_1_dda63690:
    # "That is the essential core of the universe you've witnessed. Through the Sekimeiya, the link between three worlds looped. The three sides of the mountain spun around, leading to a single peak."
    "这就是你所见证的宇宙的核心本质。借助 Sekimeiya，三个世界之间的联结形成了循环。山的三个侧面旋转交汇，最终归于同一座峰顶。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060994_1_265d87b2:
    # "...Why is it proven that there are not infinite worlds? Why can't a fourth one exist?"
    "……凭什么说世界不是无限的？为什么不能存在第四个？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060995_1_b2342b80:
    # "It is because the three worlds loop. That is the essential core of the universe you've witnessed.{w} Through the Sekimeiya, the link between three worlds looped. The three sides of the mountain spun around, leading to a single peak."
    "因为三个世界构成了循环。这就是你所见证的宇宙的核心本质。{w} 借助 Sekimeiya，三个世界之间的联结形成了循环。山的三个侧面旋转交汇，最终归于同一座峰顶。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L060998_1_3ccc716c:
    # "But that doesn't answer all the questions, does it? Why only three worlds?"
    "但这并不能解答所有疑问，不是吗？为什么偏偏只有三个世界？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061000_1_304e371c:
    # "Atsuki correctly figured out the Sekimeiya's core secret.{w} In each world, two Sekimeiya existed. When one was activated, the active range sent anyone encompassed in it through time.{w} However, if both ranges overlapped, whoever found themselves present within both were not transported through time and space, but through worlds."
    "Atsuki 准确解开了 Sekimeiya 的核心秘密。{w} 每个世界里都存在两个 Sekimeiya。激活其中一个时，生效范围会将范围内的人送往另一段时间。{w} 然而，若两个范围发生重叠，同时处在两者之中的人便不会被送往另一个时间，而是会被送往另一个世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061001_1_dd6f95ee:
    # "This effect is called a world switch, although the full extent of the name might not make a lot of sense to you yet.{w} Like everything about the Sekimeiya, the world switch hid many secrets of its own. Of course, you may have figured some of them out with the tools you were given."
    "这种现象被称为世界切换，不过这个名称的全部含义，你现在或许还无法完全理解。{w} 如同 Sekimeiya 的一切，世界切换本身也藏着许多秘密。当然，凭借手中的工具，你可能已经解开了其中一些。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061009_1_1e269431:
    # "There is one world in which only Atsuki is found alive in the tower. He is suspected of having been behind multiple crimes, but his life is suddenly cut short as he looks through a window."
    "有一个世界里，塔中唯一被找到的活人是 Atsuki。他虽被怀疑是数起案件的主谋，却就在望向窗外时突然丧命。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061010_1_a0865a14:
    # "That world will be called \"A\"."
    "那个世界就称为“A”。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061014_1_f5b39538:
    # "If that world is \"A\", then the world in which everyone survived and left the tower..."
    "如果那个世界是“A”，那么那个所有人都幸存下来、离开塔的世界……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061020_1_8ed8a0d9:
    # "No. That world is \"C\"."
    "不。那个世界是“C”。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061023_1_a1614cfd:
    # "\"B\" is the world in which the recorder was present. At {time=21}, Atsuki, Sai, and Erina weren't able to escape."
    "“B”是录音笔所在的世界。到了 {time=21}，Atsuki、Sai 和 Erina 没能逃出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061025_1_61952242:
    # "Exactly. It is \"C\"."
    "没错，就是“C”。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061028_1_b831c85e:
    # "Then, \"B\" is the world in which the recorder was present. At {time=21}, Atsuki, Sai, and Erina weren't able to escape."
    "那么，“B”就是录音笔所在的世界。到了 {time=21}，Atsuki、Sai 和 Erina 没能逃出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061032_1_0d0fe032:
    # "By world switching from world A, people were brought to..."
    "从 A世界切换之后，众人被带到了……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061038_1_5af98aeb:
    # "Yes. This is the way the worlds looped."
    "对。世界就是这样循环起来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061040_1_afa7a4bc:
    # "Incorrect. The answer is \"B\"."
    "不对，答案是“B”。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061041_1_bae742e5:
    # "You've seen a few instances of full loops. Miiya's group went from their own world, C, to world A. From world A they went to world B, and then from world B they went back to world C.{w} Shiroya, after traveling from January 5th to December 15th, went from world B to world C with Atsuki. In the attic, she went from world C to world A with Naomi, and she finally returned alone to world B. The order is A - B - C - A."
    "你已经见过几次完整的循环。Miiya 一行人从自己所在的 C世界前往 A世界。接着从 A世界到 B世界，再从 B世界回到 C世界。{w} Shiroya 从1月5日穿越到12月15日后，与 Atsuki 一同从 B世界来到 C世界。在阁楼里，她又和 Naomi 从 C世界到了 A世界，最后独自返回 B世界。顺序是 A - B - C - A。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061042_1_13881884:
    # "Worlds A and C were drastically different, as the worlds followed an intrinsic progression with each other. However, as strange as it might seem, there was only a single degree of separation between C and A."
    "A世界与 C世界差别极大，因为各世界之间是按内在顺序递进的。然而说来奇怪，C 与 A 之间却只隔了一步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061051_1_b5de01f8:
    # "There is, isn't there? I'm sure you can find instances that didn't follow that order—all of which had something in common."
    "确实有，不是吗？我相信你能找到一些不按这个顺序发生的例子——它们都有共同点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061053_1_1116cb83:
    # "You don't think so? Can you not find any instances that didn't follow that order?{w} They do exist. If you find them, perhaps you'll notice what they had in common."
    "你不这么认为？难道找不到不按这个顺序发生的例子吗？{w} 那样的例子确实存在。只要找出来，或许你就会注意到它们的共同点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061057_1_06febf4a:
    # "The incident at the tower happened in all three worlds, but the outcome was vastly different.{w} Why?"
    "塔中的事件在三个世界里都发生过，结果却大相径庭。{w} 为什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061058_1_6281151d:
    # "The major difference in world A..."
    "A世界最大的不同在于……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061064_1_6ba1d89a:
    # "In world A, many people died. The major difference from the beginning was Katei's absence."
    "在 A世界，许多人丧命。从一开始，最大的不同就是 Katei 不在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061066_1_2f7ffe0d:
    # "The major difference from the beginning was Katei's absence."
    "从一开始，最大的不同就是 Katei 不在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061068_1_5a885c9a:
    # "In world A, only one Naomi was found. The major difference from the beginning was Katei's absence."
    "在 A世界，只找到了一个 Naomi。从一开始，最大的不同就是 Katei 不在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061071_1_4f113769:
    # "Katei put his plan into action: he put both real Sekimeiya in the suitcase he had prepared and moved to the secret door in the storeroom."
    "Katei 开始执行他的计划：他把两个真正的 Sekimeiya 装进准备好的手提箱，然后来到储藏室的暗门前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061072_1_eba6fd87:
    # "He felt the handle, but he quickly realized he had dropped the key in the hallway."
    "他摸到门把手，却很快意识到钥匙掉在了走廊里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061075_1_3c36689f:
    # "While he was searching for it, Naomi found the suitcase and took it."
    "就在他寻找钥匙时，Naomi 发现了手提箱，把它拿走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061078_1_3e1f5a9d:
    # "Then, when Katei found the key, he attempted to unlock the secret door."
    "随后，Katei 找到钥匙，试图打开暗门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061082_1_ff1ff410:
    # "And he did. He was able to leave."
    "他成功了，顺利离开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061087_1_1b3002a5:
    # "But he didn't step out. He saw the Sekimeiya had been taken before hearing Naomi's movements. His plan had been very close to succeeding, so he panicked."
    "但他没有迈出去。他甚至还没听到 Naomi 的动静，就发现 Sekimeiya 已经被人拿走了。计划本来只差一点就能成功，他因此慌了神。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061090_1_588f312f:
    # "He ran behind her desperately, but Naomi had a safe place: the attic."
    "他拼命追在她身后，但 Naomi 有一个安全的去处：阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061093_1_1b4a0f52:
    # "He chased her up, but he recognized that going all the way was a mistake. He could never enter the final floor."
    "他一路追上去，却意识到一直追到顶是个错误。他根本进不了最顶层。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061094_1_c8a1976b:
    # "He tripped in the staircase leading to the fourth floor and distractedly walked back without realizing he'd dropped yet another key."
    "他在通往四楼的楼梯上绊了一跤，心神恍惚地往回走，浑然不觉自己又掉了一把钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061102_1_585fba4b:
    # "The security room's."
    "监控室的钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061104_1_86ba97f1:
    # "That isn't right. Katei didn't have that key.{w} He dropped the security room's."
    "不对。Katei 没有那把钥匙。{w} 他掉的是监控室的钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061106_1_178019d6:
    # "That isn't right. He dropped the security room's."
    "不对。他掉的是监控室的钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061107_1_9aeb13b2:
    # "You remember that Atsuki found it there, but that didn't happen in world A, did it? That was in world C.{w} You might know who found the key in world A. It was Akaro. Although many things were different, Atsuki only came across it in world C because Katei had been staring at the floor, and he wasn't there in world A."
    "你记得 Atsuki 是在那里发现钥匙的，但这件事并没有发生在 A 世界，对吧？那是在 C 世界。{w} 你也许知道 A 世界里是谁发现了钥匙：Akaro。虽然许多事情都不一样，但 Atsuki 在 C 世界之所以会偶然发现那把钥匙，是因为 Katei 当时一直盯着地板看；而在 A 世界里，Katei 并不在场。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061109_1_12271a87:
    # "His mind threatening to collapse in on itself, Katei realized his only option was to escape from the building as quickly as possible."
    "Katei 的精神几乎要崩溃，他明白自己只有一条路：尽快逃出这栋建筑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061113_1_80f7e9e2:
    # "He left through the storeroom before the others woke up. Outside, he was fast enough to meet up with everyone else who'd evacuated. He knew the floor 2 cameras had recorded him, but he was confident he could take care of that at {time=21.}"
    "其他人醒来之前，他从储藏室离开了。到了外面，他跑得够快，追上了其他已经疏散出来的人。他知道二楼的监控拍到了自己，但有把握在 {time=21.} 处理好。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061118_1_2d162553:
    # "Meanwhile, in world C, everything happened similarly. However, when Katei attempted to unlock the storeroom door, he couldn't. Something prevented him from doing so.{w} Like in world A, he heard Naomi's movements and chased her up, dropping the key in the same staircase."
    "与此同时，C 世界里的一切也大致相同。然而，Katei 试图打开储藏室的门时却没能成功。有什么东西阻碍了他。{w} 就像在 A 世界一样，他听见 Naomi 的动静后追了上去，又在那段楼梯上掉了钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061121_1_3fc93841:
    # "...So, what about world B? What happened to the security room key in that world?"
    "……那么 B 世界呢？监控室的钥匙在那个世界怎么样了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061126_1_61290c20:
    # "The truth is that Katei didn't drop it."
    "其实，Katei 并没有丢掉那把钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061127_1_d3983982:
    # "How is that possible? Why did that differ between worlds?"
    "怎么可能？为什么不同世界会有这种差异？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061128_1_ec0a94b3:
    # "The answer is tied to something else that only occurred in B."
    "答案与另一件只在 B 世界发生的事有关。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061134_1_c600eb99:
    # "...It was the handle's removal.{w} In world B, Katei went to the secret door, ready to leave. However, he immediately felt it with his hand: the handle wasn't there."
    "……问题出在门把手上。{w} 在 B 世界，Katei 来到暗门前，准备离开。然而他伸手一摸，立刻察觉：门把手不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061135_1_9e1213bf:
    # "He couldn't believe it—he had been outsmarted. Speechless, he froze in place."
    "他不敢相信——自己竟被人抢先一步。他一句话也说不出，僵在原地。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061136_1_63394576:
    # "Of course, as the keyhole had been in the handle, he couldn't even attempt to unlock the door. That is why he didn't notice that he'd dropped the rusty key in hallway A, and it's why Naomi didn't have the chance to take his suitcase."
    "钥匙孔本就开在把手上，他连试着开锁都做不到。也正因如此，他没察觉自己把生锈的钥匙掉在了 A走廊；也正因如此，Naomi 才没机会拿走他的手提箱。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061139_1_a02a3563:
    # "He understood that he would have to stay in the tower, but he didn't immediately give up. Xyn's Sekimeiya was still in the event room, and perhaps he could make use of it.{w} Katei sighed deeply, trying to figure out who could've known about the storeroom's secret."
    "他明白自己只能留在塔里，却没有就此放弃。Xyn 的 Sekimeiya 还在活动室，或许还能派上用场。{w}Katei 深深叹了口气，思索着究竟有谁会知道储藏室的秘密。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061142_1_5eb4c37f:
    # "Before anyone could see him, he went to a crystal room in hallway B; he had been told that refrigeration was essential to keep the Sekimeiya stable."
    "趁没人看见，他去了 B走廊的一间水晶展室；他听说过，要让 Sekimeiya 保持稳定，冷藏必不可少。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061143_1_5d228e15:
    # "He had independently learned that Ashiya had two identical Sekimeiya, but it wasn't public knowledge. Hence, abusing Xyn's plan still seemed feasible: he could keep a Sekimeiya for himself as long as Ashiya found Xyn's fake in the cabinet. That was why he left each Sekimeiya inside different cabinets in room B4."
    "他私下打听到，芦屋手上有两个一模一样的 Sekimeiya，但这件事并未公开。因此，他觉得仍可把 Xyn 的计划反过来利用：只要芦屋在展示柜里找到 Xyn 的赝品，他就能私吞一个 Sekimeiya。正因如此，他把两个 Sekimeiya 分别放进了水晶展室 B4 的两个展示柜。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061147_1_ddf51cc5:
    # "He came to the conclusion that it was a good idea to let the suitcase be found. As he disposed of it, he heard a sound coming from the crystal room he'd just been in."
    "他断定，让人发现那只手提箱反倒有利。就在他处理手提箱时，听见自己刚离开的水晶展室传来声响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061150_1_e08183c8:
    # "He ran there and saw one of the Sekimeiya on the floor: Atsuki and Shiroya had just world switched to world C."
    "他跑回去，看见其中一个 Sekimeiya 落在地上：Atsuki 和 Shiroya 刚刚切换到了 C 世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061151_1_ffbc8abf:
    # "He couldn't comprehend it. The Sekimeiya was gray, but nobody was there. Nobody could've escaped after he'd heard the sound."
    "他无法理解。那是个灰色 Sekimeiya，可现场空无一人。他听到声音之后，不可能有人已经逃掉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061154_1_2fe83d6d:
    # "Yet, one of the cabinets was open...{w} It was impossible anyone had been there, and the cabinet's temperature hadn't even cooled off yet. He hurriedly put the Sekimeiya back in, still trying to process what could've happened."
    "然而，有一个展示柜敞开着……{w}刚才不可能有人在那里，柜里的温度甚至还没降下来。他匆匆把 Sekimeiya 放回去，脑中仍在琢磨究竟发生了什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061157_1_85fd4b9b:
    # "When he left the room, he saw Erina's group on the floor of the hallway. She was moving slightly, so Katei felt trapped. He didn't want her to wake up and see him leaving.{w} Slowly, he walked over and crouched beside the three incapacitated people."
    "他走出展室，看见 Erina 一行人倒在走廊的地上。她微微动着，Katei 顿时觉得自己被困住了。他不愿她醒来时撞见自己离开。{w}他缓缓走过去，在那三个失去意识的人身旁蹲下。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061163_1_d0072688:
    # "So, doesn't this beg the same question? Why was the handle taken off in B?"
    "那么，这不就引出同一个问题了吗？B世界的门把手为什么会被卸下来？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061164_1_a92e50a5:
    # "To begin with, who do you think was responsible for that?"
    "那么首先，你觉得是谁干的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061172_1_4638062b:
    # "Yes. It was Akaro A."
    "没错。是 Akaro A 干的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061174_1_0bea561c:
    # "That's not right.{w} The person who removed the secret door's handle in world B was Akaro A."
    "不对。{w}在B世界卸下暗门把手的人，是 Akaro A。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061176_1_c23dfe57:
    # "He was the main person behind the attack. In his world, however, Xyn were outsmarted.{w} The alarm Xyn didn't know about went off, and the Sekimeiya Akaro had hidden in the cleaning cart was taken."
    "他是这次袭击的主谋。然而在他的世界里，Xyn 却反遭算计。{w}Xyn 并不知道的警报响了，Akaro 藏在清洁车里的 Sekimeiya 也被人拿走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061179_1_5723bf29:
    # "Who had been responsible? For a while, Akaro had no idea."
    "那究竟是谁干的？有一阵子，Akaro 毫无头绪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061182_1_bc487587:
    # "However, eventually, he world switched to B with Isla."
    "不过，他最终还是和 Isla 一起世界切换到了B世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061193_1_29e111f1:
    # "In that world, he was surprised to find out the attic was unlocked, and even more so to see that everyone was taking shelter inside a bedroom.{w} There, he learned about two things: Katei's presence in the tower and the existence of the storeroom's secret.{w} Naturally, he knew who Katei Kuiji was, but he shouldn't have been there. Akaro had suspected someone from Ashiya had hindered their plan, so he was internally taken aback when he heard details about that world's events."
    "在那个世界，他惊讶地发现阁楼没有上锁，更惊讶的是所有人都在一间卧室里避难。{w}在那里，他得知了两件事：Katei 就在塔里，以及储藏室藏有一道暗门。{w}他自然知道 Katei Kuiji 是什么人，但那人本不该出现在那里。Akaro 一直怀疑是芦屋的人妨碍了他们的计划，所以听到那个世界里那场事件的细节时，他心里暗暗一惊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061203_1_9212cfac:
    # "Soon, that Akaro traveled to the past and appeared on the 24th of November. You remember what Shiroya thought, don't you?"
    "不久之后，那个 Akaro 穿越到过去，出现在了11月24日。你还记得 Shiroya 当时是怎么想的吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061204_1_ef5a32c7:
    # "Out of nowhere, he appeared in a detention cell, but he was able to leave it. Then, he realized he was in the far past.{w} He recalled the times Katei had chosen to speak to Ido: he must've been who had interfered with Xyn's plan."
    "他毫无征兆地出现在一间拘留室里，却顺利离开了。随后他意识到，自己身处遥远的过去。{w}他回想起 Katei 几次主动找 Ido 说话的情形：干扰 Xyn 计划的人，一定就是他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061207_1_ccff7434:
    # "Katei hadn't been in the tower, yet everyone had eventually claimed he'd been there since the start. It wasn't hard to suspect the truth.{w} However, Akaro still couldn't believe what he'd done. In the tower, desperate to fulfill Xyn's plan..."
    "Katei 本不在塔里，可到头来所有人都说他从一开始就在。要猜到真相并不难。{w}然而，Akaro 仍不敢相信自己做了什么。在塔里，他为了完成 Xyn 的计划不惜一切……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061208_1_5f229876:
    # "How had Shiroya come back to life? ...And she had clearly been aware of what he'd done.{w} Why had she not said anything, then? Akaro had no idea why she had come back, but he had been next to her and Atsuki for hours; he'd seen how they'd turned out after he'd caused the death of their friend."
    "Shiroya 是怎么死而复生的？……而且她显然知道他做过什么。{w}那她为什么一句都没说？Akaro 完全不明白她为何会回来，但他曾在 Shiroya 和 Atsuki 身边待了好几个小时；他亲眼看到，在自己害死他们的朋友之后，两人变成了什么样子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061209_1_7bc1dd97:
    # "At first, when he appeared in November, Akaro thought of what to do. He could take advantage of it—he knew what would happen.{w} Yet his remorse soon overcame him. His greatest wish was to walk away, and he had the opportunity to do so. The plan was going to be a failure, but he was no longer in his world. Perhaps he could let his other self take the blame while he tried to atone for his actions..."
    "刚出现在11月时，Akaro 还在盘算该怎么办。他本可以利用这一切——他知道接下来会发生什么。{w}可愧疚很快压过了这个念头。他最大的心愿就是一走了之，而现在他正好有这样的机会。计划注定要失败，但他已不在自己的世界里。或许他可以让另一个自己去背这个罪责，而自己设法赎罪……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061215_1_af13724e:
    # "Of course, due to a certain perspective you've viewed, you know that's not what happened."
    "当然，从你先前看到的某个视角来看，你知道事情并没有那样发展。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061223_1_797ba928:
    # "In any case, Akaro's actions significantly changed the start of world B's incident. Katei didn't know he'd dropped the rusty key, and Naomi didn't run to the attic with the suitcase."
    "总之，Akaro 的举动大大改变了B世界那场事件的开端。Katei 不知道自己弄丢了生锈的钥匙，Naomi 也没有拎着手提箱跑向阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061226_1_7b2d92a6:
    # "In worlds A and C, however, the same thing occurred. In the attic, Naomi touched the Sekimeiya and world switched.{w} When Naomi A touched it, she appeared in world B. Her keys remained in world A, and the elevator was disabled. Until that changed, she was trapped up there.{w} From her point of view, both Sekimeiya disappeared, as she brought the suitcase along as one of her possessions."
    "然而在A世界和C世界，发生的是同一件事。Naomi 在阁楼触碰到 Sekimeiya，世界切换了。{w}Naomi A 触碰它时，出现在B世界。Naomi A 的钥匙留在了A世界，电梯也无法使用。在情况改变之前，她一直被困在上面。{w}在她看来，两个 Sekimeiya 都消失了，因为她是把手提箱当作随身物品一起带过来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061231_1_8548e740:
    # "However, Naomi C's outcome was different.{w} She world switched to world A, and the range encompassed Shiroya as well.{w} Even though the attic was locked, they weren't trapped. Not only did Shiroya have the key, but so did Naomi: although she'd changed worlds, she grabbed the keys Naomi A had left behind, unaware they were no longer hers."
    "但 Naomi C 的结果不同。{w}她世界切换到了A世界，Shiroya 也在重叠范围内。{w}尽管阁楼上了锁，她们却没有被困住。Shiroya 有钥匙，Naomi 也有：她虽已换了世界，却顺手拿上了 Naomi A 留下的钥匙，并不知道那已不属于她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061233_1_e070c6d2:
    # "In addition, she brought the suitcase along too, but the Sekimeiya Naomi A had used were both still there. As both Naomis world switched at exactly the same time, for Naomi C, it only seemed as though the Sekimeiya she'd touched turned gray, even though it was the one Naomi A had activated.{w} Instinctively, what she did was touch the other Sekimeiya, unable to believe her finger had changed a gem's color. When she did, she traveled through time: since one of the Sekimeiya was powered off, there was no world switch."
    "此外，她也把手提箱带了过来，但 Naomi A 用过的两个 Sekimeiya 都还在原处。由于两个 Naomi 是在同一瞬间切换世界的，所以在 Naomi C 看来，仿佛只有自己碰过的那个 Sekimeiya 变成了灰色——尽管那其实是 Naomi A 激活的那一个。{w}她无法相信自己的手指能让宝石变色，便本能地去碰了另一个 Sekimeiya。这一碰，她穿越了时间：因为其中一个 Sekimeiya 已经断电，所以没有发生世界切换。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061240_1_8bd42dc6:
    # "Although these beginning sequences evolved into drastically different days, some of the differences between worlds came from before the 15th."
    "这些开端虽然发展成了截然不同的几天，但世界之间的某些差异，早在15日之前就已经存在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061241_1_ef68a174:
    # "Isla's friend only existed in world B. In the other worlds, Isla hadn't been assured everything would go smoothly; nobody had told her she'd be able to touch the Sekimeiya. Hence, her mood was more dampened, and Erina's was lighter."
    "Isla 的朋友只存在于B世界。在其他世界，没人向 Isla 保证一切都会顺利，也没人告诉她可以触碰 Sekimeiya。因此她情绪更低落，Erina 反倒轻松些。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061242_1_c5f8930a:
    # "Sai sniffed out that something would occur on the day of the event. However, only in world B was he certain—he had read a forum thread that foretold what would unfold in the tower. In that world, he was much more active from the start."
    "Sai 察觉到活动当天会出事。但只有在B世界，他才确信无疑——他读过一篇论坛帖子，预告了塔中将会发生什么。在那个世界，他从一开始就活跃得多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061243_1_dafd832f:
    # "In world A, Akaro couldn't see Katei as his enemy, so his attitude toward the others was rougher and sterner.{w} In addition, the article detailing his escape from prison only existed in world B."
    "在A世界，Akaro 无法把 Katei 视为敌人，所以他对待其他人的态度更加粗暴严厉。{w}此外，详细报道他越狱的那篇文章只存在于B世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061244_1_696656df:
    # "In world C, Katei's Sekimeiya were taken by Naomi, so his priorities were very different. In world B, Katei had to step up to Erina's group, while in world C, he saw room A5 by himself before everyone else regained consciousness."
    "在C世界，Katei 的 Sekimeiya 被 Naomi 拿走了，所以他的当务之急就截然不同了。在B世界，Katei 不得不挺身面对 Erina 一行人；而在C世界，他趁其他人还没恢复意识，独自去查看了水晶展室 A5。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061248_1_f6d860d1:
    # "Do you think there's a relation between all these changes?"
    "你觉得这些变化之间有关联吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061254_1_61c1e687:
    # "There certainly is one: they were all caused by someone from another world."
    "当然有关联：它们全都出自另一个世界来的人之手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061256_1_9c2989ce:
    # "That's it. They were caused by someone from another world."
    "正是如此。这些变化都是另一个世界来的人造成的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061258_1_2adb40c6:
    # "No, they had an origin. The actual relation is that they were all caused by someone from another world."
    "不，它们是有源头的。真正的关联在于，它们全都是另一个世界的人造成的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061262_1_161fb37d:
    # "Up to the 24th of November, all the worlds were identical.{w} You might be familiar with the many-worlds interpretation. According to it, every choice splits the world, leading into infinite worlds which are infinitely different."
    "在11月24日之前，所有世界都完全相同。{w}你或许听说过多重世界诠释。照这种说法，每一个选择都会分裂世界，衍生出无穷多个彼此千差万别的世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061263_1_f59dd9de:
    # "In these three worlds, the initial difference came in November of 2011, and it was caused due to someone who had world switched from another world.{w} In other words, there was no change that wasn't influenced by another world—if zero world switches had occurred, each of the three worlds would've remained identical."
    "在这三个世界中，最初的差异出现在2011年11月，起因是有人从另一个世界切换而来。{w}换句话说，任何变化都受到另一个世界的影响——假如一次世界切换都不曾发生，这三个世界至今仍会完全相同。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061264_1_93b34fa8:
    # "Only they caused reality to differ. It was the world switches that shaped this maze—a maze whose walls could be broken."
    "正是它们让现实出现了差异。是这些世界切换造就了这座迷宫——一座墙壁可以被打破的迷宫。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061266_1_ca810fa3:
    # "There are numerous enigmas around the world switch. Perhaps you have some lingering questions.{w} When Akaro A appeared in world B, the storeroom had been sealed by his future self. However, in part, that helped him go back in time and seal it. Doesn't that seem contradictory? If he had appeared in a world without a sealed storeroom, he wouldn't have been able to go back and seal it... You might find a number of similar cases.{w} For that, you can look at the people who world switched and the way they shaped their new world. If the answer escapes you, that's where you will find it, alongside the real form of the world switch."
    "围绕世界切换，还有许多谜团。你或许仍有疑问。{w}当 Akaro A 出现在B世界时，储藏室已经被他未来的自己封上了。可在某种程度上，正是这一点帮了他，让他能回到过去把储藏室封上。这不是自相矛盾吗？如果他出现的那个世界里储藏室没有被封，他就无法回去把它封上……类似的情形你或许还能找出不少。{w}为此，你可以去看看那些发生过世界切换的人，以及他们如何塑造自己的新世界。想不出答案的话，答案就在那里，世界切换的真实面貌也在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061281_1_e96ae029:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061282_1_845a4f8f:
    # "Hm..."
    "嗯……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061283_1_35b26b50:
    # "I couldn't just think that infinite worlds existed. After all, it was possible I was going back and forth between two.{w} The first time, Erina had brought us to a different world, but we had eventually returned. When we'd later traveled back to that morning, Shiroya and I had changed worlds, but I suspected that we'd appeared in the same one again. That was why thinking that infinite worlds existed was a bit of a leap."
    "我不能就此认定存在无穷多个世界。毕竟，我也可能只是在两个世界之间来回。{w}第一次，Erina 把我们带到了另一个世界，但最后我们还是回去了。后来我们穿越回那天早晨时，Shiroya 和我切换了世界，可我怀疑我们又一次落在了同一个世界。所以说，断言存在无穷多个世界，还是有些操之过急。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061284_1_39798ded:
    # "I looked at both Sekimeiya. If I touched one, would the world around me really change?"
    "我看着那两个 Sekimeiya。如果碰其中一个，身边的世界真的会改变吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061285_1_27e03859:
    # "What about the range, the replicated location, the time traveled, and all that nonsense?"
    "那重叠范围、复制的位置、穿越的时间，还有那一堆乱七八糟的东西呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061289_1_92128118:
    # "I stepped into the kitchen."
    "我走进了厨房。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061290_1_12d7b334:
    # "...Can the refrigerator act like the cold cabinet?"
    "……冰箱能当那种冷藏展示柜用吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061294_1_12c6e79c:
    # "I opened it and put my hand inside. While it was cold, the temperature didn't seem as low as the Sekimeiya cabinet's."
    "我打开冰箱，把手伸了进去。里面确实冷，但温度似乎不如放着 Sekimeiya 的展示柜那么低。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061295_1_cc1c179d:
    # "There was a regulation mechanism inside, so I changed it to the coldest setting."
    "里面有调节装置，我就把它调到了最冷的一档。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061298_1_ee25f76c:
    # "I shut a Sekimeiya inside the refrigerator for a few seconds.{w} When I took it out, I felt it through my shirt."
    "我在冰箱里放了一个 Sekimeiya，关上门，等了几秒。{w}取出来时，我隔着衬衫感受它的温度。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061299_1_51783745:
    # "It did work. It was pretty hot before, and now it's not."
    "确实有效。刚才还烫得很，现在已经不热了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061300_1_72724df1:
    # "So, as long as I keep a Sekimeiya in here, I might not be encompassed within two ranges."
    "也就是说，只要我一直把一个 Sekimeiya 放在里面，也许就不会同时落入两个范围。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061301_1_742b61c9:
    # "I wasn't confident the concept of range I was working with was correct, though."
    "不过，我并没有把握自己设想的「范围」这个概念是否正确。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061302_1_59c553e5:
    # "I put both Sekimeiya inside to hopefully reset them. A few seconds later, I took one out and set it on the countertop."
    "我把两个 Sekimeiya 都放了进去，指望它们能借此重置。几秒后，我取出一个，放在流理台上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061303_1_f3f88619:
    # "Theoretically, it should begin to gather energy now, so I'll travel a short distance if I touch it soon."
    "理论上，它现在应该开始蓄能了。要是我马上碰它，大概只会穿越很短一段距离。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061304_1_c669552c:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061305_1_0fbf533a:
    # "I counted up to a minute in my head. Then, I touched the Sekimeiya on the marble."
    "我在心里数了一分钟，然后碰了碰大理石台面上的那个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061309_1_84267c65:
    # "...{w}Hm? What just happened?"
    "……{w}嗯？刚才怎么回事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061310_1_dfe8c96a:
    # "I was still in the kitchen, but I had teleported less than a step backward."
    "我人还在厨房，只是向后传送了不到一步的距离。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061311_1_b57c72a4:
    # "Huh? The Sekimeiya is powered off just where I touched it."
    "咦？Sekimeiya 就在我碰它的地方停止运作了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061312_1_9b3270be:
    # "Does that mean I traveled to the future? I think I only went a few seconds through time, and there's no past self of mine here."
    "难道说，我穿越到了未来？我记得只往前跳了几秒，而且这里也没有过去的我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061313_1_7d5ada70:
    # "The Sekimeiya was gray, indicating that I was at a point after my travel. Surprised, I realized I really had traveled forward in time."
    "那个 Sekimeiya 是灰色的，说明我此刻身处穿越之后的时间点。我这才惊觉，自己真的穿越到了未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061314_1_6e38332d:
    # "What was the difference? Why didn't I travel to the past?"
    "差别在哪里？为什么我没有穿越到过去？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061315_1_714e0677:
    # "And the location where I appeared... Why was it right next to where I touched the Sekimeiya?{w} It's as if I only moved a tiny bit because I only went a few seconds to the future."
    "还有我出现的位置……为什么恰好就在我碰 Sekimeiya 的位置旁边？{w}就好像我只往未来走了几秒，所以位置也只挪了一点点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061316_1_269bf6d9:
    # "Hm...{w} I have an idea, but I don't think I can test it."
    "嗯……{w}我有个想法，不过恐怕没法验证。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061318_1_bf475f43:
    # "Wait, no, maybe I can."
    "等等，不对——也许能验证。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061319_1_e0af40ea:
    # "As soon as I put the Sekimeiya in the refrigerator, it regained its white color. However, I ignored that and ran to the staircase."
    "我刚把 Sekimeiya 放进冰箱，它就恢复了白色。但我没有理会，径直朝楼梯跑去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061326_1_2682f727:
    # "It appeared the crystal floor was still empty, but I couldn't know for certain."
    "水晶展室看上去还是空的，可我没法确认。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061330_1_6852946b:
    # "Quietly, I walked to the security room."
    "我放轻脚步，走向监控室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061334_1_917f0888:
    # "All the screens were still black, but they weren't my focus. I began to look everywhere I could."
    "所有屏幕仍是黑的，但我的注意力不在屏幕上。我开始四处翻找。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061335_1_bf99e72c:
    # "Sai said he found the voice recorder here, but perhaps he hasn't yet. I might be able to get it in this world."
    "Sai 说过他是在这里找到录音笔的，不过也许现在还没找到。在这个世界里，我也许能先拿到手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061336_1_7232eddc:
    # "And I did. Behind one of the monitors on the wall, I found the device that had been in Isla's purse."
    "我果然找到了。在墙上某台显示器背后，我摸到了那支原本在 Isla 包里的录音笔。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061339_1_85ba0ea1:
    # "When I pressed the \"record\" button, a line appeared on the screen. Above it, numbers began to count the recorded seconds."
    "我按下「录音」键，屏幕上出现了一条线。线的上方，数字开始累计已录的秒数。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061340_1_fae3fc0c:
    # "There was no saved recording this time..."
    "这一次没有已保存的录音……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061341_1_54986dab:
    # "That wasn't strange. After all, the recorder in Isla's purse had to have traveled from the future, while the one in the security room was the original one.{w} However, my intention wasn't to record anything. I wanted to use the device as a timer that I could hold."
    "这并不奇怪。毕竟 Isla 包里的那支是从未来穿越而来的，监控室里的这一支才是原本的那支。{w}可我要的并不是录音。我只想把它当作可以随身带着的计时器。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061349_1_46ed475b:
    # "Back in the attic, I entered the kitchen again. Both Sekimeiya were still in the refrigerator, but I didn't want to take one out yet."
    "回到阁楼，我又走进厨房。两个 Sekimeiya 都还在冰箱里，但我还不想取出其中一个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061350_1_0a8a5fd9:
    # "Instead, I powered on the oven and set it to finish after ten minutes."
    "我转而启动烤箱，把定时设为十分钟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061353_1_acea4231:
    # "Then, at the same time that the oven began to count down, I pressed the record button. Immediately, the seconds began to count up on the device's screen."
    "接着，在烤箱开始倒计时的同时，我按下录音键。录音笔屏幕上的秒数随即开始递增。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061354_1_5486b183:
    # "With this setup, I can know the amount of time I'm traveling."
    "这样一来，我就能知道自己穿越了多久。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061357_1_ea749d85:
    # "I held the recorder in my hand so that it would always be in my possession. When the oven's timer showed nine minutes, the device had hit one minute."
    "我把录音笔握在手里，确保它一直在我手上。烤箱的计时器显示还剩九分钟时，录音笔刚好走到一分钟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061358_1_a04f9098:
    # "Meanwhile, I thought back on the many travels I'd experienced, wondering if there was any idea I could apply to every single one."
    "与此同时，我回想自己经历过的那些穿越，琢磨有没有哪条规律能适用于每一次。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061362_1_bc70915e:
    # "When three minutes had been recorded, I took the Sekimeiya I'd last used out of the refrigerator and left it on the countertop."
    "录音笔走到三分钟时，我把上次用过的那个 Sekimeiya 从冰箱里取出，放在流理台上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061363_1_1475e4fb:
    # "So, it's started gaining energy after three minutes have gone by."
    "也就是说，过了三分钟，它才开始蓄能。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061364_1_4c9d1448:
    # "I didn't stop staring at the ticking timer. A few seconds later, I brought my hand close to the Sekimeiya. I didn't touch it yet, though. I had to make sure I did so at the appropriate time."
    "我目不转睛地盯着跳动的计时器。几秒后，我把手凑近那个 Sekimeiya，却没有碰它。我必须等到合适的时机再动手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061366_1_dd96a145:
    # "Above the Sekimeiya, my hand patiently hovered. As soon as the recorder and the oven hit five minutes, I touched it."
    "我的手悬在 Sekimeiya 上方，耐心地等着。录音笔和烤箱同时走到五分钟的那一刻，我碰了上去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061368_1_fcffa032:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061369_1_d96ee04a:
    # "Once again, I'd hardly moved through space: I was still in the kitchen, staring at the Sekimeiya. However, it was gray, meaning that I was in the future."
    "这一次我几乎没有移动：我还在厨房，仍盯着那个 Sekimeiya。可它是灰色的，说明我身处未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061370_1_efdcd57e:
    # "Immediately, I looked at the oven. Its timer indicated that four minutes and fifteen seconds still remained.{w} Right after that, I glanced at my own hand, eager to look at my timer.{w} The device was there."
    "我立刻去看烤箱，计时显示还剩四分十五秒。{w}紧接着，我低头看向自己的手，急着看自己的计时器。{w}录音笔还在手里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061377_1_17d3fa9f:
    # "4:15... It's the same time!"
    "4:15……两边一样！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061380_1_23127e25:
    # "But while the device's screen changed to 4:16, the oven's timer went to 4:14.{w} Like before, the recorder kept counting up, whereas the oven counted down."
    "可录音笔的屏幕跳到 4:16 时，烤箱的计时却变成了 4:14。{w}和刚才一样，录音笔在递增，烤箱在倒数。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061381_1_9d1b3bec:
    # "Huh..."
    "咦……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061382_1_c7f361f4:
    # "I touched the Sekimeiya at the five-minute mark and went 45 seconds into the future. That's a little odd—the Sekimeiya gathered energy for two minutes. The times it gathered energy for fifteen minutes, we went twenty minutes through time."
    "我在计时走到五分钟时碰了 Sekimeiya，向未来跳了四十五秒。这有点奇怪——它只蓄了两分钟的能量。可之前它蓄能十五分钟时，我们穿越了二十分钟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061383_1_4c931860:
    # "The most important thing, though... is that although I went 45 seconds to the future, the recorder seems to have gone 45 seconds backward in time."
    "不过最关键的是……我虽然向未来跳了四十五秒，录音笔上的计时却似乎倒退了四十五秒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061384_1_9ed34c4f:
    # "That must mean... that the replicated location was from 45 seconds before I touched the Sekimeiya."
    "也就是说……被复制的位置，是我碰 Sekimeiya 前四十五秒所在的位置。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061388_1_65860b05:
    # "That left me thinking, but the train of thought was interrupted by the Sekimeiya. It turned white a few seconds after my reappearance."
    "我正想得出神，思绪却被 Sekimeiya 打断了。我重新出现几秒后，它就变回了白色。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061389_1_64b4d122:
    # "This is strange too. It took almost two minutes to power back on, but it spent about five minutes powered off when Sai and Shiroya disappeared from the event room."
    "这一点也很奇怪。它花了将近两分钟才重新启动，可 Sai 和 Shiroya 在活动室消失那次，它停止运作了大约五分钟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061390_1_6b4925d1:
    # "I had to do it again.{w} I turned off the oven and erased the recording. Next, I set the oven to five minutes and pressed the device's record button at the same time.{w} I left the Sekimeiya in the refrigerator until two minutes had elapsed. Then, thirty seconds later, when the recorder displayed 2:30, I touched the gem again."
    "我得再来一次。{w}我关掉烤箱，删除了录音。接着，我把烤箱设成五分钟，同时按下录音笔的录音键。{w}我让 Sekimeiya 在冰箱里放了两分钟。等过了三十秒，录音笔显示 2:30 时，我再次碰了它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061391_1_a5d4bcc7:
    # "The immediate result was the same: I appeared in the kitchen, pretty much where I'd already been standing. I looked at both timers at once.{w} The two of them showed \"2:21\", yet the device's timer kept ticking up while the oven's counted down."
    "眼前的结果还是一样：我出现在厨房，差不多就在原先站立的地方。我同时看了一眼两个计时器。{w}两边都显示「2:21」，可录音笔的计时仍在递增，烤箱的却在倒数。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061392_1_2392e1be:
    # "What the fuck? Again, I went nine seconds to the future, but the location I appeared in was from nine seconds before touching the Sekimeiya.{w} Is this it? Does traveling to the future X amount of time replicate the location in space you were at X amount of time in the past?{w} What about traveling back, though? I've gone to the future three times in a row!"
    "这他妈是怎么回事？又是这样——我向未来跳了九秒，落点却是我触碰 Sekimeiya 之前九秒所在的位置。{w}难道说，向未来跳 X 秒，复制出的地点就是你在 X 秒前所在的位置？{w}可要是向过去跳呢？我都已经连着三次跳往未来了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061395_1_9fb3a883:
    # "The only idea I had was to use the other Sekimeiya, so I put the one I'd been using in the refrigerator."
    "我能想到的唯一办法，就是换另一个 Sekimeiya 试试。于是我把一直用的那个放进了冰箱。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061396_1_9fa1ca83:
    # "I set up the same conditions with the oven's timer at five minutes as I began a new recording."
    "我照同样的条件，把烤箱定时器设成五分钟，同时开始新的录音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061397_1_13d486ec:
    # "That time, when two minutes had elapsed, I took the other Sekimeiya out. Thirty seconds later, I activated it."
    "那一次，等过了两分钟，我取出另一个 Sekimeiya。三十秒后，我启动了它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061399_1_79ebbfcd:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061400_1_a6a7644c:
    # "Wh...!"
    "什……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061401_1_f4a0a39b:
    # "The result was almost identical. I appeared in the kitchen, very close to where I'd been."
    "结果几乎一模一样。我出现在厨房里，离原先的位置很近。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061402_1_eb06a068:
    # "However, someone was in front of me. It was my past self."
    "但我面前站着一个人。是过去的我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061403_1_753253be:
    # "I remained completely still, just like a deer caught in headlights. The back of my own head was in front of my eyes."
    "我僵在原地，动也不动，活像被车灯照住的鹿。眼前正是我自己的后脑勺。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061404_1_3684fe1a:
    # "But it didn't remain there for long. Quickly, my figure disappeared, revealing the powered-off Sekimeiya."
    "可那身影没有停留多久。转眼间，我的身影消失了，露出已经停止运作的 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061408_1_afad83b5:
    # "I see... I just traveled through time, and the Sekimeiya's range was so small that it didn't pick me up again. It does seem like I went nine seconds to the past.{w} It's probably due to the Sekimeiya I used: this one makes you travel to the past, while the other sends you to the future."
    "原来如此……我刚刚经历了一次时间穿越，而 Sekimeiya 的范围太小，没能再次把我卷进去。看来我确实回到了九秒前。{w}原因大概出在我用的这个 Sekimeiya 上：这个会让人回到过去，另一个则把人送往未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061409_1_f0b31a60:
    # "The oven's timer was at 2:25, so I hurried to look at the voice recorder as I thought about it.{w} I had gone nine seconds to the past, so upon appearing, the oven's timer would've been at 2:39. Then, I had waited out the nine seconds needed for my past self to disappear, and five extra seconds had elapsed since. Before the oven's timer counted down to 2:24, I looked at the device between my hands."
    "烤箱定时器显示 2:25，我一边琢磨，一边急忙去看录音笔。{w}我是回到了九秒前，所以刚出现时，烤箱定时器应该停在 2:39。之后我等了九秒，直到过去的自己消失；那之后又过了五秒。趁烤箱定时器还没跳到 2:24，我看向手中的录音笔。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061418_1_777a4339:
    # "The screen is blank! What the hell!?{w} Why? I can't know where this location is from!"
    "屏幕一片空白！搞什么鬼！？{w}为什么？这样一来，我根本没法知道这个位置是从哪儿来的！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061419_1_d7d23d7c:
    # "Traveling nine seconds to the future put me where I'd been nine seconds in the past!{w} Wouldn't traveling to the past put me—{w} ...{w}where I'd be nine seconds in the future.{w} And I'm still here, exactly where I appeared."
    "向未来跳九秒，会把我送到九秒前我所在的地方！{w}那向过去跳，不就会把我送到——{w}……{w}九秒后我会在的地方吗？{w}而我还在这里，就在我出现的位置上，一动没动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061420_1_cb3734d3:
    # "But then why is the screen..."
    "可既然如此，屏幕为什么……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061421_1_f67fc026:
    # "Wait,{w} no.{w} It might make sense."
    "等等，{w}不对，{w}也许说得通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061428_1_506397c9:
    # "Let's say the Sekimeiya is touched at time {b}t{/b}. In this case, {b}t{/b} is 2:30.{w} {b}X{/b} will refer to the travel time, which is nine seconds."
    "假设在时刻 {b}t{/b} 触碰 Sekimeiya。这里 {b}t{/b} 是 2:30。{w}再设 {b}X{/b} 为穿越时间，也就是九秒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061429_1_a32274a2:
    # "Let's assume that traveling {b}X{/b} seconds to the past copies your state {b}X{/b} seconds after touching the Sekimeiya. What would the time on the device be upon appearing?"
    "假设向过去穿越 {b}X{/b} 秒，复制的是你触碰 Sekimeiya 后 {b}X{/b} 秒时的状态。那么出现时，设备上的时间是多少？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061433_1_974ae02b:
    # "{b}t+X{/b}, or 2:39.{w} Then {b}2X{/b} seconds would pass to reach the future state."
    "应是 {b}t+X{/b}，也就是 2:39。{w}可要抵达那个未来状态，还得再经过 {b}2X{/b} 秒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061437_1_3d41c8fb:
    # "The timer would read {b}t+3X{/b}, or 2:57, but that contradicts the past position.{w}  The timer at arrival would have to be {b}t+3X{/b}."
    "定时器会显示 {b}t+3X{/b}，也就是 2:57，可这与过去的位置不符。{w}照此推算，抵达时定时器的读数只可能是 {b}t+3X{/b}。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061441_1_3eabdf9f:
    # "But nothing stops this from continuing. Another {b}2X{/b} seconds would be added..."
    "但没有什么能让它停下。还会再叠加 {b}2X{/b} 秒……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061456_1_4f71ab98:
    # "The recorder's time would add up infinitely, and eventually its battery would run out."
    "录音笔上的时间会无限累加，电池迟早耗尽。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061462_1_28d6206f:
    # "This can't make sense, though.{w} If the replicated location is one that occurs after touching the Sekimeiya, we would die."
    "可这样根本说不通。{w}如果复制出的位置是触碰 Sekimeiya 之后才会出现的，那我们不就死定了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061463_1_4903cca2:
    # "Just like with the recorder's timer, my age would've increased by a few seconds repeatedly, making me die instantly upon traveling to the past."
    "就像录音笔的计时一样，我的年龄也会一次又一次地叠加几秒，向过去穿越的瞬间就会死掉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061464_1_98e6b150:
    # "If the device aged in a loop until it ran out of batteries, its appearance would've changed too. It would've degraded, probably even disintegrated into nothing."
    "如果设备在循环中不断老化，直到电池耗尽，它的外观也会跟着改变。它会变得老旧，甚至可能彻底崩解，什么都不剩。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061467_1_2c3a6101:
    # "However, isn't this what happened... to Sai's watch?{w} Not only to Sai, but to a Sai who I have to assume traveled to the past. When I saw him, he should've been in the attic, so he'd come from the future. Later, I learned his watch had stopped working again."
    "然而……Sai 的手表，不正是这样吗？{w}而且不只是 Sai，而是那个我不得不认定曾穿越到过去的 Sai。我见到他时，他本该待在阁楼，可见他是从未来回来的。后来我得知，他的手表又停了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061469_1_2f4ae9b6:
    # "If he appeared five minutes in the past where he would be ten minutes after his appearance... the time on his watch would've increased by ten minutes infinitely, and the battery would've eventually stopped working.{w} There's no way it would've lasted thousands of years, though, so what the hell?{w} And why would the watch's inner mechanism add up the looped time while its outer appearance wasn't affected?"
    "如果他出现在五分钟前，而那个位置正是他出现十分钟后会在的地方……那手表上的时间就会以十分钟为单位无限累加，电池迟早撑不住。{w}可它绝不可能撑上几千年，这到底是怎么回事？{w}况且，为什么只有手表的内部机件在累加循环的时间，外表却毫无变化？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061475_1_752c4de3:
    # "...The recorder isn't working anymore, so I can't keep testing."
    "……录音笔已经坏了，我没法再继续测试。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061476_1_193a3d10:
    # "Wait, no. I can make it work again if what I've concluded is correct.{w} After all, just minutes ago, I was holding it when it worked. I just have to replicate that location, which should be easy. I only have to travel a couple minutes to the future."
    "等等，不对。只要我的推论没错，我就能让它重新工作。{w}毕竟就在几分钟前，我拿着它的时候它还是好的。我只要复制出那个位置就行，这应该不难。我只需要向未来跳几分钟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061477_1_b6de98e5:
    # "That was what I did. I put the broken recorder in a drawer and traveled to the future. When I appeared, I was holding the device. The timer on its screen said 1:35, as it was still working."
    "我就这么做了。我把坏掉的录音笔放进抽屉，然后穿越到了未来。出现时，我手里正拿着那支录音笔。屏幕上的计时显示 1:35，它还在正常工作。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061478_1_1bbf16a2:
    # "This is definitely how traveling to the future works, then..."
    "看来穿越到未来的原理，确实就是这样……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061479_1_09c82ec1:
    # "But what about traveling to the past? Did all those travels work like this as well?"
    "可穿越到过去呢？之前那几次也都是这样吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061483_1_febf740d:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061487_1_4af1d49f:
    # "The first time I went to the past, I appeared in the lobby, right in front of the hallway A door. I later determined I'd gone about twenty minutes to the past."
    "第一次回到过去时，我出现在大厅，就在 A走廊门前。后来我推算出，我大约回到了二十分钟前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061488_1_051b9dc6:
    # "So, twenty minutes after the point I touched the Sekimeiya...{w} I was in the lobby, right in front of the hallway A door. I was watching the hallway while the others looked through every room."
    "也就是说，在我触碰 Sekimeiya 之后二十分钟……{w}我就在大厅里，站在 A走廊门前。当时其他人逐个房间搜查，我则守着走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061489_1_c1a15e6e:
    # "Seriously...? Is this what's been happening?"
    "真的假的……？难道一直都是这样？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061493_1_3a0ee99b:
    # "Later, Shiroya and I traveled about forty minutes to the past. I appeared in the security room, sitting down. However, the chair wasn't there to support me, so I fell to the floor."
    "后来，我和 Shiroya 一起回到了大约四十分钟前。我出现在监控室里，还保持着坐姿。可那把椅子并不在那里，我一下子摔到了地上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061496_1_71709b35:
    # "Forty minutes after the time we touched the Sekimeiya... I really was in the security room, looking at the computer. Sai had just run away from me, and I even looked at the time. I was there from {time=12:18} to {time=12:31.}"
    "在我们触碰 Sekimeiya 之后四十分钟……我确实待在监控室里，盯着电脑。那时 Sai 刚从我这逃走，我还看过时间。从 {time=12:18} 到 {time=12:31.}，我一直都在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061503_1_e12aca81:
    # "Even Shiroya... She said she'd appeared in the second floor offices, and when we reunited outside the security room, she'd just been searching for me through every floor starting from the top. Both of us had just been in the locations we'd appeared."
    "就连 Shiroya 也是……她说她出现在二楼的办公室，我们在监控室外会合时，她正从顶层开始一层层往下找我。我们两个当时都正好待在自己出现的位置。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061510_1_74384cd5:
    # "I could hardly believe it, but I finally knew the logic behind what had agonizingly eluded me: the replicated location."
    "我几乎不敢相信，可我终于弄明白了那个一直让我百思不得其解的东西——复制的位置。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061511_1_a0b59ff7:
    # "But hang on... Does this mean that every time we touched the Sekimeiya and appeared in a location we recognized, we'd gone to the future? ...It's only traveling to the future that replicates a past coordinate you've been at."
    "可等等……难道说，每次我们触碰 Sekimeiya 后，出现在一个我们认得出的地方，其实都是去了未来？……只有穿越到未来，才会复制你过去待过的坐标。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061512_1_b1b06997:
    # "This is absurd, though! It doesn't even make sense!"
    "这也太荒唐了！根本说不通！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061513_1_35f262d3:
    # "Why the hell did I appear in the security room in the past!? Because I was later in the security room? That's nonsense!"
    "我到底为什么会出现在过去的监控室！？就因为后来我会待在监控室？胡说八道！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061514_1_62044c32:
    # "Why the security room? If I had appeared in the attic, for example, I would've been somewhere else eighty minutes later! I was only in the security room in the future because it's where I appeared in the past!"
    "为什么偏偏是监控室？比方说，如果我出现在阁楼，那八十分钟后我就在别的地方了！我在未来之所以会待在监控室，就因为我在过去出现在那里！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061515_1_6c3ffb68:
    # "Why couldn't I have appeared on another continent? Then I would've been there in the future and made it come true!"
    "为什么我不能出现在另一块大陆？那样未来的我就会待在那里，把这件事变成现实！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061516_1_b1afc814:
    # "It's nonsense! What's actually determining where we appear?{w} Something must be. We appeared inside the tower every single time."
    "荒唐！到底是什么决定了我们出现的位置？{w}肯定有什么在起作用。每一次，我们都出现在塔内。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061529_1_aaf88c34:
    # "Shiroya and Atsuki had spent a long time in the elevator. Thanks to the stop button, they had managed to escape from Sai."
    "Shiroya 和 Atsuki 在电梯里耗了很久。多亏了停止按钮，两人才得以从 Sai 手中逃脱。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061530_1_032c1852:
    # "But Shiroya soon noticed something was happening to Atsuki. He looked pale, and his breathing had sped up."
    "可 Shiroya 很快发觉 Atsuki 有些不对劲。他脸色苍白，呼吸也急促起来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061531_1_27263d7e:
    # "...Are you okay?"
    "……你还好吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061532_1_b608da15:
    # "Yes, don't worry."
    "嗯，别担心。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061533_1_b6801ed3:
    # "Shiroya stared at her lap, worried about Atsuki's thoughts. Did he, perhaps, think they wouldn't be able to leave?"
    "Shiroya 低头望着自己的膝头，担心 Atsuki 心里在想些什么。他会不会以为他们根本出不去？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061538_1_5ee54b47:
    # "The silence went on for a long time."
    "沉默持续了很久。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061539_1_9cd49247:
    # "Eventually, Shiroya experienced some relief. Atsuki had closed his eyes, and he didn't appear to be as stressed. Mirroring him, Shiroya closed her eyes too."
    "后来，Shiroya 稍稍松了口气。Atsuki 已经闭上眼，看上去不像先前那样紧绷。她学着他的样子，也合上了眼睛。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061542_1_e899f631:
    # "Minutes later, both pairs of eyes shot open at the same time, and Shiroya couldn't believe what she saw."
    "几分钟后，两人同时睁开眼。Shiroya 不敢相信眼前的景象。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061543_1_c1152b0c:
    # "A knife was buried in Atsuki's chest.{w} She looked directly into his eyes, but only silence filled the elevator—neither of them could bring themselves to utter a word."
    "一把刀插在 Atsuki 的胸口。{w}她直直望进他的眼睛，电梯里却只有沉默——两人谁都说不出一句话来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061544_1_c8631ad7:
    # "Then, Shiroya looked at the hand gripping the knife. She followed it up to an arm and then a shoulder.{w} Finally, she traced it to Sai's face."
    "随后，Shiroya 看向握着刀的那只手。她的目光顺着手臂上移，越过肩膀，{w}最后落到 Sai 的脸上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061545_1_2b20d68e:
    # "But that sight didn't last long. Immediately after killing his first victim, Sai felt the urge to have a second. With a frantic motion, the knife sliced Shiroya's chest."
    "然而那一幕没有持续多久。Sai 刚杀掉第一个人，立刻又涌起再杀一个的冲动。他发疯似地挥刀，划开了 Shiroya 的胸口。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061546_1_46e20828:
    # "Before she could process the scene, Shiroya's body fell beside Atsuki, their blood pooling together in the elevator."
    "还没等她反应过来，Shiroya 的身体已倒在 Atsuki 身旁，两人的血在电梯里汇成一摊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061552_1_4c65d986:
    # "Of course, you know this never occurred."
    "当然，你知道这一切从未发生过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061553_1_6b5fd6e2:
    # "If it had, though... how would it have come to happen?"
    "可若真发生过……那又是怎么发生的呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061554_1_9f6410dd:
    # "Sai stared at both bodies momentarily. However, he didn't immediately understand that he was trapped."
    "Sai怔怔地看了两具尸体片刻，却没有立刻意识到自己已被困住。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061555_1_0a88e0d3:
    # "Atsuki had pressed the stop button, so Sai couldn't leave the elevator."
    "Atsuki按下了停止按钮，Sai无法离开电梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061556_1_7ac6e799:
    # "He couldn't move either—two bodies were on the floor. Eventually, when the replicated location took place, Sai was exactly where he'd appeared."
    "他也动不了——两具尸体就躺在地上。最终，到了复现地点该出现的时候，Sai仍待在他最初出现的位置。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061558_1_6841772d:
    # "But... why? He was able to be there in the future because he had appeared there in the past. {tip=saielevator}Why had that been the location where he'd appeared?{/tip} Why not somewhere else?"
    "可是……为什么？他之所以会在未来待在那里，是因为他过去曾在那里出现。{tip=saielevator}可为什么偏偏是那个地方？{/tip}为什么不是别处？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061560_1_6c017b73:
    # "Maybe you have a good idea."
    "或许你已经有了答案。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061569_1_e6311c69:
    # "I had no idea. It seemed to make no sense at all."
    "我毫无头绪。这怎么看都说不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061570_1_53f094cf:
    # "But what the hell would happen now if I travel to the past?{w} Let's say I travel two minutes back and appear in the kitchen. Will it be guaranteed that I'll be in the kitchen four minutes later?"
    "可如果我穿越回过去，现在到底会怎样？{w}假设我回到两分钟前，出现在厨房。那么四分钟后，我是否就一定会待在厨房？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061571_1_4cc8bb09:
    # "What if I don't want to? What if I decide to leave?{w} Does the location where I appear force me to be somewhere in the future? That makes even less sense!"
    "要是我不愿意呢？要是我决定离开呢？{w}难道我出现的地点，还能强迫我未来必须待在某个地方？这更说不通！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061572_1_11a03f90:
    # "I frowned, curious. What would actually happen? I had never traveled with knowledge of how the replicated location worked, but it seemed like having that knowledge alone would break the rule—I would no longer replicate the location in the future through some weird, unconscious fate."
    "我皱起眉，有点好奇。实际会发生什么？以前穿越时，我从不知道复现地点是怎么一回事；但光是知道这一点，似乎就足以打破规律——我不会再被某种诡异而无意识的命运推着，在未来复现那个地点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061573_1_0692d169:
    # "I mean, if I do appear in the kitchen, can I refuse to be there in the future? Can I risk doing that just out of curiosity?{w} What if it's the universe's rule? Would I end up not trying to go against it out of fear of what might happen, which would confirm the impossibility of being in a paradoxical location?"
    "我是说，假如我真出现在厨房，难道我能在未来拒绝待在那里吗？只因为好奇，我就敢冒这个险吗？{w}万一这是宇宙定下的规律呢？我会不会因为害怕后果而不敢违逆，结果反倒坐实了「不可能待在悖论地点」这件事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061574_1_66579b0a:
    # "That's pretty similar to not attempting to change the past just in case it's not possible, but it can't be fought, can it?"
    "这和「以防万一改变不了，就干脆不去尝试改变过去」差不多，可这种事根本没法抗拒，不是吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061575_1_c1c7e978:
    # "...And yet it doesn't make sense. Why would I purposely be somewhere just because it's where I appeared in the past?"
    "……可还是说不通。凭什么只因为我过去曾出现在某处，就要刻意待在那里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061579_1_b889e1bd:
    # "...I wonder. Can I maybe take advantage of it?"
    "……不过，说不准。我能不能反过来利用这一点？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061580_1_114e9b0d:
    # "It doesn't seem fair that figuring out how it works would be a detriment if I intend to travel back. Until now, the rule has been consistent through mere fate, but it wouldn't be the same if I was aware of it as it happened."
    "如果我打算回到过去，弄懂它的运作方式反而会拖我后腿，这未免太不公平。到现在为止，这条规律一直只是靠命运自然维持着一致；可要是我在它发生时就意识到了，情况就不会一样了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061581_1_5e7ea0df:
    # "A way to put the knowledge into practice... Maybe, as long as I have accurate knowledge..."
    "一个能把这份知识付诸实践的办法……或许，只要我的认知足够准确……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061582_1_23ce0afe:
    # "I put the Sekimeiya that had sent me to the past in the refrigerator. After I waited a bit, I took it back out."
    "我把送我回到过去的那个Sekimeiya放进冰箱，等了一会儿，再取出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061583_1_e036a9cb:
    # "I set the timer and waited half a minute. Then, I brought my hand toward its glow."
    "我设好计时，等了半分钟，然后把手伸向它的光芒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061584_1_e3edf673:
    # "All right. Will you send me to the living room?"
    "好。你会把我送到客厅去吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061589_1_4e10fb0f:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061590_1_0b4b0af9:
    # "That was where I appeared: in the middle of the room."
    "我出现的地方正是那里：房间正中央。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061591_1_ab1019f5:
    # "And so I waited. I had traveled nine seconds to the past, so the only mandatory rule was that I had to be there after eighteen seconds.{w} ...But I didn't wait there because the universe had forced me to—I did it so that my request could be fulfilled."
    "于是我就在那里等着。我回到了九秒之前，唯一必须满足的规则，就是十八秒后我得待在那里。{w}……不过我留在那里，并非宇宙强迫，而是为了让自己的请求得以实现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061595_1_89532281:
    # "Eighteen seconds later, I was still there."
    "十八秒后，我仍在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061597_1_02e018f1:
    # "Before touching the Sekimeiya, I had thought of what would happen. I had thought that eighteen seconds after appearing in the past, I would be in the living room.{w} Of course, if that was the case, it implied I would appear in the living room, so it was what had happened. Then, to make it possible, I'd remained there, exactly where I'd imagined myself appearing."
    "在碰Sekimeiya之前，我已经想过会发生什么。我心想，回到过去后，过十八秒，我会待在客厅。{w}如果真是这样，那就说明我会出现在客厅——而事实也确实如此。为了让这一切成立，我就一直待在自己想象中的出现地点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061598_1_f32480c5:
    # "I see. So this is the opposite of useless."
    "原来如此。那这非但不是没用，反而很有用。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061599_1_72250b5c:
    # "It's like the thought-up loops that I came up with. As long as the loop is in my head before touching the Sekimeiya, and as long as it can be executed, it will work.{w} \"As long as it can be executed\". Didn't I just travel from the 5th of January to the 15th of December?"
    "这就像我自己设想出来的那些循环。只要在碰Sekimeiya之前，循环已经在我脑中成形，而且它能够被执行，就会成立。{w}「只要能够被执行」——我不就刚从1月5日穿越到了12月15日吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061600_1_04a5a59d:
    # "I went 21 days into the past, and my knowledge of the replicated location came after the travel but before the location is replicated in the future. What the hell happens now?{w} I appeared in the lobby; does that confirm that I'll be alive in the future?"
    "我回到了二十一天前。复现地点的事，我是在穿越之后才知道的，而那个地点要到未来才会复现。现在到底会怎样？{w}我出现在了大厅——这是否就能确认，未来我还活着？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061601_1_3e0587d9:
    # "Doesn't this travel genuinely force me to be in the lobby on the day—"
    "这次穿越不就真的强迫我那天必须待在大厅——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061602_1_c45b3f59:
    # "...{w}I went 21 days to the past.{w} 21 days after January 5th is a Thursday, January 26th..."
    "……{w}我回到了二十一天前。{w}1月5日往后二十一天，是1月26日，星期四……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061605_1_1673b764:
    # "There was something there. That wasn't some random day.{w} Shiroya and I had talked with Miiya about it. We had said that we would go back to the tower on the 26th if we liked it the first time."
    "那天确实有些特别。那并不是随便哪一天。{w}我和Shiroya曾经跟Miiya聊起过。我们说过，如果第一次玩得尽兴，26号就再去一次塔里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061606_1_c9dd1138:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061607_1_08873459:
    # "Miiya had died because of the Sekimeiya—without the Sekimeiya's existence, the explosion wouldn't have occurred, and Miiya would've kept on living. Ashiya held an event in the tower every Thursday, and on January 26th, a Thursday, an event that had grabbed our attention would take place.{w} If the Sekimeiya hadn't existed, we would've been in the tower on January 26th. Even after Miiya's death, if no travels had taken place, it was feasible that Shiroya and I would've returned to continue healing and moving forward. But from what I understood, our reason for returning would be different—to satisfy a travel that had already happened."
    "Miiya是因Sekimeiya而死的——若Sekimeiya不曾存在，那场爆炸就不会发生，Miiya也会继续活下去。芦屋每周四都会在塔里举办活动，而1月26日正是星期四，那天会有一场引起我们注意的活动。{w}若Sekimeiya不存在，1月26日我们本就会在塔里。即便Miiya死后、没有任何穿越发生，我和Shiroya也很有可能回到那里，继续疗伤、继续向前走。但据我所知，我们回去的理由会不一样——为了让一次已经发生过的穿越成立。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061608_1_33eb6add:
    # "What was the exact truth hidden behind that? I didn't know, but it confirmed again that the locations where we appeared were in no way random."
    "那背后究竟藏着怎样的真相？我不知道，但这再次证实了：我们出现的地点绝非随机。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061611_1_ffdd807a:
    # "This means that I can pretty much teleport anywhere I want, doesn't it?{w} I just have to think about where I'll be in the future. The limit is that the location has to be possible to reach in a set time. Is that it?"
    "也就是说，我几乎能传送到任何想去的地方，对吧？{w}我只要想好自己未来会在哪里就行。限制只在于，那个地点必须能在规定时间内抵达。是这样吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061615_1_34ed2720:
    # "I went to the kitchen and briefly put the Past Sekimeiya in the refrigerator. Once it had stored energy for thirty seconds, I touched it."
    "我去了厨房，把过去Sekimeiya放进冰箱里待了一会儿。等它蓄能三十秒后，我碰了它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061619_1_8c1d9214:
    # "Once more, I appeared in the living room, where I'd wanted to appear.{w} I looked at my hands, but they were empty."
    "我再一次出现在客厅，也就是我想出现的地方。{w}我看了看自己的手，手上空无一物。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061620_1_c95f0eee:
    # "I see. I guess that was too nonsensical to work."
    "原来如此。看来那太荒唐了，自然不会成立。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061621_1_23101597:
    # "Before touching the Sekimeiya, I had thought that I'd be in the living room with a chocolate bar in my hands. By appearing there with the chocolate, I would be able to have it in the future so that it could appear in the past.{w} Presumably, that hadn't worked because I could never have obtained that chocolate in the span of those seconds, so I went back to the kitchen after I waited the proper amount of time."
    "在碰Sekimeiya之前，我想的是：我会出现在客厅，手里拿着一块巧克力。只要我带着巧克力出现在那里，未来我就能拥有它，好让它出现在过去。{w}大概正因为在那几秒之内我根本不可能拿到那块巧克力，这招才没有奏效。于是等够时间后，我又回到厨房。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061626_1_de1a0524:
    # "Once again, I touched the Past Sekimeiya after it had gathered energy for thirty seconds."
    "等过去Sekimeiya完成三十秒蓄能，我再一次碰了它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061630_1_1966ddfb:
    # "After I appeared in the living room, I looked at my hands.{w} I was holding a pen."
    "出现在客厅后，我看了看自己的手。{w}手里握着一支笔。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061631_1_bddc7aa0:
    # "I looked next to the television and saw the same pen."
    "我看向电视机旁，那里放着同一支笔。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061632_1_d8166173:
    # "I see... This does work."
    "原来如此……这样确实可行。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061633_1_01fdc2f4:
    # "Before touching the Sekimeiya, I'd thought that I would appear in the living room, and that during those eighteen seconds, I would go grab the pen. That was why I had appeared with it.{w} However, I already had the pen. I didn't have to go get it; I could simply stay where I'd appeared so that I could appear with it."
    "在触碰 Sekimeiya 之前，我以为自己会出现在客厅，然后在那十八秒里去拿笔——正因为这样，我才会带着笔出现。{w} 可笔本来就已经在我手上了。我根本不必去拿，只要一直待在自己出现的位置不动，就能带着它出现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061634_1_ec0e541e:
    # "Eighteen seconds went by, and I didn't step away from where I'd appeared."
    "十八秒过去，我一步也没有离开自己出现的位置。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061635_1_ffd980c0:
    # "So, even though I never obtained the pen myself, I was able to appear with it solely because I could have obtained it. I effectively duplicated the pen, but I can't spawn objects that don't exist or I can't feasibly obtain before the future coordinate, like the chocolate. And this only happened because I thought of my actions before touching the Sekimeiya."
    "也就是说，我本人压根没拿到过那支笔，只因为「本可以拿到」，就能带着它一起出现。我等于把那支笔复制了一份；但不存在的东西，或者在未来坐标之前根本不可能到手的东西——比如那块巧克力——就没法凭空弄出来。而这一切之所以成立，只因为我在触碰 Sekimeiya 之前就已经想好了自己要做的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061638_1_6537f27f:
    # "It was a fascinating concept, and an incredibly strong one. Simply by having awareness of a single rule, the Sekimeiya had grown drastically more useful."
    "这个概念很有意思，也强得惊人。仅仅是意识到这样一条规则，Sekimeiya 的用处就一下子大了许多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061639_1_7ff04cff:
    # "If I touch the Past Sekimeiya while I'm holding the pen now, I'll appear with it in the past. However, that's possible only as long as I have it in the proportional future."
    "如果我现在拿着笔去触碰过去Sekimeiya，我就会带着它出现在过去。但前提是：在与之对应的未来，我仍然持有它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061640_1_8c74a37e:
    # "So when I touch the Sekimeiya, if I either think that I'll let go of the pen before the time expires or otherwise wouldn't have it, I won't appear with it. I would be instantly annihilating the pen without having to actually get rid of it. Even though I should appear with it, I wouldn't."
    "所以，触碰 Sekimeiya 时，只要我认定自己会在时间结束前松手，或者认定自己届时不会持有它，我就不会带着它出现。这样一来，我不必真的把笔丢掉，就能让它当场湮灭。明明本该带着它出现，结果却没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061647_1_f6555de6:
    # "Exactly. On January 5th, Shiroya traveled to December 15th and noticed that out of the things she'd been holding, only her phone had disappeared."
    "正是如此。1月5日，Shiroya 穿越到12月15日，随后发现：自己原本拿着的东西里，只有手机不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061648_1_d2431760:
    # "Why?{w} She appeared in the lobby of the tower, and the future coordinate was January 26th. I'm sure you haven't forgotten that phones are strictly prohibited in the tower: she couldn't have been there with it in the future, so she appeared without it in the past."
    "为什么？{w} 她出现在塔的大厅，而未来坐标是1月26日。想必你还记得，塔内严禁携带手机：在未来，她不可能带着手机待在那里，所以她在过去出现时，手机也就不在了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061649_1_cb3a520a:
    # "You might have realized that the same thing happened to the \"XYN\" card, which she didn't think about, and her clothes. Unlike Atsuki, she didn't appear with the ones she'd been wearing. ...That's still strange, isn't it?"
    "你可能已经想到了，那张她根本没放在心上的「XYN」卡，还有她身上的衣服，也是同样的情况。和 Atsuki 不同，她出现时穿的不是原先那一套。……这仍然很奇怪，不是吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061651_1_1883a192:
    # "The knife disappeared from Shiroya's purse when she traveled to the future because she didn't have it in the past, so it would've been impossible for her to appear with it."
    "Shiroya 穿越到未来时，小刀从她的手包里消失了，因为她在过去并没有带着它，也就不可能带着它出现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061652_1_bf9451b3:
    # "But on January 5th, when she traveled to December 15th, she noticed that out of the things she'd been holding, only her phone had disappeared. She didn't think about it, but the \"XYN\" card did as well, and her clothes had changed."
    "可是1月5日她穿越到12月15日时，发现手里拿着的东西中，只有手机不见了。她并未留意，但那张「XYN」卡同样消失了，她的衣服也变了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061653_1_b91b9490:
    # "Why?{w} She appeared in the lobby of the tower, and the future coordinate was January 26th. I'm sure you haven't forgotten that phones are strictly prohibited in the tower: she couldn't have been there with it in the future, so she appeared without it in the past."
    "为什么？{w} 她出现在塔的大厅，而未来坐标是1月26日。想必你还记得，塔内严禁携带手机：在未来，她不可能带着手机待在那里，所以她在过去出现时，手机也就不在了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061655_1_6860932b:
    # "The cleaning cart disappeared when Shiroya traveled to the future because she didn't have it in the past, so it would've been impossible for her to appear with it."
    "Shiroya 穿越到未来时，清洁推车消失了，因为她在过去并没有推着它，也就不可能带着它出现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061656_1_a1500e20:
    # "But on January 5th, when she traveled to December 15th, she noticed that out of the things she'd been holding, only her phone had disappeared. She didn't think about it, but the \"XYN\" card did as well, and her clothes had changed."
    "可是1月5日她穿越到12月15日时，发现手里拿着的东西中，只有手机不见了。她并未留意，但那张「XYN」卡同样消失了，她的衣服也变了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061657_1_a90c1bb6:
    # "Why?{w} She appeared in the lobby of the tower, and the future coordinate was January 26th. I'm sure you haven't forgotten that phones are strictly prohibited in the tower: she couldn't have been there with it in the future, so she appeared without it in the past."
    "为什么？{w} 她出现在塔的大厅，而未来坐标是1月26日。想必你还记得，塔内严禁携带手机：在未来，她不可能带着手机待在那里，所以她在过去出现时，手机也就不在了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061662_1_2b1c187a:
    # "This is pretty insane. I can't believe the mechanics actually followed some rules."
    "这简直离谱。没想到这套机制居然真的遵循着某种规则。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061663_1_09e675f8:
    # "I was overwhelmed by the number of things I was learning, but I didn't want to focus on a single detail. I didn't know if anyone else would come back at some point, and there were plenty of aspects I was wondering about."
    "一下子学到这么多东西，我有些应接不暇，但我不想只盯着某一点。我不知道会不会有别人在某个时候回来，而且还有不少地方让我挂心。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061664_1_e9fe7402:
    # "How much can I figure out with what I know? Was Sai aware of all this? He had a wristwatch, so I bet it would've been a lot easier for him to learn some of it.{w} There were two Sekimeiya since this morning, but what about the third one? Does that one never work...?"
    "凭我现在知道的东西，能推出多少？Sai 清楚这些吗？他有一只手表，要弄明白其中几件事，想必比我容易得多。{w} 从今天早上起就有两个 Sekimeiya，那第三个呢？它难道永远不会启动……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061665_1_8e2ed45e:
    # "And one made us travel back in time, while the other sent us forward.{w} If I know the time someone appeared in the future, I can know that's where they were in the past—there are many ways to apply all of this.{w} I wonder... When someone travels to the past, if I think that I'll bring them somewhere in the future, would I make them appear there in the past? Could the origin be in my mind even though I'm not the one traveling?"
    "而且，一个让我们回到过去，另一个把我们送往未来。{w} 只要知道某人出现在未来的时刻，就能知道他在过去身处何处——这些信息能派上很多用场。{w} 我在想……如果有人要穿越到过去，而我认定自己会在未来把他带到某个地方，那他在过去是不是就会出现在那里？即便穿越的人不是我，原点也可能出在我的意识里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061671_1_0f9e7c9b:
    # "I tried to calm down a bit and went to the kitchen. It was better to answer the larger questions first."
    "我让自己稍微冷静下来，走进厨房。还是先弄清更重要的问题为好。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061672_1_20a6dd95:
    # "Wait a second. I can duplicate anything obtainable, can't I?"
    "等等。只要东西能到手，我就能把它复制出来，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061673_1_781f2fbe:
    # "We wondered whether duplicating the Sekimeiya was possible, but it doesn't appear to be the case. When it's activated, it doesn't count as something you possess, and it stays behind."
    "我们曾怀疑 Sekimeiya 能否被复制，看来答案是否定的。它启动时不算你持有的东西，会留在原地。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061674_1_af63bf95:
    # "Now I'm certain that the Sai with the broken wristwatch came from the future, and he had a Sekimeiya in his hip pack. He acted as if he didn't know it was there, so perhaps that was the truth."
    "现在我确定了：那个手表坏掉的 Sai 来自未来，他的腰包里有一个 Sekimeiya。他表现得好像并不知道那东西在里面，说不定那确实是实话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061675_1_eab01570:
    # "Maybe he appeared with it. An important detail is that it was inactive.{w} If he hid a powered-off Sekimeiya in his hip pack in the future, it's possible he appeared with it in the past."
    "也许他是带着它一起出现的。关键的一点是，它当时处于关闭状态。{w} 如果他在未来把一个关掉的 Sekimeiya 藏进腰包，那他穿越回过去时就有可能带着它出现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061676_1_6fd03300:
    # "Trying it was simple. First, I used the Past Sekimeiya to travel nine seconds to the past."
    "验证起来很简单。我先用 过去Sekimeiya 穿越到九秒之前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061681_1_62625dcd:
    # "In the living room, I waited eighteen seconds before I reentered the kitchen."
    "我在客厅里等了十八秒，才重新走进厨房。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061682_1_f3c3697d:
    # "The Sekimeiya will now spend a little while powered off."
    "这样一来，Sekimeiya 会关闭一阵子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061686_1_e63b8d59:
    # "I took the Future Sekimeiya out of the refrigerator and grabbed the disabled Past Sekimeiya.{w} Half a minute later, I left it on the countertop and touched the Future Sekimeiya."
    "我从冰箱里取出 未来Sekimeiya，再拿起那个已经无法使用的 过去Sekimeiya。{w} 半分钟后，我把它放在台面上，触碰了 未来Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061687_1_216bfbbd:
    # "I appeared in the kitchen nine seconds in the future. Then, I glanced at my hands."
    "我出现在九秒后的厨房，然后低头看了看自己的手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061693_1_b94d88cd:
    # "It was there. Still gray, I had it in my hands."
    "它就在那儿。它还是灰色的，正被我握在手里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061694_1_370b4df1:
    # "Did I really duplicate it...?"
    "我真的把它复制出来了吗……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061695_1_e805b043:
    # "I looked at the marble, where I'd left the Past Sekimeiya before traveling."
    "我望向那张大理石台面——穿越之前，我把 过去Sekimeiya 放在了那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061696_1_f7678b79:
    # "What!? It's not there!"
    "什么！？它不在那儿！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061697_1_5ddd2962:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061698_1_d08437cf:
    # "The Future Sekimeiya was where I'd touched it, and it was gray. That proved I'd traveled to the future. However, the original Past Sekimeiya was gone: I hadn't duplicated it."
    "未来Sekimeiya 仍在我触碰它的地方，颜色是灰的。这证明我确实穿越到了未来。可是，原本那个 过去Sekimeiya 却不见了——我并没有把它复制出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061699_1_4334045c:
    # "What the hell? Can the Sekimeiya not be duplicated?{w} It seems like the original one disappeared when I appeared with it in the future and disallowed the duplication. There's no way anyone came and took it during the nine seconds I wasn't here, right?"
    "搞什么？难道 Sekimeiya 不能被复制？{w} 看来，我带着它在未来出现之后，复制就没能成立，原本那一个也跟着消失了。总不可能有人趁我不在的那九秒里把它拿走吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061700_1_6d622d98:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061703_1_449c8623:
    # "It was bizarre, but the fact that I'd appeared with it was notable. It had counted as one of my past possessions."
    "这很离奇，但我能带着它一起出现，这点值得注意。它确实算是我过去持有的物品之一。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061704_1_46c321df:
    # "While I was thinking, the Past Sekimeiya powered on."
    "就在我思考的时候，过去Sekimeiya 启动了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061705_1_19974ae4:
    # "It's still working.{w} I wonder if the fact that it was powered off mattered at all."
    "它还能用。{w} 不知道它当时关着到底有没有影响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061706_1_d3c88617:
    # "I repeated the same process but held the powered Past Sekimeiya with my sleeves for half a minute.{w} Then, I left it in the refrigerator to avoid overlapping ranges and went nine seconds to the future."
    "我又按同样的步骤做了一遍，只是这次隔着袖子，把启动中的过去Sekimeiya握了半分钟。{w} 然后，为了避免范围重叠，我把它放进冰箱，再穿越到九秒后。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061708_1_76747add:
    # "...{w}I didn't appear with the Sekimeiya. My hands looked to be holding something that wasn't there."
    "……{w}我没有带着 Sekimeiya 出现。两手还保持着握东西的姿势，可手里空无一物。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061709_1_6a0253fd:
    # "I opened the refrigerator and saw the Past Sekimeiya where I'd just left it."
    "我打开冰箱，看见过去Sekimeiya 还在我刚放下的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061710_1_ceaba5c8:
    # "So it did matter that it wasn't active. When it isn't, its powers fade temporarily, and it acts as a normal object."
    "看来它没有启动，这一点确实有影响。未启动时，它的力量会暂时消退，变得和普通物品一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061711_1_3f44b8c7:
    # "What would happen if I did the reverse of this? Wouldn't the past change?{w} If I go to the past holding the powered-off Future Sekimeiya, I would appear with it in the past, so the \"original\" one would disappear. That means that I couldn't hold it anymore when I'm traveling to the past, thereby changing it."
    "如果把顺序反过来，会怎么样？过去不就会被改变吗？{w} 如果我拿着关闭状态的 未来Sekimeiya 回到过去，我就会带着它在过去出现，那么「原本」那一个就会消失。也就是说，我穿越回过去时不可能还拿着它——过去就这样被改写了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061714_1_56794bf1:
    # "I tried it out of curiosity. Holding the Future Sekimeiya that I'd powered off, I went nine seconds to the past."
    "出于好奇，我试了一次。我拿着那个被我关掉的 未来Sekimeiya，穿越到九秒之前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061718_1_552d6198:
    # "In the living room, however, I didn't have the Future Sekimeiya between my hands."
    "可我在客厅现身时，两手之间并没有未来Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061719_1_cb79147c:
    # "It didn't work? I thought that I would stay here for eighteen seconds with the Sekimeiya, so that's strange."
    "没成功？我明明打算带着 Sekimeiya 在这里待满十八秒，真是奇怪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061720_1_6954fcd1:
    # "Suddenly, I heard a sound coming from the kitchen. It scared me at first, but I immediately understood what it was.{w} Nine seconds later, I entered through the door."
    "忽然，厨房里传来一阵声响。我起初被吓了一跳，但马上就明白那是什么了。{w} 九秒后，我从门口走了进来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061724_1_73e91801:
    # "The disabled Sekimeiya was on the floor. It hadn't disappeared alongside my past self."
    "那个已经失效的 Sekimeiya 躺在地板上。它并没有随过去的我一同消失。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061725_1_5f52c3d1:
    # "Why, though? I don't get it.{w} ...Wait, no, I might have an idea."
    "可是为什么？我想不通。{w}……等等，不对，我或许有点头绪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061732_1_a91d2c9d:
    # "I think it's due to the infinite loop concept I thought of.{w} If I had appeared with the powered-off Future Sekimeiya in the past, eighteen seconds later, it would've been closer to powering on. Once the infinite loop is applied, the Sekimeiya could've never appeared powered off, and when it's powered on, it doesn't count as a normal object. I believe that's why it didn't travel."
    "我想，这跟先前设想的无限循环有关。{w}如果关掉的未来Sekimeiya随我一起出现在过去，那么十八秒后，它就更接近启动状态。套用无限循环后，Sekimeiya 就绝不可能以关闭状态出现；而启动状态下，它又不算普通物体。我认为这就是它没有跟着我穿越的原因。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061733_1_e8fee0b6:
    # "...What exactly would happen if I wait in the middle of the living room for a few seconds, move the sofa to where I'd been standing, and then travel to the future?"
    "……如果我站在客厅中央等上几秒，把沙发挪到我刚才站的位置，再穿越到未来，究竟会发生什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061734_1_e440e4ca:
    # "My appearance would collide with the sofa, but what would that do? Would I overwrite part of the sofa? Would it cut off my legs and kill me?"
    "我出现时会与沙发相撞，可那会造成什么后果？我会覆盖掉沙发的一部分吗？还是沙发会截断我的双腿，要了我的命？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061735_1_6dbeff82:
    # "It's too risky to test that, but I have no idea what the result would be. After all, I've been appearing where there is air, and it seems I'm overwriting it, or else it would also kill me."
    "拿这个做实验太危险了，可我完全猜不到会怎样。毕竟我每次出现的地方都有空气，看样子是我把空气覆盖掉了；不然空气也会要了我的命。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061736_1_b2d22bc5:
    # "The case might be different if I appear on top of a solid object, though."
    "不过，如果我出现在某个固体物体上面，情况也许就不一样了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061743_1_14d4271f:
    # "Indeed. That is the fate Sai A met."
    "正是。那便是 Sai A 所遭遇的命运。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061745_1_53d8df7d:
    # "Incorrect. That is the fate Sai A met."
    "不对。那才是 Sai A 遭遇的命运。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061749_1_7458aa4c:
    # "In his world, he was the first person to leave room B4, in which everyone waited."
    "在他的世界里，所有人都等在 B4 房间，而他是第一个离开的人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061750_1_3fbd7d51:
    # "After his departure, he never came back. He was never again seen alive."
    "他离开之后，再没有回来。从此没人见过活着的他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061753_1_a3f73dc0:
    # "Unaware of what awaited him, he touched the Future Sekimeiya that had been hidden in the attic."
    "他并不知道等待自己的是什么，伸手碰了那个藏在阁楼里的未来Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061757_1_c341ded9:
    # "For a prolonged period of time, he had been sitting against a door in a crystal room. However, when he appeared there in the future, that door had been opened..."
    "他曾在水晶展室里靠着一扇门坐了很久。可当他穿越到未来、出现在那里时，那扇门已经被人打开了……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061765_1_6de12813:
    # "I've been figuring all of this out, but I still don't fully understand the most important aspect: the amount of time traveled.{w} I've been repeatedly traveling nine seconds through time, so it has to be consistent as well."
    "这些我已经一点点理清了，可最关键的一点仍没弄明白：穿越的时间长度。{w}我反复穿越的都是九秒，那它也应该是一致的才对。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061766_1_9074e6a3:
    # "Thirty seconds stored equals nine seconds traveled. Two minutes stored equals 45 seconds traveled.{w} There's already an indication here: each stored second turns into more amount of time traveled than the previous. In the first case, each second stored added 0.3 seconds traveled. In the second case, each second stored added 0.37 seconds traveled."
    "蓄能三十秒，穿越九秒；蓄能两分钟，穿越 45 秒。{w}这里已经有迹象了：每多蓄一秒，换算出的穿越时间都比前一秒更多。第一种情况，每蓄一秒增加 0.3 秒；第二种情况，每蓄一秒增加 0.37 秒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061767_1_693c7467:
    # "And it's evident this keeps going—fifteen minutes stored led into twenty minutes traveled. In that case, each second stored added 1.3 seconds.{w} Earlier, keeping the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet for 25 minutes made me travel about 45 minutes to the past. That's a pretty noticeable increase. Each stored second would've counted for 1.8 seconds traveled."
    "而且很明显，这个趋势还在延续——蓄能十五分钟，穿越二十分钟。这样算下来，每蓄一秒等于 1.3 秒。{w}之前我把 Sekimeiya 放在展示柜外二十五分钟，结果穿越到了约四十五分钟前。增幅相当明显，每蓄一秒已经相当于 1.8 秒的穿越时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061770_1_25df0f1b:
    # "So the more time it's gathered, the larger the increase is. It's exponential.{w} The difference between five and ten minutes is very little compared to the difference between twenty and 25. For a while, the numbers will be low, but there'll be a point where they suddenly become immense.{w} Once the Sekimeiya has been out of the cabinet for 35 minutes, how much will one stored second equal to?{w} ...What about after an hour?"
    "也就是说，蓄能越久，增幅越大。这是指数级的。{w}五分钟到十分钟的差距，跟二十分钟到二十五分钟的差距相比微不足道。起初数值会很低，但总有一刻会突然变得极其庞大。{w}Sekimeiya 离开展示柜三十五分钟后，蓄一秒会等于多少？{w}……那一小时之后呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061771_1_763a32f8:
    # "There's an indication that I'm correct about this: Akaro and Shiroya.{w} They traveled days through time, and so did I. Akaro said he touched the Sekimeiya while we were in the attic's bedroom, so it's very possible it stored energy for a long time."
    "有件事可以证明我猜得没错：Akaro 和 Shiroya。{w}他们穿越了数日之久，我也是。Akaro 说，我们还在阁楼卧室时他碰过 Sekimeiya，所以它很可能已经蓄能了很长时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061772_1_04c98511:
    # "In any case, the increase of the time traveled is not gradual. However, I think something might be."
    "无论如何，穿越时间的增长不是渐进的。不过我认为，有另一样东西或许是渐进的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061779_1_2537006b:
    # "The range. That's what all the travels indicate."
    "重叠范围。所有的穿越都指向这一点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061780_1_1e790c95:
    # "Although I still don't fully comprehend it, I believe it must work under a gradual increase. Otherwise, when Akaro and Shiroya traveled days through time, we would've traveled as well."
    "虽然我还没完全弄懂它，但我认为它的变化一定是渐进的。否则 Akaro 和 Shiroya 穿越了数天，我们也该一起穿越了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061781_1_34544f78:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061782_1_f9bd50ee:
    # "There is something else that could follow a similar progression, which is the time it spends recovering.{w} No matter the amount of time traveled, the Sekimeiya always spends a while gray. However, the amount of time stored seems to gradually add to the guaranteed amount."
    "还有另一样东西也可能呈现类似的渐进变化，那就是它的恢复时间。{w}无论穿越多久，Sekimeiya 总会维持一段灰色状态。不过，蓄能的时长似乎会一点点累加到那段保底时间上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061786_1_31b52718:
    # "There's gotta be a formula behind the amount of time traveled that always applies."
    "穿越的时长背后一定有一个始终成立的公式。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061787_1_86993f0f:
    # "What could it be? A formula that increases the amount each second adds as more seconds have passed...{w} If I could figure it out, I could use the Sekimeiya to appear at any point in time."
    "会是什么公式？蓄能秒数越多，每秒换算出的时长也跟着增加的公式……{w}如果能解出来，我就能用 Sekimeiya 出现在任何时间点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061788_1_d66bdd13:
    # "Thankfully, if it doesn't change over time, I could do small-scale tests to figure out what exactly would occur at a larger scale; observing the difference between 30, 31, 32, 33, 34, and 35 stored seconds might be all I need to understand what one hour of stored time would cause."
    "好在只要公式不随时间改变，我就能用小规模实验推知大规模的结果；只要比较蓄能 30、31、32、33、34、35 秒之间的差异，或许就足以弄清蓄能一小时会带来什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061789_1_8e8d238f:
    # "But my way to measure time isn't precise, and I can't measure decimals. I might need a calculator too, and I don't know if there'd be one here in the attic."
    "可我计时的方式并不精确，也量不出小数。也许还需要计算器，而我不知道这阁楼里有没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061792_1_74076b08:
    # "Why was I so preoccupied with the idea? Was it due to mere curiosity?{w} No. That wasn't all. At some point, I had realized it."
    "我为什么对这件事如此执着？只是出于好奇吗？{w}不，不只是这样。在某个时候，我已经意识到了这一点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061793_1_4df9fa7a:
    # "While locked in the tower for twelve hours, I'd spent a long time trying to figure out if saving Miiya was possible. And I knew, at that moment, that it was.{w} However, those thoughts had all faded from my mind some time previously. Shiroya had caused me to abandon the idea of saving her.{w} But I'd learned that wasn't the real Shiroya, and it made a lot of sense—she would never have said that. She had wanted to save Miiya just like me and had been prepared to do it once I'd told her it was possible."
    "被困在塔里的那十二个小时里，我花了很长时间思考救下 Miiya 是否可行。而在那一刻，我就已经知道这是可行的。{w}可那些念头，之前不知什么时候已经从我心里淡去了。是 Shiroya 让我放弃了救 Miiya 的念头。{w}但我后来知道，那不是真正的 Shiroya——这就说得通了，她绝不会说出那种话。她和我一样想救 Miiya，只要我告诉她这是可行的，她早就准备好了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061794_1_e31a1a79:
    # "Had I truly heard Miiya earlier? ...That voice continually replayed in my head, but I couldn't understand the circumstances around it."
    "我先前真的听到了 Miiya 的声音吗？……那个声音在我脑中反复回响，可我理不清它究竟是怎么来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061797_1_770c6816:
    # "I don't know how reasonable this is. After a while of storing time, being off by even a single decimal would result in a substantial difference..."
    "我不知道这个办法有多可靠。蓄能时间一长，哪怕只差一个小数位，结果也会天差地别……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061798_1_d708195b:
    # "Even if I analyze repeated short travels to the future, it might take me a really long time to come up with an accurate equation with just these two timers."
    "就算反复分析短时间穿越到未来的情况，光靠这两个计时器要推出准确的公式，恐怕也得花上很久。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061799_1_2414c64e:
    # "I had no idea how long I'd be alone in the tower, but I couldn't afford to spend hours perfecting a formula. I didn't even know if it was consistent in the first place."
    "我不知道自己还要在塔里独自待多久，但耗不起几个小时去打磨一个公式。何况我连它是否始终一致都还不知道。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061801_1_22f08289:
    # "My mind went back to a thought I'd had long in the past. When I'd originally conceived of thought-up loops, I'd also considered a particular scenario."
    "我想起了很久以前有过的某个念头。最初构思假想循环的时候，我也曾设想过一种特定的情形。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061806_1_afaf5716:
    # "\"Depending on how it works, the possibilities could be limitless. There's even a higher step to reach.\""
    "取决于它如何运作，可能性也许无穷无尽，甚至还有更高的一层可以达到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061807_1_d496d7dd:
    # "\"It's considerably different, but it follows along with a few things I thought about earlier, regarding the date displayed on Sai's watch.\""
    "「这跟之前大不一样，却和我早先关于 Sai 手表上那个日期的几点想法对得上。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061808_1_db1b5a2b:
    # "\"Out of the countless examples, could you go back in time, trade information with someone, write it all down, and leave it all on a note that you'd see before traveling through time?\""
    "在无数种例子里，有没有这样一种：你回到过去，和某人交换信息，把一切写下来，全都留在一张便条上，好让自己在穿越时间之前看到？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061809_1_474bb066:
    # "\"You'd read the note and go back to the past. However, since you would already know the contents of it, you'd have no reason to exchange the information—all you'd have to do is leave behind the note you'd read so that you could read it before traveling.\""
    "你读到那张便条，然后回到过去。可既然你已经知道上面的内容，就没有理由再去交换信息——你只需把读过的那张便条留下，让自己在穿越前读到它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061810_1_4fdcc723:
    # "\"The note itself would be a paradox that you caused, but was the past truly changed? Was a past in which you exchanged information truly overwritten? ...Or did it never exist in the first place?\""
    "那张便条本身会是你造成的悖论，但过去真的被改变了吗？那个你曾交换信息的过去，真的被覆盖了吗？……还是说，它从一开始就不存在？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061811_1_9b8faf03:
    # "\"...If Sai's watch got to \"9999-12-31\" by spending infinite time in a loop, did the pasts in which the time counted up to that date really exist in any capacity?\""
    "……如果 Sai 的手表是在循环中度过了无限时间才走到「9999-12-31」，那么那些让表上的时间累积到那个日期的过去，到底有没有以任何形式存在过？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061817_1_ccb79980:
    # "...Would something like that actually be possible?"
    "……这种事真的可能发生吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061818_1_7b65bb9b:
    # "I don't have the time needed to find an equation that lets me calculate time values for the Sekimeiya, but as long as it's possible to find, could I use something like this to obtain it?"
    "我没有时间去推导一条能算出 Sekimeiya 时间数值的公式，但只要它确实可以被找到，我能不能用这种办法把它弄到手？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061819_1_0d93e95b:
    # "How long would it take me to find it? Maybe two hours of monitoring innumerable travels?"
    "找到它需要多久？也许要花两个小时，盯着无数次穿越？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061820_1_e5c2686c:
    # "If I extrapolate my old scenario to this, it would look something like... going two hours back in time, spending them working to find the formula, and noting it down on a piece of paper that I would hide inside a drawer. Before traveling two hours back, I would find the note, and in the past, as I would already know the formula, I would just have to write it down and leave it in the drawer."
    "把旧设想套用到这件事上，大概会是这样……回到两小时前，用这两个小时推导公式，再把它记在纸上，藏进抽屉。而在进行这次穿越之前，我会先找到那张纸条；回到过去后，既然我已经知道公式，只需把它写下来放进抽屉即可。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061821_1_04089c6a:
    # "But this isn't applicable, because if I go two hours back, I won't have access to the Sekimeiya. I've been testing with them, so if I go back and use them, I'll be changing the past, and the note will not be written in my current reality."
    "但这行不通，因为回到两小时前，我就拿不到 Sekimeiya 了。我一直在用它们做实验，如果回去之后继续使用，就等于改变了过去，那张纸条也就不会出现在我当前的现实里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061824_1_567e6c1c:
    # "But what if I change it up a little?"
    "不过，如果我稍作改动呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061825_1_77076454:
    # "Let's say I take the Past Sekimeiya out of the refrigerator. Two minutes later, I touch it and go 45 seconds back. I'm not even sure if this first travel would be needed, but it might be."
    "假设我把过去Sekimeiya从冰箱里拿出来。两分钟后，我碰它一下，回到 45 秒前。我还不确定这第一次穿越有没有必要，但也许有必要。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061826_1_05c284db:
    # "Then, 45 seconds later, my original self will disappear, and I'll spend two hours testing with both Sekimeiya to come up with the right formula. Once I have it, I'll go back in time to a point before I traveled the 45 seconds and write down the formula."
    "接着，45 秒之后，原本的我会消失，而我将用两个小时，拿两个 Sekimeiya 反复试验，推出正确的公式。一旦得到公式，我就回到进行那 45 秒穿越之前的某个时刻，把公式写下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061827_1_42a4efdd:
    # "Before traveling the 45 seconds, I'll read the note with the formula. Then, 45 seconds in the past, I'll write it down so that my original self can see it.{w} Would this allow me to spend two hours finding the formula without actually having to waste that time?"
    "在穿越那 45 秒之前，我会先读那张写着公式的纸条。然后回到 45 秒前，把它写下来，好让原本的我能看到。{w}这样一来，我岂不是能花两个小时找出公式，却又不必真的耗掉那两个小时？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061828_1_abbff1dc:
    # "There was no point in assuming an answer because it was easy to test. I readied myself to perform the loop and started to store time with the Past Sekimeiya.{w} However, when I looked at the drawer where I wanted the note to be hidden, it was empty."
    "凭空假定答案没有意义，因为这件事一试便知。我做好准备，要执行这个循环，便用过去Sekimeiya开始蓄能。{w}然而，当我看向那个准备用来藏纸条的抽屉时，里面空无一物。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061831_1_5c5eb22c:
    # "Huh, okay. ...Why did it not work?"
    "咦，好吧。……可为什么没成功呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061832_1_28e4958b:
    # "The success of the loop required the existence of hypothetical events. In reality, if I had seen the note, I would never have spent two hours working to find the formula—those events would only have existed in a hypothetical history. Once their result was known, their existence would've become unneeded."
    "循环要成立，假想事件就必须存在。可在现实中，如果我已经看到了那张纸条，就绝不会再花两个小时去推公式——那些事只会存在于一段假想的历史里。一旦结果已知，它们也就没有存在的必要了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061833_1_b9e93824:
    # "Am I mistaken, then? Is this concept just unworkable?{w} That can't be. It's the same thing as the recorder powering off when I go to the past: the hypothetical realities in which it progressively loses battery need to exist in order for it to appear without power in the real one."
    "那么是我想错了？这套思路根本行不通？{w}不可能。这跟我回到过去时录音笔会断电是一个道理：它只有在那些假想世界里一点点耗尽电量，才会在真正的现实里以没电的状态出现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061834_1_616c8e64:
    # "Although I didn't fully understand that, as the recorder not degrading physically still didn't make sense to me."
    "不过我没能完全想明白：录音笔本身明明没有任何损耗，这一点我怎么也想不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061835_1_d24f3d40:
    # "What if it didn't work because two hours wouldn't have been enough to determine the formula? Or what if, during those two hours, people would've shown up and I would've been unable to continue and go to the past to leave the note behind?"
    "会不会是因为两个小时根本不够推出公式？又或者，那两个小时里有人来了，我无法继续，也没法回到过去把纸条留下？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061838_1_eeb90b7d:
    # "If two hours wouldn't have been enough, what about ten? What if it would've taken me more than twenty hours to refine the formula until it was consistent with every travel?"
    "两个小时不够，那十个小时呢？要把公式修正到与每一次穿越都吻合，说不定得花上二十多个小时。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061839_1_a2d4ecd8:
    # "The tower will open at {time=21}, so assuming no one else comes, even in a hypothetical world, I would only have until {time=21} to experiment... Actually, probably way less than that, because to travel to the past and appear in the tower, I'd have to be inside it hours after {time=21.}"
    "塔在 {time=21} 开放，所以假设没有别人来，即便在假想世界里，我也只能在 {time=21} 之前做实验……不，实际能用的时间恐怕还要短得多：要回到过去并出现在塔里，我得在 {time=21.} 之后还在塔里待上好几个小时。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061841_1_f6e9f52a:
    # "...But assuming I had all the time I needed, would I be able to use a hypothetical world to my advantage? Could I make use of countless hours without actually spending any?{w} ...I considered that there might've been a way to test it."
    "……不过，假如时间充裕，我能不能把假想世界利用起来？能不能用掉无数个小时，而现实中一个小时都不必花？{w}……我想，或许有办法验证这一点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061842_1_e189e78c:
    # "I took the Past Sekimeiya out and pressed \"play\" on the recorder. Following that, I went to the living room with the Past Sekimeiya and the recorder and closed the door to the kitchen."
    "我取出 过去Sekimeiya，按下录音笔的播放键。随后，我带着 过去Sekimeiya 和录音笔去了客厅，关上了通往厨房的门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061846_1_4209881a:
    # "I had to think very thoroughly about it. Instead of using a single hypothetical world, what if I used multiple at once by making it recursive?"
    "这件事得仔细想清楚。与其只用一个假想世界，能不能让它递归起来，一次用上多个假想世界？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061851_1_694383e7:
    # "...{w}If I touch the Sekimeiya when fifteen minutes have passed, I'll go twenty minutes to the past.{w} But before I touch it, I'll open the door to the hallway and find a notepad from the bedrooms on the floor. Depending on what it says, I'll do one of three things."
    "……{w}等过了十五分钟，我再去碰 Sekimeiya，就会回到二十分钟前。{w}不过在碰它之前，我要先打开通往走廊的门，看看地上有没有从卧室拿来的笔记本。看上面写着什么，我再决定做三件事中的哪一件。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061852_1_6dc92eee:
    # "1: If it has a formula written down, I'll go twenty minutes to the past, obtain the notepad, write the formula down, and leave it in the hallway."
    "一：如果上面写着公式，我就回到二十分钟前，拿到那本笔记本，把公式抄下来，再放回走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061853_1_5fdb2a50:
    # "2: If I don't find a notepad, I'll go twenty minutes to the past, and using the Future Sekimeiya in the kitchen, I'll start to work toward finding the formula. Before twenty minutes pass, I'll obtain a notepad from the bedrooms, and in the top left corner of the first page, I'll write a \"1\" along with the progress I made in those twenty minutes. Then, I'll leave it in the hallway."
    "二：如果没找到笔记本，我就回到二十分钟前，用厨房里的 未来Sekimeiya 开始推算公式。二十分钟结束前，我从卧室取来一本笔记本，在第一页左上角写上一个“1”，再写下这二十分钟里取得的进展，然后把笔记本留在走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061854_1_459e270a:
    # "3: If I find a notepad that doesn't contain the formula, it will have my current progress along with a number in the top left corner of the first page, which will indicate the amount of iterations that have occurred so far.{w} I'll go back to the past, and using the information I read in the notepad, I'll start working to find the formula. Before the twenty minutes pass, I'll write down the updated progress in a notepad from the bedrooms, increase the number I saw in the top left corner by one, and then leave the notepad in the hallway."
    "三：如果找到的笔记本上没有公式，那上面会写着我当前的进展，第一页左上角还有一个数字，代表到目前为止已经重复了多少轮。{w}我就回到过去，依据笔记本上读到的内容继续推算公式。二十分钟结束前，我把更新后的进展写进一本从卧室拿来的笔记本，再把左上角的数字加一，然后把笔记本留在走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061858_1_2120a848:
    # "This makes use of infinite time. By repeatedly using these twenty minutes across multiple hypothetical worlds, I can carry my progress over until the formula is found. I'm able to compress years' worth of calculations into a single twenty-minute loop."
    "这样就能动用无限的时间。借助多个假想世界把这二十分钟反复重演，我就能不断累积进展，直到找出公式。数年的计算，可以压缩进一个二十分钟的循环里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061859_1_ff7e9922:
    # "Since all the worlds will collapse into a final result, I'll always find the real formula behind the hallway door if this is viable; actions 2 and 3 are only for the hypothetical worlds."
    "既然所有世界最终都会汇成一个结果，那么只要这套办法可行，我打开走廊那扇门时，看到的就一定是真正的公式；第二、第三种做法只发生在假想世界里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061860_1_fd823755:
    # "As another final point, if the number in the top left corner exceeds, say, a billion, then I can be confident no answer exists."
    "最后还有一点：如果左上角的数字超过十亿，那我就能确定，这道公式根本无解。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061861_1_a0dd62db:
    # "...{w}I realized the plan had a small flaw."
    "……{w}我意识到，这个计划有一个小小的漏洞。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061862_1_94fe1674:
    # "But if in the real world, I open the hallway door and find no notepad, I'll think that the plan hasn't worked and won't go through with the first loop. In the same way, the first hypothetical version of me, instead of assuming that he's about to start the first iteration, would assume that the plan is flawed and wouldn't start the sequence. If I want this to work, I'll have to execute the first loop in the instance that I don't find a notepad in the hallway right now.{w} This is okay, because even though the plan wouldn't work for me, I'd have to resort to trying to find the formula manually in the real world. Executing the first loop would work toward that, and it would make the plan succeed if the concept is valid."
    "可如果我在现实世界里打开走廊的门，什么笔记本都没找到，我就会认定计划失败，也不会去走第一轮。同样，第一个假想中的我也不会认为自己正要开始第一轮，而会断定计划有破绽，从而不肯启动这一连串循环。要让计划成立，我必须在此时此刻——在走廊里没有找到笔记本的这一刻——照样执行第一轮。{w}这没关系，因为即便这套计划对我无效，我在现实中也只能靠手工去推公式。执行第一轮正是在为此铺路；而只要那个构想成立，计划就会因此成功。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061870_1_10b6e1b8:
    # "Thirteen minutes had passed."
    "十三分钟过去了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061873_1_9263c599:
    # "I hadn't heard anything in the attic; if another version of me had been ready to pass the formula on to me, he'd been very quiet."
    "阁楼里一点动静也没有。就算有另一个我正等着把公式交给我，他也安静得很。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061874_1_505f8dfe:
    # "Still completely clueless as to whether it would work, I approached the hallway."
    "我仍然完全不知道这办法行不行，就这样朝走廊走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061880_1_eb0ff310:
    # "Wh—"
    "什——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061881_1_6d5a6a28:
    # "My mouth dropped to the floor. Flashes of a certain bedroom popped in my mind, a normal occurrence after seeing my own messy handwriting."
    "我目瞪口呆。某个卧室的画面在脑海里一闪而过——每次看见自己潦草的字迹，都会这样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061882_1_47991061:
    # "A notepad was beside my feet, containing a large string of numbers on the first page. Upon closer inspection, it was definitely a formula—far from a clean one."
    "脚边放着一本笔记本，第一页写着一长串数字。凑近一看，那无疑是一条公式——只是远谈不上工整。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061883_1_8511830a:
    # "This is really it. It actually worked...!"
    "就是这个。居然真的成了……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061884_1_eb6a613c:
    # "All the pages after the first one were completely empty. There was no number on the top left, so I didn't know how many iterations had been needed to reach it, but its complexity was evident."
    "第一页之后全是空白。左上角没有数字，所以我不知道一共重复了多少轮才得到它，但它的复杂程度一目了然。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061885_1_84c197e0:
    # "So Shiroya and Akaro weren't lying... Touching the Sekimeiya after an hour of stored time will really send you weeks through time, and I can calculate the exact amount."
    "看来 Shiroya 和 Akaro 没有说谎……蓄能一个小时之后再碰 Sekimeiya，真的会把人送到几个星期之外，而且我还能算出具体的数值。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061889_1_1f45eaf0:
    # "Before that, though, I had to travel to the past. Less than twenty seconds remained until the fifteen-minute mark. When the timer hit it, I touched the Past Sekimeiya."
    "不过在那之前，我得先回到过去。距离十五分钟还差不到二十秒。计时一到，我便碰了 过去Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061894_1_a4e9675d:
    # "As expected, I appeared in the hallway, right next to the kitchen, which was closed. I had gone twenty minutes back, but the Past Sekimeiya had only stored energy for fifteen. During the first five minutes, I had no access to the kitchen because my past self was there. In the hypothetical loops, that time would've been used to check the progress made until the previous iteration."
    "不出所料，我出现在走廊上，就在关着门的厨房旁边。我回到了二十分钟前，可 过去Sekimeiya 只蓄了十五分钟的能量。最初五分钟里我进不了厨房，因为过去的我还在里面。在假想的循环中，这段时间本该用来查看截至上一轮取得的进展。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061898_1_3934d7ac:
    # "I went to the right bedroom and took a notepad from a drawer. I recalled all the numbers that had comprised the formula and wrote them down."
    "我走进右边的卧室，从抽屉里取出一本笔记本，把构成公式的那些数字一一回忆出来，写在了上面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061902_1_7cbcbc2e:
    # "Then, I silently approached the hallway and left the notepad next to the living room."
    "然后，我悄无声息地走到走廊，把笔记本放在客厅旁边。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061903_1_f0a5ab9a:
    # "This is crazy. I wonder how much time was spent to reach this equation. It feels like an instant result for my real self, so I could even use something like this to brute force the computer passwords downstairs."
    "简直是疯了。不知道为这条公式花了多少时间。对现实中的我来说，结果却像凭空得来的一样——用这种办法，我甚至可以硬破楼下电脑的密码。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061904_1_54b34291:
    # "I stood in silence until I heard my past self leaving the kitchen."
    "我一声不响地站着，直到听见过去的我离开厨房。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061910_1_687edbff:
    # "The Future Sekimeiya's in the refrigerator..."
    "未来Sekimeiya 在冰箱里……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061911_1_e2ba9260:
    # "I had a slight doubt. I understood the formula, but a certain factor wasn't part of it."
    "我心里还有一点疑问。公式我看懂了，但其中少了一个因素。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061912_1_cc8f6515:
    # "Is that really it? Is there no other influential factor?"
    "真的就这些？没有别的变量会影响结果？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061913_1_ef88065b:
    # "I stepped over to the sink and set the plug for the drain. Then, I filled it with water very slowly so that I didn't make noise. Once it reached the top, I took the Future Sekimeiya out and put it in the water."
    "我走到水槽边，堵好排水口，然后极慢地放水，以免发出声响。等水满到边缘，我取出 未来Sekimeiya，把它放进水里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061914_1_d4faf581:
    # "I set the oven to count for ten minutes. When only five had passed, I put my hand in the water and touched the Sekimeiya."
    "我把烤箱定时十分钟。只过了五分钟，我就把手伸进水里，碰了 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061915_1_1cbe5a88:
    # "I appeared in the kitchen and immediately saw the disabled Future Sekimeiya under the water. Then I looked at the oven and saw the amount of time I'd gone to the future.{w} The timer was at 4:31, immediately ticking down to 4:30."
    "我出现在厨房，立刻看见水里那个已经停摆的未来Sekimeiya。接着我看向烤箱，看看自己往未来跳了多久。{w}计时器显示 4:31，转眼就跳成了 4:30。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061916_1_77696b45:
    # "29 seconds. I have gone 29 seconds forward.{w} So I was right. There's another factor:{w} the temperature."
    "29 秒。我向前跳了 29 秒。{w}果然，我没猜错。还有一个因素：{w}温度。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061919_1_bad59dd2:
    # "The water is at room temperature, and the Sekimeiya spent five minutes in it. I should've definitely gone more than 29 seconds forward."
    "水是常温的，而 Sekimeiya 在里面泡了五分钟。按理说，我向前跳的时间绝不止 29 秒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061920_1_2d6b370e:
    # "But the heat capacity of water is four times the air's, meaning that it heats up four times slower.{w} It appears a temperature higher than the cabinet lets the Sekimeiya store energy and become hot. Of course, that heats up the air around it.{w} Then, that same air makes the Sekimeiya even hotter, leading into the infinite increase of energy."
    "可水的比热是空气的四倍，升温速度也就慢四倍。{w}看来，只要周围温度高于展示柜内部，Sekimeiya 就能蓄能并升温。它当然也会把周围的空气加热。{w}而这些空气又让它更热，如此循环，能量便无止境地增长。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061921_1_a38f80c8:
    # "This is why the water's different heat capacity changes things. Because water heats up four times slower, five minutes submerged in it is the same as 75 seconds outside it. So I only traveled 29 seconds. I'm sure the hypothetical versions of me thought about this too when they were coming up with the equation, but it's not really part of it, it just modifies the result."
    "水的比热不同，结果也就变了。水升温慢四倍，泡上五分钟，只相当于在外面放了 75 秒。所以我只跳了 29 秒。假想中的我在推公式时想必也考虑过这一点，但它并不算公式的一部分，只是对结果作修正。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061922_1_bdf84886:
    # "Finally, this answers the last question regarding that time Erina touched the Sekimeiya."
    "最后，这也解开了 Erina 那次碰 Sekimeiya 留下的最后一个疑问。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061930_1_9daf7675:
    # "Why were we encompassed within Erina's range? The Sekimeiya had spent fifteen minutes outside the cabinet, and based on the previous identical travel, we should've been outside of it."
    "为什么我们会落在 Erina 的范围内？Sekimeiya 离开展示柜已经有十五分钟，按照先前那次相同的穿越来看，我们本应处在范围之外。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061938_1_b9b0bf2e:
    # "\"Erina opened the glass and rolled the Sekimeiya into her purse, avoiding direct contact with it.\""
    "「Erina 打开玻璃罩，把 Sekimeiya 拨进她的手提包，避免直接碰到它。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061939_1_21d792b8:
    # "That's why. For those fifteen minutes, the Sekimeiya was in her purse.{w} That led to the opposite situation as the water. The air inside the purse couldn't easily escape, so it heated up faster than outside it. That is the reason why the range was bigger.{w} And Sai, the only person who actually traveled through time, would have been sent more than twenty minutes."
    "原来如此。那十五分钟里，Sekimeiya 一直在她的手提包里。{w}这就和水里的情形正好相反。包里的空气不易散出，升温比包外更快。范围之所以更大，原因就在这里。{w}而真正穿越了时间的只有 Sai，他应该被送去了二十多分钟之外。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061940_1_04e2daf8:
    # "I wonder how much of an effect this had on the travels. When the Sekimeiya was in the other cabinets, for example, did it heat up faster? Their interiors are wide, but I'm sure there was an imperceptible difference."
    "不知道这对那些穿越有多大的影响。比如说，Sekimeiya 放在别的展示柜里时，升温是否也会更快？那些柜子内部空间宽敞，但肯定存在着难以察觉的差异。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061949_1_d60a0f46:
    # "Maybe you noticed the instances where this property was a factor in play."
    "或许你已经注意到，有几处情形正是这个特性在起作用。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061950_1_9172455f:
    # "Earlier, did you wonder why Shiroya world switched alongside Naomi? She was in the staircase while the Sekimeiya were on the sofa, and they had recently been taken out of the cabinet."
    "先前你有没有想过，Shiroya 为什么会和 Naomi 一同发生世界切换？她当时在楼梯间，Sekimeiya 则放在沙发上，不久前才从展示柜里取出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061951_1_27254fb4:
    # "As you might guess, it was Katei's tight suitcase that let the Sekimeiya gain power faster than normal."
    "你应该也猜到了，正是 Katei 那只塞得严严实实的行李箱，让 Sekimeiya 蓄能的速度比平时更快。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061959_1_4c48f71a:
    # "That... might be everything. Although I could be wrong on details that I can't verify, I can apply the time formula as long as I touch the Sekimeiya outside the water and in this room. The temperature in the attic doesn't feel different from everywhere else, but I should stay here."
    "大概……就是这些了。有些细节我无从验证，或许会有出入，但只要在这间房里、不隔着水触碰 Sekimeiya，我就能套用时间公式。阁楼和别处的温度感觉不出差别，不过我还是应该留在这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061960_1_2bdc69a6:
    # "I heard myself in the living room stepping to the hallway. Soon after, that me touched the Sekimeiya and went back in time."
    "我听见客厅里的自己走向走廊。紧接着，那个我便触碰了 Sekimeiya，回到了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061964_1_9a5c6300:
    # "I retrieved the Past Sekimeiya and the recorder, then stepped back into the kitchen."
    "我取回过去Sekimeiya和录音笔，随后走回厨房。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061968_1_95031118:
    # "I put both Sekimeiya in the refrigerator and took out the Past Sekimeiya as I began a new recording."
    "我把两个 Sekimeiya 都放进冰箱，又取出过去Sekimeiya，开始新一轮录音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061972_1_cb8ad483:
    # "I moved to the hallway; I had appeared right outside the kitchen, so I had to be there in twenty minutes. By leaving the door open, I could make sure the Future Sekimeiya was safe in the refrigerator."
    "我走向走廊。我出现的位置就在厨房门外，所以二十分钟后我必须待在那里。只要把门敞着，我就能确认未来Sekimeiya在冰箱里安然无恙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061973_1_76af96e3:
    # "...Is there anything else? Is there any mystery that I can't explain?"
    "……还有别的吗？还有什么我解释不了的谜团吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061974_1_1cba0f9c:
    # "In the storeroom, I'd sporadically thought about the long series of events that had gone on during the twelve-hour span of time. A few ideas had come to me, but I had to seriously think about everything with what I'd learned."
    "在储藏室里，我断断续续地回想过那十二个小时里接连发生的种种。心里也冒出过几个念头，但我必须结合已经掌握的一切，认真把事情从头想一遍。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061985_1_ed501855:
    # "At {time=9}, the smoke was released in the tower, beginning the attack that trapped us inside. What triggered the alarm? Was anyone aware of the Sekimeiya's powers? I'm still not sure about the details behind it, but it's a lot clearer now."
    "{time=9}，塔内释放了烟雾，那场把我们困在里面的袭击就此开始。警报是谁触发的？有人知道 Sekimeiya 的力量吗？背后的细节我仍不清楚，但现在已经明朗了许多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061990_1_41e63a70:
    # "While we were asleep, someone hid the Sekimeiya in room B4 and turned on the temperature regulation.{w} Was it Naomi? In this world, she ran up to the attic with them."
    "我们睡着的时候，有人把 Sekimeiya 藏进了 B4房间，还打开了温度调节。{w}是 Naomi 吗？在这个世界里，是她带着它们跑上了阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061991_1_392cf7f1:
    # "There's also Katei. He wasn't in the security room, and he has to be who dropped the rusty key in hallway A.{w} Beyond the truth of the attack, the third Sekimeiya, the one that doesn't work, was the only one inside the cabinet when we woke up. When Isla touched it, nothing happened to her."
    "还有 Katei。他不在监控室，A走廊里那把生锈的钥匙一定是他掉的。{w}除了袭击的真相之外，还有一点：我们醒来时，展示柜里只剩下第三个 Sekimeiya，也就是那个失效的。Isla 碰了它，却什么也没有发生。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061995_1_87046c14:
    # "We went to the security room and contacted the outside. That's when we had the call with Suripo, who told us about the story behind Ashiya and Xyn."
    "我们去了监控室，与外界取得联系。就是那时和 Suripo 通了话，他告诉了我们芦屋与 Xyn 之间的往事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061998_1_7ddb0895:
    # "Before it ended, Sai turned off the monitor next to him. However, the whole computer immediately powered off too."
    "通话结束前，Sai 关掉了他身旁的显示器。可整台电脑也随之立刻断电了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L061999_1_e853d91e:
    # "Who did that, and why? At this point, I believe there's an answer far more likely than the others."
    "是谁做的，又为了什么？事到如今，我认为有一个答案远比其他的更有可能。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062007_1_a2b72ffa:
    # "I think it was Katei. The person who was sitting in front of the computer.{w} When it happened, we were about to look at the recorded footage. That would've revealed that he hadn't been in the security room and who knows what else."
    "我想是 Katei。就是坐在电脑前的那个人。{w}当时我们正要查看录下的画面。那会揭穿他根本不在监控室，天知道还会带出什么别的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062008_1_981ad859:
    # "He probably wanted to use Sai's trick to his advantage. We were all focused on the screen that went black, so nobody saw him pressing the power button below the desk. Due to his timing, he tried to make it seem as if both things had the same cause."
    "他大概是想借 Sai 那一手为自己所用。我们全都盯着黑掉的屏幕，没人看见他在桌下按电源键。他挑准了时机，想让两件事看起来出自同一个原因。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062009_1_5d756cd1:
    # "The first thing he did was crouch under the desk and check the wires. He said nothing was wrong behind the computer, but I think that what he did was disconnect a cable. Then, when he repeatedly pressed the power button, the computer didn't turn on."
    "他做的第一件事是蹲到桌下检查线路。他说电脑后面没有问题，但我认为他其实是拔掉了一根线。接着，他反复按电源键，电脑却没有开机。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062010_1_e47f4fec:
    # "However, he couldn't leave it like that. If we explained what had happened to the police, they would immediately notice the disconnected cable, and no one would believe a word Katei said. So, after he acted like he'd been trying to figure out the issue for a long time, he reconnected the cable and the computer was able to power back on."
    "可他不能就这么放着不管。要是我们向警察说明经过，他们一眼就会发现那根被拔掉的线，就没人会信 Katei 说的话了。于是，他装模作样地查了很久，才把线接回去，电脑也得以重新开机。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062013_1_18ee86b5:
    # "I don't think that's all he did, though. During all the time he was below the desk, he unplugged the camera system from the computer. Later into the day, I realized the drive that stored the recorded footage wasn't being detected."
    "不过，我觉得他做的还不止这些。他待在桌下的那段时间里，把监控系统从电脑上拔了下来。那天稍晚，我才意识到存着录像的硬盘根本没有被识别。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062014_1_c3f57fe0:
    # "And even that wasn't all. We tried to communicate with the outside a second time, but upon inputting his credentials, an \"Access Denied\" message appeared.{w} Why? I'm not completely sure why he would've done that, but he could've purposely entered an incorrect password to prompt that message. Perhaps there was a reason why he couldn't allow a second call, but he must've done that. After all, there's no way Ashiya would've been the ones to cut our single method of communication."
    "而且事情还不止这些。我们第二次尝试与外界联络，输入他的账号信息后，却弹出了「拒绝访问」的提示。{w}为什么？我并不完全确定他为什么要这样做，但他很可能故意输错密码，好让那行提示出现。也许出于某种原因，他不能让第二次通话打通，而这事一定是他做的。毕竟，芦屋那边绝不可能自己切断我们唯一的联络方式。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062015_1_d8c827fe:
    # "...He wasn't in the security room when the smoke went off, but one of the things he said was that he'd tried to do his part of removing the shutter and that the system hadn't let him.{w} That didn't actually happen, but Suripo told us that a similar error was affecting Ashiya. Since Katei knew or lied about it without experiencing it, it follows he was probably the cause behind it. He didn't want the exit to open before the time limit.{w} Therefore, there was something he had to do before the time expired, and deleting the saved footage was likely part of that.{w} When we were done, we left him alone in the security room. That was the time we later learned footage had been erased; he used it to briefly reconnect the system and delete what he didn't want us to see."
    "……烟雾弥漫的时候，他并不在监控室，但他说过一句话：他试过拆下自己负责的那部分卷帘门，系统却没让他操作。{w}这件事其实并没有发生，可 Suripo 告诉过我们，芦屋那边也出现了类似的故障。既然 Katei 没亲身经历却能知道这件事，或者干脆是在撒谎，那么他很可能就是造成这起故障的人。他不想让出口在时限之前打开。{w}也就是说，在时限结束前，他有非做不可的事，而删除已存的录像多半就是其中一环。{w}我们办完事之后，把他一个人留在了监控室。后来我们才知道，录像正是在那段时间被抹掉的——他利用那段时间短暂地接回系统，删掉了他不想让我们看到的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062021_1_ba898355:
    # "We looked through the crystal floor, but we didn't find Naomi. Then, we separated into two groups to look through the other floors. Erina, Isla, Shiroya, and I took the elevator up to the sixth floor."
    "我们找遍了水晶层，却没有找到 Naomi。随后我们分成两组，去其他楼层搜寻。Erina、Isla、Shiroya 和我乘电梯上了六楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062030_1_e69f5f65:
    # "On the fifth floor, before Isla told us about her friend, we heard the elevator. Since we had left it on the sixth, and the other group only heard it once, it had to have been going down."
    "在五楼，Isla 讲起她那位朋友之前，我们听见了电梯的动静。我们把电梯留在了六楼，而另一组只听到一次声响，那么它只能是在往下走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062040_1_2a596d53:
    # "It was the Naomi who'd ended up trapped in the attic. When she appeared there, the elevator wasn't working, but she must have eventually tried it again after Katei reenabled it."
    "那就是最终被困在阁楼里的 Naomi。她出现在那里时，电梯还无法使用，但等 Katei 重新启用电梯后，她一定又试着坐过一次。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062041_1_2a105459:
    # "From the sixth floor, the elevator went to the attic. Of course, we didn't hear that.{w} Then, that Naomi used it to go all the way down."
    "电梯从六楼开到了阁楼。当然，我们并没有听见。{w}随后，那个 Naomi 又乘着它一路下到了底层。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062047_1_11878915:
    # "It was soon after when we found Naomi's first corpse in the hallway B crystal room."
    "没过多久，我们就在 B走廊的水晶展室里发现了 Naomi 的第一具尸体。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062054_1_3d7b164f:
    # "I don't think that was the Naomi who'd taken the elevator, though. The elevator moved after one Naomi had already appeared, and her set of keys was on the first dead body."
    "不过，我觉得那并不是乘坐电梯的 Naomi。电梯启动时，已经有一个 Naomi 现身了，而她的那串钥匙就在第一具尸体身上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062058_1_e5c473f1:
    # "That was likely the Naomi from our world. She appeared in front of the others and asked to talk to Katei privately. Later, the Naomi in the attic went down."
    "那多半是来自我们世界的 Naomi。她出现在众人面前，要求和 Katei 单独谈谈。之后，阁楼里的那个 Naomi 下了楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062059_1_367a0a87:
    # "But after we waited, Katei came back alone, saying Naomi hadn't wanted to come back."
    "可我们等了许久，Katei 独自回来了，说 Naomi 不愿意回来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062060_1_b8a4f717:
    # "If she was still down there, we couldn't let her keep escaping. Shiroya and I waited in front of the elevator while the others went down to make sure we'd find her.{w} Suddenly, we heard the elevator going up."
    "如果她还在下面，我们就不能再让她这样一次次脱身。Shiroya 和我守在电梯前，其他人则下楼去，确保能找到她。{w}忽然，我们听见电梯升了上来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062063_1_8a34738e:
    # "We thought that was Naomi, but we didn't find anyone where the elevator would've stopped. The reason was that my past self was the person who used it."
    "我们以为是 Naomi，可电梯本该停下的地方却空无一人。因为使用电梯的人，其实是过去的我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062066_1_3bca550a:
    # "And while we were discussing what could've happened, Akaro came running. The Sekimeiya had vanished from the cabinet for the first time."
    "就在我们讨论究竟出了什么事的时候，Akaro 跑了过来。Sekimeiya 第一次从展示柜里消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062071_1_f285235b:
    # "Everyone was waiting near the stairs when we arrived. Shiroya and I saw the empty cabinet in the event room, but the priority was still Naomi—she had to be there."
    "我们赶到时，大家都等在楼梯附近。Shiroya 和我看到了活动室里空掉的展示柜，但当务之急仍是 Naomi——她一定就在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062074_1_944a3f43:
    # "Making sure nobody could leave, room B4 was eventually looked into. That's where we found her corpse."
    "我们确保没人能离开后，终于去查看了 B4 房间，并在那里发现了她的尸体。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062082_1_380334b7:
    # "Someone coming from the future could've killed her, but I'm inclined to think it was actually Katei.{w} It happened in the room where the Sekimeiya were hidden, and in this world, Naomi didn't bring them there. That makes me think it was Katei who did."
    "从未来过来的人也可能杀了她，但我更倾向于认为动手的就是 Katei。{w}事情发生在藏匿 Sekimeiya 的那间房里，而在这一世界，把 Sekimeiya 带过去的人并不是 Naomi。所以我才会认为是 Katei 干的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062095_1_35cc768b:
    # "Naomi appeared from the second floor. She had been watching the group from a distance just in case she could gather information such as Katei's potential accomplices. Finally, she mustered the courage to confront them."
    "Naomi 从二楼现身。她一直在远处观察众人，以便尽可能收集情报，比如 Katei 有没有潜在的同伙。最后，她鼓起勇气，走到了他们面前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062096_1_73c342be:
    # "She requested to talk to Katei privately; she represented Ashiya, so she couldn't let the others hear such a bold accusation against one of their workers if it was possible an explanation existed. However, she knew Katei had taken the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet."
    "她要求和 Katei 单独谈谈。她代表的是芦屋，只要事情还有解释的余地，就不能让旁人听见她对公司员工做出这样大胆的指控。然而，她清楚 Katei 把 Sekimeiya 从展示柜里取了出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062101_1_e84cb9ef:
    # "Without speaking a word, they walked to the crystal floor. There, Naomi brought Katei to the room she'd seen him leave."
    "两人一言不发地走向水晶层。到了那里，Naomi 把 Katei 带进了她曾看见他走出来的那间房。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062105_1_33decf3c:
    # "The Sekimeiya had to be there. Naomi asked him to unlock all the cabinets and saw two of them lying inside."
    "Sekimeiya 一定就在那里。Naomi 让他把所有展示柜都打开，只见里面躺着两个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062111_1_241513fe:
    # "Raising her voice, she demanded an explanation while Katei kept quiet. He knew how bad the situation was: Naomi would bring about his doom. She would ruin everything."
    "她提高嗓门，要他解释清楚，Katei 却一言不发。他清楚处境有多糟：Naomi 会让他万劫不复，会把一切毁于一旦。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062112_1_d7bc7baa:
    # "He didn't bother making flimsy excuses. He explained everything he'd done, hoping she would sympathize with him. He had worked in Ashiya Tower all his life; he couldn't take it anymore. He'd only wanted to free himself from the life he'd lived."
    "他懒得编那些站不住脚的借口，索性把自己做过的事一一说了出来，希望她能体谅。他一辈子都在芦屋塔里工作，实在熬不下去了。他只是想从这样的日子里脱身。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062118_1_53b524fc:
    # "When she discarded Katei's justification, it was his voice that rose. There was no way he would let his life end like that."
    "她驳回了 Katei 的辩解，这回轮到他提高嗓门了。他绝不可能让自己的生命就这样结束。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062124_1_f08b3bfc:
    # "The truth was out, so Katei attempted a bribe. If they obtained the Sekimeiya, both of them could work together to trade it off.{w} Immediately, Naomi refused—she was Ashiya's most trusted employee.{w} The third step was a threat. With a calm voice, Katei let her pick between Ashiya or her own safety. He needed her to stay quiet, and starting immediately; she knew two real Sekimeiya existed.{w} However, as Katei's words were dismissed again, he finally wavered. He had been acting stern, but that was far from reality. Inwardly, Katei burned with rage toward Naomi."
    "真相已经败露，Katei 便试着收买她。要是拿到 Sekimeiya，两人就能联手把它转手卖掉。{w}Naomi 当即拒绝——她可是芦屋最受信任的员工。{w}第三步，他改用威胁。Katei 用平静的语气让她在芦屋和自己的安危之间做选择。他必须让她立刻保持沉默；她已经知道有两块真正的 Sekimeiya。{w}然而，她再次拒绝，他终于动摇了。他一直摆出强硬的样子，其实那全是装出来的。内心深处，Katei 对 Naomi 已是怒火中烧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062128_1_eabbd099:
    # "After a sudden step forward, Katei dashed at her.{w} She had enough time to react and defend herself, but she was no match for him. After an abrupt scuffle, Katei dragged her to the wall and knocked her out. Before her death, Naomi let out a yell that only reached a single pair of ears outside the room: her own."
    "Katei 猛然踏前一步，朝她扑了过去。{w}她有足够的时间反应，也出手自卫，但根本不是他的对手。一阵短促的扭打之后，Katei 把她拖到墙边，打昏了她。临死之前，Naomi 发出了一声喊叫，而门外听见这声音的只有一双耳朵——她自己的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062132_1_177a2c1e:
    # "From above, Katei stared at Naomi's body, unaware that a cabinet's temperature wheel had been damaged. Seconds later, he finally checked her breathing. ...There was none.{w} But all wasn't lost. Earlier, he had turned off that room's camera. He had known that he would have to take one of the Sekimeiya away eventually, so he had preemptively disabled the video.{w} But although he hadn't been recorded, he knew he was the only possible suspect."
    "Katei 居高临下地望着 Naomi 的尸体，没有察觉展示柜的温度转盘已被撞坏。几秒之后，他才去探她的呼吸。……已经没有了。{w}但事情还没有到山穷水尽的地步。早些时候，他已经关掉了那间房的摄像头。他早就知道自己迟早要带走一个 Sekimeiya，因此提前让监控失效了。{w}可是，尽管没有被拍下来，他也清楚自己是唯一可能的嫌疑人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062136_1_a168ea36:
    # "...That was until he heard a sudden sound that forced him out of the room. Outside, he saw Atsuki's lone figure.{w} Katei rapidly stepped aside; he couldn't afford to be seen. However, Atsuki had just been recorded by the cameras, so there was another potential culprit to build a narrative against.{w} Before he walked back up, Katei thought about what he had to say. He had killed someone else after all those years, and he could find another way out."
    "……直到一阵突如其来的声响把他逼出了房间。到了外面，他看见了 Atsuki 孤零零的身影。{w}Katei 迅速闪到一旁，绝不能让人看见自己。不过，Atsuki 刚刚被摄像头拍了下来，也就是说，还有一个可以拿来做文章的可疑对象。{w}在往回走之前，Katei 盘算着该说些什么。时隔这么多年，他又杀了人，而他还能另寻出路。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062141_1_2d86b8b6:
    # "When Naomi's body was found, Atsuki's eyes landed on the damaged wheel. It had stopped the temperature regulation, so the Sekimeiya made him travel to the past. However, the Sekimeiya lying in the neighboring cabinet was still kept cold, so no world switch occurred."
    "Naomi 的尸体被发现时，Atsuki 的目光落在了那个损坏的转盘上。温度调节因此停止，Sekimeiya 便把他送回了过去。不过，躺在隔壁展示柜里的那个 Sekimeiya 仍然保持着低温，所以没有发生世界切换。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062152_1_4ea78e68:
    # "There, I traveled to the past for the first time, and twenty minutes later, I walked right back to where everyone had seen me disappear."
    "就在那里，我第一次穿越到了过去，二十分钟后，我又走回了众人看见我消失的那个地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062155_1_17357d7e:
    # "The Sekimeiya turned gray, so we brought it to its cabinet in the event room, where it became white again.{w} We heard a sound coming from outside. After all, someone else was still lurking within the tower—the Naomi who took the elevator down. The corpse had stopped our search, and we'd never looked into every room."
    "那个 Sekimeiya 变成了灰色，我们便把它送回活动室里它原本的展示柜，它在那里又变回了白色。{w}我们听见外面传来声响。毕竟，塔里还藏着另一个人——乘电梯下楼的 Naomi。那具尸体让我们中断了搜索，我们始终没有把每一间房都查遍。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062158_1_79669ce2:
    # "But we couldn't let her escape, so we separated into two groups to look at both hallways. Katei, Erina, Isla, and I looked at hallway A, while Shiroya, Akaro, and Sai looked at hallway B. Despite that, we didn't find her."
    "可我们不能让她逃掉，于是分成两组，分别查看两条走廊。我和 Katei、Erina、Isla 查看 A走廊，Shiroya、Akaro 和 Sai 则去 B走廊。即便如此，我们还是没找到她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062162_1_c19ae51f:
    # "When we finished, Sai reiterated his distrust for Katei and refused to believe that Naomi hadn't been found in the rooms he'd investigated."
    "搜查结束后，Sai 再次表示不信任 Katei，也不肯相信 Katei 查过的那些房间里真的找不到 Naomi。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062163_1_23f1b533:
    # "Sai wanted to confirm it for himself, which led him to enter the storeroom. There, he found a Sekimeiya."
    "Sai 想亲自确认，便走进了储藏室。在那里，他发现了一个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062166_1_12dba4ab:
    # "Had it been taken already? We went to the event room, and it was in fact gone from the cabinet.{w} Who hid it in the storeroom? That question ate at me."
    "难道它已经被人拿走了？我们赶到活动室，展示柜里果然空了。{w} 是谁把它藏进了储藏室？这个问题始终缠着我不放。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062175_1_f9a976a0:
    # "I believe I now understand what happened.{w} To get the Sekimeiya out of the event room's cabinet, the key was necessary, and it was with Naomi's corpse in room B4. That means someone who investigated hallway B must have taken it to unlock the cabinet.{w} However, none of them had the chance to hide it in the storeroom without being seen by the people who'd investigated hallway A. That's why it didn't make sense."
    "我想，我现在明白是怎么回事了。{w} 要把 Sekimeiya 从活动室的展示柜里取出来，就必须用到钥匙；而钥匙就在 B4 房间里 Naomi 的尸体旁。也就是说，搜查 B走廊的人当中，必定有人取走钥匙打开了展示柜。{w} 但搜查 A走廊的人一直看在眼里，B走廊那几个人谁都没机会把 Sekimeiya 藏进储藏室而不被发现。所以那件事才说不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062176_1_8c22725e:
    # "The answer is that..."
    "答案就是……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062187_1_fca7c60f:
    # "I don't believe two people worked together. The issue was caused by a misconception."
    "我不认为有两个人合谋。问题出在一个误解上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062189_1_4c36b321:
    # "I entertained the thought that Sai had it in his hip pack, but I saw clearly when he entered the room that he didn't have the Sekimeiya yet."
    "我曾设想，Sai 会不会把它放在腰包里；可他进房间时我看得清清楚楚，他那时还没有 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062190_1_2d9d68d5:
    # "It wasn't the same Sekimeiya. The first mystery regarding its whereabouts already pointed at the truth that more than one Sekimeiya existed.{w} ...After all, when Sai left the storeroom, he made me touch it, and nothing happened.{w} It was definitely the third Sekimeiya—the one that had disappeared from the event room the first time. The Past Sekimeiya was in room B4 since we'd regained consciousness, so we never actually found the one that disappeared first."
    "那不是同一个 Sekimeiya。最初关于它下落的谜团，其实早已指向一个事实：Sekimeiya 不止一块。{w} ……毕竟，Sai 离开储藏室时让我碰过它，却什么也没发生。{w} 那肯定就是第三个 Sekimeiya——最初从活动室消失的那一块。自我们醒来后，过去Sekimeiya 就一直在 B4 房间里；也就是说，我们从未真正找到最初消失的那一块。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062196_1_fe8b1df3:
    # "Who hid the third Sekimeiya in the storeroom? That happened before Shiroya, Akaro, and I walked down from the sixth floor.{w} I don't believe it was Katei because he's likely the one who hid the two working Sekimeiya. If he wanted to also hide the third, which was originally in the event room, he would have done so while we were asleep.{w} I don't believe the other Naomi would have wanted to leave it there either."
    "是谁把第三个 Sekimeiya 藏进了储藏室？那是发生在我、Shiroya 和 Akaro 从六楼下来之前的事。{w} 我不认为是 Katei。藏起那两块还能用的 Sekimeiya 的人，多半就是他。若他还想连原本放在活动室的第三块也一并藏起来，趁我们睡着时动手就行了。{w} 我也不认为另一个 Naomi 会愿意把它留在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062197_1_b6cab202:
    # "There's one last likely candidate: Sai."
    "最后还有一个可能的人选：Sai。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062198_1_bc3d6b78:
    # "After Katei said that Naomi didn't want to return, the others investigated the crystal floor while Shiroya and I waited next to the elevator on the fourth floor. We were told exactly what happened."
    "Katei 说 Naomi 不愿意回来后，其他人去搜查水晶层，而我和 Shiroya 留在四楼的电梯旁等候。有人把事情的经过原原本本告诉了我们。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062204_1_e0bb4e6a:
    # "Sai guarded hallway A from the stairs while Katei guarded hallway B and the lobby.{w} As the hallway B rooms were inspected, Sai could've gone to the event room to take the gemstone and hide it in the storeroom."
    "Sai 守住楼梯口，负责盯 A走廊；Katei 则守着 B走廊和大厅。{w} 在 B走廊的房间被逐一检查时，Sai 本有机会去活动室取走宝石，再把它藏进储藏室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062205_1_95855a7f:
    # "Then, he let the others discover that it had disappeared and asked Akaro to go find us."
    "随后，他让其他人发现东西不见了，又让 Akaro 来找我们。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062214_1_13423947:
    # "When they came and told me what had happened, I thought you two had to get down here. Since we're dealing with this situation, I found it appropriate to join up and make sure nothing slipped away."
    "他们过来告诉我出了什么事时，我就觉得你们俩该下来了。既然事情已经变成这样，我觉得还是汇合起来比较妥当，免得再有什么从眼皮底下溜走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062222_1_57ee25ee:
    # "Why would he have done that?{w} ...At that point, we hadn't learned about the Sekimeiya's powers yet.{w} During the morning, Sai's attitude was different from how it was later. He often talked with me about what he thought and was visibly enjoying what was happening around him. When did that change, exactly?{w} I believe it was when we found out about time travel. He became a lot more reserved and hard to read. If he hid the Sekimeiya so early, his motive likely aligned to his original attitude."
    "他为什么要那么做？{w} ……那时我们还没弄清 Sekimeiya 的力量。{w} 那天早上，Sai 的态度和后来截然不同。他常跟我谈起自己的想法，也看得出他很享受身边发生的事。他究竟是什么时候变的？{w} 我想，是在我们得知时间穿越之后。他变得沉默许多，让人看不透。若他在那么早的时候就藏起了 Sekimeiya，动机多半与他最初的态度有关。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062223_1_0907562c:
    # "The event room and hallway A weren't being recorded. He chose the storeroom, another place without cameras. Later on, he acted as if he'd found it there, so I don't think his intention was to keep it.{w} Did he do it for fun, or did he have a better reason? In any case, it's likely he already knew that he would point the finger at Katei, who he immediately accused."
    "活动室和 A走廊都没有监控。他选了同样没有摄像头的储藏室。后来他又装出是在那里发现它的样子，所以我觉得，他并不打算把它留在手里。{w} 是出于好玩，还是另有更充分的理由？无论如何，他恐怕早就知道自己会把矛头指向 Katei——毕竟他一开口便指控了 Katei。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062224_1_376dc957:
    # "So, going back a little, when we found the Past Sekimeiya in room B4, we thought it was the one that disappeared from the event room. After putting it in the cabinet, we split up and searched both hallways for the person who'd made a sound. During that time, the Past Sekimeiya was hidden somewhere else while the third Sekimeiya was in the storeroom."
    "那么，稍微往前回溯一下：我们在 B4 房间发现过去Sekimeiya 时，还以为它就是活动室里消失的那个。把它放回展示柜后，我们分头去两条走廊寻找发出声响的人。就在那段时间里，过去Sekimeiya 被藏到了别处，而第三个 Sekimeiya 则在储藏室里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062231_1_25991d37:
    # "It must've been Sai again. The only choices were the people in hallway B."
    "那一定又是 Sai。可选的人只有当时在 B走廊的那几个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062232_1_d3b7faa5:
    # "I was told Shiroya and Akaro looked through the rooms while Sai watched the hallway like I did. We had to make sure the person we were searching for was found, so the search took a while. During the time Shiroya and Akaro were inside the crystal rooms, Sai had the chance to pick up the key in room B4, take the Sekimeiya from the event room, and then hide it somewhere in hallway B.{w} After that, he slipped the cabinet key into Shiroya's purse as soon as possible."
    "我听说，Shiroya 和 Akaro 逐个查看房间时，Sai 像我一样守在走廊里。为了确保能找到那个人，搜查花了不少时间。在 Shiroya 和 Akaro 进入水晶展室期间，Sai 有机会去 B4 房间取走钥匙，从活动室拿走 Sekimeiya，再把它藏到 B走廊的某处。{w} 之后，他又尽快把展示柜的钥匙塞进了 Shiroya 的手袋。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062233_1_8c0273e8:
    # "By acting like he'd found the Sekimeiya in the storeroom, he removed any potential blame from himself.{w} I didn't really think about it, but he said we couldn't trust Katei's search and never ended up looking at all the other rooms Katei went through."
    "他装出在储藏室里发现 Sekimeiya 的样子，让自己摆脱了可能受到的怀疑。{w} 我当时没怎么细想，但他说过不能相信 Katei 的搜查，最后也没有把 Katei 查过的其余房间逐一查看。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062236_1_b9854fe1:
    # "And still, I'm sure there's another reason Sai did that.{w} I don't know why, but everyone thought only one Sekimeiya existed. By finding the one that didn't work, he made sure we wouldn't search for the one he had hidden."
    "不过，我确信 Sai 那么做还有另一个理由。{w} 不知为何，所有人都以为只存在一个 Sekimeiya。他找到那个不能用的，正是为了让我们不去寻找他藏起来的那个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062237_1_dabf1808:
    # "I see... That must be the answer to that question.{w} \"Why is the Sekimeiya being hidden when it can easily be found?\"{w} I wonder who knew the truth. I wonder who knew that three Sekimeiya existed.{w} The people who did kept hiding them because leaving the third one in the event room cabinet meant no one would look for others. The quality of their hiding spots hardly mattered—we just found one Sekimeiya and thought that was it. Maybe they were often poorly hidden precisely so that we'd find one and stop the search before coming across another."
    "原来如此……那个问题的答案一定就是这个。{w} 「为什么 Sekimeiya 明明很容易就能找到，却总被人藏起来？」{w} 我想知道，究竟是谁知道真相。是谁知道存在三个 Sekimeiya。{w} 知情者之所以一再把它们藏起来，是因为只要把第三个留在活动室展示柜里，我们便不会再去寻找其他 Sekimeiya。藏得是否妥当并不重要——我们只要找到一个 Sekimeiya，就会以为只有这一个。说不定它们之所以常常被藏得很草率，正是为了让我们找到一个后就此收手，不会撞见另一个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062244_1_d08933b1:
    # "Akaro knew it from the beginning, and Sai learned it shortly after. They knew two real Sekimeiya existed alongside Xyn's fake. For twelve hours, they had a plan in mind: to keep one of the real Sekimeiya hidden."
    "Akaro 从一开始就知道，Sai 也在不久后得知。他们知道，除了 Xyn 造的赝品之外，还有两个真正的 Sekimeiya。整整十二个小时里，他们心里盘算着一个计划：把其中一个真正的 Sekimeiya 藏起来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062245_1_7fc94ef6:
    # "If that was achieved, Ashiya would find two Sekimeiya, and they wouldn't search for the second real one. That was how they intended to pull it off and why they didn't want anyone else to know the truth. The Sekimeiya were hidden countless times, but the intent was rarely to keep them from being found."
    "只要成功，芦屋方面就只会找到两个 Sekimeiya，不会再去寻找第二个真品。他们正是想借此成事，也正因如此，才不愿让旁人知道真相。Sekimeiya 曾被藏起过无数次，但藏起来的目的很少是为了不让人找到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062251_1_23ad0ecb:
    # "We still hadn't found the Naomi who'd made the sound, which meant that she had successfully escaped upstairs. That's why we searched through the higher floors.{w} Shiroya and I stayed on the fifth, and although we didn't hear anything, something strange happened with the elevator."
    "我们始终没找到那个发出声响的 Naomi，这说明她已经成功逃到楼上。所以我们才去搜查更高的楼层。{w} 我和 Shiroya 留在五楼，虽然我们什么声音都没听见，电梯却出了怪事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062255_1_f44cdc2a:
    # "Sai heard it three times. Based on that, it started from the crystal floor, which was not where we'd last left it..."
    "Sai 听见了三次。照此推断，电梯是从水晶层开始动的，可我们最后一次并没有把电梯留在那里……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062256_1_3adaf942:
    # "I don't believe Sai lied. Something happened during that time."
    "我不认为 Sai 说了谎。那段时间里，一定发生了什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062259_1_51ad1a0c:
    # "That's because in the event room, we heard another sound. It was the bathroom's door closing."
    "因为我们在活动室里又听到了一声响。那是洗手间的门关上的声音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062262_1_7233df4a:
    # "Then, inside it, we found Naomi's second body.{w} However, I later traveled forty minutes to the past and appeared on the crystal floor before we'd all come back down."
    "随后，我们在里面发现了 Naomi 的第二具尸体。{w} 可后来，我却穿越回四十分钟前，出现在水晶层——那时我们所有人都还没下楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062266_1_6b97783d:
    # "I kept a close eye on the bathroom, but nothing happened until Naomi entered it..."
    "我一直紧盯着洗手间，可直到 Naomi 走进去，什么也没发生……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062271_1_4975c7f3:
    # "First of all, why was Naomi not found? We inspected every floor but the attic. As I now understand the attic's footprints, I don't believe that Naomi went back there. Especially because she didn't have the key to unlock it."
    "首先，为什么没找到 Naomi？除了阁楼，我们把每一层都搜过了。我现在已经弄明白阁楼里的那些脚印是怎么回事了，所以不认为 Naomi 回去过。何况她也没有阁楼的钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062272_1_52315362:
    # "Somehow, the search failed to find her.{w} A different person stayed on each floor, so it's possible one wasn't investigated—the floor the person who used the elevator was supposed to guard.{w} ...Erina and Isla were on the second floor. Sai was on the third floor. Akaro was on the fourth floor. Shiroya and I were on the fifth floor. Katei was on the sixth floor."
    "不知为何，搜查没能找到她。{w} 每一层都安排了不同的人留守，所以也许有一层根本没被搜查——就是本该由乘电梯的人守着的那一层。{w} ……Erina 和 Isla 在二楼。Sai 在三楼。Akaro 在四楼。我和 Shiroya 在五楼。Katei 在六楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062279_1_f783a6ba:
    # "The strongest candidate to consider is Akaro."
    "最可疑的人是 Akaro。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062283_1_568f9100:
    # "We told him we'd left the elevator on the fifth floor, but for some reason, it was originally below Sai. If he called it from the fourth, Sai would've heard it."
    "我们告诉过他，电梯停在五楼；可不知为何，它最初却停在 Sai 所在楼层的下方。若他从四楼叫电梯，Sai 应该会听见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062284_1_b8937336:
    # "Then, he used it to go to the crystal floor... Why, though?{w} I can't help but remember that it was him who proposed this arrangement. He wanted us to stay separated between different floors, leaving the crystal floor vacant."
    "然后，他乘电梯去了水晶层……可他为什么要这么做？{w} 我不由得想起，提出这种安排的人正是他。他希望我们分散在不同楼层，好让水晶层空着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062289_1_09e81fae:
    # "Later, he would've gone back to the fourth floor, and finally, he would've sent it to the fifth, where it was supposed to be. Shiroya and I wouldn't have noticed that.{w} It definitely ended up there: Sai confirmed it when he called it from the crystal floor."
    "之后，他再返回四楼，最后把电梯送回它本该停在的五楼。我和 Shiroya 不会察觉。{w} 电梯确实回到了那里：Sai 从水晶层叫电梯时，就确认了这一点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062290_1_c9f16525:
    # "I don't get it, though. Why would Akaro do that? He knew his trips up and down could be heard, didn't he?{w} And Erina and Isla didn't hear the elevator even once. I suppose it's possible Akaro stopped on floor 2 and then used the elevator to the crystal floor if he knew that wouldn't be heard, but if that happened, surely he would've done the same on floor 3 so that Sai wouldn't hear him either..."
    "可我还是不明白。Akaro 为什么要那么做？他明知道自己乘电梯上下会被人听见，不是吗？{w} 而且 Erina 和 Isla 一次也没听见电梯声。我也想过，如果 Akaro 知道这样不会被听见，他或许会先停在二楼，再乘电梯去水晶层；可如果真是这样，他在三楼时也该照做，免得被 Sai 听见才对……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062299_1_cd377f4a:
    # "Akaro had seen that one of the real Sekimeiya had been hidden in a cabinet with a damaged temperature wheel. It had changed colors, so he knew it wasn't the one Xyn had created."
    "Akaro 曾看到，其中一块真正的 Sekimeiya 被藏在温度转盘损坏的展示柜里。它已经变了颜色，所以他明白那不是 Xyn 造的那一块。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062303_1_e9351e17:
    # "Naomi A was going up the floors ahead of them, but she stopped on the fourth when she realized that was where Akaro would remain. She wanted to collect herself enough to talk to him; her shock at what Katei had done hadn't faded at all. ...However, before she did, he was gone."
    "Naomi A 先他们一步往楼上走，却在四楼停下——她意识到 Akaro 会留在那里。她想让自己镇定下来，好去跟他谈谈；Katei 做的事仍让她震惊不已。……然而，还没等她开口，他已经不在了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062306_1_22a556b5:
    # "Akaro had a bad feeling. Something very strange was happening with the Sekimeiya, so he needed to see the cleaning cart for himself. When he did, he saw that the one he'd hidden was actually gone."
    "Akaro 有种不祥的预感。Sekimeiya 的情况十分古怪，他必须亲眼看看清洁推车。等他去看时，才发现自己藏起来的那一块竟然不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062309_1_6bd7e116:
    # "Who had taken it? Not only the one in the cart, but also one of the two Akaro had left in the event room before lying on the floor. Silently, Akaro continued watching Katei, but it could've been Naomi as well.{w} Katei was acting like only one Sekimeiya existed, and Akaro didn't know the reason. It was rational to conclude that one of them being in a cold cabinet indicated the other was as well."
    "是谁拿走的？不只是推车里的那一块，就连 Akaro 躺到地上之前留在活动室的两块中也少了一块。Akaro 默不作声地继续观察 Katei，但拿走它的也可能是 Naomi。{w} Katei 的举动仿佛只存在一个 Sekimeiya，而 Akaro 不知道其中缘由。既然有一块被放进了低温展示柜，那另一块很可能也在同样的地方，这么想才说得通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062313_1_e0991061:
    # "During the previous search, he had looked through that room. He knew there was another cabinet that had been set to 0 °C.{w} The other real Sekimeiya was there, and it was all he needed. He only had to keep one hidden, but there weren't many places he could think of."
    "在先前那次搜查中，他查看过那个房间。他知道那里还有另一个设定为 0 °C 的展示柜。{w} 另一块真正的 Sekimeiya 就在里面，而这正是他需要的。他只要藏起一块就够了，可一时也想不出多少合适的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062314_1_d06de74c:
    # "He took the Future Sekimeiya out of the cabinet. When he did, it turned gray immediately, but nothing happened to him. Did it really have time travel powers? He had a hard time believing that, but it had just changed colors before him."
    "他把 未来Sekimeiya 从展示柜里取了出来。刚一拿出，它就立刻变成了灰色，可他身上什么也没发生。它真的拥有时间穿越的力量吗？他实在难以相信，可它刚刚就在他眼前变了颜色。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062321_1_03addbcd:
    # "In a rush, he chose to hide it in the men's bathroom. Inside the water tank seemed like a good idea."
    "匆忙之下，他决定把它藏进男洗手间。水箱里面似乎是个不错的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062330_1_ade3aa9f:
    # "When I was staring at the bathroom door, Naomi appeared from the other side of hallway C. She likely came from above.{w} She was the Naomi who'd appeared in the attic, but her actions differed from the Naomi who'd been killed. Why? Why didn't she ask to talk to Katei? What was she doing, exactly, moving around through the building?"
    "我正盯着洗手间的门时，Naomi 从 C走廊的另一头走了出来。她多半是从楼上下来的。{w} 她就是那个出现在阁楼里的 Naomi，可她的举动却和被杀死的那个 Naomi 不同。为什么？她为什么没有要求见 Katei？她在楼里四处走动，究竟是在做什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062336_1_1b54fac4:
    # "\"Akaro's description of Naomi's face fell short of her actual expression. She was visibly terrified, breathing heavily, moving oddly, and stopping in place every few seconds.\""
    "「Akaro 对 Naomi 神情的描述，远不及她真实的样子。她显然惊恐万分，呼吸急促，动作怪异，每隔几秒就停在原地。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062337_1_225bc027:
    # "When I saw her face, there was no doubt in me that she'd seen her own dead body. She was avoiding being found, perhaps because she knew what her killer had done to her."
    "看到她的脸时，我毫不怀疑，她已经见过自己的尸体。她躲着不让人找到，也许是因为她知道凶手对自己做了什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062338_1_8cb26158:
    # "What was she doing, then? When she made the sound and when she walked to that bathroom..."
    "那么，她到底在做什么？在她发出声响时，在她走向那间洗手间时……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062339_1_baa33a9b:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062340_1_49168813:
    # "I'm not sure, but... she was killed right there. Naomi said a few words before her body was pulled in."
    "我不太确定，不过……她就是在那里遇害的。尸体被拖进去之前，Naomi 说了几句话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062349_1_d7bf290e:
    # "When Naomi entered the bathroom... someone else was there."
    "Naomi 走进洗手间时……里面还有别人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062352_1_08c6d38d:
    # "Then, when I approached it, my footsteps were audible: her killer slammed the door shut and locked it."
    "接着我朝洗手间走去，脚步声被里面的人听见了——凶手猛地关上门，上了锁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062355_1_bc0c77e0:
    # "However, they couldn't have left before the point we all unlocked the door. They absolutely had to have disappeared from the bathroom."
    "可是，在我们所有人打开门锁之前，对方不可能离开。那个人绝对是从洗手间里凭空消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062358_1_25b2d2a5:
    # "How? When I inspected it by myself a bit later, no Sekimeiya was there. I don't believe it was taken out before that point either."
    "怎么做到的？稍后我独自进去查看时，里面根本没有 Sekimeiya。我也不认为它在此之前被人拿走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062359_1_e5773a6c:
    # "When that Naomi was killed, the third Sekimeiya was still in the event room. It's very likely the other two were hidden somewhere on the crystal floor."
    "那个 Naomi 被杀时，第三个 Sekimeiya 还在活动室。另外两个很可能就藏在水晶层的某处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062360_1_3bc05fb2:
    # "Did someone travel through time, bringing along Naomi's killer? If that's what happened, unless the Sekimeiya was on the second floor, I would've traveled too."
    "是有人带着杀害 Naomi 的凶手一起穿越时间了吗？若真是如此，除非那个 Sekimeiya 在二楼，否则我也该跟着穿越了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062361_1_e401b90b:
    # "I think the answer is different. I believe the Sekimeiya was inside the bathroom even though I didn't find it."
    "我想答案并非如此。我认为 Sekimeiya 当时就在洗手间里，只是我没有发现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062366_1_648a5695:
    # "After killing Naomi, her killer activated it. I had already run away, so I didn't travel."
    "杀害 Naomi 后，凶手启动了它。我已经跑开了，所以并没有跟着一起穿越。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062367_1_87f2ef66:
    # "They traveled to the future. After all, I'm pretty sure the Past Sekimeiya was in one of hallway B's crystal rooms, which is where Shiroya and I later traveled from.{w} Maybe I should've pieced together the reason why no Sekimeiya was found in the bathroom..."
    "凶手穿越到了未来。毕竟，我很确定 过去Sekimeiya 就在 B走廊的某间水晶展室里，而我和 Shiroya 后来正是从那里出发穿越的。{w}或许我早该想到，为什么洗手间里找不到任何 Sekimeiya……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062371_1_427395d2:
    # "A while later, right after I couldn't find anything inside, I heard a sound coming from hallway A. It was Sai."
    "过了一会儿，我在里面什么也没找到，就听见 A走廊那边传来声音。是 Sai。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062378_1_3932b9ab:
    # "He had traveled from the future, and in his hip pack was a disabled Sekimeiya that he didn't know about."
    "他是从未来穿越过来的，腰包里还放着一个关闭状态的 Sekimeiya——他自己并不知道。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062379_1_d504007e:
    # "He appeared with it—if that was the Future Sekimeiya, the one in the bathroom would've disappeared! It would have instantly teleported. I should've made that connection."
    "他是带着它出现的——如果那就是 未来Sekimeiya，洗手间里的那个应该已经消失了！它会瞬间传送走。我早该把这两件事联系起来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062387_1_e7402393:
    # "So, the person who traveled to the future... who was it? Who killed Naomi?{w} Knowing all of that, the answer has to be Akaro..."
    "那么，那个穿越到未来的人……究竟是谁？是谁杀了 Naomi？{w}既然已经知道这些，答案只能是 Akaro……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062388_1_1a747c45:
    # "When I approached the bathroom, the door was slammed. I knew the whole floor was about to be inspected, so I ran up the stairs."
    "我靠近洗手间时，门被猛地关上了。我知道整层楼很快会被搜查，于是跑上了楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062391_1_94b2ff95:
    # "Then, eventually, the others walked up—they'd found the attic key."
    "后来，其他人终于走了上来——他们找到了阁楼钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062394_1_36d4d984:
    # "As soon as I could, I went back down. I tried to find Akaro, who had suddenly disappeared from the group. ...But I couldn't."
    "一有机会，我便回到楼下。我想找到突然从队伍里消失的 Akaro……却怎么也找不到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062397_1_0e723c6f:
    # "I stopped myself when I saw the bathroom's door. It looked identical to how we'd seen it with the group when we found Akaro behind it, and I realized it had been me who'd left it like that. I concluded that no one else would touch the door."
    "看见洗手间的门时，我停下了脚步。那扇门的样子，和我们一群人发现 Akaro 躲在门后时看到的一模一样；我这才意识到，让门保持那副样子的正是我自己。于是我断定，不会再有别人去碰那扇门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062398_1_41f9605a:
    # "And it never happened. I watched from a distance for minutes, and when the group came from the attic, Akaro was already there. I can only think he teleported inside.{w} Why didn't he leave, though?"
    "而那种情况始终没有出现。我在远处观察了好几分钟，等众人从阁楼下来时，Akaro 已经在那里了。我只能想到，他是传送进去的。{w}可他为什么没有离开？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062403_1_69473e2c:
    # "That's gotta be due to the mental state we found him in. He looked out of it and unresponsive, likely because he had just killed a second Naomi who couldn't have existed.{w} After locking the door, he touched the Sekimeiya in the bathroom and went some amount of minutes into the future. Seeing as he appeared in the bathroom, it makes me think it was him who hid the Sekimeiya there in the past. That's why he knew where it was and why he rapidly activated it in an attempt to escape."
    "那一定跟他被发现时的精神状态有关。他看上去神志恍惚、毫无反应，大概是因为他刚刚杀死了本不该存在的第二个 Naomi。{w}锁上门后，他碰了洗手间里的 Sekimeiya，穿越到了若干分钟之后。既然他出现在洗手间里，我就觉得，之前把 Sekimeiya 藏在那里的人就是他。所以他才知道它在哪里，也才会为了逃跑而迅速启动它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062409_1_62194db6:
    # "But that doesn't explain the whole set of events. After we found Naomi's second body, we suddenly lost track of Akaro. We even looked all over the floor, but he wasn't anywhere, and Erina said he hadn't gone up."
    "但这还解释不了整件事。我们发现 Naomi 的第二具尸体后，Akaro 忽然不见了踪影。我们甚至把整层楼都找遍了，却哪儿都没有他；Erina 也说他并没有上楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062410_1_c56b7b09:
    # "The only explanation for all of this is that he traveled to the past. Later, he even admitted to having touched the Sekimeiya.{w} That makes a lot of sense. If Sai hid it in the crystal room that Shiroya and I later traveled from, we would've gone much more than forty minutes into the past."
    "这一切唯一的解释，就是他穿越回到了过去。后来他甚至承认自己碰过 Sekimeiya。{w}这样就说得通了。如果 Sai 把它藏在了那间水晶展室——我和 Shiroya 后来就是从那里出发穿越的——那我们就会回到比四十分钟前更早的时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062411_1_42cdef91:
    # "That makes me think that Akaro saw through Sai. Maybe he was aware that more than one Sekimeiya existed.{w} If that was the case, from his point of view, only Sai could've hidden the Past Sekimeiya. He knew the one we found in the storeroom wasn't the same one, so it wouldn't have been too hard to find out where it was. I remember that Shiroya found it quickly because she noticed a slight bump in one of the gem cabinets."
    "这让我觉得，Akaro 看穿了 Sai。也许他知道 Sekimeiya 不止一个。{w}若果真如此，在他看来，能藏起过去Sekimeiya 的人就只有 Sai。他知道我们在储藏室找到的那个并不是同一个，因此要查出它藏在哪里并不算难。我记得 Shiroya 很快就找到了它，因为她注意到其中一个宝石展示柜有轻微的凸起。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062412_1_00dc4d97:
    # "He traveled to the past, which is why we didn't find him. I'm not sure what led him to do it, but that reset the Sekimeiya's timer, allowing Shiroya and I to only travel forty minutes back when we found it."
    "他穿越回到了过去，所以我们才找不到他。我不清楚他为什么这么做，但那次穿越重置了 Sekimeiya 的计时，使我和 Shiroya 找到它时，只回到了四十分钟前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062418_1_786f4373:
    # "Later, Akaro said that upon touching the Sekimeiya, he teleported. However, he assured us he hadn't traveled through time.{w} He said he'd seen us searching through the floor, but he was probably referring to the search from minutes prior."
    "后来，Akaro 说他一碰到 Sekimeiya 就传送了。但他向我们保证自己并没有时间穿越。{w}他说看见我们在楼层里搜寻，可他指的应该是几分钟前的那次搜查。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062423_1_923120ec:
    # "Specifically, when we went up the floors and the three elevator trips happened. It's also the time where he I think he stored the Future Sekimeiya in the bathroom, so seeing his past self might have drawn him there."
    "具体来说，就是我们逐层上楼、电梯往返三次的那段时间。我想，他也是在那个时候把未来Sekimeiya 藏进了洗手间；所以，他也许是因为看见过去的自己，才被引到了那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062424_1_e6739dc1:
    # "I don't know why he killed Naomi, but this has to be the truth. ...Was murdering her the cause of the state we found him in?{w} When we saw him, the first thing he did was ask Sai for the time, and when he heard it, he said that he hadn't traveled through time—that he'd only teleported."
    "我不知道他为什么要杀 Naomi，但真相一定就是这样。……杀害她，是不是就是我们发现他时那副状态的原因？{w}我们见到他时，他做的第一件事就是向 Sai 询问时间；听到答案后，他说自己并没有时间穿越——只是传送了而已。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062425_1_0249851c:
    # "Wouldn't this explain it?{w} He went minutes to the past. I could probably calculate the exact amount, but that seems unnecessary.{w} There, he killed Naomi and immediately went to the future when he heard me approaching the bathroom.{w} If both travels were similar in length, upon being told the current time, he would've thought that he hadn't traveled through time at all, especially because he appeared in the bathroom when he went to the future. He barely moved, so there was no way he'd earlier gone to the past...{w} But there seemed to be more to it than that. Akaro's voice seemed deeper in denial."
    "这样不就解释得通了吗？{w}他穿越到了几分钟前。具体是几分钟，我大概算得出来，但似乎没这个必要。{w}他在那里杀了 Naomi，随后一听见我走近洗手间，就立刻穿越到了未来。{w}如果两次穿越的时长差不多，那么当他被告知当前时间时，就会以为自己根本没有穿越过——尤其因为他穿越到未来后又出现在了洗手间里。他几乎没挪动过位置，所以怎么也想不到自己先前竟去了过去……{w}但事情似乎不止如此。Akaro 的声音里，那种否认的意味更深。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062435_1_0ab13b17:
    # "In the bathroom, when the door opened, what Akaro last expected was to see Naomi lying on the floor again.{w} He had been incredibly worried that she'd seen him missing in the event room. If that had happened, she was a massive threat."
    "洗手间的门打开时，Akaro 最不愿看到的，就是 Naomi 又一次躺在地上。{w}他一直极为担心她发现他不在活动室。若真如此，她便是极大的威胁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062436_1_e55ed08e:
    # "However, out of nowhere, she had appeared dead in a room. Akaro, much to his own disgust, was relieved by that."
    "然而，她竟不知从哪里出现，死在了房间里。让 Akaro 自己都感到厌恶的是，他居然因此松了一口气。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062437_1_ad0b7653:
    # "Yet, for some reason, it hadn't ended there. Once he had progressed to different worries, Naomi had appeared dead a second time.{w} Akaro had no idea what was happening inside the tower. He only wanted his plan to succeed in order to have a future ahead of him."
    "可不知为何，事情并没有就此结束。当他开始操心别的事情时，Naomi 又一次死在了他眼前。{w}Akaro 完全不知道塔里正在发生什么。他只想让计划成功，好让自己还有未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062442_1_f082fdd3:
    # "Why was the bathroom suddenly empty? Where had her body gone? ...Could he really have gone to the past? The last time, the Sekimeiya had merely changed colors when he'd touched it, but that time, he appeared in hallway C."
    "洗手间为何突然空了？她的尸体去了哪里？……难道他真的时间穿越到了过去？上一次他碰到 Sekimeiya 时，它只是变了颜色；可那一次，他却出现在了 C走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062449_1_fa0b1c0e:
    # "The third time he saw Naomi's face, her eyes were staring into his. It couldn't be real; he doubted the stability of his own mind.{w} When her mouth opened, the words Akaro had been dreading entered his ears. She knew he had left the event room, and she knew that he'd been concealing it."
    "第三次看见 Naomi 的脸时，她的双眼正死死盯着他。那不可能是真的；他开始怀疑自己的神志是否还清醒。{w}当她开口时，Akaro 最害怕听到的话钻进了耳朵。她知道他离开过活动室，也知道他一直在隐瞒这件事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062453_1_9be4cece:
    # "Akaro lost himself in desperation. Naomi should've been dead—he couldn't comprehend how she'd come back. After a single, abrupt motion, she was on the floor, unresponsive."
    "Akaro 在绝望中失去了理智。Naomi 明明已经死了——他无法理解她怎么会回来。他猛地出手，她便倒在地上，没了反应。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062454_1_48115575:
    # "Immediately after that, Akaro heard footsteps approaching from the hallway. He was barely able to make them out over the violent drumming in his ears. As fast as he could, he slammed the door and frantically looked around him."
    "紧接着，他听见走廊里传来逼近的脚步声。耳中擂鼓般的轰鸣几乎盖过了一切，他只能勉强分辨出那声音。他以最快的速度砰地关上门，惊慌地环顾四周。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062466_1_6c27ff71:
    # "When I realized one of the keys the first Naomi had was the attic's, we went there for the first time."
    "我意识到第一个 Naomi 带的一串钥匙里，有一把是阁楼钥匙，于是我们第一次去了那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062469_1_91938b88:
    # "Sai pointed out that Naomi's footprints didn't make sense, and we found an empty suitcase on the sofa. ...It was the same one we saw in hallway C—it had come from another world alongside Naomi."
    "Sai 指出 Naomi 的脚印对不上，而我们又在沙发上发现了一只空行李箱。……那正是我们在 C走廊见过的那只——它随 Naomi 一起从另一个世界而来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062470_1_13417138:
    # "That's likely where she was keeping the Sekimeiya. To change worlds, both had to be powered on, so they didn't travel with Naomi. That's why the suitcase was empty, and it's why it wasn't in the attic in this world."
    "她很可能把 Sekimeiya 放在了那里。要切换世界，两个都必须处于启动状态，所以它们没有跟着 Naomi 一起过去。因此行李箱是空的，这个世界的阁楼里才会没有它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062474_1_6c9df8d0:
    # "And now that I think about it, someone reacted differently to both suitcases.{w} Katei."
    "现在回想起来，有个人对两只行李箱的反应并不一样。{w}Katei。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062478_1_bec142b5:
    # "Before we entered the attic, when Katei went to grab the bathroom key, he brought the suitcase in hallway C to the security room. But he never did that for the one in the attic."
    "我们进阁楼之前，Katei 去拿洗手间钥匙时，把 C走廊的那只行李箱带到了监控室。可阁楼里的那只，他却从没这样处理过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062479_1_481a462e:
    # "Why...? That makes me think it's because Naomi brought it up there. That one wasn't a threat to him because he didn't know anything about it."
    "为什么……？我猜是因为那只行李箱是 Naomi 带上去的。他对它一无所知，所以它对他不构成威胁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062487_1_78fd2650:
    # "We didn't find anything else of importance in the attic, so we went down to find Akaro. He was in a crystal floor bathroom and told us to leave him there for a while."
    "我们在阁楼里没再找到其他重要的东西，便下楼去找 Akaro。他在水晶展室的洗手间里，让我们先把他一个人留在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062491_1_f3e2e4c7:
    # "We ended up going back to the top... and in one of the bedrooms, I noticed the voice recorder in Isla's purse."
    "最后我们又回到了顶层……在其中一间卧室里，我注意到 Isla 手提包里的录音笔。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062499_1_3b8120d8:
    # "Now I know a lot more about the audio that we heard, but why was it there? Why did it travel to the past?"
    "现在我对听到的那段录音明白多了，可它为什么会在那里？又为什么会回到过去？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062500_1_a4ea68e0:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062501_1_c1530a9e:
    # "Can I figure that out? How did the recorder from the future end up on December 15th?"
    "我能弄明白吗？来自未来的录音笔，怎么会出现在十二月十五日？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062513_1_3301ce1e:
    # "Thinking about it, it's very unlikely the device traveled to December 15th.{w} Isla said it was impossible someone dropped it in her purse, which means it was there when she entered the tower."
    "仔细想想，这支录音笔几乎不可能是穿越到十二月十五日的。{w}Isla 说过，不可能有人把它丢进她的手提包，也就是说，她进塔时它就已经在里面了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062514_1_26e48afa:
    # "If that's the case, why did she have it before December 15th?"
    "若真是如此，她在十二月十五日之前为什么会有它？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062515_1_7d9fe0e3:
    # "I think... I know the answer.{w} It has to be due to her \"friend\"."
    "我想……我知道答案了。{w}一定和她的「朋友」有关。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062516_1_b07ba74d:
    # "Now I know that her friend was a version of her from another world. She met with our Isla quite a while before December 15th. She knew about the attack, so she traveled to the past at some point."
    "现在我知道了，她的「朋友」是来自另一个世界的她。那个人早在十二月十五日之前很久，就与我们这边的 Isla 见过面。她知道袭击的事，所以在某个时候穿越到了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062517_1_3ec84534:
    # "Apparently, when Sai and Akaro escaped from the attic, they met with \"Isla\". Even Erina heard her from the bedroom. She was dead at that point, so she probably wasn't the same Isla we'd been with.{w} Despite that, we never found her after we left the bedroom, so one explanation is that she traveled to the past at around that time."
    "听说 Sai 和 Akaro 从阁楼逃出来时，遇见了「Isla」。连 Erina 都在卧室里听见了她的声音。可她当时已经死了，所以那多半不是与我们待在一起的那个 Isla。{w} 尽管如此，我们离开卧室后始终没再找到她，所以有一种解释是：她大约在那个时候穿越回了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062518_1_55395332:
    # "She went many days into the past, and the location where she appeared had to be identical to where she'd be in the proportional future. That means days after December 15th."
    "她回到了许多天前的过去。她出现的地点，必须和她在未来对应时刻所在的位置完全一致——也就是说，那是十二月十五日之后的几天。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062522_1_3043b570:
    # "So, what happened to the device after it recorded the audio? Isla saw Sai hiding it, and she ended up with it.{w} If the replicated location was from a time where she still had it in the future, she would've appeared with it in the past."
    "那么，那支录音笔录下音频之后，又发生了什么？Isla 看见 Sai 把它藏了起来，最后东西落到了她手上。{w} 如果复制的地点对应的是她未来仍然持有录音笔的那个时间，那么她回到过去时就会随身带着它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062523_1_21067976:
    # "Isla's \"friend\" had the recorder days before the event; that's how it got to the past. ...Why was it inside our Isla's purse, then?"
    "Isla 的「朋友」在事件发生前几天就拿到了录音笔；它就是这样到了过去。……可既然如此，它为什么会在我们这个 Isla 的手提包里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062524_1_10e0e4ea:
    # "I can't know that, but it's likely the recorder appeared inside her friend's purse. Then, both Islas tried to hide the existence of the \"friend\" from Erina.{w} Two identical purses were in the past. There was probably a mix-up at some point, like the original Isla mistakenly taking the wrong purse on the day of the event for some reason."
    "这一点我无法确定，但录音笔很可能就是出现在她朋友的手提包里。随后，两个 Isla 都试图向 Erina 隐瞒「朋友」的存在。{w} 过去有两只一模一样的手提包。中途大概发生过一次拿错，比如原本的 Isla 因为某种缘故，在事件当天误拿了另一只包。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062530_1_0f7eeb2a:
    # "I don't think I need to know exactly how it came to happen, but it had to be Isla's friend who caused the recording to exist in the past."
    "我觉得不必弄清它究竟是如何发生的，但让那段录音存在于过去的人，一定是 Isla 的朋友。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062531_1_6657a600:
    # "After we listened to it, Shiroya and I left the attic alone. Going down the floors, we came across Akaro, who kept walking up. Then, on the crystal floor, we saw that the Sekimeiya we left in the event room was no longer there.{w} Someone took the third Sekimeiya out of the cabinet. ...Who would've wanted to do that?{w} At first glance, Akaro seemed to be the only candidate. However, I know someone else was there."
    "听完之后，我和 Shiroya 独自离开了阁楼。我们逐层往下时，遇到了正往上走的 Akaro。接着，在水晶层，我们发现留在活动室的 Sekimeiya 已经不见了。{w} 有人把第三个 Sekimeiya 从展示柜里取走了。……谁会想这么做？{w} 乍看之下，Akaro 似乎是唯一的人选。可我知道，当时还有另一个人在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062536_1_dac02f11:
    # "Shiroya and I found the Past Sekimeiya in a hallway B crystal room, unaware that it wasn't the same one that had just disappeared. That's most likely where Sai chose to hide it a while earlier.{w} What stands out to me is that he chose a room with functional cameras after previously leaving it in the storeroom. I wonder if he was forced to or if he had a reason, because it happened when we were searching both hallways..."
    "我和 Shiroya 在 B走廊的一间水晶展室里找到了过去Sekimeiya，却没意识到它并不是刚刚消失的那一个。那多半是 Sai 早些时候藏东西的地方。{w} 让我在意的是，他之前把东西放在储藏室，这次却选了一间监控还在运作的展室。我猜不透他是迫不得已，还是另有原因——毕竟他这么做的时候，我们正在同时搜索两条走廊……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062537_1_75b6ab74:
    # "It had been there since the previous time the Sekimeiya had disappeared, so it's worth noting that it wasn't found when we looked for Akaro, especially since he would've left the glass open after traveling.{w} ...Recalling how that search went, though, I'm pretty sure I get why that happened."
    "早在 Sekimeiya 上一次消失时，它就已经在那里了。因此，我们寻找 Akaro 时没有发现它，这一点值得注意——尤其是 Akaro 穿越之后，柜子的玻璃本该敞开着。{w} ……不过回想那次搜索的经过，我大致明白为什么会这样了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062540_1_9475b69c:
    # "We activated it and went forty minutes to the past. Thanks to that travel, we learned about the existence of the range."
    "我们启动了它，回到了四十分钟前的过去。也多亏那次穿越，我们才得知重叠范围的存在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062544_1_582c2510:
    # "After appearing in the security room, I witnessed what happened to the second Naomi. Then, I heard someone in hallway A: Sai."
    "我出现在监控室后，目睹了第二个 Naomi 的遭遇。接着，我听见 A走廊里有人——是 Sai。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062547_1_e004069f:
    # "He was supposed to be in the attic. It's indisputable that he traveled through time. Due to his wristwatch, I'm sure he came from the future."
    "他本应在阁楼里。他穿越了时间，这一点毋庸置疑。从他的手表来看，我确信他来自未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062548_1_00dc1387:
    # "Much later, he admitted to remembering the time I'd seen him, so it was definitely the same Sai who told the people in the attic not to follow us.{w} The way he traveled to the past confused me for a while. That's because he was surprised to see me; he didn't know I'd also traveled. If he traveled after Shiroya and I returned to the attic, he would've had to fake his surprise upon seeing me."
    "很久以后，他承认记得我见到他的那一次。所以在阁楼里叫大家不要跟下来的，肯定就是他。{w} 他回到过去的方式让我困惑了一阵：他见到我时很惊讶，因为他不知道我也穿越了。如果他是在我和 Shiroya 回到阁楼之后才穿越的，那他见到我时的惊讶就只能是装出来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062555_1_e9385c78:
    # "You perfectly remember when we went up to the attic to get the lithium battery, right?"
    "我们上阁楼去拿锂电池那件事，你记得一清二楚，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062560_1_4aa0d8f8:
    # "Of course."
    "当然。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062561_1_f129ebc4:
    # "How did you do that?"
    "你是怎么做到的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062562_1_3907c322:
    # "I said you're incompetent, but at least you're doing your best, unlike the others."
    "我说过你没本事，不过至少你还在尽力，不像其他人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062563_1_714290ab:
    # "Hm...?"
    "嗯……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062564_1_5991e7eb:
    # "That's my answer. I suppose it just appeared impressive from your point of view."
    "这就是我的回答。大概只是从你的角度看，才显得了不起吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062572_1_80b39f71:
    # "How did he travel before Shiroya and I returned? The others said he was there the whole time.{w} ...Is that really the case, though?{w} Shiroya told me what she heard when she was listening to them."
    "他究竟是怎样在我和 Shiroya 回来之前完成穿越的？其他人说他一直待在那里。{w} ……可真是这样吗？{w} Shiroya 把她旁听他们谈话时听到的内容告诉了我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062579_1_68b4552a:
    # "Yes. He was leading the conversation, telling everyone not to follow us down. Akaro was there too, and he confirmed that he saw us. Sai told them all to wait for us because we'd be responsible for anything that happened after leaving of our own volition..."
    "是的。他主导着谈话，叫大家别跟着我们下去。Akaro 也在，还确认他看见我们了。Sai 让他们都等着我们，毕竟是我们自己要离开的，之后出什么事都由我们负责……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062580_1_5f4008c4:
    # "...I see. So he wanted the others not to come down."
    "……我明白了。所以他想让其他人别下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062581_1_e142c163:
    # "He kept saying it. He never left, and the elevator was still there with the door open. The conversation started winding down, and when they talked about going to the bathroom, I left right away so nobody would see me.{w} I stayed in the living room for a couple minutes with the doors closed, but I think that they all took that time to go to the bathroom, so I started going down again to find you. I looked through every floor until I saw you right as I was about to start with this one."
    "他反复这么说。他一直没离开，电梯也还停在那里，门开着。谈话渐渐接近尾声，他们提到要去洗手间时，我立刻离开，免得被人看见。{w} 我关着门在客厅里待了几分钟，但我想他们就是趁那段时间一起去了洗手间，于是我又往下走去找你。我一层层找下来，正要从这一层开始找时，就看见了你。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062587_1_d92033b3:
    # "That was all Sai needed to trick the others.{w} Everyone went to the bathroom, so when it was his turn, he could've gone to the crystal floor. He had hidden the Past Sekimeiya, so he traveled after us when it had already gathered a lot of energy.{w} There was something curious about Sai's behavior. He kept insisting that he hadn't traveled to the past, and he was in a rush. He tried to run away from me twice.{w} That's probably because he had to be ready to go back to the attic. As soon as his past self \"went to the bathroom\", he returned as if nothing had happened, which made the others say that he never left the attic."
    "对 Sai 来说，骗过其他人只需要做到这一点。{w} 所有人都去洗手间，轮到他时，他就能去水晶展室。他事先藏好了过去Sekimeiya，等它积蓄了足够多的能量，才在我们之后穿越。{w} Sai 的行为有一点奇怪。他一直坚称自己没有回到过去，而且显得很匆忙。他两次想甩开我逃走。{w} 这大概是因为他必须准备好回到阁楼。等他过去的自己一“去洗手间”，他便若无其事地回来了，所以其他人才会说，他从没离开过阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062588_1_b392a76d:
    # "I don't know about the actual specifics. Shiroya said it was possible she missed him when she was inspecting the office rooms, but when we returned to the attic, we didn't see Sai's footprints in the living room...{w} That's strange, since I don't think he could've taken the elevator back up. The key was in the attic's door, and he wouldn't have appeared with it, so he couldn't have activated the floor 7 button. Furthermore, it should have been disabled in the attic anyway."
    "具体经过我并不清楚。Shiroya 说，她在检查办公室时可能漏看了他，可我们回到阁楼后，并没有在客厅里看到 Sai 的脚印……{w} 这很奇怪，因为我不认为他能乘电梯上去。钥匙插在阁楼门上，而他穿越时不可能带着钥匙出现，所以无法按下七楼的按钮。况且，七楼按钮在阁楼里本来就该是禁用状态。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062592_1_dc1d985c:
    # "I'm not sure if this is exactly what happened, but maybe when Shiroya was in the attic, Sai, claiming to go to the bathroom, sent the elevator to the crystal floor and called it. Then, he went to the bathroom.{w} Afterward, he took the elevator down. If Shiroya was still in the attic, she wouldn't have heard it. Sai traveled to the past, and that's where I met up with him.{w} Entering the elevator on the crystal floor and waiting for his past self to call it was one route back to the attic."
    "我不确定事情是否真是这样。不过，也许 Shiroya 在阁楼时，Sai 借口去洗手间，把电梯送到水晶展室，再把它叫回来。随后，他去了洗手间。{w} 之后，他乘电梯下楼。如果 Shiroya 当时还在阁楼，就不会听见电梯的声音。Sai 穿越到了过去，我就是在那里遇见他的。{w} 回到阁楼的一条路线，就是先在水晶展室进入电梯，等过去的自己把电梯叫上去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062593_1_289915c8:
    # "I don't know if his plan went this far or if I'm missing something else...{w} Maybe he did all of this just so he wouldn't be analyzed for what he wanted to do. He set it up so that Shiroya and I would be much easier to suspect."
    "我不知道他的计划是否周密到了这一步，还是我漏掉了别的什么……{w} 也许他做这一切，只是为了不让人看穿他真正的目的。他故意布置成这样，让人更容易怀疑我和 Shiroya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062596_1_ee49c587:
    # "But again, what about the cameras? They would've recorded him going down.{w} Later, he voiced his thoughts regarding that—he didn't think the recorded footage would ever see the light of the day. As far as he and the rest of us knew, the killer had willingly recorded themselves committing crimes."
    "可话说回来，监控呢？它们应该拍到了他下楼。{w} 后来他谈到过这一点——他认为那些录像永远不可能公之于众。就他和我们所有人所知，凶手是自愿录下自己犯罪过程的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062597_1_656c0a9e:
    # "What was it he wanted to do? He'd hidden a functional Sekimeiya, so I bet he wanted to know whether he'd really travel through time with it.{w} He took the third Sekimeiya away from the cabinet even though it was him who found it for us..."
    "他到底想做什么？他藏起了一个还能用的 Sekimeiya，所以我猜，他是想知道自己是否真能靠它穿越时间。{w} 明明是他替我们找到了第三个 Sekimeiya，却把它从展示柜里拿走了……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062598_1_c1f6996f:
    # "And the Future Sekimeiya... He appeared with it in his hip pack. I think he was genuinely surprised about that."
    "还有未来Sekimeiya……他出现时，它就在他腰包里。我想他对此是真的感到意外。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062599_1_13b7d156:
    # "Then, when he ran away from me, he hid the Past Sekimeiya somewhere else. He knew I'd traveled through time, meaning that I was aware of its whereabouts."
    "后来他从我面前逃走时，把过去Sekimeiya 藏到了别处。他知道我穿越过时间，也就明白我清楚它被藏在哪里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062603_1_fdd98451:
    # "There is one detail I'm still struggling to understand."
    "还有一个细节，我始终没能想通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062604_1_86007a0d:
    # "The screen on his wristwatch was blank. The fundamental answer behind that has to be the replicated location upon traveling to the past."
    "他手表上的屏幕是一片空白。其根本原因，一定与穿越回过去时复制出的地点有关。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062605_1_8ceb534d:
    # "But, even if the watch looped through time infinitely and didn't just crumble into dust, why did the date go up to the year 9,999? There's no chance the battery would've lasted that long, and it was swapping it for a new one that let the watch work again."
    "可就算那块表在时间里无限循环，而不只是一下子碎成灰，日期又为什么会一直走到 9,999 年？电池不可能撑那么久，而它后来能重新运转，正是因为换了新电池。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062606_1_67a012e6:
    # "The answer to that is clear: it's because a new battery was added before the location to be replicated took place in the future. Thanks to that, if the watch looped infinitely, the addition of the new battery would let each instance add up more time without the battery ever running out."
    "答案很清楚：因为在未来那个待复制的地点形成之前，新电池就已经被装了进去。正因如此，如果表无限循环，新电池的加入就会让每一次循环都累加更多时间，而电池永远不会耗尽。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062607_1_0315ae06:
    # "However, this brings about another issue. Why didn't the watch work in the past?{w} After all, it worked again when we added the new battery. This means that minutes later, during the future location, the watch should've been working. It seems to be an impossibility that it wasn't working in the past, given both locations are supposed to be the same."
    "然而，这又引出了另一个问题：为什么表在过去无法运转？{w} 毕竟我们装上新的锂电池后，它就恢复了。这意味着，几分钟后、也就是处于未来那个地点时，表本应正在运转。可既然两个地点理应相同，它在过去却无法运转，这实在说不过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062608_1_ff66bb74:
    # "...Is there an answer to this? One that makes sense?"
    "……这件事有答案吗？一个说得通的答案？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062617_1_856788e3:
    # "If Sai traveled a second time before the future location, the battery would've instantly run out. However, I have no reason to believe that occurred. I think the answer could be something else."
    "如果 Sai 在未来那个地点形成之前又穿越了一次，电池应该会立刻耗尽。但我没有理由相信发生过这种事。我认为答案可能在别处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062619_1_bd473408:
    # "If Sai swapped back the batteries before the future location, it would explain the broken watch in the past. However, I have no reason to believe that occurred. I think the answer could be something else."
    "如果 Sai 在未来那个地点形成之前把电池换了回去，那就能解释表在过去为何无法运转。但我没有理由相信他这么做过。我认为答案可能在别处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062620_1_d49917b1:
    # "Now that I think more about it, it could be due to the lithium battery itself.{w} It was in the attic, a place that's been abandoned for many years. It was, I have to assume, a battery that the Ashiya family had when they lived there."
    "再仔细想想，问题也许出在锂电池本身。{w} 它一直放在阁楼里，那地方已经废弃多年。我只能推测，那是芦屋家还住在这里时留下的电池。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062624_1_e01c0db5:
    # "Lithium batteries discharge something like 2%% of their capacity every month. When we put it in the watch, it was probably almost entirely discharged."
    "锂电池每个月大约会损失 2%% 的电量。我们把它装进手表时，它大概已经快耗尽了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062625_1_1101f8b7:
    # "The small energy it had was enough to let the loop cap the timer at 9,999, but it also ran out before the future location."
    "它剩下的那点电量，足以让循环把计时器顶到 9,999，却也会在未来那个地点形成之前耗尽。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062626_1_464801cd:
    # "We eventually learned that, in the lobby, Sai asked Katei for another lithium battery. At that point, I don't actually think he should've traveled through time again. That happened because the battery we'd obtained from the attic had already run out."
    "后来我们得知，Sai 曾在大厅向 Katei 又要了一块锂电池。按理说，到那时他本不该再次穿越时间。可他之所以又穿越了，是因为我们从阁楼拿到的电池已经耗尽了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062627_1_95472f45:
    # "...{w}But does this really make sense, or am I missing something crucial? I just remembered...{w} Sai must have synced his watch to the computer after we saw the \"9,999\" date since it was working when Shiroya and I returned to the attic. The time would always have been set to that specific point before reaching the end of the loop, so it couldn't have kept counting up..."
    "……{w}可这真的说得通吗？还是我漏掉了什么关键之处？我刚刚想起来……{w} 在我们看到「9,999」这个日期之后，Sai 一定把手表跟电脑同步过——毕竟我和 Shiroya 回到阁楼时，它已经能正常显示。循环结束前，时间总会被设回那个特定时刻，所以不可能一直往上累加……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062628_1_a0954c22:
    # "Would the date have been able to reach \"9,999\" anyway? In the end, I'm not really sure I understand how that happened."
    "话说回来，日期真的有可能走到「9,999」吗？到头来，我还是不太明白那究竟是怎么发生的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062639_1_bcd38d9e:
    # "...After Shiroya and I reunited outside the security room, we went back to the attic, where we were told we'd been downstairs for fifty minutes. ...There, Sai's watch displayed the current time, but that was because he had seen it in the security room."
    "……我和 Shiroya 在监控室外会合后，回到了阁楼，却被告知我们已经在楼下待了五十分钟。……在那里，Sai 的手表显示着当前时间，但那是因为他在监控室里看过时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062640_1_82ed7e8e:
    # "We explained everything. Most importantly, the Sekimeiya had disappeared from the event room. That's why we went to the crystal floor."
    "我们把一切解释了一遍。最重要的是，活动室里的 Sekimeiya 不见了。我们正是因此才去了水晶层。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062646_1_4955ee3b:
    # "When we got there, Sai was already gone."
    "我们赶到时，Sai 已经不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062649_1_eedc15ab:
    # "We were fast enough to see him in front of the cleaning room, where he'd hidden a Sekimeiya.{w} I thought something then..."
    "我们赶得够快，正好看见他站在清洁间前——他把一个 Sekimeiya 藏在了那里。{w} 当时我心里冒出一个念头……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062652_1_e3ea6ce6:
    # "\"Shiroya was looking around while I questioned Sai's ambiguous action. If he'd concealed the Sekimeiya in that room, I wasn't sure why he left upon realizing that we'd seen him. He had the opportunity to give up, but instead, he left for hallway C.\""
    "「我琢磨着 Sai 这番难以理解的举动，Shiroya 则在四下打量。如果他把 Sekimeiya 藏在了那间屋里，为什么一发现被我们看见就离开了？他本可以就此作罢，却偏偏朝 C走廊去了。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062653_1_1b76d493:
    # "He likely wanted to travel through time, probably because he knew we were about to search the floor. But even though we'd seen him, he still had another Sekimeiya hidden somewhere else. In fact, at that point, he should've known where all three of them were, and he went toward hallway A..."
    "他多半是想穿越时间，大概是因为知道我们马上就要搜查这一层。可就算被我们看见了，他还有另一个 Sekimeiya 藏在别处。事实上，那时他应该已经知道它们三个都在哪里，却还是朝 A走廊去了……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062656_1_224e6921:
    # "And out of nowhere, I teleported. Shiroya saw the Sekimeiya's glow within the cleaning cart and made both of us appear in the attic."
    "紧接着，毫无征兆地，我被传送了。Shiroya 看见清洁车里 Sekimeiya 发出的光，于是我们俩一起出现在了阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062665_1_db4d46e0:
    # "At the time, we thought we'd gone to the past. That's not what happened, though.{w} We recognized our locations—we'd been there half an hour before we'd traveled. That means we went half an hour to the future."
    "当时我们以为自己回到了过去，其实并非如此。{w}那些地方我们都认得——正是穿越前半小时我们待过的地方。也就是说，我们往未来跳了半个小时。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062670_1_d2d89598:
    # "The staircase door is open, so this is past the time we unlocked the attic. There are a bunch of footprints next to the door, but I don't see ours. This must mean that you and I haven't gone down yet.{w} These are probably the ones that we left after going back up, when we found Akaro in the bathroom. We're not before that point since there are too many."
    "楼梯间的门开着，说明现在已经过了我们打开阁楼的时间。门边有一堆脚印，可我没看到我们的。这么说，我们还没下楼。{w}这些多半是我们重新上楼之后留下的，也就是在洗手间发现 Akaro 那会儿。脚印这么多，说明现在不会早于那一刻。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062671_1_4ec20db4:
    # "That was a big misinterpretation.{w} We were told what caused those footprints. It was the search that occurred after Isla went missing; the ones Shiroya and I had left were long buried.{w} They were all slightly faded too. There was no chance we'd just traveled a few seconds back, which led me to be pretty certain of the time."
    "那是个天大的误判。{w}后来我们才知道那些脚印是怎么来的——是 Isla 失踪后众人搜索时踩出来的，我和 Shiroya 的脚印早被盖住了。{w}而且所有脚印都略微褪了色。我们不可能只往回穿越了几秒，正因如此，我才对时间相当有把握。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062676_1_c31a2ff9:
    # "How is that possible, though?{w} We heard a sound coming from the bedroom where we'd been. Who the hell was that? Nobody should've been there, right?"
    "可这怎么可能？{w}我们听见声音从刚才待过的那间卧室传来。到底是谁？那里不该有人的吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062679_1_4fad795d:
    # "We hid ourselves, thinking we were escaping the sight of our past selves. ...It appears that didn't actually occur."
    "我们躲了起来，以为是在避开过去的自己。……可实际上，过去的自己似乎并没有出现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062682_1_9b044c32:
    # "And in the second level of the opposite bedroom, both of us fell asleep.{w} When we woke up, we had no idea how long we'd been there for. That's why, when we were told the time, we thought we'd slept for quite a while. In reality, the main reason a lot of time had passed was because we'd gone to the future."
    "而在对面卧室的第二层，我们两个都睡着了。{w}醒来后，我们根本不知道已经过了多久。所以后来有人告诉我们时间，我们才以为睡了很久。实际上，时间过去这么久，主要是因为我们跳到了未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062689_1_9d12f14c:
    # "I couldn't believe it. We'd really misunderstood so many things."
    "我简直不敢相信。我们竟把那么多事情都理解错了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062693_1_14bb244d:
    # "When we woke up, we had no idea what transpired on the crystal floor. Tired and still uneasy about our nonexistent past selves, we went to the living room."
    "醒来时，我们对水晶层上的情况一无所知。我们拖着疲惫的身子走向客厅，心里还在为那些根本不存在的过去的自己感到不安。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062699_1_414ec73d:
    # "Did we leave it like this?"
    "我们走的时候就是这样吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062700_1_370ba8dd:
    # "\"We were used to looking at the footprints in front of the door, but that was no longer possible. The door was closed, and the movement of it had erased every single footprint nearby, creating an empty arc.\""
    "我们原本习惯先看看门前的脚印，现在却看不到了。门已经关上，门扇扫过的地方把附近的脚印抹得一干二净，只留下一道空荡荡的弧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062701_1_e34ac230:
    # "We must have. This means that the group already left, though."
    "应该是吧。不过这也说明，那群人已经先离开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062702_1_31aad71d:
    # "\"Even though the motion of the door wiped out the nearby marks, there were many around the entire room. They were much fainter than the last time I'd seen them, but I was still able to recognize that new ones existed.\""
    "门的转动虽然抹去了近处的痕迹，但整个房间里还留着许多。它们比我上次见到的淡了不少，可我还是能辨认出，其中有些是新留下的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062703_1_e18d7a4c:
    # "The new footprints weren't from the time we walked to the crystal floor. ...Who did they belong to?"
    "那些新脚印不是我们走向水晶层时留下的。……它们属于谁？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062705_1_c06704d2:
    # "...That was simple to solve—the remaining few gaps in that puzzle were all part of the same piece."
    "……这倒不难。那道谜题里剩下的几处空白，其实都属于同一块拼图。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062712_1_64b1c550:
    # "When we came down, we saw that the cleaning cart had disappeared. What was strange was that the Sekimeiya was in one of the buckets which had been below it.{w} But that wasn't the Future Sekimeiya; it wasn't working.{w} Why was the third Sekimeiya there? Had it also been in the cart when we'd traveled? Shiroya said something else was there, but would the third Sekimeiya not have disappeared with the cart? ...And she said it was a dark object.{w} I'm not sure, but I think I can guess what happened to the Future Sekimeiya."
    "下楼时，我们发现清洁车不见了。奇怪的是，Sekimeiya 就在原本位于车下的一个水桶里。{w}可那不是未来Sekimeiya，它没在工作。{w}第三个 Sekimeiya 怎么会在这儿？我们穿越时它也在车上吗？Shiroya 说当时那里还有别的什么，可第三个 Sekimeiya 不是该跟车一起消失吗？……而且她说那是个深色的东西。{w}我没有把握，不过未来Sekimeiya 的去向，我大概猜得到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062720_1_ef942139:
    # "When Shiroya used it, the Future Sekimeiya remained in the cleaning room, but we only found the third Sekimeiya, which we decided to leave in Naomi's locker before going to the lobby."
    "Shiroya 使用它的时候，未来Sekimeiya 留在了清洁间，可我们只找到了第三个 Sekimeiya；我们决定把它放进 Naomi 的储物柜，然后去大厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062728_1_ec6cb1c4:
    # "There, Sai explained what happened while we were absent."
    "在那里，Sai 说明了我们不在时发生的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062729_1_863ef5dd:
    # "He pointed out the fact that he was the first person to enter the cleaning room after our disappearance. Since we had followed him there, he knew it was possible we'd traveled."
    "他指出，我们消失之后，第一个进入清洁间的人就是他。既然我们当时是跟在他后面去的，他就知道我们有可能已经穿越了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062742_1_1d0a30e6:
    # "\"Sai, showing the strongest reaction, approached the room while letting out a conspicuous grunt.{w} He opened the door and stayed still for some time. Then, he entered the small space. Before the others had time to wonder what he was doing, he exited and told them that it was empty.\""
    "反应最大的是 Sai，他闷哼一声，走向那间房。{w} 他推开门，在门口一动不动地站了好一会儿，随后才走进那个狭小的空间。其他人还没来得及琢磨他在做什么，他就已经出来，说里面空无一人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062743_1_f7cfa38d:
    # "The powered-off Sekimeiya was there, and he put it in his hip pack. That's why he had appeared with it in the past...{w} In the cleaning room, the others were distracted by the missing cart, and Sai pointed out the third Sekimeiya in the bucket.{w} I'm still having trouble understanding the cause behind some of these details, though. He was only able to obtain the Future Sekimeiya like that because he had appeared with it and had hidden it in the cleaning room... This seems to be an event with no origin, so perhaps it's an indication that something else happened on top of it."
    "那个已经断电的 Sekimeiya 就在里面，他把它收进了腰包。所以他才会带着它出现在过去……{w}在清洁间里，其他人都在为不见的清洁车分神，Sai 则指出了水桶里的第三个 Sekimeiya。{w}不过这些细节背后的原因，我到现在还是没想明白。他能那样拿到未来Sekimeiya，是因为他曾带着它出现，并把它藏在了清洁间……这件事似乎没有起因，或许说明还有别的事情叠在它上面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062751_1_e9b5ee48:
    # "\"It was Sai who first questioned its status, as it somewhat contradicted a few things they'd concluded earlier. It was white, instead of the gray color they thought it'd become after teleporting two people and a whole cleaning cart.\""
    "「最先对它的状态起疑的是 Sai，因为这和之前的几点结论有些出入。它是白色的，而不是他们以为的灰色——按说传送了两个人再加一整辆清洁车，它应该变灰才对。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062759_1_715d4759:
    # "Akaro saw us enter and never leave the cleaning room—they knew we traveled through time. However, there was another disappearance.{w} Katei's."
    "Akaro 看见我们进了清洁间就再没出来——他们知道我们穿越了时间。可还有另一起失踪。{w}Katei 的失踪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062760_1_cc950564:
    # "The remaining people searched through every room on the crystal floor, but they didn't find us.{w} When they were about to go up, Isla walked to room A5. That's when she fell into a cabinet and disappeared."
    "剩下的人把水晶层的每个房间都搜了一遍，却没有找到我们。{w}就在他们准备上楼时，Isla 走到了水晶展室 A5。她就是在那里跌进展示柜，消失不见的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062761_1_71d7b34f:
    # "...I wonder what happened.{w} The cabinet she looked into is one that can be seen from the stairs, where she and Erina were waiting.{w} During the period Sai and Akaro investigated the rooms, I'm sure Sai quickly disposed of the Future Sekimeiya. That makes me think Isla saw him do that through the door's gap..."
    "……她身上到底发生了什么？{w}她看的那台展示柜，从楼梯那边正好看得见，而她和 Erina 当时就在楼梯那儿等着。{w}在 Sai 和 Akaro 查看房间的那段时间里，Sai 肯定很快就把未来Sekimeiya 处理掉了。这么一想，Isla 会不会是透过门缝看见了……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062762_1_47bb53e1:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062763_1_e567b81d:
    # "What happened to her, though? I don't really have any good idea."
    "可她究竟出了什么事？我实在没什么头绪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062765_1_910307da:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062766_1_979f1b9f:
    # "The situation around her death was inscrutable, so I thought further ahead for the time being."
    "她的死实在蹊跷，我只好暂且把思路转到后面的事上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062771_1_95cef589:
    # "When the others saw Isla disappeared, they were unable to find a Sekimeiya in room A5's cabinet.{w} I'd bet it was powered off, and there was very little light. Since Sai knew the Sekimeiya was there, it wouldn't surprise me if he grabbed it immediately before the others saw it. I'm not sure about that, though."
    "其他人看到 Isla 消失后，在水晶展室 A5 的展示柜里找过，却没找到 Sekimeiya。{w}我猜它已经断电，周围光线又很暗。Sai 既然知道 Sekimeiya 在那里，赶在别人看清之前把它拿走，也不奇怪。不过这点我没有把握。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062774_1_81aec1bb:
    # "Everyone thought Isla had to be somewhere in the building. That made them search through every floor, but nobody was found."
    "大家都认定 Isla 一定还在楼里某处。于是他们搜遍了每一层，却一个人也没找到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062775_1_246a20f9:
    # "Isla wasn't found. Katei wasn't found. Shiroya and I weren't found.{w} Of course, we weren't found because we were in the process of traveling to the future. What about Katei, though?"
    "Isla 没被找到，Katei 没被找到，我和 Shiroya 也没被找到。{w}我们之所以没被找到，自然是因为当时正穿越到未来。可 Katei 呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062783_1_defc4454:
    # "I don't think Katei could've been found either."
    "我想 Katei 同样不可能被找到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062787_1_41220af1:
    # "Before we traveled to the future, we saw Sai in front of the cleaning room."
    "在穿越到未来之前，我们看见 Sai 站在清洁间门前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062788_1_89eba22c:
    # "\"I wasn't sure what Sai planned to do, but we'd seen him standing in front of the door. Shiroya and I entered while Katei continued toward hallway C in pursuit of him.\""
    "我不知道 Sai 打算做什么，但我们确实看见他站在门前。Shiroya 和我进了那间屋子，Katei 则继续朝 C走廊追去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062795_1_bd87beca:
    # "When we traveled to the future, Katei was actually very close to us. We went half an hour forward, so I'm sure the range picked him up."
    "我们穿越到未来时，Katei 其实离我们很近。我们向前跳了半小时，那个范围一定把他一起卷了进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062801_1_63d00d34:
    # "Half an hour earlier, he, Shiroya, and I were in the attic, so that's where we appeared in the future. Katei was in the rightmost bedroom.{w} He suddenly teleported there and left the room, disoriented. He's the one we heard approaching the door when we were in the hallway and who left the newer footprints in the living room."
    "半小时前，他、Shiroya 和我都在阁楼，所以我们穿越到未来后就出现在阁楼。Katei 当时在最右边那间卧室。{w}他忽然被传送到那里，神志恍惚地走出房间。我们在走廊里听到的靠近门口的动静就是他，客厅里较新的脚印也是他留下的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062807_1_49090f74:
    # "After failing to find anyone, Erina, Akaro, and Sai gave up and moved back to the lobby.{w} There was only silence for a long time until they heard a sound from hallway A."
    "找了一圈毫无收获，Erina、Akaro 和 Sai 只好作罢，回到大厅。{w}此后很长一段时间只剩寂静，直到 A走廊那边传来声响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062811_1_e99f0ac0:
    # "It was Katei. He had walked down after appearing in the bedroom, and Shiroya and I were about to fall asleep."
    "是 Katei。他在卧室现身之后一路走了下来，那时我和 Shiroya 正要睡过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062818_1_9674b649:
    # "Where did you go...? We searched for you."
    "你去哪儿了……？我们一直在找你。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062819_1_27652509:
    # "\"Sai shot the first question, and an immediate answer came that left the three of them unsatisfied.\""
    "先开口的是 Sai，回答来得也快，却让三人都不满意。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062824_1_d5e114d5:
    # "I don't know. I think I experienced what Atsuki said... That teleportation. I've been searching for you."
    "我不知道。我大概经历了 Atsuki 说的那件事……那个传送。我一直在找你们。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062832_1_cde42b60:
    # "Then, they looked into the cabinet where Isla had disappeared.{w} She was there, already dead. The Sekimeiya, meanwhile, was nowhere to be found."
    "随后，他们去查看 Isla 消失的那个展示柜。{w}她就在里面，人已经死了。而那个 Sekimeiya 却怎么也找不到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062833_1_b51b0ca0:
    # "After they waited in the lobby again, Shiroya and I appeared. We told them they hadn't found us because we'd been sleeping in the attic."
    "他们又在大厅等了一阵，我和 Shiroya 才出现。我们告诉他们，之所以没被找到，是因为我们一直在阁楼睡觉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062841_1_6d6734f6:
    # "Understand that what you've told us is that you two spent all this time asleep in the attic. Despite this, you weren't found."
    "你要清楚，按你的说法，你们俩这段时间一直在阁楼里睡觉。可即便如此，你们却没被找到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062842_1_33f95b38:
    # "...You didn't find Katei either, so you obviously didn't do a great job. And you were in a rush, so you kept yelling Isla's name while quickly looking. I bet you didn't look at the upper levels of the bedrooms, which is where we were, and since we were asleep, we didn't hear you."
    "……你们不也没找到 Katei 吗？可见搜得也不怎么样。而且你们当时急匆匆的，一边喊着 Isla 的名字一边草草查看。我敢说，你们根本没看卧室上层——我们就待在那儿；再说我们睡着了，也听不见你们。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062843_1_5f2c9c73:
    # "This only made sense from our point of view, but Sai never denied it.{w} Why? There's no way he really didn't look at the upper levels, is there?{w} Perhaps that was the first indication he had that traveling to the future was possible, and he consciously chose not to let us know. Since he should've been in hallway C when Katei disappeared, I wonder if he turned around and realized what had happened to him too."
    "这话只有从我们的角度才说得通，可 Sai 始终没有反驳。{w}为什么？他总不可能真的没看卧室上层吧？{w}也许正是那时，他第一次察觉到穿越到未来的可能，于是刻意不让我们知道。Katei 消失时，他应该就在 C走廊；我猜他是不是回过头，也明白 Katei 身上发生了什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062850_1_46a8e6c3:
    # "In any case, when we went to see Isla with our own eyes, there was a major distinction: the Sekimeiya was there, emitting a faint glow."
    "总之，等我们亲眼去看 Isla 时，有一个很大的不同：那个 Sekimeiya 就在那里，发着幽幽的微光。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062851_1_5639623b:
    # "What the hell happened? That Sekimeiya was working, and we had hidden the third one in Naomi's locker. ...How did that one appear back in the cabinet?"
    "究竟发生了什么？那个 Sekimeiya 明明还在运作，而第三个本该被我们藏在 Naomi 的储物柜里。……它怎么又回到了展示柜里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062852_1_8ec6dd63:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062858_1_80668c31:
    # "I don't get it. I don't know what happened to Isla.{w} Is there a whole other factor that I'm missing about this? Did something else occur that I don't know about?"
    "我不明白。我不知道 Isla 到底出了什么事。{w} 难道那件事里还有我完全没想到的另一层因素？是不是还发生了别的、我一无所知的事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062859_1_69f346c2:
    # "Isla disappeared from the cabinet, but how? Did she go to the future? ...The Future Sekimeiya should've been powered off since we had just used it.{w} Even if that happened, did she reappear in that same cabinet, where she'd gone to look?{w} Why, though? She wasn't there in the past, was she? And why did she die?"
    "Isla 从展示柜里消失了，可这是怎么做到的？她去了未来吗？……未来Sekimeiya 应该已经断电了，因为我们刚用过它。{w} 就算真是那样，她难道会重新出现在她刚才查看的那个展示柜里吗？{w} 可为什么？过去那里并没有她，对吧？而且她为什么会死？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062860_1_2447426e:
    # "Right, she yelled before falling in. What the hell does that mean? Did she go to the past?{w} Before, Sai had kept walking toward hallway A—perhaps he put the Future Sekimeiya where he had the past one, for whatever reason. Since the future one should've been powered off, Isla would've actually traveled back in time and not changed worlds. I can't know if the search took long enough for it to power back on, though."
    "对，她在掉进去之前喊了一声。那到底是什么意思？她去了过去吗？{w} 之前 Sai 一直朝 A走廊走去——也许他不知出于什么原因，把未来Sekimeiya 放到了原本放着过去Sekimeiya 的位置。既然未来Sekimeiya 应该已经断电，那 Isla 应该就是穿越回了过去，而没有触发世界切换。不过，我没法确定那次搜寻是否持续得足够久，让它重新启动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062861_1_9eb183ea:
    # "But... that still doesn't make sense, does it? If she saw herself, what happened to her other body? Why the hell was it even there? And if both Sekimeiya were active, she should've changed worlds... Also, I know Sai could only put one in his hip pack, so the other would've been seen."
    "可是……这仍然说不通，对吧？如果她看见了自己，那她的另一具身体又怎么了？那具身体究竟为什么会出现在那里？而且，如果两个 Sekimeiya 都处于启动状态，她应该已经完成世界切换了……另外，我知道 Sai 的腰包里只能装下一个，所以另一个一定会被人看见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062862_1_13d53efd:
    # "Most importantly, the Sekimeiya reappeared in that cabinet later. ...Did someone do this?{w} Or was it all an accident that didn't involve a murder?"
    "最重要的是，后来 Sekimeiya 又出现在了那个展示柜里。……是有人动了手脚吗？{w} 还是说，这一切都只是意外，与谋杀无关？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062870_1_71e2dc36:
    # "It's possible someone killed her, but who? Who would've had a motive to do that? Who could've done that?{w} There was a whole search, and the Future Sekimeiya had just been used. It's possible a killer with an elaborate plan carried this out, but that's completely out of place."
    "也许有人杀了她，可那个人是谁？谁会有这种动机？又有谁能做到？{w} 当时我们展开了全面搜索，而未来Sekimeiya 也刚被用过。一个精心谋划的凶手或许能办到，但这完全不合常理。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062871_1_25995eaa:
    # "...I don't believe she was killed. Her cause of death was one of the strangest details."
    "……我不认为她是被杀的。她的死因是最离奇的细节之一。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062876_1_8c5ddefa:
    # "It's tough, isn't it?"
    "很棘手，不是吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062877_1_b79cc13d:
    # "What happened to Isla? Under the right circumstances, touching the Sekimeiya ended her life.{w} It wasn't an instant result, however. The complexity of what occurred might be a bit more involved than what you're imagining, as no world switches factored in."
    "Isla 出了什么事？在特定条件下，触碰 Sekimeiya 结束了她的生命。{w} 不过，这并不是瞬间发生的结果。其中经过也许比你想象的更复杂一些，因为此事并没有涉及世界切换。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062878_1_6a4ed31c:
    # "The cabinet, both Sekimeiya, everyone's actions... Everything contributed to allow Isla's tragic demise."
    "展示柜、两个 Sekimeiya、每个人的行动……这一切共同导致了 Isla 的惨死。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062879_1_dc99231c:
    # "This riddle will be left all to you, but know something:{w} when Isla looked into the cabinet for the first time, she saw the body of a young girl. It was her own, but that was far from her interpretation.{w} Inside the cabinet, she saw the image of her friend. Her mind and body both teetered on the edge, and she screamed as she toppled into that sarcophagus of a cabinet."
    "这个谜题就全留给你了，但你要知道一件事：{w} 当 Isla 第一次往展示柜里看时，她看见了一具年轻女孩的尸体。那其实是她自己，可她却完全会错了意。{w} 她在展示柜里看见的是自己朋友的影像。她的身心都濒临崩溃，尖叫着跌进了那个宛如石棺的展示柜。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062887_1_3c5688d0:
    # "But if she wasn't killed, I don't know what could've happened... There are too many aspects that I don't get."
    "可如果她不是被杀的，我就不知道还能出什么事了……我想不通的地方实在太多了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062888_1_34e0d6c3:
    # "It was frustrating. I'd had the information to solve everything so far, but I was lost when it came to Isla's death."
    "这实在令人不甘。此前的一切，我都有足够的信息可以解开，可一碰到 Isla 的死，我就毫无头绪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062889_1_67578403:
    # "I wish I could know what happened to her. She died right there, and she never revived. The Isla in the future wasn't the same person..."
    "我真想知道她到底出了什么事。她就这样死在那里，再也没有醒来。未来的 Isla 并不是同一个人……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062891_1_7840c012:
    # "I looked at the voice recorder. The minutes had been ticking along, so I felt slightly rushed."
    "我看了看录音笔。时间一分一秒地过去，我不由得有些着急。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062892_1_9253f16b:
    # "I hated having to move on, but her death seemed to be surrounded by too many questions for me to solve."
    "我很不愿就此放下，可她的死似乎笼罩着太多疑问，我实在无从解开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062900_1_ffbf3972:
    # "Afterward, we simply stayed in the lobby.{w} It didn't look like any of us had the strength to stand again, but that changed when Katei and Sai left out of the blue."
    "之后，我们只是留在大厅里。{w} 我们似乎谁都没有力气再站起来，可 Katei 和 Sai 忽然离开后，情况就变了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062901_1_3135c98e:
    # "Both of them said they went to the bathroom, but it's clear that's not what happened."
    "两人都说自己去了洗手间，但显然事情并非如此。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062902_1_83a08060:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062903_1_2e2f5481:
    # "When I thought about it, I realized I could draw a solid conclusion."
    "仔细一想，我发现自己能得出一个确切的结论。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062906_1_c96addd4:
    # "The Sekimeiya that appeared next to Isla's dead body was working..."
    "出现在 Isla 尸体旁的那个 Sekimeiya 正在运转……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062913_1_fa0a5767:
    # "I think it was the Past Sekimeiya."
    "我想那是过去Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062917_1_7a19e962:
    # "That's because I put it in the Sekimeiya cabinet, and when we locked ourselves in the attic, it was still there."
    "因为是我把它放进了存放 Sekimeiya 的展示柜，而我们把自己锁进阁楼时，它还在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062918_1_63e22b30:
    # "We were told that when Sai and Akaro escaped, Akaro forced Sai to tell him where he'd stashed one of the Sekimeiya. At that point, he touched it and appeared in January, meaning that the one in the event room was the Past Sekimeiya."
    "我们听说，Sai 和 Akaro 逃跑时，Akaro 逼 Sai 说出他把其中一个 Sekimeiya 藏在了哪里。随后他碰了那个 Sekimeiya，出现在了一月，也就是说水晶展室里的那个是过去Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062919_1_139c7839:
    # "And there is something strange about this. If I'm right, Sai hid the Future Sekimeiya immediately after Isla's disappearance. This means that when Akaro touched it, it had already gathered energy for a ridiculously long time. A lot more than what I believe he needed to travel 21 days."
    "这里有一点很奇怪。如果我没猜错，Isla 消失后，Sai 立刻就把未来Sekimeiya 藏了起来。也就是说，Akaro 碰到它时，它积蓄能量的时间已经长得离谱，远远超过我估计他穿越 21 天所需的能量。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062923_1_cf53939d:
    # "After Katei and Sai left the lobby, Shiroya and I came across an empty cabinet in room B4 that was set to 0 °C. That's what reset the stored time."
    "Katei 和 Sai 离开大厅后，Shiroya 和我在 B4 房间发现了一个空展示柜，温度设定为 0 °C。正是它重置了蓄积的时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062925_1_b00e05bb:
    # "I'm not sure what happened exactly. Maybe Katei found the Sekimeiya and put it somewhere cold, but Sai saw that and removed it. The cabinet would've taken a bit to cool off, but a few minutes had passed..."
    "我不确定具体发生了什么。也许是 Katei 找到了 Sekimeiya，把它放到了某个寒冷的地方，而 Sai 看见后把它拿走了。展示柜冷却需要一些时间，但当时已经过去了几分钟……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062929_1_973b3a9e:
    # "After that, Shiroya discovered the storeroom's movable wall and the door with no handle."
    "在那之后，Shiroya 发现了储藏室里的可移动墙壁，还有那扇没有门把手的门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062932_1_b81eb606:
    # "At the time, I was certain that secret place had been used by the culprit to escape the multiple searches we did."
    "当时我确信，那个秘密之处曾被犯人用来躲避我们的数次搜查。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062938_1_3fcf4371:
    # "I don't think it was ever used by anyone who didn't want to be seen, though.{w} I saw a single set of fingerprints, identical to the ones I saw this morning. ...Since this morning, no one had opened that door from the hallway."
    "不过，我不觉得有谁为了不让人看见而用过那里。{w} 我只看到了一组指纹，和今早见到的那组一模一样。……从今早到现在，没有人从走廊那边打开过那扇门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062939_1_5c4ddb25:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062940_1_98323e1c:
    # "Katei had the rusty key, and it fits the keyhole of that door. He definitely knew of its existence."
    "Katei 手里有那把生锈的钥匙，而它正好能插进那扇门的锁孔。他肯定知道那扇门的存在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062944_1_5e807368:
    # "And immediately after that, Erina proposed that we confine ourselves. That's what led us to wait in the attic's bedroom, leaving the Past Sekimeiya behind in the event room."
    "紧接着，Erina 提议我们把自己关起来。于是我们便在阁楼的卧室里等待，把过去Sekimeiya 留在了水晶展室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062949_1_461003a2:
    # "That marked the halfway point of our imprisonment. From there, though, everything only got crazier."
    "那时，我们被囚禁的时间刚过去一半。可从那之后，一切却变得越来越疯狂。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062952_1_f0528877:
    # "Despite our efforts, Sai and Akaro managed to escape. I wouldn't be surprised if they left the way I imagined it, with a thought-up loop."
    "尽管我们努力了，Sai 和 Akaro 还是设法逃走了。就算他们像我想象的那样，靠一个凭空想出来的循环离开了，我也不会觉得意外。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062955_1_3942d43c:
    # "I attempted to replicate that idea, but it didn't work. At the time, I thought of a number of reasons that could've prevented my success, but now I can think of even more."
    "我试着照那个思路做过，却没有成功。当时我就想到了不少可能让我失败的原因，而现在能想到的更多了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062956_1_3b4c8b12:
    # "First off, at some point, Akaro traveled days into the future. It's possible that even the Isla from another world traveled days into the past. If I'd walked to the crystal floor, maybe I would've been involved in one of those travels."
    "首先，Akaro 曾在某个时候穿越到了数天之后。就连另一个世界的 Isla，也可能穿越到了数天之前。如果我当时走到水晶层，也许就会被卷进其中一次穿越。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062957_1_74cc8afc:
    # "Secondly, my idea was to leave, travel to the past, unlock the door, and reenter the bedroom immediately after my departure. That meant that my future location would've been in the bedroom, so I wouldn't have been able to appear outside it in the past."
    "其次，我的设想是先离开，穿越到过去，打开门，再在我离开后立刻回到卧室。可这意味着我未来的位置会在卧室里，所以过去的我不可能出现在卧室外。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062958_1_58fe2e6a:
    # "Lastly, my plan entailed using the Sekimeiya we had hidden in Naomi's locker. It was the third Sekimeiya, so I highly doubt it would've ever worked."
    "最后，我的计划要用到我们藏在 Naomi 的储物柜里的那个 Sekimeiya。那是第三个 Sekimeiya，所以我很怀疑这个计划根本行不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062968_1_9514489b:
    # "After both of them left, an Akaro with different memories showed up. Even another Isla was there."
    "他们两人离开后，一个拥有不同记忆的 Akaro 出现了。甚至还有一个 Isla 也在场。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062969_1_c018ea19:
    # "What happened outside the bedroom? I only have Akaro's version.{w} He touched the Sekimeiya Sai had hidden, and went to the fu—"
    "卧室外到底发生了什么？我只有 Akaro 的说法。{w} 他碰了 Sai 藏起来的那个 Sekimeiya，然后去了未——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062970_1_829eb35a:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062972_1_9a9bd858:
    # "Wait, what the fuck? This doesn't make any sense."
    "等等，搞什么鬼？这根本说不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062982_1_13f662df:
    # "...More than twenty minutes had passed, so it was safe to step back into the kitchen."
    "……二十多分钟已经过去，现在回到厨房应该安全了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062983_1_60ece0a7:
    # "How did I not think this through? There's no way we went to January 5th.{w} For that, we should've been in the tower 21 days before the 15th."
    "我怎么没想通这一点？我们不可能去了一月五日。{w} 若真是那样，我们在 15 日的 21 天前就应该在塔里了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062984_1_b5ef121f:
    # "Akaro's clothes changed. I can't rule out that he was in the tower in the past. Our clothing didn't change, though. I certainly wasn't here in the past, so if I traveled 21 days to the future, I should've appeared far outside the tower."
    "Akaro 的衣服变了，所以不能排除他过去来过塔里。可我们的衣服没变。过去的我肯定不在塔里，所以如果我穿越到了 21 天后的未来，就应该出现在离塔很远的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062988_1_7e355a26:
    # "What the hell...?"
    "到底怎么回事……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062989_1_1a764cdf:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062990_1_5af5912a:
    # "That broke my entire train of thought. It was a major contradiction regarding what I'd concluded."
    "这一下把我整条思路都打断了。这和我先前的结论严重矛盾。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062991_1_d60e5823:
    # "What happened at the end of the day?"
    "那天到最后发生了什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062992_1_7567098e:
    # "21 days before the 15th... That was November 24th.{w} I was not in the tower at that time."
    "15日往前推21天……就是11月24日。{w}那时我并不在塔里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062993_1_9c0119bc:
    # "I wonder what would happen if now I travel back in time to that day and go to the tower. ...I don't think that would explain it either."
    "如果我现在穿越回那一天，再去塔里，会怎么样呢？……我想，那也解释不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062994_1_5dd52bc4:
    # "Needless to say, that won't happen. It would mean that Sai and Erina would have to be there as well..."
    "不用说，那也不可能发生。若真如此，Sai 和 Erina 当时也得在那里……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L062999_1_08285eff:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063000_1_4a6b4166:
    # "What the hell is this? How is it possible that we traveled to January 5th?"
    "这到底是怎么回事？我们怎么可能穿越到1月5日？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063001_1_bc6e26ad:
    # "Is there another way? Could anything explain this...?"
    "还有别的可能吗？有什么能解释这一切……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063002_1_1b1038db:
    # "I thought about our last minutes in the tower, right before {time=21.}{w} What exactly had caused the travel?"
    "我回想着我们在塔里的最后几分钟，就在 {time=21.} 之前。{w}究竟是什么引发了那次时间穿越？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063003_1_4869bcb5:
    # "One of the Sekimeiya was kept cold in the event room, which means that it was likely the Past Sekimeiya. The Future Sekimeiya must have been somewhere else, and it made us travel through time."
    "其中一个 Sekimeiya 被冷藏保存在活动室，所以它很可能是过去Sekimeiya。未来Sekimeiya 应该在别处，正是它让我们穿越了时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063004_1_e105d248:
    # "But the replicated locations don't make any sense...!"
    "可那些被复制出来的地点根本说不通……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063005_1_5f2ea372:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063010_1_b885c85c:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063011_1_5c065e2b:
    # "I had to think about everything that had happened during the last segment of the day.{w} When I did, a possibility came to mind."
    "我不得不把那天最后一段时间里发生的一切重新想一遍。{w}想着想着，一个可能性浮上心头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063024_1_c0c32194:
    # "We were definitely on December 15th. The call with Suripo should confirm that. Then, given Isla's words and the evaporated water, I'm certain that we arrived on January 5th."
    "我们当时无疑是在12月15日。和 Suripo 的通话应该能证明这一点。那么，结合 Isla 的话和那些蒸发的水，我可以确定，我们抵达的是1月5日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063025_1_17a0ee29:
    # "By simply thinking about what happened during the last stretch, an obvious problem immediately comes up: we shouldn't have been able to travel 21 days through time."
    "只要回想最后那段时间发生的事，一个明显的问题便立刻浮现：我们本来不可能穿越21天的时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063028_1_839b2e3f:
    # "A bit after {time=20:30}, we found the powered-off Sekimeiya in the water tank, and we left it in the cold cabinet."
    "过了 {time=20:30} 不久，我们在水箱里找到了那个断电的 Sekimeiya，并把它留在了冷藏展示柜里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063034_1_dd17bbdd:
    # "Then, we found Shiroya in a hallway A crystal room. I don't know who she really was, but she convinced me to wait in the lobby for the shutter to open."
    "接着，我们在A走廊的一间水晶展室里找到了 Shiroya。我不知道她究竟是谁，但她说服我在大厅等卷帘门打开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063041_1_63bf4659:
    # "Something I felt iffy about occurred then. Erina left, saying she was going to search for Sai. Later, when she came back, it sounded like she'd traveled through time."
    "那时发生了一件让我觉得不对劲的事。Erina 说要去寻找 Sai，便离开了。后来她回来时，听起来像是穿越了时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063045_1_90a82e3a:
    # "The Sekimeiya wasn't in the cabinet. I couldn't stand it anymore. I felt like everyone was lying to me."
    "展示柜里的 Sekimeiya 不见了。我再也无法忍受。我觉得所有人都在骗我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063048_1_6e4164ef:
    # "I searched hallway A by myself and found a Sekimeiya in the security room."
    "我一个人搜了A走廊，在监控室里找到了一个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063049_1_3a0162e0:
    # "What's strange is that the Sekimeiya was scalding; it didn't make sense for Erina to have recently used it.{w} That makes me think it wasn't the same Sekimeiya that had just disappeared from the cabinet."
    "奇怪的是，那个 Sekimeiya 烫得灼手；如果 Erina 前不久刚用过它，实在说不通。{w}这让我觉得，它并不是刚从展示柜里消失的那一个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063054_1_7f962087:
    # "After I found the Sekimeiya in the water tank, something about Sai also seemed off."
    "我在水箱里找到 Sekimeiya 之后，Sai 也有些不对劲。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063062_1_6e6aa2a3:
    # "...{w}We still haven't searched the whole floor. I'll go leave the Sekimeiya in the event room, and we won't move it again."
    "……{w}这一层还没搜完。我去把 Sekimeiya 放到活动室，之后谁都不再动它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063067_1_3f2c1c8e:
    # "...There's nothing else to find, is there? Do you seriously believe Shiroya will be here? We've already found the Sekimeiya."
    "……已经没什么可找的了吧？你真觉得 Shiroya 会在这里？Sekimeiya 都已经找到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063068_1_23482d0d:
    # "\"I stared at Sai's eyes, a little disconcerted. His voice sounded noticeably more nervous and tense than it had recently.\""
    "我有些不安地注视着 Sai 的眼睛。他的声音明显比之前更紧张，也更紧绷。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063069_1_e794b8b6:
    # "...Is there something else to find here?"
    "……这里还有别的东西要找吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063070_1_0b4fa0b1:
    # "Hm? What would that be?"
    "嗯？还能有什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063071_1_b8a5512a:
    # "He knew there was something left to be found—the Sekimeiya in the security room. He didn't care that we found one, but he was worried we would find the second one..."
    "他知道还有东西没被找到——监控室里的那个 Sekimeiya。我们找到一个，他并不在意；他担心的是我们会找到第二个……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063077_1_7e9df7e8:
    # "What's most important is that after I found it in the security room, I put it in the cabinet. But mere minutes later, we supposedly traveled to January 5th."
    "最重要的是，我在监控室里找到它后，把它放进了展示柜。可仅仅几分钟后，我们却似乎穿越到了1月5日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063080_1_58474b1e:
    # "This seems impossible. One Sekimeiya had just been taken out of the cabinet while the other one had just been left inside. There was no time to build up the necessary energy to travel 21 days through time."
    "这似乎不可能。一个 Sekimeiya 刚被拿出展示柜，另一个又刚被放进去。根本来不及积蓄足够能量，完成21天的时间穿越。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063081_1_780cc12c:
    # "If the Future Sekimeiya was put in a hot place during those minutes, it could've gathered enough energy. However, that wouldn't explain the replicated location: I wasn't in the tower on November 24th.{w} So there is necessarily an answer that explains both mysteries at once."
    "如果 未来Sekimeiya 在那几分钟里被放到高温处，它或许能积攒足够的能量。可那解释不了被复制的地点：11月24日我并不在塔里。{w}因此，一定存在一个能同时解释这两个谜团的答案。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063082_1_1d889306:
    # "Could it really be what I'm imagining...?{w} Before the exit unlocked, the Future Sekimeiya was activated. I believe the location where that happened is a very important detail."
    "难道真如我所想……？{w}出口解锁前，未来Sekimeiya 被启动了。我认为，它被启动的地点是个非常关键的细节。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063090_1_036b99c9:
    # "It was in the mechanical room. That's where the Future Sekimeiya was at {time=21.}{w} And it was Erina who activated it. She was in the mechanical room when the lights went off."
    "它就在机械室。{time=21.} 时，未来Sekimeiya 正是在那里。{w}而启动它的正是 Erina。灯灭的时候，她就在机械室里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063094_1_1b0c140d:
    # "She still wanted to go to the past; she never stopped saying that. It was her last chance to do so.{w} Before then, she used the Sekimeiya we left in the cabinet. However, when she came back to the lobby and asked us the time, she had gone to the future instead. Based on what happened later, that had to be the Future Sekimeiya."
    "她仍想回到过去，这话她一直挂在嘴边。那是她最后的机会。{w}在此之前，她用过了我们留在展示柜里的那个 Sekimeiya。可当她回到大厅、问我们时间时，她其实是去了未来。结合后来发生的事，那个必定是未来Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063095_1_9d36d4dc:
    # "Even so late into the day, Sai was still trying to keep the Sekimeiya hidden. He knew one was in the security room, and when Erina traveled to the future, it was his chance to take care of the other."
    "即便时间已经这么晚了，Sai 仍在设法藏住 Sekimeiya。他知道有一个在监控室，而 Erina 穿越到未来时，正是他处理另一个的机会。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063096_1_9b610f45:
    # "Erina came back, asking for the time. That's when we went to the event room and saw the empty cabinet."
    "Erina 回来问时间。也正是那时，我们去了活动室，看见展示柜空了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063103_1_98e8299b:
    # "\"I noticed the brief instant in which Erina's expression showed surprise. She was still in hallway B, staring at her left.\""
    "我注意到 Erina 脸上闪过一丝惊讶。她还站在 B走廊里，盯着自己的左边。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063104_1_97d449c3:
    # "Did you see something?"
    "你看到什么了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063109_1_afef8ef6:
    # "Huh?"
    "咦？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063110_1_fc48000a:
    # "\"I walked up to her, but I found nothing that stood out in the hallway.\""
    "我走到她身边，可走廊里并没有什么引人注意的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063113_1_08d55284:
    # "...What she saw was Sai going through the mechanical room. That's where he left the Future Sekimeiya."
    "「……她看到的是 Sai 穿过机械室的身影。他就是在那儿留下了未来Sekimeiya。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063120_1_e1cdf43e:
    # "Or do we use these last minutes to find Sai and the Sekimeiya? If he took it, he must have something in mind, and as much as I want to get out, I'm not fond of letting him do as he pleases."
    "还是说，用这最后几分钟去找 Sai 和 Sekimeiya？若是他拿走的，那他一定另有打算——我虽然一心想出去，却也不愿任由他为所欲为。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063125_1_0d002a5f:
    # "Y-Yes... Maybe we should search for him."
    "是、是啊……也许该去找找他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063133_1_7b1caa52:
    # "Search complete. You all did an amazing job this time."
    "搜查结束。这次各位都干得很出色。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063135_1_c7a27f64:
    # "But that's not all. Before, Erina noticed the mechanical room had been opened. That makes me think Sai was down there and came out when we went to the event room.{w} He knew I'd purposely left the cabinet unlocked. If he later hid the Sekimeiya in the mechanical room, he was probably scoping it out ahead of time."
    "「但不止如此。Erina 之前就注意到机械室被人打开过。这让我觉得，Sai 当时就在下面，趁我们去活动室时溜了出来。{w}他知道我故意没锁展示柜。若他后来把 Sekimeiya 藏进机械室，那他多半事先就踩过点了。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063143_1_1774b56e:
    # "After that, Sai didn't waver as I looked through hallway A. He knew I would find one Sekimeiya, but not the one he'd just hidden."
    "「之后，我在 A走廊搜寻时，Sai 没有半点动摇。他知道我会找到一个 Sekimeiya，但不会是他刚藏起来的那个。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063146_1_5dfd3ffb:
    # "Once I put the Past Sekimeiya in the cabinet, all of us, including Shiroya, went back to the lobby and kept waiting where we'd been before."
    "「我把过去Sekimeiya 放进展示柜后，我们所有人——包括 Shiroya——都回到大厅，继续在原先的位置等待。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063149_1_86a92460:
    # "Erina didn't speak once. She knew the Sekimeiya Sai had hidden was still under us, and she was waiting for it to gather energy."
    "「Erina 一句话也没说。她知道 Sai 藏起来的那个 Sekimeiya 仍在我们脚下，她在等它积蓄能量。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063152_1_d34d93cf:
    # "Before the exit unlocked, she disappeared from beside us—she went down to activate the Sekimeiya one final time."
    "「出口解锁前，她从我们身边消失——她下去了，要最后启动一次 Sekimeiya。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063153_1_01bfada7:
    # "And she did. The ceiling of the mechanical room is very low, so the range encompassed us too, the people sitting right above it."
    "「她确实这么做了。机械室的天花板很低，所以作用范围也覆盖到了我们——我们正好坐在上面。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063158_1_1df99e82:
    # "Why did we go to January 5th, though? If that was the case, the range should've picked up everyone who'd been waiting outside the tower.{w} ...Somehow, Shiroya knew the travel would occur, and she ran away from us to avoid being involved..."
    "「可我们为什么会跑到1月5日？如果是这样，那范围理应把等在塔外的所有人都卷进来才对。{w}……Shiroya 不知怎么预知到会发生时间穿越，为了不被牵扯进来，才从我们身边逃开了……」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063159_1_2a139280:
    # "But why? Why 21 days into the future?{w} On the surface, it seems like Erina activating the Sekimeiya would never result in that. However... I think I can tell what the answer is by simply running through what would've happened after she touched it."
    "「可为什么？为什么会是二十一天之后的未来？{w}乍看之下，Erina 启动 Sekimeiya 无论如何都不会造成那样的结果。不过……只要顺着她触碰之后会发生什么推演一遍，我想我就能看出答案。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063165_1_edd99ba1:
    # "Sai frequently told us the current time. When Erina made us travel to the future, the Sekimeiya had gathered power for about fifteen minutes. At that point, we already knew that would result in roughly twenty minutes traveled."
    "「Sai 经常向我们报时。Erina 让我们穿越到未来的时候，Sekimeiya 已经蓄能了大约十五分钟。而那时我们已经知道，蓄能到这个程度，大约会穿越二十分钟。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063168_1_0c98a22a:
    # "So, we traveled twenty minutes to the future.{w} What would the locations have been?"
    "「于是，我们穿越到了二十分钟后的未来。{w}那么，出现的位置又会是哪里？」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063171_1_75b571e3:
    # "Twenty minutes before the travel, Sai was in the mechanical room while Erina and I were in the lobby, sitting in the same spot."
    "「穿越发生前二十分钟，Sai 在机械室，而 Erina 和我在大厅，坐在同一个位置上。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063172_1_8a679950:
    # "What occurred relied on Sai's location upon appearing.{w} By that point, I had also learned that fifteen minutes stored resulted in five minutes of the Sekimeiya's recovery phase. After Erina touched the Sekimeiya, it spent five minutes off and then gathered energy for fifteen more minutes until we appeared."
    "「接下来会发生什么，取决于 Sai 出现时所在的位置。{w}到那时我也已经明白：蓄能十五分钟，换来的是 Sekimeiya 五分钟的恢复期。Erina 触碰 Sekimeiya 之后，它先停摆了五分钟，随后又蓄能十五分钟，直到我们出现。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063175_1_23c5d8da:
    # "When we appeared, Sai was in the mechanical room, where he would hide the Sekimeiya. So the instant we appeared, he activated it again.{w} ...I'm not sure how that happened fluidly, but I can think of a couple things that make a lot of sense.{w} Immediately, we went twenty more minutes to the future, and when we appeared, the Sekimeiya had gathered energy for another fifteen minutes."
    "「我们出现时，Sai 正在机械室——他后来藏 Sekimeiya 的地方。于是就在我们出现的瞬间，他又一次启动了它。{w}……我不知道这一切为何能衔接得如此顺畅，不过我能想到几种说得通的解释。{w}紧接着，我们又穿越到了二十分钟后的未来，而我们出现时，Sekimeiya 已经又蓄能了十五分钟。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063179_1_7bfc85cc:
    # "That time, the locations were from the time Erina had touched the Sekimeiya. In other words, she was in the mechanical room while Sai and I were in the lobby.{w} So, we went twenty more minutes to the future."
    "「那一次，出现的位置是根据 Erina 触碰 Sekimeiya 时的情况来定的。也就是说，她在机械室，而 Sai 和我在大厅。{w}于是，我们又穿越到了二十分钟后的未来。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063180_1_91db810d:
    # "It's incredibly unlikely that the time matched up exactly and perfectly replicated the instant in which we had appeared twenty minutes before. However, it's possible that location was what we defaulted to, as it was the closest location in which we \"existed\". That's all I can really assume there."
    "「时间恰好完全对上，还完美复现了我们二十分钟前出现的那一刻，这几乎不可能。不过，也许我们只是默认落在了那个位置——因为那是我们「存在」过的最近的位置。这一点，我只能这样推测。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063181_1_f9851e3e:
    # "Again, when we appeared, it was Erina who instantly reactivated the Sekimeiya. This created a never-ending chain of twenty minutes jumping forward."
    "同样地，我们一出现，Erina 就立刻再次启动了 Sekimeiya。于是形成了一条每二十分钟向前跳一次、仿佛永无止境的链条。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063201_1_530066e5:
    # "Only two locations alternated: the one in which Sai was in the mechanical room, and the one in which Erina was. Meanwhile, I was in the lobby regardless.{w} This explains why I didn't see the sudden, instant flashing they talked about."
    "交替的只有两个位置：一个是 Sai 在机械室，另一个是 Erina 在机械室。而不管哪种情况，我都在大厅。{w}这就解释了为什么我没看见他们说的那道突如其来的闪光。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063202_1_b27128ae:
    # "For some reason, on January 5th, the tower was empty. Katei told us once that the lights turn off every night and are manually turned on in the morning. So, if nobody was in the tower in the morning, the lights would've remained off.{w} However, before all the lights turned off permanently, every twenty minutes, Sai and Erina alternated between being in the lobby and in the mechanical room. Although it lasted an instant each time, due to the darkness in the mechanical room and the light in the lobby, they perceived a \"flashing light\"."
    "不知为何，1月5日那天，塔里空无一人。Katei 曾告诉我们，灯每晚都会熄灭，早上再手动打开。所以如果早上塔里没有人，灯就会一直关着。{w}然而，在所有灯彻底熄灭之前，每隔二十分钟，Sai 和 Erina 就会在大厅与机械室之间交替。尽管每次只有一瞬，但机械室一片漆黑、大厅亮着灯，于是他们看到了一道「闪光」。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063208_1_63d05412:
    # "On January 5th, the chain stopped. I don't know why, but we broke free of it, effectively traveling 21 days into the future."
    "到了1月5日，这条链断了。我不知道原因，但我们确实挣脱了它，实际穿越到了二十一天后的未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063209_1_86d9c339:
    # "And the final location was from when Erina was in the mechanical room, which is why it didn't feel like we changed places. And... since she would've appeared and activated the Sekimeiya instantly in the previous location, that must mean it overlapped with part of her body upon arriving. That's why she started bleeding at the end of the chain. The tip of her finger was missing."
    "而最后出现的位置，正是 Erina 在机械室的那一刻，所以我们才没有觉得换了地方。还有……既然她会在前一个位置出现并立刻启动 Sekimeiya，那说明抵达时，Sekimeiya 与她身体的一部分发生了重叠。所以她才会在链条结束时开始流血。她少了一截指尖。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063214_1_4280da09:
    # "...Did all that really happen? And none of us realized it..."
    "……这一切真的发生过吗？而我们谁都没有察觉……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063215_1_dc023c84:
    # "It explained things, but I still had a few doubts. Why had the tower been empty on January 5th? Why had the chain not gone on infinitely?"
    "这样确实解释得通，但我仍有几处疑问。1月5日那天，塔里为什么空无一人？这条链又为什么没有无限延续下去？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063216_1_5c90d5de:
    # "So Akaro actually was in the tower on November 24th. ...His hair was longer and a different color."
    "那么，Akaro 确实在11月24日到过塔里。……他的头发更长，颜色也不一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063217_1_97887553:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063218_1_55949a0a:
    # "He traveled to the future while we were in the attic, but there's something I'm confused about."
    "我们在阁楼的时候，他穿越到了未来，但有一点我怎么也想不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063219_1_26349e93:
    # "If I'm right, and the version of Isla who was there ended up being the \"friend\", she likely traveled before we left the bedroom. We weren't there for too long of a time, though, and we'd left the Past Sekimeiya in the cabinet."
    "如果我没猜错，当时在场的那个 Isla 后来成了那位「朋友」，那她很可能是在我们离开卧室之前就穿越了。可我们在那里待的时间并不长，而且我们把 过去Sekimeiya 留在了展示柜里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063220_1_1427d530:
    # "Akaro traveled to the future after he and Sai escaped, but since Isla was still there, she went to the past afterward.{w} Would there have been enough time to store the needed energy to go so far back?"
    "Akaro 和 Sai 逃脱之后，Akaro 穿越到了未来；而 Isla 当时仍在原地，随后便去了过去。{w}要回到那么远的过去，所需能量来得及蓄够吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063226_1_102e855b:
    # "The reason she was able to go many days back was..."
    "她能回到那么多天以前，原因是……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063233_1_88b19838:
    # "Actually, yes. It was due to a bed sheet that the world C group had obtained in world A. When it was brought to world B, they wrapped it around the Past Sekimeiya and world switched back to world C. However, the sheet remained around the Sekimeiya in world B.{w} When it powered back on, the sheet was still very hot. That's why it took a short time to reach the needed amount of energy."
    "没错，那是因为 C世界那组人在 A世界拿到了一条床单。他们把床单带到 B世界，裹在 过去Sekimeiya 上，然后世界切换回 C世界。然而，那条床单留在了 B世界的 Sekimeiya 上。{w}当它重新启动时，床单还很烫。所以它才在很短的时间里蓄够了所需的能量。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063235_1_df09deed:
    # "That's wrong. It was due to a bed sheet that the world C group had obtained in world A. When it was brought to world B, they wrapped it around the Past Sekimeiya and world switched back to world C. However, the sheet remained around the Sekimeiya in world B.{w} When it powered back on, the sheet was still very hot. That's why it took a short time to reach the needed amount of energy."
    "不对。那是因为 C世界那组人在 A世界拿到了一条床单。他们把床单带到 B世界，裹在 过去Sekimeiya 上，然后世界切换回 C世界。然而，那条床单留在了 B世界的 Sekimeiya 上。{w}当它重新启动时，床单还很烫。所以它才在很短的时间里蓄够了所需的能量。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063245_1_d1d6ccd3:
    # "When Akaro and Sai escaped from the bedroom, Sai was forced to reveal the location of the Future Sekimeiya and was immediately knocked out."
    "Akaro 和 Sai 从卧室逃出时，Sai 被迫说出了 未来Sekimeiya 的位置，随即被打晕。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063250_1_a2f4d352:
    # "Isla A was there and heard it as well. Worried, she tried to get a response from the unconscious Sai, which only one person heard from the bedroom. Giving up, she went down in an attempt to prevent Akaro from damaging the Sekimeiya."
    "Isla A 也在场，同样听到了。她放心不下，试着从昏迷的 Sai 那里得到回应，而卧室里只有一个人听见了这动静。她最终放弃，下楼去阻止 Akaro 破坏 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063255_1_7060aa5a:
    # "She found it powered off in one of the hallway B crystal rooms; Akaro was already gone. She knew the event room cabinet was equipped with temperature regulation, so she carried it there."
    "她发现它已停止运转，躺在 B走廊的一间水晶展室里；Akaro 早已不见踪影。她知道活动室的展示柜装有温控装置，便把它搬了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063259_1_40459596:
    # "But after that, on the floor of hallway A, she found a sheet covering yet another Sekimeiya."
    "可在那之后，她在 A走廊的地板上发现一条床单，底下盖着另一个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063260_1_8e05db44:
    # "Confused, she felt its surface, instantly vanishing from that place with the sheet. Immediately, she found herself on November 24th."
    "她满心疑惑，伸手摸了摸它的表面，随即连同床单一起从原地消失了。转眼之间，她已身处11月24日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063263_1_c73b5afe:
    # "Someone else disappeared as well: Akaro A.{w} The bedroom where everyone stayed was directly above the event room, so the range reached him. From a locked bedroom, he appeared in an unlocked prison cell. That was when a policeman outside the building suddenly appeared 21 days in the past."
    "同时消失的还有另一个人：Akaro A。{w}大家住的卧室就在活动室正上方，所以他也被卷了进去。他从上锁的卧室，出现在没上锁的牢房里。也就在那时，楼外的一名警察突然穿越到了二十一天前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063271_1_d04635b8:
    # "Sai woke up. He was near the elevator, so Isla's travel had missed him and the people in the upper level of the bedroom."
    "Sai 醒了过来。他就在电梯附近，所以 Isla 的那次穿越没有波及他，也没有波及卧室上层的人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063275_1_956f5bba:
    # "Disoriented, he walked to the event room and found out the others had left both Sekimeiya behind for him."
    "他昏昏沉沉地走到活动室，发现其他人把两个 Sekimeiya 都留给了他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063276_1_fa17210e:
    # "He still had to complete his plan: to get out of the bedroom, he had to travel to the past."
    "他还得完成自己的计划：要想离开卧室，就必须穿越到过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063281_1_97a4f398:
    # "Once he was done, Sai had both Sekimeiya for himself. Eager to resolve the doubts he had, he brought them both to a room—B6."
    "事情办妥之后，两个 Sekimeiya 都落到了 Sai 手里。他急于解开心中的疑问，便把两个都带进了一间房——B6。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063282_1_4ac22f95:
    # "Unfortunately for him, he was only able to resolve his two major concerns before the world around him changed."
    "可惜，他只来得及弄清两个最大的疑问，周围的世界就变了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063290_1_3705f41c:
    # "When we left the bedroom... we quickly found out the third Sekimeiya had disappeared from Naomi's locker."
    "我们离开卧室后……很快就发现，第三个 Sekimeiya 从 Naomi 的储物柜里不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063294_1_894f1cd5:
    # "Who the hell did that? There's no way it teleported out.{w} ...Did anyone else have the key after all?"
    "到底是谁干的？它绝不可能自己传送出去。{w}……难道还有别人也有钥匙？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063302_1_4a1d90ee:
    # "Yes, it was Akaro A."
    "没错，是 Akaro A 干的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063304_1_53c59a60:
    # "It was Akaro A."
    "是 Akaro A。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063306_1_b9626854:
    # "You might remember he world switched while he was in the staff room, and he had Naomi A's keys."
    "你或许还记得，他在员工室的时候发生了世界切换，而他当时带着 Naomi A 的钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063307_1_d7f7fc25:
    # "While he waited in room B4, he wondered if he had access to that locker, and when he went to confirm it, he saw someone had hidden a Sekimeiya there."
    "他在 B4 房间等候时，心想自己能不能打开那个储物柜，便去确认，结果发现有人在那里藏了一个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063308_1_c6325e05:
    # "Mystified, he took it out with no comprehension that he was no longer in his own world."
    "他大惑不解，把它取了出来，全然不知自己已经不在原来的世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063314_1_d3a84c8c:
    # "...I wonder who it was. Maybe Sai, somehow."
    "……会是谁呢。也许，是 Sai 用了什么办法。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063318_1_d3930435:
    # "After that, Shiroya and I found a Sekimeiya on the floor of a hallway B room, B6."
    "在那之后，我和 Shiroya 在 B走廊的 B6房间地板上发现了一个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063324_1_36cd98b7:
    # "When we touched it, I'm pretty sure we went to the future..."
    "我们一碰到它，我敢肯定，我们去了未来……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063327_1_aaffdcb7:
    # "We appeared where we'd been ten minutes before, so we went ten minutes to the future."
    "我们出现在十分钟前所在的位置，也就是说，我们穿越到了十分钟后的未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063330_1_283467cc:
    # "We thought we'd gone to the very recent past because the footprints we'd just left looked recent. Since we went shortly into the future, that didn't change."
    "我们以为自己是回到了很近的过去，因为刚踩出的脚印还很新。可实际上我们只是去了稍后的未来，所以那些脚印看起来依旧很新。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063333_1_7670580a:
    # "And then, we concluded we'd gone five minutes to the past because we thought that we'd taken the elevator and caused the trip we heard before traveling. Instead, someone else used it from the attic after we left the bedroom..."
    "接着，我们又断定自己回到了五分钟前，因为我们以为电梯是自己乘的，穿越前听到的响动也是自己弄出来的。可实际上，那是我们离开卧室后，别人从阁楼叫了电梯……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063337_1_5f6631ca:
    # "On the crystal floor, we went to the lobby because our past selves hadn't gone there. Who did we hear if not ourselves? There was someone moving through the hallways."
    "在水晶层，我们去了大厅，因为过去的我们没去那儿。可我们听到的若不是自己，又会是谁？当时确实有人在走廊里走动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063338_1_4e4d5313:
    # "\"We heard an indistinct sound coming from hallway A, made by a door.\""
    "A走廊那边传来一阵模糊的响动，是门发出的声音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063339_1_742319f7:
    # "That's us. We just entered the event room."
    "是我们。我们刚进活动室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063340_1_1239ccda:
    # "\"We waited, and seconds later, the same sound came from hallway B. Unmistakably, a closing door had created it.\""
    "我们等了等，几秒后，B走廊也传来同样的声音。毫无疑问，那是关门声。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063347_1_48081189:
    # "There aren't many people I can think of. Sai, Erina, Katei, and maybe the other Shiroya..."
    "我能想到的人不多。Sai、Erina、Katei，也许还有另一个 Shiroya……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063348_1_79c7e181:
    # "But given the movements, I might know who it was..."
    "但从行动路线来看，我或许能猜到那是谁……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063349_1_156c63a5:
    # "And that Shiroya... How the hell did she get there...!?"
    "可那个 Shiroya……她到底是怎么到那里的……！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063350_1_7be0a789:
    # "Was she the Shiroya from this morning? Did she appear in the attic with Naomi and spend the whole day in the tower?"
    "她就是今早那个 Shiroya 吗？她和 Naomi 一起出现在阁楼，然后在塔里待了整整一天？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063351_1_1869c90c:
    # "It can't be. We would've seen her, and what the hell was the deal with her clothes!? Or anything that she said!"
    "不可能。那样的话我们应该会看见她。而且她那身衣服到底是怎么回事！？还有她说的那些话！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063352_1_cee286dc:
    # "She was the same Shiroya I'd been with. She remembered what we'd done. ...That's all I get."
    "她就是我认识的那个 Shiroya。她记得我们做过的事。……我能确定的只有这些。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063357_1_a11b9a5b:
    # "When we returned to room B6, the Sekimeiya we used wasn't there. Since we'd gone to the future, someone had time to take it away."
    "我们回到 B6 房间时，用过的那个 Sekimeiya 已经不见了。我们去了未来，有人便趁这段时间把它拿走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063360_1_15c4bdf7:
    # "Instead, we found one in a cabinet drawer. It was considerably hot, so it was there for a long time."
    "结果，我们在展示柜的抽屉里找到了一个。它还相当烫，看来已经在那里放了很久。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063365_1_49a5ad48:
    # "But we decided not to activate it and brought it to its cabinet."
    "但我们决定不启动它，把它送回了展示柜。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063374_1_36afae67:
    # "If they had touched it, though, what would've happened? It has been a while since you asked for that."
    "不过，如果他们碰了它，会发生什么？你问起这件事，已经过了好一阵子了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063375_1_9455eaa1:
    # "Atsuki would've gone many hours back in time. The lights would not yet have turned on, and he would've found himself in the lobby."
    "Atsuki 会被送回好几个小时之前。那时灯还没亮，他会发现自己身处大厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063376_1_bd6119fb:
    # "You remember, right? He spent a long time in the staff room. Eventually, after the light was turned on in the morning, he was killed by Ido, who had the suitcase ready to prepare the attack."
    "你记得吧？他在员工室里待了很久。最后，早晨灯亮之后，他被 Ido 杀害了；Ido 早已备好手提箱，准备发动袭击。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063377_1_07dc8ded:
    # "Before his eyesight failed, Atsuki saw four people he recognized."
    "在视力丧失之前，Atsuki 看见了四个他认识的人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063385_1_b6db4c6f:
    # "\"Two men, a woman, and a girl.\""
    "「两个男人、一个女人，还有一个女孩。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063386_1_b8636ec9:
    # "One was Shiroya. She was naturally encompassed by the range when Atsuki touched the Sekimeiya.{w} However, she didn't appear in the lobby with him. Strangely, she appeared in a bathroom on the crystal floor, and when she left, she was seen from the security room and addressed through the microphone."
    "其中一人是 Shiroya。Atsuki 触碰 Sekimeiya 时，她自然也被纳入了范围。{w} 然而，她并没有和他一起出现在大厅。奇怪的是，她出现在水晶层的一间洗手间里；她出来之后，有人在监控室看见她，用麦克风对她喊话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063388_1_316dd9b8:
    # "Atsuki recognized Ido and Suripo as well: he had seen both of them during the long wait before the event."
    "Atsuki 也认出了 Ido 和 Suripo：在活动开始前那段漫长的等待里，他见过这两人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063389_1_9964c811:
    # "The last person was Erina. She had been alive in room B4 next to Atsuki and Shiroya and appeared in the mechanical room."
    "最后一个人是 Erina。她原本在 Atsuki 和 Shiroya 隔壁的 B4房间里，之后出现在了机械室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063390_1_983e681f:
    # "However, she had been unconscious. Therefore, despite appearing in the past, she took a while to awaken."
    "不过，她当时还在昏迷。所以，尽管人已经出现在过去，她还是过了好一会儿才醒来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063396_1_0a9dd3a8:
    # "Two impossibilities prevented this from happening. One was the butterfly effect."
    "有两个不可能的因素，让这件事没能发生。其一是蝴蝶效应。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063401_1_2321c72b:
    # "Precisely. Atsuki died."
    "正是如此。Atsuki 死了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063403_1_21a0db27:
    # "There should've been a world switch, but this is tied to the butterfly effect. After all, the Future Sekimeiya was between another Shiroya's hands, and that version of Shiroya couldn't have existed if they had gone to the past."
    "本来应该发生世界切换，但这与蝴蝶效应相关。毕竟，未来Sekimeiya在另一个 Shiroya 手里，而如果他们去了过去，那个 Shiroya 就不可能存在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063405_1_37f392c1:
    # "Shiroya could have existed, but not Atsuki. That is because he died."
    "Shiroya 可能还存在，Atsuki 却不可能——因为他死了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063406_1_b268a086:
    # "Perhaps that problem helped you figure out the Sekimeiya's mechanics. Because Atsuki died, he could never have appeared in the lobby—he wouldn't have been there in the future."
    "也许正是这个问题让你弄清了 Sekimeiya 的机制。Atsuki 既然死了，就不可能出现在大厅——未来也不会有他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063407_1_94ce2a92:
    # "However, there's something to recognize: he had a wound on his right hand, and in the darkness, he saw that he had a key shaped like the one for Naomi's locker. ...It was Ido's instead, though; his appearing location was where he would've ended up traveling to the future in a chain of travels."
    "不过，有一点值得注意：他右手上有伤，而且在黑暗中，他发现自己拿着一把钥匙，形状和 Naomi 储物柜的钥匙一样。……但那其实是 Ido 的；他出现的位置，正是他在连锁传送中前往未来时会落脚的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063418_1_e55df48a:
    # "...That was when we found Katei dead in the security room."
    "……就是在那个时候，我们发现 Katei 死在监控室里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063428_1_cd17783d:
    # "When Katei walked out of the bedroom, Erina followed close behind.{w} She didn't believe Atsuki and Shiroya had killed Isla. ...Sai and Akaro had been with her the entire time."
    "Katei 走出卧室时，Erina 紧跟在后。{w} 她不相信是 Atsuki 和 Shiroya 杀了 Isla。……毕竟 Sai 和 Akaro 一直和她在一起。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063431_1_6b251426:
    # "However, Katei had been missing during that time, and he hadn't explained himself.{w} She didn't trust him at all; he'd been lying all day. ...He had faked going to the bathroom to take advantage of Isla's death."
    "然而，那段时间 Katei 一直不见踪影，也从没解释过自己的去向。{w} 她完全无法信任他；他整天都在撒谎。……他借口去洗手间，正是为了利用 Isla 的死。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063438_1_db97ea74:
    # "On the lowest floor, when Erina uttered his name, he turned around slowly."
    "在最底层，Erina 叫出他的名字时，他缓缓转过身。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063443_1_c74f601b:
    # "A single question was asked. \"Where were you when we couldn't find you?\""
    "她只问了一句：「我们找不到你的时候，你在哪里？」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063444_1_154952fc:
    # "Katei realized the meaning behind that. Erina suspected him of causing Isla's death.{w} He sighed quietly and then spoke."
    "Katei 明白这句话背后的意思。Erina 怀疑 Isla 的死是他造成的。{w} 他轻轻叹了口气，然后开口。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063449_1_694f2a4f:
    # "I don't know exactly. When I was walking behind Sai, I suddenly appeared in the attic."
    "我不清楚具体是怎么回事。我走在 Sai 后面的时候，突然就出现在了阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063454_1_dab1dcb5:
    # "...What?"
    "……什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063455_1_aeb1a7e7:
    # "It's the truth. It likely happened when Shiroya and Atsuki touched the Sekimeiya, remember?"
    "我说的是真的。大概就发生在 Shiroya 和 Atsuki 触碰 Sekimeiya 的时候，你还记得吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063456_1_082af329:
    # "Why didn't you say this before!? And that doesn't tell me anything! Why didn't we find you!?"
    "你之前为什么不说！？这根本说明不了什么！我们为什么没找到你！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063461_1_06860633:
    # "Katei stared into Erina's eyes. Her voice had never sounded so harsh."
    "Katei 直视着 Erina 的眼睛。她的声音从未如此尖锐。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063464_1_bc82f82a:
    # "I said I experienced the teleportation, and I am telling you the truth. I was beyond confused when I appeared there.{w} When I came down, the three of you were in the lobby."
    "我说过，我经历了传送，我说的都是实话。我出现在那里时，完全不知所措。{w} 我下楼时，你们三个人都在大厅里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063465_1_2605ed22:
    # "Although Erina wavered, she quickly dismissed Katei's claim as nonsense."
    "Erina 虽然有过片刻动摇，但很快就把 Katei 的话斥为无稽之谈。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063470_1_0bbc6a75:
    # "You're not even making sense! You were hiding in the storeroom, weren't you?"
    "你这话根本说不通！你就是躲在储藏室里，对不对？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063475_1_bc29399b:
    # "What? No! There are cameras in hallway C. What I'm saying will be proven."
    "什么？没有！C走廊里有摄像头。我说的话会得到证实。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063480_1_b0698a74:
    # "...I don't believe it. The cameras aren't recording."
    "……我不信。摄像头根本没有在录像。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063485_1_6c465005:
    # "Yes they are! Don't you see the light!?"
    "在录！你没看见指示灯吗！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063486_1_6a971762:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063487_1_fbe8db30:
    # "Katei saw nothing but hostility in Erina's face. Enough to appear as a threat.{w} Did she really think he had killed Isla? He didn't know anything about what had happened to her, but there was a way he could prove his innocence."
    "Katei 在 Erina 脸上只看到敌意，那几乎已经算是一种威胁。{w} 她真的以为是他杀了 Isla 吗？他对 Isla 的遭遇一无所知，不过，他有一个办法能证明自己的清白。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063490_1_782a8c0a:
    # "...You still haven't explained anything. Why didn't you say this earlier, and why didn't we find you?"
    "……你还是什么都没解释清楚。为什么之前不说？我们又为什么没找到你？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063491_1_61dcc20f:
    # "Erina had no idea what to believe. No one else could've harmed Isla, but who would have? Why would anyone have done that to her daughter? Part of her wanted to abandon everything and just stop thinking altogether, placidly waiting the month it would take her daughter to return."
    "Erina 不知道该相信什么。除了他，没人能伤得了 Isla——可谁会下得了手？谁会那样对待她的女儿？她心底有一部分想抛下一切，索性什么都不再想，就这样平静地等上一个月，等女儿回来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063496_1_707e2eec:
    # "...I'm not lying. Maybe I can prove myself."
    "……我没有撒谎。也许我能证明自己。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063499_1_ccfd863c:
    # "Katei started walking to the security room, gesturing at Erina to come with him."
    "Katei 朝监控室走去，示意 Erina 跟上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063509_1_69fab39c:
    # "It has been a long time since I've checked. Perhaps the security system is working again, just like what happened to the computer."
    "我很久没检查过了。也许监控系统又恢复了，就像那台电脑一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063512_1_eb1b2dcf:
    # "In silence, Katei kneeled under the desk while Erina watched expectantly."
    "Katei 一言不发地跪在桌下，Erina 满怀期待地看着他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063513_1_ec66fe16:
    # "Again, there doesn't seem to be anything wrong with this."
    "这一次，看上去同样没什么问题。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063518_1_6ca93438:
    # "As he stood up, he nonchalantly took a rusty key out of his pocket and left it in a drawer."
    "他站起身，若无其事地从口袋里取出那把生锈的钥匙，随手搁进了抽屉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063519_1_47d856f0:
    # "This time, I won't forget to keep it somewhere safer."
    "这次我不会忘记把它放到更安全的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063524_1_ca6452dd:
    # "...Katei sat on his chair and started up the three screens. As Erina stepped forward, he pressed the \"archived footage\" button."
    "……Katei 在椅子上坐下，启动了三块屏幕。Erina 上前一步时，他按下了「存档录像」的按钮。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063530_1_13d1bfdf:
    # "O-Oh! I-It's working!"
    "哦、哦！能、能用了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063531_1_cc9b8616:
    # "A list of cameras appeared on the screen. Erina read them without so much as a twitch."
    "屏幕上出现了一列摄像头编号。Erina 逐一扫过，连眉头都没动一下。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063534_1_1eb8da04:
    # "Look! I'll show you that I was telling the truth!"
    "看！我这就证明给你看，我说的都是真话！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063535_1_ed4d553a:
    # "When Katei selected one, a video of hallway C came up, mainly focusing on the bathrooms. Frustrated, Katei used the time bar to skip ahead."
    "Katei 选中其中一个，C走廊的录像随即播出，镜头主要对着洗手间一带。他有些不耐烦，拖动时间条往后快进。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063541_1_c5754b9e:
    # "Here! I'm about to disappear!"
    "就这儿！我马上就要消失了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063542_1_ccba7afa:
    # "Coming from hallway B, Sai stepped into C. Katei followed behind, and out of nowhere, his body vanished."
    "Sai 从 B走廊走进 C走廊，Katei 跟在后面，忽然之间，他整个人凭空消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063547_1_dc9aebee:
    # "See! That's when I appeared in the attic!"
    "瞧见没！就是那时候，我在阁楼里出现了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063548_1_df6daaaa:
    # "After he selected another camera and fast-forwarded further, Katei appeared from the second floor and entered hallway A."
    "他选了另一个摄像头，又往后快进了一段——Katei 从二楼出来，进了 A走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063553_1_8ed4be0c:
    # "Just like I said, I wasn't here when she disappeared! I have no idea what happened to her, but I didn't lie!"
    "就像我说的，她消失的时候我根本不在这儿！她出了什么事我完全不知道，可我没撒谎！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063561_1_09895a27:
    # "...Did you kill Naomi?"
    "……Naomi 是你杀的吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063566_1_99d19975:
    # "Huh? Of course I didn't!"
    "啊？当然不是我！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063567_1_e0eb4558:
    # "Show me what happened."
    "把当时的经过放给我看。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063572_1_26ed205c:
    # "...{w}After a brief pause, Katei moved the cursor to a different camera.{w} He was calm. He knew very little incriminating footage was located in those folders."
    "……{w}短暂停顿后，Katei 把光标移到了另一个摄像头上。{w}他很镇定。那些文件夹里几乎没有对他不利的录像，这一点他再清楚不过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063578_1_e9120cab:
    # "Once he clicked on room B4's camera, a message appeared on the screen.{w} \"{time=10:04}: Camera(s) disabled and associated footage erased\"."
    "他刚点开 B4 房间的摄像头，屏幕上就弹出一行字。{w}「{time=10:04}：摄像头已停用，相关录像已删除」。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063583_1_67e0b0a2:
    # "Wh-What!?{w} The killer erased it! H-How!?"
    "什、什么！？{w}是凶手删掉的！他、他怎么办到的！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063588_1_6eadfdf9:
    # "...{w}{time=10:04}? Isn't that when we left you here?"
    "……{w}{time=10:04}？那不就是我们把你留在这儿的时候吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063589_1_8b34d237:
    # "Huh? It might be, but why does that matter!? The system wasn't working for me at the time!"
    "啊？也许是吧，可那又能说明什么！？那时候系统对我根本用不了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063595_1_46c56038:
    # "You killed Naomi, right?"
    "Naomi 是你杀的，对吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063601_1_0447af05:
    # "Katei hung his head. He'd failed to remember the deletion time would be displayed."
    "Katei 垂下了头。他忘了，删除时间会被显示出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063604_1_2b4dcb37:
    # "...I would never kill a person."
    "……我绝不会杀人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063605_1_e20eafef:
    # "You d-did. And not only Naomi, right?"
    "你、你就是杀了她。而且不止 Naomi 一个，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063610_1_442d289c:
    # "You're wrong! I promise I didn't do anything!"
    "你错了！我发誓，我什么都没做！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063611_1_97263665:
    # "Katei's excuses were poor; he wasn't trying anymore. Even if he convinced Erina, he was done for, as the deletion time pointed straight at him."
    "Katei 的辩解苍白无力，他也不再费心。就算说动了 Erina，他也完了——删除时间明明白白地指向了他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063612_1_e9d24124:
    # "His mind was someplace else entirely. He couldn't let that message be seen."
    "他的心思早已飘到了别处。那行字，绝不能让她们看见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063613_1_af17c0c4:
    # "He had already ended someone's life for his own sake. If he was quick, he could get himself out of there. ...And there were many more suspects than the first time."
    "为了自己，他已经夺走了一条人命。只要动作够快，他就能从这里脱身。……何况这一次，嫌疑人比上次多得多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063616_1_604ea937:
    # "Katei turned around, ready to deliver a sudden blow, but he didn't expect the one that came first."
    "Katei 转过身，准备冷不防地出手，却没想到先挨打的反而是自己。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063625_1_bb459e68:
    # "After a sharp collapse, Katei's body was on the floor, splashed with its own blood."
    "Katei 猛地倒下，摔在地板上，身上溅满了自己的血。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063626_1_17f2cd4a:
    # "Next to him was Erina. Katei's fist had contacted her head, and she had also fallen on top of the blood."
    "他身旁是 Erina。Katei 那一拳正中她的头，她也倒在了那摊血上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063630_1_271c947c:
    # "Only one of them was alive."
    "两人之中，只有一个还活着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063635_1_159e8eac:
    # "Erina suddenly awakened and saw Katei's blurry outline."
    "Erina 猛然醒转，眼前是 Katei 模糊的轮廓。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063636_1_fc8da96f:
    # "She had killed him. She remembered what had happened. However, she could hardly keep herself steady."
    "她杀了他。她记得发生了什么。可她几乎站都站不稳。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063637_1_cb4373b0:
    # "She was unable to tell how much time had passed. The seconds had suddenly cut off for her, but she had to get out of there. Once she was able to stand, she walked to the door."
    "她说不清究竟过了多久。她的时间感骤然中断了，但她必须离开这里。等能站起来后，她便朝门口走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063647_1_bcefd175:
    # "She couldn't see anyone in the hallway, but the end was a bright blob. Suddenly, she felt the need to go somewhere."
    "走廊里看不到人影，尽头只有一团亮光。她突然觉得自己需要去某个地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063650_1_45206679:
    # "She approached the event room. Inside, a single drop of Katei's blood dripped off her."
    "她走到活动室，一滴 Katei 的血从她身上滴落。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063653_1_ad46d9ba:
    # "Paying it no mind, she slowly walked out through the other door."
    "她没有在意，从另一扇门慢慢走了出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063660_1_a2dbc423:
    # "She walked in a straight line. Then, beyond a door, she saw a body beneath a curtain."
    "她笔直地走着。随后，在一扇门后，她看见遮布底下躺着一具尸体。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063661_1_6cdf4d1d:
    # "She had... avenged her. Naomi could at least rest in peace."
    "她总算……替她报了仇。Naomi 至少可以安息了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063664_1_902019d9:
    # "Someone closed the door behind her, but she didn't hear it. ...Only two other people did, and they mistook it as their own action."
    "有人在她身后关上了门，她没有听见。……听见的只有另外两人，而他们都以为那是自己关的门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063674_1_95aaf0f4:
    # "...I think I can imagine what happened.{w} We then found Erina's body, but she was still alive, and after we were in the event room for a while, the other Shiroya woke me up."
    "……我大概能想象出经过。{w}之后我们发现了 Erina，但她还活着；我们在活动室待了一阵，另一个 Shiroya 把我叫醒了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063678_1_6937959d:
    # "Why the hell was she there? And why did we not find her before? Did she avoid the searches with the Sekimeiya, knowing all of them were coming?"
    "她到底为什么会出现在那种地方？我们之前为什么没找到她？难道她早就知道所有人都会来搜，靠着 Sekimeiya 躲了过去？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063679_1_b6a0c924:
    # "She really must have been the Shiroya who disappeared with Naomi..."
    "她果然就是和 Naomi 一起消失的那个 Shiroya……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063681_1_8ac78a26:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063685_1_61b155af:
    # "We couldn't find her, but suddenly, Sai attacked us.{w} I don't get that either...! Why did he want to kill us, and where did he even get that knife from!?"
    "我们没找到她，Sai 却突然袭击了我们。{w}这一点我也想不通……！他为什么想杀我们？那把刀又是从哪儿来的！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063692_1_02a68f87:
    # "I thought you'd overstepped, but it seems I was the one who had."
    "我本以为是你越界了，看来越界的是我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063693_1_d11fdcd2:
    # "What the fuck did that even mean?"
    "那话到底他妈是什么意思？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063699_1_f53053cf:
    # "Before that point, he seemed to slow down when it became clear that I didn't know why he was chasing us. ...He snapped out of it suddenly, though."
    "在那之前，当他发现我根本不知道他为什么追我们时，他的脚步似乎慢了下来。……不过，他很快就猛地回过神来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063708_1_56042e23:
    # "\"Pensively, Sai glanced around the room. Suddenly, in visible shock, his whole body went one step backward.\""
    "「Sai 若有所思地环顾房间。忽然，他像是受了什么惊吓，整个人向后退了一步。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063709_1_b9b3b28b:
    # "Sai saw the security camera behind Atsuki."
    "Sai 看见了 Atsuki 身后的监控摄像头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063710_1_fc836dbc:
    # "Earlier, Sai had experienced his first world switch. It was Atsuki A who he thought he'd been chasing."
    "先前，Sai 经历了第一次世界切换。他本以为自己追的人是 Atsuki A。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063711_1_7307d185:
    # "He realized Atsuki B didn't seem to know what had occurred and that he hadn't been crying, but it was the camera's green light that stopped him, as it otherwise would've been possible for that Atsuki to be a future version of the one who'd punched him.{w} In world A, Sai had noticed the green lights were gone; the cameras hadn't been recording. When he unknowingly returned to world B, he even saw the message on the computer that matched with the lack of green lights."
    "他意识到，Atsuki B 似乎并不知道发生了什么，而且也没有哭过；但真正让他停下的是摄像头的绿灯——否则，那个 Atsuki 也可能是打过他的那个人的未来版本。{w}在 A世界，Sai 注意到绿灯已经熄灭，摄像头并没有在录像。后来他在不知不觉中回到 B世界时，甚至看到了电脑上的那条消息，正好与绿灯熄灭的情况吻合。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063712_1_0164eaba:
    # "However, when he saw the green light again, he understood he'd been recorded chasing behind Atsuki and Shiroya with a knife. If he killed them, he would be the culprit."
    "然而，当他再次看到绿灯时，他明白了：自己拿着刀追赶 Atsuki 和 Shiroya 的样子已经被录了下来。如果他杀了他们，他就是凶手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063713_1_92b61f97:
    # "Sai didn't believe that footage would see the light of the day, but he couldn't risk his own life. As a result, he abandoned all intentions to use his knife as soon as that green light entered his eyes."
    "Sai 不相信那段录像会有重见天日的一天，但他不能拿自己的命去赌。因此，那道绿灯一映入眼中，他就彻底放弃了动刀的念头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063718_1_a9cf5b05:
    # "Sai began to think about what he'd experienced. The Sekimeiya had disappeared from room B6, where Atsuki and Shiroya had found one..."
    "Sai 开始回想自己的经历。Sekimeiya 是从 B6房间消失的，Atsuki 和 Shiroya 正是在那里找到了一个……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063719_1_b648bc27:
    # "They hadn't known yet that two existed: they thought the Sekimeiya had teleported to a drawer, meaning they might've missed that the Future Sekimeiya was still in that room."
    "他们当时还不知道存在两个：他们以为 Sekimeiya 是传送到了某个抽屉里，因此很可能没有注意到未来Sekimeiya 仍留在那个房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063726_1_0f94ecd3:
    # "Atsuki looked through every room in the hallway B and didn't find it after Sai had evaded detection there. He thought he could simply go twenty minutes back and obtain it before Atsuki's inspection, like he'd planned before dashing out of the event room."
    "Sai 在 B走廊躲过搜查后，Atsuki 把 B走廊的每个房间都找了一遍，却没有找到。Sai 以为自己只要回到二十分钟前，赶在 Atsuki 检查之前拿到它就行——这本来就是他冲出活动室之前盘算好的计划。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063727_1_51145c61:
    # "But... what had he experienced? Where was the Atsuki who'd been crying in the attic?"
    "可是……他经历过的那些究竟是什么？那个在阁楼里哭泣的 Atsuki 又去了哪里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063728_1_327638d5:
    # "Sai had seen a dead body in the lobby near a pool of blood: Shiroya's.{w} Why was it not there anymore? Why had the pool of blood diminished?"
    "Sai 曾在大厅里看见 Shiroya 的尸体倒在血泊旁。{w}为什么尸体现在不见了？为什么血泊也变少了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063729_1_8dd5a1cf:
    # "He didn't know, but he'd seen Shiroya dead. Her fate had to be death, but Sai couldn't explain the body's disappearance yet."
    "他不知道原因，但他确实看见 Shiroya 死了。她注定会死，可 Sai 还无法解释尸体为何消失。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063730_1_5e237266:
    # "She would end up dead... Someone would kill Shiroya. Sai just had to work out the structure of events."
    "她最终会死……有人会杀死 Shiroya。Sai 只需要理清事件的脉络。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063743_1_b20e229e:
    # "He ran away and managed to hide in hallway B. I'm not sure what he did, but when he unlocked the cabinet, we spoke to him for a while. ...He was pretty confident that Shiroya would die and that the blood in the lobby was hers."
    "他逃走了，设法躲进 B走廊。我不清楚他做了什么，但他打开展示柜后，我们和他说了一会儿话。……他很确信 Shiroya 会死，大厅里的血也是她的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063744_1_5661d774:
    # "...And that's when he and Shiroya disappeared from the event room."
    "……也就在这时，他和 Shiroya 从活动室里消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063749_1_6270d322:
    # "I also just said what my plan relies on: I must go back to the past, but I don't need to go too far. If I had another Sekimeiya hidden, what would the point of using this one be? I would just go back to the past with the other one I have, right?"
    "我也刚说过我的计划靠的是什么：我必须回到过去，但不用回得太远。如果我另外藏了一个 Sekimeiya，那还用这一个做什么？直接拿手上那个回去不就行了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063750_1_d44abe50:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063755_1_93e219bb:
    # "This is an actual question. If I know where another Sekimeiya is like you say, why would I not simply use that one?"
    "我是认真在问。如果真像你说的，我知道另一个 Sekimeiya 在哪儿，那我为什么不干脆用那一个？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063756_1_5e424acb:
    # "...Because it would've sent him to the future. He wanted to go to the past, and he knew the Sekimeiya in the cabinet was what he needed."
    "……因为那一个会把他送到未来。他想去的是过去，而他知道展示柜里的那个 Sekimeiya 才是他需要的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063757_1_b57cfb19:
    # "When he touched it, he and Shiroya appeared in the attic, which was inaccessible for me.{w} I'm not sure what happened there, but Shiroya told me Sai locked her in a bedroom."
    "他一碰到它，就和 Shiroya 一起出现在了我进不去的阁楼里。{w}我不清楚那里发生了什么，但 Shiroya 告诉我，Sai 把她锁在了一间卧室里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063762_1_6976b591:
    # "On the crystal floor, I was able to open another locker..."
    "在水晶层，我得以打开另一个储物柜……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063763_1_34fdcc13:
    # "Why did I find its key in the cleaning room? Why didn't we find it before that point?"
    "为什么我会在清洁间找到它的钥匙？为什么在那之前，我们始终没找到？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063767_1_0aa1c6f3:
    # "It should've been noticed plenty of times, when people were looking for the Sekimeiya. Maybe you realized that Akaro always went out of his way to look at that room before the cart disappeared."
    "在人们寻找 Sekimeiya 的时候，它本该被注意到很多次。也许你早就发现，Akaro 总会在推车消失前特意去看那个房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063772_1_5830c790:
    # "...From the staff room, I used the Sekimeiya and appeared twenty minutes in the past, in the event room. I used that time to search through the upper floors, but I had locked myself out of the attic.{w} I ended up in the security room without finding anyone, but Erina had to be somewhere, likely with Miiya..."
    "……我从员工室使用了 Sekimeiya，出现在二十分钟前的活动室。我利用那段时间搜遍了楼上几层，却把自己锁在了阁楼外。{w}最后我到了监控室，谁也没找到；但 Erina 一定在某个地方，很可能和 Miiya 在一起……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063773_1_0a546745:
    # "Many questions were eclipsed by a much bigger one: the note that I'd found on the floor of the staff room."
    "我在员工室地板上捡到的那张纸条，让其他许多疑问都显得次要了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063774_1_fd3e9f78:
    # "I touched the Sekimeiya and went twenty minutes to the past. Then, when I returned to the staff room, I found that note. It's very likely it fell from my pocket when I sat on the floor."
    "我碰了 Sekimeiya，回到了二十分钟前。后来我回到员工室时，发现了那张纸条。很可能是我坐在地上时从口袋里掉出来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063775_1_6de361e1:
    # "I never wrote it. What the fuck was it doing in my pocket? I don't believe anyone else left it on the floor.{w} Wait, no. This doesn't even make sense.{w} Nobody could've put it in my pocket, so what I must assume is that I appeared with it when I traveled to the past."
    "我从没写过它。它他妈怎么会在我口袋里？我不相信是别人把它丢在地上的。{w}等等，不对。这根本说不通。{w}没人能把它塞进我的口袋，所以我只能认为，是我回到过去时把它一起带过去的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063776_1_f38da580:
    # "From the staff room, I traveled and appeared in the event room. That makes sense—forty minutes later, we were all there when Erina was about to activate the Sekimeiya."
    "我从员工室穿越，出现在了活动室。这说得通——四十分钟后，我们所有人都在那里，而 Erina 正要启动 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063783_1_5b57e96a:
    # "Oh, right, I'd forgotten about this too."
    "啊，对了，这个我也忘了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063784_1_b585791c:
    # "\"Still sounding groggy, she traced my gaze up to her purse and took out a small piece of paper.\""
    "她声音听起来仍昏昏沉沉的，顺着我的视线看向自己的手袋，取出一张小纸片。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063789_1_c12cfb8e:
    # "I found this just now. I tried to read it, but my head hurt a lot. Do you know what it is?"
    "这是我刚捡到的。我想读，可头疼得厉害。你知道这是什么吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063794_1_ae02bf41:
    # "\"She handed it to me, and I snatched it away, gripping it tightly. My hands started trembling as soon as I glanced at the words again and saw those familiar letters.\""
    "她把它递给我，我一把夺过，紧紧攥住。我再次瞥见上面的字，认出那些熟悉的字迹时，手立刻抖了起来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063795_1_9fa63a19:
    # "Erina found the note I threw away. When I took it, I immediately put it in my pocket so that the others wouldn't see it. That's why I appeared with it in the event room forty minutes earlier..."
    "Erina 捡到了我丢掉的那张纸条。我接过它后，立刻塞进口袋，免得被其他人看见。所以四十分钟前，我才会带着它出现在活动室……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063796_1_7a90cdca:
    # "However, this is illogical. Where is its origin?{w} I appeared with it and I threw it away. Then, Erina found it and gave it to me, which is why I appeared with it. ...It doesn't have a beginning."
    "可是，这不合逻辑。它到底是从哪来的？{w}我带着它出现，又把它丢掉。后来 Erina 捡到它，交给我，所以我才带着它出现。……它根本没有源头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063797_1_b5849f2f:
    # "I must have something backward. Otherwise, it doesn't make any sense."
    "我一定是有什么地方弄反了。不然，这根本说不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063806_1_79fed2d8:
    # "Hm... I assumed Erina found the note where I'd discarded it, behind the handrail in hallway B.{w} But she only said \"I found this just now.\""
    "嗯……我以为 Erina 是在我丢掉纸条的地方——B走廊的栏杆后面——捡到它的。{w}可她只说了「这是我刚才找到的」。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063807_1_20bfb820:
    # "If she found it somewhere else, it makes sense. She gave it to me and I gripped it tightly, which is why I appeared with it in the past and saw it roughly folded. Then, I left it behind the handrail, and it remained there."
    "如果她是在别处捡到的，那就说得通了。她把纸条交给我，我紧紧攥着，所以我回到过去时才会带着它出现——那时我看到它只是被草草折过。后来我把它留在栏杆后面，它就一直在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063808_1_be670887:
    # "Maybe this is it. After all, there's only one explanation behind that note—it came from another world."
    "也许就是这样。毕竟，那张纸条只有一个解释——它来自另一个世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063809_1_17439849:
    # "...And Erina told us what happened right before that point. She met Miiya."
    "……而 Erina 告诉了我们那之前不久发生的事。她遇见了 Miiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063810_1_e0bd2201:
    # "Could Miiya have had that note...? Did I really write it in another world?"
    "那张纸条会不会在 Miiya 手上……？难道真是我在另一个世界写下的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063811_1_ae557b57:
    # "Why was she there, and where did she go?"
    "她为什么会在那里？后来又去了哪里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063812_1_4cbd4e37:
    # "I put my hand in my pocket, but the note wasn't there. It had disappeared at some point."
    "我把手伸进口袋，纸条却不在里面。不知什么时候，它已经消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063813_1_0b4d23d6:
    # "Right. The next time I traveled to the past, I didn't appear with it.{w} But... why? I should have."
    "对了。下一次我回到过去时，并没有带着它出现。{w}可是……为什么？我明明该带着它的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063815_1_67a8cf33:
    # "Although that was what it seemed like, concluding why it had vanished was relatively simple."
    "虽然看起来是那样，但它为什么会消失，其实并不难想明白。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063818_1_009f6816:
    # "Oh, it's like I thought earlier. I had the note when I traveled to the past. From the staff room, I appeared in hallway B and then slammed the storeroom door to create a new noise. After that, I waited in the bathroom on the second floor.{w} There, I put my hand in my pocket because I wanted to flush the note away. However, it wasn't there.{w} That's why I didn't appear with it. I wanted to flush it away, so if I had, I wouldn't have held the note in the future, and I never could've appeared with it."
    "哦，就像我之前想的那样。我回到过去时，身上带着那张纸条。我从员工室出发，出现在 B走廊，然后用力摔上储藏室的门，制造出新的响声。之后，我在二楼的洗手间里等着。{w}在那里，我把手伸进口袋，因为我想把纸条冲掉。可是它不在。{w}所以它才没有跟着我出现。我想把它冲掉；要是我真那么做了，未来的我手上就不会有那张纸条，我也就不可能带着它出现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063819_1_c6ddde27:
    # "These details... I wonder how many I missed.{w} Now that I think about it, something similar happened that very same travel.{w} When I touched the Sekimeiya, I had the locker key in my hand. However, when I returned to the staff room with Shiroya, I had it in my pocket. I still appeared with it in the past, but it was in my pocket."
    "这些细节……不知道我漏掉了多少。{w}现在回想起来，就在那一次穿越里，也发生过类似的事。{w}我碰到 Sekimeiya 时，手里拿着储物柜钥匙。可是当我和 Shiroya 回到员工室时，钥匙却在我的口袋里。我回到过去时还是带着它，只是它已经在口袋里了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063820_1_ab84cae7:
    # "...That's because if I'd appeared with it in my hand, I would've then put it in my pocket. That redundant action was canceled, and I simply appeared with it already inside.{w} Along the same line of thought, I didn't go to the bathroom many times, did I? I didn't feel the need to.{w} Maybe that happened due to my travels—if I'd felt that urge upon going back, I would've gone to the bathroom. Then, in the replicated location, that wouldn't have been needed anymore. My bladder just automatically emptied without me noticing."
    "……因为如果我出现时手里拿着它，之后也会把它放进口袋。结果这个多余的动作被省掉了，我出现时它已经在口袋里。{w}同理，我去洗手间的次数其实并不多，对吧？因为我没觉得有必要。{w}也许这也是穿越造成的——如果我在回去时产生了尿意，就会去洗手间。可到了复制出的地点，就已经不需要再去了。我的膀胱只是在我没注意的时候自己排空了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063824_1_0eec8332:
    # "...There certainly are mysteries I still can't solve. Maybe I can, but I'm failing to do so."
    "……确实还有一些我解不开的谜。也许我解得开，只是没能做到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063825_1_be60df23:
    # "Miiya's existence, Shiroya's..."
    "Miiya 的存在，Shiroya 的……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063833_1_232fc3a7:
    # "In the event room, when Erina activated the Sekimeiya, the world around us changed, and Sai was the only one to travel through time."
    "在活动室里，Erina 启动 Sekimeiya 的那一刻，周围的世界随之改变，而穿越时间的只有 Sai 一人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063842_1_e4728d24:
    # "Atsuki had hidden the Past Sekimeiya in Ido's locker, so Sai went to the future."
    "Atsuki 把过去Sekimeiya 藏进了 Ido 的储物柜，所以 Sai 去了未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063843_1_f761d56d:
    # "He had just been in the attic's bedroom, so he reappeared there with Shiroya. That is how he unintentionally locked himself in that room."
    "他之前就在阁楼的卧室里，于是便和 Shiroya 一同在那里现身。就这样，他无意间把自己锁进了那间屋子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063852_1_7f0c8079:
    # "When that happened, Shiroya was with us, but her clothes were different... She had appeared before me when I'd cried her name..."
    "当时，Shiroya 和我们在一起，但衣服却不同……我喊她名字时，她就那样出现在我眼前……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063853_1_c0b310db:
    # "That was the real Shiroya, but what happened to her? How did she get there?"
    "那的确是真正的 Shiroya，可她究竟出了什么事？又是怎么到那里的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063854_1_1172594c:
    # "Was she the Shiroya from this morning, the one who'd traveled to the pa—"
    "她就是今早那个 Shiroya 吗？那个穿越到过去——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063863_1_2eb57747:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063865_1_cd7c5e00:
    # "Her words came back to me. She had told me that she'd traveled to November 30th."
    "她的话又浮现在我脑海里。她曾对我说，自己穿越到了11月30日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063866_1_21d2d377:
    # "Wait, what the hell...? There's a major contradiction with that."
    "等等，这到底怎么回事……？这跟刚才说的可有天大的矛盾。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063877_1_d395ba94:
    # "She said that she appeared below the gem shop... but that can't be. She wouldn't have appeared there if she'd gone from December 15th to November 30th."
    "她说自己出现在宝石店下方……可那不可能。如果她是从12月15日回到11月30日，根本不会出现在那个地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063878_1_b08e0ac7:
    # "That location was exactly where she was on November 30th.{w} The only way for her to appear there is if she went fifteen days into the future.{w} ...To December 30th."
    "那个地方，正是她11月30日所在之处。{w} 她要出现在那里，唯一的可能就是穿越到了十五天后的未来。{w}……也就是12月30日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063879_1_c1192c47:
    # "...Could she really have gone to the future? Did that occur without her realizing it?{w} Right, I didn't think about it earlier, but the Sekimeiya that sent us repeatedly to January 5th at {time=21:00} was the one that Shiroya activated in the bathroom."
    "……她真的去了未来吗？难道连她自己都没有察觉？{w} 对了，我之前一直没想到——那个在{time=21:00}一次次把我们送往1月5日的 Sekimeiya，正是 Shiroya 在浴室里启动的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063880_1_3ed337b2:
    # "I couldn't know what had happened, but just the location where she'd appeared spelled it out clearly."
    "我无从知道究竟发生了什么，可她现身的地点本身就已经说明了一切。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063887_1_c40b7e7e:
    # "Wait, this is why..."
    "等等，原来是因为这个……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063889_1_fe5326a9:
    # "It's why the chain of travels forward stopped on January 5th! It's gotta be!"
    "正因如此，这一连串向前的穿越才会停在1月5日！一定是这样！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063890_1_48caaf16:
    # "Shiroya traveled to the future. She went to December 30th. Then, like she told me, she entered the tower through the storeroom days later—on January 5th."
    "Shiroya 穿越到了未来，去的是12月30日。然后，就像她告诉我的那样，几天之后——1月5日，她从储藏室进了塔里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063891_1_a3cff67d:
    # "She didn't tell me exactly what she did, but I know she was in the mechanical room. She told me that she found the attic key there.{w} So she was looking for something, and without realizing it, she moved the Future Sekimeiya in the mechanical room. The next time that all of us appeared, nobody instantly activated the next travel, so we stopped on the 5th. That has to be it!"
    "她没细说自己做了什么，但我知道她去过机械室。她说过，阁楼的钥匙就是在那儿找到的。{w} 也就是说，她当时在找东西，却无意间挪动了机械室里的未来Sekimeiya。等我们所有人下一次现身时，没有人立刻启动下一段穿越，所以我们才停在了5日。一定是这样！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063897_1_795c11ad:
    # "I looked at the voice recorder."
    "我看向录音笔。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063900_1_d6659fcd:
    # "58:42. It's almost been an hour already."
    "58分42秒。已经快一个小时了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063901_1_640da33b:
    # "I didn't have much time."
    "剩下的时间不多了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063908_1_417cd3ba:
    # "...Although it once seemed impossible, saving Miiya from the explosion should be simple. Very soon, if I touch the Sekimeiya, I'll be sent back to a point before she died.{w} ...Then, I could stop it. I could change the past."
    "……把 Miiya 从爆炸中救下，曾经看来毫无可能，如今却应该很简单。再过不久，只要我触碰 Sekimeiya，就会被送回她死去之前的时间点。{w}……那样，我就能阻止它。我就能改变过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063909_1_e9f9743c:
    # "That would create the world that we want—the one we thought we'd have on that day."
    "那样一来，就能创造出我们想要的世界——那个我们本以为在那一天就该拥有的世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063910_1_5fc311ce:
    # "...But there's still a big problem. If I do that, I can't live in it. Two versions of myself would remain."
    "……但还有一个大问题。真要那么做，我就没法活在那个世界里了——那里会留下两个我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063911_1_ce33fe5b:
    # "That had previously been a theoretical problem I hadn't needed to confront. However, it was the truth; although that world was attainable, it had no room for its creator."
    "这个问题从前只停留在理论上，我无须面对。可事实就是如此：那个世界纵然能够抵达，也没有创造者的容身之处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063912_1_e2a4f8a5:
    # "Given all I'd concluded, I could think of a slight workaround."
    "综合种种推论，我想到一个勉强的变通办法。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063913_1_086de4ce:
    # "I could create that world and then leave it..."
    "我可以创造出那个世界，然后从中离开……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063917_1_4cfae3a4:
    # "If I'm right, and touching the Sekimeiya when both ranges overlap will send me to the other world, I could do that after saving Miiya.{w} If it worked, although I'd end up in my original world, I would've at least facilitated the best one's existence."
    "如果我的推测没错，在两个范围重叠时触碰 Sekimeiya 就能被送往另一个世界，那我大可在救下 Miiya 之后这么做。{w} 若真能成功，纵然我最后会回到原本的世界，至少也能让那个最好的世界存在下去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063918_1_3e36fef2:
    # "But I don't get what's happening right now. Why was Miiya in the tower?{w} If I did what I'm thinking, I would make sure our past selves don't go to the event, as that would put them in danger again. So, then, why is Miiya here? ...And why have I not seen Shiroya anywhere?"
    "可眼前的一切，我仍旧想不通。Miiya 为什么会在塔里？{w} 若我按计划行事，一定会设法让过去的我们不去参加那场活动，免得他们再次陷入危险。既然如此，Miiya 又怎会在这里？……还有，为什么我到处都见不到 Shiroya？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063919_1_d60f8217:
    # "...That time before {time=21}, why did Shiroya say that she didn't want to save Miiya? It couldn't have been the real Shiroya, but I can't figure out a reason."
    "……{time=21}之前的那一次，Shiroya 为什么说不想救 Miiya？那不可能是真正的 Shiroya，可我想不出其中的缘由。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063920_1_13b66d3b:
    # "...However, as I'd thought, doing what I'd proposed myself was simple. I only had to touch the Sekimeiya when the device displayed 65 minutes and 20 seconds.{w} As I could plan out the loop before executing it, there was a best-case scenario that I'd thought up."
    "……不过，正如我所料，执行自己的方案并不难。只要在装置显示65分20秒时触碰 Sekimeiya 即可。{w} 我可以在执行之前把循环安排妥当，也想好了一套最理想的情形。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063921_1_87450a1b:
    # "I would appear on November 24th. That's 21 days before now, and it'll be January 5th in 21 days. Basically, if I think about what I'll do on January 5th, I can plan my arrival on November 24th."
    "我会在11月24日现身。那是现在的21天前，而再过21天就是1月5日。换句话说，只要先想好1月5日该做的事，我就能安排自己在11月24日出现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063924_1_b00ef88b:
    # "After November 30th, once everything is done, I could touch the Sekimeiya to go to our previous world. There, I know I'll be able to use the Sekimeiya on January 5th after we break free from the chain of travels.{w} ...If I plan this out so I obtain both Sekimeiya on the 5th, I can appear with them on November 24th, which will allow me to use them immediately after the 30th."
    "等到11月30日之后、一切尘埃落定，我可以触碰 Sekimeiya，回到我们原先的世界。在那里，等我们挣脱穿越的连锁，我知道自己能在1月5日使用 Sekimeiya。{w}……只要我事先安排妥当，让自己在5日那天拿到两个 Sekimeiya，就能带着它们出现在11月24日，这样在30日之后便能立刻动用。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063925_1_9a758635:
    # "What I can't be sure of is that doing so will bring me to the world I was in. It could send me anywhere else."
    "唯一无法确定的是，这么做是否真能让我回到原先所在的世界。也可能被送到别的什么地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063926_1_591fad42:
    # "If that happens, though, won't it be the world where Shiroya is? The Shiroya who disappeared from this world earlier today?"
    "可若真是那样，那不就是 Shiroya 所在的世界吗？就是今天早些时候从这个世界上消失的那个 Shiroya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063927_1_8172fe1d:
    # "...Would that be consistent? Even though I would've altered this world, would I be sent to the same place where she went?"
    "……这样说得通吗？纵使我改变了这个世界，难道就会被送到她去的同一个地方？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063928_1_fc68541d:
    # "I had no idea where Shiroya was, but I remembered the time I'd told her that changing the past was possible. Without a doubt, she wanted Miiya to be saved, and the opportunity to accomplish it was finally real. Even with all that I'd concluded, I found myself entirely lost, merely aware that Miiya's death was reversible."
    "Shiroya 身在何处，我毫无头绪；但我记得自己曾告诉她，过去是可以改变的。她无疑希望 Miiya 得救，而实现这一点的机会终于真正摆在眼前。尽管已经推演出这一切，我仍旧茫然无措，只知道 Miiya 的死可以挽回。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063932_1_7ab02903:
    # "If touching the Sekimeiya doesn't send me to our world, what that might mean is that on January 5th, I won't be able to have them. Then, I wouldn't appear with them on November 24th, so I suppose I'll know as soon as I travel."
    "若触碰 Sekimeiya 后没能回到我们的世界，那或许意味着1月5日那天我拿不到它们。这样一来，我也就不会带着它们出现在11月24日——看来，穿越的那一刻就能知道答案。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063933_1_70b0ac30:
    # "If that happens, I'll have to wait until December 15th to change worlds during the incident."
    "若真是如此，我就只能等到12月15日，趁那场事件发生时切换世界了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063934_1_f9a18958:
    # "...{w}Was it a flawed plan? I went over it again, and I didn't think so. I intended to change history. There was no option to check a note a future self of mine would leave behind to assure my success.{w} Saving Miiya was achievable. I'd dearly wished for that, hoped it was possible, been denied, and arrived at a real chance for it. It was a surreal thought, but there was no longer a reason to doubt it."
    "……{w}这个计划有破绽吗？我又推敲了一遍，不觉得有。我本来就打算改写历史。我也无法靠未来自己留下的字条来确认这次行动能否成功。{w} 救下 Miiya 是可以做到的。我曾那样殷切地盼望、相信它有可能实现，也曾被现实否定，如今终于等到了真正的机会。这念头仿佛不真实，却再没有理由怀疑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063935_1_1a75fcad:
    # "Once it was created, I would let that world continue to exist by leaving it.{w} Would it be possible to find the Shiroya I'd been with? If so, would we be able to return to our world? Assuming we could do that, there would be nothing else to wish for."
    "一旦那个世界被创造出来，我会离开那里，让它继续存在下去。{w} 我能找到曾与我相伴的那个 Shiroya 吗？若能找到，我们还能回到原本的世界吗？倘若这一切都能实现，那便再无所求了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063938_1_4a50e91d:
    # "But I still can't wrap my head around Miiya's existence in the tower. Does that conflict with what I'm aiming for?{w} How was she here? If I save her, I know I'll make sure none of us go to the tower. How is it possible that she was here all day?"
    "可我怎么也想不明白，Miiya 为什么会在塔里。这和我打算做的事有冲突吗？{w} 她怎么会在这里？如果我救了她，我一定会确保我们谁都不去那座塔。既然如此，她又怎么可能一整天都待在这里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063939_1_c5993d34:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063940_1_fff39ec1:
    # "I don't understand it, but it shouldn't be an issue regardless.{w} On top of that, I can't be content with just knowing that she was in the tower. I still need to act."
    "我不明白，但无论如何，这应该都不成问题。{w} 再说，光是知道她曾在塔里，并不能让我安心。我还得动手去做。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063941_1_477883c0:
    # "The note I found in my pocket could've come from Miiya. Erina said that she saw her minutes before we traveled to the world where she existed...{w} That note implied only one thing: Shiroya's death. If that world was this very same one I'm in, and Miiya came from it, could that be why I haven't seen Shiroya...? Is it because she's not here at all?"
    "我口袋里那张字条，或许是 Miiya 写的。Erina 说过，就在我们穿越到那个有她存在的世界之前几分钟，她还见过 Miiya……{w} 那张字条只暗示了一件事：Shiroya 的死。如果那个世界正是我现在身处的世界，而 Miiya 也来自那里，这会不会就是我一直没见到 Shiroya 的原因……？她根本就不在这里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063945_1_4462efa7:
    # "If I'm able to appear on November 24th with both Sekimeiya, I'll be able to freely travel back through time just in case there's any issue I can't foresee the first time around."
    "只要我能带着两个 Sekimeiya 出现在11月24日，就能随意穿越回过去，以防第一次行动中出现我无法预料的变故。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063946_1_709cac83:
    # "I exhaled slowly. I was ready to act. Even though the true shape of the universe was impossible to comprehend, I knew enough to be confident in myself."
    "我缓缓吐出一口气。我已做好准备，可以行动了。宇宙的真实面目固然无法参透，但我知道的已经足够，足以让我相信自己。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063947_1_e5156375:
    # "And no matter what, it would lead to a result. No matter what it was, an outcome would arise from the labyrinthine structure that had formed around me."
    "无论如何，行动都会带来结果。无论结果是什么，那个在我周围形成的迷宫般的结构，终将给出一个答案。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063948_1_e0ae62c6:
    # "I can do it, can't I? I can easily appear on November 24th. It has to be that day because it's proportional to January 5th.{w} I don't think anyone's still in the tower right now, so the range should only affect me."
    "我能做到的，不是吗？让我出现在11月24日并不难。必须是那一天，它与1月5日正好对应。{w} 现在塔里应该没有别人了，波及范围也只会影响我一个人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063949_1_58236a9e:
    # "The time on the screen was 62:37. I'd taken the Past Sekimeiya out of the refrigerator as I'd pressed record, so I didn't have a lot of time to waste."
    "屏幕上的时间是 62:37。我一边按下录音键，一边从冰箱里取出 过去Sekimeiya，剩下的时间并不多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063952_1_d750d184:
    # "In the past, I won't be able to stay at my house. That means I'll need money to stay somewhere else."
    "回到过去后，我不能住在自己家里。也就是说，我需要钱去别处落脚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063953_1_c7bd2179:
    # "...But that's not an issue. What I figured out earlier will help me here."
    "……不过这不是问题。之前想通的那些，正好能派上用场。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063954_1_8ab491b5:
    # "In November, I could very easily obtain the money my past self has saved. However, I'd like to avoid doing that so I don't cause any issues.{w} Instead, I can just duplicate it. I can take that money, which will allow me to have it on January 5th. Then, I'll appear with it on November 24th, so it won't be necessary to obtain it from my past self."
    "到了十一月，想拿到过去的自己存下的那笔钱很容易。但我不想节外生枝，所以还是别那么干。{w} 不如直接复制一份。我拿走复制出来的钱，就能在一月五日拥有它；再带着它出现在十一月二十四日，就不用从过去的自己手里取了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063955_1_131db2de:
    # "Of course, to have it on January 5th, I have to not spend it. There's another way to solve this—just duplicate it again."
    "当然，要在一月五日拿到它，我就不能把它花掉。要解决这个问题还有另一个办法——再复制一次就行。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063959_1_df87ff80:
    # "My body shook with anticipation, jittering all the way down to my fingertips. I was closer to leaving the tower than I had been in what felt like eons."
    "我因期待而浑身发颤，连指尖都在抖。我从未像此刻这样接近离开这座塔，仿佛已经等了千万年。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063960_1_6eb31190:
    # "On January 5th, if I'm able to get the Sekimeiya, that will happen inside the tower around the morning, after the point I traveled to the past. Since it's currently the afternoon, I'll appear at close to midnight on the 25th."
    "一月五日如果我能拿到 Sekimeiya，那应该是在塔里，时间大约是早晨，就在我穿越回过去之后。现在是下午，所以我会在二十五日接近午夜时现身。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063961_1_1dc18a7d:
    # "...That's perfect."
    "……正合适。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063964_1_1e87677f:
    # "I stopped thinking and stepped closer to the Sekimeiya."
    "我不再多想，朝 Sekimeiya 走近一步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063967_1_9f6de88f:
    # "64:47. The seconds were rapidly going up."
    "64:47。秒数正飞快地往上跳。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063969_1_72780e22:
    # "65. Only twenty more seconds."
    "65。只剩二十秒了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063970_1_d6a3adaa:
    # "The aura of heat around the Sekimeiya had compounded immensely, but my senses were honed in on the timer. I barely registered the temperature."
    "Sekimeiya 周围的热浪已积聚得极其浓烈，但我的全部感官都锁在计时器上，几乎感觉不到温度。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063972_1_2449f73f:
    # "65:15,{w=1} 16, {w=1}17,{w=1} 18..."
    "65:15，{w=1} 16，{w=1}17，{w=1} 18……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063981_1_5dcb2a1c:
    # "Lucid Dream"
    "清醒梦"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063984_1_88b05f0f:
    # "65:19. That was the last number my eyes saw before my sight blackened."
    "65:19。这是我在眼前一黑之前看到的最后一个数字。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063985_1_51c267d8:
    # "...Where—"
    "……这里是——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063986_1_7f384d81:
    # "Touching the Sekimeiya brought back the darkness. However, I immediately discerned where I was: the place where I'd thought I'd appear."
    "碰到 Sekimeiya，黑暗再度降临。但我立刻辨出了自己身在何处——正是我预想会现身的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063992_1_2f1ff2b2:
    # "It's the lobby. Since there's no light, it must be nighttime."
    "是大厅。一点光都没有，看来是夜里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063993_1_30ef9177:
    # "There was something on my lap, and I knew what it was. A suitcase. It was open, and both Sekimeiya were in it."
    "腿上放着什么东西，我知道那是什么——一只手提箱。箱盖敞着，两个 Sekimeiya 都在里面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063994_1_74104409:
    # "It worked...! The Sekimeiya are here!{w} This is everything I need to confirm this'll work!{w} I'll go back to my world, and on January 5th, I'll be able to get both Sekimeiya!"
    "成功了……！Sekimeiya 就在这里！{w} 有这些，就够我确认这计划行得通了！{w} 我回到自己的世界，到了一月五日，就能把两个 Sekimeiya 都拿到手！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063995_1_71a89945:
    # "I could feel that my clothing hadn't changed. When I looked around me, I saw the sight I'd been longing for: the sky. As my vision adjusted, the multitude of stars above me took shape. The shutter, the barrier to the outside, was gone."
    "我能感觉到自己的衣服没有变。环顾四周，我看见了那个朝思暮想的景象——天空。视线渐渐适应，头顶的繁星显出轮廓。那道隔开外界的卷帘门，不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L063996_1_64842040:
    # "I stood up, speechless, and haltingly walked over to the door."
    "我无言地站起身，一步一顿地走向门口。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064004_1_97b235c9:
    # "I could see snow on the ground, illuminated by a handful of streetlights. It was right there, behind a screen of glass."
    "我能看见地面上的积雪，被几盏路灯照亮。它就在那里，只隔着一层玻璃。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064008_1_b3ce520f:
    # "I placed my hand on the handle and gently pushed.{w} The door didn't open. As I'd expected, it was locked.{w} I couldn't go to the storeroom because the hallway cameras would record me..."
    "我把手放在门把上，轻轻一推。{w} 门没有开。果然锁着。{w} 我不能去储藏室，走廊的摄像头会拍到我……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064009_1_d288943b:
    # "I put my hand in my pocket, hoping I would feel cold metal."
    "我把手伸进口袋，盼着能摸到冰凉的金属。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064010_1_f1bde5cf:
    # "Yes! It's here!"
    "太好了！在这里！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064011_1_730f625f:
    # "It was a keyring with a dog-shaped keychain—the one I'd found in the coat of a staff member, which I could obtain on January 5th. Since it had been in the clothes that staff member had worn when entering the tower, it was possible one of the keys unlocked the door. Appearing with it guaranteed that one would."
    "那是一串挂着狗形钥匙扣的钥匙——就是我在一月五日拿到的那串，原本放在一名员工的外套里。既然钥匙串是在那名员工进塔时穿的衣服里找到的，其中一把钥匙就有可能打开这扇门。只要我带着它出现，就必定有一把能打开这扇门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064012_1_3ec3c41d:
    # "There were four keys, and one was bigger than the others. Once I found the keyhole below the handle, I inserted it."
    "一共四把钥匙，其中一把比别的都大。我找到门把下方的锁孔，把它插了进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064013_1_ecc3056d:
    # "When it turned, my shoulders dropped, unable to believe the truth. I could set foot outside that place."
    "钥匙一转，我双肩一松，几乎不敢相信这是真的——我可以踏出那个地方了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064020_1_09a66f59:
    # "And when the door opened, I did so without thinking. I was no longer in the building; there was snow around me, and I was holding the Sekimeiya. Most importantly, I had a plan I could enact successfully."
    "门一开，我便不假思索地跨了出去。我已经不在那栋楼里了；四周是雪，手里握着 Sekimeiya。最重要的是，我有了一个可以顺利执行的计划。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064021_1_e9cb10b1:
    # "A lone key was in my pocket, isolated from the set—the rusty key I'd obtained in the security room. And in my other pocket, I found money."
    "口袋里有一把单独的钥匙，是从那串上取下来的——就是我在监控室拿到的生锈钥匙。另一个口袋里，我摸到了钱。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064022_1_c54ad631:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064023_1_719e0c5e:
    # "I could only stand there, feeling the cold air hit my face."
    "我只能站在原地，任冷风扑在脸上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064024_1_297261c8:
    # "I couldn't believe I'd really been able to walk out. I'd gotten far too used to being stopped. A faint buzz hummed around me, fading into the night. I took a step forward and was assaulted by tiredness."
    "我竟然真的走了出来，简直难以置信。被拦下太多次，我早已习惯了。耳边隐约有一阵嗡鸣，渐渐消散在夜色里。我向前迈出一步，疲惫顿时涌了上来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064025_1_f4934970:
    # "So this is how I'll be on January 5th... I feel exhausted."
    "原来一月五日的我是这个样子……累得不行。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064026_1_75cf1466:
    # "And I had to go somewhere. The cold was rapidly getting to me, and a full night was still ahead."
    "而且我得找个去处。寒气正迅速侵入身体，而整夜还长着呢。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064029_1_e6bed9d2:
    # "...Where do I go? There's a motel in the center of town, but I'm not sure it'll be open."
    "……我该去哪儿？镇中心有家汽车旅馆，但不确定还开着没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064030_1_164d8559:
    # "I kept a replica of my keys outside my house, so I could silently sneak into my parents' room and stay there without alerting my own self. That wasn't something I wanted to do if I could help it."
    "我在家门外藏了备用钥匙，好悄悄溜进父母的房间落脚，又不惊动这个时间里的我。不过若非万不得已，我不想这么做。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064032_1_d63b19cc:
    # "I suppose I'll have to see."
    "看来只能去看看了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064036_1_8ae08d4b:
    # "I turned around and saw a large shadow covering the stars. It was the tower, looking even bigger than I recalled."
    "我回过头，看见一片巨大的黑影遮住了星空。那是塔，比我记忆中还要高大。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064037_1_b985b76a:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064038_1_3bddcffd:
    # "With the same key I'd used to leave, I locked the front door."
    "我用刚才离开时用的那把钥匙，把前门锁上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064043_1_1ce8addb:
    # "...Once I'd taken a few steps, all light was gone. Fortunately, I could navigate the streets without a problem."
    "……走出几步之后，四下里就一片漆黑了。好在这些街道我熟得很，走起来毫无困难。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064044_1_68d5d27e:
    # "I walked, unable to hear any sounds beyond my own steps. As I got closer to the center, more faint lights dotted the streets. Soon, I stepped into the widest street and approached a building I'd never been to."
    "我一路走着，除了自己的脚步声，什么都听不见。越靠近镇中心，街上零星的灯火就越多。不久，我踏上最宽的那条街，走向一栋从未去过的建筑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064048_1_8d7a17da:
    # "There was a sign above the door. It read \"Eagle Motel\"."
    "门上挂着一块招牌，写着「鹰旅馆」。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064049_1_04115ff3:
    # "Is it closed? I don't see anyone."
    "关门了吗？一个人都看不见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064050_1_fdf53ec3:
    # "There was a bell near it, so I pressed it."
    "旁边有个门铃，我按了下去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064054_1_a31f1795:
    # "I waited, wondering if the sound had reached anyone."
    "我等着，心想那铃声有没有传到谁耳中。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064055_1_409e5dd9:
    # "It took me a while to discern that a tall man was approaching me. He turned on the lights and opened the door from the inside, his eyes showing that he'd been about to fall asleep."
    "过了好一会儿，我才看出有个高个子男人正朝我走来。他打开灯，从里面开了门，眼神迷迷糊糊的，像是刚要睡着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064059_1_4539114b:
    # "S-Sorry. Would it be possible for me to spend the night here?"
    "抱、抱歉。能让我在这里住一晚吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064060_1_ed6d66d1:
    # "...You don't have a reservation?"
    "……你没有预订？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064061_1_4591b7d0:
    # "No... Something just came up, and I have nowhere to stay."
    "没有……临时出了点事，我实在无处可去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064062_1_801ddf74:
    # "We have spare rooms, but it's ¥8,000 a night."
    "有空房，不过一晚 ¥8,000。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064063_1_8a6738bd:
    # "That's fine. I might have to stay a few days."
    "没问题。我可能得在这儿住上几天。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064064_1_f01b0511:
    # "I suddenly looked down at myself and noticed that my clothes still had very faint traces of smoke on them, although, I thought, not identical to how they'd been before traveling."
    "我忽然低头看了看自己，发现衣服上还残留着极淡的烟味——不过我觉得，和穿越前并不完全一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064065_1_defa549a:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064071_1_bbbad1a7:
    # "I paid one night's rate and was given two keys—one for the front door and another for a bedroom."
    "我付了一晚的房费，拿到两把钥匙——一把开大门，一把开客房。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064074_1_f3aac50c:
    # "My attention was immediately grabbed by a digital clock on the table. It was {time=22:54} on November 24th, a Thursday."
    "桌上的电子钟立刻吸引了我的目光。上面显示着 11 月 24 日，星期四，{time=22:54}。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064075_1_dd8566d6:
    # "...I can't believe it. I traveled three weeks to the past."
    "……真不敢相信。我竟然回到了三周前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064076_1_3b0aabe2:
    # "Within the tower, anything had seemed possible, but with the effect reflected in the real world, my mind couldn't accept it."
    "在塔里时，仿佛什么都可能发生；可当结果真真切切地出现在现实世界，我却怎么也接受不了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064077_1_86936eaf:
    # "Both Sekimeiya were in the suitcase, and the smell of the tower still hung around me."
    "两个 Sekimeiya 都在手提箱里，我身上还留着塔里的气味。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064078_1_5af93d4e:
    # "The room was linked to a bathroom with a shower and a kitchen. I had a lot of things to think about, but my body dropped on the bed, giving me no chance to do so."
    "房间连着带淋浴的浴室和一间厨房。我有很多事要想，可身体一沾到床，就再没有力气想下去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064082_1_6b007cb4:
    # "Wait!{w} The money... I have to duplicate it."
    "等等！{w}钱……我得把钱复制出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064083_1_4a882362:
    # "I'd paid for a single night, so I had to duplicate that amount and then the entire sum. I got out of bed and approached the suitcase."
    "我只付了一晚的钱，得先复制出一晚的数额，再把整笔钱复制出来。我下了床，走到手提箱前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064084_1_fbdf9d08:
    # "They've been outside for so long, I'm sure they don't have a lot of energy. I should be able to touch one without the range reaching anyone else here.{w} I wonder which is the future one. If I touch the past one, I'll just appear in the bathroom and stay there until my past self leaves."
    "它们在外面放了这么久，能量肯定不多了。我碰其中一个，影响范围应该不会波及这里的其他人。{w}不知道哪个才是通往未来的。要是碰到过去那个，我只会出现在浴室里，一直待到过去的我离开为止。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064085_1_c7f6d304:
    # "I'd undressed before getting in bed since the room was warm. If I replicated my past location, the money I'd been holding would duplicate.{w} I placed the suitcase on the bed and separated both gemstones. Then, I touched one of them in the center of the room."
    "房间很暖和，我上床前就把衣服脱了。只要重现我过去所在的位置，我手里的钱就会复制出来。{w}我把手提箱放到床上，把两颗宝石分开，然后在房间中央碰了其中一个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064093_1_0cb6129a:
    # "Hm...?"
    "嗯……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064094_1_a36c398c:
    # "My vision went dark, but I could hear something. ...I wasn't alone."
    "眼前一黑，我却听得见动静。……这里不止我一个人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064096_1_eb53c1e4:
    # "Wait, is this...?"
    "等等，这里是……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064099_1_03e48125:
    # "My bedroom. Not the motel's, but the one in my house. When I glanced at the source of the sound, I saw my own body sleeping in my bed."
    "我的卧室。不是旅馆的房间，而是我家里那间。我朝声音的来源看去，只见床上睡着的正是我自己。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064100_1_82e971c1:
    # "What!? Why am I here...?"
    "什么！？我怎么会在这里……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064101_1_e0ac412f:
    # "I slowly stepped back, unable to take my eyes off myself. It was November; that self of mine hadn't yet reunited with Shiroya and Miiya. By the time I reached the door, I started to understand what had happened."
    "我慢慢后退，视线却离不开床上的自己。现在是十一月，那个我还没和 Shiroya、Miiya 重逢。一直退到门口，我才渐渐明白发生了什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064105_1_1af6866b:
    # "My clothes changed... I went to the future."
    "衣服变了……我去了未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064106_1_9a1a94a1:
    # "I think I traveled farther than I expected. Maybe the Sekimeiya were gathering energy inside the suitcase even though the outside was so chilly. I must have traveled more than fifteen minutes through time, so the replicated location was from a time before I appeared in the lobby, when I was about to sleep in my old world."
    "看来我穿越得比预想中更远。外面明明这么冷，Sekimeiya 或许还是在手提箱里积攒了能量。我穿越的时间跨度肯定超过十五分钟，所以复制出的位置才早于我在大厅出现的时候——那时我还在原来的世界里准备睡觉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064107_1_1caa935b:
    # "Trying to prevent myself from being noticed, I approached the front door. ...It seemed I had replicated my body on November 24th, and it was fortunate I'd appeared when I'd already fallen asleep."
    "为了不惊动那个自己，我朝大门摸去。……看来我复制出的是 11 月 24 日的自己，幸好出现时我已经睡着了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064110_1_3fbe2ab3:
    # "I felt the handle and opened the door. The sky brimmed with stars, and my clothes were no longer protecting me from the freezing air. I had left the motel bedroom empty, so I ran there."
    "我摸到门把手，推开了门。夜空满是繁星，身上的衣服却已挡不住刺骨的寒气。旅馆的房间还空着，我一路跑了回去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064111_1_29f14c40:
    # "Once again, I had to ring the bell to enter. To my surprise, an older woman opened the door."
    "我又一次按响门铃才进去。没想到开门的是一位年长的女人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064114_1_a4bba721:
    # "Sorry, I had to go out for a bit. Where's the man from before?"
    "抱歉，我出去了一趟。刚才那位男士呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064115_1_3e93a90b:
    # "Oh, old Stanley? He sticks to a strict sleep schedule. Next time, don't ring the bell, just knock. He gets mean when you wake him up. Along with you now."
    "哦，你说老 Stanley？他的作息很规律。下次别按门铃，敲门就行。把他吵醒，他脾气可不好——这下连你也要挨骂了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064121_1_6fbf4a03:
    # "The Sekimeiya was still on the bed. There was no doubt it was the future one, as the clock showed {time=23:29.}"
    "Sekimeiya 还在床上。钟上显示着 {time=23:29.}，毫无疑问是通往未来的那个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064122_1_945a7256:
    # "...I didn't change worlds, so the range of the other Sekimeiya didn't reach me. I hope nobody else traveled with me."
    "……我没有切换世界，另一个 Sekimeiya 的范围也就没有波及到我。但愿没有别人跟着我一起穿越。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064123_1_7c25c86c:
    # "I sat on the bed and panted, each inhalation bringing lancing pain. I was even more tired than before, and it took me a second to process why. The replicated location had been from when the past me was about to go to sleep."
    "我坐在床上喘息，每吸一口气都像被针扎。我比先前更累了，愣了一下才想明白其中缘由——我出现的位置，是过去的我正要入睡时的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064124_1_a2dc6404:
    # "...I didn't actually duplicate the money."
    "……钱其实没能复制成功。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064125_1_3ef2b747:
    # "My old clothes were beside the bed, but I had to reset the Sekimeiya before attempting it again.{w} I sat up and walked to the kitchen."
    "原先的衣服就在床边，不过我得先把 Sekimeiya 重置，才能再试一次。{w}我坐起身，走向厨房。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064129_1_eaa97845:
    # "Oh, there's a refrigerator here."
    "哦，这里有冰箱。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064132_1_4858acf9:
    # "It was running, so I knew it would work to cool off the Sekimeiya. After putting both of them inside, I grabbed the money from the pocket of my other pants."
    "冰箱在运转，正好可以用来冷却 Sekimeiya。我把两个都放进去，然后从另一条裤子的口袋里取出钱。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064139_1_ca1dd778:
    # "I took the Future Sekimeiya back out and waited a few seconds. Subsequently, I left the money on the floor and felt the surface of the gemstone."
    "我把 未来Sekimeiya 重新取出来，等了几秒，随后把钱放在地板上，伸手触碰宝石表面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064141_1_3aaff603:
    # "My sight hardly changed, but I knew I'd teleported. I was holding the stack of money, and the original bills were on the floor. I could use them while I kept the duplicated ones until January 5th."
    "视野几乎没有变化，但我知道自己已经传送了。我手里握着一叠钱，原先的那几张仍留在地板上。我可以先花掉原钞，把复制出来的钱留到 1 月 5 日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064142_1_f0fbfa9e:
    # "I have to duplicate a night's worth too since I already paid for it."
    "那一晚的房钱我已经付了，也得照样复制一份出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064147_1_790394f7:
    # "The Future Sekimeiya was still powered off. I reset it to repeat the process, and once I'd duplicated the full amount of money, I left both Sekimeiya in the refrigerator again."
    "未来Sekimeiya 仍处于关闭状态。我重置了它，重复同样的步骤，等整笔钱都复制好，又把两个 Sekimeiya 一起放回冰箱。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064152_1_8991f5e7:
    # "I fell to the bed. I didn't bother taking off my clothes the second time since they were a lot lighter than before."
    "我扑倒在床上。第二次我懒得脱衣服了，毕竟身上这身比之前轻多了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064160_1_0ef05980:
    # "Before I knew it, I could see the sun through the window."
    "不知不觉间，阳光已经照进窗来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064161_1_af708a9c:
    # "I looked at the clock, trying to remember where I was.{w} {time=10:09}, November 25th. It all came back to me when I saw those blurry numbers."
    "我看向时钟，努力回想自己身在何处。{w} {time=10:09}，11 月 25 日。看清那串模糊的数字，一切才重新涌回脑海。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064162_1_9e62a578:
    # "I quickly got out of bed and checked the Sekimeiya in the refrigerator."
    "我连忙下床，去查看冰箱里的 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064166_1_e10599ea:
    # "It doesn't seem like the Sekimeiya heat up inside, so they're fine here."
    "Sekimeiya 放在里面好像不会发热，搁在这儿没问题。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064167_1_efbdb898:
    # "November 25th. On this day... I hadn't even received Miiya's call yet. Right now, I was at home all alone."
    "11 月 25 日。这一天……我连 Miiya 的电话都还没接到。这个时候，我还一个人待在家里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064171_1_217a3eda:
    # "I felt a little dizzy, so I put on my original clothes and walked out of the room to a cafeteria I'd seen downstairs."
    "我有些头晕，便换上原来的衣服，走出房间，去了之前在楼下看到的那间餐厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064172_1_d568e2d0:
    # "Fortunately, I had enough money to cover all the days I needed.{w} Once I felt rested, I went back up."
    "幸好身上的钱足够付清这些天的房费。{w}歇够了，我才回到楼上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064177_1_c02e2b05:
    # "I sat on the bed and went over what I would do."
    "我坐在床上，把接下来要做的事在脑中过了一遍。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064178_1_063d02dc:
    # "...I'm in the past of the world where Miiya was alive. If I don't change the past, will she not die? ...Or was she in the tower for another reason?"
    "……我回到了 Miiya 还活着的那个世界的过去。如果我不去改变过去，她是不是就不会死？……还是说，她进塔另有原因？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064179_1_bc5992b6:
    # "I have the Sekimeiya, so maybe I should see what happens on the 30th and then go to the past. I can't risk the plan getting ruined due to a difference in the events that I'm not aware of."
    "我有 Sekimeiya，也许该先看看 30 号会发生什么，再回到过去。我不能冒险让计划因为某个我没察觉到的变故而泡汤。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064180_1_4d843212:
    # "If what happened on the 30th repeats, why would Miiya have been in the tower? ...Is there an explanation for that?"
    "如果 30 号的事会重演，那 Miiya 当初为什么会进塔？……这一点有解释吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064181_1_019f75a3:
    # "The concept of different worlds I have is rough, but I was thinking of something..."
    "我对不同世界的理解还很粗浅，不过我在想一件事……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064182_1_7717d9d2:
    # "If I save Miiya, my plan was to go back to my initial world. I can't stay in this one. That would allow this world to exist, at the very least..."
    "我的计划是救下 Miiya 之后，回到最初的世界。我不能留在这个世界里。至少这样，这个世界还能继续存在……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064183_1_ee96f923:
    # "But after saving her, I could travel to the other world with Miiya, which would result in the same effect. The other world would end up with her, while this one wouldn't."
    "但救下她之后，我也可以带着 Miiya 一起前往另一个世界，效果并无不同。那样一来，另一个世界会有她，这个世界则没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064184_1_10959f7e:
    # "I couldn't bring myself to do that. ...I had already accepted Miiya's death once.{w} Even if I was able to bring her to our world, would that truly be better? I would just create avoidable pain in another."
    "可我做不到。……Miiya 的死，我已经接受过一次。{w} 就算我能把她带回我们的世界，那真的更好吗？我不过是在另一个世界里制造本可避免的痛苦罢了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064187_1_e789b90a:
    # "But I believe it's possible the Miiya in the tower came from a different world—from one in which she didn't die. That would explain why she was there with no influence of mine."
    "但我认为，塔里的那个 Miiya 有可能来自另一个世界——一个她并没有死的世界。这样就能解释她为何会在那里，且与我的干预无关。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064188_1_9ccc8e56:
    # "Everything regarding other worlds was too hypothetical. I had to stick to what I'd planned."
    "其他世界的事，说到底都只是假想。我只能按原定计划行事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064189_1_ff1fbad9:
    # "...I'll make sure she doesn't die. I'll make this world into the one we wanted. In the end, I'll have to abandon it, but at least I'll know it exists."
    "……我会确保她不会死。我会让这个世界变成我们想要的样子。到最后，我不得不舍弃它，但至少我会知道，它存在过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064190_1_1d6136ca:
    # "After November 30th, I'll go back in time and prevent her death. After that, I'll change worlds, hopefully arriving in the one I was in."
    "11月30日之后，我会回到过去，阻止她的死亡。然后我会切换世界，希望能回到我原本所在的那个世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064191_1_2d709f2f:
    # "If that works, I won't want to change the past any further. My goal will be to find the real Shiroya, who I'm sure will be there at one point. Maybe when she disappeared with Naomi, or maybe when she was in the tower with different clothes. Once I make it there, we can leave together."
    "如果一切顺利，我就不再改动过去了。我的目标是找到真正的 Shiroya，她必定会在某个时刻出现。也许是她和 Naomi 一同消失的时候，也许是她穿着不同的衣服待在塔里的时候。只要到达那里，我们就能一起离开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064200_1_4a0d83a6:
    # "That will work."
    "这样能行。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064202_1_9bf19f76:
    # "That will not work."
    "这样行不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064208_1_0a7b56df:
    # "...It would work. Atsuki was sure of it."
    "……会成功的。Atsuki 对此深信不疑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064209_1_8ae10d1b:
    # "He had to dispel his doubts and be confident he would succeed. There were five days until the 30th, but there was nothing he could do until then."
    "他必须打消疑虑，坚信自己会成功。距离30日还有五天，可在那之前，他什么也做不了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064210_1_093c22e9:
    # "He didn't leave the motel. It had all the food he needed and a bedroom to sleep in."
    "他没有离开鹰旅馆。这里有足够的食物，也有能睡觉的房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064211_1_f703e3bd:
    # "While the final day approached, he made sure the Sekimeiya worked. He traveled a few minutes through time and confirmed that all he'd learned still applied."
    "随着最后一天临近，他试着穿越了几分钟，确认 Sekimeiya 仍能正常运作，也证实自己先前掌握的一切依然成立。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064221_1_5dabe85e:
    # "November 30th came. Atsuki was still in that room, although it would soon be his time to act."
    "11月30日到了。Atsuki 仍待在那间房里，不过很快就轮到他行动了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064222_1_3f996e41:
    # "He didn't take his eyes off the clock. At {time=21}, he could hardly breathe, remembering what had once happened."
    "他的视线一刻也没离开时钟。到了 {time=21}，回想起曾经发生过的事，他几乎无法呼吸。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064223_1_ac7586dd:
    # "...It must've already occurred by that point. Miiya was likely dead."
    "……到那个时刻，事情想必已经发生了。Miiya 多半已经死了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064224_1_9a2f047a:
    # "He hated that it had been allowed to repeat, but otherwise his plan could've been hindered. Even though the time had passed, he couldn't go to the shop for fear of being recognized."
    "他痛恨那件事竟被允许重演，可若不如此，他的计划或许就会受阻。时间虽然已经过去，他仍不敢去那家店，怕被人认出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064225_1_000d9b16:
    # "...He had to wait until the morning news to know if everything had repeated as he'd once experienced it."
    "……他只能等到早间新闻，才能知道一切是否如他经历过的那样重演了一遍。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064232_1_65bc9e33:
    # "He stared at the ceiling all night. The moment the sun rose, he went to the cafeteria and turned on the television."
    "他盯着天花板看了整夜。太阳一升起，他就去了餐厅，打开电视。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064233_1_b9b2c0f4:
    # "His eyes bored holes into the screen, waiting for the news to begin. Once it did, a mass of headlines were shown at once."
    "他死死盯着屏幕，等着新闻开始。新闻一开播，一大批标题便同时出现在屏幕上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064234_1_1b76a12b:
    # "...{w}He didn't see it. None of them had been about a gas explosion in Yushibana."
    "……{w}他没有看到。没有一条是关于丰花煤气爆炸的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064235_1_fe306132:
    # "It couldn't be. There was no way that wouldn't have made the local news."
    "不可能。那样的事，本地新闻不可能不报。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064236_1_eee5f25c:
    # "He kept changing the channel, but there was no mention of what should have happened the previous night."
    "他不停地换台，可昨晚本该发生的事，却没有半点消息。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064237_1_099fafa9:
    # "Had he made a mistake? When that thought occurred to him, he dashed out of the motel."
    "难道是自己哪里出了差错？这个念头一冒出来，他便冲出了鹰旅馆。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064242_1_5ef8e6b8:
    # "He ran toward the stone buildings as fast as the snow allowed him."
    "他朝着那些石头建筑跑去，雪地里能跑多快就跑多快。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064246_1_31e3a83a:
    # "When he reached the street, he was able to see it in the distance: there was light in Musashi Gemstones.{w} He didn't stop running. He burst through the door and gaped at the owner in disbelief."
    "跑到那条街上时，他远远就看见了：武藏宝石里亮着灯。{w} 他没有停下脚步，一把推开门，难以置信地瞪着店主。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064250_1_f6d3c5c4:
    # "Oh, you're back! What's with the rush?"
    "哦，你回来了！怎么这么急？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064257_1_73911042:
    # "Wh-What?"
    "什、什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064258_1_bd778c59:
    # "He looked at the far side of the shop. The floor was intact."
    "他望向店铺深处。地板完好无损。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064263_1_fefd5f33:
    # "D-Did anything happen yesterday?"
    "昨、昨天发生什么事了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064264_1_a6f5e890:
    # "Hm? What do you mean?"
    "嗯？你指什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064269_1_ef920858:
    # "N-No?"
    "没、没有？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064270_1_19ef77f6:
    # "I don't know what you mean. What are you talking about?"
    "我不明白你的意思。你在说什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064271_1_066480dd:
    # "After seeing the undamaged shelves, there was a question Atsuki had to ask."
    "看到那些毫发无损的货架后，Atsuki 不得不问一个问题。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064276_1_15e93143:
    # "What about th-the Sekimeiya?"
    "那、那 Sekimeiya 呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064277_1_ac31f2af:
    # "The Seki... How do you know about that name!? I was planning to use it in the future!"
    "Seki……你怎么会知道这个名字！？我可是打算以后再用的！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064282_1_343ae1ef:
    # "Atsuki bolted out of the shop, ignoring the owner's shouts. He ran to a nearby bus station, where he'd met Shiroya and Miiya on that final day."
    "Atsuki 不顾店主在身后叫喊，冲出了店铺。他跑向附近的公交站——最后那天，他就是在那里遇见 Shiroya 和 Miiya 的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064286_1_b24b694c:
    # "There was nothing there. Atsuki recalled having seen a flyer with the words \"The Sekimeiya\" stuck on the post."
    "那里什么都没有。Atsuki 记得，柱子上曾贴着一张写着「The Sekimeiya」的传单。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064287_1_cbd2cc77:
    # "Next, he ran to his own house."
    "接着，他跑向自己家。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064291_1_7dee04fc:
    # "Th-There's light in the windows... I'm not in the hospital."
    "窗、窗户里有灯光……我没有住院。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064292_1_84ebe44d:
    # "He couldn't believe it. The explosion hadn't happened."
    "他不敢相信。爆炸没有发生。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064293_1_60dcb318:
    # "Why? And what next? He had no idea what to do, so he stood paralyzed."
    "为什么？接下来又该怎么办？他完全不知道该做什么，只能僵立在原地。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064294_1_c0ed3b5f:
    # "However, that was what he'd wanted. He hadn't done anything, but the result had been the same."
    "可这正是他想要的结果。他什么都没做，结果却完全一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064298_1_d06e6250:
    # "Speechless, he waited in front of his house."
    "他无言地等在自己家门前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064300_1_11fdea6d:
    # "Light snow began to fall, but he kept watching his window. He could see a figure behind it, similar to his own."
    "细雪开始飘落，他的目光却始终不离那扇窗。窗后能看见一个人影，身形与他相仿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064301_1_faa5358c:
    # "He realized he'd been there for hours when his front door opened. ...It really was his own self, with an expression he'd personally long since abandoned."
    "直到家门打开，他才意识到自己已站在那里几个小时了。……出来的确实是他自己，脸上带着一种他早已不再流露的神情。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064306_1_69771a3c:
    # "He didn't hide, but it didn't seem like he'd been seen. He saw his own body walking ahead, so he followed him."
    "他没有躲，对方似乎也没有看见他。他眼看着自己的身体向前走去，便跟了上去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064312_1_756d35e1:
    # "Eventually, they reached Seeuta D'ella Park. Miiya and Shiroya were there, waving at him."
    "最终，他们来到了 Seeuta D'ella 公园。Miiya 和 Shiroya 就在那里，正朝他挥手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064313_1_11aed319:
    # "It was what he'd most wanted. Those days were continuing beyond November 30th."
    "那正是他最期盼的事。那些日子过了11月30日，仍在继续。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064314_1_dcef6ca2:
    # "But there was something more pressing within Atsuki's mind."
    "然而，Atsuki 心里还有更迫切的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064316_1_8314480a:
    # "It didn't make sense. It was a world... that didn't make sense."
    "这说不通。这个世界……根本说不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064317_1_6f957831:
    # "Ending: Impossible Perfection"
    "终幕：无法企及的完美"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064339_1_5e5724e4:
    # "Lucid Dream"
    "清醒梦"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064346_1_c7d389e7:
    # "Will this work...?"
    "这样真的能行吗……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064347_1_df6aaaa3:
    # "The most delicate part is altering the story of this world. When I changed the past, it was clear the result wasn't straightforward."
    "最棘手的地方，在于改写这个世界的来龙去脉。我上次改变过去时，结果显然没那么简单。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064348_1_651fee44:
    # "It almost created a mesh of realities. Some people kept their memo—"
    "那几乎把几个现实织成了一张网。有些人还保留着记忆——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064350_1_4a24d1c0:
    # "The sudden realization shattered all my thoughts."
    "那一瞬间的醒悟，将我所有的思绪击得粉碎。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064351_1_857cbff6:
    # "No... What am I thinking?{w} ...I didn't change the past at all."
    "不……我在胡思乱想什么？{w}……我根本没有改变过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064352_1_c57bd5e1:
    # "I decided I'd try to change the past after I suffered that strange injury in the elevator... I used the Sekimeiya to travel more than half an hour to the past."
    "我是在电梯里受了那道奇怪的伤之后，才决定试着改变过去的……我用 Sekimeiya 回到了半个多小时前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064358_1_3039e0cd:
    # "\"I began to walk toward the event room to check the time, but voices stopped me.\""
    "我动身往活动室走去，想确认时间，却被说话声拦住了脚步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064359_1_4cb6d786:
    # "\"I got close to the door and focused my hearing.\""
    "我凑近门边，凝神细听。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064360_1_560e7bf4:
    # "...just suddenly ran aw— ...honestly wasn't sure."
    "……突然就跑掉了——……说实话，我也说不上来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064361_1_b4724d6d:
    # "\"I recognized the conversation. I'd arrived approximately a couple minutes before the point only Sai had traveled.\""
    "我听出了这段对话。我到达的时间，比 Sai 穿越到的时间点大约早两三分钟——当时只有他穿越过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064366_1_517444e3:
    # "It was a couple minutes before Sai disappeared in front of us us. That is to say, a couple minutes before we changed worlds."
    "那是在 Sai 从我们眼前消失前的两三分钟。也就是说，是在我们切换世界前的两三分钟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064375_1_273eadb4:
    # "To change the past, I produced a sound in hallway A. ...A sound we never heard."
    "为了改变过去，我在 A走廊弄出了一声响。……一个我们从未听过的声响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064376_1_0a4dfa82:
    # "When I slammed the door, I thought I'd changed the past because we hadn't heard that sound in the event room. But... the reason we didn't hear it was because we'd gone to a different world."
    "我摔上门时，以为过去已经被我改写——因为我们在活动室里没听到那声响。可是……我们没听到，原因是我们去了另一个世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064381_1_c5f70833:
    # "And in that world, I ended up taking the elevator up to follow Shiroya.{w} That had to be when we came back. For some reason, we went back to our world.{w} That's what that injury signified—the elevator stopped abruptly because it wasn't moving in our world, and I cut myself with the handrail as my body overlapped with it."
    "而在那个世界里，我为了追 Shiroya，坐上了电梯。{w}我们一定就是在那时回来的。不知为何，我们回到了自己的世界。{w}那道伤就是这个意思——电梯在我们这个世界里本就没有运行，所以骤然停住；我的身体和扶手重叠在一起，手被割伤了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064387_1_271db5af:
    # "\"It couldn't have been going too fast, but as it ceased all movement, it propelled us upward, and we slammed to the floor.\""
    "电梯本来开得不算快，可就在它彻底停下的一瞬间，却把我们向上抛起，随后又重重摔在地板上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064388_1_ab429353:
    # "\"...!\""
    "……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064389_1_af4b1b98:
    # "\"I felt my right hand burning. I looked at it and saw a cut.\""
    "右手火辣辣地疼。我低头一看，只见一道伤口。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064390_1_8d897764:
    # "What!? You're bleeding!"
    "什么！？你在流血！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064391_1_d39f5d59:
    # "\"I could only process the intense pain coming from the wound. While I couldn't comprehend how it had happened, I understood that I had cut my hand with the handrail when our bodies lifted, as it had been right above me.\""
    "我脑中只剩伤口传来的剧痛。怎么弄的，我一时想不明白，但我知道，那是身体被抛起时，手被正上方的扶手割伤的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064399_1_189206cb:
    # "And that was the exact world we'd been in before: the Past Sekimeiya was back in the staff room, where I'd hidden it. It didn't teleport back there.{w} Akaro was gone, and Sai was once again the person we'd been with in the event room. Also, the blood I would leave on the staircase was surely already there."
    "而那正是我们先前待过的世界：过去Sekimeiya回到了员工室，就在我藏它的地方。它不是被传送回去的。{w}Akaro不见了，活动室里和我们在一起的又变回了Sai。还有，我之后会留在楼梯上的血迹，那时想必已经在那里了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064403_1_6ee35f9f:
    # "\"The doors opened, so I dashed out of the elevator as fast as I could, forcing my eyes shut to suppress the pain.\""
    "门一开，我便拼命冲出电梯，紧闭双眼强忍疼痛。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064408_1_1cf37c14:
    # "...{w}So, when I went back in time and produced that \"new\" sound... I didn't actually change anything. When I slammed the door, the event room was already empty.{w} And then, despite the difference I would've caused, Erina and I still got out of the elevator on the third floor."
    "……{w}也就是说，我穿越回过去，弄出那声「新」的响动……其实什么都没改变。我摔门的时候，活动室已经空了。{w}而后来，尽管我本该改变些什么，Erina和我还是在三楼走出了电梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064409_1_591c1a5d:
    # "I thought I had created an incomprehensible mess of memories, but now I understand. It seemed like only Sai remembered the effect of my change because he was the only person there when I slammed the door. ...For him, the blood in the hallways was always there, whereas for Erina and me, it wasn't before we took the elevator."
    "我原以为，自己把记忆搅成了一团无法理解的乱麻，现在总算明白了。似乎只有Sai记得我那番改动的影响——因为我摔门时，在场的人只有他。……对他来说，走廊里的血迹从一开始就在；可我和Erina上电梯之前，那里并没有血。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064416_1_197c221e:
    # "\"I looked next to us, and as I thought, the other trail of blood was coming from the elevator. It was from the time I'd gone down after suffering the injury; the floor was proof of both realities at once.\""
    "我看向身旁，果然，另一道血迹是从电梯那边延伸出来的。那是我受伤后下楼时留下的；这片地板同时印证了两个现实。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064424_1_d0809e1c:
    # "What the hell? This means that I still have no idea if the past can be changed!"
    "搞什么？这么说，过去究竟能不能改变，我还是毫无头绪！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064425_1_e3a7b001:
    # "No... there's no way, is there? All that must mean is that it's not possible. It wasn't changed a single time. When I produced the Sekimeiya's travel formula, I made use of hypothetical worlds all different from each other, but the real one never changed..."
    "不……不可能吧？这一切只能说明，过去改不了。一次都没改变过。我在生成Sekimeiya的穿越公式时，用的都是彼此不同的假想世界，而真正的世界从未改变过……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064426_1_b3b9c953:
    # "I was out of my mind when I tried it with the storeroom door. I could travel to the past and close a door I've seen open, but if the past can't be changed, the explanation for that could be that I'd die of a sudden heart attack or something like that!"
    "我真是疯了，才会拿储藏室的门做试验。我可以穿越回过去，关上一扇我见过开着的门；可如果过去无法改变，那解释就只可能是——我会猝死于心脏病之类的原因！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064427_1_ee2baf28:
    # "There's no other way to know but to try it, though. ...And doing so is incredibly risky."
    "可除此之外，没有别的办法能确认。……而这么做，风险大得惊人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064428_1_b9e7ad70:
    # "Now what!? Technically, I could never die after traveling to the past, or else there'd be no future location to replicate.{w} Would I die by touching the Sekimeiya, then? There's no way to verify any of this...!"
    "那又该怎么办！？严格说来，穿越回过去之后，我根本不可能死，否则就没有未来的位置可供复制了。{w}那么，我会因为触碰Sekimeiya而死吗？这些根本无从验证……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064429_1_1f5e8646:
    # "I was suddenly stuck, with no way to know whether what I wanted to accomplish was achievable. At the very least, my past travels seemed to confirm that I'd be alive on January 5th and January 26th."
    "我一下子卡住了——我想做的事究竟能不能成，我无从得知。至少，我以往的那些穿越似乎证明，我在1月5日和1月26日都还活着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064433_1_9acdec08:
    # "Is there a way to increase or decrease the chance that it's possible to change the past? Outright confirming it seems like it's off the table."
    "有没有办法提高或降低改变过去的可能性？直接去证实，看来是行不通了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064434_1_effa0b34:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064438_1_c66f6f53:
    # "I went to the kitchen, where I had both Sekimeiya."
    "我去了厨房，两个Sekimeiya都收在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064439_1_7cdb83fe:
    # "I grabbed them and determined which one was the past one."
    "我拿起它们，分辨出哪一个来自过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064440_1_5d614cdf:
    # "...What can I really do to check this?"
    "……到底该怎么做，才能验证这一点？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064442_1_f90afe0b:
    # "There was a salt shaker next to the stove."
    "炉灶旁边有一个盐瓶。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064443_1_d53d9ab5:
    # "...I think this is all I can do."
    "……看来只能这样了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064444_1_b60a9170:
    # "I left it on the floor of the bedroom. Then, I stepped back to the kitchen and closed the door."
    "我把它放在卧室地板上，随后退回厨房，关上了门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064448_1_386f980a:
    # "I waited a few minutes, thinking about what I would do. Once I was certain, I took out the Past Sekimeiya and looked at the bedroom."
    "我等了几分钟，盘算着接下来该怎么做。拿定主意后，我取出过去Sekimeiya，望向卧室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064451_1_73cf397b:
    # "The salt shaker was no longer on the floor. It was on the rightmost nightstand, next to a bunch of salt scattered around."
    "盐瓶已经不在地板上了。它现在在最右侧的床头柜上，旁边散落着不少盐。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064453_1_2de081d1:
    # "I looked at it intensely; I'd known it was going to be there."
    "我紧紧盯着它。我早就知道它会在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064457_1_88e69d4b:
    # "Then, I waited a bit before I touched the Sekimeiya in the kitchen. When I did, I went a few minutes back in time."
    "接着，我稍等片刻，才去碰厨房里的Sekimeiya。一碰之下，我回到了几分钟之前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064463_1_c95f9d8d:
    # "Huh?"
    "咦？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064464_1_a57171e4:
    # "I appeared in the bathroom.{w} Silently, I glanced at the bedroom."
    "我出现在浴室里。{w}我默默朝卧室瞥了一眼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064467_1_46ba013f:
    # "The salt shaker was on the floor, next to the closed door. I picked it up and slowly brought it to the nightstand."
    "盐瓶在地板上，就在关着的门边。我把它捡起来，慢慢放到床头柜上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064469_1_f709037d:
    # "...There was no salt on it. Its wooden surface was perfectly clean."
    "……上面没有盐。木质表面干干净净。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064471_1_abadfe93:
    # "So far, I've experienced both what occurs when you travel to the past with no intentions to change it and when you travel to the past with intentions to specifically not change it. What I don't know is what happens when you travel to the past wanting to change it—when all your actions have that intent."
    "到目前为止，我经历过两种回到过去的情况：一种是无意改变过去，另一种是刻意不让过去改变。我不知道的是，若怀着改变的念头回去——若每个举动都带着这个意图——又会发生什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064472_1_8bde4ca0:
    # "...This might be a safe way to finally know."
    "……也许，这样就能安全地弄清楚了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064473_1_df11ce4d:
    # "I gripped the salt shaker and held it over the nightstand."
    "我握住盐瓶，把它举到床头柜上方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064474_1_d13cbd65:
    # "If I shake my hand, a bunch of salt will fall out. I've already seen a pattern of the scattered salt. However, my intention is not to repeat it. I want the past to change—I wish for that pattern to differ."
    "只要我一抖手，盐就会撒落一片。那散开的形状我已经见过。但我并不想重演它。我希望过去发生改变——希望那形状与我所见的不同。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064478_1_4b02ec8f:
    # "Abruptly, I shook my hand, releasing countless bits of salt."
    "我猛地一抖手，无数盐粒撒落下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064479_1_5eac60eb:
    # "What would happen was not my call. I wanted the past to change, so if that was possible, I hoped the pattern would be different. If it wasn't possible, although I wouldn't do it on purpose, the pattern would be the same one I'd seen. The decision of whether the past would change was not mine; the universe would let me know instead. When my hand stopped still, I stared down."
    "结果如何，不由我决定。我希望过去改变，所以若真能改变，我盼着那形状会有所不同。若改变不了，那形状便会与我见过的一模一样——当然，我并非有意要它如此。过去变不变，不是我所能决定的，宇宙自会给我答案。手停下后，我低头望去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064482_1_ed26da48:
    # "...It was identical. Every last bit of salt had ended up exactly where I'd seen it despite my wishes to change history."
    "……分毫不差。尽管我盼着改写历史，每一粒盐却都落在我见过的位置上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064483_1_5d43cee2:
    # "I... see."
    "……原来如此。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064484_1_b332dd41:
    # "I could blow on it; I could make it change. However, that's impossible. Anyone who would blow on it wouldn't have made it here in the first place."
    "我可以吹一口气，让它变样。可那不可能。会想到去吹散它的人，根本不会走到这一步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064485_1_7bcce010:
    # "With my head down, I walked back to the bathroom."
    "我垂着头，走回浴室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064490_1_b5fc0821:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064491_1_e2905b81:
    # "Soon, my past self came out of the kitchen. He saw the salt pattern and went back in time."
    "不一会儿，过去的我从厨房走了出来。他看见那摊盐的形状，便穿越回了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064493_1_cb88755c:
    # "...It's funny. I thought I would appear in the bedroom instead, but I appeared in the bathroom."
    "……真有意思。我原以为自己会出现在卧室，结果却出现在浴室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064494_1_61685f12:
    # "...Because I had no urge to leave. I had no idea what to do after that."
    "……因为我当时不想离开。那之后该做什么，我毫无头绪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064512_1_26d46b5f:
    # "Eventually, I had to go eat something. When I got back, I sat on the bed, unable to clear my mind."
    "最后，我还是得去吃点东西。回来后，我坐在床上，脑子里乱成一团。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064516_1_dd9f7338:
    # "...And when I went to sleep, I was just as lost. The past couldn't be changed, so there was no point to anything."
    "……入睡时，我依旧茫然。过去无法改变，那么一切都没有意义。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064526_1_27680a38:
    # "I got up wearing the same clothes. With a persistent feeling of impotence, I went down to the cafeteria."
    "我穿着同一身衣服起身。那股无力感挥之不去，我下楼去了食堂。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064533_1_58617be7:
    # "After everything I'd been through, saving Miiya was still impossible. However, I had seen her in the tower. That was the wild card, and it was what confused me the most."
    "经历了这一切，我依旧救不了 Miiya。可是，我在塔里见过她。那是唯一的变数，也是最令我困惑的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064534_1_ff44f183:
    # "Had she really come from another world? ...Had her existence been another mere illusion? I did all I could to refuse that."
    "她真的来自另一个世界吗？……还是说她的存在也不过是又一场幻觉？我拼命不愿接受这一点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064535_1_b2104a8a:
    # "If there was something I was sure of, it was that it wasn't up to me. It was evident the universe itself was what decided the outcome of everything."
    "若说有哪一点是我确定的，那便是这一切不由我做主。万事的结果皆由宇宙本身裁定，这一点再清楚不过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064536_1_3dcda35d:
    # "A large part of my plan had been ripped to shreds, but the last bit was still in my mind. I could reunite with Shiroya. We could go back to our world and leave together."
    "我的计划大半已被撕得粉碎，可最后一步仍留在我心里。我能与 Shiroya 重逢。我们可以回到自己的世界，一起离开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064537_1_1c06496a:
    # "For that, I could change worlds at that very moment, but I knew everything would repeat. So in the world I was in, on December 15th, Miiya would be in the tower. ...I had to see that with my very own eyes."
    "为此，我此刻就能切换世界，但我知道一切都会重演。所以，在我所处的这个世界，12月15日那天，Miiya 会出现在塔里。……我必须亲眼确认。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064548_1_f31f97f3:
    # "{time=12:43.} November 28th..."
    "{time=12:43.}11月28日……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064549_1_b690345e:
    # "I hadn't left the motel once. I mustered the will to get up and lethargically exited the room."
    "我一次也没离开过旅馆。好不容易提起劲起身，我拖着沉重的步子出了房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064552_1_fa26eb7c:
    # "It'll happen in two days. Am I really not going to do anything just because I've convinced myself that there's no point?"
    "再过两天就要发生了。难道只因为我说服自己这一切没有意义，就真的什么都不做？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064553_1_640a8cf7:
    # "It wasn't just that. I knew there was no point, and I didn't want to live through it again."
    "不只是这样。我知道那没有意义，也不想再经历一遍。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064557_1_5ae6f43d:
    # "When I came back up, all I could do was fall on the bed again."
    "回到楼上，我只能再一次倒回床上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064558_1_172701a8:
    # "I shouldn't change worlds now. I have to wait here..."
    "现在不能切换世界。我得在这里等……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064559_1_d392fb61:
    # "But there are many days left until the 15th. It's November 28th, so the Sekimeiya were found just yesterda—"
    "可离15日还有好几天。今天是11月28日，那么 Sekimeiya 是昨天才被发现——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064561_1_73ba78b8:
    # "Wait.{w} This is wrong...{w} That can't be the case...!"
    "等等。{w}不对……{w}不可能是这样……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064565_1_87ea4e50:
    # "I ran to the kitchen, but I stopped myself before I opened the refrigerator."
    "我冲向厨房，却在打开冰箱前停住了手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064566_1_f9fb4156:
    # "No, I shouldn't open it. I have to think this through first."
    "不，不能打开。我得先把这件事想清楚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064567_1_97c0d035:
    # "I entirely failed to consider this! Katei told us the Sekimeiya were found on November 27th..."
    "我竟然完全没想到这一点！Katei 说过，Sekimeiya 是在11月27日被发现的……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064568_1_4e203a7c:
    # "That's impossible, though! I have them right here!"
    "可这不可能！它们明明就在我手上！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064569_1_526c17e6:
    # "In the attic, when I made a Sekimeiya travel with me, I couldn't duplicate it—the original one disappeared as soon as I appeared. Only one version of each can exist!"
    "在阁楼时，我带着 Sekimeiya 一起穿越，却无法复制它——我一现身，原本那个就消失了。每个 Sekimeiya 都只能存在一个版本！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064570_1_6d6dbe45:
    # "So, when I appeared with them on the 24th, the ones on the mountain must've disappeared. It's already the 28th, and there's no way they were found yesterday!"
    "所以，24日我带着它们现身时，山上的那些一定已经消失了。现在都28日了，它们绝不可能昨天才被发现！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064574_1_82855e30:
    # "I stared at the shut door. The Sekimeiya had to be inside, but the past couldn't be changed. I couldn't witness its interior before thinking, as I hadn't actually seen the Sekimeiya since three days prior."
    "我盯着紧闭的冰箱门。Sekimeiya 一定在里面，可过去无法改变。在理清头绪之前，我不能去看里面的情形——毕竟我已经三天没见过 Sekimeiya 了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064575_1_0f319ffb:
    # "If I opened the door and either saw them there or didn't see them there, it would be a fact locked in place. Not knowing for sure whether they were there or not was far smarter."
    "一旦打开门，无论看见它们在还是不在，都会成为既定的事实。不确认它们到底在不在，反而更明智。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064576_1_9e93d7f9:
    # "It doesn't make any sense. I know the incident will occur on the 15th, so the Sekimeiya had to have been found."
    "这说不通。我知道事件会在15日发生，所以 Sekimeiya 肯定已经被找到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064577_1_f4b36b4c:
    # "The event was announced tomorrow, on the 29th. That can't happen if the Sekimeiya aren't found on the 27th."
    "活动会在明天公布，也就是29日。如果 Sekimeiya 没在27日被发现，那件事就不可能发生。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064578_1_dc25318c:
    # "However, it would happen. It had to, or else everything would've been entirely different on the 15th."
    "可是它确实发生了。它非发生不可，否则15日的一切就会截然不同。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064579_1_0319a1ca:
    # "The tower had to be shut on the 15th, and I had to be there. ...That was how I could find Miiya and the real Shiroya."
    "15日那天，塔一定会封闭，我也一定会在场。……只有这样，我才能找到 Miiya 和真正的 Shiroya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064580_1_2404dfa3:
    # "But I had the Sekimeiya. If that had removed the ones on the mountain, the butterfly effect would surely be immense.{w} That was why I had to consider a certain question and why I hadn't opened the refrigerator. ...Was there a way for the Sekimeiya to have been found the day before?"
    "但我手里有 Sekimeiya。如果这会让山上的那些消失，蝴蝶效应必然巨大。{w}正因如此，我才必须先想清楚一个问题，才没有打开冰箱。……有没有可能，Sekimeiya 确实在前一天就被发现了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064584_1_bdb35201:
    # "...Is there any chance? If they were found, they can't be here anymore. Similarly, if they're here, they couldn't have been found.{w} Is it impossible...? That can't be..."
    "……有这种可能吗？若它们被发现了，就不可能还在这里。同样，若它们还在这里，就不可能被发现过。{w}难道真的不可能……？不会的……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064585_1_6de57973:
    # "There was one important fact: I knew where the Sekimeiya had been found. Katei had described an area that matched with a place I knew very well."
    "有一个关键事实：我知道 Sekimeiya 是在哪里被发现的。Katei 描述的那片区域，和我非常熟悉的一个地方对得上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064586_1_7dc02db5:
    # "If they're here right now... I could travel to the past and appear with them again as long as I know I'll have them in the future. Then, I could leave them on the mountain before the 27th."
    "如果它们此刻就在这里……只要我确定未来能拿到它们，我就能再次带着它们回到过去。这样，我就能在27日之前把它们留在山上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064587_1_78e4b0dd:
    # "That doesn't work, though! The past would be changing. If I ever appear with them in the past, the ones in here would disappear, and I wouldn't be able to travel in the first place."
    "可这样行不通！那等于改变过去。只要我带着它们在过去现身，这里的这些就会消失，那我从一开始就无法穿越了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064588_1_683ddf10:
    # "It's... not possible. They couldn't have been found yesterday!{w} But the past can't change, can it? Does that mean they're not in the refrigerator anymore? If I never open it, should I assume that they made it to the mountain somehow?"
    "这……不可能。它们不可能昨天就被发现了！{w}可过去是无法改变的，不是吗？那是不是说，它们已经不在冰箱里了？如果我永远不打开，是不是就该认为，它们以某种方式到了山上？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064589_1_07dd2d77:
    # "What if... someone traveled to the past after I did, holding the Sekimeiya? That's a way they could've disappeared from here."
    "如果……有人在我之后带着 Sekimeiya 穿越回了过去呢？那样它们确实可能从这里消失。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064590_1_7a990c12:
    # "Was something like that what I had to assume? How the hell had the Sekimeiya even ended up on that mountain...? And why had they even gotten to Ashiya Tower given their powers?"
    "难道我只能做这样的假设？Sekimeiya 究竟是怎么跑到那座山上去的……？凭它们的力量，又怎么会出现在芦屋塔里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064594_1_861d9891:
    # "I recalled precisely what Katei had told us."
    "我清楚记得 Katei 对我们说过的话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064598_1_62456a39:
    # "Eventually, up that mountain is a small field that's pretty well-hidden. It's not easy to spot, and you have to deviate onto a smaller path. All I was told was that it's fairly tucked away."
    "沿那座山往上走，最后会到一小片相当隐蔽的平地。那地方不容易发现，得拐上一条更窄的小路。我只听说那里藏得很深。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064605_1_3b1660cb:
    # "That's where this was found."
    "这东西就是在那儿被发现的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064613_1_64bcb342:
    # "What he pointed at was the third Sekimeiya. The one that didn't work..."
    "他指的是第三个 Sekimeiya。也就是那个没能起作用的……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064614_1_74d8cb65:
    # "Where the hell did that one come from? There were three Sekimeiya since that morning."
    "那一个到底是从哪儿冒出来的？那天早上就已经有三个 Sekimeiya 了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064615_1_2469b817:
    # "What really happened on the 27th? Were those three Sekimeiya found? And was that really the same place Shiroya and I used to go to?"
    "27 日到底发生了什么？那三个 Sekimeiya 真的被找到了吗？还有，那真的是我和 Shiroya 以前常去的地方吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064616_1_a430b35d:
    # "...It can't be that only the third Sekimeiya was found. When Katei told us that story, he was definitely talking about all the Sekimeiya; they were all found by the same person. However, Katei never mentioned any other Sekimeiya existing that entire day. ...And I'm sure that he and Naomi knew about it."
    "……不可能只找到了第三个 Sekimeiya。Katei 跟我们讲那段话时，说的肯定是所有 Sekimeiya；它们都是被同一个人找到的。可是，那一整天 Katei 都没提过还有别的 Sekimeiya 存在。……而且我敢肯定，他和 Naomi 都知道这件事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064617_1_054ab0ca:
    # "So, technically, I might have a way to make Katei's words into reality—that a Sekimeiya was found on the 27th. I only have to assume that he avoided saying when the others were."
    "所以，严格来说，我也许有办法让 Katei 的话成真——确实有一个 Sekimeiya 是在 27 日被找到的。只要假设他刻意没说另外几个是什么时候被发现的就行。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064618_1_11731157:
    # "If the first one was found on the 27th, this makes sense."
    "如果第一个是在 27 日找到的，那就说得通了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064619_1_e2a48162:
    # "There was another assumption I had to make: that I was no longer in possession of the Future Sekimeiya."
    "我还得作出另一个假设：未来Sekimeiya 已经不在我手里了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064621_1_0c9a6573:
    # "Finally, when the loop I had to make was in my head, I was ready to open the door."
    "最后，等我把必须完成的因果循环在脑中理清，便准备开门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064628_1_acc9ca7c:
    # "...A single Sekimeiya was there."
    "……里面只有一个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064630_1_64ba2751:
    # "It's the Past Sekimeiya. This is all I can do to fix my mistake."
    "是过去Sekimeiya。为了弥补我的过错，我只能做到这一步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064631_1_dc79ce8a:
    # "I took it out as I glanced at the clock."
    "我一边把它取出来，一边瞥了眼时钟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064634_1_1903e4da:
    # "I could still go to the past. I could make it back to the 27th."
    "我还能回到过去。还能回到 27 日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064635_1_ea3a0c1d:
    # "Once there, I had to take the Future Sekimeiya out of the refrigerator and bring it to the mountain so that it'd be found on that day."
    "到了那里，我得从冰箱里取出未来Sekimeiya，带到山上，让它在那天被人发现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064636_1_e89a1f96:
    # "Then, after the point I travel, the Past Sekimeiya will have to be left there too. It'll be found after the 27th, but that doesn't contradict anything that we were told."
    "然后，在我穿越到的时间点之后，我也得把过去Sekimeiya留在那里。它会在 27 日以后被发现，这跟我们听过的说法并不矛盾。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064639_1_402abbbc:
    # "The temperature in the motel wasn't the same as the tower's, so the amount of time I had to store was different."
    "旅馆里的温度和塔里不一样，所以我需要蓄能的时间也不同。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064640_1_b7170557:
    # "Fortunately, the formula was the same, so after I noted down how far I traveled after storing two minutes, I knew how long I had to wait to make it a day back."
    "幸运的是，规律并没有变。我记下蓄能两分钟后能穿越多远，也就算出了要回到一天前需要等多久。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064641_1_49f285a7:
    # "It was a little over half an hour, but I couldn't touch it there due to the large range that would form."
    "需要等半个多小时，但在那里不能碰它，因为会形成很大的重叠范围。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064642_1_3ee21ea1:
    # "...I'm certain it still gathers energy outside if it's in the suitcase, because when I touched the Sekimeiya after arriving here, I traveled a lot farther into the future than expected."
    "……我敢肯定，就算把它装在箱子里，它仍会继续蓄能。因为我到这里后一碰 Sekimeiya，向未来穿越的距离就比预想远得多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064643_1_a370fc24:
    # "I put the Sekimeiya and the clock inside the suitcase before walking down the stairs with the motel keys."
    "我把 Sekimeiya 和时钟放进箱子，然后拿着旅馆钥匙下了楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064648_1_c7ec83e8:
    # "Below, I stepped out of the motel for the first time and walked toward one of the tallest mountains I could see past the buildings."
    "到了楼下，我第一次走出旅馆，朝我能越过建筑望见的最高的几座山峰之一走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064653_1_e00b23d7:
    # "I kept going until Airun's slope was before me, close to Ashiya Tower. Far in the past, there had been a path up the mountain, but I could no longer distinguish it."
    "我一直走到 Airun 的山坡前——那里离芦屋塔很近。很久以前，这座山上曾有一条小路，可如今我已经辨认不出了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064654_1_c989ece8:
    # "When I stepped up, my feet sank deep into the snow. The layer there was much thicker, and it showed clear signs of human presence."
    "我一脚踏上去，脚便深陷雪中。这里的积雪厚得多，还留有明显的人迹。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064657_1_1f18cb09:
    # "Soon, the trees began to cast many shadows around me, but I hadn't lost track of where I was. My legs continued moving autonomously until the sun was visible again."
    "很快，树木在身边投下重重阴影，我却仍清楚自己身在何处。双腿仿佛自有意识般继续向前，直到阳光重新出现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064663_1_8e489cc2:
    # "This place..."
    "这个地方……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064664_1_3eaef9b2:
    # "A vast field surrounded by trees. It had been quite a few years since I'd been there, as evidenced by the tall grass that had grown in."
    "一片被树林环抱的广阔空地。我已经有好几年没来过这里了，丛生的高草便是明证。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064665_1_88a5124e:
    # "This is where the Sekimeiya were found. I can't believe it.{w} How is that even possible? This was our special place..."
    "那几个 Sekimeiya 就是在这里被发现的。真不敢相信。{w}这怎么可能？这里明明是我们最特别的地方……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064666_1_af4f487f:
    # "I trudged along and arrived at a cabin tucked next to the treeline."
    "我深一脚浅一脚地走过去，来到一间紧挨着林边的小木屋。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064671_1_a0c9952f:
    # "Now this place hasn't changed much..."
    "这里倒是没怎么变……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064672_1_bc0db365:
    # "Who had been the last person to open that door? The inside looked exactly like the cabin in my memories. After taking a look around, I noticed something thrown away in a corner."
    "上一个打开这扇门的会是谁？屋里和我记忆中的木屋一模一样。环顾一圈后，我注意到角落里有个被丢弃的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064673_1_b9d28dc0:
    # "That's..."
    "那是……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064674_1_b02330da:
    # "It was a stuffed tiger, much smaller than I recalled. It didn't seem damaged, and it looked at me with the same smile as always. Sitting on the wood, it appeared to be waiting for Shiroya to come back and put him in the small pocket of her school bag, from where he would peek out at the vast mountain landscape."
    "那是一只老虎玩偶，比我记忆中小得多。它看起来没有破损，仍带着一如既往的笑容望着我。它坐在木头上，仿佛在等 Shiroya 回来，把它放进书包的小口袋里，好从那里探出头，眺望辽阔的山景。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064678_1_a946eb25:
    # "...I stepped back out, opened the suitcase, and looked at the clock. It was {time=14:03.}"
    "……我重新走到屋外，打开箱子，看了看时钟。时间是 {time=14:03.}"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064680_1_a1685e4e:
    # "After that, I tested how far I'd travel if I kept the Sekimeiya in the suitcase for two minutes."
    "之后，我测试了一下：把 Sekimeiya 在箱子里放两分钟，能穿越多远。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064686_1_a13ca184:
    # "I appeared inside the cabin, next to the door. When I looked outside, I saw myself in the middle of the field.{w} 35 seconds later, I disappeared."
    "我出现在木屋里，就在门边。朝外望去，我看见自己站在空地中央。{w}三十五秒后，那个我便消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064687_1_ec31d590:
    # "I see..."
    "原来如此……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064689_1_5e3a2e71:
    # "So I'll have to keep it in the suitcase for about forty minutes. I want to make it to yesterday morning."
    "看来得让它在箱子里待上四十分钟左右。我要回到昨天早上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064692_1_9467cf95:
    # "The Sekimeiya was on the grass, next to the suitcase and the clock. I put it inside at {time=14:05.}"
    "Sekimeiya 当时在草地上，旁边是箱子和时钟。我在 {time=14:05.} 把它放了进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064696_1_6ad68ac3:
    # "I had to leave the suitcase there. Surprisingly, the cabin made for a good shelter from the cold."
    "我不得不把箱子留在那里。没想到这间木屋还挺能御寒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064697_1_70665152:
    # "It had a bed and a hatch in the floor, leading to an empty basement. There was much less dust than I had imagined, but I busied myself wiping it off."
    "屋里有一张床，地板上还有个通往空地下室的活板门。灰尘比我预想的少得多，但我还是忙着把灰擦掉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064702_1_0a1a8ef1:
    # "I couldn't get over the fact that the Sekimeiya had been found there, but perhaps I was too full of myself for thinking that it could've been anything more than a coincidence."
    "Sekimeiya 竟然会在那种地方被人发现，这一点我始终难以释怀。不过，也许是我太把自己当回事，才会以为这不只是巧合。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064703_1_90c09fd8:
    # "I spent the last stretch sitting on a bed. I could see the suitcase through the window, and at {time=14:43}, I stood up."
    "最后那段时间，我一直坐在床上。透过窗户能看见那只箱子。到了 {time=14:43}，我站起身来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064704_1_63bd702a:
    # "I grabbed the clock and walked outside."
    "我抓起时钟，走了出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064707_1_94d54ac7:
    # "I'll have to touch it as soon as I open the suitcase."
    "一打开箱子，我就得立刻碰到它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064708_1_d45c6b1b:
    # "I locked my eyes on those numbers. As soon as {time=14:45} appeared, I opened it."
    "我死死盯着那些数字。{time=14:45} 一出现，我便打开了箱子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064710_1_1382b313:
    # "That time, when my right hand reached for the Sekimeiya, my left one gripped the suitcase's handle."
    "这一次，我右手伸向 Sekimeiya，左手同时握住了箱子的提手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064717_1_8310dc83:
    # "In an instant, the sun disappeared. I was in the motel, and seconds later, I noticed the faint noise surrounding me."
    "转眼间，太阳消失了。我回到了旅馆，几秒后，才注意到周围那阵微弱的声响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064719_1_36e9975d:
    # "It was my own self sleeping. When I glanced at the clock, I saw the red numbers I'd expected: {time=7:01.} November 27th."
    "睡在那里的正是我自己。我瞥了一眼时钟，红色数字正如我所料：{time=7:01.}11月27日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064720_1_bdfc854c:
    # "I felt the motel keys in my pocket, and my hands weren't empty. One was holding the suitcase, while the other had a replica of the clock. However, its screen was blank."
    "我摸了摸口袋里的旅馆钥匙，两只手也都没空着。一只手提着箱子，另一只手拿着那台时钟的复制品。只是它的屏幕一片空白。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064721_1_eb03464b:
    # "This again..."
    "又是这一幕……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064722_1_543061ee:
    # "I'd held them when I touched the Sekimeiya so that they wouldn't remain on the field. Only the Past Sekimeiya had been left there so that it was found later."
    "触碰 Sekimeiya 的时候，我把这些东西都握在手里，免得它们留在空地上。我只把过去Sekimeiya留在了那里，好让后来的人发现它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064726_1_693de1cb:
    # "I stepped to the kitchen without making noise. When I opened the refrigerator, I saw both Sekimeiya."
    "我悄无声息地走到厨房。打开冰箱时，两个 Sekimeiya 都在里面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064729_1_56005f56:
    # "I grabbed the one on the left—the Future Sekimeiya."
    "我拿起左边的那个——未来Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064730_1_9196468e:
    # "...I suppose I have to hurry. I didn't see the Future Sekimeiya in the field, which means that it'll be taken today."
    "……看来我得抓紧了。空地上没有未来Sekimeiya，也就是说，它今天就会被人取走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064731_1_a9ff70b9:
    # "I put it in the suitcase and walked out."
    "我把它放进箱子，走了出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064738_1_8c270b69:
    # "The sun was beginning to rise. I took the same route back to Airun."
    "太阳刚刚升起。我沿着原路返回艾伦山。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064740_1_f75b5c0e:
    # "I walked up, carving a path through the trees. Eventually, I stopped myself and looked back."
    "我一路往上，在树丛间开出一条路。走了一段后，我停下脚步，回头望去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064742_1_581dda06:
    # "...I'm leaving the traces of footprints I saw."
    "……我正在留下那些我见过的脚印。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064745_1_35936771:
    # "I kept going up until I arrived at the field, covered by the shadows cast by the tall trees. Before I got to the cabin, I took the Sekimeiya out and left it on the ground."
    "我继续向上，终于来到那片空地——高树的影子笼罩着它。还没走到小屋，我就取出 Sekimeiya，放在地上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064746_1_e7084fdc:
    # "I'm sure I would've seen it if it had still been here."
    "要是它还在那儿，我不可能没看见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064749_1_9ab8bc0b:
    # "Oh, it's a lot dustier in here...{w} I suppose that makes sense; I have to stay until I can return to the motel."
    "哦，这里的灰可真多……{w}也难怪，我得在这儿待到能回旅馆为止。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064750_1_bb0f6680:
    # "I had to spend a full night inside. I'd done it in the past, but a story from earlier in 2011 made me feel a little unnerved at the prospect..."
    "我得在这里面待上整整一夜。这样的事我以前也做过，可2011年早些时候听来的一个故事，让我一想到这一夜就心里发怵……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064751_1_ddf7662f:
    # "It'll be fine. It's not so cold that I'm going to freeze, and it's only one night."
    "不会有事的。还没冷到会把我冻坏，何况只有一晚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064755_1_d6706ffe:
    # "It was nothing new. I just had to wait there like I'd been doing in the motel."
    "这也没什么新鲜的。我只要像在旅馆里那样，在那里等着就行了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064756_1_ab35e987:
    # "Strangely, the cabin made it easy. The memories all came to me as I stared at the little tiger on the floor. I didn't want to take him with me—Shiroya and I would come back for the one in our world. After a while, I removed the dust from all the wooden furniture, doing my best not to breathe in."
    "奇怪的是，待在小屋里反而容易熬过去。我盯着地上那只小老虎，往事一件件涌上来。我不想把它带走——属于我们那个世界的那一只，我和 Shiroya 会回来取的。过了一会儿，我把所有木制家具上的灰都擦掉，尽量屏着呼吸。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064757_1_2a2c450c:
    # "The clock I had wasn't working, so I had to rely on the sun to know the time. Before it set, what I'd been expecting finally happened."
    "我手上那台钟不走了，只能靠太阳判断时间。太阳还没落山，我一直等着的事终于发生了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064758_1_fb7d4e03:
    # "Through the window, I saw an old man emerging from the trees. He slowly got closer, stunned by the place he'd discovered."
    "透过窗户，我看见一个老人从林中走出来。他慢慢靠近，显然被眼前这处地方惊住了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064759_1_e7c6cf13:
    # "When I saw his face, I recognized him. He was the owner of Musashi Gemstones."
    "看清他的脸时，我认出了他——武藏宝石的店主。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064760_1_fa489456:
    # "He stopped in the middle of the field. He crouched down, and I saw the Sekimeiya between his gloves."
    "他在空地中央停下，蹲下身去。我看见他戴着手套的双手之间夹着 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064761_1_e74284e8:
    # "...What the hell is going to happen with it? I know it'll be discovered that cold temperature is needed for it, but will it really be brought to Ashiya with no one having an understanding of its powers?"
    "……这东西之后到底会怎么样？我知道人们会发现它需要低温保存，可难道在没人理解它力量的情况下，它真的会被送到芦屋去吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064763_1_28125b46:
    # "Wait... is he coming in here?"
    "等等……他要进来？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064771_1_de6dc3c1:
    # "The door to the cabin opened. Keeping my mouth shut, I waited until it closed again."
    "小屋的门开了。我没有出声，一直等到门重新关上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064773_1_ced7e174:
    # "Once it did, I emerged from below. I could see the man walking away through the window."
    "门一关上，我便从下面钻了出来。透过窗户，能看见那老人正往远处走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064775_1_9d038b15:
    # "...That's it, then. Everything happened as intended. Of course, the past didn't change."
    "……这样就算结束了。一切都按计划发生了。当然，过去并没有改变。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064776_1_95f7b7b6:
    # "I sighed faintly before falling back on the bed."
    "我轻轻叹了口气，往后倒在床上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064777_1_6702fc84:
    # "...I'm getting really hungry, and I don't have water either."
    "……我饿得厉害，连水也没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064780_1_a5c5d5fa:
    # "At the very least, I became tired fairly quickly. Soon, light stopped coming through the window, disappearing along with my awareness."
    "至少我很快就困了。不久，窗外不再透进光亮，我的意识也随之沉了下去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064787_1_a821f3db:
    # "It was the third time I'd woken up on November 28th of 2011. I felt exhausted, and I had to walk all the way down the mountain path again."
    "这是我第三次在2011年11月28日醒来。我浑身疲惫，还得再沿着山路一路走下去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064788_1_c3855d8d:
    # "I should go as soon as possible, seeing as I still have some energy. ...I need to eat and use the bathroom too."
    "趁现在还有点力气，我该尽快动身。……我还得吃饭，还得去趟洗手间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064792_1_b5cd3bf2:
    # "Yawning, I put the clock in the suitcase and drowsily moved through the rows of trees. The sun was well past the mountains, so I'd slept for a long time.{w} I entered the streets of Yushibana and walked to Eagle Motel."
    "我打着哈欠把时钟放进箱子，昏昏沉沉地穿过一排排树。太阳早已越过山头，看来我睡了很久。{w}我走进丰花的街道，朝鹰旅馆走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064797_1_05ca46e8:
    # "I quickly looked at the time: it was {time=10:29.}"
    "我赶紧看了一眼时间：{time=10:29.}"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064798_1_f2933090:
    # "There's still a while until my past self comes to the cafeteria, so I can be there until then."
    "距离过去的自己来餐厅还有一段时间，在那之前我可以一直待在那儿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064801_1_9cb63788:
    # "It was an open buffet, so nobody would be surprised by my eating habits when I came back down. I took my time, only accepting that I was full once about an hour had passed."
    "这里是自助餐，等会儿我再下楼，也没人会对我吃的量感到奇怪。我慢慢吃，过了大约一个小时，才觉得自己吃饱了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064803_1_aabc284f:
    # "I waited, hidden from view, until my past self came down. Soon after I left, I reappeared from the stairs, holding the suitcase and wearing an uneasy expression."
    "我躲起来等着，直到过去的自己下楼来。过去的我离开后不久，又从楼梯上重新出现，提着行李箱，脸上带着不安的神色。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064804_1_22b4a1f2:
    # "Finally I could go back up. I unlocked the bedroom and staggered in."
    "我终于可以回楼上了。我打开卧室门锁，踉跄着走进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064809_1_b7cb5650:
    # "...I don't have the Sekimeiya anymore. Now I can only change worlds on December 15th."
    "……Sekimeiya 已经不在我手上了。现在，我只能等到12月15日才能切换世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064810_1_43a0bb20:
    # "I'd had them sitting in the refrigerator for so long without using them. It was undeniable that I could've obtained anything with them; Sai had once talked about winning the lottery with ease.{w} But I hadn't worried about that because of the single guarantee I possessed: on January 5th, I would have both Sekimeiya."
    "它们就那么一直放在冰箱里，这么久我都没用过。不可否认，有它们在，我什么都弄得到；Sai 还说过，用它们中彩票轻而易举。{w}可我并不为此担心，因为我握着一个绝对的保证：1月5日，两个 Sekimeiya 都会在我手上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064811_1_d535601b:
    # "I can't rest easy for today just yet. In the afternoon, I have to make sure to be in possession of the keys, clock, and suitcase. Otherwise, they would've disappeared when I touched the Sekimeiya on Airun."
    "今天还不能就此松懈。下午我必须确保钥匙、时钟和行李箱都在我手上。否则，我在艾伦山触碰 Sekimeiya 的时候，它们就会消失。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064820_1_b9160cd9:
    # "Two days passed. It was November 30th, a day that would never fade from my memory. The Sekimeiya event had been announced the previous day, so everything would happen in the same way."
    "两天过去了。到了11月30日——这一天，我永远不会忘记。Sekimeiya 的展出消息前一天就已公布，所以一切都会照原样发生。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064825_1_cd45d601:
    # "I didn't leave the room. By the time the evening came, I was stuck in a loop of reliving the explosion and its aftermath, shaking my head to drive those thoughts away, and having them return not long after."
    "我没有离开房间。到了傍晚，我陷进了循环：一遍遍重温那场爆炸和之后的一切，摇头把念头赶走，没多久它们又回来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064826_1_64a42788:
    # "...And there was nothing I could do to stop it. If I'd tried to, I would have failed miserably."
    "……而我无力阻止。就算真去试，也只会一败涂地。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064827_1_d548b103:
    # "I attempted to close my eyes, doubting I would ever fall asleep."
    "我试着闭上眼，却不觉得自己能睡着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064838_1_bc931c29:
    # "{time=7:11.} December 1st.{w} I'd gotten new batteries for the clock and confirmed it was accurate. I gingerly rubbed my eyes, grateful that I'd at least been able to sleep a little."
    "{time=7:11.}12月1日。{w}我给时钟换了新电池，确认它走得准。我轻轻揉了揉眼睛，庆幸自己至少还睡了一会儿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064839_1_6837dd22:
    # "When I fully regained my senses, I quickly got up and dashed out of the room."
    "等我彻底清醒过来，便立刻起身，冲出房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064842_1_a02d0183:
    # "...The news. I need to see what happened."
    "……新闻。我得看看发生了什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064843_1_a682f18e:
    # "I had a fact to work with—Miiya would exist on December 15th. Nervous at what I'd find, I intently watched the television."
    "我手上有一条可以依据的事实——12月15日，Miiya 还会存在。我忐忑不安，紧盯着电视。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064844_1_4a1b09b2:
    # "The news was just starting. Before I could think, I saw text scrolling horizontally."
    "新闻刚刚开始。我还没来得及细想，就看见一行字横向滚动过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064845_1_774971d3:
    # "\"Gas explosion in Yushibana\".{w} At a low volume, a reporter began to talk about it."
    "「丰花发生瓦斯爆炸。」{w} 记者压低了声音，开始播报这条新闻。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064848_1_e392e8f5:
    # "Last night, a gas explosion occurred at a gem shop in Yushibana. An unknown individual released smoke that knocked four people unconscious, and some time later, the explosion occurred due to a gas heater that had depleted its surrounding oxygen.{w} Given the size of the explosion, the flame had been out before the smoke's release. Since everyone present was unconscious, nobody was able to recognize the artificial smell of the gas, which had no way to leave the enclosed space. At {time=21}, when the lights were turned on, the presence of smoke and gas caused a dust explosion."
    "昨晚，丰花的一家宝石店发生瓦斯爆炸。一名不明身份者释放烟雾，导致四人昏迷；其后，一台耗尽了周围氧气的瓦斯暖炉引发了爆炸。{w} 从爆炸的规模来看，在烟雾释放之前，火焰便已熄灭。由于在场者全部昏迷，没人能察觉出瓦斯那股人工气味，而封闭的空间又让瓦斯无处散去。{time=21}，灯光亮起时，积聚的烟雾与瓦斯引发了粉尘爆炸。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064849_1_da76c921:
    # "The blast hit two young girls who'd fallen unconscious, nineteen and twenty years of age. One of them was taken to the hospital after falling through the broken floor, but her condition is stable, as she was shielded by a shelf. The body of the other girl has not yet been found, but the chances that she is alive are slim."
    "爆炸波及两名昏迷的年轻女孩，一个十九岁，一个二十岁。其中一人从炸裂的地板坠落，被送往医院，但因为有货架挡住，伤势稳定。另一人的遗体尚未找到，生还的可能十分渺茫。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064850_1_a82141dc:
    # "The other two people, a nineteen-year-old boy and the owner of the shop, were far enough from the heater that they avoided major damage.{w} The identity of the person who released the smoke is being investigated, as is their motive. Despite the outcome, it is unlikely that the explosion was intentional, and nothing has been reported as stolen."
    "另外两人——一名十九岁的少年和店主——离暖炉较远，避开了严重的伤害。{w} 释放烟雾者的身份与动机仍在调查。尽管结果如此，爆炸多半并非蓄意为之，也没有任何失窃的报告。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064854_1_b644cdf7:
    # "...{w}I see. This is before they found her jaw. I don't even know why I thought I could expect anything else."
    "……{w}原来如此。这是在她下颌骨被发现之前。我都不知道自己凭什么觉得会有别的结果。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064855_1_5fb56c66:
    # "After hearing everything again, my heart dropped into a black abyss. It almost felt like I'd been told the news for the first time again.{w} ...I really was powerless. The immense power I'd been able to wield meant nothing."
    "再次听完这一切，我的心沉入了漆黑的深渊。几乎又像是头一次听到这个消息。{w}……我果然无能为力。我曾能驾驭的那股庞大力量，此刻毫无意义。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064865_1_9abb0339:
    # "Over two weeks were left until the 15th. Miserable, I shut myself in the bedroom. Knowing what was coming wasn't enough—I wound up isolating myself from the world in the exact same way I had the first time."
    "距离十五日还有两周多。我郁郁寡欢，把自己关在卧室里。光知道将要发生什么并无用处——我最终还是像第一次那样，把自己与世界隔绝开来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064866_1_f9f837cd:
    # "I wanted to see Shiroya. My thoughts were a mess, but all the uncertain possibilities ahead of me made me listless."
    "我想见 Shiroya。脑子里乱作一团，可前方那些不确定的可能，让我提不起半点精神。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064877_1_56412597:
    # "The next time I stepped out of the motel was on December 9th, a Friday. Late in the evening, there was a place I wanted to go."
    "我再次走出鹰旅馆，是在十二月九日，星期五。那天深夜，有个地方我想去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064878_1_b6e0330e:
    # "On the 15th, I would be able to use the Sekimeiya again. It was mandatory for me to be there and that the past would repeat."
    "到了十五日，我就能再次使用 Sekimeiya。我必须到场，过去也必须重演。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064879_1_b523386a:
    # "However, naturally, I couldn't be in the lobby with everyone else. ...I had to enter the other way."
    "可是，我自然不能和别人一起待在大厅里。……我得从另一处进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064884_1_da51628c:
    # "Ashiya Tower was before me. I could see people through the door and light behind all the windows."
    "芦屋塔就在眼前。透过大门能看见人影，每扇窗后都亮着灯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064885_1_1f964125:
    # "The Sekimeiya have to be inside. Ashiya are waiting for Xyn's attack."
    "Sekimeiya 一定在里面。芦屋家正等着 Xyn 来袭。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064886_1_9e0291c0:
    # "If I found them, perhaps I could change worlds before the incident, even though that wasn't my goal."
    "如果找到它们，我也许能在事件发生前就切换世界——尽管那并非我的目的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064887_1_a914afe5:
    # "...I felt the rusty surface of a key in my pocket. I would have to use it to enter the tower without being seen."
    "……我摸到口袋里有一把钥匙，表面已经生锈。进塔时要不被人发现，我只能靠它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064893_1_3bf78963:
    # "Before that, I stepped into the lobby. After being checked for any devices, I approached the reception desk and bought an entry pass to the hallways."
    "在那之前，我先走进了大厅。接受完随身设备的检查，我走到前台，买了一张通往各走廊的通行证。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064896_1_49929c5e:
    # "I wanted to enter the tower in case I could pinpoint the Sekimeiya's location. I was curious to know if both had been found."
    "我想进塔，好确认 Sekimeiya 的位置。我也好奇，两件是不是都已经找到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064897_1_40d282ee:
    # "However, I was met with a \"Forbidden Entry\" sign on the door to the event room."
    "然而，活动室的门上却挂着「禁止入内」的牌子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064898_1_efff21e9:
    # "As expected, they're being kept in here.{w} I shouldn't bother checking inside. That could bring me problems, and there's no way only one was found anyway..."
    "果然，它们被收在这里。{w} 我不该多此一举进去查看。那只会给我惹麻烦，而且怎么可能只找到一件……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064899_1_a3177198:
    # "I knew the cameras around me were displaying my image in the security room. Katei shouldn't have been there, but someone was watching my movements."
    "我知道，四周的摄像头正把我的影像送进监控室。Katei 应该不在那里，可总有人在盯着我的一举一动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064900_1_01907aa3:
    # "...I wonder if whoever's in the security room also knows about the storeroom's secret."
    "……不知道监控室里的人是不是也知道储藏室的秘密。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064903_1_a9bac5e6:
    # "As if I was visiting the place normally, I entered a few crystal rooms and looked through their cabinets. All the gemstones were the same as on the 15th."
    "我装作寻常参观的样子，进了几间水晶展室，逐一查看展示柜。里面的宝石和十五日那天毫无二致。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064907_1_6bfebf00:
    # "Then, as I went through hallway A, I stopped myself before the storeroom. I opened its door curiously and peeked inside."
    "随后，我沿着 A走廊往前走，在储藏室前停下了脚步。我好奇地推开门，朝里面张望。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064910_1_ef8a9ba0:
    # "I wanted to see if my key would unlock the door. When I'd been in the tower, it hadn't unlocked that exit from the inside. I closed the door behind me and rapidly opened the secret wall."
    "我想确认这把钥匙能不能打开那扇门。上次在塔里时，这把钥匙从内侧打不开那扇通往外面的门。我关上身后的门，迅速推开暗墙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064914_1_c0e0fe24:
    # "The handle was there, and with the rusty key inserted into the keyhole, a rough turn unlocked it."
    "把手还在。我把生锈的钥匙插进锁孔，用力一转，锁开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064918_1_c6fc81c7:
    # "The door opened. Through a small gap, I could see the snowy grass next to the tower."
    "门开了。透过一道窄缝，我看见塔旁覆着白雪的草地。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064921_1_6c81a8d8:
    # "I frowned, but I couldn't waste time. As if nothing had happened, I stepped back to the hallway."
    "我皱起眉，却不能再耽搁。我若无其事地退回走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064926_1_59e0d2b7:
    # "The few people there didn't seem to mind me, so I walked back to the lobby."
    "那里只有寥寥几个人，似乎都没在意我，我便回到了大厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064927_1_73976e91:
    # "Why did it not work on the 15th? No matter how much I tried, the lock wouldn't budge..."
    "十五日那天为什么打不开？不管我怎么试，那把锁都纹丝不动……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064928_1_9cbbfeef:
    # "Whatever the reason was, it had worked in my favor. Katei hadn't been able to escape, and if he had, when the others found the door, they would've been able to get out too. With things like that, I wouldn't have been able to figure out the mechanics behind the Sekimeiya."
    "不管原因是什么，这对我来说都是好事。Katei 没能逃出去；要是他逃走了，等其他人发现那扇门，他们也能出去。那样的话，我就没法弄清 Sekimeiya 背后的机制了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064929_1_3c2a7f19:
    # "I couldn't be calm, though. If the key wouldn't work on the 15th, perhaps I wouldn't be able to enter the tower."
    "可我心里仍不安稳。要是十五日那天钥匙不管用，我也许就进不了塔。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064934_1_27be8d69:
    # "I haven't seen you here before, have I? Have you taken a look at this?"
    "我以前没在这里见过你吧？这个你看过了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064937_1_fa4e5367:
    # "I was about to step out when a voice called for me.{w} It was the receptionist, who held out a green paper that I recognized."
    "我正要出门，有人叫住了我。{w} 是前台的那位，她递来一张我认得的绿色传单。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064938_1_07479228:
    # "...The Sekimeiya event, right? I've heard about it, yes."
    "……是 Sekimeiya 的活动吧？我听说过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064939_1_fc9fdb10:
    # "I'm glad you have. Have you decided if you'll come back?"
    "很高兴你听说过。你决定好要不要再来了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064940_1_c618be34:
    # "...I might."
    "……也许吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064941_1_c8c89d64:
    # "Fantastic! I'll see you there, then."
    "太好了！那就到时候见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064943_1_20817837:
    # "...Huh."
    "……哦。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064947_1_e5993990:
    # "I grabbed the flyer as she waved. By the time I stepped out of the building, the sun was completely gone. Only the cold was left, and nobody was outside."
    "她挥着手，我接过了传单。等我走出大楼，太阳已经完全落山。外面只剩寒冷，一个人也没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064949_1_139192ba:
    # "I walked to the left side of the building, hearing the woman's words replay in my mind."
    "我绕到大楼左侧，那女人的话在脑中反复回响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064950_1_7209ad4b:
    # "Fantastic! I'll see you there, then."
    "太好了！那就到时候见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064952_1_1bfbdca6:
    # "...I did see her. I remember that."
    "……我确实见过她。这一点我记得。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064955_1_03b86f7b:
    # "I went to the wall where the secret door was. Stepping on the tall grass, I felt the surface of the wall carefully until I was next to the storeroom."
    "我走向藏有暗门的那面墙，踩着高高的野草，仔细摸索墙面，一直摸到储藏室旁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064957_1_308eeb69:
    # "This is the door. I can see the keyhole too."
    "就是这扇门。锁孔也看得见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064958_1_7b941f9d:
    # "I had left it slightly open, so it was easy to find. With the key, I verified that I could lock and unlock it from the outside."
    "我先前让它留了一条缝，所以很容易找到。我用钥匙确认过，从外面能锁上，也能打开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064961_1_6fd22230:
    # "...It works. I should be able to enter through it as long as it still works on the 15th..."
    "……没问题。只要十五日那天还能用，我应该就能从这里进去……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064968_1_786fa357:
    # "I walked away with the uneasiness that the receptionist's words had caused."
    "前台那番话让我心里不安，我就这样离开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064969_1_6c4252d2:
    # "I'll see you there, then."
    "那就到时候见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064971_1_1aa5d424:
    # "When Shiroya and I stepped into the tower, she didn't react to me at all. We were there extremely early and spent hours in the lobby, but it was as if she'd never seen me. That makes sense, of course—in that world, she hadn't."
    "我和 Shiroya 走进芦屋塔时，她对我毫无反应。我们到得极早，在大厅里待了好几个小时，可她却像从没见过我。当然，这也难怪——在那个世界里，她确实没见过我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064972_1_bf9ca5c7:
    # "But in this one, when Shiroya and I enter the tower, the receptionist won't react the same way, will she? ...Because of the brief conversation we just had."
    "可在这个世界，我和 Shiroya 走进芦屋塔时，前台那位应该就不会那样反应了吧？……毕竟我们刚刚才简单聊过几句。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064973_1_14bb8d91:
    # "Didn't that mean... that I'd changed the past? I had changed something that I'd experienced in the other world."
    "那不就意味着……我改变了过去？我改变了在另一个世界里亲身经历过的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064977_1_c81ed9e9:
    # "...I began to walk somewhere."
    "……我迈开步子，走向某处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064978_1_40028921:
    # "Of course, this world isn't identical. What happened on the 15th was different, but none of that was related to my presence, was it?"
    "当然，这个世界并不完全相同。十五日发生的事不一样，可那些事都跟我在不在场无关，不是吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064979_1_ec60cd03:
    # "...There might've been a big mistake in my reasoning."
    "……我的推理也许有个很大的错误。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064980_1_5e1ddd7c:
    # "Why was I not able to change the salt pattern? ...Because I had already seen it. In that sense, the past couldn't be changed."
    "为什么我改不了盐的图案？……因为我已经看过它了。从这个意义上说，过去无法改变。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064981_1_cb401059:
    # "However, in this world, I never did experience the wait in the lobby before the hallway doors opened. I could've caused that event to differ from my world's, but I never truly changed this world's history."
    "可是在这个世界里，我从未经历过走廊门打开前在大厅等候的那段时光。我本可以让那件事和我的世界不一样，但我终究没有真正改变这个世界的历史。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064987_1_9c5bae14:
    # "I came to a very familiar street. It was my own, and I could see my house far ahead."
    "我走到一条再熟悉不过的街道。那是我家所在的那条街，远远就能看见我的房子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064988_1_32c6504f:
    # "There was light behind two of the windows."
    "有两扇窗后透出灯光。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064989_1_6840d97a:
    # "...{w}Our sleep schedule was all over the place. I spent most nights awake."
    "……{w}我们的作息彻底乱了。大部分夜晚我都醒着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064990_1_23082e4c:
    # "I couldn't see my own outline, but I remembered staring through that window every night. For that reason, the image I'd always seen was still engraved in my mind."
    "我看不见自己的轮廓，但我记得自己每晚都从那个窗口望出去。正因如此，我早已看惯的那幕景象仍深深刻在脑海里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064994_1_4d31f390:
    # "I got closer to my house, hiding myself behind the gate."
    "我朝自己家走近，藏到院门后面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064995_1_a6d8cb29:
    # "A lot of snow had piled up on it. Without thinking twice, I shook it all off."
    "门上积了厚厚的雪。我想也没想，就把雪全抖掉了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064997_1_83d07379:
    # "...{w}I was right. I changed my past, but not the past of the Atsuki from this world. In my memories, the snow piled on the gate never fell."
    "……{w}我猜对了。我改变的是自己的过去，不是这个世界的 Atsuki 的过去。在我的记忆里，门上那堆积雪从没被抖掉过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064998_1_5ebe3e5e:
    # "No rule had changed. I hadn't erased what I'd lived through. What had once happened couldn't be reversed."
    "规则没有改变。我经历过的事并没有被抹去。已经发生过的，无法倒转。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L064999_1_c4d39592:
    # "However... I truly had power in the world I was in. It was a real second chance. I couldn't change my own past, but I had just changed the other Atsuki's past."
    "然而……在我身处的这个世界里，我确实拥有力量。那是真正的第二次机会。我改变不了自己的过去，可就在刚才，我改变了另一个 Atsuki 的过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065000_1_b26465d3:
    # "I'd thought that everything would happen as the universe had decided—that my input would always be meaningless. ...But that wasn't the case. I had taken an action all by myself and changed something."
    "我原以为一切都会依照宇宙既定的轨迹发生——我的所作所为永远毫无意义。……可事实并非如此。我凭自己的意志采取行动，改变了一些东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065006_1_84500701:
    # "I locked up. Did that mean that I could've saved Miiya? If I hadn't waited in the motel, could I have prevented her death?"
    "我僵住了。那岂不是说，我本可以救下 Miiya？如果我没有在旅馆里干等，是不是就能阻止她的死？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065007_1_8111fec3:
    # "Even if that was the case, I had already failed. I had failed to do it, and it was irreversible."
    "即便真是如此，我也已经失败了。我没能做到，而这一切已无可挽回。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065008_1_4c8d2071:
    # "Because I had seen the news. I had witnessed history of the world I was in, so it was no longer any different from my own. I'd had a chance, and I'd failed to notice it."
    "因为我看到了那条新闻。我亲眼见证了自己所在世界的历史，所以这个世界已经和我的世界没有分别。机会曾在我眼前，我却没有察觉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065009_1_da3f4981:
    # "The reporter had spelled out my negligence. I hadn't acted, so nothing had changed."
    "那名记者的报道，把我的疏忽摊在了明处。我没有行动，所以什么都没有改变。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065010_1_679a2841:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065011_1_3c77eabb:
    # "No, that can't be..."
    "不，不会的……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065012_1_80fbfcb0:
    # "It's the same case. Even though I have seen the news, in this world, I've never seen any physical indication that Miiya is dead. That was the biggest barrier in my world, and it doesn't exist here. The news report is the only real obstacle, and it's a crossable one."
    "情况是一样的。虽然我看过那条新闻，但在这个世界，我从未亲眼见到任何能表明 Miiya 已死的实物证据。在我的世界里，那曾是最大的障碍，而这里并不存在。新闻报道是唯一真正的阻碍，而它是可以越过的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065018_1_60081e26:
    # "I no longer had the Sekimeiya. I couldn't travel back to the 30th."
    "我已经没有 Sekimeiya 了，没法回到30号那天。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065019_1_1e4d2f1d:
    # "However, if I could... Miiya's death could be averted without the need to change the past. It isn't yet an impossibility..."
    "不过，如果我做得到……不必改变过去，也能避免 Miiya 的死。这还不是没有可能……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065020_1_6ef84ad3:
    # "And I knew everything that I'd lived through would repeat, so I could be certain that on the 15th, I would have the Sekimeiya for myself."
    "而且我知道，我经历过的一切都会重演，所以我能确定，到了15号，Sekimeiya 会落到我手里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065022_1_76ba1615:
    # "...Finally, it made sense, and my eyes went wide. The reason why Miiya had been in the tower... I understood everything, as it all aligned with what I had to do."
    "……终于，一切说得通了，我睁大了眼睛。Miiya 会出现在塔里的原因……我全都明白了，一切都与我必须做的事吻合。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065031_1_09785086:
    # "I arrived at the motel, where I could be isolated from the world. Until I was certain about everything, I couldn't look at the news. Everything had to be in my head before the result was given to me."
    "我来到旅馆，在这里能避开外界。在把一切想清楚之前，我不能看新闻。必须先在脑子里把整件事过一遍，才能去看结果。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065041_1_4f09218e:
    # "Oubliette"
    "遗忘地牢"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065046_1_a402322e:
    # "The last days passed quickly. It was about to be December 15th once again."
    "最后这几天过得很快。12月15日又要到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065047_1_d87ea2df:
    # "I knew what I wanted to do, and I knew it would work."
    "我知道自己想做什么，也知道那会成功。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065048_1_4d762699:
    # "The end was still murky. I had to go back to my world, and I couldn't know how smoothly that would go until the time came. However, I had prepared extra steps before that point."
    "最后会怎样仍不清楚。我必须回到自己的世界，而能不能顺利，不到那一刻无从得知。不过在那之前，我已经额外做了些准备。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065049_1_6b7e5d26:
    # "In the tower, more than one person had been a killer. Someone had caused the attack, trapping all of us there. Despite all that, the security cameras weren't reliable enough to prove anything. I couldn't stand the thought of letting those criminals run free after everything was over."
    "在塔里，凶手不止一个人。有人发动了那场袭击，把我们所有人困在那里。可即便如此，监控摄像头也不足以作为确凿证据。一想到一切结束后那些凶手还能逍遥法外，我就无法忍受。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065050_1_3b098e66:
    # "For that, I had obtained two things."
    "为此，我准备了两样东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065059_1_e0246e9f:
    # "In one hand, I had an empty USB drive. In the other, I had a roll of tape."
    "一手是空白的U盘，另一手是一卷胶带。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065061_1_146dd86e:
    # "In one hand, I had an empty USB drive. In the other, I had duct tape."
    "一手是空白的U盘，另一手是一卷胶带。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065062_1_30514423:
    # "While we'd been unconscious, someone had hidden the Sekimeiya in a hallway B crystal room. Perhaps there was more of the attack that they wanted to keep hidden."
    "趁我们昏迷的时候，有人把 Sekimeiya 藏进了 B走廊的一间水晶展室。也许那场袭击里，还有更多他们想隐瞒的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065063_1_c664441c:
    # "I'd thought of a way to expose what they'd kept as a well-hidden secret."
    "我想到了一个办法，能揭穿他们藏得极深的秘密。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065070_1_403a1687:
    # "I stepped out of the motel when the sun had already risen. I couldn't be in the tower too early, or I'd conflict with what I needed."
    "太阳升起后，我才走出旅馆。我不能太早进塔，不然会打乱我该做的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065071_1_2c244aad:
    # "Basically all smoke residue had faded from my clothing, and I'd left the suitcase and my clothes from the 24th in the bedroom before departing. On the way, I grew nervous. ...Was it going to work?"
    "衣服上几乎已经闻不到烟味了。出发前，我把行李箱和24号那天穿的衣服留在了卧室里。路上，我越来越紧张。……会顺利吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065072_1_a7351863:
    # "Had I overlooked something? Was there anything crucial I was missing?"
    "我是不是漏掉了什么？有没有什么关键的东西被我忽略了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065073_1_067941e5:
    # "In the world I was in, I could save Miiya. I knew that for sure. My uncertainty went further than that."
    "在我身处的这个世界里，我能救下 Miiya。这一点我很确定。我的不安并不止于此。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065074_1_2fcb9d0e:
    # "The news and the note I'd read in the tower... They signified the real problem."
    "那条新闻，还有我在塔里读到的那张字条……那才是真正的问题所在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065075_1_fbdf22fa:
    # "How would it be solved...? I'd only been able to come up with a vague idea."
    "那该如何解决……？我只想到一个模糊的方向。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065076_1_56f793a7:
    # "I could see the tower in the distance. I still hadn't shaken off that unsettling feeling, but I knew it wouldn't disappear until everything was settled."
    "远远望去，已经能看见那座塔。那份不安仍未散去，但我知道，在一切尘埃落定之前，它不会消失。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065081_1_4b71c01f:
    # "People were by the entrance. I could see Suripo and the line of civilians from that day. However, the left wall was unguarded."
    "入口处有人。我看得见 Suripo，还有那天排成长队的平民。不过，左侧的墙边没人看守。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065084_1_934ef8c4:
    # "I surreptitiously approached it. Immediately, what I'd been very curious to see was apparent."
    "我悄悄靠近，立刻看清了自己一直想确认的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065085_1_bdb170a3:
    # "It really is there..."
    "真的在那里……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065086_1_309ac746:
    # "The rusty key was inserted in the outer keyhole."
    "生锈的钥匙插在外侧的锁孔里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065087_1_49c351c3:
    # "Really? Does this really make sense?"
    "真的吗？这真的说得通吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065088_1_8b436a1b:
    # "The reason why I hadn't been able to unlock that door from the inside... I had thought that if an identical key was on the opposite side, I might not have been able to turn it from the inside.{w} I wanted it to be there. I needed it to remain outside so that the door wouldn't be unlocked from the inside... so that Katei couldn't escape and so that the others couldn't leave when they found the door.{w} But... why was that key there? If it was just there because I'd known it would be there, that didn't really satisfy me."
    "我一直没能从内侧打开那扇门，原因就在这里……我原先猜想，如果对面插着一把一模一样的钥匙，从里面或许就拧不动了。{w} 我希望那把钥匙在那里。我需要它留在门外，这样门就无法从内侧打开……Katei 便逃不出去，其他人发现那扇门时也走不了。{w} 可是……那把钥匙为什么会插在那里？如果只是因为我早就知道它会在那儿，这个理由并不能让我满意。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065089_1_ae349ca0:
    # "...Am I supposed to assume that I'll leave it here the next time? Then, to still have it in the future, I'd have to get the key that Shiroya had."
    "……难道说，下一次我也会把钥匙留在这里？那样一来，为了在未来仍然持有它，我就必须拿到 Shiroya 那把钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065092_1_a55fb3c8:
    # "That had to be the answer. It meant that a future self of mine was already in the tower... But it was a bit hard to swallow. I would just be leaving the key behind to explain why I hadn't been able to unlock the door. If that was it, maybe there was more to it that I was missing, as the origin of the idea was unknown to me."
    "答案只能是这样。也就是说，未来的我已经在这座塔里了……可这实在难以接受。我留下那把钥匙，仅仅是为了解释自己为何打不开那扇门。若果真如此，或许还有我没想到的地方——这个念头从何而来，我至今毫无头绪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065093_1_333636e3:
    # "Despite the universe apparently deciding the outcomes of things by itself, actual ideas that went into effect had consistently originated from a human mind. I still thought that had to be the case, but it wasn't like I had a better explanation ready for the key."
    "虽说这个宇宙似乎会自行决定事情的结果，但真正生效的念头，无一例外都源自人心。我仍然认为理应如此——只是关于那把钥匙，我也拿不出更好的解释。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065100_1_5ce15b18:
    # "I locked the door while it was open and stepped into the storeroom. Once inside, I was able to close the door behind me, leaving it locked. It was fortunate—and guaranteed—that the door worked like that, and once again, I wondered why the hell it existed in the first place."
    "我趁门还开着先上了锁，然后走进储藏室。进去后，我从里面把门关上，门依然锁着。这扇门能这样运作，既幸运又理所当然——我又一次忍不住想，这扇门究竟为什么会存在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065101_1_02a03f5d:
    # "I still had the rusty key in my pocket, but when I tried to use it from the inside, it wouldn't budge. As long as the other one was inserted, opening the door from the inside would be impossible."
    "生锈的钥匙仍在我口袋里，可当我试着从里面转动它时，它纹丝不动。只要另一把还插在外面，这扇门就无法从内侧打开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065102_1_9fab36c5:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065106_1_43738e97:
    # "I got closer to the hallway. It would very soon be {time=9.}"
    "我朝走廊靠近。马上就要到{time=9.}了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065107_1_c8930ab8:
    # "Katei won't be in the security room... Nobody will see me getting out of here.{w} I'll be recorded. Maybe the footage will actually be seen by the police. ...That doesn't matter, though."
    "Katei 不在监控室……没人会看见我从这里出去。{w} 不过我会被拍下来。也许那段录像真会落到警察手里。……那也无所谓了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065108_1_3ed12d6f:
    # "I paid the utmost attention for any sound to use as a cue."
    "我全神贯注，留意着任何可以当作信号的声响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065112_1_e21366d4:
    # "There it was. As soon as I heard footsteps, I opened the door."
    "来了。一听到脚步声，我立刻打开门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065116_1_4e7a3eab:
    # "When I glanced toward the lobby, I saw two people. One was Katei, who'd just left the security room. The other was a man I'd never seen. He saw me exiting the storeroom, but he paid no mind as he kept approaching."
    "我朝大厅那边一瞥，看见两个人。一个是刚离开监控室的 Katei，另一个是我从没见过的男人。他看见我从储藏室出来，却毫不在意，继续朝这边走来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065117_1_93ba060e:
    # "I couldn't afford to waste time either. Casually, I walked to hallway C."
    "我也没时间耽搁。我装作若无其事，走向 C走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065121_1_fa337d6b:
    # "I made it just in time to see the event room closing. The first group was there.{w} I had very little time; the second group would appear at any moment."
    "我赶得及时，看见活动室的门正在合上。第一批人已经进去了。{w} 我的时间所剩无几，第二批随时都会出现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065125_1_b1e0b8ab:
    # "Fortunately, I was done in less than a minute. It had gone as smoothly as I'd hoped."
    "幸好不到一分钟我就办完了，一切顺利得如我所愿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065126_1_35c90a8d:
    # "I'd wanted to record the movements through hallway B. In our world, Katei had hidden both Sekimeiya in room B4. I knew things wouldn't be identical, but I hoped the truth would be recorded nonetheless."
    "我想拍下 B走廊里的动静。在我们那个世界，Katei 把两件 Sekimeiya 都藏进了 B4 展室。我知道情形不会完全一样，但仍旧盼着真相能被录下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065127_1_18312253:
    # "Near the lobby, one of the security cameras viewed the entire hallway. It was high up, but I'd foreseen that problem. Thanks to the handrail and the corner, I'd been able to reach its lens."
    "大厅附近有一台监控摄像头能俯瞰整条走廊。它装得很高，但这个问题我早有预料。靠着扶手和墙角，我够到了它的镜头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065132_1_068e4ac9:
    # "With the seconds I had left, I sprinted toward hallway C. I had to be somewhere during the attack."
    "趁着还剩几秒，我朝 C走廊冲去。袭击发生时，我总得待在某个地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065136_1_8fcd414b:
    # "The security room."
    "监控室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065137_1_4a1f1a27:
    # "I knew the alarm would lock it. If that happened, Katei could be fast enough to erase the footage I wanted to preserve.{w} However, I could avoid that by staying inside. He had told us once that the door could be unlocked from the inside without the need for the key."
    "我知道警报一响，那扇门就会自动上锁。若真如此，只要 Katei 手脚够快，就能把我想要保住的录像抹掉。{w} 不过，只要我待在里面，就能避免这一点。他曾经告诉过我们，那扇门从内侧打开并不需要钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065142_1_477b12ae:
    # "When I looked at all the monitors, I felt like a needle was piercing my chest."
    "看着满墙的监视器，我只觉得一根针直刺胸口。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065144_1_7533c3a9:
    # "...Miiya is here. She's wearing the tanzanite pendant..."
    "……Miiya 在这里。她戴着那条坦桑石吊坠……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065145_1_1f7bac68:
    # "She and I were in the event room with Akaro. And... Shiroya was nowhere to be seen.{w} I couldn't believe it. No matter how much I stared at the footage, I couldn't believe that she was really a room away.{w} And the cabinet covered by that crimson curtain... Which Sekimeiya were there?"
    "我和她，还有 Akaro，都在活动室里。而……Shiroya 却不见踪影。{w} 我不敢相信。无论盯着画面看多久，都不敢相信她就在一室之隔的地方。{w} 还有那个罩着深红遮布的展示柜……里面放的是哪几个 Sekimeiya？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065146_1_59644063:
    # "Every monitor displayed different locations on the crystal floor except for one. One of the screens was covered by tape.{w} I kept my eyes peeled with anticipation. It was about to happen again. I would see that dense smoke appearing out of nowhere, and my vision would blacken."
    "只有一块屏幕例外，其余每块都显示着水晶层上的不同位置。那块屏幕被胶带贴住了。{w} 我屏息凝神，紧盯着屏幕。那件事又要发生了。我会看见浓烟凭空涌出，随后眼前一黑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065154_1_b55e20d3:
    # "All at once, it happened, and I finally confirmed the truth."
    "一切骤然发生，我终于确认了真相。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065155_1_cbb92c47:
    # "Did the smoke come from Akaro!?"
    "烟是从 Akaro 那边冒出来的！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065156_1_330f8334:
    # "That was how it had seemed. In an instant, all the cameras hit by the smoke displayed a black screen."
    "看上去正是如此。一瞬间，被烟雾笼罩的摄像头全部变成了黑屏。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065157_1_35a7c342:
    # "It was Akaro. He was the one who released it."
    "是 Akaro。烟就是他放的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065158_1_1afa762f:
    # "When Shiroya and I had appeared on that morning after traveling from January 5th, we'd been able to avoid falling unconscious by looking down as we'd run through the smoke. Akaro had to have thrown himself to the ground immediately to avoid inhaling it, as it had quickly risen to the ceiling.{w} I had to act again while I still could, but I waited a few seconds so that the exit to the outside would close."
    "从 1 月 5 日穿越过来的那个早上，Shiroya 和我一出现，就一边跑过烟雾一边低头，才没有晕过去。烟雾很快升到了天花板，Akaro 想必是立刻趴到了地上，才没吸进去。{w} 我必须趁自己还能行动时再动手，可我还是等了几秒，好让通往外面的出口关上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065163_1_2d2f93eb:
    # "Then I opened the door slowly, crouching and covering my face. The smoke was there, but I was very close to the lobby."
    "我蹲下身，掩住口鼻，缓缓推开门。烟雾还在，但这里离大厅已经很近。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065164_1_8b365bc1:
    # "Is someone here...?{w} Is it Katei?"
    "有人吗……？{w} 是 Katei 吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065165_1_7e4ed20d:
    # "I didn't want them to hear me, so I took off my shoes. I could hear a person crawling on the floor, but when I opened my eyes, I only saw a dark silhouette near the wall."
    "我不想让他们听见我的动静，于是脱掉了鞋。我能听见有人在地上爬动，可睁开眼时，只看见墙边一团模糊的黑影。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065168_1_6c36fe03:
    # "The alarm... It's even louder than I remember."
    "警报声……比我记得的还要响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065173_1_66aa1be2:
    # "Unable to breathe, I took a silent step toward the light. I was in time to see the shutter locking in place and the smaller lights turning off."
    "我憋着气，无声地朝光亮处迈出一步。正好看见卷帘门落下锁死，小灯随之熄灭。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065177_1_b290bdc9:
    # "In hallway B, most of the smoke had already gotten stuck to the ceiling."
    "B走廊里，大半烟雾已经聚在天花板附近。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065181_1_6ab1c8a5:
    # "Aside from the second group, nobody seemed to be there yet. Protecting my face, I reached for the camera's lens and removed the piece of tape."
    "除了第二批人，似乎还没有别人到场。我护住脸，伸手够到摄像头的镜头，把胶带撕了下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065187_1_6a886510:
    # "I returned to the security room as fast as I could. Someone had still been in hallway A, but I didn't think they'd noticed me. I still had my shoes in my hand."
    "我以最快的速度赶回监控室。A走廊里还有人，但我想对方没有注意到我。我手里还提着鞋。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065188_1_b5b81277:
    # "I noticed the deadbolt was sticking out of the door. The alarm had just locked it, but since I'd left it open, I was able to step back in, and I used the inner handle to close it again."
    "我注意到门上的插销伸在外面。警报刚才已经把门锁上了，但因为门一直开着，我才能侧身进去，然后握住内侧的把手把门重新带上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065190_1_4a61b1ac:
    # "I looked at the monitors as I put them on. The one that had been covered by tape showed the dark hallway instead. Its screen was being assaulted by the remaining smoke, but it wasn't enough to conceal the entire image."
    "我一边穿鞋，一边看向监视器。原先被胶带贴住的那块屏幕，此刻映出昏暗的走廊。残存的烟雾不断扑向镜头，但还不至于把整个画面遮住。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065191_1_8bcbd94e:
    # "In front of the computer, I clicked on the program that managed the cameras. From there, I accessed the archived footage."
    "我在电脑前点开管理摄像头的程序，从那里调出了存档的录像。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065192_1_b551e114:
    # "...It's all here, but Katei will try to hide it. In this world, the computer was shut down too."
    "……全都在这里。但 Katei 会想办法把它藏起来。在这个世界里，电脑也被关掉了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065195_1_dc3c7110:
    # "On the screen, the culprits finally came to light.{w} Akaro came out of the event room and looked both ways."
    "屏幕上，罪魁祸首终于显露出来。{w} Akaro 从活动室里走出，左右张望。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065196_1_86c34f90:
    # "...He did fake his unconsciousness. What is he planning to do...?"
    "……他果然是装晕。他到底想做什么……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065197_1_cd64c786:
    # "Once he confirmed he was alone, he walked to the cleaning room. From there, he went back to the event room, holding a glowing object between his hands."
    "确认四下无人之后，他走向清洁间。再回到活动室时，他双手捧着一件发光的物体。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065198_1_4d3423c5:
    # "What the hell...? Is that a Sekimeiya?{w} No, I know what that must be. ...The third Sekimeiya. That's what the plan was about."
    "搞什么……？那是 Sekimeiya？{w} 不，我知道那是什么。……第三个 Sekimeiya。原来那个计划打的是这个主意。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065199_1_c762e8d5:
    # "A few seconds later, he came back out. I couldn't see his hands, but he walked back to the cleaning room again."
    "几秒后，他又出来了。我看不见他手里拿着什么，但他再次走回了清洁间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065200_1_a16a9968:
    # "...This is why only the third Sekimeiya was there when we woke up.{w} When does Katei come into the picture, though?"
    "……难怪我们醒来时，那里只剩第三个 Sekimeiya。{w} 可 Katei 又是什么时候插进来的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065201_1_75f30bda:
    # "I didn't have to wait very long to find out. After Akaro had returned to the event room, Katei appeared from the lobby.{w} Keeping his head down, he stepped to the cleaning room."
    "我没等多久就知道了。Akaro 回到活动室之后，Katei 从大厅那边出现了。{w} 他低着头，走进了清洁间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065202_1_0caf1c43:
    # "Was he working with Akaro?"
    "他和 Akaro 是一伙的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065203_1_a76da92a:
    # "I was bewildered. He came out almost immediately with two Sekimeiya and walked back to the lobby."
    "我一时愣住。他几乎立刻就出来了，手里拿着两个 Sekimeiya，走回了大厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065206_1_ea483aad:
    # "He must be going to the storeroom, but he won't be able to escape with the Sekimeiya."
    "他应该是去储藏室了，但就算带着 Sekimeiya，也逃不掉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065207_1_1eec38b9:
    # "I'd caught the two culprits behind the attack on video. Feeling the rush, I inserted the USB drive into the computer."
    "我拍下了袭击案中两个犯人的影像。一阵激动，我把U盘插进了电脑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065208_1_3dc5b3ee:
    # "Once I located the file corresponding to that camera, I saved it on the drive."
    "找到那台摄像头对应的文件后，我把它存进了U盘。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065209_1_329c766c:
    # "With this, I can bring it to the other world too."
    "有了这个，我也能把它带到另一个世界去了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065210_1_ee7b0a7f:
    # "I knew Katei would try to erase the saved footage, so I created a hidden folder on the computer where I copied the file."
    "我知道 Katei 会试图删掉保存的录像，所以在电脑上建了一个隐藏文件夹，把文件复制了进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065211_1_88106278:
    # "...And I hope the police will find it in this world."
    "……但愿这个世界的警察能找到它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065214_1_e7a839ca:
    # "Perhaps something else of value would be recorded, but I preferred to cut it short."
    "或许还能录下别的有价值的东西，但我还是决定到此为止。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065215_1_2c95d0c8:
    # "...After all, I soon heard someone running outside the security room. Then, that person appeared in hallway B."
    "……结果没过多久，我就听见监控室外有人跑过。紧接着，那个人出现在 B走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065216_1_d526f4c5:
    # "It was Naomi. She ran all the way down holding Katei's suitcase, and as she disappeared, another door opened.{w} From room B4, Shiroya and I appeared—Naomi had drawn us out. Then, Shiroya stared at the camera intensely, as if she was looking directly at me. Before I could even process it, they ran behind the sound, quickly vanishing from the frame."
    "那是 Naomi。她提着 Katei 的手提箱一路跑下楼，就在她消失时，另一扇门开了。{w} Shiroya 和我从 B4房间走出来——是 Naomi 把我们引出来的。随后，Shiroya 死死盯着摄像头，仿佛正透过镜头看着我。还没等我理清头绪，他们便循着声响跑向后方，转眼消失在画面里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065217_1_6560795a:
    # "Huh, what? Did she notice something about the camera? She didn't tell me about it, but I remember having to tug her shirt so that she'd follow me."
    "咦，什么？她察觉到摄像头有什么不对了吗？她没跟我提过这事，但我记得当时还得拽她的衣角，她才肯跟我走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065218_1_0d0f9d21:
    # "And what was Naomi's role? Given how likely it was that Katei had killed her once, she might have intercepted him after resisting the smoke."
    "那 Naomi 又扮演了什么角色？既然 Katei 很可能已经杀过她一次，她或许是在撑过烟雾之后截住了他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065221_1_6b6ce752:
    # "I saw us going up the stairs in hallway C, so I changed the cameras. They were all assigned random numbers, but I managed to display the second floor through a camera that'd been showing a crystal room."
    "我看见我们正在 C走廊上楼梯，便切换了摄像头。这些摄像头的编号全是随机分配的，但我还是设法用一台原本对着水晶展室的摄像头调出了二楼画面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065222_1_a54682af:
    # "With Naomi in the lead, our past selves ran all the way up."
    "由 Naomi 带头，过去的我们一路跑了上去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065223_1_ca2262d6:
    # "Oh, is that Katei...?"
    "哦，那是 Katei……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065224_1_99a559e4:
    # "He was tailing us, but he collapsed at the stairs two floors above. When he stood up, it seemed like he'd given up on catching us, and with his eyes shut tight, he slowly walked back down."
    "他一直跟在我们后面，却在上面两层的楼梯处倒下了。等他重新站起，似乎已经放弃追我们，紧闭着双眼慢慢走了下去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065226_1_0876a19a:
    # "I looked at the sixth floor, where Naomi unlocked the attic. She stepped in, shortly followed by me and Shiroya."
    "我看向六楼，Naomi 在那里打开了阁楼的锁。她走了进去，我和 Shiroya 紧随其后。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065228_1_a7b03c53:
    # "...Is Katei gonna come here? I should leave."
    "……Katei 会来这里吗？我该走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065229_1_c258d841:
    # "I made the monitor display the initial crystal room again and stepped out."
    "我让监视器重新显示最初的水晶展室，然后走了出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065235_1_ba5fd929:
    # "I went to the lobby, but a clear problem was about to arise."
    "我来到大厅，可一个明显的问题就要出现了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065236_1_5720a091:
    # "My past self is going to go to the storeroom very soon, so I can't stay there again."
    "过去的我很快就要去储藏室了，所以我不能再待在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065237_1_009b7c47:
    # "If I'm remembering correctly, in this world, the group didn't go to the security room after waking up. ...I can't risk staying there, though."
    "如果我没记错，在这个世界里，一行人醒来后并没有去监控室。……不过，我也不能冒险待在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065238_1_3edfe567:
    # "I kept cleaning the smoke off me. It had touched me again, so I likely looked similar to how I had in the morning."
    "我不断擦去身上的烟雾。它又沾到了我身上，所以我现在的样子大概和早上差不多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065245_1_baa76209:
    # "Katei was the first to return. At a slow pace, he scanned the floor."
    "Katei 是第一个回来的。他不紧不慢地扫视着这一层。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065246_1_5411fe68:
    # "...I just remembered when he said he'd used the security room's microphone while we were unconscious. That really was a blatant lie, which Akaro immediately realized if they weren't working together. Also, Katei will probably be confused when he finds out the security room's unlocked."
    "……我刚想起来，他说过在我们昏迷时用过监控室的麦克风。那根本是明目张胆的谎言——除非他们本就是一伙的，否则 Akaro 当场就会识破。还有，等 Katei 发现监控室没锁，大概会摸不着头脑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065250_1_12e00afa:
    # "I stayed behind the reception desk. Once Katei was next to Erina's group, someone else had come down."
    "我躲在前台后面。等 Katei 走到 Erina 一行人身边时，又有一个人下来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065251_1_9fb975dd:
    # "My past self, who went straight to the storeroom. I was unable to find the rusty key in hallway A, so I stayed inside."
    "那是过去的我，径直走向储藏室。我在 A走廊没能找到生锈的钥匙，于是留在了里面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065252_1_f8cacc99:
    # "...What was going to happen? I'd hidden in the storeroom for hours, but I knew the way things played out would be vastly different from my world's set of events."
    "……接下来会发生什么？我在储藏室里躲了好几个小时，但我知道事情的走向会和我那个世界截然不同。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065253_1_f4875b99:
    # "Eventually, everyone would disappear, and after that, my past self would bring both Sekimeiya to the attic to experiment with them..."
    "最终，所有人都会消失；在那之后，过去的我会把两个 Sekimeiya 带到阁楼去做实验……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065254_1_688afbfe:
    # "I had to hold on until that point, when the Sekimeiya would be within reach again."
    "我必须撑到那一刻，等 Sekimeiya 再次变得触手可及。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065255_1_f30b87e2:
    # "I didn't want to be found, but I knew it could happen. The Atsuki originally from that world wasn't a past self of mine—him seeing me wouldn't be a contradiction."
    "我不想被人发现，但也知道这并非不可能。那个世界原本的 Atsuki 并不是我的过去之身——他看到我，也不会构成矛盾。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065259_1_2c2b61c6:
    # "The seconds began to tick by. I had no place where I could safely stay, so I had to keep moving, my whole objective being to smoothly return to one particular point."
    "时间一分一秒地过去。我没有可以安全停留的地方，只能不断移动，而我的全部目标，就是顺利回到某个特定的时间点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065260_1_b7e15cdc:
    # "I couldn't travel forward in time to speed up the process because I hadn't been in the tower in the proportional past. However, I doubted I would have been willing to do that anyway.{w} ...To skip that last time I had... where Miiya existed. When I heard her voice, I couldn't stop myself from getting closer to the door."
    "我无法穿越到未来去加快进度，因为在对应的那段过去里，我并没有待在塔里。不过，就算能这么做，我大概也不会愿意。{w}……毕竟，那会跳过我所拥有的最后一段……有 Miiya 在的时光。听到她的声音时，我还是忍不住朝门口靠近。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065264_1_d850e34b:
    # "...ou okay? I'm so—"
    "……你还好吗？我真是太——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065268_1_e8acc695:
    # "Don't worry. No— ...our fault."
    "别担心。不——……是我们的错。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065269_1_3c60a097:
    # "She was there. It was proof that my effort wasn't worthless. But I couldn't even see her."
    "她就在那里。这证明我的努力没有白费。可我却连看都看不到她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065270_1_8bde81a0:
    # "...Aware that they could come to the lobby at any point, I walked away."
    "……我知道他们随时可能来到大厅，于是转身离开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065277_1_66f68c2f:
    # "After learning that they'd been trapped, the group saw the shutter for the first time. Then, once they stepped into hallway A, they directed themselves to the dark crystal room, A5."
    "得知自己被困后，一行人第一次看到了卷帘门。随后，他们一踏进 A走廊，便径直朝昏暗的水晶展室 A5 走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065278_1_b1f9c440:
    # "It wasn't what we'd done. ...They weren't surprised to see its stained walls."
    "这和我们当初不同。……看到墙上那些污迹，他们并不意外。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065279_1_0ac9abd6:
    # "And the security room, which should've been their priority, had been ignored completely."
    "而本应成为他们首要目标的监控室，却被完全忽略了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065281_1_37a2170a:
    # "Oh, huh. The suitcase isn't here this time.{w} Naomi ran up to the attic with it, and I didn't see it. But the Sekimeiya were on the sofa. It has to be that the suitcase was brought to our world as well, which is why we saw two."
    "哦，咦？这次手提箱不在这里。{w} Naomi 提着它跑上了阁楼，可我没看到那箱子。不过 Sekimeiya 在沙发上。一定是手提箱也被带到了我们的世界，所以我们才会看到两个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065287_1_d501586c:
    # "...There's a reason why I believe Naomi hid upstairs if she's part of this, like I suspect. Above us are five desolate floors full of offices. However, there's a seventh floor that we call the attic, or the Ashiya floor."
    "……我怀疑 Naomi 也牵涉其中；若真是这样，我想她藏到楼上是有原因的。我们头顶上是五层空荡荡的办公室。不过还有第七层，我们称之为阁楼，也叫芦屋层。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065288_1_1dcdca20:
    # "Unable to use the elevator, they all walked up the stairs."
    "电梯用不了，他们便全都走楼梯上去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065290_1_72686c59:
    # "I could follow them. It was good to know what their movements would be and the events that were bound to unfold. In the future, I could put that information to use."
    "我可以跟上去。弄清他们的行动和注定会发生的事，总归有好处。将来，这些情报或许能派上用场。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065291_1_eb468d97:
    # "I had already noticed that Katei's behavior and the things he was saying were different. The group was going up to find Naomi, who had locked herself in the attic. Unknown to them, Shiroya and I had unlocked it, and Naomi was no longer in the building."
    "我已经察觉到 Katei 的言行与以往不同。一行人正上楼去找 Naomi——她把自己锁在了阁楼里。可他们不知道，Shiroya 和我已经打开了阁楼的锁，而 Naomi 早已不在楼里了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065298_1_e4e44bc2:
    # "On the second floor, the group looked through the offices. As expected, nothing was found, and they moved on to the third floor."
    "在二楼，一行人逐个查看了办公室。不出所料，什么也没找到，于是他们又上了三楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065302_1_2efc5263:
    # "The same occurred upstairs."
    "楼上也是一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065306_1_a4d7d388:
    # "I followed them when they were going to the fourth, but all of a sudden, someone walked back down while I was following them."
    "他们上四楼时，我跟了上去；可才跟到一半，忽然有人掉头下楼了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065310_1_0ee6d45d:
    # "I couldn't run all the way down, so I was only able to enter the first partition."
    "我没法一路跑下楼，只能躲进第一间隔间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065314_1_ba9c55f9:
    # "That's me and Miiya...!"
    "那是我和 Miiya……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065315_1_6d2515cc:
    # "From behind a desk, I saw them walking beyond the glass, which greatly muddled their voices."
    "我躲在办公桌后，看见他们从玻璃另一侧走过，声音也因此变得十分模糊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065316_1_8dda03ba:
    # "Before I could breathe, Erina and Isla came down as well. They appeared to be following the other two."
    "我还没来得及喘口气，Erina 和 Isla 也下来了。看那样子，她们是在跟着先前那两个人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065318_1_1af1d816:
    # "...Was that it? No one else seemed to be coming.{w} Why had they gone down alone? As I wondered that, a fifth person came from the upper floor."
    "……就这些？似乎不会再有别人下来了。{w} 他们为什么独自下楼？我正想着，第五个人从楼上走了下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065319_1_ad1647c5:
    # "Akaro. He looked deep in thought as he walked.{w} While I was still fazed, the sixth person appeared. Sai trailed behind Akaro as he disappeared beyond the glass."
    "Akaro。他边走边沉思。{w} 我还没回过神，第六个人出现了。Sai 跟在 Akaro 身后，后者消失在了玻璃那头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065322_1_1e44dbed:
    # "...What the hell are they doing?{w} I remember this. When I was in the storeroom, everyone came back on their own. I heard different footsteps walking beyond the wall."
    "……他们到底在干什么？{w} 这一幕我记得。我待在储藏室的时候，所有人都是自己回来的。我听见墙外传来不同的脚步声。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065323_1_92989b3b:
    # "I kept waiting. After all, someone was missing."
    "我继续等着。毕竟，还少一个人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065324_1_0a08f460:
    # "Where's Katei? Why is he the only person who hasn't come down?"
    "Katei 呢？怎么只有他还没下来？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065325_1_714b4078:
    # "I couldn't hear anything. Was he still above me?"
    "什么声音也听不到。他还在楼上吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065329_1_d9a6865b:
    # "Assuming that he wasn't coming, I slowly emerged from the partition. Why in the world had they left Katei alone? Trying not to reveal my presence, I approached the staircase and went up to the fourth floor."
    "我猜他不会下来了，便慢慢从隔间里走出来。他们怎么就把 Katei 一个人丢下了？我尽量不让人发现，走到楼梯口，上了四楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065334_1_f4a24ea2:
    # "...There he was. I saw him walking toward the offices, looking a little disoriented."
    "……他在那儿。我看见他朝办公室那边走去，神情有些恍惚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065338_1_04ebdd9b:
    # "Instead of inspecting them, he kept going up to the fifth floor."
    "他没有去查看那些办公室，径直上了五楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065339_1_ca000b13:
    # "Was he going to the attic? If so, why had everyone else gone down?"
    "他要去阁楼？若真如此，其他人又为什么全都下楼了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065346_1_c42b09ad:
    # "From the second floor, I looked down as I kept myself hidden. I could see that someone was in the security room based on the light coming out of it."
    "我躲在二楼，朝下望去。监控室里透出灯光，看来里面有人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065347_1_ff473044:
    # "Then, the event room opened, and I could see a single person's lower legs."
    "接着，活动室的门开了，我只能看见一个人的小腿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065348_1_a79636cc:
    # "Those were Sai's shoes. It seemed everyone was separated, so I couldn't keep going down."
    "那是 Sai 的鞋。看来众人散在各处，我没法再往下走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065349_1_15ca1fc9:
    # "Let me guess. The Sekimeiya is about to have disappeared from the cabinet."
    "让我猜猜。展示柜里的 Sekimeiya 马上就要消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065353_1_99a855ee:
    # "I entered the offices again and stepped into the second so that I wouldn't be seen through the glass."
    "我又进了办公室，躲进第二间，免得被人隔着玻璃看见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065354_1_bb198467:
    # "What...?"
    "什么……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065359_1_76645516:
    # "As soon as I did so, I caught a glimpse of Katei. He was walking toward the crystal floor."
    "我刚躲好，就瞥见了 Katei。他正朝水晶层走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065360_1_62268a0a:
    # "What the hell? Did he not see me?"
    "怎么回事？他没看见我吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065361_1_ebc82697:
    # "He walked past without looking at me. However, his timing left me confused. ...It was like he'd been waiting for me to step aside."
    "他从我身边走过，看都没看我一眼。可这个时机让我很困惑。……就好像他一直在等我让开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065362_1_7894be33:
    # "I couldn't see his hands since they were held to his side, away from me, and he was likely just in the attic... It hasn't been very long, though."
    "他的手放在背对我的那一侧，我看不见，而他刚才大概只是去了阁楼……可这也没过多久啊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065365_1_fa71237e:
    # "I didn't care about it anymore. When they had switched worlds, everyone had been alive. That was what mattered."
    "我不再去想这些。他们切换世界的时候，所有人都还活着。这才要紧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065372_1_b71992d1:
    # "At that time, everyone was alive..."
    "那个时候，所有人都还活着……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065373_1_d650c26d:
    # "However, what about later? The first time we'd changed worlds was still in my memories."
    "可是后来呢？我们第一次切换世界的情形，我还记得清清楚楚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065374_1_d8751bda:
    # "When Erina touched the Sekimeiya in the event room, was the world we appeared in this one? ...Did everyone come back, or was it an entirely different world?"
    "Erina 在活动室里碰到 Sekimeiya 的时候，我们出现的地方就是这个世界吗？……是所有人都回来了，还是那根本是另一个世界？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065375_1_17b9d9d8:
    # "It's gotta be this one, right? Miiya was alive, and we were told Shiroya was the one who died. For them, she hadn't been in the tower yet."
    "只能是这个世界吧？Miiya 还活着，而且他们说死的是 Shiroya。在他们那边，她那时还没进塔。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065376_1_bca3f3b2:
    # "When I remembered it, something else I'd heard made me grimace."
    "想到这里，我又记起听过的另一句话，不禁皱起眉头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065385_1_ee634284:
    # "And you too, Erina! I thought you'd died!"
    "还有你，Erina！我还以为你死了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065394_1_b5c11362:
    # "...Was that the fate lying in wait in the world I was in? Was it not going to be one free of suffering...?"
    "……这就是我所在的世界里等着我的命运吗？这个世界终究不能免于痛苦吗……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065395_1_819bf123:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065397_1_5621c5db:
    # "People came from below. It sounded like it was the group of four: my other self, Miiya, Erina, and Isla. Ignoring the three partitions, they walked up.{w} I could hear their steps above me, but they rapidly faded. ...Their destination was likely the attic."
    "楼下有人上来了。听动静是那四个人：另一个我、Miiya、Erina 和 Isla。他们没理会那三处隔间，径直往上走。{w} 我能听见头顶的脚步声，可很快就远去了。……他们多半是去阁楼了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065403_1_ae667f84:
    # "Then, just as I remembered it, a single person came from the crystal floor and proceeded to walk up, their steps hardly audible. That was repeated two more times, until the number of people who'd left the crystal floor was seven. Everyone had been completely unconcerned with the offices and gone straight up."
    "接着，和我记忆中一样，一个人从水晶层上来，继续往上走，脚步声轻得几乎听不见。如此又重复了两次，从水晶层离开的人一共是七个。所有人都完全没理会那些办公室，径直上楼去了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065405_1_c801e78e:
    # "...They're all above me again, then."
    "……那么，他们又全都在我上面了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065406_1_ffd802de:
    # "I waited in case someone else was yet to appear. A while later, nobody had come, so I cautiously left."
    "我等着，怕还有谁没出现。过了好一阵也没人来，我才小心翼翼地离开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065412_1_4401b45f:
    # "What were they all doing? What had caused those bizarre movements...?"
    "他们到底在做什么？那些古怪的举动是怎么回事……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065413_1_1993db31:
    # "Once again, I had to stop myself when I heard distant voices."
    "又一次，我听见远处传来说话声，只好停下脚步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065414_1_be2bdde0:
    # "...ese would make the noise. Why did you not wa—"
    "……这些会弄出声响。你为什么不等——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065418_1_465ba2ae:
    # "Because I didn't feel like humoring your condescending attitude. Are you satisfied now?"
    "因为我不想惯着你那副居高临下的样子。现在满意了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065419_1_4b2402ad:
    # "Hardly. What do they open? And what's this thing? ...Tape?"
    "差远了。这些是开什么的？还有这个……是什么？……胶带？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065420_1_b375bcf1:
    # "Oh...! I left the duct tape in the security room!{w} It sounds like Katei found it."
    "啊……！我把那卷胶带落在监控室了！{w} 听这意思，是 Katei 找到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065422_1_78127bee:
    # "They kept going up. They wanted to see whether one of the keys Katei had would unlock the attic."
    "他们继续往上，想试试 Katei 手里的某把钥匙能不能打开阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065427_1_d7b57c87:
    # "It did. Once it was unlocked, everyone walked in."
    "果然打开了。锁一开，所有人都走了进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065428_1_24331ffa:
    # "He had the keys. That means he got the keyring that Naomi left behind.{w} Since the attic was locked just now, he definitely locked it while he was up here before."
    "钥匙在他手上。也就是说，他拿到了 Naomi 落下的那串钥匙。{w} 刚才阁楼还是锁着的，那就肯定是他先前待在上面时锁上的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065429_1_14f2f6a2:
    # "I couldn't get closer, so I waited behind. Some minutes later, I heard the elevator once."
    "我没法再靠近，只好在后面等着。过了几分钟，电梯响了一声。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065431_1_a0980876:
    # "...What? Is it working?{w} They just tried it on this floor, and it wasn't..."
    "……什么？电梯能用了？{w} 他们刚刚在这层试过，明明还不行……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065432_1_ca27436c:
    # "While I frowned, I heard people walking out of the attic."
    "我正皱着眉，就听见有人从阁楼里走了出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065437_1_02268183:
    # "I abandoned my thoughts and hid inside the offices, which was all I could do to avoid detection."
    "我抛开思绪，躲进办公室里——要避开他们的目光，我也只能如此。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065438_1_1b682696:
    # "From there, I saw the people who were walking down.{w} Myself, Miiya, and Katei."
    "我从那里看见了往下走的几个人。{w} 我自己、Miiya，还有 Katei。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065439_1_5029ac5d:
    # "The Sekimeiya..."
    "那个 Sekimeiya……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065440_1_44030d93:
    # "Katei was behind them, holding a white Sekimeiya in his hands. Although the two at the front weren't seeing it, pain was written clear across his face."
    "Katei 走在他们后面，双手捧着一个白色的 Sekimeiya。走在前面的两人看不见，可他脸上分明写满了痛苦。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065441_1_5bf670f2:
    # "He's purposely avoiding touching it with his skin! He must be in pain because the Sekimeiya's gathered energy since it was taken out of the cabinet! I bet he can barely hold it."
    "他故意不让皮肤碰到它！Sekimeiya 从展示柜里取出来后一直在蓄能，他现在肯定很痛！我看他快拿不住了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065442_1_1d819253:
    # "They disappeared from my sight. It seemed that the maximum number of occupants, four people, had taken the elevator down."
    "他们从我眼前消失了。看样子，他们坐电梯下去了，正好四个人，满员。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065443_1_874f2e1e:
    # "...Why did he only have one Sekimeiya? What about the other one?"
    "……为什么他只有一个 Sekimeiya？另一个呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065444_1_ab8101b8:
    # "Once there was some distance between us, I went down the floors myself."
    "等和他们拉开一段距离，我才自己逐层下楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065449_1_132b4045:
    # "They're all in the security room. That means the computer's already shut down."
    "他们全都在监控室。也就是说，电脑已经关掉了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065450_1_819f704c:
    # "...Katei has to be responsible. I don't know why they didn't all go to the security room immediately, but this is the same thing he did in the other world."
    "……这一定是 Katei 干的。我不知道他们为什么没有立刻全都赶去监控室，但他在另一个世界就是这么做的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065452_1_5496579b:
    # "A while later, the group went to the lobby. I was able to hear that they'd moved to hallway B, but any distinct sounds quickly faded."
    "过了一会儿，一行人去了大厅。我听出他们转到了 B走廊，但具体的声音很快就听不清了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065453_1_5532d8b4:
    # "...Did they enter a room?"
    "……他们进房间了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065460_1_265b1811:
    # "The indistinct sound was coming from the event room. They'd most likely left the Sekimeiya in the cabinet."
    "那模糊的声音是从活动室传来的。他们多半是把 Sekimeiya 留在了展示柜里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065461_1_6cd5ce69:
    # "It was soon after when they experienced something unnatural for the first time that day."
    "没过多久，他们就在那天第一次遇上了不合常理的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065462_1_efa3db69:
    # "Katei's shout was cut short. Then, voices of incredulity came from hallway A."
    "Katei 的喊声戛然而止。紧接着，A走廊传来难以置信的惊呼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065466_1_679482d4:
    # "...at the fuck?"
    "……搞什么鬼？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065467_1_8a516401:
    # "What— ...just do?"
    "你——……刚才做了什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065468_1_51c4fa28:
    # "...this man just teleport?"
    "……这家伙刚才传送了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065469_1_09738c4f:
    # "A sudden sentence I didn't expect came."
    "突然传来一句我完全没料到的话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065472_1_98a66251:
    # "I just...{w} traveled to the past."
    "我刚刚……{w}回到了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065473_1_da695514:
    # "The reality of their situation was told to them. Naturally, it wasn't something anyone could easily accept."
    "有人把实情告诉了他们。当然，这不是谁都能轻易接受的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065474_1_0f4272fa:
    # "...Why did Katei say that? He just touched the Sekimeiya and appeared in hallway A. ...Why did he immediately say that he'd traveled to the past?"
    "……Katei 为什么会那么说？他明明只是碰了一下 Sekimeiya，就出现在 A走廊。……为什么他立刻就说自己穿越到了过去？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065475_1_8d064e92:
    # "I didn't understand. In my world, he had been completely opposed to the idea of time travel existing for a very long time."
    "我不明白。在我的世界里，他很长一段时间都坚决否认时间穿越的存在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065483_1_7a8e361c:
    # "Despite what had happened, Katei made them shut the Sekimeiya away before walking to the security room."
    "尽管出了这样的事，Katei 还是让他们把 Sekimeiya 收好，然后走向监控室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065484_1_1962e446:
    # "The others remained inside the event room. Wanting to know what they were saying, I approached it slowly."
    "其他人留在了活动室里。我想知道他们在说什么，便慢慢靠近。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065488_1_7e2782aa:
    # "...efinitely working with Naomi. ...isn't being tru—"
    "……肯定和 Naomi 是一伙的。……不可能是真——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065489_1_60656ded:
    # "Unlock i—"
    "打开它——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065490_1_b5a4cb64:
    # "The door wasn't fully shut, but it was difficult to hear what they were saying. I still managed to understand that they had the key to unlock the cabinet."
    "门没有完全关上，可他们的说话声还是很难听清。不过我总算听明白，他们手里有打开展示柜的钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065491_1_166ea256:
    # "...do we touch it?"
    "……我们要碰它吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065492_1_1899b007:
    # "That's me."
    "那是我的声音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065496_1_b02adbee:
    # "...!"
    "……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065497_1_1800e70a:
    # "I realized I'd made a sound. In an attempt to hear better, I'd revealed my presence."
    "我意识到自己出了声。我本想听得更清楚，结果反倒暴露了行踪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065504_1_853bae99:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065509_1_f5c432b0:
    # "When they opened the door, I was already in hallway C. I'd been able to react fast enough."
    "等他们打开门，我已经在 C走廊了。我的反应还算够快。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065510_1_c73a7433:
    # "They started coming out to find who'd been there. A little nervous, I retreated to the second floor."
    "他们出来找刚才待在那里的人。我有些紧张，退到了二楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065517_1_9c5092ba:
    # "...They're looking into every room. I bet they think Naomi made the sound."
    "……他们在逐个查看每个房间。多半是以为那声音是 Naomi 发出来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065518_1_2d8455f9:
    # "I started to get a bit worried, but the sound stopped. They weren't continuing to the other floors."
    "我开始有些担心，声音却停下了。他们没有继续往别的楼层去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065522_1_188f004c:
    # "When I looked down, I saw they were back in the event room."
    "我往下一看，见他们已经回到了活动室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065526_1_d55fbee6:
    # "I stepped forward slowly, making sure not to reveal myself again. They had just learned about time travel, so I really wanted to hear what was happening."
    "我放轻脚步往前走，以免再次暴露。他们刚知道时间穿越这回事，我实在很想听听那边的情况。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065527_1_659e06c9:
    # "...What is my other self thinking?{w} What is he thinking now that he's witnessed time travel for the first time? The events of November 30th... Did they occur as I imagine? If so, I don't have to wonder."
    "……另一个我在想什么？{w}第一次亲眼见到时间穿越，他现在会怎么想？11月30日发生的事……是不是和我设想的一样？如果是，那我就不用再猜了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065528_1_a9108f73:
    # "It seemed Katei was still in the security room, so I got closer to hallway B."
    "看来 Katei 还在监控室，我便向 B走廊靠近了一些。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065532_1_90123f87:
    # "What!?"
    "什么！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065536_1_d5d5377b:
    # "All of a sudden, the cleaning room opened. I stepped aside immediately, but I was able to see who'd been there."
    "清洁间的门忽然开了。我立刻闪到一旁，但还是看见了里面的人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065537_1_8ab9e998:
    # "...Sai. His footsteps grew fainter as he walked to the event room."
    "……是 Sai。他往活动室走去，脚步声渐渐远去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065543_1_3713203e:
    # "However, when I glanced at the hallway, he wasn't there."
    "可是，等我再看走廊时，他已经不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065549_1_a4afb3dd:
    # "He was gone. His disappearance stunned me long enough that I didn't react to a door opening."
    "他消失了。我愣了好一会儿，连门开了都没反应过来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065550_1_375cbdbe:
    # "...!"
    "……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065552_1_504275a8:
    # "By the time I realized what had happened, I was staring into Miiya's eyes. She looked at me from the event room with a curious frown."
    "等我回过神来，已经和 Miiya 四目相对。她站在活动室里，皱着眉，好奇地望着我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065554_1_c8742157:
    # "Should I get closer...?"
    "我要再靠近一点吗……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065555_1_c7e9f202:
    # "I could hardly believe that I was seeing her alive and well. Strangely, her look didn't seem to share the same puzzlement."
    "我几乎不敢相信她还活着，就站在我眼前。奇怪的是，她的神情里并没有同样的困惑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065560_1_64d6e423:
    # "I took a step forward, unable to take my eyes off her."
    "我向前迈了一步，目光无法从她身上移开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065567_1_93cff88e:
    # "So, i-it worked...? You went to the past?"
    "那、那么……成功了？你回到过去了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065568_1_03c1ab9d:
    # "...What?{w} Did the other Atsuki just touch the Sekimeiya?"
    "……什么？{w}另一个 Atsuki 刚才是不是碰了 Sekimeiya？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065570_1_fac4d11c:
    # "Um... Y-Yes. I suppose so."
    "呃……是、是的。应该是吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065571_1_d7f493e8:
    # "I see. That's why Sai disappeared as well."
    "原来如此。难怪 Sai 也不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065572_1_e1b12bbd:
    # "I can't... I can't believe it, though."
    "可是……我还是不敢相信。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065580_1_e650e186:
    # "Is Sai not here?"
    "Sai 不在吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065588_1_866b4296:
    # "Oh, y-you're right. I don't think he's been here for a bit."
    "哦，你、你说得对。他好像有一阵子没在这儿了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065589_1_3cd5d0e6:
    # "He, Katei, and the other Atsuki were missing. The group seemed equally perplexed about Sai's and my own disappearance."
    "他、Katei，还有另一个 Atsuki 都不见了。大家似乎也同样想不通 Sai 和我怎么会消失。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065590_1_915c9137:
    # "...They think I'm the Atsuki who just disappeared. If he traveled to the past, I should leave before he's back."
    "……他们把我当成了刚才消失的那个人。如果他穿越回了过去，我最好赶在他回来之前离开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065591_1_691353c6:
    # "How is this possible...? I don't get it, but if you went to the past, why didn't you appear in this room? That's what happened to Katei."
    "这怎么可能……？我实在想不通。可如果你真回到了过去，为什么没在这个房间里出现？Katei 当时就是这样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065592_1_3824b443:
    # "Hm..."
    "嗯……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065593_1_e29332b0:
    # "Given what I saw, Katei traveled just a few seconds through time. He must have touched the Sekimeiya as soon as it was removed from the cabinet."
    "照我看到的情况，Katei 只穿越了几秒钟。他肯定是在 Sekimeiya 刚被拿出展示柜的时候就碰到了它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065594_1_d147630c:
    # "I don't think I traveled a few seconds through time, but actually minutes. About twenty, I'd say."
    "我觉得自己穿越的不是几秒，而是好几分钟。我看有二十分钟左右。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065595_1_ea398b1f:
    # "I recalled the time they'd unlocked the cabinet again. If the other Atsuki had just touched it, his experience surely resembled what I was describing."
    "我想起他们后来再次解锁展示柜的那次。如果另一个 Atsuki 正是在那时候碰到了它，那他的经历应该和我描述的差不多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065598_1_063a6595:
    # "Oh, what? That long ago, we were still in the attic, right?"
    "什么？那么早……我们还在阁楼里吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065599_1_2f180a0d:
    # "As I nodded, the air around me felt somehow dense. The situation was so surreal that I could hardly believe I was really there."
    "我点了点头，感觉周围的空气莫名发沉。眼前的情形太离奇，我几乎不敢相信自己真的就在这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065608_1_e3fcec77:
    # "I saw the Sekimeiya near the hallway B door, sitting on top of its cushion. It was clearly gray."
    "我看见 Sekimeiya 就在 B走廊的门边，放在垫子上，颜色分明是灰的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065609_1_68562a21:
    # "L-Let me see."
    "让、让我看看。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065610_1_1e2fa6bc:
    # "I placed my hand on it."
    "我把手放了上去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065611_1_0e9da2c7:
    # "It's not doing anything, and it's cold. ...It must do nothing when it's this color.{w} It's just a thought, but maybe I traveled farther because it spent more time out of the cabinet. When Katei touched it, it had barely been out for any time at all."
    "它毫无反应，还是凉的。……变成这种颜色时，它应该就什么也做不了。{w}只是我的猜测——也许是因为它在展示柜外放的时间更长，我才穿越得更远。Katei 碰它的时候，它才刚从柜子里拿出来没多久。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065612_1_234a3730:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065618_1_fce6331e:
    # "While everyone observed me, I put the Sekimeiya in the cabinet. In mere seconds, its white color returned."
    "趁大家打量我的时候，我把 Sekimeiya 放回了展示柜。短短几秒，它又变回了白色。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065619_1_ef3fa353:
    # "This again."
    "又是这样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065631_1_dccac2bc:
    # "...I still can't believe what just happened to me, but I think we should go along with what Katei said and leave this in the cabinet until we can leave."
    "……我到现在还是不敢相信刚才发生在我身上的事。不过我觉得，还是照 Katei 说的做，把它留在展示柜里，直到我们能离开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065632_1_41972049:
    # "The keyring was inserted in the cabinet, so I gave it to Miiya after locking the wheel manually."
    "钥匙串还插在展示柜的锁孔里，我手动把转轮锁好后，才把它交给 Miiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065633_1_728a842e:
    # "I doubt they'll actually do that, but it'd be best if they did. If the Sekimeiya stays in here, all those tragedies won't happen."
    "我很怀疑他们到底会不会照做，不过那样最好。只要 Sekimeiya 留在这里，那些惨剧就都不会发生。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065638_1_c7f3f6af:
    # "...I mean, what else would we do?"
    "……不然还能怎么办？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065644_1_edf71a5e:
    # "...Did you make the sound in hallway B earlier?"
    "……刚才 B走廊的声响是你弄出来的吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065645_1_bcf7aed3:
    # "Oh, yeah, I did. That was when I realized I had really traveled through time. I moved to the second floor fast enough to stay out of sight."
    "哦，对，是我。那时我才意识到自己真的穿越了时间。我及时跑上二楼，才没被你们看见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065650_1_cc57fb20:
    # "That's just insane. ...Were we actually searching for you? Where the hell is Naomi, then?"
    "这也太荒唐了。……那我们刚才找的人，难道是你？Naomi 到底跑哪儿去了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065663_1_be6fd981:
    # "Actually, where is Sai? That's another good question."
    "说起来，Sai 人呢？这倒也是个问题。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065668_1_b678b858:
    # "I know he was with us when we searched this hallway."
    "我记得搜这条走廊的时候，他还跟我们在一起。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065673_1_6deaec69:
    # "Did he go somewhere...?"
    "他是不是去哪儿了……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065676_1_bf56e263:
    # "Akaro looked through multiple doors, but he didn't find Sai."
    "Akaro 接连查看了好几扇门，都没找到 Sai。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065681_1_f02e2f98:
    # "He's not here. Did you see what happened to him?"
    "他不在这儿。你们看见他怎么了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065682_1_1ac1911f:
    # "...No. I was on the second floor, so all I know is that he didn't go up."
    "……没有。我一直在二楼，只知道他没有往上走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065683_1_a4dc4b2c:
    # "He's still here, then..."
    "那么，他还在这栋楼里……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065690_1_ae1fcb7d:
    # "We heard faint sounds coming from the security room."
    "监控室那边传来隐约的声响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065695_1_e4e9af51:
    # "...Only Katei was there. While everyone entered, I stayed near the hallway, ready to leave at any time."
    "……里面只有 Katei。大家进去的时候，我留在走廊附近，随时准备动身。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065700_1_13ca1302:
    # "...Oh, I haven't been able to fix anything. I apologize."
    "……唉，我什么都没能修好。实在抱歉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065701_1_20da72ea:
    # "He's doing the same thing as in my world."
    "他做的事，和我那个世界一模一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065702_1_15b5bc7c:
    # "I am completely lost; I don't even know what the issue is. Everything is properly arranged and connected, so unless no electricity is reaching the outlets, I'm out of ideas."
    "我完全摸不着头脑，连问题出在哪儿都不知道。线路排布、连接都好好的，除非是插座根本没通电，否则我真没别的办法了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065705_1_d907f28f:
    # "Katei crouched under the desk, inspecting things once again."
    "Katei 蹲在桌子底下，又把各处检查了一遍。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065706_1_0addb235:
    # "And you still haven't found Naomi... You were inspecting this floor just now, right?"
    "那 Naomi 还是没找到……你们刚才是在查这一层吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065711_1_a8b87c40:
    # "Yes. She wasn't here."
    "对。她不在这层。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065712_1_765765b3:
    # "That's very strange. She might have been able to keep dodging us, but there's no way that'll work for too long. There's no place where she could hide forever."
    "这就怪了。她或许能一直躲着我们，可这样撑不了太久。这楼里没有哪处能让她永远藏下去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065718_1_1baa3770:
    # "I kept looking at the staircase, wondering where the other Atsuki was. I was sure he had appeared in the past with Sai, but it was unusual that he hadn't shown himself yet.{w} The door to the lobby was open. As it was likely he was on a higher floor, I wanted to leave as soon as I saw him returning."
    "我一直望着楼梯，心里想着另一个我在哪儿。我确信他早已和 Sai 一起出现在了过去，却迟迟不露面，这很反常。{w}通往大厅的门开着。他多半在更高的楼层，我打算一看到他回来就立刻离开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065719_1_ba3d4022:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065721_1_4c3cfaf5:
    # "Wait a second. Am I falling for it again?{w} Katei touched the Sekimeiya and appeared in hallway A. He had just been there, as he'd walked from the security room to the event room.{w} He appeared in a past location! He could've gone to the future."
    "等等。我是不是又上当了？{w}Katei 碰了 Sekimeiya，然后出现在 A走廊。他刚刚才经过那里——从监控室走到活动室。{w}他出现在了过去的地点！可他也可能是去了未来啊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065723_1_59abbcde:
    # "I could see the cabinet in the event room from where I was. What was inside it at that moment was the Future Sekimeiya."
    "从我站的位置能看见活动室里的展示柜。那一刻放在里面的，是未来Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065725_1_bd7cc530:
    # "The only reason they think we went to the past is due to what Katei said. \"I just... traveled to the past.\""
    "他们认定我们去了过去，唯一的依据就是 Katei 那句话。「我只是……穿越到了过去。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065726_1_b891d087:
    # "Why the hell did he say that!? He was carefully holding the Sekimeiya without touching it with his skin, so he knew about its powers...{w} If he had traveled to the past before, it's very likely that's what he assumed just happened again. He went a couple seconds to the future, so he couldn't notice his own misinterpretation. Unless he lied on purpose, I guess."
    "他到底为什么要那么说！？他小心地捧着 Sekimeiya，不让皮肤碰到它，可见他知道它的力量……{w}如果他以前有过穿越到过去的经历，那他很可能会以为这次也是如此。可他其实是去了几秒后的未来，所以察觉不到自己判断错了。除非——他是故意撒谎。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065732_1_6cd918f8:
    # "...Is there anything...{w} Oh, the elevator?"
    "……有什么……{w}咦，电梯？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065733_1_75ca0e59:
    # "Miiya saw that I'd been looking ahead. When she followed my line of sight, she noticed the elevator wasn't properly closed."
    "Miiya 见我一直望着前面，便顺着我的视线看过去，发现电梯没关好。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065734_1_8d6ba780:
    # "It's not closed, yeah."
    "嗯，确实没关上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065735_1_adb9cbb4:
    # "What...?"
    "什么……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065743_1_3a74f947:
    # "Oh, it's been like that for a while. I noticed it when we walked down from the attic and figured the others purposely left it like that."
    "哦，那样有一阵子了。我们从阁楼下来时就看见了，还以为是其他人故意留着的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065744_1_0574e8fe:
    # "We didn't."
    "我们没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065749_1_b143834b:
    # "It must not have closed properly when you got off, then. I've seen it happen in the past."
    "那多半是你们下电梯时没关严。以前也出现过这种情况。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065750_1_2ecb5e67:
    # "Hm, I see. I didn't notice it."
    "嗯，原来如此。我倒没留意。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065755_1_388e949d:
    # "Me neither."
    "我也没注意。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065756_1_fb121fa3:
    # "I wonder what I should do. I can't change my version of what happened, but the other Atsuki didn't travel to the past. ...Neither did Sai. That's why they're not back yet."
    "我该怎么办才好。我改变不了自己经历过的那些事，可另一个我没有穿越到过去……Sai 也没有。所以他们到现在还没回来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065757_1_df2e439a:
    # "What I said still applies, though. They went about twenty minutes to the future. That's when they'll return."
    "不过我先前的说法依然成立。他们去了大约二十分钟后的未来，到那时就会回来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065762_1_e463b4f5:
    # "...Wait, I just remembered the hallway B camera. The one that had its lens completely clean."
    "……等等，我想起 B走廊那台摄像头了。就是镜头上干干净净的那台。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065763_1_07fa2bde:
    # "Oh, they did notice it."
    "哦，他们确实注意到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065769_1_ba002d2f:
    # "Excuse me...?"
    "什么意思……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065774_1_f3002d78:
    # "Right, the one above the door to the lobby."
    "对，就是大厅门上方那一台。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065779_1_13b4930d:
    # "Yeah, and the footage was being displayed up there."
    "嗯，而且那台拍到的画面当时就显示在屏幕上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065784_1_be1da3d9:
    # "Are you serious?"
    "你说真的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065785_1_e7177a0b:
    # "That makes sense. When they went to the security room, the computer wasn't disabled yet."
    "这就说得通了。他们去监控室的时候，电脑还没被停掉。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065789_1_2bd93709:
    # "Katei and Akaro ran out of the room to confirm what we were saying."
    "Katei 和 Akaro 跑出房间，去确认我们说的话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065796_1_0607aa87:
    # "You saw it, right?"
    "你看到了吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065797_1_7a940c85:
    # "What the hell...? Was it cleaned?"
    "怎么回事……？是被人擦过了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065802_1_5473ccfc:
    # "There's no way we would know."
    "我们怎么可能知道。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065803_1_0362bb5d:
    # "...I don't have it anymore, but do you remember when—"
    "……那东西现在不在我手上了，不过你们还记不记得——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065808_1_f0441db9:
    # "Wait, where the hell is Sai?"
    "等等，Sai 到底去哪了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065810_1_aee60310:
    # "Katei was told that Sai had recently vanished. Before he could begin to spit out more of his nonsense, Akaro forced him to hold off."
    "Katei 听说 Sai 刚刚不见了。他正要继续大放厥词，就被 Akaro 拦住了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065815_1_15f77b2c:
    # "What were you gonna say? We've already searched for Sai, and the Sekimeiya's locked in the cabinet."
    "你刚才想说什么？Sai 我们已经找过了，Sekimeiya 也锁在展示柜里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065821_1_b707685c:
    # "...{w}The duct tape, remember? Sai took out my keyring, and it had a piece of duct tape attached to it. That piece had smoke residue on it."
    "……{w}胶带，记得吗？Sai 拿出我的钥匙串时，上面粘着一截胶带。那截胶带上留着烟熏的痕迹。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065826_1_0538937b:
    # "I know it was duct tape because one side was still sticky, which means that it was only hit on the front side. In other words, it was stuck somewhere when the smoke was released."
    "我知道那是胶带，因为它有一面还带着黏性，说明只有正面被烟熏到。也就是说，烟散出来的时候，它正贴在某个地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065831_1_7a68f05f:
    # "Where did it even come from?"
    "那东西到底是从哪来的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065832_1_e69ace15:
    # "...{w}When I walked down to the crystal floor, searching for you, I found it hidden behind a handrail and put it in my pocket to inquire about it. That's when it got stuck to the keyring."
    "……{w}我下到水晶层找你们的时候，发现它被藏在扶手后面，就收进了口袋，打算之后再问清楚；也就是在那时，它粘到了钥匙串上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065833_1_95ee1208:
    # "Hidden behind the handrail? I think it fell to the floor when I was here. He probably found it when he was unplugging some cables."
    "藏在扶手后面？我记得我在这儿的时候它掉到了地上。大概是他拔线缆的时候捡到的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065835_1_053c15c4:
    # "I'd been quiet for a while, so I decided to speak. My voice came out rougher than I intended."
    "我沉默了一会儿，才决定开口。声音比我预想的要沙哑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065836_1_71012f73:
    # "So it was placed on the lens of that camera, which prevented the smoke from hitting it. Afterward, it was removed...{w} I'm confused about a few things. Why would someone do that? They had to already know the smoke attack would happen."
    "所以它是被贴在那台摄像头的镜头上，挡住了烟。之后又被取下来……{w}有几件事我想不通。谁会这么做？他一定事先就知道会有人放烟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065837_1_2cf1b25b:
    # "And it was removed before we entered the security room."
    "而且，它是在我们进入监控室之前就被取下的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065843_1_cb434802:
    # "Katei sighed, dramatically sitting on his chair."
    "Katei 叹了口气，夸张地坐回自己的椅子上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065844_1_03b9a28b:
    # "What the hell is Naomi doing...? We can't even use the computer to figure anything out.{w} Do you all think Sai ran away on his own? Now we need to find both of them."
    "Naomi 到底在搞什么……？连电脑都用不了，什么都查不出来。{w}你们真觉得 Sai 是自己跑掉的？现在两个人全得找。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065845_1_542b1ceb:
    # "We lost track of him when we were searching this hallway, which would've been a good opportunity to sneak away. I have no idea why he'd do that, though."
    "我们在这条走廊里搜寻的时候跟丢了他，那确实是个溜走的好机会。不过，我想不通他为什么要这么做。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065846_1_211f7e44:
    # "Katei, clearly agitated, pressed the computer's power button again while looking at all the blank monitors."
    "Katei 明显焦躁不安，一边盯着满墙漆黑的显示器，一边又按了一下电脑的电源键。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065848_1_f65ed2f2:
    # "Maybe now you can believe that he was the one up to something. I'm just trying to do my job."
    "也许现在你们该相信，真正有鬼的人是他。我只是想做好分内的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065850_1_f14ce796:
    # "None of us responded. For some reason, everyone looked tired. It seemed no one had the will to go find Sai."
    "谁都没有应声。不知为何，每个人看上去都很疲惫，似乎谁也没力气去找 Sai。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065851_1_b60812e4:
    # "I remained quiet along with them, but that was because I was counting the seconds. I figured it had been close to twenty minutes since the other Atsuki and Sai had disappeared."
    "我也和他们一样沉默，但我是在数着秒。我估摸着，另一个我和 Sai 已经消失快二十分钟了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065852_1_bb3fae85:
    # "The empty screens were the only place anyone was looking. That was all I needed to silently escape, retreating until I was safely in the lobby."
    "所有人的目光都落在那些空白的屏幕上。这已足够让我悄悄脱身，一路退到大厅里才停下。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065865_1_57f36036:
    # "Nobody noticed that I'd left. Soon after my departure, Sai and the other Atsuki returned."
    "没人察觉我离开了。我走后不久，Sai 和另一个 Atsuki 就回来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065869_1_3f0c86d3:
    # "I wondered what would happen next. Would they realize what had occurred? Two Sekimeiya had been hidden somewhere, and just like in my world, their very existence was concealed."
    "不知道接下来会怎样。他们会发现发生了什么吗？两个 Sekimeiya 被藏在了某处，和我所在的世界一样，它们的存在本身被隐瞒了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065870_1_616669c8:
    # "During the time I'd been hiding in the storeroom, there was an extended period of complete silence; I'd only heard sporadic footsteps every now and then."
    "我躲在储藏室里的那段时间，有很长一阵子一点声音都没有，只偶尔传来几声零星的脚步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065874_1_fe7f3dca:
    # "Although my perspective had grown wider, that was all that happened. However, I was able to understand it better from a distance, keeping my presence a secret thanks to the layout of the floor."
    "虽然我的视野开阔了些，但也仅此而已。不过，多亏了这一层的布局，我能藏住身形，从远处反倒看得更清楚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065878_1_b13cf5ff:
    # "The people in the security room split up. Atsuki, Miiya, Sai, and Katei went up the stairs. For a very long time, Atsuki and Miiya didn't come back."
    "监控室里的人散了。Atsuki、Miiya、Sai 和 Katei 上了楼梯。Atsuki 和 Miiya 很久都没有回来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065879_1_ebd8ad6d:
    # "Meanwhile, although calmness seemed to permeate the crystal floor, that was far from the truth."
    "与此同时，水晶层看似一片平静，实则远非如此。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065880_1_2ec016d5:
    # "Sai and Katei had returned. Everyone who I knew was on the crystal floor wanted the Sekimeiya. Not just the one in the cabinet, but the two hidden ones as well."
    "Sai 和 Katei 回来了。据我所知，水晶层上的每个人都想要 Sekimeiya。不只是展示柜里那一个，还有藏起来的那两个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065881_1_59acd3a5:
    # "I saw it with my own eyes. When Katei thought no one was watching, he took the Future Sekimeiya. The cabinet was locked, so he had a spare key."
    "我亲眼看见了。Katei 趁没人注意，取走了未来Sekimeiya。展示柜是锁着的，说明他另有一把钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065882_1_e2487aed:
    # "Then, he brought it to room B4. Strangely, like in the previous world, he chose not to hide it in the storeroom's secret area."
    "随后他把它带去了水晶展室 B4。奇怪的是，和上一个世界一样，他没有把它藏进储藏室的秘密之处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065883_1_c69cfe81:
    # "At that point, I realized that I'd been mistaken. I wasn't the only one to notice Katei."
    "那一刻我才明白自己错了。注意到 Katei 的，并不只有我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065884_1_84ff507c:
    # "After he left, it was Akaro who entered that room, hiding the Sekimeiya behind his back as he stepped out."
    "他离开之后，进那间房的人是 Akaro——出来时，他把 Sekimeiya 藏在身后。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065887_1_b49f5e5d:
    # "They both wanted to obtain all the Sekimeiya, and it became evident that Akaro and Katei weren't working together. Along with Sai, they continued silently working toward their objective."
    "Akaro 和 Katei 都想拿到所有的 Sekimeiya，但两人显然不是一伙的。再加上 Sai，三人继续沉默地朝各自的目标行动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065888_1_37eb6f9d:
    # "At one point, Erina and Isla remained in one of hallway A's crystal rooms, while the other Atsuki and Miiya were likely in the attic. It was hard to decipher everyone's goal, but all I wanted was to let the minutes keep passing without interruptions."
    "有那么一阵，Erina 和 Isla 待在 A走廊的一间水晶展室里，另一个 Atsuki 和 Miiya 则多半在阁楼。我摸不清每个人究竟想做什么，只希望时间就这么一分一分过去，不被打断。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065893_1_9f6b8574:
    # "It had been a while since Katei had entered one of the crystal rooms. ...I knew one of the Sekimeiya was there."
    "Katei 进那间水晶展室已经有一阵子了。……我知道那里放着一个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065897_1_7106319f:
    # "Had he activated it? I looked through the door and saw an open cabinet. Inside, there was a gray Sekimeiya."
    "他启动它了吗？我从门口望进去，只见展示柜敞着，里面放着一个灰色 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065898_1_775c8924:
    # "I figured that he would've traveled more than an hour through time, and the fact that I hadn't seen him yet seemed to imply he'd gone to the future."
    "我估计他穿越的时间超过了一个小时。既然到现在都没见到他，那他多半是去了未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065903_1_62a9ffc6:
    # "It appeared Katei was out of the picture, but Sai and Akaro were still around. When I saw them, they were looking for Katei, but they located the Future Sekimeiya instead."
    "看来 Katei 已经出局了，但 Sai 和 Akaro 还在。我看见他们时，他们正在找 Katei，结果却找到了未来Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065904_1_55dbff12:
    # "Since they were together, neither one revealed their true colors, and they brought it to its cabinet."
    "两人同行，谁也没露出真面目，只把它送回了原来的展示柜。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065905_1_a4c84a4b:
    # "...However, as expected, it was Akaro who later took it out again."
    "……可后来再次把它取出来的，果然还是 Akaro。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065910_1_8c51e469:
    # "I was witnessing a bizarre play. No matter how many details I was missing, their movements felt ridiculous. I considered that they might have been relocating the Sekimeiya so early in the off chance the shutter opened before the deadline."
    "我像是在看一出荒诞的戏。不管我漏掉了多少细节，他们的举动都显得可笑。我猜想，他们之所以这么早就把 Sekimeiya 挪来挪去，是怕卷帘门在期限之前就打开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065914_1_d512efce:
    # "The same thing repeated. The Sekimeiya was found in one of the drawers in the lobby. That time, when they brought it to the cabinet, I heard what they were saying."
    "同样的一幕又重演了。有人在大厅的一个抽屉里找到了那个 Sekimeiya。这回他们把它送回展示柜时，我听见了他们的谈话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065915_1_5811c95a:
    # "They were blaming the people who'd disappeared. Although they themselves were responsible, Katei, the other Atsuki, and Miiya were the hidden culprits according to their narrative. It appeared they had locked themselves up in the attic."
    "他们在指责那些消失的人。明明该负责的是他们自己，可照他们的说法，Katei、另一个 Atsuki 和 Miiya 才是藏在暗处的元凶——那几个人似乎把自己关进了阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065919_1_8b5ba14a:
    # "Of course, the Sekimeiya didn't remain in the cabinet for long. However, as I saw it being brought to the lobby, a sound in hallway A caught my ear."
    "当然，那个 Sekimeiya 没在展示柜里待多久。可是，就在我看着它被送回大厅时，A走廊里传来一个声音，引起了我的注意。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065926_1_63505bf2:
    # "The other Atsuki and Miiya were back. I saw them in the security room.{w} I didn't understand what they'd been doing. ...Why would they have locked themselves in the attic? And why had they returned?{w} Suddenly, a sound drew them to the lobby."
    "另一个 Atsuki 和 Miiya 回来了。我看见他们进了监控室。{w}我不明白他们此前在做什么。……他们为什么要把自己关在阁楼里？又为什么回来了？{w}忽然，一个声响把他们引向了大厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065927_1_da19dc35:
    # "...I had already been in the tower for hours. I didn't think a lot of time was left until they would all vanish from the bottom floor."
    "……我在塔里已经待了好几个小时。恐怕要不了多久，他们就会从底层全部消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065928_1_5bdb8991:
    # "I'd tried to keep my distance from everyone, but seeing Miiya again made me slowly approach the entrance area."
    "我一直尽量与所有人保持距离，可是再次见到 Miiya，我不由得慢慢朝入口那边走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065933_1_1f82c30b:
    # "I stood next to the far door. ...Were they on the other side of it? I couldn't hear anyone."
    "我站在最里面那扇门旁。……他们就在门后吗？我什么都听不见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065934_1_0f85cdbe:
    # "Instead, the faint voices I heard came from the event room."
    "我听见的微弱人声，其实来自活动室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065937_1_cd1ad88b:
    # "I was instantly alarmed. If they looked at the hallway, I would be seen.{w} I couldn't go to the lobby, and walking back could lead to me being noticed."
    "我顿时警觉起来。只要他们往走廊这边看一眼，就会发现我。{w}我不能去大厅，往回走也可能被人注意到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065938_1_e1e07cb2:
    # "...Wait. Erina and Isla aren't there anymore."
    "……等等。Erina 和 Isla 已经不在那儿了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065941_1_09bb4db5:
    # "The door of room A1 was slightly open. It made me gasp at first, but I quickly saw that the room was empty."
    "水晶展室 A1 的门虚掩着。我起初吓了一跳，但很快就看清房里空无一人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065942_1_2553fd20:
    # "...Are they the ones in the event room, then?"
    "……那活动室里的人，就是她们了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065946_1_6f9e14af:
    # "I didn't have time to think, so I stepped in."
    "我顾不上多想，便走了进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065952_1_61054ed2:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065953_1_70342b1a:
    # "I stayed tense by the door, unaware of whether I could leave. Someone was in the event room, and I didn't know their identity."
    "我紧绷着身子守在门边，不知道自己能不能出去。活动室里有人，我却不知道是谁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065954_1_53c62653:
    # "...However, I couldn't hear anything from the lobby. Maybe they were no longer there."
    "……可大厅那边毫无声响。也许他们已经不在那儿了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065958_1_c3dec621:
    # "I got closer to the wall and tried to listen through it."
    "我凑近墙壁，想隔着墙听个究竟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065960_1_89de4fd0:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065961_1_8573aa98:
    # "Nothing."
    "什么也没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065966_1_3b294c73:
    # "I didn't want to leave without being sure, but my fear was that Erina and Isla would return."
    "没确认清楚之前，我不想就这么走开，可又怕 Erina 和 Isla 会回来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065967_1_096fa135:
    # "I could hear sporadic sounds, likely coming from the event room. They kept me trapped behind that door for minutes until I noticed someone walking on the other side."
    "断断续续的声响，多半来自活动室。那声音害得我躲在那扇门后好几分钟，直到察觉有人在另一侧走动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065968_1_1f5b83ca:
    # "Their faint steps went off to the lobby, which let me release the breath I'd been holding."
    "轻微的脚步声朝大厅远去了，我这才把憋着的那口气吐出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065969_1_a603340b:
    # "When I put my ear against the wall, the area still sounded vacant. That time, though, I knew for sure that someone was there."
    "我把耳朵贴上墙壁时，那一带听上去依旧空荡荡的。可这一次，我确信那里有人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065971_1_27f0ad8f:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065975_1_4a0ce2a3:
    # "I focused intently. Suddenly, I heard an unexpected voice."
    "我屏息凝神。忽然，一个意想不到的声音传了过来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065977_1_2cb7ce8b:
    # "...ou there?"
    "……有人吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065979_1_de638462:
    # "What?{w} ...Who is that?"
    "什么？{w}……那是谁？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065980_1_9b7ed826:
    # "...es! ...ower!"
    "……对！……塔里！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065981_1_a88fabe6:
    # "I was shocked. That voice didn't belong to anyone who should've been in the tower."
    "我吃了一惊。那声音不属于任何本该待在塔里的人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065984_1_3d9a50b5:
    # "I turned my head abruptly. ...Had someone just come out of the security room?{w} I was fairly sure I'd sensed that, but I kept paying attention to the lobby."
    "我猛地转过头。……刚刚是有人从监控室出来了吗？{w}我几乎确定自己察觉到了动静，却还是继续留意着大厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065987_1_2c7fc5c2:
    # "The next time I heard it, the intensity of the voice was higher."
    "再次听到时，那声音更响了些。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065988_1_151e03eb:
    # "Hey! ...there!"
    "喂！……那边！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065989_1_29d49aaf:
    # "That was enough to let me confirm who it was."
    "这一声就足够让我确认那是谁了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065990_1_069117b3:
    # "Suripo...! That's him!"
    "Suripo……！是他！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065994_1_d6d0373f:
    # "It was absurd for him to be inside, but I couldn't worry about it. I had to concentrate on what was happening behind the wall."
    "他出现在塔里实在荒唐，可此刻我顾不上这些。我必须专心听墙后的动静。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065996_1_e318ca6e:
    # "Someone ran. That was all I could make out.{w} Then, a noise like someone collapsing."
    "有人跑了起来。我只分辨得出这些。{w}紧接着，传来一声像是有人倒下的响动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065997_1_767fbbe0:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L065998_1_7e321d96:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066000_1_38e61576:
    # "...{w}What? Is he gone?"
    "……{w}怎么回事？他不见了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066001_1_2c8707ba:
    # "The next thing I heard didn't come from the direction of the lobby. It came from the wall behind me."
    "接下来我听到的声音并不是从大厅方向来的，而是从我身后的墙壁那边传来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066004_1_09650dc5:
    # "Is... someone there?"
    "有……有人吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066005_1_d40ea0b6:
    # "Behind it should've been one of hallway B's crystal rooms, B1."
    "那面墙后面，应该是B走廊的一间水晶展室，B1。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066006_1_e4b15de8:
    # "...But, again, that was the last sound I heard before silence enveloped the building once more."
    "……然而，那同样是我听到的最后一点声响。之后，整栋建筑再度陷入沉寂。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066012_1_feea0923:
    # "I hadn't been mistaken. I'd heard Suripo's voice coming from the lobby."
    "我没有听错。从大厅传来的确实是 Suripo 的声音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066013_1_a4476158:
    # "Could the shutter have unlocked? There was no way. I knew the tower would be sealed off for quite a while longer."
    "难道是卷帘门解锁了？不可能。我很清楚，这座塔还要封闭很长一段时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066014_1_dc6428bb:
    # "How? How the hell was that Suripo? How did he get in?"
    "怎么会？那怎么可能是 Suripo？他是怎么进来的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066015_1_4cb82c53:
    # "Did he enter through the storeroom?{w} No. What am I thinking? My past self is currently there."
    "难道是从储藏室进来的？{w}不对。我在想什么？过去的我此刻就在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066016_1_3264772b:
    # "I wanted to see it with my own eyes, but I couldn't afford to leave; I didn't know where anyone was."
    "我真想亲眼看看，可我不能离开——我根本不知道其他人都在哪儿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066022_1_e9e0f146:
    # "Hallway A sounded empty as well, but I remained in that room. A short time later, faraway sounds made it clear I wasn't alone. I continued to bide my time in the hope that everyone else would congregate and I'd be able to slip away."
    "A走廊那边听上去也没有人，但我仍旧守在那间屋里。没过多久，远处传来的动静让我明白，这里并不只有我一个人。我继续耐着性子等待，盼着其他人聚到一处，好让我能趁机溜走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066024_1_b688a608:
    # "Wh—!"
    "什——！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066025_1_c4d64541:
    # "...!"
    "……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066026_1_c623ce01:
    # "After a few minutes had passed, a sudden gasp caused my eyes to shoot wide open. Miiya was behind the door, and I could hear myself as well."
    "几分钟后，一声突如其来的惊呼让我猛地睁大了眼睛。Miiya 就在门后，我也听见了自己的声音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066027_1_a8fe569d:
    # "Oh...!{w} D-Did I just appear out of nowhere?"
    "啊……！{w}我、我是刚刚凭空出现的吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066028_1_93c7e7cb:
    # "What...? No, that's what happened to me."
    "什么……？不，突然出现的人是我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066029_1_c2752c03:
    # "...Wait."
    "……等等。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066030_1_c410d428:
    # "Were you just in the mechanical room?"
    "你刚才在机械室？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066031_1_c8ba95f1:
    # "Yes... I touched the Sekimeiya a second ago."
    "是……我刚刚碰了 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066032_1_70689003:
    # "I showed up here as soon as you did that. Are we in the past...?"
    "你刚碰完，我就出现在这里了。我们是在过去吗……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066033_1_c3613962:
    # "...{w}It teleported you as well? How come that didn't happen the other times?"
    "……{w}连你也一起传送了？为什么之前几次没发生这种事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066034_1_222225be:
    # "And both of us appeared here..."
    "而且我们两个都出现在这里……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066037_1_9e5da644:
    # "Hey! What the fuck...!? Where have you two been!?"
    "喂！这他妈怎么回事……！？你们俩到底去哪儿了！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066038_1_505fdb12:
    # "That's Sai. I'm pretty sure he's in the event room."
    "是 Sai。他应该就在活动室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066039_1_f7eeb891:
    # "...Has anything happened?"
    "……发生什么事了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066040_1_8bc7ed89:
    # "What...!? You've been gone for over two hours! Answer the question!"
    "什么……！？你们已经消失两个多小时了！回答我的问题！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066041_1_be247e4d:
    # "So this is the first time they've seen Miiya and the other Atsuki since they went upstairs."
    "也就是说，自从 Miiya 和另一个我上楼之后，这是他们第一次见到我俩。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066042_1_0481a3d6:
    # "They were in the security room earlier, though. They weren't seen because they traveled to the future. The Future Sekimeiya was brought to the lobby, and they activated it. They just appeared in front of the security room, where they were in the past."
    "不过他们之前确实在监控室。之所以没人看见，是因为他们穿越到了未来。未来Sekimeiya 被带到了大厅，他们启动了它。于是他们直接出现在监控室门前——那正是他们过去待的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066046_1_1ffdaf92:
    # "They were in the event room, but I couldn't pick up anything.{w} That was until Sai yelled."
    "他们就在活动室，可我什么也听不清。{w}直到 Sai 大吼了一声。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066050_1_396d88b7:
    # "...H-Hey! What the fuck have you been doing!?"
    "……喂、喂！你他妈到底在干什么！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066051_1_a9b80166:
    # "You found them too...?"
    "你们也找到了……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066052_1_8c9a0b45:
    # "Akaro's voice came from the hallway."
    "Akaro 的声音从走廊里传来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066053_1_2395de2a:
    # "...ere sleeping alo— ...you been?"
    "……一个人睡——……去哪儿了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066054_1_b09e9f00:
    # "...I've been here.{w} *sigh*"
    "……我一直在这儿。{w}（叹气）"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066055_1_a4131f56:
    # "Oh...! Katei's here again!"
    "哦……！Katei 又出现了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066056_1_21a7419c:
    # "...here this whole time. I didn't go anywhere."
    "……一直在这儿。我哪儿也没去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066057_1_7661c4c3:
    # "His words suddenly connected the dots. I understood what had happened."
    "他的话忽然把一切串了起来。我明白了究竟发生了什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066058_1_1cb13333:
    # "...Right. Katei went to the future a while ago. The range was large, so I bet it barely reached outside the tower.{w} It reached far enough to include Suripo, and they went far forward in time.{w} The locations match. Before the attack, Suripo was in the lobby, near the front door. At the time, Katei was still in the security room. That's where they appeared just now.{w} Those locations are from a time before the smoke was released; Katei's clothes should have no smoke on them. They were pretty clean anyway, so I doubt anyone would notice that."
    "……没错。Katei 刚才去了未来。范围很大，我猜它勉强够到了塔外。{w}但已经远到把 Suripo 也包了进去，于是他们一起跳到了很久之后。{w}位置也对得上。袭击发生前，Suripo 就在大厅靠近正门的地方；而当时 Katei 还在监控室。Katei 刚才正是在那里出现的。{w}这两处位置的时间都在烟雾释放之前，所以 Katei 的衣服上不该沾到烟。再说那身衣服本来就挺干净的，我想没人会注意到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066062_1_a7afbc96:
    # "Katei and Akaro had entered the event room, so I gave up on understanding what they were saying."
    "Katei 和 Akaro 已经进了活动室，我也就放弃了听清他们在说什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066063_1_2b3a4c48:
    # "Where the hell is Suripo now, though!?"
    "可 Suripo 现在到底在哪儿！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066064_1_9a1fa8ee:
    # "Where was he when I was in the attic experimenting with the Sekimeiya? Did he change worlds as well?"
    "我在阁楼试验 Sekimeiya 的时候，他又在哪里？他也切换了世界吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066069_1_f1769a6c:
    # "Wh...! ...you hear that!?"
    "什……！……你们听见了吗！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066070_1_9842b33c:
    # "Huh?"
    "嗯？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066071_1_ced79ddf:
    # "My own voice shouted those words. I frowned, as I hadn't heard anything."
    "那是我自己的声音在喊。我皱起眉，因为我什么也没听见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066072_1_11dbc51d:
    # "Everyone came out of the event room and approached the lobby."
    "众人纷纷走出活动室，朝大厅走来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066074_1_6c244f42:
    # "Who...{w} is this?"
    "这……{w}这是谁？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066075_1_e569f973:
    # "Oh, Suripo's still there."
    "哦，Suripo 还在那儿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066076_1_7b535e7d:
    # "...It was the next person to talk who left me in a daze."
    "……而接下来开口的那个人，让我彻底怔住了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066077_1_dbb9644d:
    # "Ah! Isla, stay over there!"
    "啊！Isla，你待在那边别动！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066078_1_fd3913fd:
    # "What?"
    "什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066079_1_e04fe388:
    # "Isn't he...!?"
    "他该不会是……！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066080_1_8365958d:
    # "Wait, I recognize him too. Wasn't he there?"
    "等等，我也认得他。他之前不就在那边吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066081_1_405e5c34:
    # "Y-Yes... That's where I s-saw him, while we were waiting. Fuck."
    "对、对……我们等着的时候，我就是在那里看、看见他的。妈的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066082_1_99dcfe1b:
    # "That terror in my voice... It was easily recognizable."
    "我声音里的那股恐惧……任谁都听得出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066083_1_2881f9a4:
    # "Don't tell me..."
    "难道说……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066086_1_14413ceb:
    # "They all stepped in."
    "他们全都走了进来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066090_1_7bba6322:
    # "...een here at the tower recently. I don't know his name, but he was inves— ...attack."
    "……他最近一直在塔里。我不知道他叫什么，不过他一直在调查——……袭击。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066091_1_37599e68:
    # "...{w}This is a knife wound."
    "……{w}这是刀伤。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066092_1_a026381d:
    # "No way... A knife wound?"
    "怎么可能……刀伤？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066093_1_cb348b6f:
    # "I couldn't believe what I was hearing. Suripo had been killed? ...I'd never looked at the lobby."
    "我不敢相信自己听到的话。Suripo 被杀了？……我始终没往大厅那边看过一眼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066094_1_6b78fd8d:
    # "You've been missing for the last three hours. Just as you reappear— ...no coincidence."
    "你消失了整整三个小时。偏偏就在你重新出现的时候—— ……绝非巧合。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066095_1_0ebac8fb:
    # "What the hell are you talking about? How would I have left!?"
    "你在胡说些什么？我怎么可能出得去！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066096_1_3bbfff94:
    # "I cannot believe what I'm hearing! I've been here the entire time!"
    "我简直不敢相信自己的耳朵！我一直都在这儿！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066097_1_5ae31791:
    # "Yes, look at this! This is why I thought it must've been a knife. It was his own!"
    "对，你看看这个！所以我才觉得一定是刀伤。那是他自己的刀！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066098_1_3c7bc9a4:
    # "...his knife is gone. ...saw that he had a knife right here—"
    "……他的刀不见了。……我明明看到这里有一把刀——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066099_1_19d781c5:
    # "Wait... the knife was Suripo's?"
    "等等……那把刀是 Suripo 的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066100_1_da67e91c:
    # "If that's the case, the knife Sai chased us with... Where the hell did he get it from?"
    "如果是这样，那 Sai 追我们时拿的那把刀……他到底是从哪儿弄来的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066105_1_cbf37217:
    # "They found a walkie-talkie on him, but it seemed it had been damaged, and its battery was missing."
    "他们在他身上找到了一台对讲机，但似乎已经损坏，电池也不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066106_1_6dd65b7c:
    # "This happened just now. When I heard him talking, he was having a conversation with the policemen outside."
    "事情就发生在刚才。我听见他说话的时候，他正在和外面的警察对话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066107_1_5831fe8e:
    # "Who the hell would've killed Suripo immediately after seeing him? I distinctly remembered that someone had entered the lobby seconds before I'd heard his voice."
    "究竟是谁，一见到 Suripo 就立刻下了杀手？我清楚地记得，在我听见他的声音前几秒，有人走进了大厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066108_1_60595636:
    # "And breaking the walkie-talkie... Was that done so that the group couldn't communicate with the outside, or was it done so that Suripo couldn't keep talking to them?"
    "还有砸坏对讲机……是为了让他们无法和外界联系，还是为了让 Suripo 没法继续说下去？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066109_1_fff77f54:
    # "Listening to the conversation, I grew a bit more confused.{w} According to the other me, Suripo hadn't been dead six minutes previously, so nobody could've killed him."
    "听着他们的对话，我越发糊涂了。{w}按另一个我的说法，六分钟前 Suripo 还没死，那就不可能有人杀他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066110_1_fc3f4812:
    # "But that's wrong. He was dead six minutes ago.{w} Why is he saying that? ...Six minutes ago, I bet that version of me was already traveling to the future. There's no way he saw the lobby. Miiya's agreeing with him, though."
    "可那不对。六分钟前他就已经死了。{w}他为什么这么说？……六分钟前，那个我那时应该已经在往未来穿越了，根本不可能看到大厅。可 Miiya 却附和他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066113_1_a1b911d1:
    # "As I kept listening, I understood that their misinterpretation was the same—they thought they had gone to the past. If that was the case, none of them could have killed Suripo."
    "继续听下去，我明白了他们的误解如出一辙——都以为自己回到了过去。若真是如此，他们谁都不可能杀死 Suripo。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066114_1_ec46fe4e:
    # "This doesn't make sense, though. Sai just said it's {time=13:23.}"
    "可这说不通。Sai 刚才说现在是 {time=13:23.}"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066115_1_fdeb4531:
    # "That's what led Atsuki to say that Suripo was alive six minutes ago. At {time=13:17}, they'd seen the lobby was empty."
    "正因如此，Atsuki 才会说六分钟前 Suripo 还活着。{time=13:17} 的时候，他们看到大厅空无一人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066116_1_103f7c51:
    # "For that to make sense, the other Atsuki had to know the time before traveling to the future. But if he knew the time before traveling, hearing the time Sai gave should've revealed that they went to the future."
    "要说得通，另一个 Atsuki 必须在穿越前就知道时间。可如果他穿越前就知道，听到 Sai 报出的时刻，就该明白自己是去了未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066118_1_5d534fe4:
    # "...{w}Oh!{w} That's not actually right!"
    "……{w}啊！{w}不对，其实不是这样！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066121_1_c76094d9:
    # "At {time=13:17}, the lobby was empty. That was before they traveled to the future, and somehow, they knew what the time was. They just said that they touched the Sekimeiya in the mechanical room."
    "在 {time=13:17}，大厅还是空的。那是在他们穿越到未来之前，而他们不知怎么就知道了当时的时刻。他们刚才说，他们在机械室碰了 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066122_1_71aa5320:
    # "More than twenty minutes have passed since I saw them in the security room, which was right after the Future Sekimeiya was taken out of the cabinet. Since they reappeared in hallway A, they went ten minutes to the future once the Sekimeiya had gathered power for ten minutes. Something like that."
    "我在监控室看到他们时，未来Sekimeiya 刚从展示柜里取出，到现在已经过了二十多分钟。既然他们重新出现在 A走廊，那就是 Sekimeiya 蓄能十分钟后，他们向未来跳了十分钟。大概是这么回事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066123_1_e48624f7:
    # "Atsuki and Miiya appeared at around {time=13:37.} The key to this is Sai's wristwatch."
    "Atsuki 和 Miiya 大约在 {time=13:37.} 现身。关键就在 Sai 的手表上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066124_1_d595acb1:
    # "Earlier, Sai traveled to the future with Atsuki, which I deduced was almost twenty minutes to the future. So, ever since they appeared, Sai's watch has been more than half an hour behind. I'm sure that contributed to them thinking they'd gone to the past the first time."
    "先前 Sai 和 Atsuki 一起穿越到未来，我推断差不多是往前跳了二十分钟。所以他们现身之后，Sai 的表一直慢了大半个小时。他们第一次误以为回到了过去，肯定也是这个原因。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066125_1_435e74bd:
    # "Sai just said it's {time=13:23}, but his watch is still behind. The computer isn't on, so he's not going to recognize that.{w} That's what's making Atsuki and Miiya think they've gone to the past again. They think they appeared back at {time=13:23} and that Suripo has just been killed."
    "Sai 刚才说现在是 {time=13:23}，可他的表还是慢的。电脑没开，他也没法察觉。{w}正因为这样，Atsuki 和 Miiya 才以为又回到了过去——他们以为自己回到了 {time=13:23}，而 Suripo 刚刚遇害。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066130_1_da6dff1d:
    # "Sai went to the mechanical room, where he was told the Future Sekimeiya was. However, he came back claiming he hadn't found it."
    "Sai 去了机械室——据说未来Sekimeiya就在那里。可他回来说没找到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066131_1_43a4a71b:
    # "...was right. They're lying."
    "……说得没错。他们在撒谎。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066132_1_0929b42c:
    # "I see. They said that the point they traveled to the past just happened. That means the Future Sekimeiya should've still been there."
    "原来如此。他们说自己穿越回过去的那个时间点刚刚才发生。那就是说，未来Sekimeiya当时应该还在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066133_1_efc23f67:
    # "In reality, it wouldn't surprise me if Suripo's killer took it several minutes ago. When the killer entered the lobby, the door to the mechanical room could easily have been left open by Miiya and the other Atsuki."
    "实际上，就算凶手几分钟前把它拿走了，我也不意外。凶手进大厅的时候，机械室的门很可能是 Miiya 和另一个 Atsuki 没关上的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066134_1_d577263e:
    # "They went down and found the Sekimeiya. Then, after they came back up, Suripo was there."
    "他们下楼找到了 Sekimeiya。然后回到楼上，Suripo 就在那儿了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066135_1_308fcc01:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066136_1_bcfdc773:
    # "Atsuki walked down the stairs to look for himself. Soon, he returned, admitting that the Sekimeiya was no longer there."
    "Atsuki 亲自下楼去看了一趟。没多久他就回来，承认 Sekimeiya 已经不在那儿了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066140_1_44d660e0:
    # "Added to the fact that Naomi hasn't been found, you can't possibly think we did this, right?"
    "再加上 Naomi 至今下落不明，你总不会觉得是我们干的吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066141_1_cbaca7d3:
    # "You didn't?"
    "不是你们？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066142_1_2df0a835:
    # "There's n-no way. I think Naomi's the first— ...ot only has she managed to remain hidden, but she also might have the same keys that we have."
    "绝、绝不可能。我想 Naomi 才是头号嫌疑人——……她不但一直藏得好好的，手里可能还有和我们一样的钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066143_1_7eb2d9ca:
    # "There are no cameras here, but we don't know if they're recording in the first place... —idn't inspect the whole building because you thought we were in the attic— ...have to be missing something that the culprit is aware of. Could there be a place we're ignoring?"
    "这里没有摄像头，可我们也不知道它们到底有没有在录像……你说过，你以为我们在阁楼，所以没把整栋楼查遍，对吧？我们一定漏掉了什么，而凶手知道那是什么。会不会有个地方一直被我们忽略了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066144_1_a8619d60:
    # "...That's impossible."
    "……不可能。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066145_1_3f9f05af:
    # "If not, then one of you did this. Naomi's disappearance should be enough proof that we're missing something, though."
    "若不是这样，那就是你们当中有人下的手。不过，Naomi 的失踪已经足以证明我们漏掉了什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066147_1_f28d39f9:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066148_1_25cd226e:
    # "We have to find her or whoever else is here. It's almost guara— ...since this morning, and we didn't find him. ...more likely than some hidden passage."
    "我们得找到她，或者找到还在这栋楼里的其他人。几乎可以肯定，他从早上起就一直待在这栋楼里，我们却没发现他。这比什么隐藏通道要合理得多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066149_1_4ee00857:
    # "If it's neither of those, there's still an answer with the Sekimeiya. This policeman could've come from the future if he touched the Sekimeiya after {time=21}, and Naomi could've left the tower by going far to the past. We found the Seki— ...where it is now."
    "如果这两者都不是，那还可以用 Sekimeiya 来解释。要是这名警察在 {time=21} 之后碰过 Sekimeiya，他可能是从未来来的；Naomi 也可能穿越到遥远的过去，就此离开了这座塔。我们在阁楼找到了 Sekimeiya，如今却不知道它在哪儿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066150_1_4859ca8e:
    # "We'll look everywhere. Not only could people still be hiding, but the Sekimeiya has to be somewhere too. I can't imagine the real person responsible doesn't know where."
    "每个地方都要搜。不仅可能还有人藏着，Sekimeiya 也一定在某处。我不信真正的凶手会不知道它在哪儿。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066151_1_13a1cc86:
    # "Go ahead and find Naomi for us."
    "那就麻烦你去把 Naomi 找出来吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066156_1_259613f0:
    # "The hallway A door opened, and they walked down to the far end. I got closer while being careful not to make any noise."
    "A走廊的门开了，他们一路走到走廊尽头。我小心不发出声响，慢慢靠近。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066160_1_261d2473:
    # "...possible someone's on this floor. Don't move—"
    "……这层楼可能有人。别动——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066161_1_627461c5:
    # "Wait. Are they really gonna search this whole floor?"
    "等等。他们真要把整层都搜一遍？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066162_1_c50d9e0f:
    # "Oh, what am I even saying!? Of course!"
    "哎呀，我在说什么啊！？当然会啊！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066163_1_0504afd8:
    # "My past self is about to leave the storeroom! I came out in the middle of a search."
    "过去的我马上就要从储藏室出来了！可偏偏是在搜查的时候出来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066164_1_20e976ec:
    # "As soon as I comprehended my situation, I began to hear doors opening."
    "我刚弄明白自己的处境，就听见各处响起开门的声音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066165_1_1a3aa458:
    # "What the fuck? They're going to find me!"
    "搞什么啊？他们会找到我的！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066166_1_f301b8f0:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066167_1_caed78ff:
    # "No. I wouldn't be found. I knew that."
    "不。我不会被找到的。这一点我很清楚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066168_1_4ce6b19e:
    # "I didn't want to be found. The time where everyone would disappear was very close. However, the steps in the hallway unnerved me all the same."
    "我并不想被找到。所有人消失的时刻已近在眼前。可走廊里的脚步声仍旧让我心神不宁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066171_1_b6311615:
    # "There was no way to avoid it. I couldn't hide anywhere."
    "躲是躲不掉的。我无处可藏。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066172_1_757916c6:
    # "The Sekimeiya aren't here. I don't know where the future one is, but the past one is in hallway B."
    "Sekimeiya 不在这儿。未来那个在哪我不知道，不过过去那个在B走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066173_1_ac9dad20:
    # "A door opened very close to the room I was hiding in."
    "我藏身的房间附近，一扇门打开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066174_1_fd8ebfac:
    # "I could hear cabinets being opened. Then, footsteps came toward me.{w} The doorknob shook slightly, and the door slowly opened."
    "我听见展示柜一个接一个打开，接着脚步声朝我这边来了。{w}门把手轻轻一晃，门缓缓开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066182_1_9549f44a:
    # "I saw my own body stepping in. As he approached one of the cabinets, I knew there was only one thing I could do."
    "我看见自己的身体走了进来。当他走近其中一个展示柜时，我明白自己只能做一件事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066183_1_23c7b574:
    # "This is very imp—"
    "这非常重——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066188_1_fe06a412:
    # "Wha—"
    "什——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066189_1_78e4d572:
    # "He turned around with a startled gasp. His reaction was even more drastic when he saw me."
    "他猛地倒吸一口气，转过身来。等看清是我，他的反应更加剧烈。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066190_1_2ce138fc:
    # "Wh-What!? Who are you!?{w} Are you... me?"
    "什、什么！？你是谁！？{w}你是……我？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066191_1_b19c771b:
    # "I nodded, although it wasn't the entire truth."
    "我点了点头，尽管那并不完全是实话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066192_1_15a65a7c:
    # "This is very important. Stay here until the search is finished."
    "这件事非常重要。待在这里，等搜查结束。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066196_1_a3a49416:
    # "He couldn't fathom what he was seeing. However, he had already traveled through time. What was being presented was simply a request that he could take for granted—the way he saw it, there was no reason not to trust what he himself was saying."
    "他无法理解眼前所见。可他已经亲身经历过时间穿越。眼前这请求，在他看来理所当然——既然话出自他自己之口，就没有理由不信。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066197_1_69d5a933:
    # "W-Wait, why!? Why are you here!?"
    "等、等等，为什么！？你怎么会在这儿！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066198_1_1e5b9ff4:
    # "Be quiet! It's so that I'm not found, and just trust me, please."
    "小声点！这样我才不会被人发现。相信我，拜托了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066199_1_4ce56ff8:
    # "...{w}He nodded. It was the same thing I would've done."
    "……{w}他点了点头。换成我也会这么做。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066203_1_97ba9ad9:
    # "I took a deep breath. Then, hesitantly, I approached the cabinets."
    "我深吸一口气，随后迟疑地走向展示柜。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066206_1_05d8fb3d:
    # "I had to look through them so that the noise of looking through rooms continued."
    "我得继续翻查这些柜子，好让翻找房间的动静一直不断。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066210_1_611bd4c5:
    # "Right, the third Sekimeiya's here. I'd forgotten that it was brought here before Erina and Isla came to this room.{w} This is the cabinet where my past self will see it. That means that the person who left this room was the Atsuki from this world."
    "对了，第三个 Sekimeiya 就在这儿。我忘了它是在 Erina 和 Isla 来这个房间之前就被搬过来的。{w}过去的我会在这个展示柜里看到它。也就是说，离开这个房间的人，是这个世界的 Atsuki。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066217_1_d7328487:
    # "I acted as if I hadn't found anything. When I was done, I walked to the door before glancing at Atsuki. From the despondent look in his eyes, I could tell that he was in a worse place mentally than I had been during the incident. He... I... looked horrible. Maybe he really was the Atsuki who'd written that note."
    "我装作什么都没找到。查完后，我走到门口，回头看了 Atsuki 一眼。他眼中那份消沉让我明白，他的精神状态比我经历那起事件时还要糟。他……我……看起来糟透了。也许他真的是写下那张纸条的 Atsuki。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066225_1_43091229:
    # "The whole group was in hallway C."
    "一行人都在C走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066226_1_28695c4c:
    # "As if nothing had happened, I walked to the security room first."
    "我先若无其事地走向监控室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066230_1_8582c01c:
    # "I'd been able to camouflage myself in addition to something else.{w} If I hadn't been there, the Sekimeiya would've been found, but I could prevent that."
    "除了另一件事，我还成功隐藏了自己的行踪。{w}如果我不在场，Sekimeiya 就会被人发现，而我能阻止这件事发生。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066231_1_7ef955f5:
    # "Just so that nothing else would happen, I could avoid \"finding\" them. It was better if no one used them during the time that remained."
    "为了不再节外生枝，我可以不去把它们“找出来”。剩下的时间里，最好谁也别用它们。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066237_1_a7082c4e:
    # "Stay there! I'll look at the mechanical room again."
    "待在那儿别动！我再去看看机械室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066238_1_1e6306fb:
    # "When I stepped into the lobby, I saw Suripo's body on the floor. Blood covered both him and the tiles, evidently caused by the knife wound I'd heard them discussing."
    "我一走进大厅，就看见 Suripo 的尸体倒在地上。他浑身是血，地砖也被染红了——显然就是他们之前议论的那处刀伤造成的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066239_1_cd3f14ec:
    # "I still couldn't believe it; I hadn't expected that at all. Everyone else was alive, but Suripo's corpse had suddenly appeared in the lobby..."
    "我仍然不敢相信，这完全出乎我的意料。其他人全都还活着，Suripo 的尸体却突然出现在大厅里……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066243_1_57972041:
    # "I didn't like doing it, but I crouched down and verified he was dead. Then, to avoid being suspected, I went to the mechanical room as if I was searching through the floor normally."
    "我并不想这么做，但还是蹲下身确认他已经死了。随后，为了不惹人怀疑，我装成照常搜查这层楼的样子，走向机械室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066249_1_275223a8:
    # "I began with hallway B. Immediately, I found a Sekimeiya in the first room, B1."
    "我从B走廊开始。第一个房间B1里，我立刻就发现了一个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066252_1_f2c4ceb8:
    # "I felt the hot air around it. It had been powered on for a while already."
    "我感觉到它周围的热气。它已经启动好一阵子了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066253_1_51e9bce3:
    # "This is the Future Sekimeiya.{w} When I was in the other crystal room, I heard someone here. After killing Suripo, this is where his killer left the Future Sekimeiya."
    "这是未来Sekimeiya。{w}我在另一间水晶展室时，听见这边有人。杀了 Suripo 之后，凶手就把未来Sekimeiya 留在了这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066261_1_c94c503d:
    # "It wasn't until I entered the very last crystal room, B6, that I found the Past Sekimeiya. I had to quickly withdraw my hand. The air surrounding it was even hotter."
    "直到走进最后一间水晶展室 B6，我才找到过去Sekimeiya。我只好赶紧把手缩回来——它周围的空气更热。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066274_1_fc46f773:
    # "There's nobody here. I didn't find the Sekimeiya or any potential hiding spot we don't know of. If Naomi's here, she's somehow above us."
    "这里没有人。我没找到 Sekimeiya，也没发现任何我们不知道的藏身之处。如果 Naomi 在这里，那她一定是躲在我们上面的哪一层。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066275_1_d801d7a4:
    # "...Are you sure you were thorough? Do you know some cabinets have compartments inside? The Sekimeiya could be there."
    "……你确定都仔细查过了？有些展示柜里面还有暗格，这你知道吗？Sekimeiya 说不定就藏在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066276_1_9a15bfd1:
    # "Yes, I looked in all of them."
    "嗯，每一个我都看过了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066277_1_e4c8e09b:
    # "Even the ones with temperature regulation? Did you make sure to close them?"
    "连那些带温控的也查了？都关严了吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066278_1_26b7057b:
    # "Those too, yeah. It took me a bit to figure out how to open them."
    "也查了。我还花了一会儿才弄明白怎么打开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066279_1_dede28be:
    # "I knew how suspicious what I was saying was. Some people knew the Sekimeiya were in the rooms I'd just investigated, but I didn't care."
    "我知道自己这番话有多可疑。有人知道我刚刚查过的那些房间里就有 Sekimeiya，可我并不在意。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066290_1_53a06137:
    # "Before proceeding, I looked at both bathrooms and opened the elevator."
    "继续之前，我查看了两间洗手间，又把电梯门打开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066291_1_33adb64c:
    # "...I'll keep it open so that it can't be used."
    "……我让它一直开着，这样谁也坐不了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066292_1_c57e0d6b:
    # "All right. Let's go."
    "好，走吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066296_1_7149e01c:
    # "I went up first, as I couldn't bring myself to look into anyone's eyes."
    "我先一步上了楼，因为我实在不敢去看任何人的眼睛。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066304_1_2490a9b4:
    # "Hm, nothing."
    "嗯，什么也没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066316_1_f4d2975e:
    # "Wait here."
    "在这儿等着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066317_1_6680dfc5:
    # "Can I do it instead?"
    "不如让我来？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066318_1_617273f0:
    # "Huh? Yeah, sure."
    "咦？嗯，好啊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066322_1_29bcb42d:
    # "Miiya entered the partitions. I'd really just talked to her as if she had never died..."
    "Miiya 走进了隔间。我刚刚居然还那样跟她说话，就好像她从未死过一样……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066323_1_43899446:
    # "But I'd been able to see that she was suffering too. The world we were in wasn't yet what it could be.{w} I dug my fingernails into my palm, telling myself that the result would be worth everything."
    "可我也看得出来，她同样在痛苦。我们所处的世界，还不是它应有的样子。{w} 我把指甲掐进掌心，告诉自己，只要结果如愿，一切就都值得。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066329_1_7b0f300a:
    # "I didn't find anything."
    "什么都没找到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066330_1_bf0b3880:
    # "You looked everywhere, right?"
    "每个角落都看了吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066331_1_a950a3aa:
    # "Yes, but did the others not come with us?"
    "看了。不过，其他人没跟我们一起来吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066332_1_ad24578a:
    # "I think they stayed on the crystal floor and let us go by ourselves."
    "他们大概留在水晶展室了，让我们自己上来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066337_1_adf5ffc5:
    # "Really?"
    "真的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066338_1_a43bb8e4:
    # "Yes, and we should continue. We have to find something. Be it Naomi or the Sekimeiya."
    "嗯，我们继续吧。总得找到点什么，不管是 Naomi 还是 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066339_1_c72313d1:
    # "Right now, the others have just found the secret area in the storeroom. My past self is already out of there."
    "此刻，其他人刚刚发现储藏室里的秘密区域。过去的我已经离开那里了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066345_1_6018634a:
    # "We went to the third floor, which was empty. Then, quietly, we walked up the stairs again."
    "我们去了三楼，那里空无一人。随后我们又放轻脚步，走上了楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066355_1_d9c878b8:
    # "When Miiya came out of the offices, I was about to keep going, but she was looking down at the floor."
    "Miiya 从办公室里出来时，我正要继续往前走，却见她低头看着地面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066356_1_11e1eacc:
    # "Nothing again?"
    "又没有？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066357_1_f2312671:
    # "She shook her head."
    "她摇了摇头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066358_1_0423eeb5:
    # "If she's in the attic, she won't be able to take the elevator down, but this is very strange."
    "要是她在阁楼，就没法坐电梯下来。可这也太奇怪了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066359_1_aaf903f1:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066364_1_b247fe68:
    # "We headed to the staircase."
    "我们走向楼梯间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066369_1_8228c95e:
    # "...Are you all right?"
    "……你没事吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066374_1_52d69694:
    # "...Huh?{w} Yes."
    "……咦？{w} 嗯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066375_1_ce56df95:
    # "You look zoned out. Are you tired?"
    "你有点魂不守舍。累了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066376_1_befa636f:
    # "A bit. It's okay."
    "有一点。不要紧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066377_1_9549d127:
    # "All right, but don't push yourself."
    "好吧，不过别硬撑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066384_1_8a69f7f9:
    # "Her mood seemed to have suddenly changed. She appeared a little disoriented, so I decided to look through the fifth floor offices while she stayed outside."
    "她的情绪似乎突然变了，人也有点恍惚，于是我决定让她留在外面，自己进去查看五楼的办公室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066391_1_9450f8e0:
    # "...I don't really expect Naomi to be in these, but it all gets weirder every time we move on. Could a secret place that Katei doesn't know about exist...?{w} There's no way, right? If the answer is somehow a hidden spot, he must've made use of it as well."
    "……我其实并不指望 Naomi 会藏在这些地方，可我们每往前走一步，事情就越是古怪。会不会有一处连 Katei 都不知道的秘密地点……？{w} 这不可能吧？如果答案真是某处隐蔽的地点，那他没道理不利用。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066392_1_6dbb8bb5:
    # "She didn't reply, opting to continue looking down instead. It made my stomach turn. She was alive, and I was sure she was pushing herself to be strong, but her sudden change had made it evident how hard it was."
    "她没有回答，只是继续低着头。我心里一阵发紧。她确实还活着，我也知道她一直在强撑，可她刚才情绪转变得那么突然，还是让人一眼就看出她撑得有多辛苦。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066394_1_92978e32:
    # "...I felt like there was something else buried in her eyes. I didn't know if I was imagining it, but I grimaced and kept moving forward."
    "……我总觉得她眼里还藏着别的什么。我不知道是不是自己多心了，只是皱了皱眉，继续往前走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066401_1_fc086ac2:
    # "...{w}You have the key, right?"
    "……{w}钥匙在你身上吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066402_1_c1f5884f:
    # "She nodded and took the keyring out of her purse."
    "她点点头，从手提包里取出钥匙串。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066407_1_8194b895:
    # "No recent footprints...{w} It'll be fine if you stay here. If I don't find anyone, I'm gonna be pretty confused."
    "最近没有脚印……{w} 你留在这儿就好。要是我连一个人都找不到，可就真搞不懂了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066411_1_89ef4873:
    # "I went through every room. As expected, they were all empty."
    "我把每个房间都查了一遍。果然，全是空的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066419_1_49597f79:
    # "...{w}I don't get it. Was Naomi never with us?{w} How is this possible? I know we've already been here for a long time, but that doesn't make it any less confusing. Where the hell is the Sekimeiya, also?"
    "……{w}我搞不懂了。Naomi 难道从来就没跟我们在一起过？{w}这怎么可能？我知道我们在这儿已经待了很久，可我还是想不通。还有，Sekimeiya 到底在哪儿？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066420_1_e19b42b0:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066421_1_5b29017a:
    # "Let's just go back down. I hope they trust what we tell them.{w} ...We can't even take the elevator, damn it."
    "先下去吧。希望他们会相信我们说的话。{w}……该死，连电梯都坐不了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066422_1_7578bf6a:
    # "She didn't have anything to say. We went all the way back down, but that awkward silence hung around me the entire time."
    "她一句话也没说。我们一路走回楼下，那股尴尬的沉默始终跟着我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066433_1_b1f1295f:
    # "Where the hell are they?"
    "他们到底在哪儿？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066443_1_409d6ac1:
    # "...The storeroom?"
    "……储藏室？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066444_1_f0fbc420:
    # "Oh. Well, I need to go to the bathroom. I'll be back."
    "哦。那我去趟洗手间，很快就回来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066448_1_671acdf9:
    # "I had to leave. The real Atsuki would soon reappear.{w} But it was hard to turn around. Miiya was right there in front of me—a friend who I'd thought I'd never see again, and who I might have been looking at for the very last time."
    "我必须离开。很快，真正的我就要回来了。{w} 可要我转身走开，实在太难了。Miiya 就站在我面前——这个我以为再也见不到的朋友，也许这就是我最后一次看她了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066449_1_6652ca71:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066454_1_91793117:
    # "As I walked to the bathroom, I noticed she was going to the storeroom. I stopped myself once she was inside."
    "我走向洗手间时，看见她正往储藏室去。等她进去后，我停住了脚步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066458_1_7af5b5de:
    # "I approached it, intrigued as to what they were talking about."
    "我凑近了些，好奇他们在说些什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066459_1_c6b0c448:
    # "They'll go to the attic pretty soon. I can listen in without being seen."
    "他们很快就要去阁楼了。我可以躲着听，不会被发现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066463_1_534225b8:
    # "I saw that they were all next to the secret door. I hid inside the crystal room at its left."
    "我看见他们都聚在暗门旁边，便躲进了左侧的那间水晶展室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066469_1_71cd5d86:
    # "I approached the wall and put my ear against it."
    "我走近墙边，把耳朵贴了上去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066473_1_b627c5d3:
    # "...ut Atsuki had just finished looking through the whole floor."
    "……可 Atsuki 才刚把整层楼查过一遍。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066474_1_88411792:
    # "Exactly."
    "正是。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066475_1_0a71e465:
    # "I can hear them well enough."
    "他们说的话，我听得一清二楚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066476_1_accafa42:
    # "What I think is that this door leads outside. The storeroom now stretches farther out than the crystal rooms, and it's a hidden locked door that would explain the policeman's appearance and Naomi's vanishing."
    "我觉得这扇门通向外面。储藏室现在比水晶展室延伸得更远，而这样一扇上了锁的暗门，正好能解释警察为什么会出现在这里，以及 Naomi 为什么消失不见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066477_1_c4b3b78c:
    # "W-Wait, really...? If a policeman entered, why did nobody else?"
    "等、等等，真的吗……？如果警察能进来，为什么其他人没进来？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066478_1_da07c146:
    # "They kept talking about the door. I knew it led outside, but it hadn't opened since that morning."
    "他们一直在谈论那扇门。我知道它通向外面，可它从那天早上起就再没打开过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066479_1_2e0e4179:
    # "Finally, the other Atsuki returned."
    "终于，另一个 Atsuki 回来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066480_1_e15ae12b:
    # "What the fuck is this...?"
    "这他妈是什么东西……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066481_1_f81b3a5d:
    # "There he is. Do you know how to pick a lock?"
    "他来了。你会开锁吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066482_1_61cf3455:
    # "What? N-No?"
    "什么？不、不会？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066485_1_06f67167:
    # "He was told about the discovery. Sai had noticed the storeroom was open while he was going up the stairs."
    "有人把这一发现告诉了他。Sai 上楼时注意到储藏室开着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066486_1_93ac34bd:
    # "Did you really not know about this?"
    "你真的不知道那件事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066487_1_6df768a0:
    # "I promise I didn't. I also don't think this door leads outside. There's no way I wouldn't have ever noticed it."
    "我保证我不知道。我也不认为这扇门通向外面。若真有这扇门，我不可能一直没注意到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066488_1_255dceb5:
    # "And it makes sense that you didn't know about it if it doesn't lead outside?"
    "那么，如果这扇门不通向外面，你不知道它也就说得通了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066489_1_26e8e9c3:
    # "...I'm just speechless. This room is practically unused, but I can't believe this existed."
    "……我简直无话可说。这个房间几乎没人用过，可我实在难以相信这里会有这种东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066490_1_24dacd0f:
    # "...{w}Now a few things make sense, at least. As you said, nobody was found, so Naomi must've been here at some point."
    "……{w}至少现在有几件事说得通了。就像你说的，到处都没找到人影，所以 Naomi 一定来过这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066491_1_feb87b92:
    # "Yes, yes. I'd like to advise you all on something."
    "对，对。我想提醒各位一件事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066492_1_5dfaeb86:
    # "I've made sure that if this door is opened again, I'll be able to tell."
    "我已经做了安排，这扇门如果再被打开，我就能知道。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066493_1_0cdc789f:
    # "...Huh?"
    "……啊？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066494_1_8543daee:
    # "...What? How?"
    "……什么？怎么做到的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066495_1_9499d60e:
    # "I'm not telling you that. One of you could potentially manage to open this, so I'd rather not give you any indication of what I've done."
    "这我可不会说。你们之中说不定有人能打开这扇门，所以我不想透露自己做了什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066496_1_074d2576:
    # "What is this about...?"
    "这到底是怎么回事……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066499_1_b80589b7:
    # "...I think that's fair. It wouldn't be wise to demand that you tell us."
    "……我觉得这样也合理。硬要你告诉我们，并不是明智之举。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066500_1_e08540b2:
    # "Just trust me. I will know if the door opens. However, it's possible it won't and that the plan already finished after the Sekimeiya was brought outside."
    "相信我。门要是被打开，我会知道。不过，它也可能不会再开——Sekimeiya 被带到外面之后，计划就已经结束了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066501_1_aa445a9b:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066502_1_6248dc44:
    # "Let's go to the attic."
    "去阁楼吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066503_1_634c75b2:
    # "...To the attic? Why?"
    "……去阁楼？为什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066504_1_7d6972a3:
    # "Do you think I'll believe you were walking around for hours and we didn't see you? You either went through this door or were in the attic."
    "你觉得我会相信你到处转了几个小时，我们却一次都没见到你？你要么是从这扇门出去了，要么就是一直待在阁楼里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066505_1_380f5e2f:
    # "He wasn't with us. We know that much."
    "他没和我们在一起。这点我们很清楚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066506_1_595c2c38:
    # "You've said that before. I know."
    "你之前就说过了。我知道。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066507_1_39491ba1:
    # "How do you intend to know whether I was there? I won't allow anyone in lightly."
    "你打算怎么确认我有没有去过那里？我不会随随便便让任何人进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066508_1_78f1f122:
    # "No? Then how come they spent three hours sleeping there?"
    "不行？那他们怎么会在那里睡了三个小时？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066509_1_f15062a9:
    # "...I haven't forgotten about that."
    "……那件事我没忘。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066510_1_8d8c4549:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066511_1_f9891889:
    # "In the off chance Naomi's still in the tower, she's up there, being covered by the three of you. I want to go see it by myself, and I'm sure Akaro and Erina aren't content with your words alone."
    "万一 Naomi 还在塔里，那她就在楼上，被你们三个包庇着。我要亲自去看看。我敢肯定，光凭你们几句话，Akaro 和 Erina 也不会满意。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066515_1_6e757245:
    # "They left the storeroom and the crystal floor."
    "他们离开了储藏室，离开了水晶层。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066517_1_6897de16:
    # "The rest happened as I'd already experienced it."
    "接下来的事，和我已经经历过的一模一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066518_1_105a0ab7:
    # "I stayed in that room until my past self went up. I'd chosen to hide in one of the second floor bathrooms, an unlikely place to be revisited."
    "我一直待在那间房里，直到过去的我上楼。我特意选了二楼的一间洗手间藏身，那地方不太可能有人再去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066523_1_6ef47829:
    # "I went to hallway B. I knew Sai would be the first one to return and that he'd look through the hallway A rooms."
    "我去了 B走廊。我知道 Sai 会第一个回来，也知道他会逐一查看 A走廊的房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066524_1_ce6b0a42:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066525_1_04535bbf:
    # "It happened even sooner than I recalled. Evidently discontent with my search, he walked from room to room.{w} He didn't care about the third Sekimeiya; he'd been the one to leave it there. When he came to hallway B, I was already in a room in hallway A."
    "一切来得比我记忆中的更早。他显然对我先前那番搜寻并不满意，一间一间地走了过去。{w}他并不在意第三个 Sekimeiya——把它留在那里的正是他自己。等他来到 B走廊时，我已经待在 A走廊的一间房里了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066526_1_7787547f:
    # "I just had to wait.{w} Sai would find the Future Sekimeiya and bring it to the event room. Then, the others would find the Past Sekimeiya and walk to the event room."
    "我只需要等着。{w}Sai 会找到未来Sekimeiya，把它带到活动室。随后，其他人会找到过去Sekimeiya，走进活动室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066527_1_8fd35e12:
    # "The Future Sekimeiya would be activated in the event room—it was the one that had been gray, and I was far enough from its range. That would leave me alone in the tower with my past self."
    "未来Sekimeiya 会在活动室启动——那正是先前呈灰色的那一个，而我所处的位置离它的覆盖范围足够远。这样一来，塔里就只剩我和过去的我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066542_1_8b64cb5a:
    # "Picture Frame"
    "画框"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066545_1_07d33a7e:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066546_1_ae2c9e42:
    # "I'm sure everything has taken shape in your mind, but I wonder what shape that is."
    "我想，一切在你脑中都已成形，只是不知那形状如何。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066547_1_0c2d09ab:
    # "You remember this world, don't you? In it, many things weren't what they seemed."
    "你记得这个世界吧？在这里，许多事物都不是表面看上去的样子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066548_1_0ce9a701:
    # "Its real shape is the last key you will need to reach the peak."
    "它真正的形状，是你抵达顶峰所需的最后一把钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066562_1_eebc6ccb:
    # "Two people waited in the lobby. {time=9:00} was approaching."
    "大厅里有两个人等着。快到 {time=9:00} 了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066563_1_e399afca:
    # "At that point, you may have realized something was wrong. Shiroya wasn't there; Miiya was occupying her place.{w} However, her name was spoken before the doors opened."
    "那时，你或许已经察觉到有什么不对。Shiroya 并不在那里，占据她位置的是 Miiya。{w}然而，在门打开之前，有人叫出了她的名字。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066565_1_a3887d25:
    # "Shiroya...?"
    "Shiroya……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066568_1_b6eec487:
    # "\"I'd managed to leave my mind empty, but I abruptly turned around when I heard a quiet voice coming from my left. A man was crouching next to me, and when he stood up, I saw his older face underneath white hair.\""
    "「我好不容易让脑子空了下来，左边却传来一声轻唤，我猛地转过身。一个男人正蹲在我身旁，他站起身来，我才看清那一头白发下那张上了年纪的脸。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066574_1_36ddbff0:
    # "Katei said Shiroya's name..."
    "Katei 念出了 Shiroya 的名字……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066582_1_43de6d02:
    # "Is this yours? I think you dropped it."
    "这是你的吗？我想是你掉的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066583_1_61276f03:
    # "\"He showed me a ticket that must've fallen from my purse when I'd stretched my muscles. I nodded and put it back inside, all while unnerved by his stiff motions.\""
    "「他给我看了一张票，多半是我活动身体时从包里掉出来的。我点点头，把它放回包里；他动作僵硬，让我心里发毛。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066588_1_c1ed88bf:
    # "Everyone brought an identification card to verify their own tickets. Of course, the tickets had everyone's names on them. Katei read Shiroya's name and called for her."
    "每个人都带了身份证件，用来核对自己的票。当然，票上都写着各自的名字。Katei 读到 Shiroya 的名字，便叫了她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066589_1_58a7a519:
    # "Miiya was there with her own purse, which contained three tickets. When she stretched, one fell out, meaning that her purse hadn't been closed. In world B, when Shiroya opened her purse, she unzipped it—the tickets couldn't have fallen from her purse, as it was closed since long before {time=9.}"
    "Miiya 也在场，她的包里装着三张票。她一活动身体，就有一张掉了出来，说明她的包当时没合上。而在 B 世界，Shiroya 打开包时是先拉开拉链的——票不可能从她的包里掉出来，因为那只包早在 {time=9.} 之前就一直合着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066590_1_15128fc6:
    # "Hopefully, it was enjoyable to catch any of these details. However, although Shiroya's absence could be reasoned out, it wouldn't be surprising if your gut told you something was wrong before that. For everyone who'd gotten trapped in the tower, Shiroya was a girl who had died weeks ago."
    "希望你觉得发现这些细节还算有趣。不过，就算 Shiroya 的缺席能靠推理得出，你在那之前就凭直觉感到不对劲，也不奇怪。对所有被困在塔里的人来说，Shiroya 是个几周前就已经死去的女孩。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066597_1_eb775064:
    # "When the group went up the floors, Atsuki found the key for the security room. Everyone splitting up created the chances for individuals to accomplish what they needed."
    "众人逐层往上时，Atsuki 找到了监控室的钥匙。正因为大家分头行动，各人才有了机会去做自己需要做的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066605_1_e65fdd40:
    # "The next time they reunited, Sai noticed the sound of keys coming from Katei's pocket. ...They were louder than they'd been before."
    "众人再次会合时，Sai 注意到 Katei 的口袋里传来钥匙的响声。……那声音比之前更响了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066606_1_7d85bfb0:
    # "When Katei was confronted, he showed them a set of keys belonging to Naomi. However, that's when he himself noticed something."
    "被众人质问时，Katei 拿出一串属于 Naomi 的钥匙。可也就在这时，他自己察觉到了异样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066614_1_23982d4c:
    # "There were two identical keyrings in his pocket. That had made the metallic noise even easier to perceive."
    "他的口袋里有两串一模一样的钥匙。正因如此，金属碰撞的声响才格外清晰。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066615_1_eadfbd83:
    # "At that point, Katei had traveled to the past one time. Upon appearing, he hadn't realized that the keyring Naomi had left behind suddenly appeared in his pocket.{w} Then, when he came across it, he put it inside. In that way, he came into possession of two copies."
    "那时，Katei 已经穿越到过去一次。他出现时，没有察觉 Naomi 遗落的那串钥匙忽然出现在自己口袋里。{w}后来他偶然摸到它，便把它收了起来。就这样，他手上有了两串。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066616_1_b9786fcc:
    # "When Sai made him reveal it, he didn't know a second one remained in his pocket. That fact was what shaped Katei's actions."
    "当 Sai 逼他拿出来时，他并不知道口袋里还留着一串。正是这一点，影响了 Katei 之后的行动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066617_1_664806a1:
    # "In this world, he insisted the attic should be kept locked, and he made sure the Sekimeiya cabinet would always be. That way, he could unlock them with his secret set, setting up Atsuki and Miiya, who had the other one, as the only possible culprits."
    "在这个世界里，他坚持阁楼应当上锁，也设法让装着 Sekimeiya 的展示柜始终锁着。这样一来，他就能用自己藏起的那串钥匙打开它们，把持有另一串钥匙的 Atsuki 和 Miiya 变成唯一可能的犯人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066618_1_6208390f:
    # "Sai thought of a way to know whether that set was Naomi's: if one of the keys opened the attic, Katei's lie would be exposed."
    "Sai 想出了辨明那串钥匙是否属于 Naomi 的办法：只要其中一把能打开阁楼，Katei 的谎言就会败露。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066624_1_696592e9:
    # "Before they got there, he decided to test if something else Katei had said was invalid too. On the sixth floor, he attempted to call the elevator, which should've been disabled.{w} They waited, but it never came."
    "到达那里之前，他决定再验证 Katei 的另一句话是否同样站不住脚。在六楼，他试着呼叫本该被停用的电梯。{w}他们等了许久，电梯始终没有上来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066630_1_4b171787:
    # "However, at that point, the elevator was already working again."
    "然而那个时候，电梯其实已经恢复运行了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066634_1_f9bb0409:
    # "The first time Katei traveled to the past, he walked to the crystal floor. He saw an Atsuki from another world, which later made him question what everyone was saying."
    "Katei 第一次穿越回过去时，走到了水晶层。他看见了来自另一个世界的 Atsuki，这让他后来对众人的说法起了疑心。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066637_1_db7fe31a:
    # "Most importantly, he saw people leaving the security room, which had strangely been unlocked. That was his opportunity to shut the computer down. Since he was alone and hadn't told everyone about the cameras' green lights, in this world, he was able to power off the entire security system too as opposed to just one camera."
    "最重要的是，他看见有人从监控室里出来——那扇门不知为何没有上锁。这正是他关掉电脑的机会。由于他独自一人，也没把摄像头绿灯的事告诉任何人，在这个世界里，他得以切断整套监控系统的电源，而不只是关掉一台摄像头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066644_1_35963f6a:
    # "Later, when Sai called the elevator, Katei had already enabled it because he had found the attic key. However, it didn't come."
    "后来 Sai 呼叫电梯时，Katei 因为找到阁楼钥匙，已经重新启用了电梯。可电梯却没有上来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066651_1_7828db84:
    # "Katei suddenly froze up; would they notice their mistake?"
    "Katei 猛然僵住：他们会察觉到失误吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066656_1_27557270:
    # "...The elevator was disabled. That's much more unlikely to have gone wrong. If it was working for some reason, the button would light up when it arrived."
    "……电梯处于停用状态。那种东西出故障的可能性要小得多。要是它不知为何还能运行，到的时候按钮会亮起来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066657_1_3a2c3faa:
    # "The orange light never appeared—the elevator was already there, and you might recall that was the case in world B as well."
    "橙色指示灯始终没有亮起——电梯早就在那一层了，你或许还记得，B世界里也是同样的情况。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066662_1_98920869:
    # "And not only that. Atsuki from world B was spying on the group, and when they entered the attic, he was on the sixth floor. He heard the elevator, but only once—when Isla, Erina, Sai, and Akaro took it down. Since it was called from the attic and Atsuki B only heard it once, it was originally on the sixth floor."
    "不仅如此。B世界的 Atsuki 当时正在暗中监视众人，他们进入阁楼时，他就在六楼。他只听到过一次电梯的声响——那是 Isla、Erina、Sai 和 Akaro 乘电梯下楼的时候。既然电梯是从阁楼呼叫的，而 Atsuki B 只听到一次，说明它起初就在六楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066665_1_6e7b7c7c:
    # "Either way, nobody saw through his ruse, and thanks to that, Katei was able to set up a stronger illusion later on."
    "无论如何，没人识破他的计策，也正因如此，Katei 之后才得以布下更牢固的假象。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066673_1_85b147aa:
    # "When everyone entered the attic, they saw the strange footprints on the floor. They led to the sofa, where the Future Sekimeiya was."
    "众人进入阁楼时，看见地板上有奇怪的脚印，一路延伸到沙发——未来Sekimeiya 就放在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066674_1_d08beb09:
    # "Most people believed the Sekimeiya should've been on the crystal floor. If that was the case, someone had to have brought it up very recently, but it didn't seem possible for them to have left the attic."
    "大多数人认为 Sekimeiya 本该在水晶层。若真是如此，就一定是有人刚刚把它搬了上来，可那人似乎不可能从阁楼脱身。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066677_1_9a92929c:
    # "That made Sai call the elevator, and it actually did arrive."
    "于是 Sai 呼叫了电梯，而这一回它真的来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066678_1_2342f0ef:
    # "That was the feint Katei aimed for—that the elevator had just been enabled. That someone had been in the security room after they'd all stepped into the attic."
    "这正是 Katei 想要的误导——让人以为电梯刚刚才被启用，以为在众人踏入阁楼之后，有人去过监控室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066681_1_fac7d5f4:
    # "Following that, when everyone saw that the computer had lost power, what he said was reinforced; it must have happened after they had tried to call the elevator on the sixth floor."
    "紧接着，众人发现电脑断了电，他的话就更显得可信——那一定发生在他们在六楼呼叫电梯之后。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066684_1_fcd952a0:
    # "At the same time, the Sekimeiya had disappeared from the cabinet. From their perspective, it had been brought to the attic.{w} However, Sai knew the truth. Just like in worlds A and B, he had quickly hidden the fake Sekimeiya when everyone had split up, so the one they'd retrieved from the attic was different."
    "与此同时，展示柜里的 Sekimeiya 不见了。大家以为它被搬到了阁楼。{w}可 Sai 知道真相。和在 A世界、B世界一样，他在众人分头行动时迅速藏起了赝品 Sekimeiya，所以他们从阁楼取回的那一个，已经换成了别的东西。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066691_1_1676e516:
    # "That was when everyone else learned about time travel. Right before their eyes, Katei went to the future."
    "就在这时，其他人第一次得知了时间穿越。Katei 就在他们眼前去了未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066696_1_eb2e9401:
    # "Atsuki reeled. He had to learn more about the Sekimeiya. He stayed close to it, and when the crystal floor had been inspected, he touched it."
    "Atsuki 内心震动。他必须弄清 Sekimeiya 的底细。他寸步不离地守在旁边，趁水晶层接受检查时，伸手碰了它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066703_1_e0777e87:
    # "He went minutes to the future, but he wasn't alone. Sai had specifically gone to find the fake Sekimeiya he'd hidden, wondering whether it was still there, as well as whether it shared the same powers he'd witnessed. As he was returning to the event room from hallway B, he traveled with Atsuki."
    "他去了几分钟后的未来，但他并非独自一人。Sai 特意去找自己藏起来的赝品 Sekimeiya，想确认它是否还在原处，又是否拥有他亲眼见过的那种力量。就在他从 B走廊返回活动室时，他和 Atsuki 一起穿越了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066704_1_2d580eac:
    # "Atsuki appeared in the attic, which was locked. The elevator had been left open on the crystal floor, so he couldn't leave through it either.{w} However, Sai appeared on the crystal floor since his group had left the attic earlier. He realized the elevator was open and allowed Atsuki to leave."
    "Atsuki 出现在上了锁的阁楼里。电梯被留在水晶层，门还开着，所以他也无法借电梯离开。{w}而 Sai 则出现在水晶层，因为他的同伴们早些时候已经离开了阁楼。他发现电梯是开着的，便让 Atsuki 得以脱身。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066705_1_db8f91e4:
    # "When they met, they thought they'd gone minutes to the past, although neither of them spoke about it. Atsuki recalled Sai had gone missing, so finding him in the past wasn't strange.{w} His misinterpretation arose due to Sai's watch, which had ended up minutes behind. When they returned to the others, they saw that everyone was in the security room."
    "两人相遇时，都以为自己回到了几分钟前，尽管谁也没有说出口。Atsuki 记得 Sai 曾经失踪，所以在过去遇见他并不奇怪。{w}他之所以判断错误，是因为 Sai 的手表慢了整整几分钟。等他们回到其他人身边，才发现众人都在监控室里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066713_1_5b48e74b:
    # "\"As we turned around, we saw Sai staring at us next to the unassertive Atsuki.\""
    "「我们回过头，就看见 Sai 站在没什么底气的 Atsuki 身旁，注视着我们。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066719_1_5772597d:
    # "Wh-Where were you!?"
    "你、你到底去哪儿了！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066724_1_1674fd4e:
    # "Me? I just took a detour to the bathroom."
    "我？只是绕路去了趟洗手间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066725_1_84a79e51:
    # "Sai wasn't exactly aware of how blatant his lie was. According to his watch, he should've been missing for very little time, but it had been much longer than he thought since he'd vanished. He didn't reveal what had happened to him, and because of that, he was the only person aware of the Sekimeiya's range."
    "Sai 并未意识到自己这谎撒得有多拙劣。按他的手表，他失踪的时间本该很短，可他消失之后实际过去的时间远比他想的长。他没有说出自己的遭遇，也正因如此，他是唯一知道 Sekimeiya 作用范围的人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066736_1_eec3e0fa:
    # "Hours later, Suripo's dead body suddenly appeared. There's one last thing to settle."
    "几小时之后，Suripo 的尸体突然出现。还有最后一件事需要理清。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066745_1_2bb3e5fb:
    # "Naomi still hadn't been found, and it seemed like nobody else could've committed the crime without having traveled through time. That belief led to a whole search with no result."
    "Naomi 依旧下落不明。似乎除了时间穿越者，再没有别人能犯下那桩案子。抱着这个念头，众人搜遍了各处，却一无所获。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066748_1_47086810:
    # "Something very important was found, though: the storeroom's secret corridor."
    "不过，他们找到了一样极其重要的东西——储藏室的秘密通道。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066749_1_566fb224:
    # "Upon its discovery, you likely noticed that someone's actions differed from world B's."
    "发现它之后，你大概已经注意到，某人的举动和在 B 世界时不同。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066754_1_7716877e:
    # "In world C, Sai did something to know whether the door was opened from that point on. That did not happen in world B."
    "在 C 世界，Sai 做了些布置，好知道那扇门此后有没有被打开过。这件事在 B 世界并没有发生。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066755_1_a178cc29:
    # "The reason was the piece of duct tape they'd all seen. It had reminded Sai of his favorite novel, which made him think of setting up a check on that door."
    "原因就是众人都见过的那截胶带。它让 Sai 想起了自己最爱的小说，于是动了给那扇门做记号的念头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066758_1_f589b95f:
    # "After that, everyone ended up in the attic, where they hoped they could calmly spend the rest of their isolation in the bedrooms."
    "之后，众人回到了阁楼，希望能在卧室里安然度过剩下的隔离日子。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066759_1_bf2328c2:
    # "Of course, that wouldn't happen. It was Sai who soon tried to go back down unnoticed."
    "当然，事情没能如愿。很快，Sai 就试图不声不响地下楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066764_1_23663138:
    # "What if Atsuki and Miiya hadn't alerted everyone to his departure?"
    "如果 Atsuki 和 Miiya 没有把他离开的事告诉众人，又会怎样？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066773_1_7ce1858c:
    # "\"Shiroya and Atsuki stayed in the attic. Sai had gone to the crystal floor, but they didn't follow him down.\""
    "「Shiroya 和 Atsuki 留在阁楼。Sai 去了水晶展室，他们没有跟下去。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066778_1_a6f7835e:
    # "\"Shiroya let out a sigh.\""
    "「Shiroya 叹了口气。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066779_1_1b5620af:
    # "\"They had no strength left, so they kept resting, trying to ignore what was happening around them.\""
    "「他们已经没了力气，便继续歇着，尽量不去理会周围发生的事。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066784_1_b6188ec5:
    # "Indeed, your choice made Miiya become Shiroya.{w} The world changed drastically. The butterfly effect amplifies even a single unwitting change."
    "的确，正是你的选择让 Miiya 变成了 Shiroya。{w} 世界因此发生了剧变。蝴蝶效应会把哪怕一处无心造成的改变无限放大。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066785_1_97291ae1:
    # "In that world, Miiya couldn't have been saved. However, you wanted to know what would've happened if Sai was let loose. That caused Miiya to be replaced by Shiroya."
    "在那个世界里，Miiya 本来无法得救。可你想知道，若放任 Sai 自由行动，事情会变成什么样。于是 Miiya 被 Shiroya 取代了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066786_1_32c97026:
    # "That was one of numerous changes, alongside..."
    "那不过是众多变化之一，此外还有……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066793_1_5f6fdfe0:
    # "\"Six pairs of eyes saw the identical scene.\"{w} Exactly, it was Katei's absence. The storeroom's door hadn't been locked, so he'd been able to leave before everyone awakened. In that world, nobody had told the group about keeping the Sekimeiya cold."
    "「六双眼睛看到了同一幕景象。」{w} 没错，问题就出在 Katei 不在场。储藏室的门没有上锁，他才能在众人醒来前离开。那个世界里，没人告诉过他们得让 Sekimeiya 保持低温。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066795_1_271178c5:
    # "\"Six pairs of eyes saw the identical scene.\"{w} It was Katei's absence. The storeroom's door hadn't been locked, so he'd been able to leave before everyone awakened. In that world, nobody had told the group about keeping the Sekimeiya cold."
    "「六双眼睛看到了同一幕景象。」{w} 问题正是 Katei 不在场。储藏室的门没有上锁，他才能在众人醒来前离开。那个世界里，没人告诉过他们得让 Sekimeiya 保持低温。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066799_1_3fb90337:
    # "Sai roamed free for a long time, and on the crystal floor, he had access to both Sekimeiya. With his watch, he was able to figure out the basic mechanics behind traveling to the past and future."
    "Sai 长时间自由行动。在水晶展室，他能拿到两个 Sekimeiya。借助手表，他弄清了穿越到过去与未来的基本机制。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066801_1_d31b69a1:
    # "That's how he came up with a plan to remain with the Sekimeiya."
    "他因此想出了一套计划，好继续把 Sekimeiya 留在手里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066804_1_c3d06784:
    # "What did he do? When he came back up, he showed everyone what the Sekimeiya were capable of. Right now, you understand them a lot more than at that time."
    "他做了什么？重新回到上层后，他向大家展示了 Sekimeiya 的能力。比起那时候，你如今对它们的了解已经深了许多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066805_1_2ea7c32e:
    # "...However, you might still have trouble figuring out what Sai did. He had to pull out something fairly clever to trick everyone."
    "……不过，你或许还是弄不清 Sai 做了什么。他为了骗过所有人，当时不得不用上相当高明的手段。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066806_1_a8fc5a6f:
    # "If you ever want to go back and attempt to see through his scenario, I hope you're able to beat him."
    "如果你日后想回去试着识破他的布局，希望你能赢过他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066813_1_874c202b:
    # "In reality, Atsuki and Miiya brought everyone to the crystal floor in an attempt to find Sai. Before he was seen, the Past Sekimeiya was found in room B6.{w} Sai was in the event room, and he suddenly heard people approaching. Hoping it would let him escape, he touched the Future Sekimeiya."
    "实际上，Atsuki 和 Miiya 为了找 Sai，把大家带到了水晶层。还没人看见他，过去Sekimeiya 就已经在水晶展室 B6 被发现了。{w} 当时 Sai 正在活动室，忽然听见有人靠近。他指望靠这个脱身，便碰了未来Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066815_1_a22530a8:
    # "Atsuki and Miiya brought everyone to the crystal floor in an attempt to find him. Before he was seen, the Past Sekimeiya was found in room B6.{w} Sai was in the event room, and he suddenly heard people approaching. Hoping it would let him escape, he touched the Future Sekimeiya."
    "Atsuki 和 Miiya 为了找他，把大家带到了水晶层。还没人看见他，过去Sekimeiya 就已经在水晶展室 B6 被发现了。{w} Sai 当时在活动室，忽然听见有人靠近。他指望靠这个脱身，便碰了未来Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066822_1_9676b9a6:
    # "Y—! You scared the fuck out of me!{w} Holy shit! What the fuck are you doing!? You almost hit me with the door!"
    "哇——！吓死我了！{w} 搞什么啊！你到底在干什么！？门差点砸到我身上！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066823_1_90884cd3:
    # "He thought he was safe as soon as he touched it, but the door still burst open."
    "他本以为一碰到那东西就安全了，门却还是猛地被撞开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066828_1_e1716480:
    # "Don't you think that's a better question for you? What are you doing!?"
    "这话不是该我问你吗？你在干什么！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066833_1_ac0b7d7b:
    # "I'm doing absolutely nothing."
    "我什么都没干。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066840_1_66983718:
    # "\"We turned to Katei, who hadn't interrupted us. He was perplexed, staring at his empty hands.\""
    "「我们转头看向 Katei。他刚才没有插话，此刻正困惑地盯着自己空空的双手。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066845_1_491cf5dd:
    # "What's up with you?"
    "你怎么了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066850_1_c74164d4:
    # "...Where's the Sekimeiya?"
    "……Sekimeiya 呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066855_1_e87edae6:
    # "What? I have no—"
    "什么？我根本没——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066856_1_bed3369d:
    # "I-It disappeared. I legitimately felt it disappear."
    "它、它消失了。我真的感觉到它消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066861_1_4d7a413f:
    # "Excuse me?"
    "你说什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066868_1_d33af9eb:
    # "Both had disappeared, as a world switch had been triggered. Oblivious, they found themselves in world A."
    "世界切换被触发了，两个 Sekimeiya 都随之消失。他们浑然不觉，已经身处 A 世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066869_1_5bf10fb2:
    # "\"Sai spun and looked at the cabinet covered by the curtain. Then, he looked all around the room with a slight frown.\""
    "「Sai 转过身，看向被遮布罩住的展示柜。随后，他微微皱眉，环视了一圈房间。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066870_1_a0045226:
    # "\"I was also moderately puzzled. Katei couldn't have been lying. He didn't have the Sekimeiya, it wasn't on the floor, and he couldn't have hidden it anywhere without us seeing it.\""
    "「我也有些困惑。Katei 不可能在撒谎。Sekimeiya 不在他手上，也不在地上；他更不可能当着我们的面把它藏到别处。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066871_1_7dcff14f:
    # "Out of nowhere, the cabinet was covered by its curtain. However, that was nothing compared to what awaited in hallway C."
    "不知何时，展示柜又被遮布罩住了。然而，与 C走廊里等着他们的景象相比，这根本不算什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066875_1_ffdbb2a7:
    # "The panel to call the elevator was gone.{w} ...All of them were. They had been ripped off on every floor."
    "呼叫电梯的面板不见了。{w} ……所有面板都不见了，每一层的都被拆掉了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066883_1_fab00be9:
    # "Wait, we didn't lock it, did we?"
    "等等，我们没锁门吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066884_1_f5e8a87e:
    # "What?"
    "什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066889_1_7768c8bb:
    # "You're right... I forgot to tell you to lock it because I was annoyed that Sai left."
    "说得对……我因为 Sai 走了而心烦，忘了提醒你们锁门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066894_1_0dc9821a:
    # "Whoa, then someone's definitely in here. Is it time to have a talk with Naomi? I wonder if she knows we can enter."
    "这么说，里面肯定有人。是不是该和 Naomi 谈谈了？不知道她到底知不知道我们能进来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066902_1_1f7a240d:
    # "In the living room, their footprints had disappeared."
    "客厅里，他们的脚印已经消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066904_1_82fc0a5a:
    # "And Katei was the lucky person who found the Future Sekimeiya in the open refrigerator. ...Opening it had been the last thing Sai A would ever do."
    "而 Katei 就是那个幸运儿，在敞开的冰箱里发现了未来Sekimeiya。……打开冰箱，成了 Sai A 此生做的最后一件事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066910_1_5943c3f6:
    # "Atsuki wanted to look at the BIOS's time, but the security room was locked. In addition, Sai realized the mark he'd left in the storeroom was gone. ...He was convinced someone had opened it, so he marked it again."
    "Atsuki 想查看 BIOS 的时间，但监控室锁着。另外，Sai 发现自己留在储藏室里的记号不见了。……他认定有人打开过那里，于是又做了一次标记。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066911_1_1dba2b43:
    # "Of course, that was far from the truth, but it made them believe that someone else had entered the tower."
    "当然，事实远非如此，但这让他们相信，确实有别人进过塔里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066916_1_49f84feb:
    # "The next time they attempted to enter the attic, it was locked again."
    "下一次他们想进阁楼时，门又锁上了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066917_1_cd38efcf:
    # "\"We all stared at the door in shock. It was locked.\""
    "「我们全都震惊地盯着那扇门。门锁着。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066918_1_3ab21aa6:
    # "Someone else is certainly in this building. I left the attic just now."
    "这栋楼里肯定还有别人。我刚从阁楼出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066919_1_3e7a2960:
    # "The truth behind that was the secret keyring Katei still had. Long before he'd traveled to the future, he'd left it in the security room so that he couldn't be found with it. He'd been able to retrieve it when he'd appeared there."
    "真相是，Katei 还带着那串秘密钥匙。早在他穿越到未来之前，就把钥匙留在了监控室，免得有人发现钥匙在他身上。后来他出现在监控室时，才把钥匙取了回来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066920_1_23c2e594:
    # "He'd left the key inserted in the door because he knew what had happened with the elevator: it was in the attic despite the panel having vanished.{w} Inside, he'd found that world's attic key. He could keep everyone from entering the highest floor by locking the door in.{w} He left it by bringing the elevator to the sixth floor; he could keep it there as a hidden way up. Since he had his set of keys, he could always access the attic through the elevator he'd prepared."
    "他把钥匙插在门上没有拔走，因为他知道电梯出了什么状况：面板明明已经消失，电梯却仍停在阁楼。{w} 在阁楼里，他找到了那个世界的阁楼钥匙。只要把门反锁，就能让众人无法进入顶层。{w} 他离开时把电梯叫到六楼停住，留作一条隐藏的上楼通道。由于他带着自己的那串钥匙，他随时都能通过准备好的电梯进入阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066927_1_a68ca5cb:
    # "But... it was found when Atsuki attempted to open it.{w} Inside, there were the bodies of Naomi C and Shiroya A."
    "可是……Atsuki 试着打开阁楼时，秘密还是暴露了。{w} 里面躺着 Naomi C 和 Shiroya A 的尸体。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066940_1_82dd80c5:
    # "The shock was natural. Naomi hadn't been seen for hours, and Shiroya had supposedly died weeks ago. It was undeniable that her existence was related to Atsuki and Miiya."
    "他们那么震惊也难怪。Naomi 已经好几个小时不见踪影，而 Shiroya 据说几周前就死了。她的存在与 Atsuki 和 Miiya 有关，这一点无可否认。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066941_1_2e247dbc:
    # "But nobody knew what had happened to the two women, and all they could do was bring them to the lobby."
    "但没人知道这两名女子遭遇了什么，他们能做的只有把她们搬到大厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066943_1_18d1022d:
    # "With the elevator, the group was able to reach the attic again, where they found the single key in its inner keyhole."
    "众人乘电梯再次来到阁楼，发现那把唯一的钥匙就插在里侧的锁孔里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066951_1_a2c0deb3:
    # "...Over thirty minutes later, a new dead body was found near the hallway C stairs."
    "……三十多分钟后，C走廊的楼梯附近又发现了一具尸体。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066958_1_7841c7ed:
    # "It was Erina A's."
    "那是 Erina A 的尸体。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066959_1_3eb3ca3c:
    # "Erina C, who they'd been with, was in room A1 with Isla. Meanwhile, the world A group was waiting in room B4. After Sai, Erina had been the second person to leave."
    "和他们在一起的 Erina C，此刻正和 Isla 待在 A1 房间。与此同时，A 世界的一行人正在 B4 房间等候。Sai 是第一个离开的，Erina 是第二个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066961_1_68fe78bd:
    # "\"Don't lie! It can only be you. You killed them.\""
    "「别撒谎！只可能是你。是你杀了她们。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066971_1_93841885:
    # "Everyone saw Erina's body atop a pool of blood. Someone had just killed her, and Atsuki had heard her words before dying. ...She had confronted who she'd thought was the killer.{w} However, it quickly became clear that nobody could've easily committed the crime. Everyone stated what they'd been doing."
    "所有人都看见了躺在血泊中的 Erina 的尸体。有人刚刚杀了她，而 Atsuki 死前听到过她说的话。……她曾当面质问那个她认定的凶手。{w} 然而，很快就查清，没有人能轻易犯下这桩罪行。众人也纷纷说出了自己当时在做什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066975_1_b9c79d96:
    # "Atsuki said that after being the first to leave the attic, he'd spent a few minutes on the second floor. He said that at one point, he heard the elevator once.{w} Miiya said that she'd left second and remained on the third floor until Atsuki ran up from below, letting her know what had happened.{w} Sai and Katei claimed to have been above them, and their versions of events seemed to confirm each other.{w} Akaro claimed to have left the attic last when Erina and Isla had still been sitting on the sofa, and that afterward, he'd stayed on the sixth floor alone."
    "Atsuki 说，他最先离开阁楼，之后在二楼待了几分钟。他说其间听到过一次电梯的动静。{w}Miiya 说自己是第二个离开的，一直待在三楼，直到 Atsuki 从楼下跑上来，告诉她出了事。{w}Sai 和 Katei 则说自己当时在他们上面，两人的说法似乎互相印证。{w}Akaro 说自己是最后离开阁楼的，那时 Erina 和 Isla 还坐在沙发上，之后他便独自留在六楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066976_1_9a283df6:
    # "The elevator was on the crystal floor. Since the panels hadn't been reattached, the \"1\" button must've been pressed from the attic.{w} It seemed like nobody could've performed a murder simply. The only way to get to the crystal floor after Atsuki's departure would've been by riding in the elevator with Erina and Isla. However, if that had happened, they couldn't have ended up above Atsuki when he'd gone to find everyone; nobody had seen them walking up, and the elevator hadn't been heard again."
    "电梯停在水晶展室。既然面板还没装回去，那个「1」按钮只能是从阁楼按的。{w}看来没人能轻松犯下这桩谋杀。Atsuki 离开之后，想上水晶展室，唯一的办法就是和 Erina、Isla 一同乘电梯。可若是那样，等 Atsuki 去找大家时，他们就不可能出现在他上方——没人看见他们走上去，也没人再听到电梯响过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066977_1_14f1538f:
    # "There were three main options in everyone's minds, and one was correct."
    "每个人心里都有三个主要可能，其中只有一个是对的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066984_1_2393eb2b:
    # "Atsuki hadn't been lying; everything he said was the truth."
    "Atsuki 没有撒谎，他说的每句话都是真的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066985_1_2d722018:
    # "People they didn't know about were present in the building—the world A group. However, none of them had left room B4."
    "楼里还有他们不知道的人——A世界的那群人。可那些人谁也没有离开过 B4房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066986_1_5c9f294f:
    # "The answer had to be the Sekimeiya. Someone would travel through time and kill Erina."
    "答案只能是 Sekimeiya。有人会穿越时间，杀死 Erina。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066987_1_1eb2a2e3:
    # "For them, that seemed like a fickle solution; there was no way to prove it. If that was the case, unless the culprit had already escaped, they had to search for them."
    "他们觉得这答案虚无缥缈，也无从证实。若果真如此，除非凶手早已逃出去，否则就只能去搜捕凶手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066988_1_bf6e6bb8:
    # "However, for you, that solution might seem odd."
    "不过，你可能会觉得这个答案很奇怪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066991_1_a624261c:
    # "You know what happened in that world. The Past Sekimeiya was in room B4 with the world A group.{w} It was in the cabinet where Akaro had put it, and it wasn't activated until he and Isla world switched to world B."
    "你知道那个世界发生了什么。过去Sekimeiya 和 A世界那组人一起留在了 B4 房间。{w}它就在 Akaro 放进去的那个展示柜里，直到他和 Isla 一起世界切换到了 B世界，它才被启动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L066994_1_ebf0f3c4:
    # "After that, what happened to it? Shiroya B found it and was able to world switch to world B. Later on, Sai B found it was well and world switched back to world B.{w} Lastly, Atsuki A found it and also world switched to world B."
    "那之后它又怎样了？Shiroya B 找到了它，借此世界切换到了 B世界。后来，Sai B 也找到了它，随后世界切换回了 B世界。{w}最后，Atsuki A 找到它，同样世界切换到了 B世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067001_1_e9cb1061:
    # "That was it. The Past Sekimeiya from world A wasn't activated ever again."
    "到此为止。A世界的过去Sekimeiya 再也没有被启动过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067004_1_b2dd9986:
    # "So then, who killed Erina? How did her killer show up before her and push her off the stairs?"
    "那么，究竟是谁杀了 Erina？凶手又是怎样出现在她面前，把她推下楼梯的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067010_1_4c27f5c7:
    # "Her killer couldn't have world switched before her. After all, they would've had to appear from world C, where Atsuki was experimenting with the Sekimeiya in the attic."
    "凶手不可能先于她完成世界切换。毕竟，那样他们只能是从 C世界出现的——在 C世界，Atsuki 正在阁楼里试验 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067012_1_ed959c0f:
    # "The Past Sekimeiya couldn't have been used to carry out her murder. The key to solving it was the Future Sekimeiya."
    "这场谋杀不可能借助过去Sekimeiya 完成。解谜的关键在于未来Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067015_1_c24493a0:
    # "It was the one that Katei had found in the kitchen refrigerator. He hid it somewhere in the attic, which he locked, intending to keep it away from the others."
    "那就是 Katei 在厨房冰箱里找到的那一个。他把它藏在阁楼某处，并锁上了阁楼，不想让其他人拿到它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067016_1_97d28d93:
    # "Before the world C group arrived in world A, only one person had touched the Future Sekimeiya: Sai A. However, he immediately died where he arrived. In other words, nobody from world A could've killed Erina."
    "在 C世界的人抵达 A世界之前，只有一个人碰过未来Sekimeiya：Sai A。可他一到就死了。换言之，A世界的人不可能杀死 Erina。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067017_1_3debd00f:
    # "Before her death, the world C group had been on the crystal floor; anyone who traveled to the future could've appeared there, bypassing Atsuki's view."
    "在她死之前，C世界那组人一直待在水晶展室；任何穿越到未来的人都可能出现在那里，避开 Atsuki 的视线。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067018_1_cc198c4b:
    # "But that wouldn't have been all. After appearing there, they would've had to make it above him, and such a thing didn't seem simple. No Sekimeiya could've been activated on the crystal floor, and the elevator never went back up."
    "但事情不止如此。出现在那里之后，他们还得绕到他上方，而这绝非易事。水晶展室里不可能启动任何 Sekimeiya，电梯也再没有上去过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067025_1_3287e4a5:
    # "People were leaving, and Isla said she wanted to come down too since she still hadn't seen all the gems. I noticed she was trying to cheer herself up a little despite the... two bodies we found, so even though I didn't want to leave, I went with her just so that it took her mind off it."
    "大家陆续离开了，Isla 说她也想下楼，因为她还没把宝石看完。我看出她是在强打精神——毕竟我们发现了……两具尸体。所以尽管我并不想走，还是陪她一起下去，好让她分散些心思。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067026_1_860a9f8e:
    # "\"People were leaving\". Erina and Isla were on the sofa then, and from their point of view, not everyone had left the attic."
    "「大家陆续离开了」——那时 Erina 和 Isla 正坐在沙发上，从她们的位置看，并不是所有人都离开了阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067033_1_a29403ac:
    # "There's only one person who could've done it."
    "能做到这件事的，只有一个人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067039_1_eaf1ef20:
    # "\"I walked to the bedrooms and opened the left one. I needed to throw myself onto the bed and be alone for some time.\""
    "「我走到几间卧室前，打开了左边那间。我只想扑到床上，独自待上一阵。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067044_1_23af819a:
    # "\"I stood in the middle of the floor 3 corridor. I didn't want to see the others, so I'd been thinking to myself.\""
    "「我站在三楼走廊中央。我不想见到其他人，就一直独自想着心事。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067045_1_0603fd6d:
    # "\"As anyone could've been anywhere, all I wanted was to wait. I could perceive faint footsteps above me, signaling someone was on the fourth floor. I approached a potted plant and sat next to it. I calmly felt the seconds pass, appreciating the sensation.\""
    "「谁都可能在任何一个地方，我只想等着。我隐约听到头顶有脚步声，说明有人在四楼。我走到一盆绿植旁坐下。我平静地感受着时间一秒秒流逝，享受着这种感觉。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067051_1_52e6b039:
    # "A-Are you alone...!? Where are the others?"
    "你、你一个人……！？其他人呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067052_1_f8e043ef:
    # "\"He was pretty agitated, so I kept my composure and waited for him to tell me what had occurred. Everything about him gave away that he'd seen something frightful.\""
    "「他相当激动，我便保持镇定，等他说出发生了什么。他的一举一动都说明他看见了什么可怕的东西。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067058_1_21ba0adc:
    # "\"Erina's body lay facing down over a vast pool of blood, traces of which started in the middle of the staircase. I didn't have to walk farther down to know she was dead.\""
    "「Erina 的尸体俯卧在一大片血泊中，血迹从楼梯中段一路延伸过来。无需再往下走，我也知道她已经死了。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067060_1_17c44f27:
    # "I-I think someone was on the floor above me at some point. Were you alone when you found her?"
    "我、我好像有一阵觉得楼上有人。你发现她的时候是一个人吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067065_1_138cccee:
    # "\"I kept walking down while I silently wondered why he'd been alone. On the floor of hallway C, I pressed two fingers to Erina's body and waited for any perceptible movement.\""
    "「我一边往下走，一边暗自纳闷他怎么会是一个人。到了 C走廊那一层，我把两根手指搭在 Erina 身上，想探探还有没有动静。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067066_1_e5b84ea8:
    # "It's not possible for us to take the elevator, so let's walk up. We should come across someone."
    "电梯是坐不成了，我们走上去吧。总会碰上人的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067067_1_429c1dbb:
    # "\"My heavy breathing was interrupting my words, and I didn't let my gaze stray from Erina. Being so close to her, I noticed that blood was coming out of the part of her head that hit the edge of a step.\""
    "「我喘得厉害，话都说不连贯，视线却始终没离开 Erina。靠得这样近，我才发现她头上撞到台阶边沿的地方还在渗血。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067073_1_da6ab799:
    # "\"With what we'd talked about, could Erina's killer be identified? I didn't think so, but there was a chance I was failing to consider something.\""
    "凭我们刚才说的这些，能找出杀害 Erina 的凶手吗？我觉得不能，但也许有什么是我没想到的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067081_1_0e1f63db:
    # "\"She was there, casually leaning against the line of cabinets. I could hardly believe what I was seeing, but there was no wariness in her eyes and not even a trace of blood near her.\""
    "她就在那里，随意地靠在一排展示柜上。我几乎不敢相信自己的眼睛，可她眼里没有一丝警惕，身旁也看不到半点血迹。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067091_1_f6dc9ab9:
    # "Most people weren't aware that traveling to the future was possible. When Miiya noticed the peculiar smell again and touched the Sekimeiya, she immediately thought she'd traveled to the past."
    "大多数人并不知道穿越到未来是可能的。当 Miiya 再次闻到那股异样的气味、碰到 Sekimeiya 时，她立刻以为自己回到了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067096_1_7106b87a:
    # "She appeared where she'd been in the past; it was what had happened before. That made her think she'd gone back in time."
    "她出现在自己过去待过的地方；眼前正是曾经发生过的事。这让她以为自己回到了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067098_1_9dcd733f:
    # "She was alone above the hallway C stairs when she suddenly heard Erina's voice."
    "她独自待在 C走廊楼梯上方，忽然听到了 Erina 的声音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067099_1_ed1ef4be:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067106_1_a439f15d:
    # "\"Don't lie! It can only be you. You killed them.\""
    "「别撒谎！只可能是你。是你杀了她们。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067107_1_2388e120:
    # "Erina had seen the bodies in the lobby. Shiroya had died, but she'd just been in the crystal room. Sai hadn't come back.{w} ...Naomi was dead, and earlier in the day, what had happened with the elevator buttons convinced Erina that the killer was someone they'd been unable to find."
    "Erina 见过大厅里的尸体。Shiroya 死了，可她刚刚还在水晶展室；Sai 没有回来。{w}……Naomi 也死了。而那天早些时候，电梯按钮的事让 Erina 认定，凶手是一个他们始终找不到的人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067108_1_92335e7f:
    # "...Miiya."
    "……Miiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067111_1_ffdb9213:
    # "The way Miiya looked at her only made her more convinced. When she dismissed the accusation with quiet, cold words, Erina ran up the stairs in sheer agitation."
    "Miiya 看她的眼神反而让她更加确信。Miiya 用平静而冰冷的话否定了指控，Erina 一时激愤，冲上了楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067114_1_2bc340ca:
    # "She was quickly knocked back. In midair, she let out a yell that cut off upon impact."
    "她当即被撞了回来。她在半空中喊了一声，撞上时戛然而止。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067120_1_2771fdc5:
    # "Miiya wasn't sure what to do. She stared at Erina, processing the fact that she wasn't moving. Then, slowly, she took a few steps backward."
    "Miiya 一时不知如何是好。她盯着 Erina，慢慢意识到她一动不动，随后缓缓退后了几步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067125_1_60d16e16:
    # "Shock rushed through her when she heard footsteps approaching. Atsuki was about to see her."
    "听到脚步声逼近，她浑身一震。Atsuki 就要看到她了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067129_1_5ba25395:
    # "To hide from him, she rushed into one of the bathrooms on the second floor."
    "为了躲开他，她冲进了二楼的一间洗手间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067135_1_45a0125c:
    # "The first thing Atsuki did was run down the stairs and check Erina's pulse, which allowed Miiya to escape toward the third floor."
    "Atsuki 先是跑下楼梯去探 Erina 的脉搏，Miiya 便趁机逃向三楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067139_1_7d10e565:
    # "There, she heard someone above her. She'd looked at the security cameras and seen no green lights, which perhaps meant that she hadn't been recorded."
    "在那里，她听见上方有人。她曾看过监控摄像头，没见到绿灯亮起，这或许意味着她没有被拍下。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067140_1_9d126885:
    # "Nonetheless, she was completely certain that she'd changed the past."
    "即便如此，她十分确信，自己改变了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067145_1_5d468a30:
    # "However, after Atsuki came running from below, she soon realized that she couldn't easily explain what had happened."
    "然而，Atsuki 从楼下跑上来之后，她很快意识到，发生的事根本无法轻易解释清楚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067150_1_9caaa05c:
    # "It's not possible for us to take the elevator, so let's walk up. We should come across someone."
    "电梯是坐不成了，我们走上去吧。总会碰上人的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067151_1_ca97276b:
    # "She attempted to hide her future knowledge. At that point in time, the elevator hadn't been opened yet; nobody knew it was usable despite the broken panels.{w} And despite the fact that they should have been together recently, Atsuki had told her he'd been alone. ...Did that mean that she'd overwritten her past self?"
    "她想隐瞒自己知道未来的事。那时电梯还没被人打开过；面板虽已破损，却没人知道它还能用。{w} 而不久前他们本该待在一起，Atsuki 却说自己一直独自一人。……这是不是意味着，她覆盖了过去的自己？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067155_1_e706a512:
    # "\"I saw that the attic key was inserted into the door. We all entered to find the missing person.\""
    "「我看见阁楼的钥匙已经插在门上。我们一起进去找失踪的那个人。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067158_1_91ad0269:
    # "\"I stared at the floor's footprints—the proof that the past had changed. I had no idea how, but it was undeniable that it greatly had.\""
    "我盯着地板上的脚印——那是过去被改写的证据。我不知道是怎么做到的，但无可否认，过去已经大不一样了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067165_1_c386c6ee:
    # "...Should I bring her to the lobby?"
    "……要我把她带到大厅去吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067166_1_45f1f301:
    # "To the lobby? Why?"
    "带到大厅？为什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067167_1_d672b92a:
    # "So she's with the others. Sorry, that was stupid of me. This time, this is actually where she died."
    "这样她就能和其他人在一起了。抱歉，是我糊涂了。这次，她确实是死在这里的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067168_1_20836f5a:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067169_1_09718b30:
    # "\"I went quiet. I'd begun to form a small theory, but it appeared I was wrong. After that, I realized I had no idea what had actually happened.\""
    "「我沉默了。我本已隐约想到一种可能，看来是我猜错了。随后我才意识到，自己根本不清楚究竟发生了什么。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067170_1_15811ec7:
    # "When everyone saw Erina's corpse and began to explain what they'd done, Miiya realized her perception was flawed."
    "当众人看到 Erina 的尸体、开始说明自己做过什么时，Miiya 意识到自己的认知有误。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067171_1_d44e16e1:
    # "Had she only traveled a few seconds through time? She wasn't sure."
    "难道她只穿越了几秒钟的时间？她并不确定。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067178_1_9e907253:
    # "When it was her turn to clear her name, she said she'd left the attic after Atsuki and that she'd stayed on the third floor."
    "轮到她自证清白时，她说自己比 Atsuki 晚离开阁楼，之后一直待在三楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067179_1_5a69165c:
    # "...Did Atsuki notice that contradiction?"
    "……Atsuki 察觉到那处矛盾了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067180_1_dfffe67e:
    # "I just wanted to be alone for a bit, but I didn't feel like staying put somewhere. However, I ended up spending the most time on the third floor, where I heard the elevator. I spent some time in the offices and some outside."
    "我只是想一个人待一会儿，却又不愿意老是停在同一个地方。结果，我在三楼待的时间最长，也是在那一层听到了电梯的声音。我在几间办公室待过，也到过外面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067181_1_099b9794:
    # "Everyone stated that the elevator had been heard once, so she'd been forced to go along with it.{w} However, if she'd really heard it, she should've known that the elevator had ended up on one of the first two floors."
    "所有人都说只听到过一次电梯的声音，她也只能顺着这么说。{w} 可是，倘若她真的听见了，就该知道电梯最后停在了一楼或二楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067187_1_7793449d:
    # "It's not possible for us to take the elevator, so let's walk up. We should come across someone."
    "电梯是坐不成了，我们走上去吧。总会碰上人的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067188_1_c8963d80:
    # "So, why had she said that they couldn't have taken the elevator up when she and Atsuki had seen the body? The panels hadn't been reattached—if the elevator had been above them, they wouldn't have been able to use it. However, if she'd heard it on the third floor, she should've known it was next to Erina's body."
    "那么，她和 Atsuki 看到尸体时，为什么说他们不可能坐电梯上去？面板还没有装回去——如果电梯当时在他们上方，他们就用不了它。可如果她是在三楼听见的，就该知道电梯当时停在 Erina 的尸体旁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067189_1_3ca28108:
    # "...Did Atsuki make that connection? Did he choose to omit the fact that he hadn't heard Miiya's footsteps above him?"
    "……Atsuki 想到这一层了吗？他是故意不提自己没听见头顶上 Miiya 的脚步声吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067197_1_9eeb8995:
    # "In any case, they found out that Erina was still alive. She and Isla had been in room A1 since they'd taken the elevator down."
    "总之，他们得知 Erina 还活着。她和 Isla 乘电梯下去之后，就一直待在 A1房间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067201_1_fba6422a:
    # "The next time a Sekimeiya was found, it was in one of the attic's wardrobes."
    "下一次发现 Sekimeiya，是在阁楼的一只衣柜里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067208_1_b2a28d2c:
    # "Look what I found!"
    "看我找到了什么！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067209_1_f8aaf98e:
    # "\"With two hands, Isla was holding one of the bed sheets, folded up into a sphere. It was wrapped around something, and I could tell what Isla was going to say before she did.\""
    "「Isla 双手捧着一条团成球状的床单，里面裹着什么东西。她还没开口，我就猜到她要说什么了。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067210_1_2379e7f7:
    # "It's the Sekimeiya."
    "是 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067215_1_391c26f5:
    # "What? The Sekimeiya's on the crystal floor."
    "什么？Sekimeiya 明明在水晶展室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067220_1_e555e810:
    # "No, I have it here. It was in the, um... wardrobe."
    "不对，它就在我这儿。它刚才在……呃，衣柜里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067221_1_32a8ee73:
    # "It was the Future Sekimeiya that Miiya had activated. Within the sheet, it gathered energy very quickly.{w} The killer could've been hiding somewhere, so starting with the attic, they searched every floor. Since they had the Sekimeiya, they figured nobody could use it to hide from them."
    "那是 Miiya 启动过的未来Sekimeiya。它在床单里蓄能极快。{w} 凶手可能藏在某处，于是他们从阁楼开始，逐层搜查。既然 Sekimeiya 在他们手上，他们便认为谁也没法借它躲过搜查。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067227_1_2e160ab3:
    # "But the search didn't yield any results..."
    "然而搜查毫无结果……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067233_1_8a4cb177:
    # "The world A group was in room B4, but they weren't found."
    "A世界的一组人就在 B4房间，却没被找到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067234_1_9eb363f6:
    # "Akaro, Isla, Atsuki, and Shiroya remained there. Akaro and Isla world switched to world B, but Shiroya and Atsuki stayed behind."
    "留在那里的是 Akaro、Isla、Atsuki 和 Shiroya。Akaro 与 Isla 世界切换到了 B世界，Shiroya 和 Atsuki 则留了下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067235_1_997adbe4:
    # "The reason they weren't seen was that everyone else world switched."
    "他们之所以没被看见，是因为其余所有人都发生了世界切换。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067238_1_11c543f8:
    # "The world C group world switched..."
    "C世界的一组人也发生了世界切换……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067243_1_74048a60:
    # "When they were on an office floor. More specifically, on the second floor."
    "那时他们正在办公楼层。更准确地说，是在二楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067246_1_6c08c003:
    # "Isla A touched the Past Sekimeiya in the cabinet. Akaro had set it to 5 °C, so it had slowly gathered energy. Since the Future Sekimeiya was on the second floor, the overlapping ranges created a world switch."
    "Isla A 碰了展示柜里的过去Sekimeiya。Akaro 把它设成 5 °C，因此它一直在缓慢蓄能。由于未来Sekimeiya 就在二楼，两者的作用范围重叠，引发了世界切换。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067249_1_b38c591c:
    # "Everyone but Shiroya B and Atsuki A world switched to world B. ...Alongside both groups, there was someone else who world switched as well."
    "除了 Shiroya B 和 Atsuki A，所有人都世界切换到了 B世界。……而除了这两组人，还有一个人也发生了世界切换。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067258_1_46b025c5:
    # "Naomi C, who was in the lobby, world switched too."
    "待在大厅里的 Naomi C 也发生了世界切换。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067264_1_c3ca9bf0:
    # "Naomi and Shiroya were in the lobby, but only Naomi world switched. That happened because she was still alive."
    "Naomi 和 Shiroya 都在大厅，但只有 Naomi 发生了世界切换，因为她仍活着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067269_1_584dced1:
    # "When Isla A touched the Past Sekimeiya, the Future Sekimeiya was just outside the partitions on the second floor."
    "Isla A 碰到过去Sekimeiya 时，未来Sekimeiya 正好在二楼的隔间外。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067279_1_8c1bbef1:
    # "...Which was right above the lobby.{w} This is why Shiroya and Atsuki were the only two who didn't world switch—they were in hallway C."
    "……而那里就在大厅的正上方。{w} 正因如此，只有 Shiroya 和 Atsuki 两人没有发生世界切换——他们当时在 C走廊。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067284_1_c16496db:
    # "When the world switch happened, Isla C had the Future Sekimeiya wrapped up deep inside the bed sheet. She didn't immediately notice its disappearance."
    "世界切换发生时，未来Sekimeiya 正被 Isla C 裹在床单深处，她并没有立刻察觉它不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067287_1_d3f0211d:
    # "However, what everyone did notice was that the elevator panel had reappeared. Not only on the second floor, but on all of them."
    "不过，所有人都注意到，电梯的面板重新出现了。不只是二楼，每一层都是如此。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067291_1_c21e9e9f:
    # "Shiroya and Atsuki remained in world A with the corpses. When they went to the second floor, they saw the single Sekimeiya outside the partitions, which Shiroya was later able to use to return to world B."
    "Shiroya 和 Atsuki 与那些尸体一起留在了 A世界。两人上到二楼时，看见隔间外孤零零地放着一个 Sekimeiya，后来 Shiroya 正是用它回到了 B世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067300_1_a9291322:
    # "The moment everyone else world switched to world B, the world B group was in the attic. They had locked themselves in a bedroom."
    "就在其他所有人都世界切换到 B世界的那一刻，B世界那组人正在阁楼里，把自己反锁在一间卧室里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067303_1_c9ada8aa:
    # "And when the world C group saw the Sekimeiya in the cabinet, Isla unwrapped the bed sheet and saw that hers had disappeared. The Sekimeiya behind the glass was the Past Sekimeiya, which the world B group had left locked in the cabinet before going to the attic."
    "而当 C世界那组人看到展示柜里的 Sekimeiya 时，Isla 解开了床单，发现自己的那个已经不见了。玻璃后面那个就是过去Sekimeiya。B世界那组人去阁楼前，把它锁在了展示柜里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067310_1_e19aded9:
    # "Wait, it's still here."
    "等等，它还在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067317_1_16c013e1:
    # "\"Isla rapidly unwrapped the sheet to prove that she hadn't lied.\""
    "「Isla 飞快地解开床单，想证明自己没有说谎。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067324_1_40c02092:
    # "Hang on, it's not here. The thread I left."
    "等等，不在这儿。我留下的那根线也不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067331_1_5a20017b:
    # "It's not here...! The Sekimeiya!"
    "不在这儿……！Sekimeiya 不见了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067338_1_a500a26b:
    # "...I-Is this what you're implying? That it was taken out of the cabinet since the thread is gone and then brought to the attic? Then, at some point, it teleported inside again?{w} I have another idea. Let me take the Sekimeiya. Akaro and Katei, you watch the stairs."
    "……你、你是说，线不见了，所以有人把它从展示柜里拿出来带去了阁楼？然后它又在某个时刻传送回柜子里？{w} 我有个别的想法。Sekimeiya 我来拿。Akaro、Katei，你们盯住楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067344_1_ec98b77a:
    # "Why?"
    "为什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067352_1_d5b2b5ff:
    # "Because the last time it wasn't working, remember? I can test if it is now without activating it."
    "因为上次它没起作用，还记得吧？现在不用启动它，我也能试出它是否恢复正常。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067360_1_866de9d2:
    # "\"Sai grabbed the Sekimeiya with his sleeves, causing the curtain to fall, and put it in the middle of the sheet.\""
    "「Sai 隔着袖子抓住 Sekimeiya，遮布随之落下，他把 Sekimeiya 放到了床单中央。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067361_1_a8a38519:
    # "It was very cold, so let's see if that changes."
    "它刚才冰得很，看看这样会不会有变化。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067368_1_c3c89bf8:
    # "\"He wrapped it around with one layer of the cloth and waited a few seconds with his hand over it.\""
    "「他用布裹了一层，把手覆在上面，等了几秒。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067373_1_46971774:
    # "...It is getting hot—definitely.{w} All right, I'm sure there's someone on this floor. Don't take your eyes off the stairs. I'm not sure we'll find them, though."
    "……热起来了——确实是热了。{w}好，这一层肯定有人。盯紧楼梯。不过能不能找到，就不好说了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067378_1_0c3ec5e4:
    # "Why do you say that?"
    "为什么这么说？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067379_1_ae55f4e3:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067384_1_cff62690:
    # "Back then, you said it was burning and you could hardly hold it. Is it possible it teleports when it gets too hot?"
    "当时你说它烫得几乎拿不住。会不会是热到一定程度，它就会传送？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067389_1_c345d6c6:
    # "And the next time we found it, it wasn't working. It could be that..."
    "而下一次我们找到它时，它已经失灵了。会不会是因为……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067394_1_343548d1:
    # "It's working now, but we can test it. If the outer layer of the sheet felt hot for Isla, it's possible that it making the sheet hot made it heat up even more quickly."
    "它现在还能用，不过可以试一试。Isla 隔着床单都能摸到烫，那也许是床单被加热后，反过来让它升温更快。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067395_1_81cce835:
    # "\"Sai wrapped the Sekimeiya up completely once again.\""
    "「Sai 又把 Sekimeiya 整个裹了起来。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067402_1_5403e97e:
    # "Inside the wrapped sheet, the Past Sekimeiya quickly gathered energy. When Sai touched it in hallway A, they world switched to world C, leaving the sheet behind. The Future Sekimeiya had been very close, and its range was considerable, as it would soon make Akaro travel weeks to the future."
    "裹在布里的 过去Sekimeiya 很快积蓄了能量。Sai 在 A走廊碰到它时，世界切换到了 C世界，那块布则被留在了原地。未来Sekimeiya 就在不远处，作用范围也相当广——很快，它就会把 Akaro 送到数周之后的未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067403_1_ff3ddbef:
    # "Without realizing it, they were back in their world. They had made a full loop."
    "不知不觉间，他们已经回到了自己的世界，完成了一次完整的循环。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067407_1_edef3eb1:
    # "They inspected the crystal floor, but nobody was found. Akaro and Isla A had remained in world B.{w} However, there were many things they noticed: Suripo's body had reappeared, and Shiroya's had disappeared. But Naomi was still there—she had returned to her world too, and the blood that had pooled below her had vanished."
    "他们查过水晶层，却一个人也没找到。Akaro 和 Isla A 留在了 B世界。{w}不过，他们注意到了不少变化：Suripo 的尸体重新出现，Shiroya 的却不见了。可 Naomi 还在——她也回到了自己的世界，身下积的那摊血却已经消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067410_1_457a067c:
    # "...Oh wait, look at Naomi's head."
    "……等等，看 Naomi 的头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067411_1_f0abf56c:
    # "\"From the wound she had, quite a bit of blood was pouring out.\""
    "「她的伤口正往外涌出不少血。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067412_1_c9094081:
    # "Yes, more blood is coming out than before."
    "没错，血比刚才流得更多了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067413_1_89266c50:
    # "And it seems like it started just now, right? Otherwise, the pool on the floor would be much bigger."
    "而且看起来是刚刚才开始流的，对吧？否则地上的血泊会大得多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067416_1_c46f27a3:
    # "They'd all returned to world C, but during the brief time they'd been in world B, Naomi's had been the only body in the lobby. She'd been bleeding from her head, so she'd left a large spot of blood on the polished floor.{w} That blood confused many people, but the person most thoroughly deceived by it was Sai B.{w} When he world switched to world A, only Shiroya's corpse was in the lobby, and there was blood next to her. Of course, he naturally assumed that it was hers, not Naomi's.{w} However, when he returned to world B, not only had the pool shrunk, but Shiroya's corpse had disappeared—she was still alive in that world."
    "所有人都回到了 C世界。但他们在 B世界待的那一小段时间里，大厅里的尸体只有 Naomi 一具。血从她头部流出，在光洁的地板上留下一大片血迹。{w}那片血迹让不少人产生了误解，被它骗得最彻底的正是 Sai B。{w}当他切换到 A世界时，大厅里只有 Shiroya 的尸体，旁边还有一摊血。他自然以为那是她的血，而不是 Naomi 的。{w}可当他回到 B世界，血迹不仅缩小了，Shiroya 的尸体也不见了——在那个世界里，她还活着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067425_1_d7a67774:
    # "In world C, it became clear that understanding what had happened around them might've been out of everyone's grasp. Nobody had been found, but the bizarre occurrences within the tower hadn't stopped."
    "在 C世界，众人渐渐明白，身边发生的一切，或许没人能真正弄懂。一个人也没找到，可塔内的怪事仍未停歇。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067426_1_4079e67d:
    # "The security room had unlocked, Erina's body had disappeared, the Sekimeiya had teleported..."
    "监控室的门开了，Erina 的尸体不见了，Sekimeiya 也传送走了……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067427_1_20cb2e57:
    # "That time, Miiya had found it in room A1. It was the fake Sekimeiya, which they decided to leave in the event room for good."
    "那一次，Miiya 在 A1房间找到了它。那是赝品 Sekimeiya，他们决定就把它永远留在活动室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067428_1_330f339d:
    # "After that, things finally slowed down."
    "那之后，事情总算平息了一些。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067431_1_eea8c563:
    # "And a long time later, Miiya had the urge to lie down. She went to the attic, where she fell asleep."
    "很久之后，Miiya 忽然很想躺下。她去了阁楼，在那里睡着了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067443_1_24f45d0c:
    # "When she woke up, the light suddenly turned on. That was the sign of a world switch."
    "她醒来时，灯忽然亮了。那是世界切换的征兆。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067444_1_1a2ecf9b:
    # "The exact appearance of the bed where she'd been had changed, but she couldn't notice that, as the light had been off. In the world where she appeared, the sheets had been messy as well."
    "她躺的那张床，样子其实已经变了，只是灯一直关着，她没能察觉。在她所抵达的那个世界里，床单同样凌乱。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067445_1_5b6d69ff:
    # "Nobody was above her, and she heard sounds coming from the opposite bedroom. ...It was Shiroya, who'd been trapped there by Sai."
    "她上方没有人，对面卧室却传来动静。……是 Shiroya，她被 Sai 关在了那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067446_1_40ad6dc0:
    # "Is there anything wrong with this?"
    "这有什么问题吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067452_1_d27f35bc:
    # "...Shiroya was locked behind that door. It follows that Miiya was in world B."
    "……Shiroya 被锁在那扇门后。照此推断，Miiya 当时在 B世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067455_1_be1b3ee6:
    # "However, the first time a world switch happened from world C, everyone went to world A."
    "可是，第一次从 C世界发生切换时，所有人都去了 A世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067456_1_ecc22f90:
    # "The world switch order is A - B - C - A... Why did Miiya go from world C to world B, then?"
    "世界切换的顺序是 A－B－C－A……那么，Miiya 为什么会从 C世界到 B世界？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067463_1_e3a26ebc:
    # "If she had world switched while she slept, she would have died. By lying in bed, she pressed the mattress down. Upon changing worlds, her body would've been split in half by an uncompressed mattress."
    "如果她在睡着时发生世界切换，她就死了。躺上床时，她把床垫压了下去。一旦换了世界，未被压下的床垫就会把她的身体从中间劈开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067464_1_05150ec0:
    # "The reason does not follow the order you're accustomed to."
    "这其中的原因，并不符合你们习惯的那个顺序。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067465_1_f9398021:
    # "Can you recall another time a backward world switch happened?"
    "还能想起另一次逆向的世界切换吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067474_1_0f59b29c:
    # "After Sai and Akaro escaped the attic's bedroom, Sai world switched to world A while in room B6. ...From world B, he went to world A."
    "Sai 和 Akaro 逃出阁楼的卧室之后，Sai 在 B6房间里切换到了 A世界。……他从 B世界去了 A世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067478_1_64678b07:
    # "What about a third instance?"
    "那第三次呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067485_1_f16e1f64:
    # "Yes. When Atsuki and Erina returned to world B, they had been in world C. Once again, they went from world C to world B."
    "对。Atsuki 和 Erina 回到 B世界的时候，他们原本在 C世界。他们又一次从 C世界去了 B世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067487_1_acc596ac:
    # "When Atsuki and Erina returned to world B, they had been in world C. Once again, they went from world C to world B."
    "Atsuki 和 Erina 回到 B世界的时候，他们原本在 C世界。他们又一次从 C世界去了 B世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067492_1_7dbeb7b4:
    # "Is there anything interesting that these examples share?"
    "这些例子有什么有趣的共同点吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067499_1_06a01eea:
    # "That is not the case."
    "并非如此。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067500_1_56187d75:
    # "The similarity is that neither of the Sekimeiya were activated in their world."
    "共同点是，两个 Sekimeiya 在他们所在的世界里都没有被激活。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067502_1_1b1c982a:
    # "Exactly. Neither of the Sekimeiya were activated in their world."
    "正是。两个 Sekimeiya 在他们所在的世界里都没有被激活。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067504_1_b9c91659:
    # "That's wrong. In Sai's case, it was his first time."
    "不对。Sai 那一次是头一回。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067505_1_28431598:
    # "The similarity is that neither of the Sekimeiya were activated in their world."
    "共同点是，两个 Sekimeiya 在他们所在的世界里都没有被激活。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067507_1_14a92b81:
    # "In Sai's case..."
    "Sai 那一次……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067513_1_caa99fbd:
    # "\"Puzzled, he stepped into hallway B. ...What had just happened?{w} Out of nowhere, the Sekimeiya had disappeared.{w} He wondered if he'd traveled through time. Even though he hadn't touched the Sekimeiya, something peculiar had occurred.\""
    "「他满腹疑惑，走进了 B走廊。……刚才究竟发生了什么？{w}Sekimeiya 忽然不见了。{w}他怀疑自己是不是经历了时间穿越。明明没有碰过 Sekimeiya，却出了怪事。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067514_1_e871efa5:
    # "Sai world switched without touching the Sekimeiya, and he had both of them."
    "Sai 没碰 Sekimeiya 就切换了世界，而且两个都在他手上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067515_1_96c90f2d:
    # "So, then, why did he world switch? Is there another shared similarity?"
    "那么，他为什么会切换世界？还有别的共同点吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067526_1_fd10ab62:
    # "That's not it. Both Sekimeiya had been used recently when Sai world switched."
    "不是这个。Sai 切换世界时，两个 Sekimeiya 都刚被用过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067527_1_987edd5c:
    # "...It happened when they were pulled from the previous world."
    "……是在它们被从前一个世界拉过来时发生的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067529_1_6def66c7:
    # "That's not it."
    "也不对。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067530_1_cf74f02e:
    # "It happened when they were pulled from the previous world."
    "事情就发生在它们被从前一个世界拉过来的时候。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067532_1_8cc5535d:
    # "Yes. It happened when they were pulled from the previous world."
    "没错。事情就发生在它们被从前一个世界拉过来的时候。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067533_1_d8c436ad:
    # "When Sai world switched from world B to world A, someone world switched from world A to world B.{w} ...Shiroya."
    "当 Sai 从 B世界切换到 A世界时，也有人从 A世界切换到了 B世界。{w}……是 Shiroya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067536_1_0b365c78:
    # "In the storeroom, she touched the Sekimeiya to return to her world."
    "她在储藏室里触碰了 Sekimeiya，回到了自己的世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067545_1_e54c5958:
    # "When Miiya world switched from world C to world B, someone world switched from world B to world C. In the event room, Erina, Atsuki, and Shiroya suddenly appeared in world C."
    "当 Miiya 从 C世界切换到 B世界时，也有人从 B世界切换到了 C世界。活动室里，Erina、Atsuki 和 Shiroya 突然出现在 C世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067554_1_de131ac3:
    # "Every time a world switch was activated, it occurred in the world someone would be sent to as well. If someone was in the overlapping ranges of the next world, they would be pulled backward to the previous one. ...This swap begins to define the real meaning of the world switch."
    "每次有世界切换被触发时，它也会发生在某人即将被送去的那个世界里。若有人身处下一世界的重叠范围内，就会被拉回前一个世界。……这种互换，逐渐揭示出世界切换的真正含义。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067562_1_9df559f6:
    # "When Erina and Atsuki returned to world B in the elevator, they had been in world C."
    "Erina 和 Atsuki 乘电梯回到 B世界时，他们原本身在 C世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067571_1_6587fa83:
    # "It was Atsuki A—the person behind the \"extra\" elevator sound in world C."
    "那正是 Atsuki A——在 C世界弄出那声「多余」电梯响动的人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067575_1_df35ac77:
    # "He'd been escaping from Sai in world A and found both Sekimeiya, which brought him to world B."
    "他在 A世界躲避 Sai 的追赶，找到了两个 Sekimeiya，结果被带到了 B世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067576_1_69bcf189:
    # "He hadn't experienced the Sekimeiya's powers yet. Startled by the burn, he thought both glowing gems had merely disappeared."
    "他还没领教过 Sekimeiya 的力量。灼痛令他吃了一惊，他以为那两颗发光的宝石只是凭空消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067579_1_db225322:
    # "In world B, he saw the Future Sekimeiya on the floor of the event room, which Erina had activated. He touched it, and as the Past Sekimeiya was still active in Ido's locker, he world switched to world C."
    "在 B世界，他看见活动室的地板上放着未来Sekimeiya——那是 Erina 启动过的。他伸手碰了它；由于 Ido 储物柜里的过去Sekimeiya 仍处于启动状态，他切换到了 C世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067583_1_8cc4e42e:
    # "...He was only there momentarily.{w} After allowing Erina and his world B self to return to world B, he took the elevator up."
    "……他只在那里停留了片刻。{w} 等 Erina 和 B世界的自己回到 B世界后，他便乘电梯上去了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067586_1_cc4693cd:
    # "Out of nowhere, the elevator disappeared, and he fell all the way down onto that world's elevator, leaving him unconscious and wounded."
    "电梯毫无征兆地消失了，他一路坠落，重重摔在那个世界的电梯上，当场昏迷，浑身是伤。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067590_1_b3303388:
    # "That was where the police found him—the only survivor of the incident."
    "警察就是在那儿发现他的。他是那起事件唯一的幸存者。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067598_1_00dbd37e:
    # "The light suddenly turned on; Miiya was pulled to world B. She heard Shiroya's voice and silently left the attic."
    "灯光骤然亮起；Miiya 被拉到了 B世界。她听见 Shiroya 的声音，悄悄离开了阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067601_1_c6ff69e6:
    # "On the crystal floor, she found the Past Sekimeiya in Ido's locker, where Atsuki had kept it."
    "她在水晶展室的 Ido 储物柜里找到了过去Sekimeiya——那是 Atsuki 先前放在那里的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067602_1_3c09fed3:
    # "\"Despite being filled with questions, my mind was blank. My hand was drawn to the shape that had begun to take form behind the dark lines, and through the narrow space, I made contact, hoping with all my might that I would be brought to the awaited time.\""
    "「纵然满腹疑问，我的脑中却一片空白。昏暗的缝隙后，一个轮廓已渐渐成形，我的手不由自主地伸了过去；穿过狭窄的空隙，我触到了它，拼命祈愿自己能抵达那个等待已久的时间。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067603_1_4054df44:
    # "After what had happened with Erina, Miiya had learned that traveling to the future with the Sekimeiya was possible. She wanted to be brought to {time=21}, out of the tower.{w} Through the slits in the locker, she activated it, and as Erina had just triggered the world switch, the Future Sekimeiya was powered off. Miiya went more than half an hour to the past and reset the Sekimeiya. When Atsuki B, who had originally hidden it there, later activated it, he only went forty minutes back in time."
    "经历了 Erina 那件事后，Miiya 明白用 Sekimeiya 穿越到未来是可行的。她希望自己被送到 {time=21} 的塔外。{w} 她透过储物柜的缝隙启动了它；由于 Erina 刚触发过世界切换，未来Sekimeiya 已处于关闭状态。Miiya 回到了半个多小时前，并重置了 Sekimeiya。后来，原本把它藏在那里的 Atsuki B 再次启动它时，只回到了四十分钟前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067609_1_d9ea06c1:
    # "Miiya appeared in hallway A and immediately fell down. An interesting location.{w} After all, forty minutes after the point she traveled, she was back in world C. She and Atsuki were running to the event room, which was what had made her fall in the past. ...The replicated location was from world C, but it was applied in the past of world B."
    "Miiya 出现在 A走廊，随即摔倒在地。这个地点很有意思。{w} 毕竟，在她穿越到的那个时间点的四十分钟后，她就回到了 C世界。她之所以会在过去摔倒，正是因为那时的她和 Atsuki 正跑向活动室。……那个被复制的地点来自 C世界，却被套用在了 B世界的过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067619_1_0fd403c6:
    # "At {time=18:21}, Miiya found Katei dead. Following that, she noticed the flickering green lights of the security cameras."
    "在 {time=18:21}，Miiya 发现 Katei 已经死了。紧接着，她注意到监控摄像头的绿色指示灯在闪烁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067622_1_6f4baf7a:
    # "\"The cabinet was covered by its curtain. If the Sekimeiya was behind it, it was possible someone else was soon to be on the crystal floor.\""
    "「展示柜被遮布盖着。若 Sekimeiya 就在后面，说不定很快就会有别人出现在水晶展室。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067623_1_ea2f5a9a:
    # "\"It was possible\"... She wasn't sure if she had gone to the past.{w} She couldn't know if she had gone to the future because she had slept for an unknown period of time. The computer's clock couldn't confirm anything for her."
    "「有可能」……她不确定自己是否回到了过去。{w} 她不知道自己睡了多久，也就无法判断是否去了未来。电脑上的时钟同样无法为她证实什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067629_1_bb53780f:
    # "Then, in hallway B, she was found by Erina B, who didn't recognize her. They entered room B4 and found the Sekimeiya that Shiroya had left in a cabinet, which they brought to the event room."
    "随后，Erina B 在 B走廊发现了她，却没有认出她。两人进入 B4房间，在展示柜里找到了 Shiroya 留下的 Sekimeiya，并将它带到了活动室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067638_1_38845564:
    # "When Miiya heard Atsuki's yells, she ran away without noticing that she'd dropped the note she'd been trying to prevent him from seeing. Erina had just reached into Miiya's purse to grab her keys, so it had remained slightly open."
    "听到 Atsuki 的喊声，Miiya 转身就跑，却没发现自己掉落了那张一直不想让他看到的纸条。先前 Erina 刚把手伸进 Miiya 的包里拿钥匙，包口因此还微微敞着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067643_1_ba397c35:
    # "He and Shiroya were there, talking to each other. After Erina joined them, Miiya attempted to eavesdrop from afar."
    "他和 Shiroya 就在那里交谈。Erina 也过去之后，Miiya 试图从远处偷听。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067646_1_764ec4ed:
    # "They went to the event room, so Miiya entered the staff room to listen through the wall."
    "他们去了活动室，于是 Miiya 进了员工室，隔着墙壁偷听。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067647_1_decf29f6:
    # "Minutes later, the same world switch that had pulled her to world B took place."
    "几分钟后，曾把她拉到 B世界的那场世界切换发生了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067658_1_1eb9a85b:
    # "She was the fourth person to world switch to world C. With her ear against the wall, both ranges encompassed her too."
    "她是第四个完成世界切换、来到 C世界的人。当时她耳朵贴着墙壁，两个范围也都覆盖到了她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067659_1_3037fc68:
    # "In world C, the fake Sekimeiya was still in the event room, so it seemed like it teleported into the cabinet."
    "在 C世界，赝品 Sekimeiya 仍在活动室里，因此看上去就像是它自己传送进了展示柜。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067666_1_6d68c985:
    # "Two hours remained until {time=21.}"
    "距离 {time=21.} 还有两个小时。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067674_1_46004265:
    # "Fortunately, everyone was able to leave safely. That included Naomi, who was woken up by the loud noise of the shutter."
    "幸运的是，所有人都安然离开了，包括被卷帘门巨响惊醒的 Naomi。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067675_1_5fac0729:
    # "However, a single decision nearly sent everything spiraling into destruction."
    "然而，仅仅一个决定，就险些让一切坠入毁灭。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067679_1_b410f917:
    # "Instead of the shutter, yells of pain that would've woken Naomi up before that time were almost let out. Disastrous yells that would've shattered everything that had been needed to get there."
    "差点响起的并不是卷帘门的声音，而是痛苦的喊叫——那会在那个时刻之前就把 Naomi 吵醒。那将是灾难般的喊声，足以让一路走到这里所需的一切尽数崩塌。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067684_1_aea52bcf:
    # "They were yells that, in reality, nobody ever heard. At {time=21:04}, the police entered the building.{w} Even though everyone was alive, Suripo was dead on the floor. The officers could hardly believe their eyes while the survivors emerged."
    "那些喊声，现实中谁也没有听见。在 {time=21:04}，警察进入了大楼。{w} 尽管所有人都还活着，Suripo 却已倒在地板上，没了气息。幸存者一个个走出来时，警官们几乎不敢相信自己的眼睛。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067685_1_c01b315f:
    # "...Two of whom knew what had happened. They knew that their lives after the 15th were ones that had been gifted to them."
    "……其中两人知道发生了什么。他们明白，自己十五号之后的人生，是别人赠予的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067694_1_a5967f28:
    # "Hopefully, you enjoyed this story."
    "希望你喜欢这个故事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067695_1_88937298:
    # "It's not made for everyone, but I'm glad you're still here. ...We're pretty high up."
    "它并非为所有人而作，不过你还在这里，我很高兴。……我们已经爬得相当高了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067697_1_0d1717d3:
    # "Let's see... You answered {} out of {} ({}%) questions correctly. I hope you're proud of that."
    "让我看看……你答对了 {} 道题，共 {} 道（{}%）。希望你能为此感到自豪。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067698_1_def82a3b:
    # "Of course, though, there's one last thing for you to see.{w}{w=0.3} The peak."
    "不过，当然，还有最后一样东西等着你去看。{w}{w=0.3} 顶峰。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067699_1_5dc70fa3:
    # "Did you think you'd already seen it, maybe?"
    "你是不是以为自己早就见过了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067700_1_e391a943:
    # "...What exactly is at the very top?"
    "……最顶端究竟有什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067712_1_e191a9d8:
    # "The Peak"
    "顶峰"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067719_1_42524f58:
    # "The crystal floor was empty. Everyone had disappeared a long time earlier."
    "水晶层空无一人。所有人早就不见了踪影。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067720_1_54b816df:
    # "My past self was in the attic. I'd been waiting at the bottom of the tower so that the large range of my past travel wouldn't reach me."
    "过去的我还在阁楼里。我一直等在塔底，以免过去那次大范围的时间穿越把我也卷进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067721_1_aa5f92aa:
    # "It's already been more than an hour. It should happen soon."
    "已经一个多小时了。应该快发生了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067722_1_6e454879:
    # "What will happen after? Are the others gonna come back?"
    "之后会怎样？其他人会回来吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067723_1_8e8404e7:
    # "I'd been resting my mind, but the hours that remained were still an unknown area."
    "我一直在放空思绪，但剩下的几个小时依旧是一片未知。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067724_1_8fb21da1:
    # "The first time we changed worlds, did we appear in this world? I've been wondering that for a while..."
    "我们第一次切换世界时，真的出现在这个世界了吗？这个问题我想了好一阵子了……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067725_1_85fdf1d9:
    # "I'm pretty sure the people we met belonged to this world, but the world we went to could've been the one they were sent to. They don't necessarily have to return to this one."
    "我很确定，我们遇见的人属于这个世界；但我们去到的世界，或许正是他们被送往的那个。他们未必会回到这个世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067727_1_c3174f3f:
    # "Hm..."
    "嗯……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067728_1_a332a4bd:
    # "I realized I had a new piece of information to work with."
    "我意识到，自己手上又多了一条可用的信息。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067729_1_9fd90017:
    # "...Actually, I'm pretty sure the world we were sent to was this very world.{w} Sai asked me how Shiroya got into the tower. For him, she'd never been there."
    "……其实，我很确定，我们被送往的世界正是这一个。{w} Sai 问我 Shiroya 是怎么进塔的。对他来说，她根本没来过塔里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067738_1_90c3034b:
    # "I'd appreciate it if you told the truth, though. How did she get in?"
    "不过，我还是希望你说实话。她究竟是怎么进来的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067739_1_8352a1c1:
    # "She was with us from the beginning..."
    "她从一开始就跟我们在一起……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067744_1_14ae1ef8:
    # "That's false. Since she seems to be with you, I really doubt you were stupid enough to make her enter through the storeroom. That's what's strange, but perhaps you did.{w} Let me see."
    "不对。她看起来是和你一起的，所以我实在不觉得你会蠢到让她从储藏室进来。奇怪就奇怪在这里，不过也许你真这么做了。{w}让我看看。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067747_1_68b70163:
    # "\"Indifferent to my confusion and rage, Sai walked to hallway C.\""
    "「Sai 对我的困惑和怒火毫不在意，径直走向 C走廊。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067752_1_ca95f790:
    # "What are you doing!?"
    "你干什么！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067753_1_5f3226b8:
    # "\"Instead of answering, he entered the storeroom.{w} Seconds later, he returned.\""
    "「他没有回答，直接走进储藏室。{w} 几秒后，又折返回来。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067760_1_7768549d:
    # "I just wanted to verify that she hasn't entered through the storeroom yet."
    "我只是想确认她还没有从储藏室进来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067767_1_10c81340:
    # "I get it now. He had marked the door in some way—he could tell whether it had opened. So, he went to the storeroom and confirmed that his mark was still there."
    "我现在明白了。他在门上做了什么标记——只要门开过，他就能看出来。所以他才去储藏室，确认标记还在原处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067768_1_a772519d:
    # "That implies that it was this world. The mark existed, as the door hadn't opened since he'd left it."
    "这说明这里就是那个世界。标记还在——他离开之后，门确实没有开过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067769_1_d276d9ba:
    # "That means they'll return here. Just like we came back to our world, they'll come back here. It'll happen before {time=19.}"
    "也就是说，他们会回到这里。就像我们回到了自己的世界一样，他们也会回到这里。而且会发生在 {time=19.} 之前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067771_1_aa4a7f0c:
    # "And that's not all..."
    "而且还不止这些……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067781_1_d2e8321d:
    # "Sai, what time is it?"
    "Sai，现在几点？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067786_1_60b8e3df:
    # "Uh...{w} it's {time=18:43.}"
    "呃……{w} 现在是 {time=18:43.}。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067787_1_c15e6447:
    # "{time=18:43.}.. That was almost twenty minutes behind the real time I estimated. That made me think that after traveling, Sai's replicated location had been of twenty minutes prior, and his watch hadn't stopped working."
    "{time=18:43.}……这比我估算的真实时间慢了将近二十分钟。于是我猜想，Sai 穿越后出现的位置，其实是二十分钟前的位置；而他的手表并没有停走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067795_1_4e7d2be6:
    # "Now, I'm pretty sure that his watch was a bit more than twenty minutes behind, but it wasn't because he had traveled. It was the Sai from this world, who still had the time wrong from when he'd traveled to the future with the other version of me.{w} Later, when we returned to our world, Sai's time was accurate again, and I figured he must've synced it using the computer."
    "现在，我基本确定，他的手表慢了不止二十分钟，但这并不是因为他穿越过，而是因为这个世界的 Sai 曾和另一个我一起穿越到未来，表上的时间从那时起就一直不准。{w} 后来我们回到自己的世界时，他的手表又准了，我猜他一定用电脑校准过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067799_1_be77f90a:
    # "It happened even before I expected it. Suddenly, I heard a voice in hallway A."
    "事情来得比我预想的还早。忽然，A走廊里传来一个声音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067800_1_5eeb43e2:
    # "...pen again."
    "……又开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067801_1_56a2cbd8:
    # "Wha—"
    "什么——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067802_1_0c508523:
    # "But why is the sheet—"
    "可为什么那块布——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067806_1_b6536c64:
    # "I stood up immediately to hide."
    "我立刻起身躲了起来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067807_1_aff235f4:
    # "Everyone's there! Erina too, she's still alive!"
    "大家都在！Erina 也在，她还活着！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067808_1_f8e86923:
    # "She was a bit closer to the staircase with Isla, and it seemed everyone had just appeared. I'd been sitting on the stairs, so they hadn't noticed me."
    "她和 Isla 站得离楼梯稍近一些，看样子所有人都是刚刚出现的。我一直坐在楼梯上，所以他们没发现我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067809_1_d2f5e8a8:
    # "Sai went to the storeroom."
    "Sai 走向储藏室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067810_1_11adcd40:
    # "...It hasn't been opened again."
    "……那扇门没有再开过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067811_1_3f405a5c:
    # "Fuck... Let's hurry. The Sekimeiya might've appeared on this floor.{w} I didn't think this through. If someone's actually here, there's a chance it'll allow them to escape."
    "妈的……动作快点。Sekimeiya 可能已经出现在这层了。{w}是我考虑不周。要是真有人在这儿，说不定反而会让对方有机会逃走。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067812_1_9e80ab21:
    # "Suddenly, they began to look through every room."
    "忽然，他们开始逐个房间搜查。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067815_1_a2baff76:
    # "They're really all back, and my past self is likely already gone from the attic."
    "他们真的全都回来了，而过去的我大概已经离开阁楼了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067816_1_7e0cdeb5:
    # "What now, then? I need to have the Sekimeiya for myself...{w} Am I going to be found? The Sekimeiya are in the attic, so I can probably use the future one to escape from them."
    "那现在怎么办？我必须把 Sekimeiya 拿到手……{w} 我会被他们发现吗？Sekimeiya 都在阁楼，我或许能用未来那个逃离他们。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067818_1_f7a11f49:
    # "That wasn't needed. They found the third Sekimeiya, but when they were done, they didn't move up to the second floor."
    "那倒没必要。他们找到了第三个 Sekimeiya，可是搜查完后，并没有上二楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067819_1_fafdd50f:
    # "...{w}Are they not planning to keep going?"
    "……{w}他们不打算继续往上搜了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067820_1_6e1964fc:
    # "They remained below, separate from each other."
    "他们留在下面，彼此隔开了一段距离。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067821_1_89c4e032:
    # "Why? Why would they search like that only to not continue? Did they only want to find the Sekimeiya?"
    "为什么？为什么他们都那样搜了一遍，却不继续往上？难道他们只想找到 Sekimeiya？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067822_1_404bc775:
    # "...{w}Maybe I get it. They don't know that the world around them just changed.{w} Perhaps they just looked through the whole building, ending at the crystal floor. If that's when they changed worlds, they must think that the whole building is empty."
    "……{w}也许我明白了。他们不知道周围的世界刚刚切换过。{w}他们可能把整栋楼都搜了一遍，最后搜到水晶层。如果世界就是在那时切换的，他们一定会以为整栋楼已经空了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067823_1_c801339e:
    # "...And if that's the case, as long as they stay there, I can move freely above them."
    "……若真是这样，只要他们留在下面，我就能在他们上方自由行动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067830_1_c7f2ebaa:
    # "Now I'm sure I'm in the world we once went to. That means I can do everything I want."
    "现在我能确定，我正身处我们曾经去过的那个世界。也就是说，我想做什么都可以。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067831_1_3aacffaf:
    # "The end of my plan had always been blurry. After everything else, I wanted to find Shiroya and return to our original world, sure that the reality I wanted to shape did exist. I'd never truly known how to do that until just then."
    "我计划的终点一直都很模糊。在经历了这么多之后，我想找到 Shiroya，回到原本的世界，并确信我想塑造的那个现实真的存在。直到刚才，我才真正明白该怎么做。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067832_1_2c93fc8c:
    # "We arrived in this world at {time=19.} At that time, I'll be able to meet Shiroya again."
    "我们是在 {time=19.} 来到这个世界的。到了那时，我就能再次见到 Shiroya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067833_1_1f45eea0:
    # "She was with us. Her clothes were different, but she was the real one—she had lived through much more than I had imagined.{w} She'll be here at {time=19}, and she'll go to the attic all of a sudden. That's where I'll be."
    "她曾和我们在一起。衣着虽然不同，但她才是真正的 Shiroya——她经历的事情远比我预想的多。{w} 她会在 {time=19} 来到这里，然后忽然前往阁楼。我也会在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067834_1_84254a59:
    # "Then, I know we'll be able to return to our world. We merely have to be in the middle of the building."
    "那样一来，我就能确定我们可以回到自己的世界。我们只需要待在这栋楼的中间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067835_1_dd977f45:
    # "When we took the elevator up, it stopped on the third floor. That was when we returned.{w} That must mean that the third floor was being encompassed by the ranges of both Sekimeiya, and someone activated one. If we're there at that time, I know for a fact we'll be able to return."
    "我们坐电梯上去的时候，电梯停在了三楼。我们就是那时回去的。{w}也就是说，当时三楼正处于两个 Sekimeiya 的重叠范围内，而且有人启动了其中一个。只要那时我们在那儿，就一定回得去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067839_1_cf2f1a82:
    # "I went up to the attic."
    "我上了阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067845_1_1e8923ea:
    # "As I thought, I'm no longer here."
    "果然，我已经不在这里了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067849_1_e48e1e32:
    # "The kitchen was empty, but I could see my footprints on the floor. I had very recently traveled to the 24th of November."
    "厨房空无一人，但地板上能看见我的脚印。我不久前才穿越到 11 月 24 日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067853_1_15f5ede3:
    # "The Past Sekimeiya was on the marble countertop, already white again. By its side was the voice recorder with numbers on its screen.{w} 81:04."
    "过去Sekimeiya 就放在大理石台面上，已经重新变回白色。它旁边是录音笔，屏幕上显示着数字。{w} 81:04。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067854_1_140a2a25:
    # "The Future Sekimeiya was still in the refrigerator, so I put the past one inside too."
    "未来Sekimeiya 还在冰箱里，我便把 过去Sekimeiya 也放了进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067857_1_a441f1bf:
    # "I began a new recording."
    "我重新开始录音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067860_1_02985a80:
    # "I was about to take the Past Sekimeiya back out, but my arm stopped itself."
    "我正要把 过去Sekimeiya 取出来，手却停住了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067861_1_faff56f6:
    # "...{w}My heartbeat picked up, causing my fingers to jitter on their own. A thought had suddenly come to me."
    "……{w}我的心跳快了起来，手指也不受控制地发颤。一个念头忽然冒了出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067862_1_c50d1537:
    # "...It should be simple. I can travel to November 30th one more time. I know saving Miiya is within my reach—she's alive.{w} Then, I have to do what I just thought. I can enter the tower when the 15th comes. I can be in the attic at {time=19}, before Shiroya appears."
    "……应该很简单。我可以再穿越到 11 月 30 日一次。我知道救下 Miiya 并非遥不可及——她还活着。{w} 然后，我必须去做刚才想到的事。等 15 日到来，我就能进入塔里。我可以在 {time=19} 就待在阁楼里，赶在 Shiroya 出现之前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067864_1_7e1bc337:
    # "Was that really the case, though?"
    "可事情当真如此吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067869_1_cd540843:
    # "According to my estimate, it should've been a little past {time=16.} Three hours still remained until {time=19.}"
    "照我的估算，此刻应该刚过{time=16.}，距离{time=19.}还有三个小时。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067870_1_da2ebb86:
    # "My plan had been to use the Past Sekimeiya one more time after my past self's disappearance."
    "我的计划，是在过去的我消失之后，再用一次 过去Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067871_1_861009eb:
    # "I could live through November 30th a third time; I could save Miiya, as the news I'd read was the only obstacle in that pursuit.{w} In the world I was in, Shiroya didn't exist, but I had never seen her blood, no definitive proof of her death. Her absence was no real barrier."
    "我可以第三次度过十一月三十日，也可以救下 Miiya——毕竟我读到的那则新闻，是这条路上唯一的阻碍。{w}在我此刻所在的世界里，Shiroya 并不存在，但我从未见过她的血，也没有她已死的确证。她的缺席并不能算真正的障碍。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067872_1_2f60ec91:
    # "After that, I had to return with Shiroya to our world. The way to accomplish it was by being in the center of the building at close to {time=19:30.}"
    "之后，我必须带着 Shiroya 回到我们的世界。要做到这一点，就得在快到 {time=19:30} 的时候待在大楼中央。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067873_1_8d9de4ba:
    # "That was how I had to do it. If I attempted to change worlds before that point by using the two Sekimeiya, it was very likely I would appear someplace else. After all, that was how the group from the world I was in had vanished earlier, and I was completely confident they hadn't appeared in our world."
    "我只能这么做。若是在那之前就用两个 Sekimeiya 切换世界，我很可能会出现在别的地方。毕竟，我所在的这个世界里的那群人，先前正是那样消失的，而且我可以完全肯定，他们并没有出现在我们的世界里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067874_1_dac9b1bf:
    # "It should've been doable—I'd never really considered otherwise. ...What made my arm stop was the connection I'd just made."
    "按理说，这应该办得到——我从未想过别的可能。……让我停下手来的，是我刚刚串起的那层关联。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067875_1_1407b46e:
    # "Just before {time=19:30}, Sai had gone to the storeroom to check whether his mark had disappeared. At that time, the door hadn't opened yet."
    "就在{time=19:30}之前，Sai 曾去储藏室确认自己的标记是否消失。那时，门还没有打开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067880_1_ca82fa19:
    # "...{w}I left the attic; I didn't feel comfortable thinking there. If anyone came up with the elevator, I wouldn't hear them, so I chose to go to the sixth floor, where I would hear both the elevator and any approaching footsteps."
    "……{w}我离开了阁楼。我总觉得在那里思考不踏实。要是有人乘电梯上来，我根本听不见，于是我选择去六楼——在那里，电梯的动静和任何靠近的脚步声都能传进耳中。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067885_1_60deb689:
    # "...Of course, my plan implied a future version of myself was in the tower. A version of myself who had been there since the morning.{w} I'd known that, which was why I'd followed the group's movements—so that I could give myself a route to hide throughout the day, aware of where to be at all times."
    "……当然，我的计划意味着，未来的我就在这座塔里——一个从早晨起便待在这里的我。{w}这一点我早就清楚，所以才一直留意那群人的动向，好给自己安排一条整日藏身的路线，随时知道该待在何处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067886_1_12521a94:
    # "Could that really be the case, though?"
    "可是，真的会是这样吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067887_1_f9a41eab:
    # "When I thought about it after having witnessed the whole series of events, my heartbeat grew erratic."
    "亲眼目睹了整件事的经过之后，再回想起来，我的心跳便乱了起来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067888_1_cb634dfb:
    # "Is it...?{w} Just before the group left this world, the whole building was searched, when I replaced the other Atsuki without anyone noticing. Naturally, my future self wasn't found—that would've been a paradox, as I would've seen myself before knowing where I would be."
    "会是这样吗……？{w}在那群人离开这个世界之前，整栋楼都被搜查过——正是在那时，我不动声色地顶替了另一个 Atsuki。未来的我自然没有被发现。若被发现，就会成为悖论：那等于我在得知自己该去何处之前，就先看见了自己。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067889_1_5d924135:
    # "So, why was that me not found? How will I avoid being found?{w} At the time, every single place was inspected except for the hidden area in the storeroom. However, I couldn't have been there, as my own past self already was."
    "那么，那个我为什么没被找到？我又要怎样才能不被找到？{w}当时，除了储藏室里那处隐蔽的空间，每一处都被查过了。可我不可能待在那里——过去的我已经占着那个位置了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067892_1_03c15384:
    # "I'd had the thought in the back of my mind: if a similar problem arose, the storeroom's secret could aid me. ...That was no longer the case."
    "我心里一直留着一个念头：要是再碰上类似的问题，储藏室的秘密也许能帮上忙。……现在已经行不通了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067893_1_68e9953b:
    # "My future self merely has to be here at {time=19:30.} ...It's not exact, but I'll say the search happened at {time=14.}{w} My past self was in the storeroom from {time=9} to {time=14.} Immediately after I left it, the fake wall was found by this world's group.{w} I thought that in the worst-case scenario, I could enter through the storeroom after the attack. ...But that's not possible. As soon as it was found, Sai marked it, and I know that mark will still be there at {time=19:30}, right before we returned to our world."
    "未来的我只需在{time=19:30.}待在这里就够了。……时间未必精确，但搜查大约是在{time=14.}。{w}从{time=9}到{time=14.}，过去的我一直待在储藏室。我刚离开那里，这个世界的众人就发现了那面假墙。{w}我原以为，最坏的情况下，还能在袭击之后从储藏室进入……但那已不可能。假墙一被发现，Sai 就在上面做了标记，而我知道，就在{time=19:30}、也就是我们即将回到自己的世界之前，那个标记仍然还在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067894_1_b033130e:
    # "Knowing all that, it wasn't possible that a future self of mine would enter the tower after the {time=14} search."
    "既然清楚这些，未来的我就不可能在{time=14}的搜查之后进入这座塔。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067897_1_b9dd86f9:
    # "More importantly, it's very unlikely this would be possible either way. I shouldn't assume that I could enter through the storeroom without being seen. Technically, I could enter after {time=19:30} and travel to the past in order to be at the center of the building at the right time, but I don't know whether I'll be seen outside, and if I am, I'll be unable to travel back.{w} I shouldn't go back to the 30th with a plan that could fail, so I have to entirely rule out the storeroom."
    "更重要的是，无论怎么看，这都极难办到。我不能假定自己能不被人看见就从储藏室进去。严格来说，我可以在{time=19:30}之后进入，再穿越回过去，好在恰当的时刻待在大楼中央；但外面会不会有人看见我，我并不知道，一旦被看见，就没法再穿越回去。{w}我不能带着一个可能失败的方案回到三十日，所以储藏室这条路必须彻底排除。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067898_1_efba9fd9:
    # "That meant that for a future self of mine to be present at {time=19:30}, he would've had to be in the tower since a time before my past self had begun to wait in the storeroom.{w} Since I was aware of that, how could I avoid being found by the search at {time=14}?"
    "也就是说，未来的我若要在{time=19:30}出现在这里，就必须在过去的我开始守候于储藏室之前，就已经待在塔里了。{w}既然我清楚这一点，又怎么可能躲过{time=14}的那场搜查？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067899_1_ca7f9ca3:
    # "There's one way—by traveling to the future."
    "只有一个办法——穿越到未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067903_1_816b9f1a:
    # "When could I have used the Future Sekimeiya to not be present at {time=14}?"
    "我可能在什么时候用过未来Sekimeiya，才能让自己在{time=14}不在场？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067904_1_4652a876:
    # "After the smoke was released, it was brought to the attic in a suitcase. The next time it moved was when Katei brought it to the crystal floor with the other Atsuki and Miiya."
    "烟雾放出之后，它被人装进手提箱送上了阁楼。它下一次被移动，是在 Katei 与另一个 Atsuki、Miiya 一同把它带到水晶层的时候。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067905_1_55ed9445:
    # "I remember how he looked when he had it in his hands. He was in pain because the Sekimeiya hadn't been activated since it had been taken out of the cabinet."
    "我记得他双手捧着它时的神情。他当时疼得厉害，因为那个 Sekimeiya 从展示柜里被取出后，就一次都没有启动过。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067906_1_42c84d27:
    # "If my future self had used it before he brought it down, it would've reset and spent a while powered off. There's no way Katei would've had to hold it carefully like he did."
    "若是未来的我在他把它带下来之前用过它，它就会重置，并有一段时间处于关闭状态。那样的话，Katei 根本不必像那样小心翼翼地捧着它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067907_1_4dde9f4d:
    # "If I'd touched it at that point, I would've had to be in the storeroom during the night to appear in the tower in the future. Maybe that's possible, but there's too much uncertainty; there's clear room for failure."
    "如果我在那个时候碰过它，那么为了让未来的自己出现在塔里，我就必须在夜里进入储藏室。或许这办得到，但不确定的因素太多，明显有失败的可能。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067908_1_b6fc2bcf:
    # "I could explain Katei's face in a different way: I could leave the Sekimeiya in a hot place as I touch it. However, both Sekimeiya were in the attic. I would have to find out which was which, keep the past one in the refrigerator due to its large range, and travel to the future."
    "Katei 的表情也可以有另一种解释：我可以在触碰 Sekimeiya 的同时，把它留在高温的地方。可两个 Sekimeiya 都在阁楼里。我得先弄清楚哪个是哪个，把范围大的那个——也就是过去Sekimeiya——放进冰箱，然后再穿越到未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067913_1_4ffd4f72:
    # "...I'd once put some thought into the type of web I was entangled in. I'd considered that in order to work around what you'd observed, having observed too much could be a fatal flaw."
    "……我曾想过自己究竟陷在怎样一张网里。也想到过，为了避开你观察到的情况，看得太多反而可能成为致命缺陷。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067914_1_80ad2682:
    # "At the time, I'd also come up with another concept in the form of thought-up loops, which were fundamentally similar to the way the Past Sekimeiya worked."
    "当时，我还想到过另一个概念——凭空设想的循环，它与过去Sekimeiya 的运作方式在根本上相似。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067915_1_7916ac29:
    # "It's uncertain whether traveling to the future before Katei brought the Sekimeiya down will work out smoothly. However, I have a way to know if it will."
    "在 Katei 把 Sekimeiya 带下来之前穿越到未来，究竟能否顺利成功，还说不准。不过，我有办法确认它是否行得通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067916_1_75988f61:
    # "A cue.{w} If I had a loop in my head, I could know whether it could be completed. If I thought about everything that I would do after touching the Past Sekimeiya, I could observe whether a cue I intended to leave would exist."
    "一个提示。{w}只要脑中存着一个循环，我就能知道它能否成立。若我把触碰过去Sekimeiya 之后要做的每一件事都想清楚，便能观察自己打算留下的那个提示是否存在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067917_1_0e2ad4a2:
    # "So, could I do this? If it works, I'll draw a mark with a pen beneath a drawer on this floor..."
    "那么，我做得到吗？如果行得通，我就用笔在这一层的某个抽屉底下画一个记号……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067923_1_191d5c05:
    # "I went to the offices and walked up to the drawer I'd selected."
    "我走到办公区，来到自己选定的那个抽屉前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067927_1_09d4aad0:
    # "...It's not here. There's no mark."
    "……没有。这里没有记号。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067931_1_ff447b7d:
    # "There'd been clear uncertainty behind the loop I'd thought of, but thanks to the lack of the cue, the uncertainty could be erased—that loop wouldn't work."
    "我设想的那个循环背后，本有明确的不确定之处；而今提示并不存在，这份不确定也就有了答案——那个循环行不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067932_1_9f80a5ba:
    # "It's impossible, then. I might be failing to realize the reason why it couldn't be executed. I don't know if it's just a tiny detail."
    "那么，这不可能。或许我还没意识到它无法执行的真正原因。也许只是某个极小的细节，我也说不准。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067936_1_794f0acb:
    # "What about entering through the storeroom after {time=19:30} and then traveling to the past? Could that be possible?"
    "那在{time=19:30}之后从储藏室进入，再穿越回过去呢？这能办到吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067939_1_7016fea6:
    # "If it is, I'll go back in time to a point after {time=14} and leave a mark beneath that drawer. If I need to, I'll travel back twice in order to make it to a point prior to now."
    "若能办到，我就穿越回{time=14}之后的某个时刻，在那个抽屉底下留下记号。如果有必要，我会连续穿越两次，回到比现在更早的时点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067944_1_ba368d6b:
    # "There was nothing there."
    "那里什么也没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067945_1_0ecf0da7:
    # "That makes sense. That means I couldn't enter the building through the storeroom without being seen from outside."
    "原来如此。看来只要从储藏室进入大楼，就一定会被外面的人看见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067946_1_1ea9df49:
    # "I was growing nervous. Miiya was alive—success must've awaited me.{w} ...But could I be sure of that?{w} It was a guarantee that Miiya was alive, but what about Shiroya? The circumstances around her were what left room for doubt."
    "我渐渐不安起来。Miiya 还活着——等待我的本该是成功。{w}……可我能确定吗？{w}Miiya 活着是确凿的，但 Shiroya 呢？她那边的情形，才留出了疑问的余地。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067952_1_58659468:
    # "When the Future Sekimeiya was brought down from the attic, Katei used it. Then, the other Atsuki and Sai traveled minutes forward as well. There's no way I could travel before then."
    "未来Sekimeiya 从阁楼被带下来时，Katei 用了它。随后，另一个 Atsuki 和 Sai 也向未来穿越了几分钟。在那之前，我不可能穿越。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067953_1_e7857a94:
    # "But... the situation is the same later. I saw what happened to the Sekimeiya.{w} Sai, Akaro, and Katei moved them back and forth, but I remember it clearly—no place where the Future Sekimeiya was hidden was accessed by a future self of mine. My line of sight unconsciously blocked myself."
    "可是……之后的情形也一样。Sekimeiya 的遭遇我都看在眼里。{w}Sai、Akaro 和 Katei 把两个 Sekimeiya 搬来搬去，可我记得很清楚——未来Sekimeiya 藏身过的任何一处，都不曾被未来的我碰过。我的视线在不知不觉间，把自己挡在了外面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067958_1_0d5653f4:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067959_1_d4734cbe:
    # "There's no way a future self of mine was on the crystal floor and wasn't seen by me or anyone who was there. The Future Sekimeiya wasn't activated, and neither was the past one."
    "未来的我若在水晶层，不可能瞒过我或在场的任何人。未来Sekimeiya 没有被启动，过去Sekimeiya 也一样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067960_1_b9699456:
    # "Katei did go a long time to the future, but even if I were to enter his travel's range, I wouldn't go past {time=14.}"
    "Katei 确实向未来穿越了很长一段，但即使我进入他穿越的范围，也到不了{time=14.}以后。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067961_1_2795e778:
    # "And when the Future Sekimeiya was hidden in the mechanical room, the other Atsuki and Miiya used it to go to the future."
    "而当未来Sekimeiya 被藏进机械室时，另一个 Atsuki 和 Miiya 用它去了未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067962_1_ce1ec1d0:
    # "Suripo's killer brought it to a room in hallway B. When I was enacting the search, I felt the air around it, which was burning. There's no way I had touched it before then."
    "杀害 Suripo 的凶手把它带到了B走廊的一个房间。我搜查时，感觉到它周围的空气烫得厉害。在此之前，我不可能碰过它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067963_1_b12f15d7:
    # "...So is it not possible? Was there really no time where I could've gone to the future!?"
    "……那么，真的办不到？我当真没有一刻能穿越到未来！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067964_1_57b1e7ad:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067965_1_ed769b1e:
    # "I thought of using the Past Sekimeiya instead. Its only use would've been to travel seconds back to a room that had just been inspected. However, I'd also felt the air around it during the search, and it had been even hotter... That path was blocked too."
    "我转而想到用过去Sekimeiya。它唯一的用处，不过是穿越回几秒之前，回到一间刚刚搜查过的房间。可搜查时我也感觉到了它周围的空气，而且比先前更烫……这条路同样被堵死了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067969_1_63f3027f:
    # "...{w}I felt lost. How the hell could I accomplish anything?"
    "……{w}我茫然无措。这样下去，我究竟能做成什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067970_1_5ce5df69:
    # "Traveling to the future before the attack won't be doable, and after the 30th, Ashiya already had the Sekimeiya. The days up to the 15th are useless.{w} It was the owner of that gem shop who found the Sekimeiya. On the 30th, it's very likely they were in that box I saw...{w} But they were taken by the man who released the smoke, and he ran away with them."
    "赶在袭击之前穿越到未来行不通，而30号之后，Sekimeiya 已经落到芦屋手里了。15号之前的日子都没有用。{w}找到 Sekimeiya 的，是那家宝石店的店主。30号那天，它们很可能就在我看到的那只箱子里……{w}可它们被那个释放烟雾的男人抢走了，他带着它们逃了出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067971_1_cc18ba56:
    # "I know the smoke was released thanks to the news report I saw, so I can't obtain the Sekimeiya and save Miiya together. Not to mention that to appear in the tower on the 15th, I would also have to be there on the 15th of November.{w} I'm sure that after the man ran away with the box, he was caught. That's what Katei told us about, and it's the reason why the Sekimeiya returned to Ashiya. There's nothing I can do there."
    "我看到的新闻报道说烟雾被释放了，所以我没法既拿到 Sekimeiya 又救下 Miiya。何况，要在15号出现在塔里，我就得在11月15日待在那里。{w}我确信那个男人带着箱子逃走之后被抓了。Katei 跟我们讲的就是这件事，正因如此 Sekimeiya 才回到了芦屋。那边我插不上手。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067972_1_cbebe9b7:
    # "Just in case, I need to try it.{w} A loop where I go to November 15th and remain inside the tower. Then, on November 30th, I take that box with the Sekimeiya.{w} As fast as possible, I make sure Miiya won't die and run away. Then, I travel to the future and appear after the search that happened at {time=14.}{w} I'll tell the police about the Sekimeiya's location before I travel so that they can find them and return them to Ashiya.{w} If this can work, a mark will be under that drawer."
    "以防万一，我得试一试。{w}一个循环：我先去11月15日，留在塔里。然后在11月30日，拿走那只装着 Sekimeiya 的箱子。{w}我要尽快确保 Miiya 不会死，然后逃走。接着穿越到未来，出现在{time=14.}那次搜查结束之后。{w}穿越之前，我会先把 Sekimeiya 的位置告诉警方，好让他们找到后归还给芦屋。{w}如果这能行得通，那只抽屉下面就会有记号。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067978_1_652b4414:
    # "{tip=ohnoitdidntwork}It wasn't there{/tip}. It appeared that couldn't work either."
    "{tip=ohnoitdidntwork}那里什么也没有{/tip}。看来这条路同样走不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067982_1_ecb0d669:
    # "I kept thinking about the events that had occurred throughout the day in case I could find the smallest opening, but it really seemed like there was no place for a future self of mine to exist."
    "我一整天都在反复回想发生过的事，想找出哪怕一线可能，可看来未来的我根本无处容身。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067983_1_e4e582d8:
    # "Does this mean that I can't be here at {time=19:30}? But that's the single guaranteed way I have to go back!"
    "这就是说，我不能在{time=19:30}待在这里？可那是我唯一能确定回去的办法啊！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067984_1_df07bb7f:
    # "I could change worlds in the morning instead, after Shiroya and Naomi did. That's a lot less likely to bring me to the world I want, though...!"
    "我也可以改到早上，在 Shiroya 和 Naomi 之后再做世界切换。可那样一来，我就更不可能落到自己想去的世界了……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067985_1_ba4f68f6:
    # "...Maybe there was no way to skip the {time=14} search, but what about another way around it?"
    "……也许{time=14}那次搜查是没法跳过的，但换个方向绕开它呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067986_1_157f40ea:
    # "The Atsuki from this world looked at the rooms in hallway A. Then, I took his place and looked through the rest of the crystal floor.{w} Finally, Miiya and I completed all the other floors."
    "这个世界的 Atsuki 查看过 A走廊的房间。之后我接替他，把水晶层剩下的地方查了一遍。{w}最后，我和 Miiya 把其余楼层都查完了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067987_1_a30a7a80:
    # "What if... my future self was in one of the hallway A rooms? Technically, that's how I was able to not be found that time. I told the Atsuki from this world to stay put, and he did so because it was his own request."
    "万一……未来的我就在 A走廊的某个房间里呢？严格说来，那次我能不被找到，靠的就是这个。我让这个世界的 Atsuki 待在原地，他照做了，因为那正是他自己的要求。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067988_1_114f187a:
    # "Could I do the same? Could I ask him to ignore having seen me?"
    "我能照做吗？能让他当作没见过我吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067989_1_3e0f325a:
    # "I wondered that, well aware of the answer."
    "我这样想着，心里却清楚答案。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067992_1_660183ba:
    # "I recalled the time he'd seen me."
    "我想起他看见我的那一刻。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067998_1_8742c7fe:
    # "\"I saw my own body stepping in. As he approached one of the cabinets, I knew there was only one thing I could do.\""
    "「我看见自己的身体走了进来。当他走向其中一个展示柜时，我知道自己只有一件事能做。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L067999_1_deefb676:
    # "This is very imp—"
    "这非常重要——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068004_1_9dd48d15:
    # "Wha—"
    "什——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068005_1_f98869bc:
    # "\"He turned around with a startled gasp. His reaction was even more drastic when he saw me.\""
    "「他吃惊地倒吸一口气，转过身来。等看清是我，他的反应更加剧烈。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068006_1_c49f7c83:
    # "Wh-What!? Who are you!?{w=0.7} Are you... me?"
    "什、什么！？你是谁！？{w=0.7}你是……我？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068007_1_4269a3e5:
    # "\"I nodded, although it wasn't the entire truth.\""
    "「我点了点头，虽然那并不完全是实话。」"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068008_1_9dce86bf:
    # "This is very important. Stay here until the search is finished."
    "这件事非常重要。待在这里，等搜查结束。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068015_1_f2fc4b17:
    # "That reaction gave me the answer. That was the first time he'd seen another self of his."
    "那个反应已经给了我答案。那是他第一次见到另一个自己。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068016_1_cbf876a3:
    # "Could my future self have told him to react that way? ...Word by word?{w} I didn't think that was how it worked; his reaction seemed completely genuine. Likely, the only way for me to make such a thing work would've been by considering it before seeing his reaction."
    "未来的我有没有可能教过他那样反应？……一字一句地教？{w}我觉得事情不该是这样运作的；他的反应看起来完全是真心的。恐怕，我要真想促成这种事，唯一的办法就是在他做出反应之前先想到这一点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068017_1_3dc52dc2:
    # "Nonetheless, I verified whether it would work. If a mark was below the next desk, it would."
    "尽管如此，我还是验证了一下是否可行。如果下一张桌子下面有记号，那就说明可行。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068022_1_eea95999:
    # "Once again, there was nothing."
    "还是一样，什么也没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068026_1_28b78a93:
    # "I thought back to the look in Miiya's eyes. It had changed at one point."
    "我回想起 Miiya 的眼神。有那么一刻，那眼神变了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068027_1_b89eb952:
    # "What if she saw me? What if my future self was in the partitions on that floor?{w} Could he have told her to not reveal him?"
    "如果她看见我了呢？如果未来的我就躲在那层楼的隔间里呢？{w}他会不会嘱咐过她别把他暴露出来？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068028_1_00ab4053:
    # "That felt a little strange. If that had happened, why would her look have changed in that way? I knew the answer couldn't be that I would instruct her to do so."
    "这感觉有些奇怪。若真是如此，她的眼神为什么会那样变？我知道答案不可能是「我吩咐她这么做」。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068029_1_53b477f4:
    # "Not only that, but if I stayed in that partition, the reason would've been due to knowing how Miiya's demeanor changed. In short, the result would've caused the effect."
    "不止如此，若我藏在那间隔间里，理由必然是「我知道 Miiya 的神情会如何变化」。简而言之，结果反过来造就了原因。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068030_1_9d785148:
    # "Well, is that so? I did notice a while ago that there's something special about the offices on the fourth floor...{w} I'm pretty sure that nobody ever looked at them—neither in the morning nor later in the day. Miiya was the only person to inspect them. I spent the day following everyone to know where to be in a future loop."
    "哦，是这样吗？我先前就注意到四楼的办公室有些特别……{w}我敢说，不管是早上还是后来，都没人去看过那里。只有 Miiya 检查过。为了弄清未来的循环里该待在哪里，我一整天都跟着所有人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068031_1_db0f42b2:
    # "Could my future self really have been there all the time? Could that work?"
    "未来的我真能一直待在那里吗？这行得通吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068032_1_0d152d2e:
    # "I tested it right away. If it could, a mark would be below a drawer..."
    "我立刻去验证。如果行得通，某个抽屉下面就会有记号……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068037_1_ca64f3b6:
    # "There's nothing! What the fuck!?"
    "什么都没有！他妈的怎么回事！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068038_1_5c97ff52:
    # "Once again, it seemed my idea was deemed an impossibility by the universe. For one reason or another, it wasn't something that could occur."
    "又一次，似乎宇宙判定我的想法不可能实现。不知为什么，这种事就是无法发生。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068039_1_8bca8e35:
    # "You've gotta be joking. I'm certain Miiya and Shiroya can both be alive in this world, but can I not return to mine? Do I have to hope changing worlds at another time will work?"
    "开什么玩笑。我确信 Miiya 和 Shiroya 都能在这个世界活着，可我却回不了自己的世界？难道我只能指望换个时间再切换世界就能成功？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068040_1_639e4486:
    # "...It had to be at {time=19:30.} I was fairly certain about that."
    "……必须是在{time=19:30.}。这一点我相当确定。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068046_1_05e87ea1:
    # "If my future self had been in the attic when Shiroya and Naomi disappeared this morning, he would've appeared along with them. Even if not in the same world, I would reunite with Shiroya."
    "如果今早 Shiroya 和 Naomi 消失时，未来的我就在阁楼里，那他就会跟她们一起出现。即便不在同一个世界，我也能和 Shiroya 重逢。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068047_1_25bdb05f:
    # "I don't think that's possible, though. I would've had to be there before Naomi unlocked the attic. When I looked through the cameras, I saw that our past selves were right behind her.{w} Even then, because the range didn't reach me, I'm not sure it would've reached the kitchen. There's no way I could've been in the living room, and I didn't see my footprints anywhere."
    "可我觉得那不可能。我得在 Naomi 打开阁楼之前就待在那里。我看监控时，看到过去的我们就跟在她身后。{w}即便那样，因为范围没有覆盖到我，我也不确定它有没有延伸到厨房。我不可能待在客厅，而且哪里都没看到我的脚印。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068048_1_caa592b7:
    # "...That's not even everything. I need to be certain the travel will work because there's no way I'll have another chance. If I intend to change worlds when Shiroya and Naomi did, even if it works, I'll end up in a different world from this one. This means that I'll be unable to leave a physical indication for me to see now..."
    "……还不止这些。我必须确定这次穿越一定能成，因为我不可能再有第二次机会。如果我打算像 Shiroya 和 Naomi 那样切换世界，就算成功，我也会落在一个与这里不同的世界。也就是说，我没法给现在的自己留下任何实物记号……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068049_1_302711cb:
    # "I don't think it would work, but what matters is that there's room for failure. I can't afford that."
    "我觉得那行不通，但关键在于，它仍有失败的可能。而我承受不起失败。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068054_1_328f5534:
    # "I had been lost in thought for a while when something alerted me. Someone was walking up."
    "我出神地想了许久，忽然有什么让我警觉起来。有人正走上来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068058_1_d369e9c9:
    # "I quickly hid in the second partition and saw a single person walking past the glass. Fortunately, they hadn't seen me."
    "我赶紧躲进第二个隔间，看见一个人从玻璃外走过。幸好对方没有看见我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068059_1_a2f4ea99:
    # "...Miiya? Why is she alone?"
    "……Miiya？她怎么一个人？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068060_1_0e6c0a37:
    # "All by herself, she went to the attic. She'd been yawning, so perhaps she wanted to rest on the beds."
    "她独自一人去了阁楼。她一直在打哈欠，大概是想去床上歇一歇。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068061_1_4a285885:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068062_1_18eb646b:
    # "The Sekimeiya are in the refrigerator. She shouldn't see them."
    "Sekimeiya 都在冰箱里。不能让她看到它们。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068064_1_b47f690f:
    # "I couldn't get distracted. I had to find a solution to my problem."
    "我不能分心。我必须为自己的问题找到出路。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068071_1_6afe95d4:
    # "I attempted to come up with something else. There had to be something that would help me...!"
    "我试着再想别的办法。总该有什么能帮到我……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068072_1_e4c222b2:
    # "What if I let the Past Sekimeiya gather energy right now and I bring it somewhere so that its range reaches behind the tower?"
    "如果我现在就让过去Sekimeiya 开始蓄能，再把它带到某个地方，让它的范围延伸到塔后方呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068073_1_fe12939d:
    # "I activate it and go a few minutes to the past, knowing that in the future, my future self will be right outside the tower, waiting to be encompassed. If I do that and think that I'll be in the tower in the future, will I appear inside it?"
    "我启动它，穿越到几分钟前。我知道在未来，未来的我会守在塔外，等着被范围覆盖。如果我这么做，同时想着自己将来要在塔里，我会出现在塔内吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068074_1_16bdc0c9:
    # "Or would I run into the same issue as trying to appear with an item that I can't obtain? I need to test it."
    "还是说，我会跟「带着拿不到的东西现身」一样，碰上同样的问题？我得试一试。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068079_1_6efc0416:
    # "I failed to see any cue."
    "我没能捕捉到任何征兆。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068080_1_a04c2fd5:
    # "Really? ...Is it just because I couldn't enter the tower by my own means, or is there another reason...?"
    "真的？……只是因为我没法靠自己进塔，还是另有原因……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068081_1_3b55a845:
    # "There's gotta be something else. I could get into the tower through the storeroom and affect Sai's mark. That should allow the travel to put me inside the tower, which would bypass the mark. So, his mark would only be affected in a hypothetical world. It should work...!"
    "肯定还有别的办法。我可以通过储藏室进入塔内，从而影响到 Sai 的标记。这样，时间穿越就该能把我送进塔里，绕开标记。也就是说，他的标记只会在假想世界里受到影响。这应该行得通……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068088_1_6169ea07:
    # "Something else... There had to be something else."
    "还有别的……一定还有别的什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068089_1_c8522fa0:
    # "What if the Atsuki that Miiya has been with is my future self?"
    "如果一直陪在 Miiya 身边的人，就是未来的我呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068090_1_c2dd3299:
    # "It sounded interesting. Before that morning, I could've replaced the Atsuki of that world by making him stay outside the tower. Then, I could've hidden in plain sight by acting as the Atsuki who'd gotten trapped."
    "这个想法很有意思。在那天早晨之前，我本可以设法让那个世界的 Atsuki 留在塔外，从而取代他。然后，我就能扮演那个被困在塔里的 Atsuki，光明正大地出现在众人眼前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068091_1_7a88bb68:
    # "Of course, it was an impossibility: I would've observed my own movements all along, giving them no origin. However, if I had thought about that concept early enough, I felt it would've been viable."
    "当然，这是不可能的：如果我的行动自始至终都被我自己看在眼里，那它们就没有源头了。不过，如果能早一点想到这个构想，我觉得它其实行得通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068094_1_d5e7137a:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068099_1_7039e47d:
    # "My thoughts went back to the search at {time=14.}"
    "我的思绪又回到了 {time=14.} 的那次搜索。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068102_1_a9041bcb:
    # "I had thought about everything: my past self couldn't have been in the rooms I'd investigated. He couldn't have been in the rooms the other Atsuki had investigated. He couldn't have been in the places Miiya had investigated."
    "我什么都考虑过了：过去的我不可能藏在我查过的房间里，也不可能在另一个 Atsuki 查过的房间里，更不可能在 Miiya 找过的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068103_1_e9c12ba3:
    # "And he couldn't have been traveling forward in time."
    "他也不可能穿越到未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068104_1_94ceef9b:
    # "Where the hell had he been, then? The answer I was looking for had to be somewhere as well."
    "那他到底藏在哪儿？我想要的答案也一定就在某处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068105_1_8c5022bd:
    # "I hadn't forgotten about Miiya's change of attitude. She had come out of the fourth floor's partitions with an entirely different demeanor."
    "我也没有忘记 Miiya 态度的转变。她从四楼那些隔间里出来时，整个人判若两人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068106_1_55c6f956:
    # "Why? I knew my future self couldn't have been there.{w} So, then, what could she have seen?"
    "为什么？我明明知道未来的我不可能在那里。{w}那么，她究竟看到了什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068109_1_a0211597:
    # "It was clear the way I was handling my thoughts wasn't proper; I had to widen their scope."
    "显然，我这样想问题的方式不对；我得把思路放宽一些。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068110_1_ab70fd0a:
    # "In the end, only two things mattered: saving Miiya and returning to my world. The way I was thinking about it, those two aspects seemed to be incompatible."
    "说到底，只有两件事要紧：救出 Miiya，回到我的世界。可按我眼下的思路，这两件事似乎无法两全。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068111_1_aa445a79:
    # "How else could Miiya be saved, though? How the hell could the news I saw be bypassed?"
    "可是，除此之外还能怎么救 Miiya？我看到的那条新闻，又到底该怎么绕过去？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068112_1_b7d91186:
    # "There's no other way. I have to go back to the past again, to the 30th."
    "没有别的路。我必须再一次回到过去，回到 30 日那天。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068113_1_1f0e38b5:
    # "This is what I determined. I can salvage this world's history. Since I'm from another world, I can save this one."
    "我下定了决心。我能挽救这个世界的历史。既然我来自另一个世界，我就能救下这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068114_1_16457dbd:
    # "It has to be me—someone who hasn't observed the truth of this world yet. That's the only way."
    "必须是我——一个还没有看清这个世界真相的人。这是唯一的办法。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068116_1_1f96bac9:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068117_1_947372e0:
    # "It is the only way, isn't it?"
    "这是唯一的办法，不是吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068121_1_4a031c80:
    # "...I suppose it's not. Only one part of that is correct.{w} It doesn't have to be me, but the only reason I can do it is that I'm not from this world. Only someone who isn't from this world can divert this world's history from their own. That's a better way to put it."
    "……恐怕不是。那句话只有一半说对了。{w}未必非我不可，但我之所以能做到，只是因为我并非来自这个世界。只有不属于这个世界的人，才能让这个世界的历史偏离其原本的轨迹。这么说才更准确。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068123_1_94b716c7:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068124_1_1bace489:
    # "That's... right. I'm not the only person who can do this. It can be anyone from another world.{w} And... at {time=19}, the Shiroya from my world will appear here and go to the attic."
    "说得……没错。能做到这件事的不止我一个，任何来自其他世界的人都行。{w}而且……到了 {time=19}，我那个世界的 Shiroya 会出现在这里，然后前往阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068125_1_ff060cdc:
    # "She can do this too. ...Would that make a difference, though? Would that solve any problems?"
    "她也能做这件事。……可那又有什么用呢？能解决什么问题吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068126_1_0d7ceb28:
    # "I can tell her what I've learned. I can tell her everything. ...If she went to the past and saved this world, would she be able to be here at {time=19:30}?"
    "我可以把我查到的一切告诉她，全部告诉她。……如果她回到过去，救下这个世界，她还能在 {time=19:30} 出现在这里吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068127_1_fadde105:
    # "She couldn't have been in one of the rooms the Atsuki from this world investigated. The way he looked said more than enough. ...That means there's only one other possibility, but it doesn't make sense either.{w} It doesn't make sense."
    "她不可能出现在这个世界的 Atsuki 搜查过的任何一个房间里。他当时的神情已经说明了一切。……那就只剩下另一种可能，可那也说不通。{w}说不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068131_1_16db4758:
    # "When I looked under the next drawer, it was clear that the universe disagreed with me."
    "我朝下一个抽屉底下看去，顿时明白，连宇宙都不站在我这边。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068136_1_56c76023:
    # "I almost burst out laughing at what I saw. Not only from the absurdity of it existing, but also from how cartoonish it was. Maybe Shiroya had doodled something so goofy-looking just to elicit that reaction."
    "看到眼前的东西，我差点笑出声。不只是因为这东西存在本身就荒唐，更因为它那副卡通般的模样实在滑稽。也许 Shiroya 就是故意画了这么个傻乎乎的东西，好让人发笑。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068137_1_04eb65f8:
    # "Stunned, part of me refused what I was seeing. It flew in the face of what I knew. If that was the truth, what was the meaning behind that search? Why had nobody been found?"
    "我愣在原地，心里有一部分拒绝接受眼前的景象。它与我已知的一切相悖。若这才是真相，那次搜索又有什么意义？为什么谁都没有被找到？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068138_1_e9a9278b:
    # "Did it really make more sense than the other ideas I'd envisioned? ...Perhaps it didn't matter. Success had been assured to me—I was extremely puzzled, but I felt relieved more than anything."
    "这真的比我设想过的其他可能更合理吗？……也许这并不重要。成功已经有所保证——我满心困惑，但更多的还是释然。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068141_1_0ee235e1:
    # "Oh, that's right. The rusty key..."
    "啊，对了。那把生锈的钥匙……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068142_1_a0c4f115:
    # "That finally made sense. Before I'd entered the tower, the fact that I'd seen it in the outer keyhole had been almost ridiculous."
    "这下终于说得通了。进塔之前，我竟在外侧的钥匙孔里看到了它——当时我只觉得荒唐。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068143_1_40e54961:
    # "And..."
    "还有……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068144_1_e8583166:
    # "I felt a familiar sensation. In a few brief moments, swathes of problems still lingering in my mind slotted into place."
    "一种熟悉的感觉涌了上来。短短几瞬之间，我脑中还盘旋着的一堆问题都各归其位。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068145_1_8d22c839:
    # "At {time=19:30}, that's who activated one of the Sekimeiya. That's why we returned to our world."
    "在 {time=19:30}，启动其中一个 Sekimeiya 的人就是他。所以我们才回到了自己的世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068152_1_58968f50:
    # "I stood up slowly, my vision momentarily blurry. After some seconds, I began to approach the attic."
    "我缓缓起身，眼前一时有些模糊。过了几秒，我朝阁楼走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068158_1_da6b8d7a:
    # "I couldn't see Miiya, but her footprints were visible."
    "我看不见 Miiya，却能看见她的脚印。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068162_1_a74c8cbc:
    # "I was careful not to make a sound. The bedroom doors were closed, but it was very likely she was behind one of them."
    "我小心不弄出声响。卧室的门都关着，但她很可能就在其中一扇门后。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068166_1_cd28b37f:
    # "I shut myself in the kitchen. The recorder was still there, counting up the seconds. It had been an hour and a half since I'd started a new recording."
    "我把自己关进厨房。录音笔还在那里，秒数还在往上跳。距离我开始新的录音，已经过了一个半小时。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068167_1_f18a8a5b:
    # "...It must be about {time=17:30.}{w} I'll take the Sekimeiya out at {time=18:30.}"
    "……现在应该是 {time=17:30.} 左右吧。{w}我要在 {time=18:30.} 把 Sekimeiya 拿出来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068168_1_96497b69:
    # "It's strange... I know we'll change worlds at {time=19:30}, so I'll take both Sekimeiya out so that can happen..."
    "奇怪……我明明知道我们会在 {time=19:30} 切换世界，所以我要把两个 Sekimeiya 都取出来，好让那件事发生……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068169_1_08b40e29:
    # "Doesn't that contradict what the universe just repeatedly denied? Won't I allow something to happen because I experienced the result first?"
    "这难道不和宇宙刚刚一再否定的事相矛盾吗？我岂不是因为先看到了结果，才让某件事得以发生？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068170_1_6d8aaa87:
    # "Maybe there's something I'm missing. Maybe I don't really understand why it will happen."
    "也许我漏掉了什么。也许我还没真正明白它为什么会发生。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068172_1_73e0fedb:
    # "...I suppose it doesn't really matter, though. All I know is that it'll repeat."
    "……不过，算了，或许也无所谓。我只知道，那一切会重演。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068174_1_9e3b178f:
    # "I had to wait through the last stretch. I thought of going back to the sixth floor, but I chose to remain near the timer."
    "最后这段时间，我只能等。我一度想回六楼，最终还是选择留在计时器旁。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068182_1_2c821e6e:
    # "...{w}The news that I heard matched our world's. It was identical to how it would've been without my input."
    "……{w}我听到的新闻和我们世界的一样，和我没有插手时的版本完全相同。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068183_1_9f1cb7f5:
    # "That's why I imagined everything had happened the same way. Then, I realized that didn't have to be the case. The news was the only thing I'd observed in this world."
    "正因如此，我才以为一切都以同样的方式发生了。后来我才明白，未必如此。在这个世界里，我观测到的只有那条新闻。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068184_1_75912719:
    # "One girl had been severely injured, and the other hadn't been found. It matched up with what I'd personally experienced, although it wasn't the end. Seeing as it was the only barrier in this world, I could've gone back in time, saved Miiya, and prevented Shiroya from being found."
    "一个女孩受了重伤，另一个下落不明。这和我亲身经历的一致，但事情并未到此结束。既然这是这个世界上唯一的障碍，我本可以回到过去，救下 Miiya，并阻止 Shiroya 被发现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068185_1_eabd88f3:
    # "That's what I thought as soon as I put together that I could alter this world's history. The news could remain consistent because it didn't lead to a single interpretation.{w} I also thought that everything finally made sense—that it was the reason why Miiya had been in the tower and why Shiroya had been absent. It fit with the plan I came up with, so I thought I finally understood this world."
    "我意识到自己能改变这个世界的历史时，首先想到的就是这一点。新闻报道之所以能保持一致，是因为它并未引出唯一的解释。{w} 我还以为一切终于说得通了——Miiya 之所以会在塔里、Shiroya 之所以不在，原因就在于此。这与我拟定的计划吻合，于是我以为自己终于理解了这个世界的运作。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068186_1_8ce984ef:
    # "...It didn't make as much sense as I thought. After all, I saw Miiya in the tower—I saw the result of a loop before I came up with it. The news hadn't actually been the only piece of this world I'd observed.{w} And maybe it makes real sense. ...I believe I know why I saw Miiya before I understood how she'd be saved."
    "……事情并没有我想的那么合理。毕竟，我是在塔里见到 Miiya 的——在我想出那个循环之前，就已经看到了它的结果。我在这个世界观察到的东西，其实并不只有那则新闻。{w} 也许这样才真正说得通。……我想我知道，为什么我还没弄明白她将如何获救，就先见到了 Miiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068190_1_32455974:
    # "I didn't step out of the kitchen. Miiya was close by, but I hadn't heard anything. If she hadn't silently left, she was sleeping in a bedroom."
    "我没有走出厨房。Miiya 就在附近，我却什么也没听见。她若不是悄悄离开了，就是在某间卧室里睡着了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068193_1_80fdf0f0:
    # "Sixty more minutes had been added to the timer. It was finally {time=18:30.}"
    "计时器上又多了六十分钟。现在终于到了 {time=18:30.}"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068195_1_c9454d0e:
    # "At the same time that I took both Sekimeiya out of the refrigerator, I began a new recording."
    "我一边把两个 Sekimeiya 从冰箱里取出来，一边开始了新的录音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068196_1_fd76bb56:
    # "This is it. When the timer hits sixty minutes, it'll be {time=19:30.}"
    "就是这个时刻。等计时器走到六十分钟，就到 {time=19:30.} 了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068199_1_145551fb:
    # "I should keep waiting on the sixth floor. I don't know if Shiroya will use the elevator, but if she does, that's where she'll come out."
    "我应该继续在六楼等着。不知道 Shiroya 会不会乘电梯；如果她乘了，就会在那里下电梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068201_1_046a7c8b:
    # "I was about to leave when I heard someone behind the door."
    "我正要离开，却听见门后有人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068205_1_32e10785:
    # "...!{w} Who's here?"
    "……！{w} 谁在那里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068206_1_0386773b:
    # "Their steps approached one of the bedrooms and stepped inside."
    "那人迈步走向其中一间卧室，随后走了进去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068208_1_b94702d0:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068209_1_be3117e7:
    # "Is that all? Are they going to stay inside? I'm pretty sure whoever that was arrived with the elevator."
    "就这样？对方打算一直待在里面不出来？我敢肯定，刚才那人是乘电梯上来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068210_1_d93e402e:
    # "I stood still, awaiting any other movement. ...But it seemed they would remain there."
    "我站在原地，等着看还有没有别的动静。……但看来，对方会一直待在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068215_1_ac907078:
    # "Wait a second. I might have overlooked something important."
    "等等。我可能漏掉了什么重要的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068216_1_31a3346e:
    # "Even though I never saw Miiya in our world, Erina apparently did. She was definitely there at one point and left that note behind, right?"
    "虽然我在我们的世界里从没见过 Miiya，但 Erina 显然见过她。Miiya 肯定在那里待过，还留下了那张纸条，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068217_1_aad7626d:
    # "But she didn't stay there, or we would've seen her."
    "但她没有留在那里，否则我们就会看见她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068218_1_e8eeb27d:
    # "That's odd. If Erina saw Miiya, it should've been at around this time. Slightly before it, actually."
    "奇怪。如果 Erina 见到了 Miiya，那应该就是在这个时候。准确说，还要稍微早一点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068219_1_70f3420b:
    # "Isn't she here right now, though...?"
    "可她此刻不就在这里吗……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068220_1_36116ae6:
    # "There was a chance she was about to appear in our world. If that would happen, it was evident I didn't understand the details behind it."
    "她有可能马上就要出现在我们的世界里。如果真发生了，那就显然说明我还不了解其中的细节。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068221_1_d14f4a28:
    # "Perhaps {time=19:30} wasn't the only time where returning would be possible. It could occur earlier too, at a time I wasn't aware of."
    "也许能回去的时间并不只有 {time=19:30}。也可能更早，在我不知道的某个时刻。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068222_1_58de3288:
    # "If that time was still yet to happen, I had to get away from the Sekimeiya, or else I could disappear before Shiroya's arrival."
    "如果那个时刻还没到，我就必须远离 Sekimeiya；否则，我可能在 Shiroya 到来之前就消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068223_1_130d3ec5:
    # "I hid the Sekimeiya on a high cabinet shelf, as keeping them in a drawer would've severely messed with the temperature."
    "我把 Sekimeiya 藏到了展示柜高处的架子上，因为放进抽屉里会让温度大受影响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068229_1_7ae2628c:
    # "Then, I stepped onto the sixth floor, and like before, I entered the offices."
    "随后，我走上六楼，像之前那样进了办公室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068234_1_1d802b8d:
    # "Unless I've made a big mistake, she should be here in thirty minutes."
    "除非我犯了大错，否则她三十分钟后就该到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068235_1_c4c66ad4:
    # "If one of the Sekimeiya is activated before then for some reason, that'll cause the world change that could still happen. Since I know we'll return at {time=19:30}, though, I have a pretty strong guarantee that the Past Sekimeiya won't be the one activated."
    "如果在那之前，其中一个 Sekimeiya 因某种原因被激活，就会引发那场仍可能发生的世界变化。不过，既然我知道我们会在 {time=19:30} 回去，我就能相当肯定，被激活的不会是过去Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068245_1_0f3828bd:
    # "I was so close. It had been more than two weeks since I'd seen her."
    "就差一点了。我已经两个多星期没见过她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068246_1_b318b078:
    # "I had plenty of things to say, but I wanted to know her story too. Why would she run up to the attic? Why were her clothes different? What had she done in January?"
    "我有很多话想说，但也想知道她的经历。她为什么会跑上阁楼？衣服为什么和之前不一样？一月里她到底做了什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068247_1_03b4d60c:
    # "Just thinking about it made the time go by swiftly. The end was truly near."
    "光是想着这些，时间便过得飞快。终点真的近了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068253_1_0530ea40:
    # "I stood up and walked out. I was sure she was about to appear."
    "我站起身，走了出去。我确信她马上就要出现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068257_1_3695361c:
    # "I didn't have the voice recorder with me, but it had been close to half an hour. I stood still, trying to perceive the faintest sound."
    "我没带录音笔，但已经过了将近半小时。我站定不动，努力捕捉最细微的声响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068259_1_5cfb5f75:
    # "And it came. Finally, I heard what I'd been desperately wishing for.{w} Footsteps were approaching."
    "它终于来了。我听见了自己苦苦盼望的声音。{w} 脚步声正在靠近。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068267_1_70e380f2:
    # "...!"
    "……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068268_1_69ebc68b:
    # "...!"
    "……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068269_1_bfac6f76:
    # "...!"
    "……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068270_1_d6e4c5ed:
    # "What!?"
    "什么！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068271_1_a618355d:
    # "It wasn't who I'd been expecting. Miiya and the Atsuki she'd been with were there, staring deep into my eyes."
    "来的人并不是我期待的那一个。Miiya 和跟她在一起的另一个我就站在那里，直直凝视着我的眼睛。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068272_1_26161441:
    # "What the fuck...?"
    "这他妈……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068273_1_1d62e5f4:
    # "What the fuck? Why are they here!? Miiya should be in the attic!"
    "这他妈怎么回事？他们怎么会在这里！？Miiya 明明应该在阁楼！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068274_1_79d9f7cb:
    # "Hey, answer me! You really were here... Are you really me? What the fuck is going on!?"
    "喂，回答我！你真的在这里……你真的是我吗？这到底是怎么回事！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068276_1_2154ef89:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068277_1_b9b58176:
    # "...I didn't think you'd be here."
    "……我没想到你会在这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068283_1_a38bc875:
    # "Wh-What!? What does that mean!? You're me, right?"
    "什、什么！？这话是什么意思！？你就是我吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068284_1_0689d579:
    # "...I am."
    "……我就是。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068289_1_5b27f8ad:
    # "What the fuck is happening, then!? I thought it was impossible that we'd see each other. Was that wrong?"
    "那这到底是怎么回事！？我原以为我们不可能碰面。难道我想错了？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068291_1_07157745:
    # "In a way, yes."
    "某种意义上，是的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068292_1_567bfabf:
    # "What the fuck...? Tell me, then! What's going on!? How the fuck can you even exist!?"
    "这他妈……？那就告诉我！到底发生了什么！？你怎么可能还存在！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068293_1_abad2059:
    # "...I'm sorry, I'm not sure how to answer that question."
    "……抱歉，这个问题我不知道该怎么回答。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068294_1_53846efb:
    # "What...!?"
    "什么……！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068295_1_5a9d0419:
    # "I know exactly how you feel, I promise. I will tell you one thing, though, since we've already met: you shouldn't worry about anything."
    "我完全明白你现在的感受，真的。不过既然我们已经碰上了，我就告诉你一件事：你什么都不用担心。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068296_1_bdeb29b0:
    # "It must be too early. When we appeared in this world, Shiroya spent a short while on the crystal floor. It must not be time yet."
    "应该是太早了。我们刚来到这个世界时，Shiroya 在水晶展室待了一小会儿。现在还没到时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068301_1_61469c01:
    # "I shouldn't worry? There's no way you're actually me, right?"
    "不用担心？你根本不可能是真正的我吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068302_1_28aba4da:
    # "...I am. I promise, it will all be fine."
    "……我就是。我保证，一切都会没事的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068307_1_85924226:
    # "Wh-What...? How can you tell? And how would that even be possible!?"
    "什、什么……？你怎么知道？而且这怎么可能！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068308_1_7aae1a52:
    # "I know how it sounds, but I genuinely don't have time to explain, and I'm not sure I could."
    "我知道这话听起来很荒唐，但我真的没时间解释，也未必解释得清楚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068313_1_007cbb34:
    # "What does that even mean...!?"
    "这算什么话……！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068314_1_22b37aac:
    # "Look, we're the same person. Just trust me, or yourself, on this. Sincerely, everything should turn out fine."
    "听着，我们是同一个人。这件事上，你就信我，也就是信你自己。我说真的，一切都会顺利的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068315_1_0ef84b0e:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068320_1_c855ee6b:
    # "When he heard that, I saw my own body crumple down, and my heart ached. I didn't want to imagine how I felt."
    "听到那句话，我眼看着自己的身体瘫倒下去，心口一阵发疼。我不愿去想自己当时是什么感受。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068321_1_c82e2d21:
    # "You believe me, right? Like I said, I don't have much time."
    "你信我，对吧？我说过，我时间不多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068324_1_25044596:
    # "But that c-can't be the case...! Shiroya... died again!"
    "可、可这不可能啊……！Shiroya……又死了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068325_1_e4b5dd40:
    # "Again? What do you mean?"
    "又死了？你什么意思？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068330_1_9d66aa1a:
    # "Do you not know that? She was killed here, and her body disappeared from the lobby!"
    "你不知道吗？她在这里被杀了，尸体却从大厅里消失了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068331_1_b5e71dff:
    # "What...? What does that mean?"
    "什么……？这是什么意思？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068332_1_117a2170:
    # "It can't be. She won't be in the tower.{w} This is the same as before! Someone is telling me that Shiroya's fate within the tower is death. Why have so many people said that!?"
    "不可能。她不会在塔里。{w}这和之前一模一样！有人在对我说，Shiroya 在塔里只有死路一条。为什么这么多人都这么说！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068333_1_ea4b841b:
    # "It's not true! I've never seen her dead! That must be a mistake.{w} She'll be fine. It's impossible that she will die in the tower. We'll make sure of that."
    "不是真的！我从没见过她死！那一定是弄错了。{w}她会没事的。她不可能死在塔里，我们会阻止这种事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068334_1_a992d496:
    # "You should believe what I say. I still don't fully understand how that works, but you have to trust me."
    "你该相信我说的话。这到底是怎么回事，我还没完全弄明白，但你得信我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068339_1_253f75bc:
    # "...You can't explain it? Then there's no way you're actually telling the truth, right?"
    "……你解释不了？那你说的就不可能是真的吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068340_1_d6f9d7bb:
    # "I am. While I can't be fully confident about what I'm saying, I'll just ask you to believe me."
    "是真的。虽然我对自己的话也没有十足把握，但我只能请你相信我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068341_1_1775a6b0:
    # "...{w}Okay."
    "……{w}好吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068344_1_46503878:
    # "...Good. I suppose there's one thing you could do, then."
    "……好。既然如此，有件事你可以做。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068349_1_81d053ba:
    # "What?"
    "什么事？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068350_1_91636a90:
    # "Wait here a second."
    "在这儿等我一下。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068356_1_a5453a27:
    # "I turned around and went to the attic, where Miiya should've been."
    "我转身去了阁楼，Miiya 本该在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068360_1_136efd37:
    # "The Sekimeiya are still here. Neither of them were activated."
    "Sekimeiya 都还在这里。两个都没有启动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068361_1_86bd90a5:
    # "What the hell, then? I don't get what happened...!"
    "那到底是怎么回事？我根本搞不懂发生了什么……！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068362_1_b57cf9cf:
    # "There was no time to wonder. After I grabbed the Future Sekimeiya, I dashed back out."
    "没空多想。我抓起未来Sekimeiya，转身冲了出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068370_1_794e5e21:
    # "Huh...?"
    "啊……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068371_1_9129e0b5:
    # "Take this, but don't touch it."
    "拿着，但别直接碰它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068372_1_2db8448f:
    # "I handed him the Sekimeiya."
    "我把 Sekimeiya 递给了他。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068373_1_522f3194:
    # "You two should hurry back down. On the second floor, enter the second partition, leave the Sekimeiya on the floor, and wait there."
    "你们俩赶紧下楼去。到二楼，进第二个隔间，把 Sekimeiya 放在{tip=floor}地上{/tip}，就在那儿等着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068378_1_72251092:
    # "On the second floor?"
    "二楼？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068379_1_44d5341b:
    # "Yes. From there, if anyone passes by, you should hear them. If you hear the elevator four times, you can go back down and place the Sekimeiya in its cabinet. Make sure that it isn't activated again."
    "对。待在那里，只要有人经过，你们应该都能听见。要是听到电梯响四次，就可以下楼，把 Sekimeiya 放回它的展示柜里。务必确保它不会再被启动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068380_1_a496ffc9:
    # "However, it's possible that the first time, instead of hearing the elevator, you'll hear someone running up. If that happens, once you hear the elevator two times, you can go down and place the Sekimeiya in the cabinet."
    "不过，第一次你们听到的可能不是电梯，而是有人跑上楼的脚步声。若是那样，等电梯响过两次，你们就可以下楼，把 Sekimeiya 放回展示柜。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068385_1_37269a13:
    # "I wasn't completely sure if Shiroya would walk up or take the elevator. However, a while after that, they would hear Erina and my past self taking it. That would be their cue to go down."
    "我不确定 Shiroya 会走楼梯还是坐电梯。不过，过一会儿他们会听见 Erina 和过去的我坐电梯的动静。那就是该下去的信号。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068391_1_ebd5de99:
    # "O-Okay, and... after that, you're saying everything will be fine, right?"
    "好、好的，那……之后，你是说一切都会没事，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068392_1_d2e518b7:
    # "Yes. Wait patiently with everyone on the crystal floor and make sure to get out safely. I'll pray with you for what will happen after that."
    "对。和大家一起在水晶层耐心等着，务必平安离开。至于之后会发生什么，我会和你们一同祈祷。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068393_1_a3895a95:
    # "All... All right."
    "好……好吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068397_1_293ee801:
    # "The other Atsuki didn't waste time. As soon as he said that, he ran back toward the stairs."
    "另一个我没有耽搁，话音一落就朝楼梯跑了回去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068399_1_e26f18e9:
    # "Goodbye, Miiya."
    "再见，Miiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068400_1_f8d6a94a:
    # "It took all I had in me to say that and nothing more. It was a second goodbye. I would never see her again."
    "我用尽全力，也只说出这一句。这是第二次告别。我再也见不到她了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068401_1_b23b285a:
    # "Goodbye."
    "再见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068407_1_19d7e21e:
    # "Oblivious to the gravity of her farewell, she turned around and left my sight."
    "她并不知道这句告别有多沉重，转身便走出了我的视线。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068413_1_780521dc:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068414_1_8d0065ba:
    # "Once I could no longer hear their running, I found myself standing alone. ...I couldn't bring myself to move."
    "脚步声远去之后，只剩我独自站在那里。……我一步也迈不动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068415_1_f3429951:
    # "If nothing happened very soon, I would've been wrong about everything."
    "如果很快什么都没发生，那就说明我全都判断错了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068421_1_87340f7d:
    # "When I heard the elevator, all the tension within me was released. She was there."
    "听到电梯声的那一刻，我全身的紧绷一下子卸了下来。她到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068422_1_e7d86b10:
    # "She'd called the elevator from the crystal floor. I waited, and seconds later, I heard it again."
    "她从水晶层叫了电梯。我等着，几秒后，又听到了电梯声。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068423_1_1b88da23:
    # "Wait, what? Why did I hear it again? Doesn't that mean that it's going to the attic?"
    "等等，怎么回事？怎么又响了一次？那不就说明电梯是往阁楼去的吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068424_1_9afb7132:
    # "Oh, that's right! She had the key!"
    "啊，对了！钥匙在她手上！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068428_1_d0b36f83:
    # "I bolted off as fast as I could."
    "我拔腿就跑，用尽了全力。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068441_1_536106da:
    # "She was in the hallway. When she saw me, it was apparent we'd both been looking for each other."
    "她在走廊里。她一见到我，我就明白，我们俩一直在互相找对方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068448_1_70e419f7:
    # "There you are... You did come.{w} I'd forgotten you had the key to the attic."
    "你来了……你真的来了。{w}我都忘了，阁楼的钥匙在你手上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068453_1_1b739c43:
    # "Are you... the Atsuki from this morning?"
    "你是……今天早上的那个 Atsuki？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068454_1_564e6064:
    # "Yeah. I'm glad I wasn't wrong."
    "嗯。还好我没猜错。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068455_1_e6ae6058:
    # "Y-You knew I would be here, right? You remembered what happened."
    "你、你知道我会来，对吧？你还记得发生过的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068456_1_56bce9fe:
    # "I nodded slowly. I was right about everything. ...We had reunited in a world other than our own."
    "我缓缓点头。我果然没猜错。……我们重逢的这个世界，并不是我们原来所在的世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068462_1_d745151e:
    # "Have you been here all this time? When you disappeared this morning, I tried to find you, but I was in another world, right?"
    "你一直待在这里吗？今天早上你消失之后，我想去找你，可那时我已经在另一个世界了，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068463_1_a1e585e5:
    # "I see. So she really is the same person who was here this morning."
    "原来如此。看来她确实是今天早上在这里的那个人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068464_1_4aad374b:
    # "I... think so. I learned a lot of things. It's been longer than you think since I saw you."
    "我……想是吧。我弄清了很多事。从我上次见你到现在，比你想象的要久得多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068469_1_2dda9119:
    # "What do you mean? You said the recording was real, right? What happened at {time=21}? And why did both of us appear at the start of today?"
    "什么意思？你说过那段录音是真的，对吧？{time=21} 到底发生了什么？还有，为什么我们两个都出现在今天刚开始的时候？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068470_1_af706493:
    # "...Why did we travel to this morning?{w} I know the answer now."
    "……我们为什么会穿越到今天早上？{w}现在我知道答案了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068471_1_5e067ea1:
    # "...Hm?"
    "……嗯？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068472_1_792060a3:
    # "I remember what you told me. You said you traveled to the 30th of November, and that a few days later, you touched the Sekimeiya in the tower. Is that right?"
    "我记得你跟我说过的话。你说你穿越到了 11 月 30 日，几天之后，在塔里碰了 Sekimeiya。是这样吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068473_1_2581ca51:
    # "Y-Yes. That's when I appeared with you in the lobby."
    "是、是的。我就是在那时和你一起出现在大厅的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068474_1_e39171f8:
    # "No, that's wrong. I know what happened to you."
    "不，不对。我知道你身上发生了什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068479_1_b1f6ea16:
    # "She frowned. It seemed she hadn't entertained the possibility."
    "她皱起眉，似乎从未想过这种可能。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068480_1_612dc590:
    # "You didn't go to November... You went to the future."
    "你没有去 11 月……你去的是未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068485_1_0262e254:
    # "...Wh-What? No I didn't. I went two weeks to the past."
    "……什、什么？不可能。我是回到了两周前。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068486_1_4884369b:
    # "I don't know why you think that, but I believe you went to the future.{w} You said that you entered the tower in early December. I believe that was the 5th of January instead."
    "我不知道你为什么会这么想，但我相信你去的是未来。{w}你说过，你是在 12 月初进入塔里的。我认为那其实是 1 月 5 日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068491_1_b99935b7:
    # "The 5th of January? That doesn't make any sense."
    "1 月 5 日？这根本说不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068492_1_0bfb1724:
    # "Like I said, the recording was real. On the 5th of January, we were in the tower. That's why I appeared with you in the lobby when you touched the Sekimeiya."
    "我说过了，录音是真的。一月五日那天，我们就在塔里。所以你碰到 Sekimeiya 的时候，我才会和你一起出现在大厅。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068493_1_e374459d:
    # "N-No. No. How would I have gone to the future? There's no way."
    "不、不会的。我怎么可能穿越到未来？绝无可能。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068494_1_fe068972:
    # "With the Sekimeiya. There were two of them."
    "靠的是 Sekimeiya。当时有两个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068501_1_63ef187d:
    # "I... know. I saw that too. What do you mean, though?"
    "我……知道。那个我也看见了。可你这话是什么意思？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068502_1_93182551:
    # "I've thought about everything that happened. There always were two Sekimeiya, but only one of them made us go to the past. The other one made us go to the future instead."
    "发生过的事我都想过了。一直以来都有两个 Sekimeiya，但把我们送往过去的只有一个；另一个则把我们送去了未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068503_1_31a9cf44:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068504_1_f4082571:
    # "The one in the water tank sent you to the future, but that wasn't the first time. ...It wasn't the first time you'd traveled forward in time. There were others."
    "水箱里的那个把你送到了未来，但那不是第一次。……你以前就穿越到过未来，而且还不止一次。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068509_1_bb4eb1e5:
    # "She looked astonished. For a while, she didn't respond."
    "她满脸震惊，好一会儿说不出话。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068515_1_35f03bb7:
    # "A-Are you serious...?"
    "你、你说的是真的……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068516_1_d97ce9da:
    # "I am. I've been able to understand the Sekimeiya.{w} The Future Sekimeiya made us appear where we were in the past; I believe that could be part of your confusion. The Past Sekimeiya made us appear where we would be in the future.{w} ...And, if both ranges overlapped, the world around us would change instead."
    "是真的。我已经弄懂 Sekimeiya 了。{w}未来Sekimeiya 会让我们出现在我们过去所在的位置——我想，你之所以困惑，可能也有这个原因。过去Sekimeiya 则会让我们出现在我们未来会在的位置。{w}……而一旦两个范围重叠，被改变的就会是我们周围的世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068517_1_ce535e68:
    # "O{w=0.2}-Oh!{w=0.3} ...That makes sense. That's how I came back."
    "噢{w=0.2}——！{w=0.3}……说得通。原来我是那样回来的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068523_1_9c5dde59:
    # "She stared off into the hallway, working with the information I'd given her."
    "她望着走廊出神，在心里盘算着我告诉她的那些事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068525_1_2a60dfa6:
    # "When she opened her mouth again, she asked what she most wanted an answer to."
    "她再次开口时，问出了她最想知道答案的那个问题。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068531_1_53846913:
    # "So... what now? What will happen at {time=21}?"
    "那么……现在怎么办？{time=21} 会发生什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068532_1_15b82b6b:
    # "It'll be fine. We'll be able to leave."
    "{cps=80}没事的。{w=0.4}我们能出去的。{nw}"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068537_1_55f84a3e:
    # "She breathed a sigh of relief. Everything could finally end."
    "她松了口气。一切终于可以结束了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068538_1_be56a2d2:
    # "This isn't over yet, though. We have to do one more thing."
    "{cps=80}不过，{w=0.2}这事还没完。{w=0.5}我们还得再做一件事。{nw}"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068543_1_6c1c7798:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068545_1_f6d78efe:
    # "...We{w=0.6} are going to save Miiya."
    "……我们{w=0.6}要去救 Miiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068549_1_e83f136b:
    # "Wh-What? Really...?{w} Can the past really be changed after all!?"
    "什、什么？真的……？{w}难道过去真的能改变吗！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068550_1_62e744e7:
    # "That's not it. The past is set in stone.{w} But in a different world, the past is no different from the future for us."
    "不是这样。过去是定死的。{w}但在另一个世界里，过去对我们来说，和未来并没有什么区别。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068555_1_39632bd3:
    # "Huh...?"
    "诶……？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068556_1_76d8ade6:
    # "We can save her in this world. If you travel, you can save her.{w} ...It has to be you, though."
    "我们可以在这个世界救她。只要你穿越回去，就能救她。{w}……不过，这件事必须由你来做。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068557_1_03228af0:
    # "What do you mean?"
    "你什么意思？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068563_1_a93865d3:
    # "I walked to the kitchen. The recorder's timer showed 44:24."
    "我走进厨房。录音笔上的计时显示着 44:24。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068568_1_b0baad6a:
    # "That is the Past Sekimeiya. If you activate it when the timer reaches 63:14, you'll appear on November 30th. If you're there, Miiya will not die.{w} I can't come with you, though. If you activate it, anyone in the center of the building will go back to our world. If I travel to the past too, I won't be able to be there.{w} But, if it's you who does this, you will be. When December 15th comes, you'll be able to enter through the storeroom, and if you stay in the third partition on the fourth floor, you'll make it back to this point."
    "那就是过去Sekimeiya。等计时走到 63:14 时启动它，你就会出现在 11 月 30 日。只要你在那里，Miiya 就不会死。{w}不过我没办法跟你一起去。你一旦启动它，所有位于大楼中心的人都会回到我们原本的世界。如果我也穿越回过去，就没办法待在那里了。{w}但换成你去做，你就能留在那里。等到 12 月 15 日，你可以从储藏室进来；只要待在四楼第三间隔间里，就能回到这个时间点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068573_1_85e93162:
    # "She looked overwhelmed. There was very little time left, so I was trying to explain everything rapidly."
    "她看上去有些不知所措。时间所剩无几，我只能尽快把一切讲清楚。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068575_1_a3f0cf1e:
    # "W-Wait, so, I'll be able to prevent her death? And then, at this time, both of us will go back to our world?"
    "等、等等，也就是说，我能阻止她死去？然后到了这个时间，我们两个都能回到自己的世界？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068580_1_28213aee:
    # "When I nodded, her eyes briefly widened."
    "我点了点头，她微微睁大了眼睛。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068583_1_02f02fd2:
    # "The seconds were passing quickly, so I had to make sure I could say everything I needed to."
    "时间过得很快，我必须确保该说的都能说完。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068584_1_cfd3b77e:
    # "You will appear on November 30th where you will be on December 30th. If you think about where you'll be, that's where you'll appear."
    "你会在11月30日现身，地点就是你在12月30日所在之处。只要想好自己到时候会在哪儿，就会在那里出现。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068589_1_3113aa99:
    # "...What?"
    "……什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068590_1_2e08197c:
    # "On December 30th, you have to be in that gem shop so that you appear there in November."
    "12月30日那天，你必须待在那家宝石店里，这样到了11月，你才会在那里现身。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068591_1_92c3052d:
    # "In the gem shop? I don't think that will be possible. ...It was still closed."
    "宝石店里？我想那不太可能。……那家店当时还关着门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068592_1_7cc0c1b0:
    # "I-In that case, right outside it.{w} It was snowing on November 30th, wasn't it?"
    "那、那就待在店门外好了。{w}11月30日那天在下雪，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068593_1_f4678aab:
    # "I bit my lip. I didn't know what would happen if she were to appear right on top of falling snow, given what had happened to me with the elevator's railing."
    "我咬住嘴唇。我自己在电梯扶手上出过事，不知道她要是直接出现在落雪中会怎样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068594_1_b936d1bc:
    # "You'll have to be below a stone roof, where the snow won't hit you and there'll be none on the ground. Then, you'll be able to prevent Miiya from being hit by the explosion.{w} That's not all, though. There's something else very important. Your body can't be found."
    "你得待在石制屋檐下，雪淋不到你，地上也没有积雪。这样你就能让 Miiya 不被爆炸波及。{w}不过不止这些。还有一件很重要的事——不能让人发现你的身体。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068596_1_7afd878a:
    # "M-Mine?"
    "我、我的？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068599_1_10591bb1:
    # "I nodded, although I still didn't fully understand that. ...Why was her body the one that had to go missing? If the news had to be merely followed, why couldn't Miiya's be the one that wouldn't be found despite her well-being? ...The only reason it had to be Shiroya's was because I knew Miiya was in the tower. I still felt like there was something else to all of that."
    "我点了点头，但心里还是没完全弄懂。……为什么偏偏必须是她失踪？如果只要照着新闻来安排就行，那为什么不能是 Miiya 平安无事、只是她的身体没被发现？……之所以非得让 Shiroya 失踪，唯一的依据就是我知道 Miiya 当时在塔里。可我总觉得，事情没那么简单。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068600_1_9e0cd50e:
    # "Then, early on the 15th, you'll be able to enter the tower through the storeroom. You still have the rusty key, right?"
    "然后，15日一早，你就能从储藏室进入塔里。生锈的钥匙还在你手上吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068605_1_186dc46f:
    # "...Yes."
    "……在。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068606_1_efc8631f:
    # "She showed it to me."
    "她把钥匙拿给我看。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068607_1_4acf92f9:
    # "You'll be able to stay in the third partition on the fourth floor. I know that'll work, because after {time=14}, you'll go to the sixth floor and leave some kind of indication for me under one of the drawers. The fifth desk from the left, in the first partition.{w} After that, you'll only need to leave momentarily at {time=15:30.} If you're in the floor 2 and 3 staircase, you'll avoid being inside the range of a travel. The range might actually reach the crystal floor, but if you're in a corner of the building a floor above, you'll avoid it. Just not in the crystal floor staircase since that's where I was at the time."
    "你可以待在四楼的第三个隔间。我知道那样行得通：过了 {time=14} 之后，你会去六楼，在某个抽屉底下给我留个记号。也就是第一个隔间里从左数第五张桌子的抽屉。{w}之后，你只要在 {time=15:30.} 暂时离开一下就行。只要你在二楼和三楼之间的楼梯上，就不会落在某次穿越的范围内。范围说不定会延伸到水晶展室，但只要你待在这栋楼比水晶展室高一层的角落，就能避开。只是别待在通往水晶展室的楼梯上——那个时间点我正在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068610_1_7c197c21:
    # "O-Okay..."
    "好、好的……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068611_1_ecd8ab0b:
    # "I'm sorry. There's not much time left."
    "抱歉。时间不多了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068613_1_0924fb2f:
    # "50:06. I had to leave soon to escape the range, and I wasn't sure if I'd explained myself well at all. {tip=rush}Something about the rush I was in felt paradoxical{/tip}, but I had no time to try to think about it."
    "50:06。我马上就得离开，才能避开那个范围，而我也不确定自己到底有没有解释清楚。{tip=rush}我这样匆忙，本身就似乎有些矛盾{/tip}，但我没空细想。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068618_1_f595afcf:
    # "Let me check that nobody's in the bedrooms anymore. I don't know what happened to them, but someone might still be here."
    "我去看看卧室里还有没有人。我不知道他们出了什么事，但说不定还有人留在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068622_1_77e7acd1:
    # "I looked at the four separate bedrooms, which were all vacant. Meanwhile, I felt my fingers beginning to tremble. Shiroya was there again, and it seemed as if the future finally had a distinct shape."
    "我望向那四间独立的卧室，里面空无一人。与此同时，我感到指尖开始发抖。Shiroya 又站在那里，未来仿佛终于有了清晰的轮廓。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068628_1_ebe5b118:
    # "That's it, then. Everything is ready."
    "那就这样吧。一切都准备好了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068629_1_4ad44de8:
    # "It will work. I'm sure."
    "会成功的。我确定。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068634_1_55ebbb45:
    # "Y-Yeah."
    "嗯、嗯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068635_1_3b9c22d4:
    # "Can I ask, though? ...Why are your clothes like this?"
    "不过我能不能问一句？……你的衣服怎么是这个样子？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068640_1_9d6245ca:
    # "O-Oh. I put them on hoping I would come back to the point you saw me."
    "啊、哦。我穿上这一身，是希望自己能回到你见到我的那个时刻。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068641_1_10fcfb83:
    # "Really? ...That's interesting."
    "是吗？……有意思。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068642_1_365d87b4:
    # "In fact, it seemed to go against most conclusions I'd made. There was no time to care, however."
    "事实上，这似乎和我之前得出的大部分结论都对不上。但我已经没有时间在意了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068645_1_8a39e4c5:
    # "Wait. You have the attic key. You should give it to me."
    "等等。阁楼的钥匙在你手上。把它交给我吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068646_1_81d5adf2:
    # "You need it?"
    "你需要它？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068647_1_eeb7e9be:
    # "No, but you will on January 26th. If I don't take it now, you won't be able to have it.{w} Because, at {time=21} today, the police will find you, and they'll take this key from you if you have it. I need to keep it."
    "我不需要，但1月26日的你会需要。如果我现在不把它拿走，你就拿不到它了。{w}因为今天 {time=21} 的时候，警察会找到你，钥匙要是还在你身上，就会被他们收走。我得留着它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068652_1_a1e1a496:
    # "And they won't take it if you have it?"
    "那要是放在你身上，他们就不会收走？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068653_1_33979280:
    # "...No.{w} I'd tell you why, but there's not enough time right now."
    "……不会。{w}原因我可以告诉你，但现在时间不够。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068654_1_33f72a05:
    # "...Hm."
    "……嗯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068658_1_ed8c9c06:
    # "Five minutes were left until she would travel to the past. For me, I was five minutes away from returning to our world with her."
    "距离她穿越回过去还有五分钟。而我，也只剩五分钟就能和她一起回到我们的世界。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068659_1_8d591580:
    # "I grabbed the Past Sekimeiya and left it on the highest cabinet shelf, where it wasn't easy to see."
    "我拿起过去Sekimeiya，把它放到展示柜最高一层的架子上，那个位置不容易被看见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068660_1_ff3b4b7d:
    # "If you activate it when it's there, in the instance that the people from this world come back up, it's possible they won't find it."
    "如果它在上面的时候你启动它，万一这个世界的人重新上来，他们也许就找不到它了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068661_1_83973099:
    # "I see."
    "原来如此。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068669_1_1cef76ee:
    # "...{w}I should go. I'm sure your future self is currently on the fourth floor. She's been there for hours.{w} You understand everything I said, right?"
    "……{w}我该走了。未来的你此刻一定就在四楼，已经待了好几个小时。{w}我说的话，你都明白了吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068670_1_f47ed568:
    # "...I think so. When that screen says 63:14, I just have to touch the Sekimeiya."
    "……大概明白。等那块屏幕上显示 63:14，我只要碰一下 Sekimeiya 就行。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068671_1_51faf268:
    # "You'll appear on the 30th, next to that gem shop.{w} I have to go now, but I guess I'm about to see you again. I'm sorry that there wasn't more time to explain."
    "你会在30日出现在那家宝石店旁边。{w}我现在得走了，不过看来我很快就会再见到你。抱歉，没能有更多时间解释。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068676_1_39ea84e4:
    # "A-All right. I'll see you."
    "好、好的。再见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068677_1_a9a5e000:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068684_1_b4c0b2d0:
    # "But before I knew it, my body had jumped forward in a sudden impulse and was tightly embracing Shiroya. I couldn't stand the thought of anything going wrong from that point on."
    "还没等我反应过来，身体已经在一阵冲动下向前扑去，紧紧抱住了 Shiroya。我无法忍受从这一刻起再出任何差错。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068687_1_c18c7508:
    # "Right next to my ear, I felt her surprised breath, and after the initial shock, her hands slowly tightened up behind me. I couldn't believe what was happening, but I took advantage of it and rested my head on her shoulder."
    "我能感觉到她惊讶的呼吸就在耳边。最初的震惊过后，她的双手缓缓在我背后收紧。我几乎不敢相信眼前发生的事，却还是顺势把头靠在了她的肩上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068688_1_511cd625:
    # "I wished the moment could go on forever, but the clock was ticking. When I let go of her, I couldn't bring myself to say anything else or even look directly at her again."
    "我真希望这一刻能永远持续下去，但时间仍在流逝。松开她之后，我再也说不出别的话，甚至连再看她一眼都做不到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068694_1_d91613f6:
    # "It was hard to turn around, but I had to. With my body still shaking, I trudged to the stairs, aware it was the last time my footprints would be left on that floor."
    "转身是如此艰难，但我非转不可。身体仍在发抖，我拖着步子走向楼梯，心里清楚这是我最后一次在那层楼留下足迹。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068706_1_a3e47e97:
    # "63 minutes. Shiroya tightly gripped the device that had once been found in Isla's purse while her heart raced from Atsuki's sudden hug."
    "63分钟。Shiroya 紧紧握住那件曾经在 Isla 手包里被发现的装置，Atsuki 突如其来的拥抱让她心跳不已。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068711_1_f5999f76:
    # "Her other hand was reaching high above her, close to the Sekimeiya as she withstood the immense heat around it."
    "她的另一只手高高伸起，向 Sekimeiya 探去，同时强忍着它周围灼人的高温。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068713_1_582fd0dc:
    # "She hadn't traveled to the past, but she was about to. She stared firmly at the numbers on the screen and gradually moved her hand deeper into the heat.{w} After fourteen more seconds had gone by, she felt the hard touch."
    "她还没有穿越回过去，但马上就要。她定定地盯着屏幕上的数字，把手一点点探入那团灼热之中。{w}又过了十四秒，她的指尖触到了坚硬的表面。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068729_1_f31fa146:
    # "Light snow was falling on a dim street in Yushibana. Despite the few lit windows, not one of them saw the figure of a young girl appearing by the entrance of a house, below a stone roof."
    "细雪落在丰花一条昏暗的街道上。几扇窗子亮着灯，却没有一扇看见那个少女的身影——她出现在一户人家的门口，站在石制屋檐下。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068734_1_ba3f6876:
    # "She found herself leaning on the cold wall and rapidly looked down. There, she was able to see some of the footprints she'd once left."
    "她发觉自己正倚着一面冰冷的墙，急忙低头看去。在那里，她看见了自己曾经留下的几行足迹。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068739_1_5157194e:
    # "She traced them up to an opaque door on the opposite side of the street. Wasting no time, she dashed over and opened it."
    "她顺着足迹看去，尽头是街对面一扇不透明的门。她毫不迟疑地冲过去，推开了门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068744_1_cbd1f981:
    # "Remnants of the smoke were in the air. It had already been released, but it wasn't too late."
    "空气里还残留着烟雾。烟已经放出来了，但还来得及。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068745_1_8f60d99b:
    # "On the floor, she saw the first two people to fall unconscious—those who had already escaped danger."
    "地板上躺着最先失去意识的两个人——她们已经脱离了险境。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068749_1_f1af2885:
    # "Behind the shelves were two girls. One was being protected by the wooden structures, whereas the other was an open target."
    "货架后面有两个女孩。一个被木架挡得严实，另一个却完全暴露在外。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068752_1_3d86d30e:
    # "She crouched and grabbed the shoulders of the girl in red, shuffling backward to drop her behind the shield of shelves."
    "她蹲下身，抓住红衣女孩的肩膀，向后挪去，把她拖到货架后面，让货架挡住她。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068755_1_f5befb5d:
    # "Once that danger was removed, she stood up and looked at her own body on the floor. She didn't know the exact time, but her work wasn't finished yet."
    "危险解除后，她站起身，看向地板上自己的躯体。她不知道确切的时间，但她的工作还没有做完。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068758_1_4534e3dc:
    # "She picked herself up by her shoulders and began to retreat.{w} However, a slight sound caused her to spin around, and her heart skipped a beat."
    "她抓住另一个自己的肩膀，把她扶起来，随后开始后退。{w}然而，一点轻微的响动让她猛地转过身，心头骤然一紧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068759_1_7b2edb1b:
    # "She didn't see the door opening because a wooden shelf was blocking it. However, soon after she heard its squeaky sound, the lights turned off."
    "一排木架挡住了视线，她没能看见门被打开。但听到吱呀声之后不久，灯就灭了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068762_1_3251a770:
    # "There was practically no time to react. During the instants before the light came back, the girl closed her eyes and attempted to cover her face with her arms."
    "几乎来不及反应。在灯光重新亮起前的一瞬间，女孩闭上眼睛，抬起手臂护住脸。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068770_1_24f2937d:
    # "The floor had been devastated, and she found herself falling with the rubble, the deadly light shrinking as she was consumed by familiar darkness."
    "地面已被炸得支离破碎，她随着碎石一同坠落，那致命的光芒渐渐远去，熟悉的黑暗将她吞没。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068781_1_fe844746:
    # "She saw something shining above and heard very faint shouts. Her entire body was wracked with pain, but she was able to stand up."
    "她看见上方有什么在发亮，也听见极其微弱的喊声。全身痛得像散了架，但她还是站了起来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068783_1_bf714072:
    # "When she looked around her, she saw there was light there too: an egg-shaped gemstone had rolled away, and it gave off a soft glow."
    "她环顾四周，发现这里也有光：一颗蛋形的宝石滚落在一旁，散发着柔和的光晕。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068784_1_db7375ab:
    # "She heard a moan laced with pain. Her other self was conscious. She had been holding her as they'd fallen; that time, neither one of them had lapsed into a lengthy unconsciousness."
    "她听见一声带着痛楚的呻吟。另一个自己已经恢复了意识。坠落时她一直抱着她；这一次，两人都没有陷入长时间的昏迷。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068785_1_b550a58c:
    # "Her friend had told her something very important: her own body couldn't be found. She didn't understand why, but a realization immediately came to her."
    "朋友告诉过她一件很重要的事：她本人的身体是找不到的。她不明白为什么，但一个念头立刻浮上心头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068787_1_73d07486:
    # "As she took a slow step back, she saw her own self awakening. It was difficult to make out, but she saw that the other her was staring at the distant gemstone."
    "她缓缓后退一步，看见另一个自己正在苏醒。虽然难以看清，但她看得出，另一个她正凝视着远处的宝石。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068788_1_3d31271f:
    # "That was when she understood... that the universe would do the rest—that she didn't have to enact something that was already meant to happen."
    "就在那时她明白了……余下的事，这个世界自会去完成——已经注定会发生的事，不需要由她来推动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068791_1_0caa8e29:
    # "She stepped back. She knew the way out of there."
    "她向后退去。她知道离开这里的路。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068793_1_3b0b1425:
    # "Meanwhile, the other girl approached the stone. The act of her touching it would be the {tip=force}driving force{/tip} behind a forthcoming attack in her town."
    "与此同时，另一个女孩走近了那块石头。她伸手触碰它，而这一碰，将成为不久后降临在她所在城镇的那场袭击的{tip=force}驱动力{/tip}。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068801_1_85b0601b:
    # "The girl found herself looking out upon a nostalgic view, but the snow was still piling up to form the scenery she'd once seen. Once more, she began walking to her empty apartment."
    "女孩望见一片令人怀念的景色，积雪却仍在不断堆积，渐渐堆成她曾经见过的模样。她又一次迈开步子，走向那间空无一人的公寓。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068802_1_6505a347:
    # "But when she realized that it would soon be December 1st, her destination changed."
    "但当她意识到12月1日就快到了，她改变了目的地。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068803_1_53ce47e8:
    # "She had once felt a false sense of freedom walking down that path, but the kind she felt the second time was genuine; she knew where the path went."
    "她曾在那条路上感到过一种虚假的自由；第二次踏上时，那种自由却是真的——她知道这条路通向何处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068804_1_1d86480b:
    # "It led to a place she hadn't thought existed, and one that she was eager to reach."
    "它通向一个她从未想过存在的地方，也是她迫切想要抵达的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068815_1_fa293016:
    # "I arrived on the fourth floor and looked at the wall to my right. ...She had to be on the other side of it."
    "我来到四楼，看向右侧的墙壁。……她一定就在墙的另一边。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068820_1_998b5930:
    # "Nobody had been found, but... she was there."
    "没有找到任何人，可是……她就在那里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068824_1_cf5dc964:
    # "I opened the door to the last partition."
    "我打开最后一个隔间的门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068830_1_126107f4:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068836_1_9a3fb7d2:
    # "It's been a while."
    "好久不见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068837_1_4084e408:
    # "...Yeah."
    "……嗯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068845_1_c69daf4d:
    # "She rose from the chair she'd been sitting in, but she looked worn out. Although I had just left the attic, for her, that had happened fifteen days in the past."
    "她从椅子上站起身，却显得疲惫不堪。我刚刚才离开阁楼，而对她来说，那已经是十五天前的事了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068849_1_732ddd85:
    # "D-Did everything work out?"
    "一……一切顺利吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068854_1_c0d8c88a:
    # "Before she could answer, we heard a noise.{w} It sounded like the elevator had opened."
    "她还没来得及回答，我们就听见了响动。{w}听起来像是电梯门开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068857_1_17606fc8:
    # "...ody's here! I... didn't pre—"
    "……有人来了！我……没想到——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068858_1_37af11d4:
    # "Has it been enough time already?"
    "时间已经到了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068859_1_3e79a8c2:
    # "...op the bleedi—"
    "……快把血止——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068860_1_622ee46c:
    # "I looked at Shiroya. We were back. It had really worked.{w} That was happening on the third floor, near the staircase. Our past selves had returned too, although they were unaware of it. Their voices hardly reached us, but I could understand them since I knew what they were saying."
    "我看向 Shiroya。我们回来了。真的成功了。{w}那声音来自三楼，就在楼梯附近。过去的我们也回来了，只是他们自己并不知道。他们的声音几乎传不到这里，但我听得懂——因为我知道他们在说什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068862_1_7b829925:
    # "...A-Ats—{w} ...not bleedi—"
    "……A-Ats——{w}……没在流——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068864_1_54a61b65:
    # "That's right. My past self was waiting outside the offices after traveling to the past. Right now, Shiroya's in the attic, and Sai's on the crystal floor."
    "没错。穿越到过去之后，过去的我就在办公室外等候。现在，Shiroya 在阁楼里，Sai 在水晶层。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068867_1_25f2ea96:
    # "What were you gonna say?"
    "你刚才想说什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068872_1_840eaa57:
    # "...Um, everything did go well, but...{w} I saw Miiya earlier. She came in here once, and I'm pretty sure she saw me.{w} She didn't say anything, though. I almost froze from the shock, but before I could react, she had already left."
    "……嗯，事情确实都顺利，只是……{w}我刚才见到 Miiya 了。她进来过一次，而且我敢肯定她看见我了。{w}不过她什么也没说。我吓得几乎僵住，还没等我反应过来，她就已经走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068873_1_5662cf78:
    # "R-Really?"
    "真……真的吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068874_1_4746f851:
    # "She nodded, still puzzled.{w} So, it really had been like that. It had happened as I'd imagined it.{w} I didn't get it. I'd known that she wouldn't be found thanks to the drawing under the drawer. Before seeing it, I hadn't come up with a reason to explain why Miiya hadn't found her, but at that point, I had realized that one wasn't needed. If she simply stayed there, she wouldn't be found. ...I still couldn't understand what had happened."
    "她点了点头，仍是一脸困惑。{w}原来，事情真的就是这样。一切正如我想象的那样发生了。{w}我不明白。多亏抽屉下面那张画，我早就知道她不会被找到。在看到它之前，我一直想不出理由解释 Miiya 为什么没找到她；可那一刻我明白，根本不需要什么理由。只要她就那样待在那里，就不会被找到。……可我还是不懂，到底发生了什么。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068878_1_c6370038:
    # "What about the you from the other world? Is she okay?"
    "另一个世界的你呢？她没事吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068883_1_a315bcf1:
    # "Yes. She wasn't found at the site of the explosion, but she wasn't harmed.{w} ...Why couldn't she be found?"
    "嗯。爆炸现场没有找到她，不过她没有受伤。{w}……为什么就是找不到她呢？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068884_1_498f6965:
    # "...To match the news report that I saw. I did travel to November too, before you did, but I failed to accomplish anything."
    "……为了和我在新闻里看到的报道对上。我也穿越到十一月去过，比你还早，可什么都没能做到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068885_1_aeabcc69:
    # "I know. I saw you at the motel. I thought about staying there in case someone found me in my apartment."
    "我知道。我在鹰旅馆看见你了。我还想过就待在那里，以防有人在公寓里找到我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068886_1_2053d8f7:
    # "You were there?{w} By the way, what keeps happening to your clothes? They're the ones you entered the tower with again, but you didn't have them when you went to the past."
    "你在那儿？{w}话说回来，你的衣服到底是怎么回事？又变回你进塔时穿的那身了，可你回到过去的时候穿的并不是这身。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068887_1_28a4b413:
    # "Oh, yeah. They're the ones from that world."
    "哦，对。这是那个世界的衣服。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068888_1_53d521d9:
    # "I see."
    "原来如此。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068889_1_4851c715:
    # "...Ah. That time, right before {time=21}, I did think that something about her looked strange. It was so late into the day that I didn't realize it was the complete lack of smoke on her clothes. ...And her pendant is gone too—the thing that tied her with Miiya disappeared when she went to the future."
    "……啊。那一次，就在 {time=21} 之前，我确实觉得她哪里有些不对劲。可当时天色已晚，我没意识到那是因为她衣服上一点烟味都没有。……还有她的吊坠也不见了——那个把她和 Miiya 联系在一起的东西，在她去往未来时消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068892_1_613a32e0:
    # "She took a digital watch out of her purse."
    "她从手提包里取出一块电子表。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068893_1_289bc4a2:
    # "You bought a watch? That's smart."
    "你买了一块手表？这主意不错。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068894_1_3661f27f:
    # "It's {time=19:37.}"
    "现在是 {time=19:37.}"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068896_1_55791666:
    # "Shiroya pointed out very faint footsteps coming from the other side of the wall. Although I hadn't noticed them, I knew she was right."
    "Shiroya 指出墙的另一侧有极其微弱的脚步声。我虽然没听见，却知道她说得没错。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068897_1_4532f442:
    # "That's us. Myself, Sai, and Erina. We're going to the attic."
    "是我们。我、Sai 和 Erina，正要去阁楼。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068898_1_a6f5f609:
    # "They went around the floor and disappeared up the next staircase."
    "他们绕过这一层，从下一处楼梯上去，随即不见踪影。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068903_1_6e072555:
    # "Now what, then? I don't know what happened at the end."
    "那接下来呢？最后发生了什么，我可不知道。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068904_1_47df90fd:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068905_1_3a0ebeca:
    # "Let's go down first. I need to do something very important."
    "先下楼吧。我还有件很重要的事要做。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068906_1_bc08aa72:
    # "Okay."
    "好。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068912_1_98ed8c5a:
    # "I had very little strength within me, and Shiroya looked dizzy when she moved. We took our time walking down, knowing full well that there was nobody left beneath us."
    "我浑身几乎使不上力气，Shiroya 走动时也一副眩晕的样子。我们慢慢地往楼下走，心里清楚底下已经没有人了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068919_1_5dbe7b4d:
    # "Let's go to the security room."
    "去监控室吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068925_1_e7be7ed3:
    # "Katei's dead body was there, filling the room with a stench I'd forgotten about. The monitors were working, which meant that someone had been there fifty minutes previously. Although it was slightly strange, I could barely bring myself to care."
    "Katei 的尸体还在那里，房间里弥漫着一股我早就忘掉的臭味。监视器还亮着，说明五十分钟前有人来过。这虽然有点奇怪，我却几乎没心思去在意。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068926_1_52b2a74d:
    # "Actually... I bet I know why. Only Sai could have used the computer, and not too long ago, he traveled to the past from the event room with Shiroya.{w} That would've disabled his watch, but the next time we saw him, it was working. Every time that happened, he came here to sync it with the computer's time. There was a drawer with a bunch of batteries."
    "其实……我想我知道原因。能用那台电脑的只有 Sai，而就在不久前，他还和 Shiroya 一起从活动室穿越回过去。{w}那会让他的手表失效，可我们下一次见到他时，手表又在走了。每次出现这种情况，他都会来这里，把手表与电脑的时间同步。这里有个抽屉，里面放着一堆电池。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068932_1_27d4f462:
    # "What's that?"
    "那是什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068933_1_e4382219:
    # "A USB drive I brought to the tower in the other world. I have enough to put Katei and Akaro in jail with the footage on this."
    "是我带到另一个世界那座塔里的 U 盘。里面的录像，足够把 Katei 和 Akaro 送进监狱。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068937_1_a814a47e:
    # "Once the computer detected it, I saved two copies of the file. The normal folder with the saved footage was nowhere to be found, so I left them elsewhere. If necessary, I would reveal the location to the police. Then, I left the drive behind one of the drawers so that it could also be found."
    "电脑识别出它之后，我把文件存了两份。原本存放录像的那个文件夹怎么也找不到了，我只好把副本存到别处。若有需要，我会把位置告诉警方。随后，我又把 U 盘塞在某个抽屉后面，好让它也能被人找到。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068940_1_59188881:
    # "By the way, you left the rusty key outside the storeroom, right? Was that so that it wouldn't open from the inside?"
    "对了，你把生锈的钥匙留在储藏室外面了吧？是为了防止门从里面被打开吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068945_1_95acd479:
    # "Yes."
    "嗯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068946_1_4ee08b68:
    # "That's what I thought. Not completely sure how much sense it makes yet, but there's nothing I can do to fight it.{w} I have the rusty key right here too, by the way, but there's a slight problem. I'll need it on January 5th, and since you gave up yours, you'll also need this one on December 30th."
    "我就知道。这其中的道理我还没完全弄明白，但也没法违逆。{w}顺便说一句，生锈的钥匙现在也在我手上，不过有个小问题。一月五日我需要用它，而你既然把自己的那把交了出去，十二月三十日你也得用这一把。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068947_1_189c4721:
    # "Oh, I guess so."
    "哦……好像是这样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068948_1_66e3a3c4:
    # "I looked under the desk. A Sekimeiya was there."
    "我朝桌子底下看去，那里放着一个 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068949_1_d5350cc3:
    # "This is the Past Sekimeiya. My past self traveled with it very recently in the staff room, and Sai brought it here. It doesn't have a lot of power right now."
    "这是过去Sekimeiya。不久之前，过去的我刚在员工室里用它穿越，后来是 Sai 把它带到了这里。它现在的能量不多了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068956_1_517488be:
    # "I left the rusty key on the floor of hallway A and closed the door."
    "我把生锈的钥匙放在 A走廊的地上，随后关上了门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068964_1_72d1cf43:
    # "We need to duplicate it. Otherwise, we won't be able to have it on those days."
    "我们得把它复制一份。否则那两个日子我们就拿不出钥匙了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068969_1_f8de1e15:
    # "...{w}She didn't seem to know why that was the case."
    "……{w}她似乎并不明白为什么会这样。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068970_1_c974b0a6:
    # "I'll go a very short distance back in time one last time. Since I left the key outside this room, my past self will be able to grab it and have it in the future. But since that will let me appear with it, I won't have to really grab it, which will duplicate it."
    "我会最后一次回到极近的过去。我把钥匙留在了这间房门外，过去的我便能捡到它，带到未来去。但这样一来，我出现时手里就会带着钥匙，不必真的去捡——于是钥匙就复制成了两把。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068971_1_abfb1c03:
    # "Will that actually work?"
    "这样真的行得通？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068972_1_d1dfb690:
    # "Yes.{w} As soon as I leave, open the door."
    "行。{w} 我一走，你就开门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068973_1_ae275995:
    # "...All right."
    "……好吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068978_1_1229b1ed:
    # "I stepped back and touched the Sekimeiya."
    "我后退一步，伸手碰了碰 Sekimeiya。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068986_1_1a789f7a:
    # "The light went out, but I knew where I was before I looked around me."
    "光消失了，可我还没环顾四周，就已知道自己身在何处。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068990_1_7832c32b:
    # "The mechanical room."
    "机械室。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068991_1_885be51a:
    # "I confirmed that the rusty key was in my pocket."
    "我确认生锈的钥匙就在口袋里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L068996_1_93f1e12c:
    # "When I went to hallway A, I saw it on the floor too."
    "我走到 A走廊，也看见它躺在地上。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069003_1_eda31330:
    # "I didn't have to wait very long until the security room opened."
    "没过多久，监控室的门就开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069004_1_e06f05c0:
    # "There we go, now we have two. Take this one."
    "成了，现在有两把了。这把给你。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069010_1_4ed87217:
    # "The movements of the rusty key were interesting. Shiroya had found it on January 5th, in our world. Then, she had traveled to December 15th and had still been holding it. Later, she had traveled to November 30th and had still been holding it. However, she'd used it to lock the storeroom from outside in the other world, which meant it couldn't be recovered."
    "这把生锈钥匙的流转经历很有意思。一月五日，Shiroya 在我们的世界里发现了它。之后她穿越到十二月十五日，钥匙仍在她手上；再后来她又穿越到十一月三十日，钥匙也依旧在手。可是在另一个世界，她用这把钥匙从外面锁上了储藏室，这意味着它再也取不回来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069011_1_a66af1b8:
    # "When we had talked, she had told me about its location, so I'd been able to find it in the other world's security room as well. That was the key we had just duplicated."
    "我们谈过之后，她告诉了我钥匙的位置，所以我也能在另一个世界的监控室里找到它。那正是我们刚刚复制出来的钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069012_1_fa33d15c:
    # "However, it was the one she ended up with, and it was the one she would have on January 26th. As a result, when she had appeared on the 15th, she hadn't been holding the same key she'd found. The fact that she'd had to leave it outside the storeroom had made it transform."
    "然而，最终落到她手里的是这一把，一月二十六日她手上的也是这一把。所以，当她出现在十五日时，她拿的已经不再是她当初发现的那把钥匙了。她不得不把钥匙留在储藏室外，正是这件事让钥匙发生了变化。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069013_1_b19cebce:
    # "What she'd appeared with had been a mesh of both. To obtain that key, both had been needed, and in a single instant, it had changed from the key of our world to the key of the other world."
    "她现身时带着的那把，是两者交织而成的。要得到那把钥匙，两把都不可或缺；就在一瞬间，它从我们世界的钥匙，变成了另一个世界的钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069023_1_b403248b:
    # "The powered-off Sekimeiya was on the floor, so I put it back where I'd found it; there was no reason to do otherwise."
    "断电的 Sekimeiya 就放在地上，我把它放回原处——反正也没有理由不这么做。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069024_1_c88d4fcb:
    # "We need to go to the mechanical room. The others will come back soon."
    "我们得去机械室。其他人很快就要回来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069037_1_6770d0b2:
    # "It's {time=19:45.} I'll travel to the past soon.{w} ...Sorry, to the future."
    "现在是 {time=19:45.} 我很快就要穿越到过去了。{w} ……抱歉，是未来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069038_1_d44afb9c:
    # "Yeah. They must be coming down already."
    "嗯。他们多半已经在往下走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069039_1_fe94ac5b:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069041_1_8b9a962a:
    # "So, you stayed at Eagle Motel too?"
    "这么说，你也住在鹰旅馆？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069046_1_062b4639:
    # "Yes. I was there until today. I didn't realize the owner wasn't a native."
    "是的，我一直住到今天。我都没发觉老板不是本地人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069051_1_9173db43:
    # "We heard people above us. The group was beginning their wait near the shutter."
    "我们听见头顶传来人声。那一群人开始在卷帘门附近等候。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069052_1_61390cfb:
    # "Will it be fine if we stay here?"
    "我们待在这里没问题吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069053_1_db7a9d8f:
    # "...Hm... Not quite.{w} Once you leave for the bathroom, they'll search everywhere for you."
    "……唔……不太行。{w} 你一去洗手间，他们就会四处找你。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069058_1_385d1e90:
    # "Wait, are they going to see us? They can't, right?"
    "等等，他们会不会看到我们？不会吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069059_1_7dfe3360:
    # "No. If my past self saw me, that'd be a paradox.{w} But there's no simple way out of this. The Future Sekimeiya will be powered off and Sai will stay next to it when it repowers, and the Past Sekimeiya will send us too far to hide us since it'll build up energy until your past self leaves. I doubt touching it twice would work due to the powered-off time."
    "不会。如果过去的我看到我，就会形成悖论。{w}但这事没那么容易解决。未来Sekimeiya 会处于断电状态，等它重新通电时，Sai 会守在旁边；过去Sekimeiya 则会一直蓄能，直到过去的你离开，再把我们送到太远的地方，根本没法藏身。考虑到它断电的那段时间，再碰一次恐怕行不通。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069060_1_0f6341a9:
    # "It was a very similar dilemma to the one I'd faced when searching the drawers for a marking. However, the answer was much clearer."
    "这和我翻找抽屉寻找标记时面临的困境十分相似。只是这一次，答案清楚得多。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069065_1_5bb5679b:
    # "Ah, I need to be found, then. If they find me, the search will stop before they realize you're here."
    "啊，那我就得让他们找到。只要他们找到我，搜索就会停下，他们也就不会发现你在这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069066_1_088d5880:
    # "I nodded in the darkness."
    "我在黑暗中点了点头。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069067_1_bba7181d:
    # "That's what you said, right? That I was still here even after I'd traveled from the bathroom."
    "你是这么说的吧？就算我从浴室穿越走了，我也还是会留在这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069068_1_5c102198:
    # "Yeah."
    "嗯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069074_1_16e95edb:
    # "But what about at {time=21}? The shutter won't move, will it?"
    "可 {time=21} 的时候呢？卷帘门不会动，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069075_1_b90f6048:
    # "No, it will."
    "不，它会动。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069080_1_5a8f9f1c:
    # "What? Didn't you say that the recording was real?"
    "什么？你不是说那段录音是真的吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069081_1_6504c683:
    # "Yes, but before the exit opened, we went to the future. We appeared on January 5th, where the recording occurred.{w} So, if you're out of that range, you'll stay here and be able to leave."
    "是，但在出口打开之前，我们去了未来。我们出现在 1 月 5 日，录音就是那天留下的。{w}所以，只要你不在那个范围里，就会留在这里，也就能离开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069086_1_ab889805:
    # "Oh... that's what happened.{w} Where will the range be?"
    "哦……原来是这么回事。{w}那范围会在哪里？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069087_1_1582e2d2:
    # "Here. Just before {time=21:05}, Erina is going to activate it. The Future Sekimeiya has yet to be brought here.{w} It won't be a normal travel, though. When she touches it, she'll trigger a chain reaction that will bring us to January 5th. We'll go twenty minutes to the future repeatedly. Akaro will appear a bit later because he traveled directly from today to January 5th after escaping from the bedroom with Sai."
    "就在这里。就在 {time=21:05} 之前，Erina 会启动它。那时未来Sekimeiya 还没被带到这里。{w}不过，那不会是一次普通的穿越。她一碰它，就会引发连锁反应，把我们带到 1 月 5 日。我们会一次又一次地向未来跳二十分钟。Akaro 会稍晚出现，因为他是和 Sai 一起逃出卧室后，直接从今天穿越到了 1 月 5 日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069091_1_62e25f78:
    # "W-Wait, a chain reaction...? Do we just have to avoid being here when that happens?"
    "等、等等，连锁反应……？我们只要在它发生的时候别待在这里就行了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069092_1_daf7084b:
    # "...{w}Not being here twenty minutes before it's activated would also avoid it.{w} It won't be so simple, though...{w} Only you will be able to do that."
    "……{w}只要在它启动前二十分钟不待在这里，就能避开。{w}不过没那么简单……{w}能做到这一点的，只有你。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069097_1_92321635:
    # "Hm? ...Wh-Why?"
    "嗯？……为、为什么？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069098_1_da982153:
    # "The people above us will search for you soon. They'll find you, and then the shutter will open. You can leave this place.{w} I can't do that, though. There's something very important that still has to happen.{w} On January 5th, I'll have to be in the tower in order to appear on November 24th with the Sekimeiya. If I stay here, I'll travel to the future one more time. That's when I'll finally be able to leave."
    "楼上那些人很快就会来找你。他们会找到你，然后卷帘门就会打开。你就能离开这里。{w}可我不行。还有一件非常重要的事必须发生。{w}1 月 5 日，我必须待在塔里，才能在 11 月 24 日带着 Sekimeiya 出现。如果我留在这里，就会再向未来穿越一次。到那时，我才能真正离开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069101_1_74e3f657:
    # "Can't you just enter through the storeroom on the 5th?"
    "你 5 日直接从储藏室进去不就行了吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069102_1_27a7ea47:
    # "No... there are a few reasons why I can't.{w} The 5th is 21 days away. It's possible that getting out today will prevent me from being in the tower in the future.{w} I don't know what the police will do. If they find any evidence that incriminates me, being here on the 5th might not be possible. I'm sure my parents will keep trying to make me leave with them too. ...Staying here is the only way to guarantee it, and it's what I thought I'd do before I touched the Sekimeiya."
    "不行……有几个原因。{w}距离 5 日还有 21 天。今天出去的话，我之后可能就没法待在塔里了。{w}我不知道警方会怎么做。如果他们找到任何对我不利的证据，5 日那天也许就没法待在这里了。我父母肯定也会一直想办法让我跟他们走。……留在这里是唯一能保证的办法，也是我在碰 Sekimeiya 之前就打算做的事。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069103_1_e315eea1:
    # "Technically, I knew I'd be in Yushibana on January 26th, but my parents had spent the previous two weeks telling me to go live with them. I feared they would give me no option after what had happened in the tower and force me to leave town until after January 5th."
    "严格来说，我知道自己 1 月 26 日会在丰花，但过去两周里，父母一直在劝我去他们那里住。我担心塔里发生的事会让他们不再给我选择，逼我离开这座小镇，直到 1 月 5 日以后。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069106_1_e4664be0:
    # "There are more reasons too. If both of us leave, the attic key will be taken from us, and we need it on the 26th. Leaving it somewhere until the 5th is risky, so I can just bring it there myself."
    "还有别的原因。如果我们两个都离开，阁楼的钥匙就会被收走，而 26 日我们需要它。把它放在别处留到 5 日太冒险，所以我可以自己把它带过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069107_1_fff7f672:
    # "...You're right. When I traveled to the 15th, I had the attic key, but the cabinet key was the only one that wasn't in my purse. I still don't get that."
    "……你说得对。我穿越到 15 日时，身上有阁楼钥匙，但唯一不在我包里的就是展示柜钥匙。我到现在也不明白。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069108_1_c56de498:
    # "The cabinet key? If the police found you with it, they would take it, so the only way to get it to the 26th would be by doing the same thing as with the attic's.{w} Did you ever need to unlock the cabinet?"
    "展示柜钥匙？如果警方发现你带着它，就会收走。要把它带到 26 日，唯一的办法就是像阁楼钥匙那样处理。{w}你之前有需要打开展示柜的时候吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069113_1_698be693:
    # "...No. I don't think so."
    "……没有。应该没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069114_1_892d56ec:
    # "I see. That's why, then. There's no reason to bring it to the 26th, so you didn't appear with it."
    "原来如此。那就说得通了。既然没有理由把它带到 26 日，你出现时也就没带着它。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069120_1_ae1f62b8:
    # "Wait, so can't I do the same? We can both travel to the 5th."
    "等等，那我不也能这么做吗？我们都可以穿越到 5 日。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069121_1_7f2929d9:
    # "That's not true. On November 30th, you appeared outside the gem shop, right?"
    "不对。11 月 30 日，你出现在了宝石店外，对吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069122_1_b6785669:
    # "...Yes."
    "……对。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069123_1_6884bc87:
    # "So, on December 30th, you'll be out of the tower. That's why you can't stay here."
    "所以，12 月 30 日你会在塔外。正因如此，你不能留在这里。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069128_1_46b93b8a:
    # "I... see."
    "我……明白了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069129_1_0f2d1dbf:
    # "It'll be fine. I'll just take a little longer."
    "没事的。我不过是多花一点时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069134_1_1978ed62:
    # "Yeah."
    "嗯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069135_1_e9a1cd75:
    # "You can stay at my house too. At least you'll be with Maxi and Umi.{w} You were on January 5th once already, right? Was the tower not open?"
    "你也可以住在我家。至少还有 Maxi 和 Umi 陪着你。{w}你已经去过一次 1 月 5 日，对吧？那时塔没有开放吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069140_1_06a82e18:
    # "N-No. I don't know why, but it seems it won't open again after today."
    "没、没有。我不知道为什么，但塔似乎今天之后就不会再开了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069141_1_717d4def:
    # "...Yeah, that's what I thought."
    "……嗯，我也这么想。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069148_1_238ac7c5:
    # "There was a mountain of things I wanted to tell her, but we went silent for a while. Both of us were even more tired than we appeared, and we had to speak very quietly."
    "我有千言万语想对她说，但我们沉默了一阵。我们两个都比看上去更疲惫，而且说话必须压低声音。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069149_1_8fdfc742:
    # "Everything we'd gone through since we'd stepped into the tower was like an endless expanse of tangled web. I could hardly even recall what things had been like before I knew what the Sekimeiya were capable of."
    "自踏入塔以来经历的一切，就像一张无边无际、纠缠不清的网。我甚至快要记不起，在知道 Sekimeiya 能做到什么之前，日子是什么样子了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069150_1_278146f4:
    # "But we had taken that day to its conclusion. Without any doubt, we were going to make it end."
    "但我们把这一天熬到了最后。毫无疑问，我们会让这一切结束。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069151_1_7a61a95f:
    # "People had died in horrible ways. I didn't expect that the outside world would ever learn the full truth of what had happened within the tower, but at the very least, Shiroya and I knew. We had built a better reality out there through our own actions."
    "有人以惨烈的方式死去。我并不指望外界会知道塔里发生之事的全部真相，但至少 Shiroya 和我清楚。我们用自己的行动，在外面构筑了一个更好的现实。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069152_1_e8e0254a:
    # "Surprisingly, I wasn't sad that the world where we had saved Miiya wasn't our own. Ours wasn't perfect, and I had no idea what awaited us in the future... but all I wanted was to step outside with Shiroya."
    "意外的是，我们救下 Miiya 的那个世界并不是我们自己的世界，我却并不为此难过。我们的世界并不完美，我也不知道未来有什么在等着我们……但我只想和 Shiroya 一起走出去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069159_1_1adf8c30:
    # "They'll leave soon. There's only forty minutes left."
    "他们快走了。只剩四十分钟了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069160_1_750d8b40:
    # "Yeah. They'll go to the attic and come back down.{w} By the way, can I borrow your watch? It'll be useful to have it."
    "嗯。他们会去阁楼，然后再下来。{w}对了，能借你的手表用用吗？带着会方便些。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069161_1_fc9f4c08:
    # "Take it."
    "拿去吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069162_1_84aaefed:
    # "Thanks."
    "谢谢。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069164_1_4f93e971:
    # "Our wait was short. When the time came, we heard the group walking to the hallway."
    "我们没等多久。时间一到，就听见那群人朝走廊走去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069167_1_99ae87a4:
    # "...I guess I'll go."
    "……那我走了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069168_1_255f4398:
    # "All right. I'll see you soon."
    "好。回头见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069169_1_0413b7fc:
    # "Are you going to stay here? You won't be seen?"
    "你要留在这里？不会被看到吗？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069170_1_1600aee1:
    # "I'm sure I'll be fine."
    "放心，我不会有事的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069171_1_023a49dc:
    # "Okay."
    "好。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069176_1_7c204509:
    # "I'll see you."
    "回头见。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069181_1_3006bfd4:
    # "Her shadowy figure slowly faded up the stairs.{w} I recalled the time we'd found her drowsy in room A1 and the words she'd told me in hallway C... They were words I'd hated before, but they had grown to bring me happiness."
    "她的身影渐渐隐没在楼梯上。{w}我想起我们在 A1 房间发现她昏昏欲睡时的情形，还有她在 C走廊对我说过的那番话……那些话我从前很讨厌，后来却渐渐给我带来了幸福。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069188_1_a34e231b:
    # "The next time I heard sounds above me, she was already with them."
    "等我再次听见楼上的动静时，她已经和他们在一起了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069190_1_26fbd44d:
    # "I stayed behind the piled furniture in the corner of the room. Like I'd expected, a single person came down soon after."
    "我躲在房间角落那堆家具后面。果然，没过多久就有一个人走了下来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069191_1_70945b12:
    # "I couldn't see who they were, but it had to be Sai. He seemed to be looking around in the dark.{w} I feared he would find me until his movements slowed down. He kneeled under a table and stopped."
    "我看不清来人的脸，但一定是 Sai。他似乎正在黑暗里四下摸索。{w}我生怕他发现我，直到他的动作慢了下来。他在一张桌子下面跪了下来，停住不动了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069192_1_001cf8cc:
    # "I bet he's looking for a good place to hide the Sekimeiya. Did he find one under that table?"
    "他这是在给 Sekimeiya 找个合适的藏处吧。难道他看中的是那张桌子底下？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069193_1_bfecce52:
    # "I was doing my best to conceal my breathing, but he remained there for a long time. Finally, he seemed to decide he was done and walked up the stairs."
    "我极力屏住呼吸，他却在那边待了很久。最后，他似乎觉得已经弄好了，便走上楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069194_1_d491a115:
    # "I hardly had time to exhale before he was back. There was a glaring difference—the area between his hands was glowing.{w} Once more, he kneeled under the table and ran back up the stairs as soon as he was finished."
    "我还没来得及松口气，他就回来了。这次有明显不同——他两手之间正发着光。{w}他又一次在桌下跪下，刚弄完就立刻跑上了楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069195_1_096ca2f1:
    # "The Sekimeiya wasn't simply on the floor. From what I could see, he had tucked it just under the surface of the table—there seemed to be a tiny space where he'd left it."
    "Sekimeiya 并不是就那样放在地板上。就我所见，他把它塞进了桌面下方——那里似乎有个很小的空隙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069196_1_5aeb3f6b:
    # "...{w}Now, my past self will find the Past Sekimeiya in the security room, and we'll all wait out the last few minutes in the lobby."
    "……{w}接下来，过去的我会在监控室找到过去Sekimeiya，然后我们所有人就在大厅里熬过最后这几分钟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069200_1_c0a84eac:
    # "I stared at the glowing numbers on the watch until {time=21:01} came. At that point, someone began to carefully descend the stairs."
    "我一直盯着表上发光的数字，直到 {time=21:01} 来临。就在这时，有人小心翼翼地走下楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069201_1_ad990213:
    # "While I couldn't see their face, I knew it was Erina. She stood still until something caught her eye."
    "虽然看不清脸，但我知道那是 Erina。她站在原地不动，直到某样东西吸引了她的目光。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069202_1_39e45ba0:
    # "Perhaps Sai thought he had found a good hiding spot, but he hadn't factored in the mechanical room's darkness. The faint illumination gave it away after Erina looked around a little."
    "也许 Sai 以为自己找到了个好藏处，却没料到机械室会这么暗。Erina 四下张望了一会儿，那点微光便暴露了它的位置。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069204_1_11573524:
    # "She approached it and crouched. Her figure covered the light, and suddenly, it was gone."
    "她走近，蹲下身。她的身影挡住了光，那光便忽然消失了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069210_1_8b38d3bd:
    # "Wh—"
    "什——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069211_1_171d684b:
    # "However, Erina was still there. Her outline had disappeared because the light had moved.{w} The faint ceiling light had turned off, and the Sekimeiya's glow couldn't be seen."
    "然而，Erina 还留在原处。消失的是她的轮廓，因为光源移开了。{w}天花板上那盏微弱的灯熄灭了，Sekimeiya 的光也看不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069213_1_f693f8ab:
    # "I hadn't felt anything myself, but I knew. I was on January 5th of 2012. Since I'd been in the mechanical room during both recurring locations, I had traveled seamlessly, and as my vision was more adjusted to the darkness, I could make out that a few pieces of furniture had moved slightly."
    "我自己什么都没感觉到，但我知道。我来到了 2012 年 1 月 5 日。两次循环我都待在机械室，所以穿越毫无痕迹；而我的眼睛更适应黑暗，能分辨出有几件家具挪动了一点点。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069214_1_cc424b92:
    # "Oblivious, Erina crawled out. To her, the Sekimeiya had simply disappeared. Then, she walked to the stairs, likely thinking she had traveled to the past."
    "Erina 浑然不觉，从桌下爬了出来。在她看来，Sekimeiya 只是凭空消失了。随后她走向楼梯，大概是以为自己已经回到了过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069215_1_1a554998:
    # "...It's still there; the Sekimeiya's on the floor. It rolled up to the wall."
    "……它还在。Sekimeiya 就在地板上，滚到墙边去了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069217_1_1eb634b0:
    # "Hey! What's going on!?"
    "喂！怎么回事！？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069218_1_d4fc10b3:
    # "That time, when the door to the lobby opened, light didn't fill the stairs—the whole building was devoid of it."
    "那一次，大厅的门打开时，楼梯上并没有照进光——整栋楼里一点光都没有。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069222_1_82df40d3:
    # "The watch still showed {time=21:03}, but that was far from the real time. I could hear the others shouting above me. The shutter wasn't opening."
    "表上仍显示 {time=21:03}，可那离真正的时间还差得远。我能听见头顶上其他人在喊。卷帘门没有打开。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069223_1_fc28dcac:
    # "I can't get out yet. I'll need to have both Sekimeiya after the watch shows {time=22:30.}"
    "我还出不去。得等到表上的时间过了 {time=22:30.}，并且两个 Sekimeiya 都到手才行。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069228_1_5ee256a2:
    # "I was forcing Shiroya to wait, but I had to stay there for a little while longer.{w} When {time=21:50} came, I approached the stairs."
    "我让 Shiroya 干等着，自己却还得在那里多待一会儿。{w}等到 {time=21:50}，我走向楼梯。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069229_1_37efc3dc:
    # "At that time, my past self had traveled to the past. The others were soon to notice my absence."
    "那个时候，过去的我已经回到过去了。其他人很快就会发现我不见了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069233_1_08027479:
    # "I grabbed the Future Sekimeiya and stepped up the stairs. I could no longer see the walls of the lobby, but unfortunately, I knew I'd have to see them once more in the future."
    "我拿起未来Sekimeiya，登上楼梯。大厅的墙壁已经看不见了，可惜我知道，将来我还得再看它们一次。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069234_1_3ee47dad:
    # "I couldn't shake off the anticipation of stepping out. Even though I'd already left once before, it didn't feel like it."
    "我按捺不住即将走出去的那份期待。明明之前已经走出去过一次，感觉上却完全不像。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069238_1_fc433d3a:
    # "I walked to the crystal room the past me had traveled from, B5. After feeling the floor, I realized that the powered-off Past Sekimeiya was there.{w} For the time being, I went to the crystal room at my right and put both inside a temperature regulation cabinet, setting it to where I believed 0 °C was. It seemed the curtains were all still raised."
    "我走向过去的我穿越离开的那间水晶展室 B5。伸手一探地板，便发现断电的过去Sekimeiya就在那儿。{w}我暂且走进右边那间水晶展室，把两个都放进带温控的展示柜，把温度调到我估计是 0 °C 的位置。看来所有遮布都仍然卷着。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069244_1_85bf08d9:
    # "I could've gone to the attic, but the last thing I wanted was to have to explain myself to anyone. ...My sole desire was for the final few minutes to elapse."
    "我本可以去阁楼，但我最不愿的就是向任何人解释。……我唯一的愿望，就是让最后这几分钟赶快过去。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069250_1_4de2cdba:
    # "I walked to the lobby. I could feel the shutter with my hands."
    "我走到大厅，伸手摸到了卷帘门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069251_1_7696c785:
    # "I'd waited patiently all day, but I couldn't take it anymore. I needed time to move faster. The goal was right there, and I was the only person who knew."
    "我一整天都在耐心等待，如今却再也熬不住了。我只盼时间能走得快些。目标就在眼前，而知道这一切的只有我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069252_1_f01fef7d:
    # "...Minutes after I had started staring at Shiroya's watch, I heard voices in the far hallway."
    "……我盯着 Shiroya 的表看了几分钟，听见远处走廊里传来说话声。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069253_1_46165ee6:
    # "...tsuki! Where the fuck—"
    "……tsuki！你他妈到底在——"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069256_1_c60f1095:
    # "..."
    "……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069257_1_46877426:
    # "I kept looking down. It was already past {time=22.}"
    "我一直低着头。时间已经过了 {time=22.}"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069261_1_bbe2e9fe:
    # "Wait... are they actually searching for me?"
    "等等……他们真的在找我？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069262_1_608edc7a:
    # "Sai's yells got closer and closer. It seemed he was looking in every room."
    "Sai 的喊声越来越近。看来他在一间间地找。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069266_1_97a70bbe:
    # "This piece of shit! The Sekimeiya's not in the cabinet!"
    "这混蛋！展示柜里没有 Sekimeiya！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069267_1_50c9f1e0:
    # "Fuck. There's no way he'll find them, right?"
    "妈的。他总不至于真找到吧？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069269_1_6f3e8f99:
    # "Look! I found the Sekimeiya!"
    "看！我找到 Sekimeiya 了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069273_1_e7288c91:
    # "What?{w} No. That's the third one."
    "什么？{w}不对。那是第三个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069274_1_e7736405:
    # "He had found it in another room in hallway B. He had plenty of energy to spare, as I heard him running to the event room and leaving it there. Fortunately, that caused him not to find the real ones."
    "他是在 B走廊的另一间房里找到的。他精力旺盛得很，我听见他一路跑到活动室，把那东西留在那里。也正因如此，他才没能找到真正的那两个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069279_1_2552d320:
    # "Atsuki! I know you're here!"
    "Atsuki！我知道你在这儿！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069280_1_57300e94:
    # "I didn't move. The darkness was all I needed to stay hidden."
    "我一动不动。只要藏在黑暗里，我就不会暴露。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069284_1_7b432ff6:
    # "He went to the mechanical room. Maybe he noticed the Sekimeiya he'd hidden was no longer there, but he didn't say anything. Afterward, he walked back with the others.{w} Akaro was there. Hopefully, the recording of him had been obtained by the police.{w} Erina and Isla were the last two. Their stories had been tragic in different ways. They were together again, but it was possible that Erina would never understand that the Isla she'd entered the tower with was gone."
    "他去了机械室。也许他发现自己藏起来的 Sekimeiya 不见了，可他什么也没说。之后，他和其他人一起走了回去。{w}Akaro 也在。但愿警方已经拿到了录有他的那段录音。{w}最后两个是 Erina 和 Isla。她们两人的遭遇都很悲惨，只是方式不同。她们又在一起了，但 Erina 也许永远无法明白，当初和她一起走进这座塔的那个 Isla 已经不在了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069285_1_fa2018ee:
    # "What is going to happen with them? The police must've found her corpse, but now they'll see that she's still alive. ...I suppose the case is similar with Naomi."
    "她们会怎么样呢？警方肯定已经找到了她的尸体，如今却又会看到她活生生地站在那里。……Naomi 的情况大概也一样吧。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069290_1_d4138271:
    # "I felt their voices fading. They were going back up."
    "我听着他们的声音渐渐远去。他们回楼上去了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069291_1_84f5611c:
    # "Now that I think about it, it was when I traveled to {time=21:00} that my hand injury disappeared. Even though I only went 45 minutes to the past, it took me many days to reach the proportional future."
    "说起来，我的手伤是在我穿越到 {time=21:00} 的时候消失的。虽然我只回到了 45 分钟前，可要到达对应的未来时间点，却花了我好几天。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069292_1_26e34058:
    # "Right now, I have Shiroya's watch and the rusty key. When I was briefly at {time=21:00}, I might not have realized that. However, after Shiroya made me travel to the 15th, there's no way I had them.{w} I suppose that makes sense since that location was based on a point much farther into the future. That's still a little strange, though, because Shiroya did have the rusty key."
    "现在，我手里有 Shiroya 的表和生锈的钥匙。我短暂停留在 {time=21:00} 的时候，也许还没意识到这一点。可是，在 Shiroya 让我穿越到 15 日之后，我绝不可能带着这两样东西。{w}想想也合理，毕竟那个位置对应的，是未来更远处的一个时间点。不过还是有点奇怪——毕竟当时 Shiroya 确实拿着生锈的钥匙。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069293_1_3ab31361:
    # "I stopped myself there. I really didn't care anymore. No matter how many details had flown far over my head, I didn't care about any of them."
    "想到这里，我打住了。我真的已经不在乎了。不管有多少细节让我摸不着头脑，我都无所谓了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069294_1_90d4ae86:
    # "I stood there for what seemed like hours, but eventually, {time=22:30} came."
    "我在原地站着，仿佛过了好几个小时，{time=22:30}终究还是到了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069298_1_f9b4f815:
    # "I tried to force myself to breathe properly. It wasn't over yet."
    "我强迫自己调整呼吸。事情还没有结束。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069299_1_affa882c:
    # "In the staff room, there was a keyring that I needed and I could obtain. I already had it in my pocket, though."
    "员工室里有一串我需要的钥匙，我也拿得到。可它其实早已在我口袋里了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069300_1_7cd2f8d1:
    # "...I forgot that I need to go to the attic. I thought I'd never see that place again."
    "……我忘了自己还得去一趟阁楼。我还以为，再也不会见到那个地方了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069301_1_f4c8d449:
    # "When I'd thought up the loop to appear on November 24th, I'd imagined appearing with the Sekimeiya in a suitcase. The one in the security room was locked away, so I had to get the one on the attic's sofa."
    "当初构思出这个让我在11月24日现身的循环时，我想象的是自己带着装在行李箱里的 Sekimeiya 出现。监控室里的那个被锁着，所以我只能去拿阁楼沙发上的那个。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069305_1_24a7dea7:
    # "I left the watch behind so that it wouldn't cast any light and gradually ascended. Every floor was dark, and my steps echoed more loudly than I liked."
    "我把手表留在原处，免得它透出光亮，然后慢慢往上走。每一层都一片漆黑，脚步声回荡得比我希望的要响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069309_1_24cf5e35:
    # "Once I reached the highest door, I saw that the living room was empty."
    "走到最上面那扇门时，我看见客厅里空无一人。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069310_1_b791b016:
    # "I was leaving my footprints behind, but it didn't matter. Once I'd taken the suitcase, I dashed back, leaving that place for good."
    "身后留下了一串脚印，但也无所谓了。拿到行李箱后，我便一路奔回，永远离开了那个地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069317_1_4b58f209:
    # "I took both Sekimeiya from the cold of the cabinet with my bare hands. The instant I activated them, I traveled the smallest fraction of time. Enough for it to have no real effect."
    "我赤手从冰凉的展示柜里取出两个 Sekimeiya。启动它们的瞬间，我穿越了极短的一段时间——短到不会产生任何实际影响。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069321_1_6e3d358e:
    # "With the suitcase in hand, I descended to the lobby and sat on the floor. Then, I put the Sekimeiya inside it and placed both of my hands on them.{w} I suddenly realized a key had fallen from my pocket before I'd even taken it out willingly..."
    "我提着行李箱下到大厅，坐在地上。随后把两个 Sekimeiya 放进去，双手按在它们上面。{w}我这才猛然发觉，一把钥匙从我口袋里掉了出来——我甚至还没主动掏过它……"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069323_1_042b256e:
    # "...That had been my plan before I'd gone to the 24th. I'd wanted to appear with the Sekimeiya, but for that, they had to be powered off in the future. It was very hard to calculate the exact second I needed to have them, so the position I was in was a good way to cover a longer stretch of time."
    "……那是我去24日之前的计划。我本想带着 Sekimeiya 一起出现，可要做到这一点，它们必须先在未来被关掉。要精确算出我需要在哪一秒拿到它们实在太难，所以我所在的位置正好能覆盖更长的一段时间。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069324_1_e0be8516:
    # "Every time a Sekimeiya powered on, my hands would immediately power it off, resulting in no effect whatsoever. Furthermore, they emitted no light, so nobody could see me in the dark."
    "每当一个 Sekimeiya 启动，我的手就会立刻把它关掉，因此没有产生任何效果。而且它们不会发光，黑暗中谁也看不见我。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069330_1_64c1cfad:
    # "However, I had calculated enough... I only had to be there for ten more minutes."
    "不过，该算的我都算好了……只需再在那里待上十分钟。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069331_1_29da04ba:
    # "They were the last ten minutes I'd spend trapped in that place. The suitcase was on my lap, and both of my hands were planted firmly on the Sekimeiya's surfaces, too far apart to overlap their minuscule ranges.{w} ...It was the end. I knew I was in the position where I'd appeared on the 24th."
    "那是我被困在那个地方的最后十分钟。行李箱搁在腿上，双手牢牢按在 Sekimeiya 的表面，彼此相距太远，无法让它们那微小的范围重叠。{w}……结束了。我知道自己所在的位置，正是24日我出现的地方。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069332_1_c05333de:
    # "I couldn't check the time anymore; the watch was hidden behind the reception desk. Instead, I counted the seconds inside my head."
    "我已经没法再看时间了，手表藏在接待台后面。只能在心里数着秒。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069336_1_d85886e8:
    # "...She's there right now. I'm sure."
    "……她此刻就在那里。我确定。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069337_1_654e589d:
    # "Time had passed. It hadn't frozen—it hadn't forbidden me from taking the final step."
    "时间已经过去了。它没有冻结——也没有阻止我迈出最后一步。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069341_1_559945ce:
    # "I closed the suitcase and stood up, grabbing the fallen key. Before anything else, I went to retrieve Shiroya's watch."
    "我合上行李箱站起身，捡起掉落的那把钥匙。别的先不管，我先去把 Shiroya 的手表取了回来。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069345_1_2b1f6d5f:
    # "I opened the hallway A door. Each step I took toward the storeroom was more surreal than the last. I took out the rusty key and suddenly understood why I wouldn't have it on the 26th."
    "我推开A走廊的门。每向储藏室走近一步，都比前一步更像在梦里。我掏出那把生锈的钥匙，忽然明白为什么26日我身上不会有它了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069349_1_f062dedd:
    # "I was there; I could feel the dusty couch, and the wall wasn't blocking my way."
    "我到了那里。我摸得到那张落满灰尘的沙发，墙也没有挡住我的去路。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069350_1_5e8cabd6:
    # "With bated breath, I approached the final door—the one that could only be opened from the outside."
    "我屏住呼吸，走向最后那扇门——那扇只能从外面打开的门。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069355_1_ab6a218c:
    # "...And it was open."
    "……而门是开着的。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069413_1_0212a9cf:
    # "Atsuki, you son of a bitch! Open the fucking door!"
    "Atsuki，你这混蛋！把这该死的门打开！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069414_1_2ba4e7be:
    # "I know you just left! I heard you talking with Shiroya! You better come back right now!"
    "我知道你刚走！我听见你和 Shiroya 说话了！你最好现在就给我回来！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069417_1_503ed21f:
    # "Atsuki! Piece of shit!"
    "Atsuki！你个王八蛋！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069418_1_9c1bf976:
    # "I'll convince everyone this was all your doing if you don't open this fucking door!"
    "你要是不把这该死的门打开，我就让所有人都相信这一切是你干的！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069421_1_1fff7028:
    # "At least tell the police we're here! I'm fucking hungry, man!"
    "至少告诉警察我们在这儿啊！我他妈快饿死了！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069424_1_07d8ab2b:
    # "...I don't think he's coming."
    "……我觉得他不会来了。"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069425_1_8bdcc61d:
    # "Can you just shut up?"
    "你能不能闭嘴？"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069426_1_c3b36bbe:
    # "Atsuki! You think I won't tell them that you left with the Sekimeiya!? This is your last chance to come back!"
    "Atsuki！你以为我不敢告诉他们，你带着 Sekimeiya 走了吗！？这是你回来的最后机会！"

translate zh_cn script_rpy_L069432_1_405b08ca:
    # "\"Atsuki!\"{w=1.1}{nw}"
    "「Atsuki！」{w=1.1}{nw}"
